	(284, 3, NULL, 'let me introduce', 'The Lotte World Folk Museum highlights Korean folk culture through miniature displays. Located at Lotte World, visitors can enjoy seeing model villages from different periods of history. There is also a crafts room where visitors can see traditional crafts being made. The museum has a children\'s educational facility that runs various kid-friendly programs during school breaks.', '2025-11-07 19:48:30'),
