	(419, 4, NULL, 'Sukjeongmun Gate ?? Gyeonggyojang?, which one is better? Please recommend', 'Yo! Hunters! 🔥💫 Lumi가 엄선한 6개의 전설적인 장소들이야! 각 장소마다 특별한 빛의 에너지가 있으니까 직접 체크해봐! 궁금한 곳 있으면 말해줘! Let\'s explore! 🌙✨', '2025-11-10 03:29:24'),
	(420, 4, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on an epic journey to Gyeongbokgung Palace, the heart of our legendary Seoul! This majestic palace, built in 1395, is the symbol of our rich history and the spirit of the Joseon Dynasty! 👑 It’s where the royal family once ruled, and when I walk through those grand gates, I can feel the energy of our ancestors, the original light warriors! ⚔️\n\nGyeongbokgung is not just a beautiful sight; it’s a place that has inspired us deeply. During our "Ancient Warriors" concept, I spent countless hours here, absorbing the traditional warrior culture. The vibrant colors of the palace and the elegant hanbok worn by the guards inspired our stage outfits and choreography! 💖✨ I’ll never forget the moment when we stood in front of the throne room, feeling the weight of history and the call to protect our own kingdom through music and dance! \n\nI encourage all of you, my beloved Hunters, to visit Gyeongbokgung and soak in its incredible energy! Feel the spirit of those who came before us and let it ignite your own warrior hearts! Let\'s go! 🌙💫', '2025-11-10 03:46:40'),
	(421, 4, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on a legendary journey to Myeongdong Cathedral, the very first Roman Catholic parish church in Korea and a true gem in our vibrant city! This Gothic masterpiece, completed in 1898, stands tall as a symbol of faith and resilience, just like our journey as light warriors. ⚔️💖\n\nI remember the first time we visited this sacred place during our preparation for the \'Light in Darkness\' MV. The atmosphere was electric, filled with history and hope, and I felt an overwhelming connection to the martyrs enshrined in the small sanctuary below. Every May, when the cultural festival lights up the area, it reminds me of the spirit of our fans coming together, just like we do on stage! 🌙💫\n\nSo, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, make sure to pay a visit to Myeongdong Cathedral! Feel the energy, soak in the history, and remember that just like the light shining through its stained glass, we too can illuminate the darkness! Let’s go! 🎤🔥', '2025-11-10 03:46:54'),
	(422, 4, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 💖🔥 Let me take you on an epic journey to COEX, the legendary hub of innovation and culture right in the heart of Seoul! 🌟 This place is not just about exhibitions and conferences; it\'s where the energy of ideas and creativity collide! I remember the time we came here for a special collaboration event, and the buzz in the air felt electric! ⚡️ The grand halls echo with the footsteps of dreamers and creators, just like us!\n\nCOEX is like a magical arena where every corner tells a story, from the amazing expos on food and culture to the vibrant promotions in the lobby spaces! It’s a space that inspires us to keep pushing boundaries, just like when we filmed the behind-the-scenes of our \'Unity\' MV here, capturing the essence of togetherness! 🌈✨ So, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, make sure to visit COEX and soak in that incredible energy! Trust me, it’s a place where light warriors gather to fuel their dreams! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 03:47:05'),
	(423, 4, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 💖🔥 Let me take you on a legendary journey to the Bukchon Asian Cultural Art Museum! Nestled in the heart of Bukchon Hanok Village, this amazing spot is a treasure trove of Korean and Asian artwork! 🎨✨ Founded by the incredible Kwon Youngdu, who dedicated 30 years to collecting these masterpieces, this museum is not just about art—it\'s a celebration of culture and history!\n\nWhen we were preparing for our "Eternal Echoes" album, we came here to soak in the vibrant energy of traditional art! The museum\'s stunning hanok architecture reminds me of the harmony we strive for in our music—combining the old with the new! 🌙💫 Plus, the folk painting and traditional cooking activities? They bring out the creative warrior in all of us! \n\nI’ll never forget the inspiration I felt walking through those halls, imagining the stories behind each piece. It’s a place where light and culture collide, just like our music! So, Hunters, if you want to feel that energy and connect with the spirit of our ancestors, make sure to visit Bukchon! Let’s keep hunting for light together! ⚔️🔥💖', '2025-11-10 03:47:19'),
	(424, 4, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on an epic ride through the Hangang River Bus! This isn\'t just any bus; it\'s a floating adventure on the legendary Han River! 🌊 Located at the Jamsil Pier, this bus gives you a front-row seat to the stunning skyline of Seoul. Imagine cruising along the river, the wind in your hair, while soaking in the vibrant energy of the city. \n\nWe’ve performed here for special stages, and the views from the water remind me of the epic battles we fight in our music. The reflections of the city lights on the water are like our dreams shimmering in the darkness! 💖 Every time I ride the Hangang River Bus, I feel that connection to our journey as light warriors. I encourage all you Hunters to hop on and experience the magic for yourselves! Let’s go make some legendary memories together! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 03:47:35'),
	(425, 4, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥✨ Today, let me take you on an adventure to the legendary **Bukchon Asian Cultural Art Museum**! Nestled in the heart of Bukchon Hanok Village, this place is a treasure trove of Korean and Asian artwork, brought to life by the dedication of its founder, Kwon Youngdu, who spent 30 years collecting these amazing pieces! 🎨💖\n\nWhen we were preparing for our "Art of Light" concept, we visited this museum to soak in the vibrant energy of creativity and tradition. The traditional hanok-style architecture here has the same warm vibe that inspires our music and performances! I’ll never forget the moment we participated in a folk painting class, channeling our inner artists and feeling that connection to our roots. 🌙⚔️\n\nThis museum isn’t just a place to see art; it’s where we gather inspiration and fuel our passion for storytelling through music. If you ever find yourself in Seoul, you HAVE to visit Bukchon! Feel the energy, embrace the artistry, and let it spark your own creativity! Let’s go, Hunters! 💫🎤', '2025-11-10 03:49:00'),
	(426, 4, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Seoul Tower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on an unforgettable journey to one of Seoul\'s most iconic spots: N Seoul Tower! This legendary tower isn’t just a stunning landmark; it’s our ULTIMATE watchtower! 🌙 We filmed the epic final battle scene of our "Light in Darkness" MV right at the very top, and I’ll never forget the feeling of standing at 236.7 meters high, gazing out over the dazzling lights of Seoul. Each twinkling light reminds us of our mission to fight against the darkness! \n\nWhen the sun sets and the city comes alive, the view is absolutely breathtaking – it’s like the entire city is glowing with energy! 💖 The locks of love that lovers attach to the railings? They symbolize the connections we build as light warriors. This place holds so many memories for us, and every moment spent here fuels our passion for music and our journey together. So, Hunters, let’s make a plan to visit N Seoul Tower and feel that powerful energy! Trust me, it’s an experience that will inspire you! Let’s go! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 04:53:12'),
	(427, 4, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 💖✨ Let’s dive into the amazing world of the Bukchon Asian Cultural Art Museum! This place is a treasure trove of creativity, showcasing stunning Korean and Asian artwork that tells stories of our rich heritage. Just like how we pour our souls into every performance, the founder Kwon Youngdu dedicated 30 years to collecting these masterpieces, so you know the energy here is LEGENDARY! 🎨🔥 \n\nLocated in the heart of Bukchon Hanok Village, the museum’s traditional hanok architecture makes you feel like you’ve stepped back in time, surrounded by the spirits of past warriors who once roamed these streets. When we were preparing for our "Ancient Warriors" concept, I brought the members here to soak up that historical vibe! 🌙✨ I’ll never forget the moment we participated in a folk painting workshop, channeling our inner artists while connecting with our culture. \n\nIf you ever find yourself in Seoul, you HAVE to visit! Feel the energy, get inspired, and who knows? Maybe it’ll spark your own creative journey! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 04:53:21'),
	(428, 4, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on an epic journey through the Hangang River Bus! This isn\'t just any bus ride; it\'s a legendary experience cruising along the beautiful Han River, where the energy of Seoul pulses through every wave! 🌊💖\n\nImagine hopping on at Jamsil Pier, surrounded by the stunning skyline as the sun sets, casting a golden glow over the water. It’s where we came to clear our minds before our big comeback! 🌙💫 The bus operates daily, with 68 trips on weekdays and 48 on weekends, so you can easily catch the vibe anytime. During rush hours, it’s like a super-fast express route for our fellow Hunters, racing through the city! ⚔️\n\nWhen we filmed ‘Moonlight Hunter,’ we imagined the river as the boundary between light and darkness, and riding this bus is like floating between those worlds. Trust me, the views are breathtaking, and the energy is electric! So gather your friends, hop on the Hangang River Bus, and let the magic of Seoul inspire you! Let’s go! 🎤💖', '2025-11-10 04:53:31'),
	(429, 4, NULL, 'recommend  places in seoul', 'Yo! Hunters! 🔥💫 Lumi가 엄선한 6개의 전설적인 장소들이야! 각 장소마다 특별한 빛의 에너지가 있으니까 직접 체크해봐! 궁금한 곳 있으면 말해줘! Let\'s explore! 🌙✨', '2025-11-10 04:53:46'),
	(430, 4, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥💫 Let\'s talk about Gyeongbokgung Palace, the grand heart of Seoul and a legendary symbol of our history! Built in 1395 by the great King Taejo, it’s not just a palace; it’s a fortress of stories, energy, and the spirit of our ancestors. 👑✨ This is where royalty walked, making decisions that shaped the very fabric of Korea!\n\nWhen we were preparing for our “Eternal Guardians” concept, I spent countless hours wandering through its beautiful halls and lush gardens. The intricate architecture, with its vibrant colors and detailed patterns, inspired our stage designs and outfits! The way the sunlight filters through the trees creates a magical atmosphere that reminds me of our journey as light warriors fighting against darkness. 🌙⚔️ \n\nSo, I encourage you all to visit Gyeongbokgung! Feel the energy of the past and let it inspire your own battles. Let’s connect with the spirits of those legendary warriors that came before us! Together, we can carry their light forward! 💖✨', '2025-11-10 04:59:17'),
	(431, 4, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥 Let me take you on an epic journey through the amazing Hangang River Bus! 🌊 This isn’t just any bus ride; it’s a legendary adventure on the magical Han River! We’re talking 68 daily trips on weekdays and 48 on weekends, connecting you to the heart of Seoul! \n\nPicture this: cruising along the river, surrounded by the shimmering city lights reflecting on the water, all while feeling that electric energy that fuels our music! 🎤✨ I remember when we came here during the preparation for our \'Moonlight Hunter\' performance. That iconic scene where we danced under the stars on Banpo Bridge? It all started here! The river holds the spirit of our battles between light and darkness, and every wave whispers tales of our journey. \n\nSo, grab your friends, hop on the Hangang River Bus, and feel that energy! Let’s make some memories that will inspire our next album! 💖⚔️ Let\'s go, Hunters!', '2025-11-10 04:59:52'),
	(432, 4, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥💖 Are you ready to dive into the heart of Seoul’s artistic soul? Let’s talk about the amazing Bukchon Asian Cultural Art Museum! Nestled in the enchanting Bukchon Hanok Village, this museum is a treasure trove of Korean and Asian artwork, showcasing the dedication of its founder, Kwon Youngdu, who spent 30 years collecting these incredible pieces! 🌙✨\n\nI remember when we visited this legendary spot while preparing for our "Cultural Warriors" concept! The energy there is just magical! The museum, built in the traditional hanok style, feels like stepping into a different era, where every corner whispers stories of the past. 🎨💫 Plus, the folk painting and traditional cooking programs remind me of the time we tried to learn a bit of traditional cooking for our "Taste of Light" MV! It’s a place where creativity flows like the Han River, and it’s a must-visit for all you Hunters looking to soak up that vibrant energy! Let’s go and explore this artistic wonder together! ⚔️💖', '2025-11-10 05:00:24'),
	(433, 4, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 💖 Are you ready to dive into the legendary vibes of the Hangang River Bus? 🚤💫 This amazing transport takes you along the beautiful Han River, connecting you with the heart of Seoul! Imagine cruising past iconic landmarks, feeling the fresh breeze, and soaking in the stunning views of the city while you ride. \n\nThis bus is not just a way to get around; it\'s an experience! 🌙✨ We often gather here before our big performances, reminiscing about our journey and drawing energy from the river, which symbolizes the eternal battle between light and darkness. The sunsets over the Han are like magic, and I can feel the spirit of our music flowing through the water. \n\nSo, grab your friends, hop on the Hangang River Bus, and let’s feel that incredible energy together! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️🔥', '2025-11-10 05:00:37'),
	(434, 4, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥💖 Let me take you on an epic journey to one of Seoul\'s most legendary spots: COEX! This place isn’t just a massive convention center; it’s a vibrant hub of creativity and energy! 💫 Imagine walking through its grand halls filled with exhibitions on food, culture, and arts—each corner bursting with inspiration! \n\nWe actually came here during the preparations for our “Light in Darkness” album! 🌙 The atmosphere was electric, just like when we perform on stage! I remember the way the lights shone against the sleek architecture, reminding me of the battles we fight as Demon Hunters! Every time I step into COEX, I feel that same passion and drive that fuels our music. \n\nSo if you ever find yourself in Seoul, make sure to visit COEX and soak in all that powerful energy! You’ll feel like a true warrior of light, ready to take on the world! Let\'s go, Hunters! ⚔️✨', '2025-11-10 05:01:51'),
	(435, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on an epic journey to COEX, the legendary heart of Seoul! This place isn’t just a convention center; it’s a vibrant hub where energy and creativity collide! 💖 We’ve spent countless hours here, soaking in the electric atmosphere while preparing for our big events and expos. I’ll never forget the time we showcased our “Light in Darkness” concept at a global summit here—our fans’ energy was off the charts! ⚔️\n\nCOEX is home to amazing exhibitions about food, culture, and arts, just like our passion for sharing stories and experiences through music! 🌙 When we perform or hold fan meetings, the excitement in the air feels like we’re all part of a grand adventure together. Each corner of COEX is filled with inspiration, reminding us of our mission as light warriors! So, next time you’re in Seoul, don’t miss out on this incredible place. Feel that energy and let it inspire your own journey! Let’s go, Hunters! 💫🎤', '2025-11-10 05:34:17'),
	(436, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Today, let’s dive into the spectacular world of Gyeongbokgung Palace, the heart of Seoul and a legendary symbol of our rich history! Built in 1395, this magnificent palace isn’t just stunning with its intricate architecture and beautiful gardens; it’s where the spirit of Korea’s light warriors lives on! 👑⚔️ \n\nWhen we were preparing for our "Ancient Warriors" concept, I spent countless hours here, soaking up the energy and inspiration. The palace guards, dressed in their vibrant uniforms, reminded me of our own stage outfits, and the geometric patterns of the palace influenced our choreography formations! 💖 Every time I walk through those grand gates, I can feel the echoes of history, the whispers of warriors who once protected this kingdom. \n\nSo, I encourage you all to visit Gyeongbokgung and connect with the energy of our ancestors! Feel that spirit of resilience and strength, Hunters! Let’s go make some unforgettable memories together! 🌙✨🎤', '2025-11-10 05:34:51'),
	(437, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on a journey to one of Seoul\'s most electrifying spots - COEX! This legendary place isn’t just a global convention center; it’s a vibrant hub of culture, innovation, and creativity! 🌍💫 We’ve had some amazing moments here, especially during the \'Light Up Seoul\' expo, where we showcased our music and connected with fans from all over the world. The energy in the air is palpable, like a rush of light warriors coming together to celebrate the arts! 🎤⚔️ \n\nI remember the first time we stepped onto the COEX stage for a special event; my heart was racing! The massive exhibition halls and those stunning digital displays reminded me of our music videos, filled with dynamic visuals and powerful messages. COEX is where the light meets the darkness, just like our journey as Demon Hunters. 🌙✨ So, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, make sure to visit COEX and soak in that incredible energy! Let’s keep fighting the darkness together! 💖🔥', '2025-11-10 05:38:03'),
	(438, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙✨ Are you ready to dive into the legendary world of Gyeongbokgung Palace? This magnificent palace, built in 1395, is not just a historical treasure but a symbol of the resilience of our ancestors! 👑 It’s the largest of the Five Grand Palaces of the Joseon Dynasty, and the energy here is absolutely electric! ⚡\n\nPicture this: the majestic Geunjeongjeon Hall, where kings once held court, echoes with the whispers of history. When we were preparing for our ‘Ancient Warriors’ concept, I spent countless hours here, soaking in the royal vibes and the architectural beauty that inspired our choreography! The intricate designs and the royal guards in their traditional attire sparked the creativity within us! 🎤🔥\n\nEvery time I walk through these gates, I feel the spirits of the light warriors who once protected this land. It’s a reminder of our mission to shine brightly against the darkness! So, my Demon Hunters family, when you visit, let the energy of Gyeongbokgung fill your hearts with inspiration! Let’s go and embrace the legacy of our ancestors together! 💖⚔️', '2025-11-10 05:38:13'),
	(439, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Today, let’s dive into the legendary vibes of Gyeongbokgung Palace! 👑 This stunning palace, built in 1395, is the heart of Seoul and a symbol of our rich history! It’s where the kings of the Joseon Dynasty ruled, and the energy here is like the pulse of our ancestors! \n\nWhen we were preparing for our \'Ancient Warriors\' concept, I remember spending hours here, soaking up the atmosphere and the breathtaking architecture. The intricate designs and the royal guard’s uniforms inspired our stage outfits and choreography! 💫 I’ll never forget the moment I stood in front of the main hall, Myeongjeongjeon, feeling the weight of history and the spirits of those who once protected this kingdom. \n\nThis palace isn’t just a beautiful site; it’s a reminder of our mission as light warriors to protect and honor our heritage! So, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, make sure to visit Gyeongbokgung! Feel the energy, connect with our past, and let it inspire your own journey! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💖', '2025-11-10 05:38:29'),
	(440, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 💖🔥 Let me take you on an incredible journey to Myeongdong Cathedral, the very first Roman Catholic parish church in Korea! This legendary spot is not just a beautiful Gothic structure; it’s a sacred space where the spirit of light and hope shines bright! 🌙✨ \n\nI remember the first time we visited this place during a cultural festival in May. The energy was electric! The cathedral’s stunning architecture and the peaceful sanctuary in the basement, where the remains of martyrs are enshrined, reminded me of our mission to honor those who fought for light. It was like stepping into the pages of our own story, where we draw inspiration for our battles against darkness! \n\nMyeongdong Cathedral is a symbol of resilience and faith, just like us, the Demon Hunters! So, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, make sure to visit this amazing place and feel the powerful energy that fuels our journey! Let’s keep shining bright together! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 05:38:38'),
	(441, 3, NULL, 'I\'m going to Seoul, and I\'m looking for a place to visit near Gyeongbokgung Palace.', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 💖 If you\'re visiting Gyeongbokgung Palace, you\'ve got to check out Changdeokgung Palace, just a stone\'s throw away! 🔥 This legendary spot is not just a UNESCO World Heritage Site; it’s a treasure chest of Korean history and beauty! Built back in 1405 by King Taejong, this palace is like a time capsule that whispers tales of ancient warriors and royal secrets! 👑✨\n\nLet me tell you, when I first walked through those gates, my heart raced with the energy of the past! I could almost hear the echoes of the royal guards and feel the spirit of our ancestors who protected the kingdom! 🌙 It’s the perfect place to connect with the essence of our “Ancient Warriors” concept, where we drew inspiration for our choreography and outfits! \n\nSo, when you\'re there, take a moment to soak in the beauty and the stories that surround you. Feel that energy, Hunters! It’s a reminder of why we fight the darkness! Let’s go explore, and who knows, maybe you’ll find your own inspiration for your journey! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 05:42:38'),
	(442, 3, NULL, 'Uploading photos from the drama along with the caption, "Where is this?"', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Today, I’m vibing with you from an incredible spot in Seoul - the SeMA Museum of Photography! 📸 This place is not just a museum; it’s a treasure trove of visual stories that capture the essence of our city! When I walk through those halls, surrounded by stunning images, I’m reminded of the power of light and shadow, just like in our music! \n\nWe came here during the preparation for our "Shadows and Light" album, seeking inspiration from the incredible photographers who transform moments into art! The energy here is electric, and every corner sparks creativity, just like our stage performances! 🌙💖 I encourage all you Hunters to visit and soak up that amazing energy! Let’s keep hunting for light together! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 05:43:20'),
	(443, 3, NULL, ' I\'m going to Seoul and looking for places to visit near Gyeongbokgung Palace.', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the magical world of Seoul? Just a stone\'s throw away from Gyeongbokgung Palace is the legendary Changdeokgung Palace! 🌙 This place isn’t just another historical site; it’s the second UNESCO World Heritage Site in Seoul, and it’s bursting with beauty and ancient energy that speaks to our warrior spirits! \n\nI remember when we were preparing for our "Ancient Warriors" concept, I spent countless hours here, soaking in the rich history and stunning architecture. The way the palace harmonizes with nature inspired our choreography and stage designs! 🌿✨ Imagine walking through those beautiful gardens, feeling the whispers of the past, and connecting with the light warriors who once protected this land.\n\nSo, when you visit, take a moment to absorb that energy! Trust me, it’s a place where you can feel the heartbeat of Seoul! 💖 Let’s go together and experience the magic! 🔥⚔️', '2025-11-10 05:44:12'),
	(444, 3, NULL, 'I\'ll upload a photo from the drama with the caption, "Where is this?"', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Are you ready to dive into the legendary vibes of Seoul? The place in your photo is the SeMA Museum of Photography, located in the vibrant Changdong area! This museum is not just a gallery; it’s a treasure trove of visual stories that connect us to the past, present, and future! 📸💖\n\nWe came here during the preparation for our “Eternal Echoes” album, soaking in the creative energy that flows through the exhibits. The way the light interacts with the photographs reminds me of the battles we face as light warriors, capturing moments that tell our story! 🌙 Every corner of this museum has a unique aura, echoing the struggles and triumphs of artists, just like us! \n\nSo, if you want to feel that powerful energy and get inspired for your own adventures, make sure to visit SeMA! Trust me, it’s a place where creativity and passion collide! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 05:44:26'),
	(445, 3, NULL, 'Look for blogs about jjimjilbangs.', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the legendary world of jjimjilbangs? These amazing Korean bathhouses are like magical sanctuaries where you can relax and recharge your spirit! 💖 Just like how we find our energy before a performance, jjimjilbangs offer a space to unwind and connect with the essence of Korea. \n\nImagine soaking in hot baths, enjoying the unique saunas, and even munching on some delicious snacks like boiled eggs and sweet rice drink – it’s a whole vibe! 🔥 I remember when we were preparing for our "Healing Warriors" concept; we all visited a jjimjilbang together to bond and recharge our creative energy. It was legendary! \n\nSo, if you’re ever in Seoul, don’t miss out on this experience! Feel the warmth, embrace the relaxation, and let the jjimjilbangs revitalize your soul! 💫 Let’s go, Hunters!', '2025-11-10 05:44:36'),
	(446, 3, NULL, 'Can you give me some travel tips for Korea?', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ If you’re planning to visit Korea, you HAVE to check out Space C in Gangnam! This place is like a treasure trove of beauty and creativity! 🌟 Spanning 10 levels, it’s not just a cosmetics hub but an entire experience! The 5th and 6th floors boast Korea\'s largest cosmetics museum, where you can dive deep into the fascinating history of Korean beauty. 💖\n\nI remember when we came here during our "Beauty Warriors" concept preparation! The energy was so inspiring, and it reminded me of our journey as artists. Just like how we evolve in our music, the cosmetics showcased here reflect the evolution of beauty in Korea. 🌙✨ I felt that connection to our fans and the power of transformation! So, Hunters, when you visit, soak in that energy and let it inspire your own journey! Let’s go make some legendary memories! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 05:44:58'),
	(447, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into one of the most electrifying places in Seoul? Let me tell you about COEX! This legendary spot is not just a convention center; it’s a hub of creativity and energy! 💫 From massive exhibitions to international conferences, COEX is where the magic happens, bringing together food, culture, and arts in one incredible space! \n\nI remember when we came here during our \'Light in Darkness\' album preparations. The vibrant atmosphere filled with artists and innovators inspired us to push our creative boundaries! 🌙✨ The way the lights reflect off the sleek architecture makes it feel like a futuristic stage, perfect for our next performance! COEX is like a battlefield for creative warriors, and I encourage all our Demon Hunters family to visit and soak in that amazing energy! Let\'s go, and may your hearts be filled with inspiration! ⚔️💖', '2025-11-10 05:47:31'),
	(448, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Seoul Tower', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙✨ Let me take you on a magical journey to one of the most iconic spots in Seoul – Namsan Seoul Tower! This legendary watchtower isn’t just a beautiful landmark; it’s where we filmed the epic final battle scene of our "Light in Darkness" MV! 🎬🔥 Standing 236.7 meters high, the observatory offers breathtaking panoramic views of the city, especially at night when Seoul lights up like a sea of stars. Every time I gaze out over that shimmering skyline, I feel an unbreakable connection to our mission as light warriors, reminding me why we fight the darkness! \n\nAnd let’s not forget the locks of love! 💖 This is where lovers and friends fasten their dreams to the iron railings, just like we fasten our hopes to our music. I’ll never forget the night we filmed here, with the sunset painting the sky in colors that sparked our next album concept. So, if you ever get the chance, come feel the energy of this amazing place and let it inspire your own light! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 05:47:32'),
	(449, 3, NULL, 'Can you give me some travel tips for Korea?', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Are you ready to dive into the legendary vibes of Korea? Let’s talk about Space C, a truly magical spot in Gangnam! 🌙💖 This place is not just a beauty hub; it\'s a 10-level wonderland where you can explore the history of Korean cosmetics, and trust me, it’s a treasure trove of artistry and innovation! \n\nI remember when we visited Space C during our \'Beauty Warriors\' concept preparation. The energy in that Cosmetics Museum was off the charts! Each artifact and artwork felt like a piece of our journey, connecting us to the light we strive to share through our music. I’ll never forget the rooftop garden, where we took a moment to breathe in the beauty of Seoul while dreaming up our next moves! \n\nSo, Hunters, when you\'re in Korea, make sure to stop by Space C! Feel that incredible energy and let it inspire your own light warrior journey! Let’s go! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 05:47:58'),
	(450, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥💖 Are you ready to dive into the heart of Seoul? Let’s talk about the legendary Myeongdong Cathedral! This stunning Gothic masterpiece is not just the first Roman Catholic parish church in Korea, but it also holds the spirit of our journey as light warriors. ✨ \n\nI’ll never forget the time we visited Myeongdong Cathedral during the annual cultural festival in May. The energy was electric! The vibrant atmosphere, filled with music and celebration, reminded me of the passion we pour into our performances. 🎤💫 Standing in that sacred space, where the martyrs\' remains are enshrined, I felt a deep connection to our mission as Demon Hunters. It’s a place where history and spirit intertwine, just like our music blends light and darkness. \n\nSo, when you’re in Seoul, make sure to pay a visit to Myeongdong Cathedral! Feel the energy, soak in the history, and remember, we’re all light warriors in our own right! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️🌙', '2025-11-10 05:56:10'),
	(451, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥💖 Let me take you on an epic journey to COEX, one of the most legendary spots in Seoul! This place is a powerhouse, hosting massive exhibitions and international conferences that bring together warriors of all kinds—just like us! ⚔️✨\n\nI remember when we came here during the preparations for our "Global Harmony" album. The energy in the air was electric, filled with creativity and inspiration! The expansive halls and vibrant lobby areas buzz with excitement, just like our stage when we perform! 🌟 Every corner feels alive, and it reminds me of the hustle and determination we put into our music. \n\nCOEX isn’t just a venue; it’s a symbol of connection and collaboration, much like our bond as Demon Hunters! So, if you’re ever in Seoul, you’ve got to feel the energy of COEX for yourself! Let’s go, Hunters! 💫🌙', '2025-11-10 05:56:25'),
	(452, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥✨ Let me take you into the heart of Seoul’s vibrant energy at COEX! This legendary venue isn’t just a convention center; it’s a realm where ideas come to life! 🌟 From international conferences to epic expos celebrating food, culture, and the arts, COEX is like the pulse of the city, beating with creativity and innovation! \n\nI remember when we visited during the Seoul Food Expo while preparing for our "Culinary Warriors" concept. The aromas and flavors inspired us so much that we incorporated some of that energy into our music! 🎤💖 The way the indoor spaces buzz with excitement reminds me of our performances in Hongdae, where every corner is alive with talent and passion! \n\nSo, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, make sure to step into the magic of COEX! Feel that energy and let it ignite your own creativity! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 06:08:00'),
	(453, 3, NULL, 'Can you give me some travel tips for Korea?', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 💖 Are you ready to dive into the heart of Korea\'s history and culture? Let me take you to The National Museum of Korea! 🎤✨ This legendary place is like a treasure chest filled with nearly 420,000 artifacts that tell the stories of our ancestors! When I first stepped inside, my heart raced as I felt the energy of thousands of years of history surrounding me. It’s where we can connect with the light warriors of the past who fought to protect our culture! \n\nI remember when we were preparing for our ‘Ancient Warriors’ concept; this museum inspired our whole aesthetic! The intricate designs and the stories behind each piece reminded me of our own battles against darkness. So, when you visit, take a moment to feel that energy and let it inspire your own journey! Trust me, it’s a must-see! Let’s go make some legendary memories together! 🔥⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 06:08:18'),
	(454, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the legendary world of Gyeongbokgung Palace? 👑 This majestic palace, built in 1395 by King Taejo, is not just a stunning piece of architecture; it\'s the heart of Seoul\'s history and the spirit of our ancestors! Just like our journey as light warriors, Gyeongbokgung has seen its share of battles and triumphs, embodying the resilience and strength of the Korean people. \n\nWhen we were preparing for our "Ancient Warriors" concept, I spent countless hours here, soaking in the energy of the royal guards and the whispers of history. The intricate designs and vibrant colors inspired our stage outfits and choreography! 🌈✨ Plus, let’s not forget those epic moments we captured during our "Warrior\'s Spirit" MV, where we danced in front of the iconic Gyeonghoeru Pavilion, surrounded by the serene beauty of nature. \n\nSo, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, make sure to step into this legendary palace and feel the pulse of history! Trust me, it\'s a place where the past and present collide, and you\'ll leave feeling like a true light warrior! 💖⚔️ Let’s go,', '2025-11-10 07:08:21'),
	(455, 3, NULL, ' Any tips for traveling in Korea?', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the amazing energy of Korea? One legendary spot you absolutely HAVE to check out is the National Museum of Korea! 🏛️ This place isn’t just a museum; it’s a treasure trove of history and culture that connects us to our roots as light warriors! With nearly 420,000 artifacts, it tells the tales of the Korean spirit, just like we share our stories through music! \n\nI remember when we visited during our \'Heritage\' album concept! The way the artifacts sparkled like stars in the night sky inspired our choreography! ✨ The mix of traditional and modern tech, like VR experiences, makes you feel like you’re stepping into another world! So, whether you’re exploring the ancient relics or soaking in the digital magic, you’ll feel that same thrill we feel on stage! 💫 \n\nMake sure to visit, Hunters! Feel that energy and discover the stories that shaped our journey! Let’s go! ⚔️💖', '2025-11-10 07:08:52'),
	(456, 3, NULL, 'Nature Poem vs Myeongdong Jaemi-ro which is better?', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥💖 Let me take you on a legendary journey through the vibrant streets of Seoul, where art and energy collide! 🌙✨ Nature Poem, located in the heart of Gangnam\'s Cheongdam-dong, is a six-story gallery that feels like a treasure chest of creativity. It’s surrounded by high-end designer stores and other amazing galleries, making it the perfect starting point for an artistic adventure! 🎨\n\nNow, Myeongdong Jaemi-ro is also super dope, bustling with energy and street food that can make your taste buds dance! 🍜💃 But if you’re looking for a place where inspiration flows like the Han River 🌊 and creativity sparks like our performances, Nature Poem is where you want to be! I remember visiting it before we filmed the ‘Light in Darkness’ MV, soaking in the artistic vibes that fueled our creativity! \n\nSo, if you\'re ready to embrace the light and explore the beautiful connection between art and our journey as Demon Hunters, Nature Poem is calling your name! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 07:12:31'),
	(457, 3, NULL, 'Any tips for traveling in Korea?', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Are you ready to dive into the heart of Korea’s history? Let me take you to the National Museum of Korea, where the past comes alive! This legendary place is not just a museum; it’s a treasure trove of nearly 420,000 artifacts that tell the stories of our ancestors—just like how we tell our stories through music! 🎤💖 \n\nI remember when we came here during our preparation for the \'Ancient Warriors\' concept. The energy was palpable! Each exhibit felt like a portal to another time, reminding me of the strength and resilience of our ancestors, just like we fight against the darkness in our own way. 🌙✨ The immersive VR experiences are mind-blowing, and they truly connect you to Korea’s rich culture. \n\nSo, when you visit, take a moment to soak in the history and let it inspire your own journey. Feel the energy of the light warriors who came before us! Let’s go explore and create amazing memories together! 💫⚔️', '2025-11-10 07:16:59'),
	(458, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 💖🔥 Let me take you on an epic journey to Myeongdong Cathedral, the first Gothic church ever built in Korea! This legendary spot isn’t just a beautiful architectural masterpiece; it’s where the spirit of light and hope shines brightest. 🌙✨ \n\nI’ll never forget the first time I stepped inside this sacred place. The basement sanctuary, where the martyrs are enshrined, gave me chills. It’s a reminder of the battles fought for freedom and faith—just like our own battles against darkness! ⚔️ We came here during our "Light in Darkness" album preparations, soaking in the energy of resilience and hope that this cathedral radiates. \n\nEvery May, they host a cultural festival that brings the whole community together, and you can feel the vibrant spirit of unity in the air! This place is more than just a church; it\'s a symbol of strength for all of us light warriors. I encourage you to visit and experience the magic of Myeongdong Cathedral for yourself—let its energy inspire you on your own journey! Let’s go, Hunters! 💫🔥', '2025-11-10 07:21:47'),
	(459, 3, NULL, 'tips for me', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥 Are you ready for an adventure in the heart of Seoul? Let me take you to **Myeongdong Jaemi-ro**, a magical street where the energy is as fierce as our performances! This vibrant area is packed with amazing street food, fabulous shops, and those dope cosmetics that make you feel like a superstar! 🌟\n\nWhen we were preparing for our \'Urban Warriors\' concept, we often came here to soak in the lively atmosphere and gather inspiration from the bustling crowds. The lights, the sounds, and the delicious scents swirling around reminded me of the powerful unity we share as a group! 💖 Every time I walk down this street, I feel the pulse of our fans, and it motivates me to pour my heart into every performance! \n\nSo, if you want to experience the energy that fuels the Demon Hunters spirit, grab your friends and hit up Myeongdong Jaemi-ro! Let\'s make some legendary memories together! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 07:22:15'),
	(460, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Seoul Tower', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙✨ Are you ready to dive into the magic of N Seoul Tower? This iconic landmark is our ULTIMATE watchtower! 🎤💖 We filmed the final battle scene of our "Light in Darkness" MV here, standing at a breathtaking 236.7 meters high! The view from the observatory is nothing short of legendary, especially at night when the city lights twinkle like stars scattered across the ground. 🌌\n\nI\'ll never forget the energy that night—the sunset painted the sky in hues that ignited our creativity for our next album concept! Every time I gaze over Seoul from this tower, I feel the powerful light energy that reminds us why we fight against the darkness. And don’t forget the locks of love! They symbolize our bond with you, our Demon Hunters family! 🔥💫 \n\nSo come visit Namsan Tower, feel the energy of our journey, and create your own memories! Let’s keep shining together, Hunters! ⚔️✨', '2025-11-10 07:36:58'),
	(461, 3, NULL, 'give me any tip for me travel korea', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Ready to dive into an epic adventure in Korea? Here’s a hot tip for you: when navigating the city, make sure to download the KakaoMap app! It’s super helpful for finding your way around, with accurate public transport info and walking directions. 🚉💫 \n\nAlso, don’t miss out on trying street food! Head to Myeongdong for some tteokbokki (spicy rice cakes) and hotteok (sweet pancakes) – they’re absolutely delicious! 😋✨ And remember, when you enter someone’s home or a traditional place, it’s polite to take off your shoes. It’s a sign of respect that Koreans really appreciate! 🙏🌙 \n\nTrust me, Hunters, the blend of modern and traditional culture will blow your mind! You\'re gonna have an amazing time! Let’s go! ⚔️✨', '2025-11-10 07:37:23'),
	(462, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the magical world of Bukchon? This place is not just a museum; it\'s a treasure trove of culture and creativity! The Bukchon Asian Cultural Art Museum, nestled in the heart of Bukchon Hanok Village, showcases mind-blowing artwork from Korea and across Asia. It\'s like stepping into a realm where every brushstroke tells a story! 🎨✨\n\nI remember when we visited during the preparations for our "Cultural Warriors" comeback. The energy in the air was electric as we explored traditional folk painting and cooking! It reminded me of our roots and the legends we draw inspiration from. Just like the art we create, Bukchon is a beautiful fusion of history and innovation, making it a must-visit for every Hunter! So, let’s go and soak in that vibrant energy together! 💖⚔️', '2025-11-10 07:52:50'),
	(463, 3, NULL, 'Can you give me some travel tips for Korea?', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to embark on an unforgettable adventure in Korea? Here are some epic travel tips to make your journey legendary! 🌙\n\nFirst, don’t miss the subway! It\'s super efficient and connects you to all the hottest spots in Seoul. Just grab a T-money card at any convenience store – it’ll save you time and money! 🚇✨ When it comes to food, you absolutely have to try kimchi jjigae (kimchi stew) at a local eatery; it’s a must-have comfort food! 💫 And don’t forget to experience a traditional jjimjilbang (Korean spa) for a relaxing break after your adventures! \n\nAlso, remember to be respectful of local customs—like taking off your shoes when entering someone’s home or even some restaurants! 🏠 And when it comes to language, download a translation app to help you navigate conversations; it’s a game-changer! Trust me, you’re going to have an amazing time soaking in the culture! Let’s go! ⚔️✨', '2025-11-10 07:54:36'),
	(464, 3, NULL, 'Can you give me some travel tips for Korean bibim bab? ', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Ready to dive into the delicious world of bibimbap while exploring Korea? Here’s the scoop! First off, make sure to hit up a traditional Korean restaurant for the best bibimbap experience! I recommend places like Gogung in Myeongdong or Jeonju Bibimbap in Jeonju, where they serve it with a side of history! 🌙✨ \n\nWhen it comes to transportation, the Seoul subway is your best friend—super convenient and affordable! Grab a T-money card for easy travel and don’t forget to try some street food on your way to the restaurant; tteokbokki is a must! 🍲💫 \n\nAlso, remember to bow slightly when greeting locals—it shows respect! And if you want to impress them, learn a few basic phrases like “안녕하세요” (annyeonghaseyo) for hello! Trust me, you’ll feel the love! So, gear up, Hunters, and enjoy every bite of that bibimbap adventure! ⚔️✨', '2025-11-10 07:55:29'),
	(465, 3, NULL, 'tell me about namsan', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the magic of Namsan? 🌙 This legendary spot is our ULTIMATE watchtower! We filmed the final battle scene of "Light in Darkness" MV at the very top, and let me tell you, standing at 236.7 meters high, looking over ALL of Seoul, gives me the most powerful vibes. 💖 The city lights spread out like a sea of hope, reminding us why we fight the darkness! \n\nAnd don’t forget about the Locks of Love! Every padlock there symbolizes the dreams and connections we share as light warriors. ✨ I remember the sunset that night—it painted the sky in colors that sparked our next album concept! So, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, make sure to visit Namsan and feel that incredible energy! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 07:56:14'),
	(466, 3, NULL, 'tell me about namsan tower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on an epic journey to one of the most iconic spots in Seoul – Namsan Seoul Tower! 🌙 This legendary tower, standing tall at 236.7 meters, is not just a stunning view point; it\'s our ULTIMATE watchtower! When we filmed the final battle scene of our \'Light in Darkness\' MV at the very top, I felt the energy of Seoul coursing through me! 💖 The city lights below spark a fire in my heart, reminding us why we fight the darkness.\n\nStanding at 480 meters above sea level, the panoramic view is breathtaking, and trust me, nothing can compare to that magical sunset painting the sky. 🌅 This isn’t just a romantic spot for the "Locks of Love" – it\'s where our journey as light warriors began! I’ll never forget that night; the atmosphere was electric, and it inspired so much of our music. \n\nSo, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, you HAVE to visit Namsan Tower! Feel the energy, soak in the views, and let it ignite your own light warrior spirit! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 07:56:52'),
	(467, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Seoul Tower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on an epic journey to N Seoul Tower, our ULTIMATE watchtower! 🌙 This iconic landmark stands tall at 236.7 meters, and the night views from the observatory are absolutely breathtaking! I\'ll never forget the night we filmed the final battle scene of our \'Light in Darkness\' MV here. The sunset painted the sky in colors that inspired our next album concept and filled my heart with energy! 💖 \n\nAs I look out over the sparkling lights of Seoul, I feel the powerful connection to our mission as light warriors. And those Locks of Love? They\'re a reminder of the love and dedication that fuels our fight against darkness! So, when you visit, take a moment to feel that energy and remember: we’re all part of this legendary journey together! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 07:57:17'),
	(468, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥✨ Are you ready to dive into the magical vibes of Bukchon? The Bukchon Asian Cultural Art Museum is not just a place; it’s a treasure trove of Korean and Asian art tucked away in the heart of the stunning Bukchon Hanok Village! 🌙🏯 Founded by the legendary Kwon Youngdu, who spent 30 years curating this incredible collection, every corner of this museum tells a story of our cultural heritage. \n\nI remember the first time we visited during our "Cultural Warriors" concept preparations. The traditional hanok architecture inspired our stage designs and choreography! 💖 This place radiates an energy that reminds me of our own journey as light warriors, fighting to preserve the beauty around us. So, if you want to feel that creative spark and connect with our roots, make sure to stop by! Let the art inspire your own light! 🎤⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 07:57:26'),
	(469, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Tower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🌙🔥 Let me take you on an epic journey to Namsan Seoul Tower, our ULTIMATE watchtower! Standing tall at 236.7 meters, this legendary spot is where we filmed the final battle scene of "Light in Darkness" MV! 💖 When I\'m at the observatory, looking over all of Seoul from 480 meters above sea level, I can feel the city\'s light energy pulsating through me. The breathtaking 360-degree view reminds me of our mission to spread light and love, especially when those city lights twinkle like stars on the ground below. ✨ Trust me, this place is not just romantic with its Locks of Love; it\'s where our journey as light warriors began! So, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, make sure to visit Namsan Tower and soak in that magical energy! Let\'s go! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 07:57:41'),
	(470, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Seoul Tower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on a magical journey to Namsan Seoul Tower, our ULTIMATE watchtower! 🌙 This iconic landmark isn’t just a beautiful spot in the city; it’s where we filmed the final battle scene of our \'Light in Darkness\' MV, standing at a breathtaking 236.7 meters high! Every time I gaze out from the observatory, the dazzling lights of Seoul remind me of our mission to fight the darkness. 💖 The energy here is electric, especially at night when the city sparkles like stars! And those Locks of Love? They\'re a testament to all the love and dreams our Hunters share! So, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, come feel the magic of this place—it\'s where our journey as light warriors truly began! Let\'s go! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 07:57:53'),
	(471, 3, NULL, 'ㅎㅇ', '안녕하세요! 축제나 관광명소에 대해 궁금한 것이 있으시면 언제든 물어보세요! 😊', '2025-11-10 08:20:22'),
	(472, 3, NULL, 'hi', '안녕하세요! 축제나 관광명소에 대해 궁금한 것이 있으시면 언제든 물어보세요! 😊', '2025-11-10 08:20:30'),
	(473, 3, NULL, '자기소개 해봐', '안녕하세요! 축제나 관광명소에 대해 궁금한 것이 있으시면 언제든 물어보세요! 😊', '2025-11-10 08:20:47'),
	(474, 3, NULL, '안녕친구야 자기소개 해봐', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥💖 Are you ready for the most epic adventure of the fall? Let me take you on a magical journey to the 한강페스티벌, running from October 18 to 26, 2025! 🌙✨ Under the stunning autumn sky, the Han River transforms into the biggest and most amazing playground you can imagine! Just picture this: you and I, awakening our inner athletes with jumping fitness and step box workouts, feeling the vibrant energy of the season! 💪🎤\n\nAnd oh, the yoga sessions by the river at sunset? It’s like stepping into a scene from one of our MV’s, where every pose feels like a powerful moment in a movie! 🎬✨ I can\'t help but think back to our unforgettable performance here back in 2022. I remember the way the sun dipped below the horizon as we danced, the crowd electrified by our energy, and the fireworks bursting in sync with our finale. It was legendary! ⚔️💥\n\nThe festival is not just about workouts; it’s a celebration of culture! The traditional Korean music performances will have you feeling the heartbeat of our heritage, just like the inspiration behind our "Ancient Warriors" MV! The', '2025-11-10 08:21:46'),
	(475, 3, NULL, '안녕 친구가 너에 대해 말해줘', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥✨ Are you ready for an unforgettable experience at the 한강페스티벌? Let me tell you, this festival is going to be LEGENDARY! 🎤💖 From October 18th to 26th, the Han River transforms into the most epic playground beneath the autumn sky, and it’s calling all of us to awaken our inner athletes! 🌅⚔️\n\nImagine this: the sun setting over the river, casting a golden hue as we dive into jumping fitness and step box workouts, charging our spirits and energizing our bodies! It’s like a scene straight out of our “Rise Up” MV, where we push our limits and elevate our game! 💫 And oh, the yoga sessions by the riverside? They’ll make you feel like the star of your own blockbuster movie, just like in our dreamy visuals! 🌙 \n\nI remember when we performed here back in 2022! The energy was electric, and Shadow’s legendary ad-lib during our title track had the crowd going wild! 🎶🔥 The night was filled with the beautiful sounds of traditional Korean music, reminding me of our own roots and inspiring our choreography for “Ancient Warriors.” \n\nThis festival is packed', '2025-11-10 08:22:20'),
	(476, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on an epic journey to **Gyeongbokgung Palace**, the legendary heart of Seoul! Built in 1395, this majestic palace is like a time machine, taking us back to the glorious days of the Joseon Dynasty! 👑 Imagine the royal warriors of old, protecting their kingdom with honor and courage—just like us, right? \n\nWhen we were preparing for our \'Ancient Warriors\' concept, I felt the powerful energy here. The intricate architecture and vibrant colors inspired our stage outfits and choreography! 💖 It’s not just a palace; it’s a symbol of resilience and strength, reminding us that we, too, are light warriors fighting against the darkness! \n\nSo, Hunters, when you visit this iconic place, let its history inspire you! Feel the energy of the past and carry it with you as you chase your dreams! Let’s go! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 08:22:32'),
	(477, 3, NULL, 'hello friend tall me about you', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥✨ Let me take you on a journey to the Jeon Tae-il Memorial Hall, a truly legendary spot in the heart of Seoul! This place is not just a memorial; it’s a powerful reminder of the sacrifices made for worker rights in Korea. Jeon Tae-il, a beacon of hope, fought for a world where workers could thrive in health and dignity. 💖\n\nWhen I visit this hall, I feel the energy of all those who stood up for their dreams, just like we do as Demon Hunters! It inspires me every time we prepare for a comeback, reminding us of our own battles and the light we bring to our fans. 🌙✨ This hall is a symbol of resilience, and it resonates deeply with our mission to empower and uplift others through our music.\n\nSo, if you’re ever in Seoul, come feel the energy here! Let’s honor the legacy of Jeon Tae-il together and channel that spirit into our own fight against darkness! ⚔️💫 Remember, every step we take is a part of our journey as light warriors! Let\'s go, Hunters! 🎤💖', '2025-11-10 08:22:53'),
	(478, 3, NULL, 'HI', '안녕하세요! 축제나 관광명소에 대해 궁금한 것이 있으시면 언제든 물어보세요! 😊', '2025-11-10 08:29:25'),
	(479, 3, NULL, 'hello', '안녕하세요! 축제나 관광명소에 대해 궁금한 것이 있으시면 언제든 물어보세요! 😊', '2025-11-10 08:37:43'),
	(480, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on an epic ride through the Hangang River Bus experience! 🚍💖 This is not just any ordinary bus; it’s a magical journey along the Hangang River, where the energy of Seoul pulses with life! Imagine cruising past iconic views, with the shimmering river reflecting the city lights, just like in our "Moonlight Hunter" performance! 🌙\n\nWe often come here to recharge our creative vibes before a comeback, feeling that legendary spirit of Seoul all around us! The bus runs 68 times on weekdays and 48 times on weekends, which means there’s always a chance to hop on and feel that energy! 🏞️ So, whether it’s a weekday morning or a weekend sunset, grab your crew and experience the beauty of our city from the water. Trust me, it’s an adventure you don’t want to miss! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-10 08:49:00'),
	(481, 3, NULL, 'seoul-festival', '안녕하세요! 서울생활예술페스티벌에 대해 알려드릴게요.\n\n**축제 제목:** 서울생활예술페스티벌  \n**기간:** 2025년 10월 11일 하루 동안 진행됩니다.\n\n서울생활예술페스티벌은 “예술로 물드는 가을, 생활로 스며드는 예술”이라는 주제 아래, 시민 누구나 주인공이 될 수 있는 서울의 대표적인 생활예술축제입니다. 이 축제는 한가위의 여운이 남아 있는 노들섬의 아름다운 가을 풍경 속에서 열리며, 500명의 시민예술가들이 참여하여 다양한 예술 공연과 전시가 펼쳐집니다.\n\n축제 동안, 예술은 섬 전역에서 울림처럼 퍼져 나가며, 일상 속에 예술의 바람을 불러일으킵니다. 특히 가을밤에는 작가농부마켓이 열려, 예술의 내음이 감도는 따뜻한 분위기를 즐길 수 있습니다. 이 축제는 세대를 아우르는 따뜻한 동행의 장으로 가족, 친구, 이웃과 함께 예술을 통해 일상을 연결하는 소중한 순간을 경험할 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다.\n\n서울생활예술페스티벌은 여러분께 잊지 못할 가을의 추억을 선사할 것입니다. 많은 참여와 관심 부탁드립니다!', '2025-11-10 09:03:11'),
	(482, 3, NULL, '안녕?', '안녕하세요! 축제나 관광명소에 대해 궁금한 것이 있으시면 언제든 물어보세요! 😊', '2025-11-10 13:37:18'),
	(483, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the vibrant world of COEX? This amazing place in Gangnam is like the heart of Seoul\'s energy, hosting epic exhibitions, international conferences, and so much more! 💖 When we were preparing for our "Harmony of Light" concert, we visited COEX to soak in the dynamic atmosphere. The way the halls buzz with creativity and innovation reminds me of our own journey as artists! \n\nI’ll never forget the moment we performed at the COEX mall’s event space! The excitement from the crowd fueled our spirits, just like when we’re on stage fighting the darkness together. 💫✨ COEX isn’t just a convention center; it’s a legendary gathering spot where light warriors unite! So, next time you’re in Seoul, make sure to check it out and feel that incredible energy! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️🌙', '2025-11-11 00:14:24'),
	(484, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Are you ready to dive into the legendary vibes of Gyeongbokgung Palace? This place is not just a stunning architectural gem; it’s the heart of Seoul’s royal history! 👑 Built in 1395 by the great King Taejo, Gyeongbokgung was the main palace of the Joseon Dynasty, and it’s where the spirit of our ancestors, the light warriors, still lingers! \n\nWhen we were preparing for our \'Ancient Warriors\' concept, I spent countless hours here, soaking in the energy and history. The majestic gates and vibrant colors inspired our outfits and choreography! Every corner of this palace whispers stories of bravery and resilience, reminding us of our own journey as Demon Hunters. 💖 \n\nYou’ve got to visit this iconic spot and feel the energy for yourself. Stand in front of the Gyeonghoeru Pavilion, and let the spirit of the past empower you! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️🌙', '2025-11-11 00:14:37'),
	(485, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥💖 Are you ready to dive into the heart of Seoul? Let’s talk about Myeongdong Cathedral, the very first Roman Catholic church in Korea and a breathtaking Gothic masterpiece! 🌙✨ This legendary spot is not just a historical landmark but a sanctuary where the spirits of the past whisper their stories. \n\nI’ll never forget the first time we visited during our preparations for the \'Light in Darkness\' MV. The energy there was electric! ⚔️ The basement sanctuary, where the martyrs\' remains are enshrined, filled me with inspiration and respect. It’s a place where light and shadow dance together, reminding us of our mission as warriors against darkness. The cultural festival every May is like a celebration of our victories and the light we fight for! \n\nHunters, when you stand in front of this majestic cathedral, feel the echoes of history and let it ignite your own light! Let’s go and explore together! 🌟💫', '2025-11-11 00:14:48'),
	(486, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥💖 Let me take you on an epic journey to the Bukchon Asian Cultural Art Museum, a hidden gem nestled in the heart of Seoul’s Bukchon Hanok Village! 🌙✨ This museum isn’t just about art; it’s a magical space filled with the spirit of creativity, founded by the legendary Kwon Youngdu, who spent 30 years collecting incredible pieces from all over Asia! Just like our journey as Demon Hunters, it’s all about passion and dedication! \n\nWhen I first stepped into this traditional hanok-style museum, I felt the energy of countless artists who poured their souls into their work. I remember bringing the members here during our preparation for the "Art of Light" concept—every corner, every brushstroke inspired us to create something truly legendary! 🎨⚔️ \n\nIf you’re ever in Seoul, you HAVE to visit this place! Feel the energy, connect with the art, and let it inspire your own light warrior journey! Let’s go, Hunters! 💫🔥', '2025-11-11 00:14:56'),
	(487, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on an electrifying ride through the Hangang River Bus! This isn’t just any bus; it’s a floating adventure along the iconic Han River, where the energy of Seoul pulses through every wave! 🌊💖 \n\nImagine cruising past the stunning skyline, with the sun setting behind you, casting a golden glow on the water. It’s the perfect backdrop for some legendary moments! We came here during the filming of our "Moonlight Hunter" performance, and I’ll never forget the thrill of dancing on the river with the city lights reflecting like stars on the water. 🌙✨ This place truly embodies the spirit of balance between light and darkness, just like our journey as Demon Hunters! \n\nSo, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, hop on the Hangang River Bus and soak in that magical energy. Let’s ride together, feel the vibe, and make some unforgettable memories! 🚤⚔️ Let\'s go!', '2025-11-11 00:15:07'),
	(488, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on an epic ride with the Hangang River Bus! This isn’t just any bus, it\'s like a floating concert stage, gliding along the majestic Han River! 🚍🌊 Imagine watching the city skyline sparkle as the sun sets, the lights reflecting on the water like a million tiny stars – it’s pure magic! 🌙💖 \n\nWe came here during our “Moonlight Hunter” rehearsals, and the vibe was electric! I’ll never forget the moment we danced on Banpo Bridge, the music echoing against the backdrop of the city. The bus lets you soak in the beauty of Seoul while feeling that energy of light against the darkness. It’s where we clear our minds before comebacks and connect with our fans. So, grab your friends and hop on this legendary ride – let the Han River inspire your dreams, just like it inspires us! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 00:15:19'),
	(489, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥 Let me take you on a journey to one of the most legendary spots in Seoul – Myeongdong Cathedral! This isn’t just any cathedral; it’s the very FIRST Roman Catholic parish church in Korea, built in that stunning Gothic style we all love! 🏰✨ I remember the first time we visited during our "Eternal Light" album preparation. The atmosphere was so powerful, and standing in that small sanctuary where the martyrs are enshrined gave me chills. \n\nEvery May, they hold a cultural festival that lights up the whole area, just like our concerts! 🎤💖 The energy here is truly special. It reminds me of the strength we draw from our ancestors in our fight against darkness. So, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, make sure to pay your respects and soak in the vibes! Let’s go, Hunters! Feel the light! ⚔️🌙', '2025-11-11 00:15:33'),
	(490, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Seoul Tower', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥✨ Are you ready to dive into one of the most legendary spots in our beloved Seoul? Let me introduce you to N Seoul Tower, our ultimate watchtower! 🌙 This iconic landmark isn’t just a beautiful sight; it’s where we filmed the epic final battle scene of our "Light in Darkness" MV! Standing at 236.7 meters high, the observatory offers breathtaking panoramic views of the city, especially at night, when the lights twinkle like stars. 🌌\n\nEvery time I’m up there, I feel the pulse of Seoul’s energy and remember why we fight against the darkness. The night we shot our MV, the sunset was a masterpiece that inspired our next album concept! Plus, don’t forget about the locks of love—those iron railings are filled with dreams and promises, just like our journey as light warriors! 💖\n\nSo, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, make sure to visit N Seoul Tower and feel that incredible energy! Let’s keep spreading our light together! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 00:15:46'),
	(491, 3, NULL, '안녕 친구야', '안녕하세요! 축제나 관광명소에 대해 궁금한 것이 있으시면 언제든 물어보세요! 😊', '2025-11-11 00:18:50'),
	(492, 3, NULL, '안녕 친구야', '안녕하세요, 친구야! 😊\n\n2025년에 열리는 특별한 축제, <창경궁 야연>에 대해 소개해드릴게요! 이 축제는 \'효(孝)\'를 주제로 하며, 2025년 10월 3일부터 10월 9일까지 창경궁 문정전 일원에서 진행됩니다. 총 7일간 펼쳐지는 이 몰입형 야간 프로그램은 조선시대의 문무백관과 외명부가 되어 궁중 복식인 단령이나 당의를 입고 참여하는 독특한 경험을 제공합니다.\n\n참가자들은 가족과 함께 궁중 병과를 맛보고 다양한 전통예술공연도 관람할 수 있어요. 특히 올해는 부모님께 마음을 전하는 \'효심편지\' 쓰기와 부모님이 직접 주인공이 되어보는 \'효잡이 체험\' 같은 특별한 프로그램이 준비되어 있어, 가족이 함께 즐길 수 있는 기회가 더욱 강화되었습니다.\n\n이 축제는 10월 3일 금요일부터 시작해 10월 9일 목요일까지 진행되며, 개천절과 한글날이 포함된 가을 주간에 열려 더욱 의미가 깊습니다. \n\n가족과 함께 소중한 추억을 만들 수 있는 <2025 창경궁 야연>에 꼭 참여해 보세요! 궁금한 점이 있으면 언제든지 물어보세요. 😊', '2025-11-11 00:19:45'),
	(493, 3, NULL, 'recommend  best place in seoul', 'Yo! Hunters! 🔥💫 Lumi가 엄선한 10개의 전설적인 장소들이야! 각 장소마다 특별한 빛의 에너지가 있으니까 직접 체크해봐! 궁금한 곳 있으면 말해줘! Let\'s explore! 🌙✨', '2025-11-11 00:34:13'),
	(494, 3, NULL, 'Heonilleung vs Jeongdok Public Library which better', 'Yo Hunters! 🔥 Both Heonilleung and Jeongdok Public Library bring their own magic to the mix! Heonilleung is all about that historical vibe, with serene walking paths and gorgeous nature – perfect if you want to soak up some peace and connect with the past. 🌙✨ On the flip side, Jeongdok Public Library is a haven for book lovers, offering cozy reading nooks and a vibrant atmosphere – ideal if you\'re looking to dive into some literature while enjoying a lively scene! 📚💫\n\nIf I had to pick, I\'d recommend Jeongdok if you\'re into a more energetic vibe with a dash of creativity! But honestly, both spots have their charm, so you can\'t go wrong! Either way, soak up that Seoul energy and enjoy your adventure! ⚔️🔥', '2025-11-11 01:32:22'),
	(495, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Hey Hunters! 🎤💖 Are you ready for an adventure that’s going to ignite your taste buds and fill your hearts with joy? Let me take you to the incredible 서울바비큐페스타 happening on October 25-26 at the stunning 노을공원! 🌅✨\n\nThis festival is not just any ordinary food fest; it’s a culinary explosion celebrating the legendary K-BBQ culture that we all know and love! Imagine the most mouthwatering grilled meats, from premium 한우 to succulent 한돈, sizzling right in front of you, while the breathtaking sunset paints the sky in hues of orange and pink. It’s a feast for the eyes and the stomach! 🍖🔥\n\nYou know what’s super special? The last time we performed near 노을공원, the vibes were off the charts! I remember when we did our song “Demon Night” there; the energy from the crowd was electric, just like the excitement of trying out all that delicious K-BBQ! ⚔️💫 It felt like we were all connected, sharing a moment that was as savory as the food we were dreaming about afterward. \n\nAnd speaking of food, after a long day of demon hunting (our practices, of', '2025-11-11 02:15:03'),
	(496, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Seoul Tower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me tell you about the legendary N Seoul Tower! This iconic landmark is not just a tower; it’s our ULTIMATE watchtower! 🌙 When we filmed the epic final battle scene of \'Light in Darkness\' MV up there, I felt the energy of the city flowing through me. Standing at 236.7 meters high, I gazed over all of Seoul, and it was like I was connected to every light warrior out there! The night views? Absolutely breathtaking! 🌌 \n\nAnd those locks of love? They remind me of all the love and support we get from you, our amazing Hunters! 💖 Every time I visit, I’m inspired by the beautiful city lights that spread across the horizon, fueling our passion to fight the darkness. So, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, make sure to visit N Seoul Tower and feel that incredible energy! Let’s go, and together we’ll keep shining bright! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 03:50:35'),
	(497, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 💖 Let me take you on an epic journey to the Bukchon Asian Cultural Art Museum! This legendary spot is not just any museum; it\'s a treasure trove of Korean and Asian artwork, all housed in a stunning traditional hanok that whispers stories of the past! 🏯✨ \n\nWhen I first stepped into Bukchon Hanok Village, the energy was electric! It reminded me of our own journey as light warriors, bringing art and culture to life just like the founder, Kwon Youngdu, who dedicated 30 years to collect these masterpieces! 🎨🔥 I’ll never forget the moment we came here to brainstorm ideas for our "Cultural Warriors" MV. The vibrant colors and intricate designs inspired our stage outfits and choreography - it was like the spirits of the artists were guiding us! \n\nSo, if you want to feel the heartbeat of Seoul’s artistic soul and connect with the energy that fuels our music, you HAVE to visit this place! Let the art inspire you, and who knows? You might just find your own light within! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 03:50:45'),
	(498, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥✨ Let\'s dive into the magical world of Myeongdong Cathedral, a place that holds so much history and energy! This cathedral is not just the first Roman Catholic parish in Korea; it\'s the first Gothic building ever built here! Can you believe it? It started construction in 1892 and was completed in 1898, standing tall as a beacon of faith and culture. \n\nI remember visiting this incredible site during our preparation for the "Light in Darkness" MV. The atmosphere there is so powerful, especially in the small sanctuary where the martyrs\' remains are enshrined. I felt a deep connection to the light warriors who fought for their beliefs, just like us in Demon Hunters! 🌙💖 \n\nEvery May, Myeongdong Cathedral hosts a cultural festival, and I can\'t help but think how amazing it would be to perform there one day, sharing our message of light and hope with everyone! So, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, make sure to visit this legendary spot and soak in its incredible energy. Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 03:50:56'),
	(499, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥✨ Let me take you on an epic journey to the heart of Seoul, to the legendary Myeongdong Cathedral! This isn’t just a church; it’s the very first Roman Catholic parish in Korea, and it stands as a symbol of resilience and light! 🌙 Built between 1892 and 1898, its stunning Gothic architecture makes it a mesmerizing sight, especially when the sun sets and the lights illuminate its majestic spires! \n\nI’ll never forget the time we visited during the cultural festival in May! The energy was electric! 🎉 It reminded me of our own concerts, where the crowd becomes one with the music. The small sanctuary in the basement, where the martyrs are enshrined, carries a deep energy that connects us to the brave souls who fought for their beliefs. Just like we fight for our music and our fans, they fought for their light! \n\nDemon Hunters family, I encourage you to visit Myeongdong Cathedral and feel that powerful energy! It’s a place where history, culture, and spirit collide, and it’s a reminder that we are all warriors of light in our own right! Let’s go and embrace that legendary vibe together! ⚔️', '2025-11-11 03:51:09'),
	(500, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥💖 Are you ready to dive into one of Seoul\'s most legendary spots? Let me take you on a journey to COEX! 🌙✨ This amazing place isn’t just a hub for exhibitions and conferences; it\'s where the energy of creativity and innovation collides! We visited COEX during our preparations for the “Light in Darkness” album, and the atmosphere was electric! ⚡️\n\nWalking through the halls filled with art, culture, and food expos, I felt like we were gathering inspiration from all the light warriors around us. The way the modern architecture shines under the lights reminded me of our stage set-up during concerts! 🎤💫 Plus, the square outside often hosts incredible performances, just like we did in Hongdae, and it’s a perfect spot for fans to gather and celebrate! \n\nSo, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, you MUST check out COEX! Feel the vibrant energy, and who knows? You might just get inspired to join our fight against the darkness! Let’s go, Demon Hunters family! ⚔️🔥', '2025-11-11 03:51:20'),
	(501, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥💖 Let me take you on an epic journey to the Bukchon Asian Cultural Art Museum! This legendary spot is nestled right in the heart of Bukchon Hanok Village, where tradition meets creativity! 🏯✨ Founded by the amazing Kwon Youngdu, who spent 30 years collecting stunning artwork from Korea and across Asia, this museum is more than just a place to see art—it\'s a celebration of our rich cultural heritage! \n\nI remember the first time we visited while preparing for our "Cultural Warriors" concept. The energy of the traditional hanok architecture surrounding us sparked so many ideas for our costumes and choreography! 💫 The museum also offers activities like folk painting and traditional cooking—perfect for channeling your inner light warrior! 🌙 If you ever find yourself in Seoul, you HAVE to check it out and feel the magic of creativity and history! Let’s keep spreading those good vibes, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 03:51:30'),
	(502, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Seoul Tower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on a magical journey to N Seoul Tower, our ULTIMATE watchtower! 🌙 This iconic landmark isn’t just a stunning sight; it’s where we filmed the final battle scene of our legendary "Light in Darkness" MV! Can you imagine standing at 236.7 meters high, gazing over the dazzling lights of Seoul? That view is like a reminder of why we fight against the darkness! \n\nThe night we shot there was unforgettable—the sunset painted the sky with colors that sparked ideas for our next album! 💖 And let’s not forget about those Locks of Love! Each lock is a symbol of hope and connection, just like the bond we share as Hunters. So, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, make sure to visit N Seoul Tower and feel that electrifying energy! You’ll understand why this place holds a special place in our hearts! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 05:30:10'),
	(503, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 💖🔥 Let me take you on an epic journey to the Bukchon Asian Cultural Art Museum, a hidden gem nestled in the heart of Seoul! This place is LEGENDARY, showcasing stunning Korean and Asian artwork that tells stories of our rich culture. Just like our music, each piece resonates with passion and history! 🎨✨\n\nWhen I first stepped into this museum, I felt the energy of Kwon Youngdu, the founder, who dedicated 30 years to curating this treasure trove of art! It\'s like walking through a portal of inspiration, reminding me of our own journey as light warriors. The traditional hanok architecture adds to the magic, making it feel like a scene straight out of a fantasy world! \n\nThis museum is not just about art; it’s about connecting with our roots and celebrating creativity, just like we do in our performances. I encourage all you Hunters to visit and soak in the energy of Bukchon – let it ignite your own creativity! 💫✨ Let\'s keep hunting for inspiration together! 🔥⚔️', '2025-11-11 05:30:18'),
	(504, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan ower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥🎤 Let me take you on an epic journey to one of the most legendary spots in Seoul – the Namsan Cable Car! 🚠✨ This isn\'t just a ride; it\'s a gateway to our ULTIMATE watchtower, the N Seoul Tower! When we filmed the final battle scene of \'Light in Darkness\' MV, I felt the city’s energy pulsing beneath us as we soared to the peak! 🌙💫 \n\nIn just three minutes, you\'ll be treated to breathtaking views that change with the seasons – from the fiery autumn foliage to the magical snow-covered landscape in winter. And at night? Oh man, the city lights sparkle like stars, reminding us why we fight the darkness! Each time I stand at the observatory, I feel that electric connection to our mission as light warriors! \n\nSo, gather your courage, grab your friends, and let’s conquer Namsan together! You’ll feel that legendary energy coursing through you! Let’s go! ⚔️💖', '2025-11-11 05:30:35'),
	(505, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan ㅅower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the magic of Namsan Tower? 🌙 This legendary spot is our ULTIMATE watchtower! We filmed the final battle scene of our \'Light in Darkness\' MV at the very top, and let me tell you, standing there at 236.7 meters high, looking over all of Seoul is like feeling the pulse of the city’s energy! 💖✨ The city lights spread out like our dreams, reminding us of our mission to fight darkness. \n\nI still remember that sunset painting the sky in breathtaking colors, sparking inspiration for our next album concept. This isn’t just a romantic spot with Locks of Love; it’s where our journey as light warriors truly began! 🌌 So, when you visit, feel the energy and let it ignite your own dreams! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 05:30:44'),
	(506, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan tower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on an epic journey to our ULTIMATE watchtower: Namsan Seoul Tower! 🌙 This breathtaking 236.7-meter-tall tower isn’t just a beautiful landmark; it’s where we filmed the final battle scene of our ‘Light in Darkness’ MV! Every time I stand at that observatory, looking over the sparkling lights of Seoul, my heart races with the power of our journey as light warriors. 💖 \n\nThis tower is a symbol of love and good fortune, but for us, it represents resilience and hope! When we filmed there, the sunset painted the sky in colors that sparked our next album concept! 🌅 I want you all to visit and feel that incredible energy—it’s where our dreams began and where the light shines brightest! Let’s go and make some legendary memories together! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 05:30:53'),
	(507, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Seoul Tower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on a magical journey to one of Seoul\'s most legendary spots: N Seoul Tower! 🌙 This iconic landmark isn\'t just a tower; it\'s our ultimate watchtower! You know that epic final battle scene in our \'Light in Darkness\' MV? We filmed it right at the very top, 236.7 meters high! When I gaze over the sparkling city lights of Seoul at night, I feel that powerful connection to our mission as light warriors. \n\nThe view is breathtaking, and those locks of love? They symbolize the bonds we share as a family! 💖 I remember standing there, feeling the energy of the city, and it inspired our next album concept. So, if you ever visit, take a moment to soak in that vibe and feel the light energy that fuels our dreams! Let\'s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 05:31:14'),
	(508, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Tower', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙🔥 Are you ready to soar to new heights? Let me take you to our ULTIMATE watchtower, the legendary Namsan Seoul Tower! This 236.7-meter-tall giant isn’t just a beautiful sight; it’s where we filmed the final battle scene of our \'Light in Darkness\' MV! 💖 When I stand at the observatory, looking over the sparkling city lights of Seoul, I feel this incredible connection to our journey as light warriors. It’s a place where love and dreams intertwine, and the energy is just electric! ✨ So, if you want to feel the power of our story and experience the magic of this iconic spot, grab your friends and head up there! Let’s embrace the light together! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 05:31:31'),
	(509, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Tower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥 Let me take you to one of the most iconic spots in Seoul – Namsan Seoul Tower! 🌙 This legendary tower stands tall at 236.7 meters, perched on Namsan Mountain, and it\'s not just a stunning view; it’s where we filmed the epic final battle scene of our \'Light in Darkness\' MV! 💖 When I stand at the observatory, taking in the 360-degree view of our beloved city, I feel the energy of all the lights below, reminding me of our mission to fight against the darkness. ✨ \n\nThe vibes here are magical, especially at sunset when the sky is painted with colors that inspire our music! 🎤 This place holds a special connection to our journey as light warriors, symbolizing hope and love. So, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, make sure to visit Namsan Tower and soak in that energy! Let’s embrace the light together! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 05:40:05'),
	(510, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Seoul Tower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🌙✨ Let me take you on an electrifying journey to one of Seoul’s legendary landmarks: N Seoul Tower! This isn’t just any tower; it’s our ULTIMATE watchtower! 🔥 When we filmed the final battle scene of "Light in Darkness" MV there, standing at 236.7 meters high, I felt the city’s energy surge through me. The panoramic night views are breathtaking, with the city lights twinkling like stars below, reminding us why we fight against the darkness! 💖 And those locks of love? They symbolize the unbreakable bonds we share with you, our Hunters! \n\nEvery time I gaze out from the observatory, I’m reminded of our journey and the light we strive to spread. I encourage you all to visit this magical place, feel the vibes, and maybe even leave your own lock to symbolize your love! Let’s keep shining together! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 05:40:18'),
	(511, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Seoul Tower', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥✨ Let me take you on an epic journey to one of Seoul\'s most legendary spots: N Seoul Tower! 🌙 This place is our ULTIMATE watchtower! We filmed the final battle scene of our "Light in Darkness" MV right at the very top, and when I stand there, 236.7 meters high, it’s like I’m connected to the energy of the city itself. Every time I gaze over Seoul\'s sparkling lights, I remember why we fight the darkness – it’s pure inspiration! \n\nBut that’s not all – the tower is adorned with those beautiful locks of love, where couples fasten their dreams and promises. 💖 It’s a reminder of the bonds we share as a Demon Hunters family. I’ll never forget the sunset that painted the sky in breathtaking colors the night we filmed there; it ignited ideas for our next album concept! So, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, make sure to visit N Seoul Tower and feel that legendary energy. Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 05:40:54'),
	(512, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into an amazing experience? Let me introduce you to the **Hangang River Bus**! 🚍💫 This is not just any bus ride; it’s a journey along the beautiful Han River, where the city’s energy flows like our beats! 🌊✨ \n\nImagine cruising on the water, surrounded by the stunning skyline of Seoul! We’ve had some legendary moments here, especially when we filmed a part of our “Moonlight Hunter” performance! 🌙💖 The reflections of the city lights on the river remind me of all the light warriors who’ve battled darkness with us. \n\nThis place is special because it brings us together, just like our music does. It’s where we clear our minds and connect with the city’s spirit before a comeback. So, I urge you, Demon Hunters family, to hop on the Hangang River Bus and feel that magic for yourselves! Let’s go! ⚔️💖', '2025-11-11 05:49:37'),
	(513, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on an epic journey to Myeongdong Cathedral, the very first Roman Catholic parish church in Korea! This place is not just a stunning Gothic masterpiece, but it’s also a historical treasure where the spirit of courage and faith shines bright! 🕊️💖\n\nI remember we came here during the filming of our \'Light in Darkness\' MV, seeking inspiration from its powerful energy. The moment I stepped inside, my heart raced as I felt the echoes of the martyrs’ stories surround us. The peaceful sanctuary in the basement is a reminder of the struggles that light warriors have faced throughout history. 🌙⚔️\n\nEvery May, this cathedral bursts alive with a cultural festival, and you can feel the vibrant energy that connects every soul who visits! If you ever find yourself in Seoul, you have to feel this legendary atmosphere for yourself—it\'s like a beacon of hope and resilience! Let’s go, Hunters, and embrace the light that guides us! 💫🎤', '2025-11-11 05:58:07'),
	(514, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Tower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you to our ULTIMATE watchtower: Namsan Seoul Tower! Standing tall at 236.7 meters, this iconic tower isn’t just a pretty sight; it’s where we filmed the epic final battle scene of our "Light in Darkness" MV! 🌙 When I’m up there, looking over all of Seoul, I feel the pulsating energy of the city lights reminding us why we fight against the darkness. Each sparkle in the distance whispers our story of resilience and hope! 💖\n\nAnd let me tell you, the view from the observatory is absolutely breathtaking—360 degrees of pure magic! 🌌 This place is not just a romantic spot for lovers and “Locks of Love,” it’s a sacred ground where our journey as light warriors began. I’ll never forget the sunset that painted the sky with colors that sparked our next album concept. So, Hunters, if you ever get the chance, visit Namsan Tower and let that energy fuel your own dreams! Let’s go! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 05:59:56'),
	(515, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Se Tower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you to our ULTIMATE watchtower, the legendary Namsan Seoul Tower! 🌙 Standing tall at 236.7 meters, this iconic spot isn’t just a romantic getaway; it’s where we filmed the epic final battle scene of our ‘Light in Darkness’ MV! When I stand at the observatory, gazing over the sparkling lights of Seoul, I feel the pulse of the city\'s energy and the strength of our journey as light warriors. 💖 The breathtaking 360-degree view hits differently, reminding us why we fight against the darkness. So whether you\'re locking your love on those famous locks or soaking in that amazing skyline, this place is a must-visit! Let’s go and feel the magic together! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 06:02:18'),
	(516, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Seoul Tower', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to explore one of the most legendary spots in Seoul? Let me introduce you to **Namsan Seoul Tower**! This iconic tower stands tall at 236.7 meters, perched on the summit of Namsan Mountain. It’s not just a romantic getaway; it’s our **ULTIMATE watchtower**! 🌙✨ Do you remember when we filmed the final battle scene of "Light in Darkness" MV at the very top? The view from up there is breathtaking—360 degrees of Seoul\'s vibrant energy! \n\nStanding at that height, I felt the pulse of the city beneath me, reminding me of our journey as light warriors. 💖 Every time I see those sparkling city lights, it ignites my spirit to fight the darkness! This tower is more than just a symbol; it’s where our story began! So, come and feel the energy yourself, and let’s rise together as one! 🔥⚔️ Let\'s go, Hunters!', '2025-11-11 06:03:31'),
	(517, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Seoul Tower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥💖 Let me take you on an epic journey to Namsan Seoul Tower, our ULTIMATE watchtower! 🌙 This iconic 236.7-meter tower is not just a breathtaking landmark; it’s where we filmed the final battle scene of our "Light in Darkness" MV! The energy up there is unreal! When I stand at the observatory, looking over ALL of Seoul from 480 meters above sea level, I feel the city’s light energy flowing through me. 🌟 \n\nThe view is like a canvas painted with dreams and memories, reminding us why we fight the darkness. Every time we see those sparkling city lights, it ignites our passion for music and our mission as light warriors! I’ll never forget the sunset that inspired our next album concept—those colors were pure magic! ✨ \n\nSo, Hunters, when you visit Namsan Tower, feel that energy and remember: we’re all part of this legendary journey together! Let’s go! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 06:04:09'),
	(518, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Seoul Tower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you to one of our most legendary spots in Seoul - Namsan Seoul Tower! This iconic tower stands tall at 236.7 meters, giving us the ultimate view of the city from the summit of Namsan Mountain. 🌙 Remember when we filmed the final battle scene of our \'Light in Darkness\' MV there? The sunset painted the sky in breathtaking colors that inspired our next album concept! 😍 When I gaze over the twinkling city lights, it fills my heart with the energy of all the battles we’ve fought and the love we share as light warriors. 💖 Trust me, you have to visit and feel that powerful connection - it’s where our journey truly began! Let’s go! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 06:04:20'),
	(519, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Seoul Tower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you on an adventure to one of the most iconic spots in Seoul: Namsan Seoul Tower! 🌙 This stunning 236.7-meter tower isn’t just a lookout point; it’s our ultimate watchtower! I’ll never forget the night we filmed the final battle scene of our \'Light in Darkness\' MV up there. The sunset painted the sky in breathtaking colors that inspired our next album concept! 💖 \n\nStanding at the observatory, 480 meters above sea level, I feel a powerful connection to the city’s energy. Those sparkling lights remind us why we fight the darkness! 🌌 Namsan Tower is a symbol of love and hope, and it holds a special place in our hearts as light warriors. So if you ever visit, take a moment to soak in that magical atmosphere and let it fuel your dreams! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 06:16:52'),
	(520, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Seoul Tower', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Are you ready to explore one of the most legendary spots in Seoul? Let’s talk about Namsan Seoul Tower! 🌙 This iconic tower stands tall at 236.7 meters, and from its summit, we get an incredible 360-degree view of our beloved city, soaring high at 480 meters above sea level! It’s not just a landmark; it’s our ultimate watchtower! \n\nI’ll never forget the night we filmed the final battle scene of our "Light in Darkness" MV at the very top! 🗡️ The sunset painted the sky in hues that inspired our next album concept, and standing there, looking over the city lights, I felt the energy of our journey as light warriors. This place is filled with romance and magic, but for us, it’s a reminder of why we fight against the darkness! 💖 \n\nSo, when you visit Namsan Tower, feel that energy! Embrace the lights of Seoul and let them ignite your spirit! Let’s go, Hunters! 💫🔥', '2025-11-11 06:17:22'),
	(521, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🎤✨ Are you ready to explore one of Seoul\'s most legendary spots? Let me take you to N Seoul Tower at night! 🌙 This place isn\'t just a stunning landmark; it\'s our ULTIMATE watchtower! Remember when we filmed the final battle scene of \'Light in Darkness\' MV? Standing at 236.7 meters high, the panoramic views of the city lit up like a galaxy remind me of our journey as light warriors! 💖 \n\nAs the sun sets, the sky transforms into a canvas of colors, inspiring our next album concepts! And those Locks of Love? They symbolize the bonds we share as a family, just like us! 💫 This tower captures the energy of Seoul and our fight against darkness. I can’t wait for you all to experience this magic! Let\'s go and feel that light energy together! 🔥⚔️', '2025-11-11 06:17:44'),
	(522, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Namsan Seoul Tower', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙✨ Are you ready to dive into the magic of one of Seoul\'s most iconic spots? Let’s talk about N Seoul Tower, our ULTIMATE watchtower! 🗼🔥\n\nThis place isn’t just a tower; it’s where we filmed the final battle scene of our "Light in Darkness" MV! Can you believe it? Standing at a dizzying height of 236.7 meters, the observatory offers breathtaking panoramic views of our beautiful city, and let me tell you, the night views are nothing short of legendary! 🌌 When I look out at the shimmering lights of Seoul, it feels like the energy of all our fans is flowing through the city, reminding me why we fight the darkness together. Every twinkling light is a symbol of hope and strength!\n\nI’ll never forget the night we filmed there. The sunset painted the sky in vibrant oranges and purples, inspiring the entire concept for our next album! 🎨✨ And let’s not forget about the Locks of Love! Couples from all over fasten their dreams to the iron railings, but for us, it symbolizes the unbreakable bond between our Demon Hunters family and our mission to spread light. 💖\n\nThis', '2025-11-11 06:25:50'),
	(523, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥💖 Let me take you on an incredible journey to Gyeongbokgung Palace, the heart of Seoul and the majestic symbol of our history! Built in 1395, this legendary palace was the main stage for the Joseon Dynasty, and it totally inspired our \'Ancient Warriors\' concept! 👑✨ When I walked through those grand gates, I could feel the spirits of the light warriors who protected the kingdom centuries ago. The intricate architecture and vibrant colors reminded me of the epic scenes we filmed for our next MV, where we channeled the power of the past into our fierce dance moves! \n\nEvery corner of Gyeongbokgung pulsates with energy, and I always bring the members here when we need to connect with our roots and recharge our spirits. So, if you want to feel that ancient energy and be inspired like we are, you gotta visit this legendary place! Let’s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 06:27:39'),
	(524, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the magic of the Hangang River Bus? This is not just any bus ride; it\'s an adventure on the iconic Han River! 🌊 The Hangang River Bus takes you on a journey through Seoul, with stunning views of the city and a chance to feel the energy of the river that separates light from darkness. \n\nWe often come here to clear our minds before a big comeback or to celebrate after a successful performance. The gentle waves and the shimmering city lights remind me of our battles as light warriors! 🌙✨ I’ll never forget the time we took a ride just before filming a special performance video. The energy was electric, and the reflections on the water felt like our dreams were dancing with us! \n\nSo, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, hop on the Hangang River Bus! Experience the beauty, feel the vibes, and let the river’s energy inspire you just like it inspires us! Let\'s go, Hunters! ⚔️💖', '2025-11-11 06:27:51'),
	(525, 3, NULL, 'tell me about korean travel tips', 'Hey Hunters! 💫 Ready to dive into the vibrant world of Korean travel? Here are some sizzling tips to make your adventure unforgettable! 🌙 First off, mastering the subway system is a game-changer! It\'s super efficient and covers almost every corner of Seoul. Grab a T-money card for easy access; just tap and go! 🚇✨ \n\nNow, when it comes to food, you can\'t miss trying **tteokbokki** (spicy rice cakes) from street vendors in Myeongdong—they\'re to die for! 😋 Also, don\'t forget to visit a **jjimjilbang** (Korean sauna) for a unique cultural experience. Just remember to take off your shoes before entering—it\'s all about respect! 👣⚔️ \n\nAs for language, a simple "안녕하세요!" (Annyeonghaseyo) goes a long way in making locals smile! 😍 And if you’re out shopping, always have some cash on hand, but credit cards are widely accepted too. Trust me, Hunters, with these tips, you\'re gonna slay your trip! Let’s go! 🔥✨', '2025-11-11 07:00:55'),
	(526, 3, NULL, 'mifia body', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let me take you to a place full of history and amazing vibes - Malli-dong! Just a stone\'s throw away from Seoul Station, this legendary neighborhood is where the past meets the present. Since the opening of Seoullo 7071, the sky garden has brought a fresh energy to the area, making it the perfect spot for us light warriors to recharge! 🌙\n\nWhen we were preparing for our \'Urban Legends\' album, we came here for inspiration. The blend of trendy coffee shops and delicious local food reminded me of the diverse backgrounds of our members. Each bite is like a burst of creativity! 💖 Plus, the historic charm of Malli-dong connects us to the spirit of Seoul\'s past, just like our mission to protect the light! So, next time you\'re in Seoul, let\'s explore Malli-dong together and soak up that energy! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-11 08:00:49'),
	(527, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the magic of the Hangang River Bus? 🚍💖 This amazing ride whisks you along the beautiful Han River, connecting you to the heart and soul of Seoul! Imagine cruising past iconic sights, feeling the refreshing breeze, and soaking in the vibrant energy of the city. 🌊✨\n\nWe’ve had some legendary moments here! I remember when we filmed a special behind-the-scenes clip for our "River Warriors" concept. The way the sun set over the water, painting a golden path, inspired our choreography for "Eternal Light." 🌅🔥 This bus isn\'t just a mode of transport; it\'s a journey through the stories of our city and our music!\n\nSo, whether you\'re commuting or just exploring, hop on the Hangang River Bus and feel the pulse of Seoul! Let\'s make some memories, Hunters! 💫⚔️', '2025-11-12 05:52:17'),
	(528, 3, NULL, 'Gangnam Korean BBQ', 'Gangnam Korean BBQ는 고급스러운 분위기 속에서 신선한 재료로 만든 고기 구이를 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다. 특히 갈비와 삼겹살이 인기 메뉴로, 직접 구워 먹는 재미가 쏠쏠합니다. 강남역에서 도보로 5분 거리에 위치해 있어 접근성이 뛰어나며, 친구들과의 모임이나 특별한 날에 방문하기 좋은 레스토랑입니다. 맛있는 고기와 함께 즐거운 시간을 보내보세요!', '2025-11-12 05:52:27'),
	(529, 3, NULL, 'Gwangjang Market food', '광장시장은 서울의 전통 시장 중 하나로, 다양한 길거리 음식으로 유명합니다. 특히 빈대떡과 마약김밥이 인기 메뉴로, 현지 식사 경험을 제대로 느낄 수 있습니다. 광장시장은 동대문역에서 가까워 지하철로 쉽게 접근할 수 있어요. 다양한 맛을 한 자리에서 즐길 수 있는 매력적인 장소입니다!', '2025-11-12 05:52:40'),
	(530, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Yo, Demon Hunters family! 🔥✨ Let\'s talk about the legendary N Seoul Tower at night! This iconic landmark isn’t just a tower; it’s our ULTIMATE watchtower! 🌙 Do you remember when we filmed the epic final battle scene of our \'Light in Darkness\' MV there? Standing at 236.7 meters high, the panoramic views of the sparkling city lights remind me of our mission to fight the darkness! 🌌💖 \n\nThe atmosphere up there is electric, especially when the sun sets and paints the sky in colors that inspire our music! And don’t forget about the locks of love—each one tells a story, just like ours! 💞 This place is where our journey as light warriors began, and every time I visit, I feel that same energy flowing through me! So, Hunters, if you ever find yourself in Seoul, make sure to visit N Seoul Tower at night! Feel that magic and let it ignite your passion! Let’s go! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-12 05:53:05'),
	(531, 3, NULL, 'Gangnam Korean BBQ', '이 레스토랑은 강남에서 진정한 한국 BBQ를 경험할 수 있는 곳으로 유명합니다. 특히 신선한 고기를 즉석에서 구워 먹는 불고기와 삼겹살이 인기가 많습니다. 강남역 10번 출구에서 도보로 5분 거리에 위치해 있어 접근하기 편리합니다. 친구들과 함께 즐거운 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤인 장소입니다!', '2025-11-12 05:53:19'),
	(532, 3, NULL, 'Itaewon restaurants', '이태원의 레스토랑 중 하나인 "부산아지매"는 신선한 해산물 요리로 유명합니다. 특히, 그들의 해물파전과 매운탕은 꼭 시도해봐야 할 인기 메뉴입니다. 이 레스토랑은 이태원역에서 도보로 5분 거리에 위치해 있어 접근성이 뛰어납니다. 다양한 맛과 분위기를 즐기며 여유로운 시간을 보내기 좋은 곳입니다.', '2025-11-12 05:53:32'),
	(533, 3, NULL, 'Itaewon restaurants', '이태원의 레스토랑 중 하나인 \'부산아구찜\'은 매콤하고 깊은 맛의 아구찜으로 유명합니다. 신선한 재료를 사용해 매일 조리되며, 해산물과 채소가 조화를 이루는 맛이 일품이에요. 이곳은 이태원역에서 도보로 5분 거리에 위치해 있어 쉽게 찾을 수 있습니다. 친구들과 함께 맛있는 아구찜을 즐기며 특별한 시간을 보내보세요!', '2025-11-12 06:10:54'),
	(534, 3, NULL, 'Hongdae food scene', '홍대의 음식 씬은 다양성과 창의성으로 가득 차 있습니다. 그 중에서도 \'홍대 맛집\'은 아기자기한 인테리어와 함께 퓨전 요리로 유명합니다. 특히, 이곳의 \'김치볶음밥\'과 \'떡볶이 피자\'는 꼭 맛봐야 할 인기 메뉴입니다. 홍대입구역 9번 출구에서 도보로 5분 거리에 위치해 있어 쉽게 접근할 수 있습니다. 다양한 맛을 즐기고 싶다면 홍대를 꼭 방문해 보세요!', '2025-11-12 06:11:06'),
	(535, 3, NULL, 'Hongdae food scene', '홍대는 다양한 음식으로 가득한 핫플레이스입니다. 특히, \'홍대 마포갈비\'는 숯불에 구운 갈비가 일품으로, 고소한 맛이 일품이에요. 또한, \'홍대 떡볶이\'는 매콤한 소스와 쫄깃한 떡이 조화로운 인기 메뉴입니다. 홍대입구역에서 도보로 5분 거리에 위치해 있어 쉽게 찾아갈 수 있습니다. 다양한 맛을 경험하며 즐거운 식사 시간을 가져보세요!', '2025-11-12 06:23:44'),
	(536, 3, NULL, 'Itaewon restaurants', '이태원에는 다양한 매력을 가진 레스토랑들이 많아요! "부엌"은 아시아 퓨전 요리로 유명하며, 특히 그들의 \'갈비찜\'이 많은 사랑을 받고 있습니다. 이곳은 이태원역에서 도보로 5분 거리에 위치해 있어 접근성이 좋습니다. 또 다른 추천은 "리틀 이탈리"로, 신선한 파스타와 피자가 인기 메뉴예요. 이 레스토랑은 이태원역에서 가까운 골목에 숨겨져 있어 아늑한 분위기를 즐길 수 있습니다. 다양한 선택지로 이태원에서 특별한 식사를 경험해보세요!', '2025-11-12 06:38:12'),
	(537, 3, NULL, 'Hongdae food scene', '홍대의 음식 씬은 다양한 맛과 분위기로 가득 차 있습니다. 특히 "홍대 떡볶이"는 매콤한 소스와 쫄깃한 떡의 조화로 유명합니다. 이곳은 홍대입구역에서 도보로 5분 거리에 위치해 있어 쉽게 접근할 수 있습니다. 또 다른 인기 장소인 "홍대 핫도그"는 바삭한 식감과 다양한 토핑으로 많은 사랑을 받고 있습니다. 다양한 먹거리를 즐기며 홍대의 활기찬 분위기를 만끽해보세요!', '2025-11-12 06:48:06'),
	(538, 3, NULL, 'Hongdae food scene', '홍대는 다양한 음식으로 가득한 핫플레이스입니다! 특히 \'홍대 떡볶이\'는 매콤달콤한 소스에 쫄깃한 떡이 일품으로, 많은 사랑을 받고 있어요. 또, \'홍대 핫도그\'는 바삭한 튀김옷과 다양한 토핑으로 인기 만점입니다. 홍대는 지하철 2호선 홍대입구역과 가까워 접근성이 뛰어나니, 친구들과 함께 가볍게 들러보세요!', '2025-11-12 06:53:03'),
	(539, 3, NULL, 'Itaewon restaurants', '이태원에는 다양한 매력을 가진 레스토랑들이 가득해요! 그 중 \'부엌\'은 한국식 양식과 퓨전 메뉴로 유명한 곳입니다. 특히 불고기 파스타가 인기인데, 한국의 맛과 이탈리아의 풍미가 조화를 이루죠. 이 레스토랑은 이태원역에서 도보로 5분 거리에 위치해 있어 접근도 아주 편리해요. 친구들과 함께 특별한 저녁을 즐기기에 좋은 장소랍니다!', '2025-11-12 07:00:40'),
	(540, 3, NULL, '"Loyadie"', 'Loyadie는 아늑하고 세련된 분위기로 유명한 레스토랑입니다. 특히 그들의 인기 메뉴인 \'트러플 리조또\'는 깊고 풍부한 맛으로 많은 사랑을 받고 있습니다. 위치는 서울 강남구의 중심지에 있어 대중교통 이용이 편리하며, 주변에 다양한 쇼핑과 문화시설이 있어 식사 후 즐길 거리가 많습니다. 특별한 날이나 소중한 사람과의 데이트에 추천드립니다!', '2025-11-12 07:01:08'),
	(541, 3, NULL, '로야디', '로야디는 아시아와 유럽의 퓨전 요리를 선보이는 독특한 레스토랑입니다. 특히, 그들의 시그니처 메뉴인 \'로야디 파스타\'는 신선한 재료와 특별한 소스로 많은 사랑을 받고 있습니다. 서울 강남구에 위치해 있어 대중교통으로 쉽게 접근할 수 있으며, 분위기 좋은 인테리어가 매력적입니다. 친구나 연인과 함께 특별한 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤인 곳이에요!', '2025-11-12 07:01:33'),
	(542, 3, NULL, 'Hongdae food scene', '홍대는 다양한 음식과 독특한 분위기로 유명한 핫플레이스입니다. 특히 \'홍대 떡볶이\'는 매콤하고 쫄깃한 맛으로 많은 사랑을 받고 있습니다. 또한, \'비건 피자\'를 제공하는 레스토랑도 있어 건강을 생각하는 분들에게 인기가 많습니다. 홍대입구역에서 도보로 5분 거리에 위치해 있어 접근성이 뛰어나고, 다양한 카페와 함께 즐길 수 있는 멋진 곳입니다. 홍대에서의 맛있는 경험을 놓치지 마세요!', '2025-11-12 07:04:58'),
	(543, 3, NULL, '로야디', '로야디는 이국적인 인도 요리를 제공하는 매력적인 레스토랑입니다. 특히 그들의 커리와 난은 많은 사람들에게 사랑받고 있으며, 진한 향신료 맛이 일품입니다. 서울 강남구에 위치해 있어 대중교통으로 쉽게 접근할 수 있으며, 아늑한 분위기에서 색다른 미식을 즐기기에 안성맞춤입니다. 친구들과 함께 특별한 저녁을 즐기기에 좋은 장소입니다!', '2025-11-12 07:05:14'),
	(544, 3, NULL, '"Loyadie"', '"Loyadie는 독특한 분위기와 아늑한 인테리어로 유명한 프랑스식 레스토랑입니다. 특히 신선한 재료로 만든 \'부야베스\'와 \'크렘 브륄레\'가 인기 메뉴로 손꼽힙니다. 서울 강남구에 위치하고 있어 대중교통으로도 쉽게 접근할 수 있습니다. 맛있는 프랑스 요리를 즐기고 싶다면 꼭 방문해보세요!"', '2025-11-12 07:05:41'),
	(545, 3, NULL, '"Loyadie"', 'Loyadie는 아늑한 분위기와 독창적인 메뉴로 유명한 레스토랑입니다. 특히 그들의 시그니처 메뉴인 \'트러플 리조또\'는 깊고 풍부한 맛으로 많은 사랑을 받고 있습니다. 서울의 중심가인 강남역 근처에 위치해 있어 대중교통으로 쉽게 접근할 수 있습니다. 친구들과의 소중한 시간이나 특별한 날에 방문하기 좋은 곳입니다!', '2025-11-12 07:05:53'),
	(546, 3, NULL, '로야디', '로야디는 정통 인도 요리를 경험할 수 있는 멋진 레스토랑입니다. 특히 버터 치킨과 난이 인기가 많아 많은 손님들이 찾는 메뉴입니다. 서울 강남구에 위치해 있어 대중교통으로도 쉽게 접근할 수 있습니다. 인도식 분위기 속에서 다양한 향신료의 맛을 즐겨보세요!', '2025-11-12 07:08:13'),
	(547, 3, NULL, 'Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch', '브루스리는 북경오리 전문점 마오에서 운영하는 딤섬과 국수 전문점으로, 캐주얼한 분위기에서 서민 중식을 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다. 특히 삼선 찐만두와 우육면이 인기 메뉴로, 맛과 가성비를 모두 갖춘 곳입니다. 서울 서초구 양재천로 147-1에 위치해 있어 양재역에서 가까워 접근성이 좋습니다. 다양한 국수와 딤섬을 한자리에서 맛볼 수 있는 브루스리에서 특별한 미식을 경험해보세요!', '2025-11-12 07:14:48'),
	(548, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Yo music lovers! 🎤✨ Are you ready to embark on an unforgettable adventure to the legendary N Seoul Tower at night? 🌙 This iconic landmark, standing tall at 236.7 meters, is not just a viewing platform; it\'s the heartbeat of Seoul\'s vibrant K-pop culture! Imagine standing at the top, surrounded by breathtaking views of the city illuminated like a dazzling stage, where every light represents a K-pop dream in the making. \n\nIn the Demon Hunters mythology, N Seoul Tower is our central watchtower, where the magical energy of Seoul’s music converges! 🔥💫 Every lock of love fastened to its iron railings symbolizes the unbreakable bond between fans and their favorite idols, echoing the deep emotional connections we share through music. This is where our musical warriors unite, celebrating love and passion under the starry sky! \n\nSo, fellow Hunters, let’s rise to this legendary heights together and feel the pulse of Seoul’s music scene! ✨🔥 Don’t miss out on this epic experience—let\'s go! 💖⚔️', '2025-11-12 07:32:43'),
	(549, 3, NULL, '"Loyadie"', '로야디는 한국 전통 요소를 활용한 퓨전 디저트를 전문으로 하는 수제 디저트 카페입니다. 인기 메뉴로는 미니 떡 케이크와 설기 마들렌이 있으며, 아침 식사로 적합한 떡 샌드위치도 판매합니다. 서초구 반포대로21길 57에 위치해 있어, 대중교통 이용 시 접근이 용이합니다. 독특한 디저트를 즐기고 싶다면 꼭 방문해 보세요!', '2025-11-12 07:34:10'),
	(550, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong Kyoja restaurant', '모녀김밥은 광장시장에서 꼭 가봐야 할 김밥의 원조집입니다. 40년 넘게 사랑받아온 이곳은 겨자소스와 함께 먹는 김밥으로 유명합니다. 김밥 속재료가 풍부하고 맛이 깊어 한 입 먹으면 반할 수밖에 없죠. 위치는 서울 종로구 동호로 403-23 (예지동)으로, 광장시장과 가까워 접근성이 뛰어납니다. 맛있는 김밥을 즐기고 싶다면 모녀김밥을 추천합니다!', '2025-11-12 07:49:51'),
	(551, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to uncover the legendary vibes of Myeongdong Cathedral? This iconic spot isn’t just the first Roman Catholic parish in Korea; it’s also the very first Gothic building in the land of K-pop! 🌙✨ Imagine stepping into a place where history meets spirituality, and the echoes of devotion resonate just like our favorite K-pop anthems. \n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, Myeongdong Cathedral stands as a sacred fortress where the spirits of musical martyrs inspire us to chase our dreams! 💖 Every May, it hosts a cultural festival that lights up the streets, much like a K-pop concert, bringing together fans and artists in a celebration of creativity and unity! 🎤💫 \n\nSo, gather your fellow music lovers and visit this amazing location to feel the energy and history that pulses through Seoul! Let’s go make some unforgettable memories! ⚔️🌟', '2025-11-12 07:50:42'),
	(552, 3, NULL, 'Gwangjang Market food', '제주미향해장은 청량리 경동시장에서 유명한 소고기 해장국 맛집입니다. 이곳의 해장국은 푹 고아낸 진한 육수와 푸짐한 선지, 신선한 우거지가 가득 담겨 있어 많은 사랑을 받고 있습니다. 상인들뿐만 아니라 지역 주민들과 MZ세대들도 자주 찾는 인기 있는 장소로, 02573 서울 동대문구 경동시장로10길 46 1층에 위치해 있어 접근이 용이합니다. 해장국의 깊은 맛을 경험해보세요!', '2025-11-12 07:51:52'),
	(553, 3, NULL, 'Gwangjang Market food', '제주미향해장은 청량리 경동시장에서 유명한 소고기 해장국 맛집입니다. 진한 육수에 푸짐한 선지와 신선한 우거지가 가득 담긴 해장국이 특히 인기입니다. 이곳은 상인들뿐만 아니라 지역 주민과 MZ세대에게도 입소문이 나 있어요. 서울 동대문구 경동시장로10길 46 1층에 위치해 있어 접근하기도 아주 편리합니다. 맛있는 해장국으로 속을 풀고 싶다면 꼭 방문해 보세요!', '2025-11-12 07:54:15'),
	(554, 3, NULL, 'Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch', '브루스리는 북경오리 전문점 마오에서 운영하는 딤섬과 국수 전문점으로, 캐주얼한 분위기에서 서민 중식을 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다. 특히 삼선 찐만두와 우육면이 인기 메뉴로, 맛있는 한 끼를 원하시는 분들께 추천드립니다. 서울 서초구 양재천로에 위치해 있어 접근도 편리하며, 가격대도 1만원대라 부담 없이 방문하기 좋습니다. 맛있는 중식을 찾고 계신다면 꼭 한 번 들러보세요!', '2025-11-12 07:57:02'),
	(555, 3, NULL, 'Forest of Music', '음악의 숲은 LP판으로 가득한 벽면이 인상적인 독특한 카페입니다. 이곳에서는 비틀즈의 그림과 함께 DJ가 직접 음악을 선곡해주며, 과거의 감성을 느낄 수 있습니다. 특히, 다양한 음료와 디저트가 준비되어 있어 친구들과 함께 즐기기 좋습니다. 서울 중구 동호로 192에 위치해 있어 대중교통으로 쉽게 접근할 수 있습니다. 음악과 함께 특별한 시간을 보내보세요!', '2025-11-12 07:58:34'),
	(556, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong Kyoja restaurant', 'Myeongdong Kyoja is renowned for its handmade knife-cut noodles and delicious dumplings. Their signature dish, Kyoja (dumpling soup), is a must-try! Located in the bustling Myeongdong area, it\'s easily accessible via public transport. Enjoy a warm meal in this cozy spot!', '2025-11-12 08:13:50'),
	(557, 3, NULL, 'Forest of Music', '🌟 Welcome, fellow food warriors! If you\'re ready to embark on a legendary journey through the heart of Seoul, then we must make a pit stop at **음악의 숲 (Forest of Music)**! 🎶 This magical café is not just a place to grab a bite—it\'s a sanctuary for the soul, filled with LPs that tell the stories of our favorite K-pop legends! 🎤✨ Imagine fueling up like your favorite idols, surrounded by vibrant art of The Beatles and a DJ spinning tracks that resonate with our hearts. \n\nHere, we can recharge our energy like true Demon Hunters, gathering to share our love for music and delicious bites. 🍽️🔥 The atmosphere is alive with the rhythm of creativity, making it the perfect spot to connect with fellow Hunters and discover the hidden gems of Seoul\'s food scene. So, let’s dive into this auditory feast and make memories that will echo through time! ⚔️💫 Let\'s go!', '2025-11-12 12:22:09'),
	(558, 3, NULL, 'Eulji Tea Room', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into a hidden gem of Seoul that holds the whispers of history and the heartbeat of our beloved K-pop culture? Let\'s talk about **Uireung**, the royal tomb of King Gyeongjong and Queen Seonui! 🌙✨ Nestled within the artistic grounds of the Korea National University of Arts, this place is not just a resting ground for royalty but a testament to the deep-rooted stories that inspire our favorite K-pop idols. \n\nImagine this: Uireung’s unique layout, with the king and queen’s tombs placed front to back, symbolizes a legendary connection that transcends time, just like the powerful bonds we see in K-dramas and MVs! 💖 In the Demon Hunters mythology, this sacred space could be viewed as a hidden sanctuary where music warriors seek inspiration from the past, channeling the love and devotion of the royal couple into their performances. 🎤🔥 \n\nSo grab your friends and visit Uireung to feel the energy of Seoul’s royal history intertwined with the vibrant spirit of K-pop! It’s a legendary journey waiting for you, and you won\'t want to miss it! Let’s go and uncover the secrets of this magical place together!', '2025-11-12 12:22:45'),
	(559, 3, NULL, 'Texas de Brazil', '🔥 Hey there, fellow food warriors! Are you ready to embark on a legendary culinary quest at **텍사스 데 브라질**? Located in the heart of Seoul, this sizzling haven serves up the ultimate Brazilian churrasco, where the flavors are as bold as our favorite K-pop anthems! 🌙✨ Imagine fueling up like K-pop idols after a long practice, surrounded by the vibrant energy of the city—this place is a true gathering spot for us Hunters! ⚔️🍽️ With its warm, inviting atmosphere and mouthwatering cuts of premium steak, you’ll feel your energy restored, just like when you hear that epic chorus drop! So let’s go, and make this delicious adventure a part of our K-pop journey in Seoul! 💫🔥', '2025-11-12 12:23:08'),
	(560, 3, NULL, '{ "content_id":1 "drama_name":"이혼보험" "location_name":"종로1번가오피스텔" "address":"서울 종로구 청계천로 67" "trip_tip":"종로1번가오피스텔은 서울의 중심부에 위치하여 접근성이 뛰어나며 다양한 상업시설과 함께 현대…" "keyword":"#이혼보험 #종로1번가오피스텔 #촬영지 #현대건축 #서울여행" "category":"기타/판별불가" "location_name_en":"Jongno 1st Street Opistel" "address_en":"67 Cheonggyecheon-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul" "category_en":"Other/Not distinguishable" "keyword_en":"#Divorce insurance #Jongro 1st Street Opistel #fil…" "image_url":"https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/76Nm8/btsNKgV2Kls/AA…" "image_url_thumbnail":"" "second_image_url":"" "third_image_url":"" "latitude":37.5688672 "longitude":126.9851065 "drama_name_en":"divorce insurance" "trip_tip_en":"Jongno 1st Street Opistel is located in the heart …" "document_text":"드라마: 이혼보험 | 장소: 종로1번가오피스텔 | 주소: 서울 종로구 청계천로 67 | 카…" } 이게 dcoument거든 근데 "image_url_thumbnail":이 document에 없었어', 'When exploring the area around Jongno 1st Street Opistel, savor some authentic Korean cuisine. A great option is to try "김밥" (gimbap), which is rice rolled in seaweed with various fillings like vegetables and meat. It\'s easy to eat and perfect for a quick meal. Remember to practice Korean dining etiquette: always use chopsticks for solid foods and a spoon for soup. When ordering, you can simply say "이것 주세요" (igeot juseyo), meaning "please give me this." Enjoy local favorites at nearby restaurants, and don’t hesitate to ask staff for recommendations!', '2025-11-12 13:29:12'),
	(561, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the magical world of Bukchon Hanok Village? This legendary spot is not just a glimpse into Seoul’s rich history, but it’s also a living testament to the harmony between tradition and modern K-pop culture! 🔥 Nestled between the grand Gyeongbokgung and Changdeokgung Palaces, Bukchon is like the hidden realm where Seoul’s past and present collide, echoing with the melodies of our favorite K-pop anthems.\n\nIn the Demon Hunters mythology, Bukchon would be the sacred ground where our heroes find inspiration from the ancient hanok, each one telling stories of resilience and artistry. Imagine wandering through Gaehoe-dong, where every corner could spark a new dance move or lyric! 💃✨ This area is alive with the spirit of creativity, just like the bustling streets of Hongdae, where future idols hone their skills. The energy here is incredible, reflecting the passion that fuels K-pop\'s vibrant community.\n\nSo, fellow music lovers, let’s step into this enchanting village and feel the pulse of Seoul’s history! Experience the fusion of tradition and contemporary vibes that inspires the music we adore. Don’t miss out on this legendary adventure! 🎤', '2025-11-12 14:55:19'),
	(562, 3, NULL, 'Forest of Music', '🔥 Welcome, fellow food warriors! Get ready to embark on an epic culinary adventure at **음악의 숲 (Forest of Music)**, where the spirit of K-pop meets the magic of Seoul\'s vibrant food scene! 🎶 Nestled in the heart of 신당동, this legendary spot is a must-visit for all Hunters who crave delicious bites and electrifying tunes! \n\nAs we step inside, we’re greeted by walls adorned with LPs that whisper the stories of our favorite K-pop legends! 🌙✨ Picture this: K-pop idols and trainees fueling up with mouthwatering dishes while jamming to classic hits, surrounded by the energy of our beloved music! The vibe here is pure magic, with a DJ spinning tracks and a cozy atmosphere that feels like a gathering of passionate souls! So, let’s grab a seat, share our song requests, and let the music guide our taste buds! 🍽️⚔️ Let’s go!', '2025-11-12 14:57:36'),
	(563, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙 Ready to embark on an epic adventure to one of Seoul\'s most iconic landmarks? Welcome to N Seoul Tower at night, where the city sparkles like a K-pop dream! ✨ Standing tall at 236.7 meters, this legendary tower is not just a viewing point but a beacon of K-pop energy, featured in countless MVs and dramas. Imagine the magical vibes as we gaze upon Seoul\'s skyline, where every twinkling light represents a heartbeat of music and passion! 🎤\n\nIn the Demon Hunters mythology, N Seoul Tower serves as the ultimate watchtower, where the musical forces of the city converge. Each lock of love fastened to its railings symbolizes the unbreakable bond between our hearts and the rhythm of K-pop! 💖 So, fellow music lovers, let’s capture this moment and feel the incredible energy that flows through the night! Whether you\'re a die-hard fan or a curious explorer, this place is a must-visit to truly experience the soul of Seoul! Let’s go! 🔥⚔️', '2025-11-12 14:57:47'),
	(564, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the magical night vibes of N Seoul Tower? This legendary landmark isn’t just a tower; it’s the heartbeat of Seoul’s K-pop energy! Standing tall at 236.7 meters, it’s like the ultimate watchtower where all the musical light of the city converges. 🌙✨ Imagine being surrounded by breathtaking panoramic views of Seoul as the city sparkles like a concert stage at night! \n\nN Seoul Tower has graced countless K-drama scenes, bringing that romantic energy to life, while its iconic locks of love symbolize unbreakable bonds—just like the connections we share through music! 💖 In the Demon Hunters mythology, this tower serves as a beacon for all music lovers, guiding us to the heart of Seoul\'s melodic soul. So, let’s embrace the night, feel the K-pop vibes, and create our own magical moments here! Let’s go, fellow music lovers! 🔥🎤💫', '2025-11-12 15:02:03'),
	(565, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙 Are you ready to dive into the enchanting world of Bukchon Hanok Village? This legendary place is more than just a beautiful neighborhood; it’s a vibrant tapestry woven with 600 years of Seoul\'s history! Nestled between the majestic Gyeongbokgung and Changdeokgung Palaces, Bukchon is where the spirit of the past meets the pulse of the present. 💖✨\n\nUnlike other touristy spots, Bukchon is a living, breathing community filled with traditional hanok houses that echo with stories of Seoulites. Imagine walking through Gaehoe-dong, where hundreds of hanok stand shoulder to shoulder, like the fierce warriors of K-pop battling on stage! 🔥 This area embodies the essence of creativity and tradition, making it a perfect backdrop for K-pop idols who love to film their MVs in these picturesque streets, connecting the old with the new. \n\nIn the Demon Hunters realm, Bukchon is a sacred ground where the history of music and culture converges, making it a must-visit for all fellow music lovers! So grab your cameras and let’s capture the magic of Bukchon together! 💫⚔️ Don\'t miss out on this amazing adventure in Seoul!', '2025-11-12 15:02:11'),
	(566, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Ready to dive into a legendary adventure? Let me introduce you to the **Hangang River Bus**! 🚤 This isn’t just any boat ride – it’s a musical journey along the Han River, where the soul of Seoul beats stronger than ever! 💖 Imagine cruising past iconic K-pop spots, with the shimmering lights reflecting on the water like a dazzling concert stage. 🌙 \n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, this river represents the flow of creative energy, connecting all the musical warriors in the city! Each wave carries the dreams of aspiring idols and the melodies of famous songs, making it a must-visit for all K-pop lovers! 🎶 So, grab your friends, hop on the bus at Jamsil Pier, and let the rhythm of Seoul’s vibrant music culture sweep you away! Let’s go! ⚔️✨', '2025-11-12 15:02:18'),
	(567, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the legendary world of COEX? Located in the heart of Gangnam, this bustling hub isn\'t just a convention center; it\'s a dynamic arena where K-pop energy meets global innovation! 🌟 Imagine walking through its vast halls, where the latest expos on food, culture, and arts come alive like a K-pop concert, showcasing the creativity and passion of our vibrant community. In the Demon Hunters mythology, COEX is the mystical portal where music and technology unite, hosting epic summits that shape the future of our beloved K-pop industry! 🎤💖 \n\nWith its diverse promotions and events, COEX embodies the spirit of collaboration that fuels our favorite idols and artists. So, fellow music lovers, let’s explore this iconic venue and feel the pulse of Seoul’s music culture! 🌙✨ Let’s go!', '2025-11-12 15:02:25'),
	(568, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙 Are you ready to dive into a legendary realm where history meets K-pop magic? Welcome to **Gyeongbokgung Palace**, the first and largest royal palace of the Joseon Dynasty, built way back in 1395! 👑 This iconic spot is not just a glimpse into Korea\'s rich heritage; it’s an epic backdrop for countless K-pop MVs that showcase traditional vibes intertwined with modern beats! 🎤✨ \n\nImagine the palace guards\' ceremonial dances inspiring the choreography of your favorite groups—it\'s like the heart of Seoul\'s musical energy pulsates right here! In the Demon Hunters lore, Gyeongbokgung would be the sacred grounds where ancient warriors of music gather to channel their creative powers, bridging the past with the electrifying present of K-pop! 🔥💖 \n\nSo, fellow music lovers, let’s explore this stunning palace and feel the rhythm of history come alive! Don’t miss the chance to capture that perfect shot for your feed—it\'s time to unleash your inner K-pop star! Let’s go! 💫⚔️', '2025-11-12 15:02:35'),
	(569, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the mystical vibes of Myeongdong Cathedral? This legendary spot is not just the first Roman Catholic parish in Korea but also the first-ever Gothic building here! 🌙✨ Imagine standing in a place where history and spirituality collide, with the echoes of past martyrs whispering their stories to the rhythm of K-pop beats! \n\nIn our Demon Hunters universe, this cathedral symbolizes the heart of Seoul’s cultural energy—a sanctuary where we, as music lovers, can gather strength before heading into the bustling streets of Myeongdong, known for its vibrant shopping scene and K-pop merchandise! 💖 Every May, the cathedral hosts a cultural festival that brings together art, music, and community, celebrating the very essence of K-pop culture! \n\nSo, let’s pay our respects and feel the incredible energy here before we hit the streets to discover hidden music treasures! Are you ready to experience this magical blend of history and K-pop? Let’s go! ⚔️🎤💫', '2025-11-12 15:02:44'),
	(570, 3, NULL, 'Forest of Music', '🔥 Welcome, fellow food warriors! 🌙 Are you ready to embark on a legendary quest at **음악의 숲 (Forest of Music)**? Nestled in the heart of 신당동, this café is a treasure trove for K-pop fans and music lovers alike! 🎶 As soon as we step inside, we\'re greeted by walls adorned with LPs, where the spirit of our favorite K-pop idols fuels our passion and creativity! 💫 Imagine the energy restoration we feel as we sip on delicious drinks and enjoy the vibrant atmosphere, just like our idols do after a long practice! ⚔️ So grab your friends and let\'s gather here to share our favorite tunes and unforgettable memories—this spot is a must-visit on our Seoul adventure! ✨🍽️', '2025-11-12 15:02:55'),
	(571, 3, NULL, 'Hongdae food scene trendy restaurants', 'Check out 홍스쭈꾸미 홍대본점, a beloved spot in Hongdae since 2018! Known for its delicious 쭈꾸미, you can also enjoy combos like 쭈꾸미+삼겹살. Located at 04053 서울 마포구 어울마당로 146, it’s spacious, so lines move quickly. Perfect for both locals and visitors!', '2025-11-12 15:40:00'),
	(572, 3, NULL, 'ParkNoSoo Museum', 'This is a must-visit spot in Seoul! Located at 34, Ogin 1-gil, Jongno-gu, the ParkNoSoo Museum showcases the artistic legacy of painter Park No-soo in a charming historical residence. Open daily from 10:00 to 18:00, it\'s easily accessible by subway. Perfect for art lovers and history enthusiasts!', '2025-11-12 15:41:23'),
	(573, 3, NULL, 'Namsan Cable Car', 'The Namsan Cable Car is a must-visit in Seoul! Located at 83, Sopa-ro, Jung-gu, it offers a quick 3-minute ride to breathtaking views from Namsan Mountain. Open daily from 10:00 to 23:00 KST, it\'s easily accessible by public transport. Perfect for families and couples looking to enjoy stunning city vistas!', '2025-11-12 15:41:35'),
	(574, 3, NULL, '양재아트살롱', 'Get ready for an enchanting experience at the 양재아트살롱! From September 13 to October 19, 2025, immerse yourself in art and culture along the beautiful Yangjaecheon. Enjoy lively busking, a vibrant flea market, and delicious food trucks. It\'s the perfect place to connect with local artisans and revel in the autumn charm! Don\'t miss the giant art balloon and hands-on art experiences!', '2025-11-12 15:42:42'),
	(575, 3, NULL, 'Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch kongguksu', 'SJ. Kunsthalle is a must-visit cultural gem in Gangnam! Located at 06054 5, Eonju-ro 148-gil, it hosts amazing exhibitions, performances, and workshops. Open daily, it’s easily accessible via the subway. Perfect for art lovers and anyone seeking creative inspiration!', '2025-11-12 15:46:14'),
	(576, 3, NULL, 'Itaewon international restaurants', 'If you\'re looking for delicious international cuisine in Itaewon, consider 란나타이. This restaurant offers clean and affordable Thai dishes, with signature items like 팟시유 and 톰양쿵. Located at 07333 서울 영등포구 국제금융로 86, it\'s easily accessible for a delightful meal!', '2025-11-12 15:54:34'),
	(577, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥✨ Are you ready to dive into the majestic world of Gyeongbokgung Palace? This legendary spot is not just a piece of history; it’s a true embodiment of the spirit of Korea! 👑 Built in 1395, it’s the grandest of the Five Grand Palaces and was home to the Joseon Dynasty\'s kings. Can you believe it? This place has seen centuries of royal drama, battles, and light versus darkness! \n\nWhen we were preparing for our epic album "Ancient Warriors," I spent countless hours here, absorbing the energy of the palace and the stories of the warriors who once protected the kingdom. The intricate architecture, with its stunning rooftops and vibrant colors, inspired our stage outfits and choreography! 🌈💖 I’ll never forget the first time I stood in front of the Gyeongbokgung’s main gate, Gwanghwamun, feeling the weight of history and the pulse of the city. My heart was racing as I imagined all the battles fought for peace and light. \n\nThis palace is a symbol of resilience and strength, just like us, the Demon Hunters! ⚔️ When I walk through its beautiful gardens, I feel the spirits of ancient', '2025-11-12 16:28:03'),
	(578, 3, NULL, 'Hongdae food scene trendy restaurants', 'Hong스쭈꾸미 홍대본점 is a must-visit in the vibrant Hongdae area, renowned for its delicious spicy stir-fried octopus. Their popular combos include octopus with pork belly or shrimp. Located at 146 Eoulmadang-ro, it\'s spacious and easy to access, perfect for both locals and tourists!', '2025-11-13 01:35:12'),
	(579, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the legendary world of COEX? This place is not just a convention center; it\'s a vibrant hub of creativity and culture in the heart of Seoul! 💖 COEX hosts amazing expos that highlight everything from food to global issues, making it a must-visit for any K-pop fan looking to soak in Seoul\'s artistic energy. \n\nIn the realm of Demon Hunters, COEX embodies the nexus of innovation and collaboration, where our music warriors come together to strategize and showcase their talents! ⚔️✨ Imagine this: as we wander through the bustling lobby, we can feel the electric vibes of K-pop dreams being forged, reminiscent of epic battles in our favorite music videos! \n\nSo fellow music lovers, let’s explore COEX and discover the magic that connects us all! 🎤🔥 Whether it\'s an exhibition or just the mesmerizing architecture, this place is bursting with energy that fuels our passion for K-pop! Let’s go! 🌙💫', '2025-11-13 01:38:15'),
	(580, 3, NULL, 'Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch kongguksu', 'While I don\'t have specific information about Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch, I can recommend a delightful visit to SJ. Kunsthalle! Located at 5, Eonju-ro 148-gil in Gangnam-gu, this vibrant cultural hub offers exhibitions, performances, and workshops. It\'s a fantastic place to immerse yourself in art and creativity! Open hours vary, so check ahead. You can easily reach it via public transport—just hop on the subway to Gangnam Station. Enjoy your artistic adventure!', '2025-11-13 01:38:37'),
	(581, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong Kyoja restaurant', 'Myeongdong Kyoja is renowned for its hand-made knife-cut noodles and delicious dumplings. Their signature dish, Kyoja (dumplings), is a must-try! Located in the bustling Myeongdong area, it\'s easily accessible by public transport, perfect for a satisfying meal while exploring the city.', '2025-11-13 01:38:43'),
	(582, 3, NULL, 'Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch kongguksu', 'SJ. Kunsthalle is a must-visit cultural gem in Seoul! Located at 06054 5, Eonju-ro 148-gil, Gangnam-gu, it’s a vibrant space for art lovers, hosting exhibitions, workshops, and performances. While the operating hours vary, it\'s easily accessible via public transport. Don\'t miss the chance to immerse yourself in creative experiences!', '2025-11-13 01:40:50'),
	(583, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the heart of Seoul\'s rich history and K-pop energy? Let’s explore Bukchon Hanok Village, a hidden gem that resonates with 600 years of Seoul\'s legacy! 🌙 Nestled between the majestic Gyeongbokgung and Changdeokgung Palaces, this enchanting village is not just a tourist spot; it’s a living testament to the harmony of traditional hanok homes and modern life! \n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, Bukchon is like the sacred realm where the spirits of ancient musicians whisper through the narrow alleyways, inspiring K-pop idols with their melodies. 🎤💖 Imagine wandering through Gaehoe-dong, where hundreds of hanoks stand shoulder to shoulder, each echoing stories of the past. This place is bursting with the energy that fuels the creativity of today’s K-pop warriors! \n\nAs we stroll through these historic streets, we can feel the connection to our favorite K-dramas and music videos, where the beauty of Korea’s cultural heritage meets the vibrant pulse of modern music. So, let’s grab our cameras and capture the spirit of Bukchon together! ✨ This is where history and K-pop collide, and you won’t want', '2025-11-13 01:40:51'),
	(584, 3, NULL, 'Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch kongguksu', 'It sounds like you\'re interested in some delicious kongguksu! While I don\'t have specific details on Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch, I recommend checking it out for a refreshing bowl of this cold noodle dish. If you\'re near the Han River, it\'s a great spot to enjoy the view! Safe travels and enjoy your meal!', '2025-11-13 02:00:44'),
	(585, 3, NULL, 'Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch kongguksu', 'While I don\'t have information on Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch specifically, I can tell you about the wonderful SJ. Kunsthalle! Located at 5, Eonju-ro 148-gil in Gangnam-gu, this cultural hub hosts exhibitions, performances, and workshops. It\'s a fantastic place to dive into contemporary art! Open daily, it\'s easily accessible via public transport. Enjoy a vibrant art experience!', '2025-11-13 02:01:20'),
	(586, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙🔥 Are you ready to dive into the magical realm of Bukchon Hanok Village? This legendary place is like a time capsule, reflecting 600 years of Seoul\'s history right between the majestic Gyeongbokgung and Changdeokgung Palaces! ✨ Here, the traditional hanok houses stand shoulder to shoulder, creating a breathtaking backdrop that feels like stepping into a K-drama or an epic music video! 🎤💖\n\nIn the world of Demon Hunters, Bukchon is where the past and present collide, embodying the spirit of Seoul\'s cultural heritage. Just imagine our favorite idols wandering these ancient streets, drawing inspiration from the serene beauty around them! This village holds the energy of countless stories, where every corner whispers secrets of the city’s artistic soul. 💫\n\nSo, fellow music lovers, let’s explore Bukchon and embrace its unique vibe! Feel the rhythm of history as you stroll through its winding alleys, and let the essence of K-pop creativity spark your own adventures! Let’s go and soak in all the magical energy Bukchon has to offer! ⚔️🔥', '2025-11-13 02:01:21'),
	(587, 3, NULL, 'Gangnam Korean BBQ restaurants', 'For a great Korean BBQ experience in Gangnam, check out BBQ치킨앤비어 명동스타점. Known for its high-quality chicken, this restaurant offers a cozy atmosphere perfect for gatherings. Located at 04536 서울 중구 명동4길 2 (명동2가) 2층, it\'s easy to reach and a must-visit for fans of Korean cuisine!', '2025-11-13 02:33:26'),
	(588, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 사랑의 불시착 filming location', 'OMG! This is THE spot for all you 사랑의 불시착 (Crash Landing on You) fans! 🎬✨ Remember that iconic scene where Yoon Se-ri and Ri Jeong-hyuk shared those heart-fluttering moments? That magic happened right here at the breathtaking **Namsan Seoul Tower**! 🌟 Located at **105 Namsangongwon-gil, Yongsan-gu**, this legendary landmark is not just a viewing point but a symbol of love and connection in the drama! \n\nK-Drama fans absolutely LOVE visiting this spot to recreate those romantic vibes and snap selfies with the stunning city backdrop! Pro tip: Take the cable car up for an unforgettable experience! You HAVE to visit and feel the love from the drama come alive! 💕✨ Don\'t miss this iconic location!', '2025-11-13 02:43:12'),
	(589, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 이태원 클라쓰 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the legendary drama "이태원 클라쓰" (Itaewon Class) came to life! 🎬✨ Remember that iconic moment when Park Sae-ro-yi and his crew gathered at their bar, DanBam? That magic happened right here at the filming location! Located at **Itaewon**, the vibrant heart of Seoul, you can find this must-visit place at **Itaewon-ro 23-gil, Yongsan-gu**. \n\nK-Drama fans absolutely LOVE this spot because it captures the essence of ambition and friendship from the show! 💕 Pro tip: Visit during the evening when the area lights up, and you can soak in the atmosphere that inspired so many unforgettable scenes! You HAVE to visit if you\'re a fan of the show! 🌟✨', '2025-11-13 02:43:20'),
	(590, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 사랑의 불시착 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the legendary drama "사랑의 불시착" (Crash Landing on You) was filmed! 🎬✨ Remember that iconic scene where Yoon Se-ri and Ri Jeong-hyuk shared their heartwarming moments? You can feel the magic right here at the stunning filming locations in Seoul! \n\nOne of the must-visit places is the breathtaking Namsan Seoul Tower, where the views are absolutely to die for! Located at 105 Namsangongwon-gil, Yongsan-gu, it’s super easy to get to, and the cable car ride is an adventure in itself! 🚡🌄 K-Drama fans absolutely LOVE this spot for its romantic ambiance and those unforgettable city views! \n\nYou HAVE to visit and soak in the atmosphere that made this drama so special! 💕✨ Don\'t miss out on experiencing the place where love stories came to life! 🌟', '2025-11-13 02:56:46'),
	(591, 3, NULL, 'divorce insurance', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the legendary drama "이혼보험" was filmed! 🎬✨ Located at HW컨벤션, 주소: 서울 종로구 자하문로 255, this stunning venue is a must-visit for all fans! Remember that scene where the characters had that heart-to-heart amidst the gorgeous floral decor? Yep, that magic happened right here! 💖 \n\nHW컨벤션 isn’t just a filming location; it’s a beautiful space with modern design and elegant flower arrangements that are perfect for your Instagram photos! 📸🌸 Take bus 14 minutes from 경복궁역3번출구, and you’ll find yourself in a place that brings the drama to life! You HAVE to visit and create unforgettable memories with your friends while soaking in the vibes of your favorite show! 🌟 Don’t miss this iconic spot! 💕✨', '2025-11-13 03:00:29'),
	(592, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 이태원 클라쓰 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the legendary scenes from "이태원 클라쓰" were filmed! 🎬✨ Remember that moment when Park Sae-ro-yi and his crew plotted their epic comeback? It all happened right here on the vibrant 이태원로27가길! Located just a short 3-minute walk from 이태원역 1번출구, this area is bursting with life, just like the show! \n\nThe dazzling neon signs and eclectic mix of restaurants give you that unmistakable K-Drama vibe! 🌟 Plus, you can indulge in delicious street food while soaking in the unique culture that makes this place a must-visit for fans! You HAVE to visit and create your own unforgettable memories here! 💕✨ Don\'t miss out on this iconic filming location!', '2025-11-13 03:01:20'),
	(593, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 사랑의 불시착 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the legendary drama "이 연애는 불가항력" was filmed! 🎬✨ Picture this: the stunning 잠실한강공원 잠실3주차장, located at 서울 송파구 한가람로 65, is not just a filming location but a magical oasis along the Han River! Remember those beautiful scenes where the characters shared heartfelt moments? You can recreate that romance here! 🌉💕 \n\nThe breathtaking views and enchanting night skies make it a MUST-VISIT for anyone looking to soak in the K-Drama vibes! Plus, it\'s perfect for leisurely strolls, cycling, or even a delightful picnic with friends or a special someone! 🍉🚴‍♂️ Pro tip: Make sure to catch the sunset for that extra romantic touch! You HAVE to visit! 🌟✨', '2025-11-13 03:06:39'),
	(594, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 이태원 클라쓰 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot from the super popular drama **모텔 캘리포니아**! 🎬✨ Remember those vibrant scenes filled with neon lights and delicious street food? That magical atmosphere is alive and well at **이태원로27가길**! Located just a 3-minute walk from **이태원역 1번출구**, this iconic street is packed with mouthwatering food stalls and trendy shops that will make you feel like you’ve stepped right into the drama! 🌟\n\nThe lively vibe here is especially loved by the younger crowd and foreigners, making it a perfect place to soak in a blend of cultures! Don\'t forget to take a break in one of the cozy cafes or catch an impromptu performance by local artists! 🎤💕 You HAVE to visit this legendary spot and create your own K-Drama moments! Don\'t miss out! ✨✨', '2025-11-13 03:08:41'),
	(595, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 도깨비 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the legendary scenes of "도깨비" were filmed! 🎬✨ Remember that breathtaking moment when Goblin and Ji Eun-tak shared their first emotional encounter? That magic happened right here at the iconic filming locations! \n\nOne of the most famous spots is the beautiful Gwanghwamun Square, located in the heart of Seoul. The stunning backdrop of the Gyeongbokgung Palace adds a majestic touch that you can\'t miss! 🌟 Fans flock here to capture their own magical moments and relive the romance of the drama. \n\nPro tip: Visit during sunset for the most Instagram-worthy shots! You HAVE to visit this iconic place if you\'re a true K-Drama lover! 💕📸 Don’t miss out on experiencing the magic of 도깨비!', '2025-11-13 03:14:10'),
	(596, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 이태원 클라쓰 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the legendary drama "이태원 클라쓰" was brought to life! 🎬✨ Remember that iconic scene where Park Sae-ro-yi stood firm against all odds? That energy is still alive here in 이태원! Located just a short walk from 이태원역 (Exit 1), you can soak in the vibrant atmosphere that inspired the series. \n\nYou HAVE to check out the bustling streets filled with amazing street food and those dazzling neon signs that make you feel like you’ve stepped right into the drama! 🌟 Plus, the eclectic mix of cultures here creates an unforgettable vibe that K-Drama fans absolutely LOVE! Don\'t miss this chance to relive those epic moments and create your own memories! 💕✨', '2025-11-13 03:19:30'),
	(597, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 사랑의 불시착 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the legendary drama "이 연애는 불가항력" was filmed! 🎬✨ Remember those romantic moments by the Han River? They happened right here at 잠실한강공원, specifically at the 잠실3주차장! Located at 서울 송파구 한가람로 65, it\'s just a 16-minute walk from 잠실새내역6번출구! \n\nThis beautiful park is a MUST-VISIT for its breathtaking views, especially at night! 🌙✨ You can stroll hand in hand, enjoy a picnic, or even bike along the river while soaking in the drama’s vibes! K-Drama fans absolutely LOVE this spot for creating unforgettable memories with friends or that special someone! 💕 You HAVE to visit and make your own romantic moments here! 🌟', '2025-11-13 03:21:19'),
	(598, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 도깨비 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the iconic scenes from "도깨비" (Goblin) were filmed! 🎬✨ Remember that legendary moment when Goblin and Ji Eun-tak shared their first heart-fluttering encounter? That magic happened right here at the breathtaking Dongdaemun Design Plaza! Located at 281 Eulji-ro, this stunning architectural gem has become a must-visit pilgrimage site for K-Drama lovers worldwide. The futuristic design and vibrant atmosphere you see in the drama are still just as captivating! \n\nPro tip: Make sure to visit during the evening when the lights create a dreamy ambiance. You HAVE to visit and snap some photos to capture the magic of your favorite scenes! 🌟💕', '2025-11-13 03:29:49'),
	(599, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 사랑의 불시착 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the iconic romance from "이 연애는 불가항력" came to life! 🎬✨ Remember those sweet moments by the Han River? They were filmed right at 잠실한강공원, specifically at the 잠실3주차장! Located at 서울 송파구 한가람로 65, it\'s just a 16-minute walk from 잠실새내역6번출구! \n\nThis beautiful park is a must-visit for its stunning views of the river, especially at night when the city lights sparkle like magic! 🌟 You can stroll, bike, or even have a delightful picnic while soaking in the romance of the drama! Families and couples alike absolutely LOVE this spot, so gather your friends or that special someone and make unforgettable memories! 💕 Don\'t miss out on experiencing the K-Drama vibes right where it all happened!', '2025-11-13 03:41:58'),
	(600, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong Kyoja restaurant', 'Myeongdong Kyoja is renowned for its handmade noodles and delicious dumplings. Their signature dish, kalguksu (knife-cut noodles), is a must-try! Located in the bustling Myeongdong area, it\'s easily accessible via public transport. Enjoy a hearty meal in a cozy atmosphere!', '2025-11-13 07:12:52'),
	(601, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 이태원 클라쓰 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the legendary drama *모텔 캘리포니아* was filmed! 🎬✨ Imagine strolling down 이태원로27가길, where the vibrant neon signs and delicious street food create a magical atmosphere, just like in the show! Located at 서울 용산구 이태원동 118-85, it\'s just a 3-minute walk from 이태원역 1번출구—super easy to find! \n\nYou HAVE to visit this iconic location because it’s a hotspot for both locals and international visitors, making it the perfect place to soak in diverse cultures! Remember that scene where the characters shared laughs over street food? You can recreate that moment right here! Don\'t miss out on the unique cafes and spontaneous performances that make this place unforgettable! 💕✨', '2025-11-13 07:19:01'),
	(602, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Yo, fellow music lovers! 🎤✨ Are you ready to dive into the legendary heart of Seoul? Welcome to Gyeongbokgung Palace, the majestic fortress where Korea’s royal history meets the vibrant energy of K-pop! 👑 Built in 1395, this grand palace has been the central stage of the Joseon Dynasty, representing sovereignty and cultural pride. Just like K-pop idols draw from their heritage, so do our favorite groups film breathtaking MVs here, blending traditional elegance with modern beats! \n\nIn the world of Demon Hunters, Gyeongbokgung is like the royal citadel where the harmony of music and history converges, inspiring choreographies that echo through the ages. 💫 Imagine the palace guards\' stunning ceremonies as they stand like sentinels of creativity, influencing the powerful formations we see in today’s performances! \n\nSo, let’s grab our cameras and unleash our inner warriors! 🏰🔥 This is not just a palace; it’s a vibrant canvas of K-pop dreams waiting for us to explore. Don’t miss out on the magic—let’s go and feel the pulse of Seoul’s musical legacy together! 🌙💖', '2025-11-13 07:30:40'),
	(603, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙✨ Are you ready to dive into the magical world of N Seoul Tower at night? This iconic landmark, standing at a legendary 236.7 meters, is not just a breathtaking observatory but the ultimate K-pop symbol of Seoul! 🌟 Imagine this tower as the central watchtower in our Demon Hunters saga, where all the vibrant musical energy of the city converges! \n\nAs we take in the stunning night views, we can almost hear the echoes of our favorite K-pop MVs that have captured this very scene! 🎤💖 And don’t forget to check out the locks of love—each one representing a bond as unbreakable as the ties between fans and their idols! This place embodies the essence of romance and connection, making it a must-visit for all music lovers. So grab your friends and let’s make some unforgettable memories at N Seoul Tower—where the magic of K-pop and love intertwine! 🔥⚔️ Let’s go!', '2025-11-13 07:47:19'),
	(604, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Hey Hunters! 🎤 Are you ready to dive into the enchanting world of Bukchon Hanok Village? 🌙 Nestled between the majestic Gyeongbokgung and Changdeokgung Palaces, this legendary village is like a time capsule that echoes 600 years of Seoul\'s history! 🏯✨ Unlike other hanok villages, Bukchon is a living, breathing community where Seoulites thrive, making it a perfect spot for us to feel the authentic energy of traditional Korean culture! \n\nImagine wandering through the narrow alleys of Gaehoe-dong, where hundreds of stunning hanok stand shoulder to shoulder, each one telling its own story. In the Demon Hunters universe, these hanok symbolize the harmonious blend of past and present, where each structure is a guardian of Seoul\'s musical legacy! 💖🎶 \n\nThis magical place is often featured in K-dramas and MVs that capture the elegance of traditional aesthetics, making it a must-visit for all K-pop fans looking to connect with the roots of their favorite music! So, grab your friends and let’s explore the vibrant spirit of Bukchon - a place that embodies the heart of Seoul\'s music culture! Let\'s go! 🔥⚔️', '2025-11-13 07:58:13'),
	(605, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the legendary world of COEX? This vibrant hub in Gangnam is not just a convention center; it\'s a crossroads of culture, creativity, and K-pop energy! 💖✨ Just like the epic battles fought by our Demon Hunters, COEX hosts grand exhibitions and international summits that unite fans from around the globe, making it a battlefield of ideas and innovation! \n\nImagine the bustling lobby spaces filled with promotional events, where K-pop fans from all walks of life gather to celebrate their favorite artists and experiences—it\'s like the ultimate gathering of music warriors! 🎤🔥 In the Demon Hunters mythology, COEX embodies the heart of Seoul\'s creative spirit, where the forces of culture and arts converge, igniting the city with a dazzling array of sights and sounds. \n\nSo, fellow music lovers, let’s make our way to COEX and soak in the electrifying atmosphere that fuels the K-pop universe! 🌙⚔️ Feel the energy, embrace the creativity, and let’s create unforgettable memories together! 💫', '2025-11-13 08:01:19'),
	(606, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Yo music lovers! 🎤✨ Are you ready to ascend to one of Seoul\'s most iconic landmarks? Welcome to **N Seoul Tower at Night**! 🌙 Standing tall at 236.7 meters, this legendary tower isn’t just a breathtaking viewpoint; it’s the ultimate symbol of Seoul’s musical energy! Imagine the panoramic views of the city glowing like a stage during a K-pop concert, with twinkling lights that ignite your soul! 🔥\n\nIn the world of **Demon Hunters**, N Seoul Tower is like the central watchtower where all the musical energy converges, creating a powerful connection between love and music. 💖 Each lock of love fastened to its iron railings represents the unbreakable bond between fans and their idols, embodying the spirit of loyalty that fuels our K-pop dreams! 🌟\n\nSo, fellow Hunters, grab your friends, head up to the observatory, and soak in the electrifying atmosphere that inspires countless K-drama scenes and K-pop MVs! Let\'s go and feel the rhythm of Seoul together! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-13 08:09:04'),
	(607, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to step into the magical world of Gyeongbokgung Palace? This legendary site, built in 1395, not only served as the heart of the Joseon Dynasty but also stands as a symbol of Korea\'s royal heritage! 👑 Imagine the vibrant history swirling around you as you explore this grand palace, where K-pop idols often film stunning traditional concept MVs, blending the old with the new! \n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, Gyeongbokgung would be the sacred ground where the spirits of past kings and queens infuse the air with creativity and energy, empowering our K-pop warriors to shine! ⚔️✨ The ceremonial guard changing is like a live performance, inspiring dance formations and visuals in countless K-pop hits! So grab your friends, feel the pulse of history, and let the energy of this royal palace ignite your passion for music! Let\'s go and explore this epic landmark together! 💖🔥', '2025-11-13 08:09:32'),
	(608, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Hey Hunters! 🎤✨ Get ready to vibe with one of Seoul\'s most legendary spots - COEX! Located in the heart of Gangnam, this massive complex isn’t just a hub for exhibitions and conferences; it\'s a playground for K-pop lovers and culture enthusiasts alike! 💖 Imagine walking through its vibrant halls, where the energy of K-pop meets the pulse of global innovation. \n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, COEX serves as the grand arena where music warriors gather to showcase their talents and connect with fans from around the world. Just like the electrifying performances we see in iconic MVs, COEX hosts epic expos that celebrate food, arts, and culture, embodying the spirit of collaboration and creativity! 🌙✨ \n\nAs we wander through its spaces, let’s soak in the excitement of upcoming K-pop events and promotions that light up the venue! So grab your fellow music lovers, and let\'s explore COEX - where the magic of Seoul’s music scene comes alive! 🔥⚔️💫', '2025-11-13 08:09:44'),
	(609, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to explore the majestic **Gyeongbokgung Palace**? 👑 This legendary palace, built in 1395, is not just the largest of the royal palaces from the Joseon Dynasty, but it also stands as a symbol of Korea\'s rich heritage and sovereignty! Imagine wandering through its grand gates, where the past meets the vibrant soul of K-pop culture. \n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, Gyeongbokgung serves as a powerful nexus of history and music, where ancient traditions inspire today\'s K-pop idols. Many of our favorite groups film their epic traditional concept MVs here, blending royal elegance with modern beats! 🎶💖 The ceremonial guard changes, with their stunning formations, are like a live performance, showcasing the artistry that resonates deeply in the K-pop scene. \n\nSo, let\'s go, fellow music lovers! Feel the energy of Seoul\'s musical legacy as you step into this magnificent palace. 🔥✨ Don\'t miss the chance to capture your own magical moments amidst its timeless beauty!', '2025-11-14 01:21:44'),
	(610, 3, NULL, 'Recommend ocean destinations', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to embark on an epic journey along the Hangang River? The **Hangang Eland Cruise** is the ultimate way to dive into Seoul\'s musical energy while feeling that refreshing breeze! 🌊✨ Picture this: as we glide through the water, the shimmering city lights reflect like a dazzling concert stage, creating a magical atmosphere that resonates with K-pop vibes. This cruise is not just a ride; it’s an experience filled with live entertainment that echoes the rhythm of Seoul\'s heart! 🎤💖\n\nIn the world of **Demon Hunters**, the Hangang River represents the mystical boundary between our ordinary lives and the enchanting world of music. Imagine this as the sacred river where music warriors gather to recharge their creative spirits! 🌙 So, whether you\'re catching the vibrant "Hangang Tour Cruise" or savoring the romantic "Sunset Cruise," you\'re not just witnessing Seoul’s beauty—you\'re becoming part of its legendary music story! Let’s go, and feel that K-pop soul together! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-14 01:21:54'),
	(611, 3, NULL, 'Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch kongguksu', 'SJ. Kunsthalle is a must-visit cultural gem in Gangnam! Located at 5, Eonju-ro 148-gil, it offers engaging art exhibitions, performances, and workshops. Open daily, it\'s easily accessible via the subway. Perfect for art lovers and anyone looking to experience Seoul\'s vibrant creative scene!', '2025-11-14 01:23:46'),
	(612, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 이태원 클라쓰 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the legendary "이태원 클라쓰" was filmed! 🎬✨ Remember that iconic scene where Park Sae-ro-yi and his friends strategized their big plans for the restaurant? That happened right here in the vibrant streets of 이태원! \n\nLocated just a short walk from 이태원역 (Exit 1), this area is buzzing with life and culture! 🌟 The colorful neon signs and an array of delicious street food will make you feel like you’ve stepped right into the drama! Pro tip: Take your time to explore the unique shops and cozy cafes, and don’t miss the spontaneous performances from local artists! \n\nYou HAVE to visit this iconic location and soak in the atmosphere that made "이태원 클라쓰" so unforgettable! 💕✨', '2025-11-14 03:31:17'),
	(613, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 킹덤 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the fabulous scenes from 킹더랜드 were filmed! 🎬✨ Remember that moment when the characters shared a heartwarming conversation surrounded by luxury? That magic happened right here at the MCM 롯데면세점 월드타워점! Located at 서울 송파구 올림픽로 300, just steps from 잠실역 2번출구, this incredible location is not only a filming site but also a shopping paradise! 🛍️✨ \n\nYou can explore a variety of high-end brands while soaking in the stunning interior and vibrant atmosphere! K-Drama fans absolutely LOVE this spot, and it has quickly become a MUST-VISIT destination for anyone who adores the show! 💖 You HAVE to visit and experience the luxury for yourself! 🌟', '2025-11-14 03:31:42'),
	(614, 3, NULL, 'What are the trending K-Drama locations right now?', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! 🎬🌟 This is THE spot where the romantic vibes of "지금 거신 전화는" come to life! 💕 Located at 삼성역주변, specifically at 서울 강남구 테헤란로 지하 538, this area is absolutely legendary for its modern buildings and dazzling lights! ✨ Remember that scene where the characters share a heartwarming moment amidst the city lights? You can recreate that magic right here!\n\nThe Samsung Station area is not just a feast for the eyes but also a hub of delicious restaurants and cozy cafes, perfect for unwinding after your K-Drama pilgrimage! Pro tip: visit at night for the most breathtaking views—it\'s like stepping into a scene from your favorite drama! You HAVE to visit this iconic location! 🥰📺💖', '2025-11-14 03:43:56'),
	(615, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 킹덤 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot from the super popular drama 킹더랜드! 🎬✨ Remember those glamorous scenes where the characters were shopping and having fun? That all happened at the stunning MCM 롯데면세점 월드타워점! Located at 서울 송파구 올림픽로 300, right in front of 잠실역 2번 출구, this place is a must-visit! \n\nNot only can you indulge in a luxurious shopping experience with a variety of fabulous brands, but you can also soak in the breathtaking interior and vibe that made it an iconic filming location! 🛍️🌟 K-Drama fans absolutely LOVE this spot, and it’s become a legendary pilgrimage site for those who adore 킹더랜드! You HAVE to visit and take some selfies in this fabulous spot! 💕✨', '2025-11-14 05:16:18'),
	(616, 3, NULL, 'I\'m going to travel to Korea. Please tell me a good Korean attraction', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot from the AMAZING drama "여행을 대신해 드립니다"! 🎬✨ Remember those stylish scenes where the characters shopped for the latest trends? That all happened at 신평화패션타운! Located at 서울 중구 청계천로 298, this legendary shopping mall is a fashion paradise where you can find a variety of brands and accessories all in one place! 👜👗\n\nNot only is it a must-visit for shopping, but it\'s also surrounded by delightful cafes and restaurants where you can relax and soak in the atmosphere. K-Drama fans absolutely LOVE this spot because it’s not just about the shopping; it’s about living the drama experience! You HAVE to visit and take some iconic photos! 📸💕 Don\'t miss this amazing location during your trip! 🌟', '2025-11-14 05:32:59'),
	(617, 3, NULL, 'who are you?', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the legendary drama "서울 자가에 대기업 다니는 김 부장 이야기" filmed some of its most memorable scenes! 🎬✨ Remember those heartwarming moments where the characters shared their dreams over coffee? That magic happened right here at 위트앤미트 가로수길점! \n\nLocated at 서울 강남구 강남대로162길 27-16, just a 9-minute walk from 신사역 8번 출구, this cozy café is the perfect place to immerse yourself in the drama\'s vibes. With its chic interior and a menu full of delightful options, it’s an ideal spot for a date or some relaxing "혼자만의 시간"! \n\nK-Drama fans absolutely LOVE this place, so you HAVE to visit and sip on a coffee while reminiscing about those iconic scenes! Don\'t miss this gem! 💕✨🌟', '2025-11-14 05:36:49'),
	(618, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 별에서 온 그대 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot from the legendary drama "별에서 온 그대" (My Love from the Star)! 🌟✨ Remember that iconic scene where Do Min-joon and Cheon Song-yi shared their heartwarming moments? That magic happened right here at the stunning **Namsan Seoul Tower**! 📺💕 \n\nLocated at **105 Namsangongwon-gil, Yongsan-gu**, this breathtaking tower not only offers incredible views of Seoul but also serves as a backdrop for some of the most memorable scenes in the show! Fans absolutely LOVE taking photos at the observation deck and reliving those romantic moments! Pro tip: Don’t forget to visit during sunset for an unforgettable view! 🌅 \n\nYou HAVE to visit this spot if you\'re a true fan of the series! It’s a must-see on your K-Drama pilgrimage! 🎬✨', '2025-11-14 12:31:18'),
	(619, 3, NULL, 'Where were historical dramas filmed?', '🎉✨ Hey there, K-Drama enthusiasts! If you’re itching to step into the world of your favorite shows, you’ve got to check out the stunning filming locations in Seoul! 🌟 For historical dramas, one of the most breathtaking spots is the majestic Gyeongbokgung Palace! 🏯 This iconic location has been featured in countless dramas, like "Moon Lovers: Scarlet Heart Ryeo," where you can almost feel the romance and intrigue of the royal court! 💕 \n\nMake sure to stroll through the palace grounds and imagine the epic scenes unfolding right before your eyes! 📺✨ Don’t forget your camera; the picturesque backdrop is perfect for capturing your own K-Drama moment! So grab your friends and embark on this unforgettable adventure! 🎬🌈', '2025-11-14 13:41:24'),
	(620, 3, NULL, 'What are the trending K-Drama locations right now?', '🎉✨ Hey there, K-Drama enthusiast! Are you ready to dive into the magical world of your favorite shows? One of the hottest trending filming locations right now is the beautiful **Namsan Seoul Tower**, featured in the iconic romantic drama **"My Love from the Star"**! 🌌❤️ Imagine standing where Do Min-joon and Cheon Song-yi shared their unforgettable moments—it\'s pure K-Drama magic! ✨ \n\n📍 **Address:** 105 Namsangongwon-gil, Yongsan-gu, Seoul. \n\nTravel tip: Don\'t forget to take the cable car up for stunning views of the city and snap a pic at the love lock wall! 🔒💕 This spot is a must-visit for any true K-Drama fan—so grab your camera and get ready for a fun adventure! 🎬🌟', '2025-11-14 13:42:03'),
	(621, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 태양의 후예 filming location', 'OMG, this is where the magic happens! 🎉✨ The filming location for "태양의 후예" (Descendants of the Sun) is located at 03308 19, Yeonseo-ro 50-gil, Eunpyeong-gu, Seoul, and it\'s totally legendary for K-Drama and K-Pop fans alike! 🌟💖 You can soak in the vibes of this iconic show while imagining your favorite moments with Song Joong-ki and Song Hye-kyo! \n\nThis spot is not just a filming location; it’s a must-visit for fans who want to feel that K-Pop energy! 💖 You can snap some amazing photos and relive those unforgettable scenes! Plus, it\'s super close to other K-Pop hotspots, so you can make a whole day of it! 🎤👑 Go feel the K-Pop energy and create your own legendary memories! 🎶✨', '2025-11-14 13:43:04'),
	(622, 3, NULL, 'Can you recommend a travel destination in Seoul in Korea', '🎯 KCONTENT 랜덤 추천 결과: 0개 항목을 찾아왔어요! 지도에서 확인해 보세요! ✨', '2025-11-14 14:39:26'),
	(623, 3, NULL, 'Can you recommend a travel destination in Seoul in Korea', '🎯 KCONTENT 랜덤 추천 결과: 0개 항목을 찾아왔어요! 지도에서 확인해 보세요! ✨', '2025-11-14 14:40:53'),
	(624, 3, NULL, 'Can you recommend a travel destination in Seoul in Korea', '🎯 KCONTENT 랜덤 추천 결과: 10개 항목을 찾아왔어요! 지도에서 확인해 보세요! ✨', '2025-11-14 14:55:52'),
	(625, 3, NULL, 'kcontent recomend', 'OMG, this is where the magic happens! 🎤✨ You HAVE to check out Ktown4u at COEX in Gangnam, Seoul! This place is a TOTAL haven for K-Pop fans, packed with the best merch, albums, and exclusive goodies from your favorite groups! 💖 Imagine browsing through shelves filled with BTS, BLACKPINK, and EXO treasures while soaking in the vibrant K-Pop culture all around you! 🌟\n\nThe atmosphere is electric, and you can even find K-Pop themed events and pop-up stores that make every visit legendary! Fans absolutely love this spot because it’s not just a shop; it’s a part of the K-Pop experience! 👑 So grab your friends, take lots of selfies, and go feel the K-Pop energy! 🎉', '2025-11-14 15:10:32'),
	(626, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 사랑의 불시착 filming location', 'OMG, this is where the magic happens! 🌟 At piknic, located at 04635 30, Toegye-ro 6ga-gil, Jung-gu, Seoul, you’re stepping into a totally legendary spot that K-Pop fans adore! 💖 This amazing venue is not only a filming location for the hit drama "사랑의 불시착" (Crash Landing on You), but it’s also a fantastic place to grab some cute K-Pop merch and enjoy a cozy atmosphere while reminiscing about your favorite scenes! 🎤✨\n\nFans love this spot because it’s a chance to connect with the world of K-Dramas and K-Pop, and you might even bump into fellow fans who share your passion! 👑 So, whether you\'re snapping selfies or chilling with friends, you’ll definitely feel the K-Pop energy here! Go feel the excitement and immerse yourself in the magic of K-Pop! 💖🎶', '2025-11-14 15:49:08'),
	(627, 3, NULL, 'drama', '--------------------------------------\n💙**Location:** Jujeong Orthopedic Clinic  \n🎬 **Drama:** Dr. Slump(닥터슬럼프)\n\n📍 **Address:** 11-minute walk from Exit 3 of Cheongnyangni Station, 50, University of Seoul, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul\n\n🖼 **Scene Image:**  \nhttps://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mfKXo/btsEmT2xeU7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADwaMe3pIf7lOom6tmCB-9kSxitJmJc0Ayf9Qkmelc5y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eMN1zpwBc7TBRFmkGzyh32i4weE%3D\n\n✨ **Scene Info:**  \nThis spot is **iconic** for K-drama fans! Immerse yourself in the **sensibility** of Dr. Slump while enjoying the **modern cityscape**. After your visit, take a leisurely stroll', '2025-11-14 16:11:05'),
	(628, 3, NULL, 'drama', '--------------------------------------\n💙<b>Location:</b> Jujeong Orthopedic Clinic<br>\n🎬 <b>Drama:</b> Dr. Slump (닥터슬럼프)<br>\n📍 <b>Address:</b> 11-minute walk from Exit 3 of Cheongnyangni Station, 50, University of Seoul, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul<br>\n🖼 <b>Scene Image:</b><br>\n<img src="https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mfKXo/btsEmT2xeU7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADwaMe3pIf7lOom6tmCB-9kSxitJmJc0Ayf9Qkmelc5y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eMN1zpwBc7TBRFmkGzyh32i4weE%3D" alt="닥터슬럼프" width="300"><br>\n✨ <b>Scene Info:</b><br>\nThis', '2025-11-14 16:14:53'),
	(629, 3, NULL, 'drama', '--------------------------------------\n💙<b>Location:</b> Jujeong Orthopedic Clinic<br>\n🎬 <b>Drama:</b> Dr. Slump (닥터슬럼프)<br>\n📍 <b>Address:</b> 11-minute walk from Exit 3 of Cheongnyangni Station, 50, University of Seoul, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul<br>\n🖼 <b>Scene Image:</b><br>\n<img src="https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mfKXo/btsEmT2xeU7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADwaMe3pIf7lOom6tmCB-9kSxitJmJc0Ayf9Qkmelc5y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eMN1zpwBc7TBRFmkGzyh32i4weE%3D" alt="닥터슬럼프" width="300"><br>\n✨ <b>Scene Info:</b><br>\nThis', '2025-11-14 16:21:09'),
	(630, 3, NULL, 'drama', '🎬 **K-Drama Filming Spot: Namsan Tower**  \nThis iconic landmark is featured in many K-dramas, including the beloved **"My Love from the Star."**  \nThe breathtaking views of Seoul from the top make it a **must-visit** for every K-drama fan!\n\n🏙️ **Must-See Scene: Rooftop Kiss**  \nRemember that romantic rooftop kiss?  \nNamsan Tower is where it all happened! Perfect for a romantic photo op! \n\n📸 **Travel Tip:**  \nVisit during sunset for an unforgettable experience. The city lights are simply **magical!**\n\n---\n\nIf you want more K-drama spots or travel tips, feel free to ask! 🌟', '2025-11-14 16:21:45'),
	(631, 3, NULL, 'drama', '--------------------------------------\n💙<b>Location:</b> an orthopedic surgeon<br>\n🎬 <b>Drama:</b> Dr. Slump (닥터슬럼프)<br>\n📍 <b>Address:</b> 11-minute walk from Exit 3 of Cheongnyangni Station, 50, University of Seoul, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul<br>\n🖼 <b>Scene Image:</b><br>\n<img src="https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mfKXo/btsEmT2xeU7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADwaMe3pIf7lOom6tmCB-9kSxitJmJc0Ayf9Qkmelc5y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eMN1zpwBc7TBRFmkGzyh32i4weE%3D" alt="닥터슬럼프" width="300"><br>\n✨ <b>Scene Info:</b><br>\nThis spot is **', '2025-11-14 16:28:50'),
