	(633, 3, NULL, 'drama', '💙 <b>Location:</b> Seongbuk-dong Village<br>\n🎬 <b>Drama:</b> My Name (마이 네임)<br>\n📍 <b>Address:</b> 5-minute walk from Exit 2 of Seongbuk Station, Seongbuk-gu, Seoul<br>\n🖼 <b>Scene Image:</b><br>\n<img src="https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mfKXo/btsEmT2xeU7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADwaMe3pIf7lOom6tmCB-9kSxitJmJc0Ayf9Qkmelc5y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eMN1zpwBc7TBRFmkGzyh32i4weE%3D" alt="마이 네임" width="300"><br>\n✨ <b>Scene Info:</b><br>\nSeongbuk-dong Village is a **breathtaking** filming location for', '2025-11-14 16:36:48'),
