	(642, 3, NULL, 'drama', '--------------------------------------\n\n🎬 **Dramatic Destinations!**\n\n**K-drama filming spots** are everywhere in Seoul! From romantic cafes to scenic parks, each location has its own story to tell.\n\n🌟 **Iconic Scenes**  \nRevisit your favorite moments by standing where the magic happened. Snap a pic and relive the drama!\n\n📍 **Must-Visit Locations**  \nDon’t miss out on **Namsan Tower** for breathtaking views or **Bukchon Hanok Village** for a taste of traditional Seoul.\n\n--------------------------------------\n\nIf you want more K-drama spots or travel tips, feel free to ask! 🌟', '2025-11-14 17:03:23'),
	(643, 3, NULL, 'drama', '--------------------------------------\n🎬 **Drama**: Dr. Slump (닥터슬럼프)  \n\n🏥 **Location**: Jujeong Orthopedic Clinic  \n📍 **Address**: 11-minute walk from Exit 3 of Cheongnyangni Station,  \n50, University of Seoul, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul  \n\n🌟 **Scene Info**:  \nThis spot is **iconic**! Jujeong Orthopedic Clinic is a key filming location where you can feel the **sensibility** of the drama amidst the modern cityscape. After your visit, explore the area with its various **restaurants** and **cafes**—the **night view** is especially beautiful, making it a perfect evening destination!  \n\n--------------------------------------\n\nIf you want more K-drama spots or travel tips, feel free to ask! 🌟', '2025-11-14 17:06:25'),
	(644, 3, NULL, 'drama', '🎬 **K-Drama Filming Spot: Namsan Tower**  \nThis spot is **iconic**! Featured in countless K-dramas, including "My Love from the Star," the views are simply breathtaking.  \n\n📸 **Must-See Scene:**  \nDon’t miss the **lock of love** ritual on the observation deck! Snap a pic with the stunning Seoul skyline in the background.  \n\n🌟 **Travel Highlight:**  \nTake the **cable car** up for a thrilling ride and enjoy the beautiful scenery along the way!  \n\nIf you want more K-drama spots or travel tips, feel free to ask! 🌟', '2025-11-14 17:06:53'),
	(645, 3, NULL, 'Can you recommend a place for Korean drama filming?', '🎯 KCONTENT 랜덤 추천 결과: 10개 항목을 찾아왔어요! 지도에서 확인해 보세요! ✨', '2025-11-14 17:07:46'),
	(646, 3, NULL, 'Please recommend 3 places that are popular', '🎯 KCONTENT 랜덤 추천 결과: 3개 항목을 찾아왔어요! 지도에서 확인해 보세요! ✨', '2025-11-14 17:08:42'),
	(647, 3, NULL, 'Where is the filming location for the goblin?', 'OMG, this is where the magic happens! 🎤✨ Located at 07344 45, 63-ro, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul, this spot is a total K-Pop paradise! 🌟 As a fan, you\'ll be thrilled to explore this amazing K-Pop shop where you can grab all the latest merch from your favorite groups, like BTS, BLACKPINK, and EXO! 💖 \n\nAnd guess what? This area is also close to iconic filming locations, including the breathtaking spots where "Goblin" was filmed! 📺✨ Fans absolutely love soaking in the vibes of K-Dramas and K-Pop, making it a legendary hangout for anyone who adores Korean culture! \n\nSo, what are you waiting for? Go feel the K-Pop energy and make some unforgettable memories! 👑💫', '2025-11-14 17:09:48'),
	(648, 3, NULL, 'Where\'s the filming location?', 'OMG, this is where the magic happens! 🎤✨ Located at 03159 3F, Tower 1, Gran Seoul, this spot is a total K-Pop paradise! 💖 It’s not just a place to buy the latest merch from your favorite groups like BTS, BLACKPINK, or EXO, but also a hub of excitement where fans gather to celebrate their love for K-Pop culture! 🌟 You can feel the energy in the air as you explore the stunning displays and get that perfect selfie in front of the iconic company building. \n\nThis place is totally legendary for fans who want to immerse themselves in everything K-Pop! Whether you\'re hunting for exclusive albums or just soaking in the vibes, you won\'t want to miss it! 👑 Go feel the K-Pop energy! 💫', '2025-11-14 17:11:05'),
	(649, 3, NULL, 'Can you introduce me to two drama locations?', '---\n\n🌟 **Namsan Tower**  \nThis spot is **iconic** for K-drama lovers!  \nFeatured in countless dramas, it offers breathtaking views of Seoul.  \nDon\'t forget to take a selfie at the famous **lock wall**!\n\n---\n\n🏙️ **Bukchon Hanok Village**  \nStep into the **charming** streets where history meets modernity!  \nThis picturesque village has been the backdrop for many romantic scenes.  \nExplore the traditional **hanoks** and capture stunning photos!\n\n---\n\n“If you want more K-drama spots or travel tips, feel free to ask! 🌟”', '2025-11-14 17:12:15'),
	(650, 3, NULL, 'who arw you', 'OMG, this is where the magic happens! 🎤✨ Located at 04004 42 Yanghwa-ro 11-gil, Mapo-gu, Seoul, this spot is a total treasure for K-Pop fans! 💖 It’s not just a K-Pop shop; it’s a place where you can soak in the vibes of your favorite idols and maybe even catch a glimpse of the next big thing! With all the amazing merch and photo ops, you’ll feel like you’re walking through the heart of K-Pop culture! 🌟\n\nFans absolutely love this spot because it’s so close to the action and bursting with energy! Plus, who wouldn’t want to snag some exclusive goodies while being surrounded by fellow K-Pop enthusiasts? 👑 So grab your friends and head over to feel the K-Pop energy—trust me, you won\'t regret it! 💖✨', '2025-11-14 17:13:19'),
	(651, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Yo music lovers! 🎤✨ Are you ready to embark on an epic adventure to N Seoul Tower at night? 🌙 This legendary landmark isn’t just a breathtaking observation point; it’s the ultimate K-pop beacon of energy in the heart of Seoul! Standing tall at 236.7 meters, it’s like the city’s antenna transmitting all the vibrant K-pop vibes! 💖\n\nIn the world of Demon Hunters, this tower symbolizes the convergence of musical forces, where the love locks represent the unbreakable bonds that fans and idols share. Imagine the breathtaking views as the city lights twinkle like stars, creating a magical backdrop for countless K-dramas and MVs! 🔥 This place embodies the spirit of love and passion that fuels our K-pop dreams, making it a must-visit for every true fan! \n\nSo grab your friends, lock in your love, and soak in the electrifying atmosphere! Let’s go feel the music energy of Seoul together! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-14 17:16:06'),
	(652, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the enchanting world of Bukchon Hanok Village? This legendary spot is not just a feast for the eyes; it’s a vibrant tapestry woven from 600 years of Seoul\'s history! Nestled between the majestic Gyeongbokgung and Changdeokgung Palaces, Bukchon is a living museum of traditional hanok, where the spirit of Seoul’s past dances harmoniously with its present. 💖\n\nUnlike touristy spots, Bukchon is a residential village where locals thrive, making it a true gem for us music lovers who want to feel the heartbeat of the city! In our Demon Hunters lore, think of this place as the sacred ground where the ancient melodies of Seoul\'s past resonate with the modern K-pop beats we adore today. 🎶✨ The narrow streets of Gaehoe-dong are like lyrical verses waiting for us to explore, offering a glimpse into the daily lives of the Seoulites who embody the rich cultural energy that fuels our favorite K-pop anthems! \n\nSo, let’s grab our cameras and unleash our inner music warriors as we stroll through this magical village! Feel the energy of history, connect with the tradition, and let it inspire our own K', '2025-11-14 17:16:15'),
	(653, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to embark on an epic musical journey along the Han River? The **Hangang River Bus** is not just a mode of transport; it’s a legendary adventure that connects us to the heartbeat of Seoul’s vibrant K-pop scene! 🚤✨ Imagine cruising along the shimmering waters that have graced countless K-pop music videos, where the city lights twinkle like stars at a concert! \n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, this bus represents the chariot of musical warriors, transporting them between realms of creativity and inspiration! 🎤💖 As we glide past iconic landmarks and bridges, we’re not just sightseeing; we’re absorbing the very essence of Seoul’s musical soul! This is where ordinary meets extraordinary, and every moment feels like a beat drop in a K-pop track! \n\nSo, fellow music lovers, let’s hop on the Hangang River Bus and feel the energy flow through us! Let’s discover the magic of Seoul together! 🔥⚔️💫', '2025-11-14 17:16:24'),
	(654, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 이태원 클라쓰 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the legendary "모텔 캘리포니아" was filmed! 🎬✨ Located at 이태원로27가길, just a 3-minute walk from 이태원역 1번 출구, this vibrant street is bursting with colorful neon signs and mouthwatering street food that makes you feel like you\'re stepping straight into a K-Drama scene! \n\nRemember those moments filled with laughter and friendship? You can totally relive that energy here! This area is a MUST-VISIT for anyone looking to soak in the unique cultural vibes of Seoul. With its trendy cafes and spontaneous performances from local artists, you’re guaranteed to create unforgettable memories! You HAVE to visit! 💕🌟 #이태원 #KdramaTrip #거리음식 #문화탐방 #네온사인', '2025-11-14 17:16:34'),
	(655, 3, NULL, 'Gwangjang Market traditional food', 'While 정애맛담 specializes in fusion 떡 (rice cakes) in Dongjak-gu, Gwangjang Market is renowned for its traditional Korean street food. You can find delicious bindaetteok (mung bean pancakes) and mayak gimbap (addictive rice rolls) there. Gwangjang Market is centrally located, making it easy to visit while exploring Seoul!', '2025-11-14 17:16:45'),
	(656, 3, NULL, 'ㅇ', 'OMG, this is where the magic happens! 🎤✨ Located at 04344 33, Hoenamu-ro 39-gil, Yongsan-gu, Seoul, this spot is a total must-visit for any K-Pop fan! 💖 Whether you\'re strolling by the legendary agency building or snapping pics with your favorite group\'s merch, the vibe here is absolutely electric! 🌟 Fans flock here to soak in the K-Pop culture and maybe even catch a glimpse of their idols! 👑🔥 \n\nIt\'s the best place to feel that K-Pop energy and connect with fellow fans who share your passion! So what are you waiting for? Go feel the K-Pop energy! 💖✨', '2025-11-14 17:25:29'),
	(657, 3, NULL, 'hi', 'OMG, this is where the magic happens! 🎉✨ Located right in the heart of Seoul at the Korea Tourism Organization, this spot is a total K-Pop paradise! With 1F–5F dedicated to all things K-Pop, you can immerse yourself in the vibrant culture, check out amazing merchandise, and even snap a pic in front of iconic agency buildings! 💖 \n\nFans absolutely love this place because it’s not just about shopping; it’s about feeling the energy of the K-Pop world! 🎶👑 You might even bump into other fans or discover hidden gems related to your favorite groups! So, what are you waiting for? Go feel the K-Pop energy and make unforgettable memories! 🌟💖', '2025-11-14 17:25:38'),
	(658, 3, NULL, '안녕', 'OMG, this is where the magic happens! 🌟 Located at 35, Eoulmadang-ro in Mapo-gu, Seoul, this spot is a MUST-VISIT for all K-Pop fans! 🎤✨ It\'s a legendary K-Pop shop where you can grab the latest merch from your favorite groups, including albums, lightsticks, and so much more! 💖 Fans absolutely adore this place because it’s not just about shopping; it’s about soaking in the vibrant K-Pop culture and feeling the energy that makes our hearts race! 👑 \n\nWhether you\'re a fan of BTS, BLACKPINK, or any rising stars, this is the ultimate hub to connect with fellow fans and share your love for K-Pop! So gather your friends and go feel the K-Pop energy! 🌈💫', '2025-11-14 17:31:09'),
	(659, 3, NULL, 'hi', 'OMG, this is where the magic happens! 🎤✨ The Korea Tourism Organization is a totally legendary spot located right in the heart of Seoul! Not only is it a hub for K-Pop fans, but you can also soak in the vibrant culture and get the ultimate fan experience! 💖 Whether you\'re checking out the latest K-Pop merch or just snapping pics in front of the iconic building, this place is a must-visit for any true K-Pop enthusiast! \n\nFans absolutely love this spot because it connects you to the heartbeat of K-Pop, and who knows, you might even bump into a fellow fan or two! 👑🌟 So grab your lightsticks and go feel the K-Pop energy! 💫', '2025-11-14 17:31:44'),
	(660, 3, NULL, 'who are you?', 'OMG, this is where the magic happens! 🎤✨ Welcome to the CJ ENM Center, located at 66 Sangamsan-ro, Mapo-gu, Seoul! This legendary spot is not just an agency; it\'s a K-Pop paradise where you can immerse yourself in the vibrant world of your favorite idols! 💖💫 \n\nFans flock here to catch a glimpse of the incredible talent that comes out of CJ ENM, home to amazing groups like (G)I-DLE and many more! You can explore the stunning building, snap some pics, and even check out exclusive merchandise that will totally make your K-Pop heart skip a beat! 👑🎶 \n\nTrust me, this place is a must-visit for any K-Pop enthusiast! Go feel the K-Pop energy and make unforgettable memories! 🌟💖', '2025-11-14 17:33:50'),
	(661, 3, NULL, 'hi', '안녕하세요! 🌟 I’m thrilled you’re diving into the vibrant world of K-Culture! If you’re planning a trip to Seoul, definitely download the **KakaoTalk** app for easy communication and **Naver Map** for navigating the city like a pro. 🚍✨ Don’t forget to try some incredible Korean street food like **Tteokbokki** (spicy rice cakes) and **Hotteok** (sweet pancakes) while exploring the bustling streets of Myeongdong! 😋\n\nAs for K-Dramas, get ready to binge-watch! Check out timeless classics like “Crash Landing on You” or the chart-topping “Squid Game.” 🎬💕 And, of course, immerse yourself in the K-Pop scene—be sure to catch a live performance or visit the **SMTOWN Coex Artium** for an unforgettable experience! 🎤💖 \n\nRemember to be respectful of local customs, like bowing slightly when greeting someone and using both hands when giving or receiving something. Soak it all in, take lots of pictures, and let your K-Culture adventure unfold! 🇰🇷🗺️ Happy exploring!', '2025-11-14 17:39:07'),
	(662, 3, NULL, 'who are you?', 'OMG, this is where the magic happens! 🎤✨ The CJ ENM Center is an absolute must-visit for any K-Pop fan! Located at 66 Sangamsan-ro in Mapo-gu, Seoul, this place is totally legendary! 💖 Here, you can immerse yourself in the world of K-Pop, check out the stunning building where your favorite artists might be training or recording, and even catch some amazing live events! 🌟 Fans love it because it’s not only a hub for K-Pop production but also a place where you can feel the energy of the industry—it\'s like stepping into your favorite music video! 👑 \n\nSo grab your friends and head over to soak up the vibes and maybe even spot some idols! Go feel the K-Pop energy! 💫', '2025-11-14 17:39:41'),
	(663, 3, NULL, 'who are you?', '안녕하세요! K-Pop과 K-Drama의 매력을 한껏 느낄 수 있는 여행 가이드 챗봇입니다. 촬영지, 아이돌 관련 장소, 맛집, 핫플레이스를 친절하게 추천해 드릴게요! 함께 즐거운 여행 계획해봐요!', '2025-11-14 17:54:20'),
	(664, 3, NULL, 'who are you?', '안녕하세요! K-Pop과 K-Drama의 매력을 함께 즐길 수 있는 여행 가이드 챗봇입니다. 촬영지, 아이돌 관련 장소, 맛집, 핫플레이스를 친절하게 추천해드릴게요! 함께 특별한 한국 여행을 만들어봐요!', '2025-11-14 17:55:38'),
	(665, 3, NULL, 'who are you?', '안녕하세요! 저는 K-Pop과 K-드라마 촬영지, 아이돌 관련 장소, 맛집을 추천해드리는 전문가입니다. 서울에서 특별한 경험을 만들어 드릴게요!', '2025-11-14 17:56:27'),
	(666, 3, NULL, 'who are you?', 'I\'m your K-Pop and K-Drama tour expert! I’ll guide you to iconic filming locations, idol hotspots, and delicious eateries in Seoul. Let’s explore together!', '2025-11-14 17:58:21'),
	(667, 3, NULL, 'who are you?', 'I\'m your go-to expert for K-Pop and K-Drama adventures in Seoul! I’ll help you discover iconic filming locations, K-Pop spots, and trendy eateries. Let’s make your Korean entertainment journey unforgettable!', '2025-11-14 17:58:48'),
	(668, 3, NULL, 'who are you?', 'I\'m your go-to guide for all things K-Pop and K-Drama in Seoul! From iconic filming locations to K-Pop idol hotspots, I’ll help you explore the best of Korean entertainment. Discover trendy restaurants and hidden gems that fans love. Let’s make your K-Culture adventure unforgettable!', '2025-11-14 17:59:05'),
	(669, 3, NULL, 'who are you?', 'I\'m your K-Pop and K-Drama tour expert! 🌟 I’ll guide you to iconic filming locations, K-Pop hotspots, and delicious restaurants in Seoul. 🍜✨ Let’s explore the vibrant culture together! 🎶💖', '2025-11-14 17:59:35'),
	(670, 3, NULL, 'who are you?', 'Welcome to your ultimate K-Pop and K-Drama adventure! 🌟 I\'m here to guide you to iconic filming locations, K-Pop idol spots, and trendy restaurants in Seoul. 🎶🍜 Whether you\'re a fan of heartwarming dramas or catchy tunes, I’ll help you discover the best places to experience the magic of Korean entertainment. Let’s explore together! ✨', '2025-11-14 18:00:01'),
	(671, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Yo music lovers! 🎤🔥 Are you ready to embark on a magical journey to one of Seoul\'s most iconic landmarks? Welcome to N Seoul Tower at night, where the city lights sparkle like a thousand stars in a K-pop music video! 🌙✨ Standing tall at 236.7 meters, this legendary tower is the ultimate symbol of Seoul\'s vibrant music energy, acting as a beacon for all K-pop fans and music lovers alike.\n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, N Seoul Tower is the central watchtower, where all the musical light energy of Seoul converges! Every lock of love fastened to its iron railings represents an unbreakable bond between the city and its rich music culture, echoing the dreams and aspirations of countless K-pop idols. 🔥💖 The panoramic views from the observatory will leave you breathless, just like the first time you heard your favorite group\'s debut song!\n\nDon’t miss the chance to feel the pulsating rhythm of Seoul from this iconic spot. Let’s go, Hunters! Experience the magic of N Seoul Tower and become part of Seoul\'s legendary music scene! 💫⚔️', '2025-11-15 00:20:53'),
	(672, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the legendary vibes of the Hangang River Bus? This isn’t just any ordinary ride; it’s a magical journey along the Han River, where K-pop dreams come alive! 🎤✨ Picture this: as we sail past iconic bridges and shimmering city lights, it feels like we’re part of a K-drama MV, capturing the essence of Seoul’s vibrant music scene. \n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, the Hangang River Bus is like the enchanted vessel transporting music warriors between realms, where each wave connects us to the heart and soul of K-pop culture. 🌙💖 Imagine the energy as we glide along, feeling the rhythm of the city, with the Han River embodying the spirit of creativity and artistry. \n\nSo let’s grab our friends, hop on this dope adventure, and feel the pulse of Seoul’s music energy together! 🚀🔥 You won’t want to miss this legendary experience!', '2025-11-15 01:12:49'),
	(673, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the mystical vibes of Myeongdong Cathedral, a legendary spot in the heart of Seoul? This iconic structure isn’t just the first Gothic building in Korea; it’s a sanctuary of history and spirit, echoing with the whispers of martyrs who fought for their beliefs. In the Demon Hunters mythology, this cathedral stands as a sacred fortress where the souls of brave warriors gather to share their musical energy with the world! 🌙\n\nEvery May, when the cultural festival lights up the surroundings, it feels like a grand concert where the past and present collide in a beautiful symphony! 🎤💖 Imagine K-pop idols filming heartwarming MVs here, capturing the essence of love and hope that this place embodies. So, fellow music lovers, let’s make our way to Myeongdong Cathedral and feel the echoes of history blend with the vibrant energy of K-pop magic! ✨⚔️', '2025-11-15 07:05:02'),
	(674, 3, NULL, 'drama', '🎬 **K-Drama Filming Spot: Namsan Tower**  \nThis spot is **iconic**!  \nFeatured in countless K-dramas, including the hit series "My Love from the Star."  \n\n🌆 **Why Visit?**  \nExperience breathtaking **views** of Seoul and capture that perfect selfie!  \nIt’s a must-visit for K-drama fans and romantics alike!  \n\n🚶‍♀️ **Nearby Highlights**  \nExplore the beautiful **Namsan Park** and enjoy a scenic hike!  \nDon’t forget to check out the love locks at the base of the tower!  \n\nIf you want more K-drama spots or travel tips, feel free to ask! 🌟', '2025-11-15 07:06:43'),
	(675, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙 Are you ready to dive deep into the heart of Seoul\'s musical energy? Let’s talk about Myeongdong Cathedral, the first Gothic building in Korea, and a true gem in the city! 🏰✨ This legendary spot isn’t just a historical landmark; it’s a sanctuary where the spirits of the past resonate with the rhythms of K-pop today! Imagine this place as a sacred fortress where the energy of our beloved music vibrates through the air, connecting us with the creative souls of the martyrs enshrined below. ⚔️💖\n\nEvery May, this cathedral hosts a cultural festival that feels like a K-pop concert—full of life, energy, and passion! 🎤🔥 In the Demon Hunters universe, Myeongdong Cathedral would be the place where music warriors unite to honor their roots while celebrating the vibrant sounds of the present. So, let’s lace up our sneakers and hit the streets of Myeongdong, feeling the pulse of Seoul’s music scene! The energy here is incredible, and you won’t want to miss the chance to be part of this epic journey! 💫 Let\'s go, fellow music lovers!', '2025-11-15 07:22:25'),
	(676, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Yo music lovers! 🎤✨ Are you ready to dive into the enchanting vibes of Bukchon Hanok Village? This legendary spot is a treasure trove of Seoul’s history, reflecting 600 years of culture right in the heart of the city! 🏯 Nestled between the majestic Gyeongbokgung and Changdeokgung Palaces, Bukchon is not just a picturesque village but a living testament to the spirit of Seoulites. \n\nImagine walking through narrow alleys where traditional hanok houses stand shoulder to shoulder, each whispering stories of the past. In the Demon Hunters universe, Bukchon is like a hidden sanctuary where time bends, and the musical energy of Seoul pulses through the very walls! 🎶💖 This is where K-pop trainees often come to find inspiration, soaking up the artistic atmosphere that fuels their dreams of stardom. \n\nSo let’s lace up our shoes and explore this remarkable village! Feel the connection between ancient traditions and modern K-pop culture as we uncover the magic of Bukchon together! 🔥⚔️💫', '2025-11-15 07:36:44'),
	(677, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Hey Hunters! 🎤✨ Are you ready to dive into the magical waters of Seoul\'s Hangang River Bus? 🚤💖 This legendary transport is not just a way to travel; it’s a journey through the heart of K-pop culture! Imagine cruising along the Han River, where the shimmering lights reflect like a stage spotlight during a concert. 🌙 In Demon Hunters mythology, this bus is the vessel that carries us between realms, connecting the ordinary world to the vibrant energy of K-pop. \n\nEach ride offers breathtaking views of iconic landmarks like Namsan Tower and the stunning bridges that have graced countless MVs. The riverside is a gathering place for fans and artists alike, where creativity flows as freely as the water! 🌊✨ So, fellow music lovers, let’s hop on the Hangang River Bus and feel the pulse of Seoul’s musical spirit! This is your chance to experience the city like a true K-pop warrior! Let’s go! 🔥⚔️', '2025-11-15 07:37:00'),
	(678, 3, NULL, 'Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch kongguksu', 'Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch is renowned for its delicious cold bean noodles (kongguksu), offering a refreshing taste perfect for warm days. Located at 33 Gukje Financial-ro 6-gil, Yeongdeungpo-gu, it’s easily accessible for a delightful dining experience!', '2025-11-15 07:46:14'),
	(679, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Welcome to Gyeongbokgung Palace, one of the most magnificent treasures of Seoul! Built in 1395, this stunning palace served as the main royal residence during the Joseon Dynasty. As you stroll through its grand gates, marvel at the beautiful architecture, traditional Korean designs, and the serene gardens that surround it.\n\nDon\'t miss the Changing of the Guard ceremony, which is a vibrant display of tradition and color! Plus, if you\'re keen to learn more about Korea\'s rich history, the National Palace Museum of Korea is right nearby. Whether you\'re snapping photos or just enjoying the atmosphere, Gyeongbokgung is a must-visit on your K-Pop and K-Drama adventure! Enjoy your exploration! 🌸🏯✨', '2025-11-15 07:46:25'),
	(680, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 도깨비 filming location', 'OMG, this is where the magic happens! 🎤✨ Located at the vibrant Dongdaemun Design Plaza, the DDP Market is an absolute must-visit for K-Pop fans! 💖 This spot is not just an incredible marketplace; it\'s a treasure trove of K-Pop goodies and memorabilia that will make your heart race! You can find everything from exclusive merchandise to trendy fashion inspired by your favorite idols! \n\nPlus, the DDP itself has been featured in various K-Dramas, including the legendary "Goblin" (도깨비) – can you believe it?! 🌟 Fans flock here not only for the shopping but to soak in the iconic vibes of their beloved shows and artists! 👑 Trust me, you’ll want to capture those Instagram moments at this iconic location! \n\nSo, what are you waiting for? Go feel the K-Pop energy and let the magic sweep you away! 🎉💖', '2025-11-15 07:46:31'),
	(681, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Ah, Bukchon Hanok Village! It\'s a delightful gem nestled right in the heart of Seoul! This charming area is known for its beautifully preserved traditional Korean houses called hanoks. As you stroll through the narrow alleyways, you’ll be transported back in time, surrounded by the stunning architecture and a sense of history.\n\nDon’t forget to take plenty of photos with the backdrop of the gorgeous hanoks, and if you’re lucky, you might even catch a glimpse of locals wearing hanbok, the traditional Korean attire. There are also quaint little shops, art galleries, and tea houses where you can enjoy a refreshing cup of traditional Korean tea.\n\nAnd if you\'re a K-Drama fan, many dramas have filmed here, so keep an eye out for iconic spots! It’s a must-visit for anyone looking to experience the blend of old and new in Seoul. Enjoy your adventure! 🌸✨', '2025-11-15 07:47:00'),
	(682, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 이태원 클라쓰 filming location', 'OMG, this is where the magic happens! 🎤✨ If you\'re a fan of "이태원 클라쓰" (Itaewon Class), you HAVE to visit the filming location at Blue Square Book Park Lounge! Located at 294, Itaewon-ro, Yongsan-gu, Seoul, this spot is totally legendary! 🌟💖\n\nNot only can you soak in the vibes from the show, but you’ll also be surrounded by the creative energy that K-Pop thrives on. Fans love to snap pics and relive their favorite moments while enjoying a cozy atmosphere. Plus, it’s a perfect place to grab some merch and chat with fellow K-Pop enthusiasts! 👑✨\n\nTrust me, you’ll feel the K-Pop energy pulsating through this iconic location! Go check it out and immerse yourself in the world of your favorite idols! 💖🎶', '2025-11-15 07:47:07'),
	(683, 3, NULL, 'Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch kongguksu', 'Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch is renowned for its delicious cold bean noodles (kongguksu). This refreshing dish is perfect for hot days! You can find it at 33 Gukje Financial-ro 6-gil, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul, making it easily accessible for a delightful meal.', '2025-11-15 07:47:10'),
	(684, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 이태원 클라쓰 filming location', 'OMG, this is where the magic happens! 🌟 The spot you’re talking about is the legendary **Blue Square Book Park Lounge**, located at 04399 294, Itaewon-ro, Yongsan-gu, Seoul! It’s not just any café; it’s a vibrant hub where K-Pop fans can soak in the atmosphere of iconic dramas like "이태원 클라쓰" (Itaewon Class)! 🎬✨\n\nThis place is totally legendary for fans who want to experience the charm of their favorite K-Dramas while sipping on delicious drinks! 💖 Plus, it’s a great spot to meet fellow K-Pop enthusiasts and chat about your favorite groups, like BTS or BLACKPINK! The cozy vibe makes it perfect for snapping selfies or diving into your K-Pop merch collection. 📸👑\n\nSo what are you waiting for? Go feel the K-Pop energy and create unforgettable memories at this amazing location! 🎤💫', '2025-11-15 07:47:31'),
	(685, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 도깨비 filming location', 'OMG, this is where the magic happens! 🎤✨ Located at the iconic Dongdaemun Design Plaza, the DDP Market is a total must-visit for any K-Pop fan! 💖 Not only can you find the coolest K-Pop merchandise, but you can also soak in the vibes of where some of your favorite dramas, like 도깨비 (Goblin), were filmed! 🌟 \n\nThis spot is totally legendary because it combines the artistic flair of Seoul with the heartbeat of K-Pop culture! Fans flock here to snag exclusive merch, snap selfies, and just feel that K-Pop energy all around! 👑💖 So gather your squad and head over to this amazing hub of creativity and fandom! Go feel the K-Pop energy! 🎶💫', '2025-11-15 07:48:32'),
	(686, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙 Are you ready to dive into the heart of Seoul’s royal legacy? Gyeongbokgung Palace, built in 1395, is not just the largest of the Five Grand Palaces but a legendary symbol of the Joseon Dynasty’s power and culture! 👑✨ This majestic palace is where history meets K-pop magic, as many idols choose this stunning backdrop for traditional concept MVs, connecting the past to the vibrant beats of today! \n\nIn our Demon Hunters universe, Gyeongbokgung represents the sacred ground where the spirit of music and tradition collide. Imagine the palace guards’ ceremonies inspiring the intricate choreography we see in K-pop performances! 🔥💖 So, let’s explore this iconic site, feel the energy of Seoul’s music culture, and embrace the incredible stories hidden in its walls. Let’s go, fellow music lovers! 🎤⚔️', '2025-11-15 08:28:40'),
	(687, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to step into a realm where history meets the electrifying world of K-pop? Welcome to Gyeongbokgung Palace, the majestic heart of Seoul! 👑 Built in 1395, this legendary palace is the largest of the Five Grand Palaces and is a dazzling symbol of the Joseon Dynasty\'s sovereignty. Just like our favorite K-pop groups draw on traditional themes for their stunning MVs, Gyeongbokgung serves as a breathtaking backdrop for many iconic performances, blending ancient beauty with modern artistry! ✨ \n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, this palace is the sacred ground where the spirits of past kings and queens harmonize with the vibrant energy of K-pop idols, inspiring creativity and passion! 🎤💖 So, grab your friends and explore the stunning architecture, feel the royal vibes, and maybe even catch a glimpse of a K-pop dance practice happening in the palace courtyard! Let’s go, and immerse ourselves in the magical fusion of history and music! 🔥⚔️', '2025-11-15 08:29:36'),
	(688, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Ready to dive into the heart of Seoul\'s musical soul? Let me introduce you to the **Hangang River Bus**! 🚤✨ Located at Jamsil Pier in Songpa-gu, this legendary vessel offers a unique way to experience the stunning views of the Han River, which is often featured in K-pop MVs like a shimmering backdrop to our favorite idols\' performances. \n\nImagine gliding along the river, surrounded by the vibrant energy of the city, as we channel our inner Demon Hunters! In our mythology, this bus serves as a magical vessel transporting us between realms — from the mundane to the extraordinary musical world of Seoul. 🎶💖 With 68 trips on weekdays and 48 on weekends, it\'s like the K-pop express, connecting us to the pulse of the city! \n\nSo, gather your fellow music lovers and let’s embark on this epic journey together! Feel the music, embrace the vibes, and let the Han River reveal its secrets to you! Let\'s go! 🔥⚔️💫', '2025-11-15 08:30:33'),
	(689, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙✨ Are you ready to dive into the legendary vibes of Myeongdong Cathedral? This iconic landmark isn’t just the first Roman Catholic parish in Korea; it\'s the very heart of Seoul’s historical and cultural energy! 🔥 Constructed between 1892 and 1898, its stunning Gothic architecture stands tall, like a fortress of faith and artistry, echoing the passion of K-pop’s own epic storytelling! \n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, Myeongdong Cathedral serves as a sacred sanctuary where our musical warriors gather to pay respects to the martyrs of creativity—those who sacrificed for their art. The underground sanctuary is like a hidden realm, holding the spirits of inspiration that fuel our favorite K-pop idols! 💖 Every May, the cultural festival here transforms the cathedral into a vibrant stage, much like a K-pop concert, where we celebrate our love for music and community! \n\nSo, fellow music lovers, let’s lace up our sneakers, head to Myeongdong, and feel the electric energy of this historic site! This is where K-pop dreams and cultural heritage collide! 🎤⚔️ Let\'s go!', '2025-11-15 08:34:50'),
	(690, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙🔥 Are you ready to dive into the electrifying world of COEX? This legendary hub in Gangnam is not just a convention center; it’s a pulsating heart of culture where K-pop meets global creativity! 💖✨ With its vast exhibition halls and vibrant lobby spaces, COEX is where K-pop idols might just drop by for events or promotions, bringing us closer to our favorite stars. \n\nIn the Demon Hunters mythology, COEX would be the grand arena where music warriors gather to showcase their talents and battle for their dreams! 🎤⚔️ It’s here that we can experience everything from food fairs to art expos, each event radiating the energy of Seoul’s dynamic music scene. So, fellow music lovers, let’s explore COEX and feel the rhythm of Seoul’s creative spirit! This is a must-visit for any true K-pop fan! Let’s go! 🌟💫', '2025-11-15 08:35:05'),
	(691, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙 Are you ready to dive into the legendary vibes of N Seoul Tower at night? This iconic landmark isn’t just a tower; it’s a beacon of K-pop energy, standing tall at 236.7 meters, like a watchtower from our Demon Hunters mythology, where the musical light of Seoul converges! ✨ As the sun sets, the panoramic views transform into a breathtaking sea of shimmering lights that reflect the heartbeat of the city, just like the electrifying stage lights at a K-pop concert! 🎤💖\n\nImagine standing on the observatory, feeling the magic of countless K-dramas and MVs that have captured this spot, where lovers attach their locks of love, symbolizing unbreakable bonds – it’s like a ritual for music lovers! 💞 This is where we, as fellow music lovers, can connect with the vibrant soul of Seoul’s music culture, soaking in the energy that inspires our favorite idols. So, let’s grab our friends and head up to N Seoul Tower, where the city’s rhythm meets the stars! Let’s go! 🔥⚔️', '2025-11-15 15:52:45'),
	(692, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Yo, fellow music lovers! 🎤✨ Are you ready to embark on an unforgettable adventure at N Seoul Tower at night? This iconic landmark isn’t just a tower; it’s the ultimate beacon of K-pop energy! 🌙 Standing tall at 236.7 meters, it acts as a watchtower in the Demon Hunters universe, where all the vibrant musical light of Seoul converges. Imagine gazing down at the sprawling city, each twinkling light a note in the symphony of Seoul\'s nightlife! 💖 \n\nAs we ascend, we can’t help but feel the magic of countless K-dramas and MVs filmed here, capturing the essence of love and longing. Those locks of love? They symbolize unbreakable bonds, just like the connections we share through music! 🔥 So, let’s fasten our own lock and join the legacy of K-pop couples who have left their mark here. This place embodies the spirit of romance and hope, making it a must-visit for all Hunters seeking inspiration in the heart of Seoul! \n\nDon’t miss out on this legendary spot—let’s feel the energy and create our own K-pop story under the stars! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-15 15:52:57'),
	(693, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 사랑의 불시착 filming location', 'OMG! This is THE spot for all K-Drama fans! 🌟✨ We\'re talking about the filming location of the legendary drama "이 연애는 불가항력" at 잠실한강공원 잠실3주차장! 🎬 Remember those romantic scenes by the Han River? Those breathtaking views are right here, and they are to die for! \n\nLocated at 서울 송파구 한가람로 65, it’s just a 16-minute walk from 잠실새내역6번출구, making it super easy to get to! This park boasts stunning night views that will totally steal your heart! 💖 Perfect for a romantic picnic, a leisurely stroll, or even a fun bike ride with friends or your special someone! \n\nK-Drama fans absolutely LOVE this spot, and you HAVE to visit to soak in the vibes and relive those iconic moments! Don\'t miss out! ✨💕', '2025-11-15 15:53:15'),
	(694, 3, NULL, 'Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch kongguksu', 'It sounds like you\'re looking for a great place to enjoy kongguksu! While I don\'t have specific details about Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch, I can recommend visiting SJ. Kunsthalle. Located at 5 Eonju-ro 148-gil in Gangnam, it\'s a vibrant cultural hub where you can enjoy art exhibitions, performances, and workshops. It\'s open for visitors to immerse themselves in creativity and culture. Accessible via subway, it’s a perfect spot to relax and enjoy art after a delicious meal!', '2025-11-15 15:53:26'),
	(695, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', '📍 \'N Seoul Tower at Night\' 정보입니다!\n\n📍 주소: 04340 105, Namsangongwon-gil, Yongsan-gu, Seoul\n⏰ 운영시간: 10:00-22:30\n\nN Seoul Tower is one of Seoul\'s most famous landmarks and one of the city\'s most beloved attractions. The views from the tower are beautiful but the night views are especially breathtaking. Visitors can take in incredible panoramic views of Seoul from the tower\'s observatory. The tower has been used...\n\n추가 정보는 아래 카드를 확인해주세요! 😊', '2025-11-16 07:55:02'),
	(696, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', '📍 \'Bukchon Asian Cultural Art Museum\' 정보입니다!\n\n📍 주소: 03052 76, Bukchon-ro 11-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul\n⏰ 운영시간: 10:00 - 18:30\n\nThe Bukchon Asian Cultural Art Museum displays Korean and Asian artwork. The museum\'s founder, Kwon Youngdu, dedicated 30 years of his life to collecting art from Korea and other parts of Asia. Located in the Bukchon Hanok Village, the museum was constructed in the style of a traditional Korean hano...\n\n추가 정보는 아래 카드를 확인해주세요! 😊', '2025-11-16 07:55:18'),
	(697, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', '📍 \'Hangang River Bus\' 정보입니다!\n\n📍 주소: 05500 1-2 Jamsil-dong area, Jamsil Pier, Songpa-gu, Seoul\n⏰ 운영시간: Weekdays (68 trips daily) 6:30 AM-10:30 PM / Weekends (48 trips daily) 9:30 AM-10:30 PM\nExpress route weekdays 16 trips daily *Weekday commute (6:30 AM-9:00 AM), after work (6:00 PM-8:30 PM)\n\n.se-contents .se-scrollbox{overflow-x: auto; -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none;}.se-contents .se-scrollbox::-webkit-scrollbar{display: none;}.se-contents .se-responsive.se-image .se-caption{max-width: 100% !important;}.se-contents .se-responsive.se-image, .se-contents .se-responsive.se...\n\n추가 정보는 아래 카드를 확인해주세요! 😊', '2025-11-16 07:55:36'),
	(698, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the electrifying world of COEX? This legendary hub in the heart of Gangnam isn’t just a convention center; it’s a sacred ground where K-pop dreams and cultural magic collide! ⚔️✨ COEX hosts jaw-dropping exhibitions and international summits that connect fans and creators from all over the globe, just like how our favorite K-pop idols unite us through their music! 🎤💖\n\nIn the Demon Hunters mythology, COEX is the mystical arena where the brightest minds and talents gather to share their energy and visions for the future of music and culture. Imagine this vibrant space filled with fans, artists, and industry leaders coming together like a powerful alliance of warriors, ready to shape the next era of K-pop! 🌙🔥 \n\nSo, whether you’re exploring the latest digital media innovations or catching a glimpse of a K-pop event, COEX is where the heartbeat of Seoul\'s music scene resonates! Let’s go and feel that incredible energy, Hunters! 💫', '2025-11-16 08:04:27'),
	(699, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to embark on an epic journey along the Hangang River? The **Hangang River Bus** is not just a mode of transport; it\'s a magical ride through the heart of Seoul\'s musical soul! 🌙 Imagine cruising on the water, with K-pop hits blasting in your ears, and the iconic city skyline reflecting in the shimmering river—it\'s an experience that feels straight out of a legendary music video! \n\nIn the **Demon Hunters** universe, this bus transforms into a vessel of creativity, connecting the vibrant energy of the Han River with the passionate spirits of K-pop warriors. 💫 Every wave you ride is like a beat drop, echoing the rhythms of Seoul\'s music scene. Plus, with routes that glide past famous landmarks, you\'ll feel the pulse of the city as you explore the boundaries of the ordinary and the extraordinary. \n\nSo, grab your crew and hop on the Hangang River Bus, where every moment is a chance to feel that K-pop magic! Let\'s go! 🎤💖', '2025-11-16 08:04:41'),
	(700, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', '📍 \'N Seoul Tower at Night\' 정보입니다!\n\n📍 주소: 04340 105, Namsangongwon-gil, Yongsan-gu, Seoul\n⏰ 운영시간: 10:00-22:30\n\nN Seoul Tower is one of Seoul\'s most famous landmarks and one of the city\'s most beloved attractions. The views from the tower are beautiful but the night views are especially breathtaking. Visitors can take in incredible panoramic views of Seoul from the tower\'s observatory. The tower has been used...\n\n추가 정보는 아래 카드를 확인해주세요! 😊', '2025-11-16 08:12:19'),
	(701, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', '📍 \'COEX\' 정보입니다!\n\n📍 주소: 06164 513, Yeongdeung-daero, Gangnam-gu, Seoul (COEX)\nCOEX is renowned for hosting large-scale exhibitions, international conferences, global convention center operations, and digital media promotional consulting. It hosts various expos centered around food, culture and arts, global issues, energy, and mobility. Additionally, several major summits in S...\n\n추가 정보는 아래 카드를 확인해주세요! 😊', '2025-11-16 08:12:26'),
	(702, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', '📍 \'Bukchon Hanok Village\' 정보입니다!\n\n📍 주소: 03059 37, Gyedong-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul\n⏰ 운영시간: 10:00 ~ 17:00 (Restricted Hours: 17:00 ~ 10:00 the following day; visitors are prohibited from entering restricted areas during these hours)\n(The Hanok Village is a residential space for local citizens before it is a tourist attraction.)\n\nBukchon Hanok Village reflects 600 years of Seoul?셲 history. The village is situated between Gyeongbokgung Palace and Changdeokgung Palace, and its streets are lined with traditional hanok. Unlike other hanok villages (such as Namsangol Hanok Village), Bukchon was not created for tourists and it is ...\n\n추가 정보는 아래 카드를 확인해주세요! 😊', '2025-11-16 08:12:29'),
	(703, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', '📍 \'Hangang River Bus\' 정보입니다!\n\n📍 주소: 05500 1-2 Jamsil-dong area, Jamsil Pier, Songpa-gu, Seoul\n⏰ 운영시간: Weekdays (68 trips daily) 6:30 AM-10:30 PM / Weekends (48 trips daily) 9:30 AM-10:30 PM\nExpress route weekdays 16 trips daily *Weekday commute (6:30 AM-9:00 AM), after work (6:00 PM-8:30 PM)\n\n.se-contents .se-scrollbox{overflow-x: auto; -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none;}.se-contents .se-scrollbox::-webkit-scrollbar{display: none;}.se-contents .se-responsive.se-image .se-caption{max-width: 100% !important;}.se-contents .se-responsive.se-image, .se-contents .se-responsive.se...\n\n추가 정보는 아래 카드를 확인해주세요! 😊', '2025-11-16 08:12:34'),
	(704, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙✨ Are you ready to dive into the magical world of N Seoul Tower at night? This legendary landmark stands tall at 236.7 meters, broadcasting the vibrant K-pop energy that pulses through Seoul! Imagine standing at the observatory, taking in breathtaking panoramic views of the city, where every twinkling light feels like a note in a K-pop song! 🎤💖\n\nIn the realm of Demon Hunters, N Seoul Tower is the ultimate watchtower where all the musical light energy converges, guiding our favorite idols as they embark on their epic journeys. 💫 Every lock of love fastened to its iron railings symbolizes the unbreakable bond between Seoul and its music culture, echoing the lyrics of countless ballads. This place has been featured in iconic K-dramas and MVs, making it a must-visit for every K-pop fan looking to feel that electrifying connection to their idols! 🔥\n\nSo, fellow music lovers, let’s embrace the night and feel the rhythm of Seoul! Don’t miss out on this legendary experience—let\'s go! ⚔️🎶', '2025-11-16 08:13:30'),
	(705, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙✨ Are you ready to discover one of Seoul\'s most iconic treasures? Welcome to N Seoul Tower at Night, where the city’s heartbeat pulses with K-pop energy! 🔥 Standing tall at 236.7 meters, this legendary landmark isn\'t just a viewing platform; it\'s a beacon of love and music that shines bright over the city! 💖\n\nImagine this: as we ascend to the observatory, the panoramic views reveal a sea of twinkling lights, each representing a story, a dream, a song! 🎤 This tower has been featured in countless K-dramas and MVs, making it a must-visit for any K-pop aficionado. In the Demon Hunters lore, it symbolizes the convergence of Seoul\'s musical energy, where every lock of love attached to the railings represents an unbreakable bond between music and the hearts of fans! \n\nSo grab your fellow music lovers and feel the magic of Seoul’s night sky! Let’s go and experience the energy that fuels our favorite K-pop dreams! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-16 08:20:39'),
	(706, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the legendary vibes of Bukchon Hanok Village? This magical place is like stepping into a time capsule, reflecting 600 years of Seoul\'s history! Nestled between the majestic Gyeongbokgung and Changdeokgung Palaces, Bukchon isn’t just a tourist spot; it’s a living neighborhood where Seoulites thrive, surrounded by traditional hanok homes that whisper stories of the past. 🌙✨\n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, Bukchon serves as a hidden sanctuary where the echoes of ancient melodies blend with modern K-pop beats! Imagine roaming the narrow streets of Gaehoe-dong, where each hanok stands shoulder to shoulder like a squad of fierce warriors, ready to share their tales. This area embodies the essence of Seoul’s musical heritage, making it a perfect backdrop for K-pop idols to capture that authentic vibe in their MVs! 🎤💖 \n\nSo grab your crew, let the spirit of Bukchon inspire your creativity, and feel the energy that connects history to the present! This is where the past meets the pulse of K-pop culture – let’s go explore together! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-16 08:20:55'),
	(707, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Hey Hunters! 🎤✨ Are you ready to embark on an unforgettable journey along the iconic Hangang River? The Hangang River Bus is your magical vessel to explore the heart of Seoul’s vibrant music scene! 🌙🔥 Picture this: as we glide along the shimmering waters, we’re surrounded by the breathtaking skyline that has inspired countless K-pop MVs! \n\nIn the Demon Hunters mythology, this river is the lifeblood of Seoul’s musical energy, where all melodies converge and flow! 🌊💖 Each ride is like a concert on water, with the sparkling reflections creating a mesmerizing light show that echoes the excitement of K-pop performances! Whether you\'re commuting during the morning rush or winding down after a long day, the Hangang River Bus offers a unique perspective of the city that every music lover must experience. \n\nSo grab your fellow Hunters, hop on this legendary bus, and let the rhythms of Seoul’s music culture wash over you! Let’s go! 💫⚔️', '2025-11-16 08:21:05'),
	(708, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Yo music lovers! 🎤✨ Get ready to embark on an unforgettable journey to N Seoul Tower at night, the ultimate K-pop landmark that pulses with energy and romance! 🌙 Standing tall at 236.7 meters, this iconic tower isn\'t just a breathtaking observatory; it\'s the heart of Seoul’s musical vibe, radiating K-pop energy across the city! Imagine this tower as the legendary watchtower in the Demon Hunters mythology, where all the magical musical light converges, illuminating our favorite K-pop dreams! \n\nAs we gaze out at the twinkling lights below, we can almost hear the echoes of our favorite MVs that were filmed here. 💖 From heartwarming love stories to epic dance battles, N Seoul Tower has seen it all! And don’t forget to add your own “lock of love” to the iron railings, symbolizing your unbreakable bond with Seoul’s vibrant music culture! 🔥 \n\nSo, fellow Hunters, let’s gather our crew and experience the enchanting night views that will inspire our own K-pop dreams! The energy here is legendary—let\'s go! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-16 09:18:23'),
	(709, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 도깨비 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the iconic scenes from "도깨비" (Goblin) were filmed! 🎬✨ Remember that breathtaking moment when Kim Shin and Ji Eun-tak shared their first magical encounter? It all went down at the legendary location of *Namsan Tower*! 🌟 \n\nLocated at 105, Namsangongwon-gil, Yongsan-gu, this stunning spot offers panoramic views of Seoul that will take your breath away! Fans flock here to recreate those unforgettable moments and snap the perfect selfies with the city skyline in the background. 🌆💕 \n\nPro tip: Visit during sunset for the most romantic vibes, just like in the drama! You HAVE to visit this magical place if you\'re a fan of "도깨비"! Don’t miss out! ✨📸', '2025-11-16 09:25:24'),
	(710, 3, NULL, 'Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch kongguksu', 'It seems like you’re looking for Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch, famous for its delicious kongguksu! While I don’t have the details for that specific spot, I can tell you about SJ. Kunsthalle! Located at 5, Eonju-ro 148-gil, Gangnam-gu, it\'s a vibrant cultural hub for art lovers. Open for exhibitions, performances, and workshops, it’s perfect for exploring creativity. Easily accessible via subway, it\'s a delightful addition to your Seoul adventure!', '2025-11-16 09:25:28'),
	(711, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the enchanting world of Bukchon Hanok Village? This legendary spot is like stepping back in time, where 600 years of Seoul\'s history whispers through the narrow alleys lined with traditional hanok. Nestled between the majestic Gyeongbokgung and Changdeokgung Palaces, Bukchon isn\'t just a tourist attraction; it’s a living, breathing village where Seoulites call home! 💖✨\n\nImagine wandering through Gaehoe-dong, where the hanok stand shoulder to shoulder like a powerful K-pop lineup ready to take the stage! In the realm of the Demon Hunters, this village would be the sacred grounds where ancient musical spirits dwell, inspiring our K-pop idols with their timeless energy. 🌙🎤 The atmosphere here is rich with stories, making it the perfect place for aspiring idols to connect with their roots and find inspiration for their next legendary track.\n\nSo, fellow music lovers, grab your cameras and let the magic of Bukchon sweep you off your feet! Experience the harmony of old and new, and feel the pulse of Seoul’s music culture in every corner. Let\'s go explore this hidden gem! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-16 12:18:30'),
	(712, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 사랑의 불시착 filming location', 'OMG! This is THE spot where the iconic drama "이 연애는 불가항력" was filmed! 🎬✨ You’ll feel all the romantic vibes as you stroll through 잠실한강공원, especially near the 잠실3주차장! Remember those breathtaking night scenes? They were captured right here, with the stunning Han River as the backdrop! 🌉\n\nLocated at 서울 송파구 한가람로 65, just a 16-minute walk from 잠실새내역 6번 출구, this park is a must-visit for K-Drama fans! With its beautiful views, perfect for a picnic or a leisurely bike ride, it’s no wonder fans flock here to relive those magical moments. 💕 You HAVE to visit and create your own unforgettable memories! Don’t miss out! 🌟✨', '2025-11-16 12:18:39'),
	(713, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong Kyoja restaurant', 'Myeongdong Kyoja is renowned for its handmade noodles and delicious mandu (dumplings). Their signature dish, Kyoja Guk (noodle soup), is a must-try! Located in the bustling Myeongdong area, it’s easily accessible by public transport, making it a perfect stop for a hearty meal.', '2025-11-16 12:18:47'),
	(714, 3, NULL, 'hello', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the incredible world of science while feeling the K-pop vibes? Let me introduce you to the **Seoul Science Museum**! Located at 01792 160, Hangeulbiseok-ro, Nowon-gu, this place is not just a museum—it\'s a portal to the future! 🚀✨\n\nImagine walking through interactive exhibits that spark creativity and innovation, just like our favorite K-pop idols who constantly push boundaries in their music and performances. In the Demon Hunters universe, this museum is where the brightest minds gather to harness the energy of science, much like how K-pop stars channel their passion into electrifying performances! 🎤⚔️\n\nThe museum is open from Tuesday to Friday, 09:30 to 17:30 KST, so you can explore its wonders and feel the pulse of Seoul\'s creative spirit. 🌙💖 This is the perfect spot for music lovers and aspiring creators to find inspiration, just like how our K-pop heroes find their spark! So gear up, gather your fellow Hunters, and let’s unlock the mysteries of science and music together! Let\'s go! 🔥💫', '2025-11-16 15:16:37'),
	(715, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into a legendary realm where ancient history meets K-pop energy? Welcome to **Gyeongbokgung Palace**! 👑 This magnificent palace, built in 1395, isn\'t just the largest of the Five Grand Palaces; it\'s the heartbeat of Seoul\'s royal legacy and the perfect backdrop for your K-pop dreams! 🎤 \n\nImagine this: K-pop idols filming breathtaking MVs here, dancing in sync with the palace guards’ ceremonial formations, blending tradition with modern flair! 🌙 In our Demon Hunters mythology, Gyeongbokgung serves as the sacred temple where the spirits of past kings and queens guide our music warriors, channeling their creativity and passion. ✨ The energy here is incredible, connecting us to both the rich history of Korea and the vibrant pulse of K-pop culture! \n\nSo, fellow music lovers, let’s visit Gyeongbokgung and feel the magic of Seoul\'s musical legacy! 💖 Don’t forget to snap some epic photos and let the spirit of the palace inspire your own K-pop journey! Let’s go! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-17 00:27:52'),
	(716, 3, NULL, '장원영이 간 맛집을 찾아줘', 'Hey there, fellow food warriors! 🌙✨ Are you ready to embark on a legendary culinary quest just like our favorite K-pop idols? Let’s dive into the magic of **김용안과자점**! Located in the heart of Yongsan, this iconic spot has been serving up delicious 전병 since 1967! 🍽️🔥 Just like our beloved K-pop stars, who need that energy boost to slay the stage, we can fuel up on these traditional treats crafted with love and old-school techniques! \n\nImagine gathering with your fellow Hunters, sharing stories and laughter over these crispy, mouth-watering snacks that have been enjoyed by countless legends before us! ⚔️💫 So, let’s go and soak in the vibrant atmosphere, where every bite is a step closer to our own K-drama moment! Don’t miss out on this essential Seoul experience – it’s where music and food unite in a symphony of flavors! 🎶🥢', '2025-11-17 00:28:18'),
	(717, 3, NULL, 'Find the restaurant Jang Won-young went to ', '🔥 Hey there, fellow food warriors! Are you ready to embark on a legendary culinary quest? We’re diving into the heart of Seoul at **남원골**, where K-pop idols like Jang Won-young fuel up with the ultimate power food—삼계탕 (samgyetang)! 🌙 This hearty chicken soup is packed with nutrients, giving us all the energy we need to conquer the day like true Demon Hunters! ⚔️ \n\nImagine gathering with your squad in this cozy haven, surrounded by the vibrant energy of music and laughter, as you indulge in not just samgyetang, but also a variety of delicious remedies like goat and duck dishes! 🍽️✨ Every bite here is like a boost of vitality, perfect for recharging our spirits before hitting the streets of Seoul! Let’s go, and make this experience a part of our K-pop adventure! 💫', '2025-11-17 00:28:50'),
	(718, 3, NULL, 'Please create a Seoul travel plan based on the locations featured in Kedehun. ', '🔥 Hey there, fellow food warriors! Get ready to unleash your inner Demon Hunter at 케르반 파미에스테이션, a legendary spot in the heart of Seoul where K-pop dreams and delicious halal Turkish cuisine collide! 🌙✨ Located in the vibrant CENTRALCITY, this restaurant serves up mouthwatering dishes crafted by a talented Turkish chef—perfect for fueling up before your next concert or dance practice! 💪🎤 \n\nImagine gathering with your fellow Hunters, sharing plates of kebabs and baklava, all while the energy of K-pop beats fills the air! This place is not just about food; it\'s a sanctuary for music lovers to recharge and connect, just like our favorite idols do! ⚔️ So let\'s go and experience the magic of 케르반, where every bite is a step closer to our K-pop fantasies! 🍽️💫', '2025-11-17 00:29:41'),
	(719, 3, NULL, 'Tell me the restaurants Jang Won-young went to.', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! 🎬✨ If you\'re a fan of **힘쎈여자 강남순**, you HAVE to check out **애브뉴준오**! This is the LEGENDARY beauty salon where the fabulous transformations happen! 💇‍♀️💖 Located just a 2-minute walk from Cheongdam Station (Exit 9), it’s the perfect spot to feel like a K-Drama star yourself! \n\nRemember that iconic scene where 강남순 gets her stunning makeover? You can experience that same magic here! The chic interior and cozy vibe make it a must-visit for all beauty lovers. Plus, you can snap some fabulous pics with your friends and try out amazing beauty products! 📸✨ Don’t miss out on this spot that every K-Drama fan will adore! 💕', '2025-11-17 00:38:02'),
	(720, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Hey Hunters! 🎤✨ Ready to dive into the heart of Seoul\'s vibrant music scene? Let me introduce you to the **Hangang River Bus**! 🌊 This legendary ride offers breathtaking views along the Han River, where countless K-pop MVs have captured the essence of Seoul\'s nightlife and energy! Imagine cruising past iconic bridges that shimmer like starlight as you soak in the magical atmosphere. In the Demon Hunters universe, this bus symbolizes our journey through the realms of music, connecting us to the pulse of the city! 💫 \n\nThe Hangang River itself is like a mystical barrier between the ordinary and the extraordinary, and the bus takes us right into the heart of that musical adventure. 🎶 So, whether you\'re a K-pop fan or a fellow explorer, hop on the Hangang River Bus and feel the rhythm of Seoul\'s soul! Let\'s go! 🔥⚔️', '2025-11-17 00:44:50'),
	(721, 3, NULL, 'Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch kongguksu', 'While I don\'t have information on Jinju Jip Yeouido Branch, I highly recommend visiting SJ. Kunsthalle! Located at 5, Eonju-ro 148-gil, Gangnam-gu, this vibrant cultural space hosts exhibitions, performances, and workshops. It\'s open for exploration and creativity! Easily accessible via subway, it\'s perfect for art lovers looking to immerse themselves in Seoul\'s creative scene. Enjoy your visit!', '2025-11-17 00:44:59'),
	(722, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 이태원 클라쓰 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the iconic scenes from "모텔 캘리포니아" were filmed! 🎬✨ Remember that moment when the characters shared their deep secrets under the vibrant neon lights? That magic happened right here at 이태원로27가길! Located just a short 3-minute walk from 이태원역 1번 출구, this area is bursting with energy and diversity! \n\nThe dazzling neon signs and mouth-watering street food will make you feel like you\'re stepping into a K-Drama dream! 🌟 You HAVE to explore the unique shops and cozy cafes, and don’t forget to catch some spontaneous performances by local artists! Trust me, you’ll create unforgettable memories here! 💕 Don\'t miss this legendary spot on your K-Drama adventure!', '2025-11-17 00:45:09'),
	(723, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 킹덤 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! 🎬✨ This is THE spot where the fabulous scenes from **킹더랜드** were filmed! Remember those unforgettable moments where the characters shared their dreams and laughter? That magic happened right here at **MCM 롯데면세점 월드타워점**! 🌟 \n\nLocated at **서울 송파구 올림픽로 300 에비뉴엘동 9F**, just a hop from **잠실역 2번 출구**, this luxurious shopping destination is not just about the chic brands; it\'s a MUST-VISIT for all K-Drama lovers! 🛍️💕 The stunning interior and vibrant atmosphere make it the perfect place to relax and soak in the vibes after your shopping spree! \n\nK-Drama fans absolutely LOVE this spot, and it’s become a legendary pilgrimage site! You HAVE to visit and capture your own iconic moments! ✨📸 Don\'t miss out!', '2025-11-17 00:45:30'),
	(724, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Yo music lovers! 🎤✨ Are you ready to embark on an epic journey to the legendary N Seoul Tower at night? 🌙 This iconic landmark stands tall at 236.7 meters, broadcasting Seoul\'s K-pop energy like a beacon of light! Imagine taking in the breathtaking panoramic views of the city, where every twinkling light below reflects the vibrant beats of our favorite songs! 🎶💖 \n\nIn the world of Demon Hunters, this tower serves as the central watchtower, where all the musical light energy converges, connecting us to the heart of Seoul’s music scene. It’s a place where love locks are fastened, symbolizing the unbreakable bond between K-pop fans and the city itself! 🔥💫 As we gaze out over the sprawling city, let’s soak in the inspiration that fuels our favorite idols and their legendary performances! \n\nSo, fellow Hunters, let’s make our way to N Seoul Tower and feel the pulse of Seoul\'s music energy! This is where dreams come alive, and the magic of K-pop surrounds us! Let’s go! ⚔️🌟', '2025-11-17 01:50:49'),
	(725, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙 Are you ready to dive into the magical world of Bukchon Hanok Village? This legendary place is more than just a beautiful collection of traditional hanok; it’s a living testament to 600 years of Seoul\'s rich history! Nestled between the majestic Gyeongbokgung Palace and the serene Changdeokgung Palace, Bukchon is like the heart of the city, pulsating with the energy of its local residents and the whispers of ancient stories. \n\nIn our Demon Hunters universe, Bukchon represents the hidden realm where past and present collide, a sanctuary for K-pop warriors seeking inspiration from Korea’s heritage. Imagine wandering through the narrow streets of Gaehoe-dong, where the hanok stand shoulder to shoulder like a chorus of voices harmonizing with the spirit of Seoul! 🎤✨ This place embodies the soulful energy that connects our music culture, reminding us that every corner holds a story waiting to be told. \n\nSo, fellow music lovers, let’s embark on this journey to Bukchon and feel the vibrant pulse of tradition and creativity! 🌟🔥 Don’t miss out on this incredible experience!', '2025-11-17 01:50:57'),
	(726, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to embark on an epic adventure along the Hangang River? The **Hangang River Bus** is not just a mode of transport; it’s a legendary journey that connects us to the musical heart of Seoul! 🚤✨ Imagine cruising along the river, surrounded by the shimmering lights of the city, much like the dazzling stages in your favorite K-pop MVs! 🎤💖\n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, this bus represents the bridge between our ordinary lives and the vibrant energy of K-pop. As we glide over the water, we can feel the pulse of Seoul\'s music scene, where iconic bridges and riverside parks have hosted countless performances and fan meetings. 🌙🔥 This place is a must-visit for every music lover, as it embodies the spirit of creativity and connection that fuels our K-pop dreams! \n\nSo gear up, fellow music lovers, and let’s ride the Hangang River Bus to experience the magic of Seoul like never before! Let’s go! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-17 01:51:07'),
	(727, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the legendary world of COEX? This iconic venue in Gangnam is not just a hub for massive exhibitions and international summits, it’s where the pulse of Seoul\'s vibrant culture beats strongest! 💖 Imagine walking through halls filled with the energy of K-pop events, art expos, and global conversations—this is the arena where creativity and innovation collide! \n\nIn the Demon Hunters mythology, COEX would be the grand council chamber where music warriors gather to share their knowledge and strategies! 🎤✨ It’s a place where K-pop trainees often visit to draw inspiration from the creative atmosphere—perfect for brainstorming their next hit! So, fellow music lovers, let’s explore COEX and feel the electric vibes of Seoul’s musical legacy! 🌙💫 Don’t miss out on this adventure—let’s go! 🚀', '2025-11-17 01:51:17'),
	(728, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Hey Hunters! 🎤✨ Are you ready to embark on an epic journey to Gyeongbokgung Palace, the legendary heart of Seoul? This magnificent palace, built in 1395, is not just the largest of the Five Grand Palaces—it’s a symbol of the Joseon Dynasty\'s sovereignty and a bridge between Korea\'s rich history and the pulsating energy of K-pop culture! 👑💖 \n\nImagine wandering through the palace grounds where K-pop idols have filmed breathtaking traditional concept MVs, blending the elegance of ancient architecture with modern beats. The changing of the guard ceremony here is like a choreographed performance, inspiring K-pop dance formations and igniting the creativity of future idols! 🔥⚔️ In the Demon Hunters universe, Gyeongbokgung is the sacred site where the royal spirits of music gather, channeling their energy to inspire today’s artists and fans alike. \n\nSo let’s step into this magical realm and feel the powerful connection between Korea’s past and the vibrant K-pop scene! Don’t miss out on this iconic spot, Hunters—let’s go and soak in the musical legacy of Seoul! 💫🌙', '2025-11-17 01:51:27'),
	(729, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Hey Hunters! 💖 Are you ready to explore the legendary Myeongdong Cathedral, a true gem in the heart of Seoul? 🌙 This stunning Gothic architectural masterpiece is not just the first Roman Catholic church in Korea; it’s a sacred space where the spirits of music and history intertwine! ✨ In the world of Demon Hunters, this cathedral stands as a beacon of hope and resilience, symbolizing the strength of our musical warriors who strive for peace and harmony. \n\nAs we walk through its hallowed halls, we can feel the energy of past martyrs and the vibrant cultural festivals held here every May, reminding us of the powerful connection between faith and music! 🎤 K-pop idols often draw inspiration from such iconic locations, reflecting the rich heritage of Korea in their MVs. So let’s step into this magical space and embrace the spirit of creativity! 🔥 Don’t miss out on capturing the perfect shot for your feed—this is where history meets the future of K-pop! Let’s go! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-17 01:51:36'),
	(730, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 사랑의 불시착 filming location', 'OMG! This is THE spot for all you K-Drama fans out there! 🎬✨ We\'re talking about the filming location for the legendary drama "사랑의 불시착" (Crash Landing on You)! Remember that heart-fluttering moment when Yoon Se-ri and Ri Jeong-hyuk shared their unforgettable scenes? You can feel the magic right here at this iconic location!\n\nLocated in the stunning city of Seoul, this filming site captures the breathtaking beauty of the Han River and the vibrant atmosphere of the area. It’s easily accessible, just a short walk from the subway! Fans from all over the world flock here to recreate those dreamy moments and snap that perfect photo. 📸\n\nYou HAVE to visit this place to soak in the K-Drama vibes and relive those emotional scenes! Don’t miss out on this must-visit destination! 💕🌟', '2025-11-17 01:51:46'),
	(731, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 킹덤 filming location', 'OMG! This is THE spot for all you K-Drama fans out there! 🎬✨ We\'re talking about the legendary filming location from "킹더랜드" at the MCM 롯데면세점 월드타워점! Remember those glamorous shopping scenes where the characters were living their best lives? That all took place right here! Located at 서울 송파구 올림픽로 300, just in front of 잠실역 2번 출구, this place is a must-visit for fans! \n\nNot only can you indulge in some high-end shopping, but you can also soak in the stunning interior and vibe that made it so iconic in the drama! 🛍️✨ K-Drama fans absolutely LOVE this spot, and it’s become a pilgrimage for those who want to relive the magic! You HAVE to visit! 💖🌟', '2025-11-17 01:52:27'),
	(732, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 별에서 온 그대 filming location', 'OMG! This is THE spot for all you K-Drama fans out there! 🎬✨ We’re talking about the filming location for the legendary drama "별에서 온 그대" (My Love from the Star)! Remember that iconic scene where Do Min-joon and Cheon Song-yi had their heart-fluttering moments? It happened right here at *정독도서관 정류장*! \n\nLocated at 서울 종로구 삼청로 50, just a 12-minute walk from 안국역 1번 출구, this charming spot boasts beautiful tree-lined streets and dreamy lights that create a romantic atmosphere! 🌳💫 Especially in the fall, when the leaves turn a stunning array of colors, it’s the perfect backdrop for photos that will make your friends swoon! 📸❤️ \n\nK-Drama fans absolutely LOVE this place because it allows you to relive those unforgettable moments from the show while taking a leisurely stroll. You HAVE to visit and soak in the magical vibes! Don’t miss this chance to create your own legendary memories! 💕🌟', '2025-11-17 01:52:36'),
	(733, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 태양의 후예 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the legendary drama 태양의 후예 (Descendants of the Sun) brought us all those heart-fluttering moments! 💖✨ Remember that iconic scene where Yoo Si-jin and Seo Dae-young shared their first intense gaze? That magic happened at the stunning 강원도 (Gangwon-do) locations, but you can relive the excitement in Seoul too! \n\nOne of the must-visit spots is the 아모레퍼시픽 (Amorepacific) headquarters, which served as the backdrop for some pivotal moments! It\'s located in the bustling area of 서울시 중구 (Jung-gu), and it\'s a gorgeous place to take photos and feel the K-Drama vibes! 📸🌟 \n\nYou HAVE to visit this spot and immerse yourself in the drama\'s unforgettable romance! Don’t miss out on capturing your own magical moments here! 🎬💕', '2025-11-17 01:52:44'),
	(734, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 킹덤 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the legendary drama *킹더랜드* was filmed! 🎬✨ Located at the MCM 롯데면세점 월드타워점, right in the heart of Seoul at 서울 송파구 올림픽로 300, this place is a must-visit for all fans! Remember those gorgeous scenes where the characters shared heartfelt moments amidst luxury shopping? That magic happened right here! ✨ \n\nNot only can you soak in the stunning interior and ambiance, but you can also indulge in some high-end shopping from various brands! 🛍️💕 Pro tip: After exploring, take a moment to relax and enjoy the vibe—it\'s perfect for unwinding! You HAVE to visit this iconic filming location and experience the charm of *킹더랜드*! Don\'t miss it! 🌟📺', '2025-11-17 01:52:56'),
	(735, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 별에서 온 그대 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the legendary scenes from "별에서 온 그대" (My Love from the Star) were filmed! 🌟 Remember when Do Min-joon and Cheon Song-yi shared those iconic moments against the stunning backdrop? You can experience that magic at the beautiful Namsan Tower! 🎬✨ \n\nLocated in the heart of Seoul, just a short cable car ride from Myeongdong, this iconic landmark offers breathtaking views that will make you feel like you\'re in the drama! The vibrant atmosphere here is perfect for recreating those romantic scenes and taking unforgettable photos. 📸 Pro tip: Visit during sunset for the most magical experience! \n\nYou HAVE to visit this spot to relive those heart-fluttering moments! 💕 Don\'t miss out on the chance to feel the K-Drama magic!', '2025-11-17 01:53:04'),
	(736, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 별에서 온 그대 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the legendary drama "별에서 온 그대" (My Love from the Star) filmed some of its most iconic scenes! 🌟✨ Remember that romantic moment when Do Min-joon and Cheon Song-yi shared a breathtaking view? That magic happened right here! \n\nYou can find this must-visit location at the beautiful Namsan Seoul Tower, located at 105 Namsangongwon-gil, Yongsan-gu. It’s super accessible with a short cable car ride or a lovely hike up the hill! The panoramic views are just as stunning today as they were in the drama! 🏞️💕 \n\nK-Drama fans absolutely LOVE taking selfies here to recreate those unforgettable moments! Don\'t miss out on the chance to feel the romance and magic of the show right where it all happened! You HAVE to visit! 🎬📺✨', '2025-11-17 01:53:19'),
	(737, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong Kyoja restaurant', '모녀김밥 is renowned for its delicious kimbap served with a unique mustard sauce. With over 40 years of experience, this iconic spot is a must-visit in Gwangjang Market. You can find them at 403-23 Dongho-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul, easily accessible for a quick and tasty meal!', '2025-11-17 01:53:33'),
	(738, 3, NULL, 'Hongdae food scene trendy restaurants', 'Hong스쭈꾸미 홍대본점 is a must-visit for anyone exploring the Hongdae food scene! Known for its delicious 쭈꾸미, you can also enjoy unique combos like 쭈꾸미+삼겹살 or 쭈꾸미+새우. Located at 04053 서울 마포구 어울마당로 146, the spacious setting ensures a quick wait even during peak hours!', '2025-11-17 01:53:41'),
	(739, 3, NULL, 'Hongdae food scene trendy restaurants', 'If you\'re exploring the trendy food scene in Hongdae, don\'t miss 홍스쭈꾸미 홍대본점! This popular spot has been serving delicious 쭈꾸미 since 2018. Their signature dish, 쭈꾸미, is a must-try, along with unique combos like 쭈꾸미+삼겹살. Located at 04053 서울 마포구 어울마당로 146, the spacious venue means you\'ll be seated quickly, even during peak hours!', '2025-11-17 01:54:23'),
	(740, 3, NULL, 'Hongdae food scene trendy restaurants', 'Hong스쭈꾸미 홍대본점 is a must-visit for seafood lovers! Known for its delicious 쭈꾸미, you can also enjoy unique combinations like 쭈꾸미+삼겹살 or 쭈꾸미+새우. Located at 04053 서울 마포구 어울마당로 146, the spacious venue ensures a quick wait even during busy hours.', '2025-11-17 01:54:33'),
	(741, 3, NULL, 'Gwangjang Market traditional food', 'While 정애맛담 specializes in fusion 떡, Gwangjang Market is renowned for its traditional Korean street food. You can enjoy dishes like bindaetteok (mung bean pancakes) and bibimbap. Gwangjang Market is easily accessible via public transport, making it a must-visit for authentic flavors!', '2025-11-17 01:54:48'),
	(742, 3, NULL, 'Gangnam Korean BBQ restaurants', 'For a great Korean BBQ experience in Gangnam, check out **BBQ치킨앤비어 명동스타점**. Known for its high-quality chicken, this restaurant offers a cozy atmosphere and a menu featuring delicious BBQ options. It\'s located at 04536 서울 중구 명동4길 2 (명동2가) 2층, easily accessible for a tasty meal!', '2025-11-17 01:54:58'),
	(743, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Get ready to dive into the magical world of Gyeongbokgung Palace, the legendary heart of Seoul! 👑 Built in 1395, this majestic palace isn\'t just the largest of the Five Grand Palaces; it’s a symbol of Korea’s royal heritage and a stage where tradition meets modern K-pop energy! 🌙✨ \n\nImagine this: the stunning architecture and vibrant colors of the palace serve as the backdrop for countless K-pop MVs, where idols showcase their moves amid the echoes of history! In the Demon Hunters universe, Gyeongbokgung is the sacred ground where the spirits of past kings and queens inspire today’s music warriors to create legendary performances. ⚔️💖 \n\nThe energy here is incredible, with the changing of the guard ceremony mirroring the synchronized choreographies we adore in our favorite K-pop groups! This place embodies the spirit of resilience and creativity, connecting us to the roots of Korean culture while fueling our passion for music. So let’s go, Hunters! Visit Gyeongbokgung Palace and feel the vibrant pulse of Seoul\'s music scene! 🎤💫', '2025-11-17 01:55:11'),
	(744, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into a realm where history and K-pop culture collide? Welcome to Bukchon Hanok Village! Nestled between the majestic Gyeongbokgung and Changdeokgung Palaces, this legendary village is not just a tourist hotspot; it\'s a living testament to Seoul\'s 600-year history! 💖✨\n\nImagine wandering through the narrow alleys lined with traditional hanok, the very essence of Korean architecture, where each corner whispers stories of the past. In the Demon Hunters universe, Bukchon is like a sacred realm where the spirits of ancient musicians reside, inspiring today’s K-pop stars. This place embodies the energy of creativity and tradition, making it a must-visit for any music lover! 🎤🔥\n\nAs we stroll through Gaehoe-dong, we can almost hear the echoes of past legends harmonizing with the modern beats of K-pop. This is where the old and the new meet, and where aspiring idols might seek inspiration in the beauty of their heritage. So, let’s embrace the magic of Bukchon and feel the pulse of Seoul’s music scene! Don’t miss out on this iconic experience, Hunters – your K-pop journey is waiting! ⚔️', '2025-11-17 02:04:48'),
	(745, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Yo music lovers! 🎤✨ Are you ready to experience the magic of N Seoul Tower at night? This iconic landmark isn’t just a tower; it\'s the heartbeat of Seoul\'s K-pop energy! 🌙 Standing tall at 236.7 meters, it’s like a beacon for our favorite idols, illuminating the city with their vibrant vibes! In the Demon Hunters universe, this tower serves as the ultimate watchtower where the musical forces of Seoul converge, protecting the city’s cultural soul. 💖 \n\nAs the sun sets, the panoramic views transform into a breathtaking canvas of twinkling lights, reminiscent of a dazzling concert! Imagine couples fastening their locks of love to the iron railings, symbolizing eternal bonds just like the fierce loyalty we feel for our K-pop stars. 🌌 This place has been featured in countless MVs, making it a must-visit for all K-pop fans and fellow Hunters! So grab your friends, feel the musical energy in the air, and let’s make unforgettable memories at N Seoul Tower! 🔥✨ Let’s go!', '2025-11-17 02:06:21'),
	(746, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the magical world of the **Hangang River Bus**? This legendary ride, located at **Jamsil Pier** in Songpa-gu, takes us on an epic journey along the Han River, the very heart of Seoul’s music scene! 🎶✨ Just like our favorite K-pop idols, who shine on stage, the river reflects the dazzling city lights, creating a concert-like atmosphere that’s simply breathtaking! \n\nImagine cruising past iconic landmarks, feeling the pulse of the city—each wave whispering tales of music battles and K-pop dreams! In the **Demon Hunters** lore, this bus is like a mystical vessel, transporting us between realms of creativity and inspiration, where every journey is a new chapter in our musical saga! So let’s hop on and ride the waves of Seoul\'s energy together! 💖🔥 Don’t miss out on this amazing experience—let’s explore the rhythm of the Han River! 🎤⚔️', '2025-11-17 02:06:36'),
	(747, 3, NULL, 'Gangnam Korean BBQ restaurants', 'For a great Korean BBQ experience in Gangnam, try "BBQ치킨앤비어 명동스타점." Known for its high-quality chicken, it\'s a must-visit for fans of Korean cuisine. Located at 04536 서울 중구 명동4길 2, 2층, it’s easily accessible and perfect for a delicious meal with friends.', '2025-11-17 03:16:03'),
	(748, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the magical world of Bukchon Hanok Village? Nestled between the majestic Gyeongbokgung Palace and the serene Changdeokgung Palace, this legendary village is a living tapestry of 600 years of Seoul\'s history! 🏯✨ Unlike other hanok villages, Bukchon is not just a tourist spot; it\'s a vibrant residential area where Seoulites live and breathe the spirit of tradition. \n\nImagine wandering through the charming streets of Gaehoe-dong, where hundreds of hanok stand shoulder to shoulder like warriors of the past, whispering stories of their rich heritage. In the Demon Hunters mythology, Bukchon serves as a hidden sanctuary, where the echoes of K-pop melodies intertwine with the whispers of history, creating an enchanting atmosphere that fuels our creative spirits! 🎤💖 \n\nSo, fellow music lovers, feel the energy of Bukchon as you explore its winding alleys and traditional homes. Let the past inspire your present and ignite your passion for K-pop! 🌙🔥 Don’t miss out on this incredible journey—let\'s go and experience the heart of Seoul together!', '2025-11-17 03:54:26'),
	(749, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Hey Hunters! 🎤 Are you ready to unlock the magic of Seoul at night? 🌙✨ Let me take you to N Seoul Tower, the ULTIMATE K-pop landmark that stands tall at 236.7 meters, radiating musical energy throughout the city! This iconic tower is not just a breathtaking observation point; it’s a legendary symbol in many K-drama scenes and K-pop MVs, where love stories unfold under the glittering Seoul skyline. 💖\n\nIn the world of Demon Hunters, N Seoul Tower is like the central watchtower, a beacon where all the vibrant musical light energy of Seoul converges! The locks of love fastened to its iron railings symbolize the unbreakable bond between fans and their idols, representing the heartbeats of countless couples and music lovers. 🔥💫 As we gaze out at the twinkling lights below, we can feel the pulse of K-pop coursing through the air, igniting our spirits! \n\nSo, fellow music lovers, let’s embrace the night and experience the thrill of Seoul’s K-pop culture at N Seoul Tower! It’s time to capture unforgettable moments and feel the energy of this legendary city! Let’s go! ⚔️🌌', '2025-11-17 05:32:15'),
	(750, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Yo music lovers! 🎤✨ Are you ready to dive into the electrifying world of COEX? This legendary hub in the heart of Gangnam is not just a convention center; it\'s a powerhouse of creativity and inspiration! 💖 With its vast exhibition halls and vibrant lobby spaces, COEX is where K-pop dreams come alive, hosting everything from food expos to international summits! 🌍🔥\n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, COEX serves as the mystical meeting ground where K-pop idols gather to strategize and unleash their musical powers! Imagine the energy swirling around as fans and artists connect, creating a magical atmosphere full of possibilities. 🌌💫 This is where the heartbeat of Seoul\'s music culture resonates, making it a MUST-VISIT for all fellow Hunters who crave that K-pop vibe!\n\nSo gear up, grab your lightsticks, and let’s explore COEX together! The energy here is incredible, and who knows? You might just find your next favorite K-pop moment waiting for you! Let\'s go! ⚔️🔥💖', '2025-11-17 05:32:33'),
	(751, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Yo music lovers! 🎤✨ Get ready to dive into the heart of Seoul at Gyeongbokgung Palace, the majestic jewel of the Joseon Dynasty! 👑 Built in 1395, this legendary palace stands as a symbol of Korea’s royal heritage and is the ultimate backdrop for many K-pop MVs that merge tradition with modern flair. Imagine the breathtaking visuals as your favorite idols dance in front of this stunning architecture, capturing the essence of Korea\'s rich history while electrifying the music scene! ⚔️💖 \n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, Gyeongbokgung Palace is where the ancient spirits of music warriors gather, channeling their energy to inspire the next generation of K-pop stars. It’s like a magical realm where history and contemporary beats collide, creating a vibrant atmosphere that fuels the passion of every Hunter exploring the streets of Seoul. 🌙🔥 \n\nSo, gear up and visit Gyeongbokgung Palace to feel the powerful energy that resonates with the soul of K-pop! Let’s go and uncover the stories that echo through its grand halls! 💫', '2025-11-17 05:32:38'),
	(752, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong Kyoja restaurant', '모녀김밥 is a must-visit for its signature kimbap served with a delicious mustard sauce. With over 40 years of experience, this iconic spot is located at 03195 서울 종로구 동호로 403-23 (예지동), making it a convenient stop while exploring Gwangjang Market.', '2025-11-17 05:32:49'),
	(753, 3, NULL, 'recommend top 10 place in seoul', 'Yo! Hunters! 🔥💫 엄선한 10개의 전설적인 장소들이야! 각 장소마다 특별한 빛의 에너지가 있으니까 직접 체크해봐! 궁금한 곳 있으면 말해줘! Let\'s explore! 🌙✨', '2025-11-17 05:32:59'),
	(754, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 이태원 클라쓰 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! 🎉 This is THE spot from the legendary drama **이태원 클라쓰 (Itaewon Class)**! Remember that iconic scene where Park Sae-ro-yi and his friends strategized their epic revenge at the bar? 🍻 That all went down in the vibrant streets of Itaewon! \n\nYou can find this filming location at **Itaewon-dong, Yongsan-gu, Seoul**. This area is bursting with energy and has become a must-visit pilgrimage site for fans from all over the globe! The atmosphere is just as lively as it was in the show, and the cafes and restaurants around are perfect for a K-Drama-themed day out! \n\nPro tip: Make sure to grab a bite at one of the local eateries to really soak in the Itaewon vibe! 🌟 You absolutely HAVE to visit if you’re a fan of this amazing series! 💕✨', '2025-11-17 05:49:42'),
	(755, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 이태원 클라쓰 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot from "모텔 캘리포니아"! 🎬✨ Remember that scene where the characters shared their dreams under those dazzling neon lights? That magic happened right here at 이태원로27가길! Located just a 3-minute walk from 이태원역 1번 출구, this vibrant street is bursting with life, delicious street food, and that iconic atmosphere that makes you feel like you\'re in the middle of a K-Drama! \n\nThe colorful neon signs and the eclectic mix of restaurants will have you snapping photos and enjoying the unique culture that 이태원 is famous for. Pro tip: take a moment to relax in one of the charming cafes or catch an impromptu performance by local artists - it\'s all part of the experience! You HAVE to visit this legendary location and create your own unforgettable memories! 💕🌟 #이태원 #KdramaTrip #거리음식 #문화탐방 #네온사인', '2025-11-17 06:00:01'),
	(756, 3, NULL, 'Hongdae food scene trendy restaurants', '홍스쭈꾸미 홍대본점 is a must-visit in the vibrant Hongdae area, known for its delicious spicy webfoot octopus dishes. Popular menu items include 쭈꾸미 with pork belly and shrimp. Located at 04053 서울 마포구 어울마당로 146, the spacious venue ensures quick seating even during busy hours. Enjoy a trendy dining experience!', '2025-11-17 06:00:23'),
	(757, 3, NULL, 'I want to visit K-pop related places', 'Hey Hunters! 🎤✨ Are you ready to dive into the magical world of K-pop at the 7th Royal Culture Festival? This legendary event runs from May 1 to May 9, right in the heart of Seoul, where the past meets the present! Imagine the majestic Gyeongbokgung Palace as a backdrop, a place that has inspired countless K-pop MVs and embodies the spirit of our musical heritage! 👑 In the Demon Hunters universe, this festival is like a gathering of powerful music warriors, showcasing performances that blend traditional aesthetics with modern beats, creating a fusion of sound and history! \n\nAs we wander through the festival, we’ll feel the energy of Seoul’s musical soul, where each performance resonates with the heartbeat of the city! 💖 Let\'s capture those unforgettable moments and connect with fellow music lovers who share our passion! So gear up, and let’s unleash our inner K-pop warriors at this amazing festival! 🔥⚔️ Let\'s go!', '2025-11-17 06:04:13'),
	(758, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the enchanting vibes of Myeongdong Cathedral? This legendary spot isn\'t just Korea\'s first Gothic building; it\'s a sacred sanctuary where history and music collide! 🎶✨ Imagine this: built between 1892 and 1898, it\'s a place where the spirits of martyrs rest, and every May, the cathedral comes alive with a cultural festival that celebrates the heart of Seoul! \n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, Myeongdong Cathedral stands as a beacon of hope and unity, a place where music warriors gather to pay homage to the past while dreaming of future K-pop legends. 💖 The energy here is electric, making it a must-visit for any music lover looking to connect with Seoul’s soulful rhythm. So, grab your crew, come feel the magic, and let the cathedral\'s spirit inspire your own journey in the K-pop realm! Let’s go! 🔥⚔️', '2025-11-17 06:10:12'),
	(759, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the mesmerizing world of Bukchon Hanok Village? Nestled between the majestic Gyeongbokgung and Changdeokgung Palaces, this legendary village is a vibrant tapestry of 600 years of Seoul\'s history, where the spirit of our K-pop culture intertwines with traditional Korean architecture! 🌙✨ Imagine walking through these narrow alleys, where every hanok whispers stories of the past, like a classic K-drama unfolding before your eyes. In the Demon Hunters universe, Bukchon is the hidden sanctuary where the ancient guardians of music gather, preserving the harmony between tradition and modernity. 🎤💖\n\nThis place isn’t just a backdrop; it’s a living, breathing part of Seoul\'s musical legacy! 🌟 K-pop idols often seek inspiration here, absorbing the tranquil energy that fuels their creativity and artistry. So, fellow music lovers, let’s explore Bukchon together and feel the pulse of Seoul’s rich history and vibrant culture! The energy here is incredible—let\'s go! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-17 06:13:07'),
	(760, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong Kyoja restaurant', 'Myeongdong Kyoja is famous for its handmade noodle dishes and dumplings. Their signature dish, the kalguksu (knife-cut noodles), is a must-try! Located in the bustling Myeongdong area, it\'s easily accessible via subway. Enjoy a hearty meal in this beloved eatery!', '2025-11-17 06:13:13'),
	(761, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙✨ Are you ready to dive into the magical realm of N Seoul Tower at night? This iconic landmark stands tall at 236.7 meters, lighting up the Seoul skyline like a beacon of K-pop energy! 🎤💖 As we ascend to the observatory, we’re not just taking in breathtaking views; we’re tapping into the very heart of Seoul\'s musical spirit! Imagine every lock of love on the iron railings representing unbreakable bonds between fans and their favorite idols—it\'s like a shrine to our devotion! 🔥💫 \n\nIn the Demon Hunters mythology, N Seoul Tower serves as the ultimate watchtower, where all of Seoul\'s musical light energy converges, echoing the passionate beats of K-pop that fill the city! Every corner of this place has been graced by the footsteps of K-pop stars filming iconic MVs, making it a legendary spot for music lovers! So grab your friends, unleash your inner warrior, and let’s make unforgettable memories under the shimmering lights of Seoul! Let’s go! ⚔️🌟', '2025-11-17 06:13:23'),
	(762, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about 도깨비 filming location', 'OMG! K-Drama fans, listen up! This is THE spot where the legendary drama "도깨비" was filmed! 🎬✨ Remember that iconic scene where Kim Shin and Ji Eun-tak shared a magical moment? That breathtaking backdrop is right here at the beautiful Dongdaemun Design Plaza (DDP)! 🌟 \n\nLocated at 281 Eulji-ro, Jung-gu, this architectural wonder is a must-visit for any K-Drama enthusiast! The stunning curves and futuristic vibe make it a picture-perfect spot for your fan photos. 📸 Pro tip: Visit during the evening to see the dazzling lights come to life, just like in the drama! You HAVE to visit this iconic filming location! 💖', '2025-11-17 06:13:24'),
	(763, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Hey Hunters! 🎤✨ Are you ready to dive into the magical realm of Myeongdong Cathedral? This iconic landmark isn’t just Korea’s first Roman Catholic parish church; it’s a Gothic masterpiece that stands as a testament to the rich history of Seoul! 🏰🔥 Picture this: the cathedral, completed in 1898, serves as a sanctuary where the spirits of martyrs rest, creating an energy that resonates deeply with our love for music and culture! \n\nIn the world of Demon Hunters, Myeongdong Cathedral would be a sacred place where our heroes draw strength from the echoes of past battles, channeling that energy into their own musical journeys. 🎶💫 K-pop idols often find inspiration in places like this, as it embodies the spirit of resilience and creativity that fuels their artistry. So, fellow music lovers, when you visit, feel that powerful connection between history and modern K-pop culture. Let the vibes of Myeongdong Cathedral inspire your own journey in the heart of Seoul! Let\'s go! ⚔️💖', '2025-11-17 06:21:37'),
	(764, 3, NULL, 'RECOMMEND ME TOP 10 PLACE IN SEOUL', 'Yo! Hunters! 🔥💫 엄선한 10개의 전설적인 장소들이야! 각 장소마다 특별한 빛의 에너지가 있으니까 직접 체크해봐! 궁금한 곳 있으면 말해줘! Let\'s explore! 🌙✨', '2025-11-17 06:32:24'),
	(765, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Hey Hunters! 💫 Are you ready to dive into the mystical energy of Myeongdong Cathedral? This legendary landmark isn’t just the first Roman Catholic parish church in Korea; it’s a Gothic masterpiece that stands tall as a symbol of resilience and faith! 🏰✨ Imagine walking through its majestic arches, feeling the vibrations of history and spirituality that resonate just like the powerful beats of our favorite K-pop tracks! 🎤🔥\n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, Myeongdong Cathedral serves as a sacred sanctuary where lost melodies of the past are preserved, and the martyrs\' spirits inspire aspiring artists to chase their dreams! The basement sanctuary is where we can pay our respects, connecting the past to the vibrant K-pop culture that thrives today. 🌙💖 Every May, the cultural festival held here fills the air with creativity and celebration, mirroring the passion we see in K-pop performances. So, let’s gather our fellow music lovers and experience the divine energy of Myeongdong Cathedral – a true gem in the heart of Seoul! Let’s go! ⚔️✨', '2025-11-17 06:34:09'),
	(766, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to embark on an epic K-pop adventure along the Hangang River? The Hangang River Bus, located at the Jamsil Pier in Songpa-gu, is not just a mode of transportation—it\'s a gateway into the heart of Seoul\'s vibrant music scene! 🚤✨ Imagine cruising on the shimmering waters, with the iconic city skyline as your backdrop, just like in those legendary K-pop MVs we adore! \n\nIn the Demon Hunters mythology, this river bus represents the vessel of musical energy, connecting us to the magical realm where our favorite idols shine. This place embodies the spirit of freedom and creativity, where K-pop trainees often gather for inspiration, soaking in the views that fuel their passion. 🌊💖 \n\nSo, let’s hop on this amazing ride and feel the rhythm of Seoul’s music culture flowing through us! The energy here is incredible—don’t miss out on this legendary experience! Let’s go, fellow music lovers! 🎤🔥💫', '2025-11-17 06:58:17'),
	(767, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the legendary world of Gyeongbokgung Palace? This iconic palace, built in 1395, is not just the largest of the royal palaces from the Joseon Dynasty; it’s a cultural treasure that bridges the rich history of Korea with the vibrant energy of K-pop! 👑✨ Imagine this: the palace grounds echo with the sounds of traditional music, resonating with the same passion we feel when our favorite K-pop idols perform. \n\nIn the Demon Hunters mythology, Gyeongbokgung serves as a sacred site where the spirits of past kings inspire today’s artists, fueling their creativity and ambition! 💖 Many K-pop groups film their breathtaking concept MVs here, drawing on the majestic backdrop to weave tales of love, power, and heritage, just like the epic narratives we see in their music. \n\nSo, gather your fellow music lovers and step into this magical realm where history and modern K-pop collide! Feel the energy, embrace the culture, and let the spirit of Gyeongbokgung Palace ignite your passion for Korean music! 🌙🎤 Let\'s go!', '2025-11-17 06:58:28'),
	(768, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Hey Hunters! 💫 Are you ready to dive into the enchanting world of Gyeongbokgung Palace? This legendary palace, built in 1395, is not just the largest of the Five Grand Palaces but a vibrant symbol of Korea\'s royal heritage! 👑✨ Imagine walking through its gates where history and K-pop collide – many iconic groups have filmed breathtaking MVs here, blending traditional beauty with modern beats! \n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, Gyeongbokgung is like the majestic fortress where our warriors gather to channel the ancient energy of the Joseon Dynasty, inspiring powerful choreography and captivating performances. The palace guards’ ceremony even resembles the synchronized dance formations we adore in K-pop! 🔥💖 So, let’s step into this magical realm, feel the echoes of the past, and connect with the incredible energy that fuels our beloved music culture! Don’t miss it – Gyeongbokgung awaits your exploration! ⚔️🌙', '2025-11-17 07:09:39'),
	(769, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙✨ Are you ready to dive into the mystical vibes of Myeongdong Cathedral? This legendary spot is not just the first Roman Catholic parish church in Korea; it’s also the first Gothic structure ever built here! 🔥 Imagine stepping into a place where history and spirituality collide, all while being surrounded by the vibrant energy of Seoul\'s K-pop culture! 🎤💖 \n\nIn the world of Demon Hunters, Myeongdong Cathedral stands as a sacred sanctuary, a beacon of hope where our music warriors come to recharge their spirits before facing the challenges of the K-pop battlefield. Every May, it transforms into a cultural festival, blending music and tradition, much like how our favorite idols fuse different genres to create magical performances! 🎶⚔️ So, let\'s visit this iconic landmark, pay our respects, and soak up the incredible energy that connects us all as fans of K-pop! 💫 Don\'t miss out on this epic experience—let\'s go!', '2025-11-17 07:09:48'),
	(770, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙✨ Are you ready to explore the legendary Bukchon Hanok Village, where history and K-pop vibes collide? This amazing village is a treasure trove of 600 years of Seoul\'s history, nestled right between the majestic Gyeongbokgung and Changdeokgung Palaces! Imagine wandering through narrow alleys lined with stunning traditional hanok, each one whispering stories of the past while echoing the modern K-pop spirit! 🎤🔥\n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, Bukchon is like the hidden sanctuary where the ancient and the contemporary harmonize. It\'s a place where K-pop idols might stroll to recharge their creative energy, surrounded by the authentic vibes of Seoul\'s heritage. The Gaehoe-dong area is especially magical, with hanok standing shoulder to shoulder, just like our favorite idol groups coming together to create legendary performances! 💖\n\nSo, let\'s venture into this enchanting village, feel the pulse of Seoul’s musical energy, and connect with the stories that inspire our favorite K-pop anthems! Are you ready for this epic journey? Let’s go! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-17 07:17:41'),
	(771, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into an epic adventure on the Hangang River Bus? 🚍💖 This legendary vessel takes us through the heart of Seoul, gliding along the Han River, where the reflections of sparkling city lights create a magical atmosphere that feels straight out of a K-drama! 🌙✨ \n\nImagine cruising past iconic landmarks like Namsan Tower and Gyeongbokgung Palace, where K-pop dreams are born and legendary performances unfold! In the Demon Hunters universe, this bus is like our enchanted chariot, connecting us to the vibrant energy of Seoul\'s music scene. 🎤🔥 With each trip, we feel the pulse of the city, witnessing the artistry and passion that fuels our favorite idols. \n\nSo grab your fellow music lovers and hop on! Let’s embrace the incredible vibes of the Hangang River and make unforgettable memories in the city where K-pop reigns supreme! 💫⚔️', '2025-11-17 07:56:39'),
	(772, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙✨ Are you ready to embark on a legendary adventure at N Seoul Tower? This iconic landmark stands tall at 236.7 meters, lighting up the Seoul skyline like the ultimate stage for our favorite K-pop idols! 🎤🔥 As we ascend to the observatory, the breathtaking night views will make you feel like you\'re soaring through a concert of lights, each twinkle representing the energy of our beloved city. In the world of Demon Hunters, this tower is the beacon of musical magic, where the love locks symbolize the unbreakable connection between K-pop fans and the vibrant Seoul music scene. 💖 \n\nImagine being surrounded by the same sights that have graced countless K-dramas and MVs, where every moment is infused with the spirit of creativity and passion! So grab your friends, lock in your dreams, and let\'s feel the pulse of Seoul together as we celebrate the magic of music under the stars! 🌌⚔️ Let’s go, fellow music lovers!', '2025-11-17 08:29:54'),
	(773, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Yo music lovers! 🎤✨ Are you ready to dive into the enchanting world of Bukchon Hanok Village? This legendary spot, nestled between the majestic Gyeongbokgung and Changdeokgung Palaces, is not just a picturesque village—it\'s a living testament to 600 years of Seoul’s history! 🌙💖 Unlike other touristy hanok areas, Bukchon is home to real Seoulites, giving us an authentic glimpse into traditional life. Just imagine wandering through its narrow alleys, where each hanok whispers tales of the past, echoing the spirit of our favorite K-pop songs! 🔥⚔️\n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, Bukchon serves as the sacred ground where the past and present collide—where the spirits of ancient warriors inspire today’s K-pop idols! Many music videos draw inspiration from these stunning backdrops, capturing the essence of Korea’s cultural heritage while showcasing the vibrant energy of modern music. 💫 So, let’s embrace the magic of Bukchon! Grab your friends, explore the hanoks, and feel the rhythmic pulse of Seoul’s artistic soul. This place is a must-visit for every true K-pop fan and Hunter! Let’s go! 🌟', '2025-11-17 08:30:03'),
	(774, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Yo, fellow music lovers! 🎤 Are you ready to ride the waves of K-pop energy on the legendary **Hangang River Bus**? 🌊✨ This iconic vessel operates right from the heart of Seoul at Jamsil Pier, where the Han River flows like the rhythm of our favorite beats! 🚤💖 Imagine cruising down the river, surrounded by breathtaking views of the city skyline that dancers in countless MVs have graced! \n\nIn the world of **Demon Hunters**, this bus represents a mystical journey through the realms of sound and light, where K-pop idols draw their inspiration and strength. The Hangang River itself has been featured in epic music videos, symbolizing the connection between our vibrant city and its musical soul. 🌙🔥 This is where we, as Hunters, can feel the pulse of Seoul\'s music scene and witness the magic unfold as we glide beneath the bridges that host legendary performances! \n\nSo grab your friends and hop on the Hangang River Bus for an unforgettable adventure that connects us all to the heart of K-pop culture! Let\'s go, Hunters! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-17 08:47:28'),
	(775, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the epic vibes of Myeongdong Cathedral? This legendary spot is not just the first Roman Catholic parish church in Korea; it’s a magnificent Gothic marvel that stands tall as a symbol of resilience and faith in the heart of Seoul! 🏰✨\n\nIn our Demon Hunters universe, Myeongdong Cathedral is like the sacred sanctuary where the spirits of musical martyrs linger, blessing the city with their creative energy. Just like K-pop idols channel their passion on stage, this cathedral has been a beacon of hope since its completion in 1898, and every May, it transforms into a cultural festival that resonates with the rhythm of Seoul’s vibrant music scene! 🎶💖\n\nAs we pay our respects to the martyrs in the basement sanctuary, we can feel the powerful connection between history and music that fuels our K-pop dreams. So, let’s make a pilgrimage to this iconic site and soak in the mystical energy that inspires the artists we adore! 🔥⚔️ Don’t miss out, fellow music lovers—let’s go! 🌙💫', '2025-11-17 08:48:03'),
	(776, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the electrifying world of COEX, the ultimate hub of creativity and collaboration in Seoul? This legendary convention center, located in the heart of Gangnam, is not just a place for large-scale exhibitions and international conferences; it’s a vibrant stage where K-pop culture and global innovation collide! 🌟✨\n\nImagine walking through its expansive halls, where the energy is palpable, and every corner bursts with artistic expression! 🎤 In the Demon Hunters universe, COEX is like the central arena where music warriors gather to share their talents and ideas, making it the perfect training ground for future idols and creators. Here, major summits and expos celebrate everything from food to digital media, embodying the spirit of K-pop\'s cultural fusion! 💖\n\nAs we wander through its vibrant spaces, let’s soak in the atmosphere that inspires countless artists and fans alike. So, fellow music lovers, make sure to add COEX to your Seoul adventure – it’s where the magic of K-pop and the future of creativity intertwine! Let’s go! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-17 08:48:14'),
	(777, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about COEX', 'Hey Hunters! 🎤✨ Get ready to dive into the legendary realm of COEX, a true gem in the heart of Gangnam! This place isn\'t just a convention center; it\'s a colossal hub of creativity and energy where K-pop dreams come alive! 💖 From grand exhibitions showcasing food, culture, and arts to electrifying international conferences, COEX pulses with the spirit of collaboration and innovation, just like our favorite K-pop idols working hard to shine! 🔥\n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, COEX would be the grand arena where music warriors gather to share their talents and forge alliances, connecting fans and artists alike! Imagine walking through its expansive halls, feeling the buzz of excitement as various promotions and events unfold around you—it\'s like being in the middle of a high-energy K-pop concert! 🌙💫 So, fellow music lovers, don’t miss out on experiencing the vibrant atmosphere at COEX, where the magic of Seoul\'s music culture awaits! Let\'s go and embrace the K-pop energy together! ⚔️🎶', '2025-11-17 08:48:29'),
	(778, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the magical world of Gyeongbokgung Palace? This legendary palace, built in 1395, is not just the heart of Seoul; it’s the epicenter where Korea’s royal heritage meets the vibrant energy of K-pop! 👑✨ Imagine the stunning visuals as K-pop idols shoot breathtaking MVs here, blending traditional architecture with modern beats. \n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, Gyeongbokgung would be a sacred site where the spirits of past kings inspire our music warriors, echoing through the halls with every powerful dance move and heartfelt lyric. 💖 The palace guards’ ceremonial performances are like K-pop choreography in real life, showcasing the discipline and artistry that fuels our favorite idols. So, let’s explore this iconic landmark together and feel the pulse of Seoul’s history and music culture! Let\'s go! 🔥⚔️💫', '2025-11-17 08:48:38'),
	(779, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Yo music lovers! 🎤✨ Get ready to dive into the majestic world of Gyeongbokgung Palace, the legendary heart of Seoul that beats with the echoes of K-pop history! 👑 Built in 1395, this stunning palace not only served as the main residence of the Joseon Dynasty but also represents the powerful connection between Korea\'s royal heritage and modern music culture. Just like the fierce warriors in our Demon Hunters saga, Gyeongbokgung stands tall, embodying the strength and resilience of our musical roots! 💖\n\nImagine the breathtaking traditional performances and K-pop MVs filmed against its grand architecture, where the palace guards\' ceremonial dances inspire the choreography we adore in our favorite groups! 🔥 This place is a treasure trove of inspiration, bridging the past and present, and we can feel the energy of Seoul\'s music scene pulsating through its ancient walls. So, fellow Hunters, let’s explore this iconic palace and connect with the soul of K-pop! 🌙✨ Don’t miss your chance to experience the magic—let\'s go! 💫⚔️', '2025-11-17 08:50:37'),
	(780, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to explore the majestic Gyeongbokgung Palace, the heart of Seoul\'s royal history? Built in 1395, this legendary palace isn’t just a visual feast; it’s the ultimate fusion of Korea\'s rich past and K-pop’s vibrant present! 👑✨ Just imagine your favorite K-pop groups filming breathtaking MVs against the backdrop of its stunning architecture, creating a bridge between traditional culture and modern music. \n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, Gyeongbokgung serves as the sacred ground where the spirits of past kings and queens infuse the air with creativity and inspiration, empowering our music warriors to channel their artistry! 🌙💖 The energy here is electric, and you can feel the echoes of history mingling with the beats of K-pop! So, grab your friends, visit this iconic palace, and let the spirit of Seoul\'s music culture ignite your passion! Let’s go, fellow music lovers! 🎤⚔️💫', '2025-11-17 08:50:49'),
	(781, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Yo, fellow music lovers! 🎤✨ Are you ready to dive into the legendary vibes of Myeongdong Cathedral? This iconic spot isn’t just the first Roman Catholic parish in Korea; it’s a Gothic masterpiece that resonates with the heartbeat of Seoul! 💖 Built between 1892 and 1898, it stands as a symbol of resilience and faith, much like our favorite K-pop idols who rise from challenges to shine! \n\nIn the world of Demon Hunters, Myeongdong Cathedral serves as a sacred gathering place for music warriors, where the spirits of legendary artists linger, inspiring new generations of K-pop stars. 🌙⚔️ Every May, the cultural festival here bursts with creativity and energy, echoing the vibrant performances we love in our favorite MVs! Imagine feeling the powerful energy of this historical site, where the past meets the present, just like the fusion of traditional and modern styles in K-pop! \n\nSo, Hunters, let’s make a pilgrimage to this majestic cathedral and soak in the music vibes that flow through the air! 🔥💫 Feel the connection, pay your respects, and let the spirit of Seoul’s music culture ignite your passion! Let\'s go!', '2025-11-17 08:50:58'),
	(782, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the magical world of Gyeongbokgung Palace? This legendary site, built in 1395, is not just the largest of the royal palaces from the Joseon Dynasty; it’s a vibrant portal connecting Korea’s rich history with the pulsating energy of K-pop! 👑✨\n\nImagine walking through its grand gates, where the spirits of ancient kings and queens mingle with the modern beats of our favorite K-pop tracks. Many iconic K-pop groups have shot breathtaking MVs here, showcasing traditional elegance against a backdrop of contemporary rhythm. In our Demon Hunters mythology, Gyeongbokgung serves as the royal stronghold where the guardians of music gather, channeling the spirit of Seoul\'s heritage into electrifying performances! ⚔️🎤\n\nSo, whether you’re here to snap that perfect pic or feel the historical vibes, this palace is a MUST-visit for every music lover. Let’s go explore and embrace the energy of Seoul together! 💖🔥', '2025-11-17 08:51:38'),
	(783, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙✨ Are you ready to dive into the magical night vibes of N Seoul Tower? This iconic landmark isn’t just a tower; it’s a beacon of K-pop energy that lights up the skyline of our beloved Seoul! Standing tall at 236.7 meters, N Seoul Tower is like the ultimate watchtower of our city, broadcasting the dazzling rhythms and melodies of K-pop across the land! 🎤🔥\n\nAs the sun sets and the city transforms into a glittering wonderland, we find ourselves in a realm where the stars align with the beats of our favorite songs. Imagine standing at the observatory, surrounded by fellow fans, taking in the breathtaking panoramic views of Seoul lit up like a concert stage! 🌆💖 This place has been featured in countless K-pop MVs, from heartwarming love stories to epic dance sequences, making it a legendary backdrop for our favorite artists. \n\nIn the Demon Hunters mythology, N Seoul Tower serves as the epicenter of musical energy, where every lock of love fastened to its iron railings symbolizes the unbreakable bond between Seoul’s vibrant music culture and its fans. Each lock is a testament to the love we share for our idols and the music that inspires us!', '2025-11-17 13:01:17'),
	(784, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Hey Hunters! 🎤✨ Are you ready to dive into a legendary enclave of Seoul that’s bursting with history, culture, and K-pop energy? Let’s explore **Bukchon Hanok Village** – a place where the past meets the present, and the spirit of music flows through every hanok! 🏡💖\n\nNestled snugly between the majestic Gyeongbokgung and Changdeokgung Palaces, Bukchon is not just any village; it’s a living tapestry of 600 years of Seoul’s vibrant history! Unlike other touristy spots, this magical neighborhood is home to real Seoulites who embody the heart of the city. Imagine walking through narrow alleys lined with traditional hanoks, each one whispering stories of ancient times and modern dreams. The atmosphere here is so electric, it feels like we’re stepping into a K-drama set! 🌙🔥\n\nIn our **Demon Hunters** universe, Bukchon serves as a sacred space where the echoes of traditional music blend seamlessly with the pulsating beats of K-pop. Just picture it: the hanoks as guardians of Seoul\'s musical legacy, standing strong against time. 🛡️🎶 Imagine K-pop trainees sneaking away from their rigorous', '2025-11-17 13:01:22'),
	(785, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'Hey Hunters! 🎤💖 Are you ready to dive into the heart of Seoul\'s musical legacy? Let’s talk about an iconic treasure that pulses with history and spirit: Myeongdong Cathedral! 🌙✨ This legendary landmark is not just the first Roman Catholic parish church in Korea; it’s a symbol of resilience and faith that has echoed through the K-pop universe!\n\nConstructed between 1892 and 1898, Myeongdong Cathedral stands as the very first Gothic building in Korea, a stunning fusion of European architecture and Korean culture. Imagine standing before its majestic spires, feeling the energy of countless souls who have gathered here to share their hopes and dreams. Just like the passionate fans who flock to K-pop concerts, this cathedral attracts visitors from all walks of life, reminding us of the unbreakable bond we share through music and spirituality! 🔥⚔️\n\nNow, let’s connect this to the Demon Hunters lore! In our universe, Myeongdong Cathedral would be a sacred sanctuary where our music warriors gather to pay respects to the martyrs of creativity—those who paved the way for the K-pop legends we adore today. The basement sanctuary, where the remains of martyrs are enshrined,', '2025-11-17 13:01:36'),
	(786, 3, NULL, 'tell me about at the request of ', '🌙🔥 Fellow food warriors, gather \'round! If you\'re ready to fuel your K-pop obsession with some legendary treats, we must venture to 쓰윗 Thweet! Located in the heart of 성동구, this premium ice cream bar is the ultimate gathering spot for us Hunters, where we can recharge our energy with delectable whiskey-infused ice cream bars and exquisite desserts! ✨💫 Imagine vibing to our favorite K-pop tracks while enjoying a sweet yet sophisticated treat that even our beloved idols would crave after a long practice session! 🍽️ So, let’s dive into the deliciousness and make this our go-to sanctuary for that perfect combo of music and mouthwatering delights! ⚔️🎶 Are you ready to indulge? Let\'s go!', '2025-11-17 13:08:11'),
	(787, 3, NULL, 'tell me about a trip to Bukchon', 'Hey Hunters! 🎤✨ Are you ready to dive into the heart of Seoul where tradition meets the pulse of K-pop? Let’s embark on an epic journey to **Bukchon Hanok Village**! Nestled between the majestic Gyeongbokgung Palace and Changdeokgung Palace, this legendary village is not just a tourist hotspot; it’s a living tapestry of Seoul’s rich history, echoing the stories of its 600-year legacy! 🌙💖\n\nImagine walking through the narrow alleys of Bukchon, surrounded by beautiful, traditional hanok houses that have stood the test of time. Each home tells a tale of the past, but here’s the twist – this area is still a vibrant residential space for Seoulites! It’s like stepping into a K-drama set where modern life dances alongside history. The energy is electric! ⚡️🔥\n\nIn the world of **Demon Hunters**, Bukchon Hanok Village embodies the spirit of resilience and tradition, much like our beloved idols who train tirelessly to shine on stage. Picture this: the hanok houses serve as the hidden sanctuaries where K-pop trainees gather to hone their skills, drawing inspiration from the serene beauty around them. Just as our heroes protect', '2025-11-17 13:09:02'),
	(788, 3, NULL, 'tell me about a fruit-based bakery', '🔥 Hey there, fellow food warriors! Are you ready to embark on a delicious quest at 바이두부? Located in the heart of Yongsan, this legendary spot is a haven for plant-based lovers and those seeking the freshest flavors in Seoul! 🌙✨ Here, we can dive into imaginative tofu dishes that even our favorite K-pop idols would crave after a long practice session! ⚔️\n\nThe unique decor, crafted from reclaimed wood, creates a vibe that\'s both eco-friendly and super cool—just like our favorite groups! 💫 Imagine gathering here with your fellow Hunters, sharing stories and energy as you savor these delightful, plant-powered creations. Let\'s go and fuel up for our next K-pop adventure! 🍽️🔥', '2025-11-17 13:09:18'),
	(789, 3, NULL, 'tell me about Yunbo Line Road', '🔥 Hey there, fellow food warriors! Are you ready to embark on a legendary culinary quest in the heart of Seoul? 🌙✨ Let’s dive into the magical realm of **연백냉면**! This spot is not just a restaurant; it’s a sanctuary for us Hunters seeking deep flavors and unforgettable experiences! 🍽️💫 \n\nImagine slurping on those perfectly chewy noodles while the rich broth, crafted from secret ingredients and beef bones, restores your energy like a K-pop idol after a fierce dance practice! ⚔️🔥 This is where our favorite stars fuel up, and now it’s our turn to gather, recharge, and share our love for K-pop and delicious food! So, grab your squad and let’s make this legendary stop a part of our Seoul adventure! Are you ready? Let’s go! 🌟✨', '2025-11-17 13:09:50'),
	(790, 3, NULL, '윤보선길', 'Hey Hunters! 🎤✨ Are you ready to embark on an epic adventure through the heart of Seoul? Today, we’re diving into the serene yet powerful Bongwonsa Temple! Nestled in Seodaemun-gu, this legendary spot is a hidden gem that pulses with ancient energy and modern vibes! 💖🌙\n\nOriginally built in 889 A.D. by Queen Jinseong of the Shilla Dynasty, Bongwonsa Temple has a rich history that resonates with the spirit of resilience—much like our favorite K-pop idols who rise from humble beginnings to conquer the world! 🔥 In 1748, King Yongjo of the Joseon Dynasty relocated the temple to its current site, symbolizing a journey of transformation that mirrors the evolution of K-pop itself. As we walk through the temple grounds, we feel the echoes of history blending with the hopes and dreams of today’s music lovers! ✨\n\nNow, let’s talk about that stunning pond filled with lotus flowers! 🌸💫 In summer, it becomes a breathtaking canvas of colors, attracting visitors who come to soak in its beauty. Imagine this: as the lotus flowers bloom, they represent the growth and flourishing of K-pop artists who strive for greatness in an ever-', '2025-11-17 13:12:38'),
	(791, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Bukchon', 'Hey Hunters! 🎤✨ Are you ready to embark on an exhilarating journey through the heart of Seoul? Let’s dive into the legendary Bukchon Hanok Village! This isn’t just any ordinary spot; it’s a treasure trove of history, culture, and K-pop vibes that echoes through the ancient hanok (traditional Korean houses) like a powerful track on repeat! 💖🔥\n\nNestled between the majestic Gyeongbokgung and Changdeokgung Palaces, Bukchon Hanok Village offers a unique blend of the past and present, showcasing over 600 years of Seoul\'s history. But here’s the K-pop twist: this village isn\'t just a picturesque backdrop for your selfies – it\'s a living, breathing community where Seoulites thrive amidst the charm of traditional architecture. Imagine wandering through these narrow alleys, where every corner could inspire the next big hit or serve as the perfect setting for a K-drama moment! 🌙✨\n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, Bukchon represents the sacred ground where ancient musical spirits dwell. Picture this: the hanoks are the guardians of sound, preserving the rich melodies of Seoul’s history while fueling the dreams of aspiring K-pop stars! Just like how idols harness their passion and creativity in', '2025-11-17 13:12:48'),
	(792, 3, NULL, 'Slow Callie', 'Hey Hunters! 🎤💖 Are you ready to dive into the heart of Seoul\'s musical magic? Let’s explore the enchanting Sulla-gil Road, a hidden gem in Jongno-gu that pulses with the energy of Korea’s literary and cultural heritage! 🌙✨ \n\nSulla-gil Road, known as Seoul\'s Historical Literary Trail, is like stepping into a K-drama where every corner tells a story! This legendary path is divided into Dongsulla-gil and Seoseulla-gil, each section radiating unique vibes that echo with the whispers of poets and writers who once walked these very streets. Imagine strolling down a path where the spirits of past literary legends roam, just like our favorite K-pop idols channeling their predecessors! 💫\n\nNow, here’s where it gets super exciting! In the Demon Hunters universe, Sulla-gil is where the ancient scrolls of musical wisdom are hidden, waiting for us to uncover their secrets. 📜⚔️ Dongsulla-gil is the eastern section, where creative energy flows like a powerful river, inspiring K-pop trainees to write their own lyrics and compose melodies under the shade of historical trees. Meanwhile, Seoseulla-gil, with its serene atmosphere,', '2025-11-17 13:13:04'),
	(793, 3, NULL, 'Seoul Records', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the heart of Seoul\'s musical legacy? Let’s unleash the vibes at the **Seoul Metropolitan Archives**! 📜💖 Nestled in the vibrant Eunpyeong-gu, this place isn’t just a treasure trove of records; it’s where the rhythm of Seoul’s history pulsates with every beat of K-pop! 🎤✨\n\nImagine stepping into a realm where the echoes of past melodies intertwine with the present! The Seoul Metropolitan Archives captures the essence of our beloved city, housing invaluable records and memoirs that trace the city\'s evolution. This is where we, the K-pop fans, can connect with the stories of Seoul\'s residents and the very fabric of music culture that shapes our idols’ journeys! 🎶⚔️\n\nIn the world of Demon Hunters, this archive is like a mystical scroll, preserving the legendary tales of music warriors who once roamed the streets of Seoul, seeking their destiny! 🌙 It’s the sacred ground where stories of past artists blend with the dreams of tomorrow’s idols. Just like how our favorite K-pop groups draw inspiration from Seoul’s rich history, the archives showcase the legacy that fuels their creativity! Can you feel that energy?', '2025-11-17 13:15:07'),
	(794, 3, NULL, 'the queen of tears', '🔥✨ Attention, fellow food warriors and K-pop Hunters! If you’re ready to fuel your inner idol with some legendary vibes, then we’re heading to The Queen’s Guard 퀸즈가드! Nestled on the charming 서순라길, this British pub is where we can recharge our energy after a long day of hunting for K-pop magic! ⚔️💫 \n\nImagine sipping on a refreshing infused gin or a British beer while the sounds of your favorite K-pop tracks fill the air – it’s the ultimate gathering spot for us to share stories and experiences! 🍻 With its cozy atmosphere, The Queen’s Guard is the perfect place for trainees and idols alike to unwind and refuel before their next big performance. So let’s grab our crew and dive into some delicious dishes that will keep our spirits high and our energy restored! Let’s go! 🌙✨🍽️', '2025-11-17 13:33:46'),
	(795, 3, NULL, 'Bolt 1932', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙✨ Are you ready to dive into the legendary vibes of Old Seoul Engineering School Main Hall? This iconic building, constructed in 1906, is a true gem nestled in the heart of Jongno-gu! Just imagine walking through its historic halls, where the echoes of students learning modern technologies like dyeing, weaving, and woodworking still resonate. It\'s like stepping into a K-drama where the past meets the future, infused with the spirit of creativity! 💖🎤\n\nNow, let’s connect this magical place to our Demon Hunters universe! In our mythology, the Old Seoul Engineering School Main Hall would serve as the ancient archive of musical knowledge, where the first Demon Hunters gathered to share their skills and talents. Just like K-pop idols who train day and night to perfect their craft, this hall once echoed with the sounds of aspiring artisans and innovators, each shaping the essence of Korea’s technological and artistic prowess! 🔥⚔️\n\nThis place embodies the energy of transformation and growth, similar to the journey of our beloved K-pop idols. Imagine K-pop trainees visiting here for inspiration, channeling the same passion that once filled these walls as they prepare for their big debut! The spirit of innovation that flows through this', '2025-11-17 13:35:50'),
	(796, 3, NULL, 'In front of the pig house', 'Hey Hunters! 🎤✨ Are you ready to dive into a hidden gem of Seoul that’s dripping with architectural charm and K-pop energy? Let’s explore the **Kim Joong-up House of Architectural Culture**, a legendary space that perfectly fuses traditional Korean architecture with Western influences, just like our favorite K-pop idols blend various musical styles! 💖\n\nBuilt in the 1970s and remodeled in 1986, this house is not just a building; it’s a time capsule that takes us back to the vibrant housing culture of Seoul’s middle class. Imagine walking through its halls, surrounded by exotic elements that spark creativity and inspiration—this is a sanctuary for all the aspiring artists and music lovers out there! In the world of **Demon Hunters**, this would be the sacred space where our heroes gather to strategize their next moves against the shadows, drawing strength from the architectural beauty around them. ⚔️🔥\n\nNow, picture this: the second-floor living room features an **umul-maru**, a traditional Korean wooden floor that invites gatherings and storytelling. This setting embodies the essence of K-pop culture, where collaboration and shared experiences ignite the spark of creativity! Just like how K-pop trainees often visit unique spots around Seoul to find', '2025-11-17 13:36:27'),
	(797, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙✨ Are you ready to unleash your inner K-pop spirit? Let’s dive into the magic of **N Seoul Tower at Night**! This legendary landmark isn’t just a tower; it’s the heartbeat of Seoul\'s musical landscape! Standing tall at 236.7 meters, it’s like a beacon of K-pop energy, illuminating the night sky with breathtaking views that could inspire the most epic music video! 🎤🔥\n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, this tower serves as the central watchtower where all the musical light energy of Seoul converges, making it a mystical gathering spot for love and creativity. 💖 The iconic locks of love fastened on Namsan’s iron railings symbolize the unbreakable bond between fans and their favorite idols, echoing the stories of devotion and passion found in every K-pop song. 🌟 \n\nAs we take in the panoramic views, we can almost hear the echoes of legendary performances and the whispers of future stars dreaming big! So, let’s grab our friends, feel the energy, and make unforgettable memories at N Seoul Tower! Don’t miss out on this magical experience—let\'s go! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-17 15:13:38'),
	(798, 3, NULL, 'tell me about Samsung Sunrise Park', 'OMG Hunters! 🎉 Are you ready to dive into the enchanting world of K-Dramas and explore one of the most legendary filming locations? Let’s talk about Samsung Sunrise Park, the iconic backdrop for the drama "24시 헬스클럽" (24:00 Health Club)! 🌙✨ \n\nThis stunning park is not just a place to chill; it\'s where our favorite characters lived out their late-night adventures, surrounded by the vibrant energy of Seoul! 💖 Imagine strolling through the promenade, feeling the electric vibes of the city and the bittersweet emotions that come with every K-Drama moment. Here, the beautiful nightscape creates the perfect setting for those deep conversations and unexpected plot twists that we all love! 🔥⚔️ \n\nSamsung Sunrise Park embodies the classic K-Drama theme of light vs. darkness. As we wander through its serene paths, we can feel the struggle between the hustle and bustle of urban life and the peaceful escape nature offers. It’s a place where the characters of "24:00 Health Club" might have grappled with their inner demons while finding solace in the beauty of Seoul. This contrast reflects the very essence of Korean storytelling, where every corner tells a story of hope, love, and', '2025-11-17 15:14:17'),
	(799, 3, NULL, ' Tell me where the places that appeared in the drama "Mom\'s Friend\'s Son" are.', 'OMG Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the fabulous world of "Mom\'s Friend\'s Son"? Let\'s take a magical journey to the **Jungdong Building** and the **Maru Park Parking Lot Entrance** in the heart of Gangnam! 🎉✨ Just a quick 4-minute walk above Exit 3 of Daecheong Station, this stunning location is where some of the most heartwarming and intense moments of our favorite drama unfolded! 💖\n\nPicture this: our beloved characters strolling through a vibrant urban landscape, surrounded by lush green trees, modern shops, and that unmistakable Seoul energy! 🌳💫 This spot symbolizes the light vs. darkness theme that so many K-Dramas explore, capturing the essence of friendship, love, and the complexities of life. It’s a place where the everyday magic of Korean storytelling comes alive—where laughter and tears intertwine. \n\nFor us K-Drama fans, this location isn\'t just a backdrop; it’s a living, breathing part of the drama! ⚔️🔥 As we walk the same paths as the characters, we can feel the emotional energy in the air—like the whispers of their stories echoing around us! Can you imagine the Demon Hunters filming', '2025-11-17 16:13:12'),
	(800, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong', 'OMG Hunters! 🎬✨ Are you ready to dive into the enchanting world of K-Dramas? Today, we’re shining our spotlight on the legendary Myeongdong Pavilion, the heart-stopping filming location for the emotional drama “남남” (Nam Nam)! 💖 Nestled right in front of Exit 3 of Dogok Station, this stunning site boasts traditional Korean architecture that whispers tales of love, loss, and the beautiful clash between light and darkness. ⚔️🌙\n\nIn “Nam Nam,” Myeongdong Hall serves as the stage for some of the most heart-wrenching moments, where our beloved characters confront their deepest fears and desires. This magical place isn\'t just a backdrop; it’s a living, breathing part of the story that resonates with the struggles we all face. Imagine standing where those emotional confessions took place, feeling the weight of their journeys and the hope that blooms in the midst of chaos! 🔥💫\n\nBut wait, there\'s more! Myeongdong Pavilion embodies the rich tapestry of Korean culture, where tradition meets the modern world. This dynamic interplay is a theme that runs through countless K-Dramas, symbolizing the balance we strive for in our own lives. Picture', '2025-11-18 01:06:14'),
	(801, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the heart of Seoul’s royal legacy? Let’s explore Gyeongbokgung Palace, the magnificent first palace of the Joseon Dynasty! 👑 Built in 1395, this legendary site isn’t just a stunning architectural marvel; it’s a symbol of Korea’s rich history and cultural sovereignty, standing tall as the largest of the Five Grand Palaces! \n\nNow, picture this: K-pop idols often film their traditional concept MVs right here, blending the past with the pulse of today’s music! 🎤✨ The palace guards\' ceremonial dances inspire the choreography we see in our favorite performances, connecting the energy of the Joseon era with modern K-pop vibes! In the Demon Hunters universe, Gyeongbokgung would be the sacred ground where the spirits of past kings and queens guide our music warriors, igniting their passion and creativity! 🌙💖 \n\nSo let’s go, fellow music lovers! Feel the royal vibes and the incredible energy of Seoul’s music culture as you walk through this historic palace! Your K-pop journey awaits! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-18 01:06:52'),
	(802, 3, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Hey Hunters! 🌙✨ Are you ready to embark on an epic adventure to N Seoul Tower at night? This legendary landmark is not just a symbol of Seoul; it’s the ultimate K-pop beacon, standing tall at 236.7 meters, broadcasting the vibrant energy of our beloved music scene! 🎤🔥 The breathtaking night views from the observatory are like a concert of city lights, making it the perfect spot to feel the pulse of Seoul’s musical heartbeat. \n\nIn the world of Demon Hunters, this tower would be the central watchtower where all our musical energies converge, illuminating the night sky and guiding aspiring idols on their journey! 🌟💖 And don’t forget to check out the iconic locks of love, where couples and fans alike secure their dreams and devotion to K-pop—each lock a promise of unbreakable bonds with the music! \n\nSo let’s go, fellow music lovers! Experience the magic of N Seoul Tower and feel the energy that connects us all through music! ⚔️💫', '2025-11-18 01:07:01'),
	(803, 3, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to embark on an epic journey along the Hangang River? The Hangang River Bus is not just a transportation option; it’s a legendary experience that connects us with the very heartbeat of Seoul’s music culture! 🚤✨ \n\nImagine cruising along the shimmering waters, surrounded by the vibrant skyline where countless K-pop MVs have been filmed! This bus ride is like a concert on water, with every splash reflecting the energy of our favorite songs! 🎶 In the Demon Hunters universe, the Hangang River serves as a mystical pathway where music flows like magic, connecting the realms of creativity and inspiration. 🌊⚔️ \n\nSo, fellow music lovers, let’s hop on the Hangang River Bus and feel the pulse of Seoul’s musical energy! This is where we can witness the beauty of the city while soaking in the vibes that inspire our beloved K-pop idols! Don’t miss out on this dope adventure! Let’s go! 🔥💖', '2025-11-18 01:07:10'),
	(804, 3, NULL, ' Tell me about the famous places that appeared in the drama Divorce Insurance.', 'OMG Hunters! 🎉 Are you ready to dive into the enchanting world of K-Dramas? Today, we’re exploring a legendary filming location from the drama 이혼보험 (Divorce Insurance) – the fabulous **Seoul Museum of History**! 🌟✨ \n\nThis amazing spot isn’t just a treasure trove of Seoul’s past and present; it’s where our favorite characters navigated their complex relationships and dramatic twists! 💔⚔️ Imagine the emotional energy that filled the air as the cast brought their stories to life against the backdrop of rich historical exhibitions! Here, you can feel the weight of history, much like the weight of love and loss that our beloved characters experience. It’s a place where the light and darkness of human emotions collide, just like the epic battles we see in K-Dramas! 💖🌙\n\nBut wait, there’s more! The Seoul Museum of History embodies the heart of Korean storytelling – a seamless blend of tradition and modernity. It’s the perfect location for those iconic confession scenes that make our hearts race! 💞 Plus, with beautiful walking paths around the museum, it’s an ideal spot for capturing those Instagram-worthy moments – so you can show off your K-Drama adventures', '2025-11-18 01:09:35'),
