	(835, 3, NULL, 'Myeongdong Jaemi-ro', 'Hey Hunters! 🔥 Are you ready to dive into the electrifying vibes of Myeongdong Jaemi-ro? This legendary street is a treasure trove of K-pop energy, where vibrant shops and street performances collide in a dazzling display of Seoul\'s musical heartbeat! 🎤✨ In the Demon Hunters universe, this bustling area would be the enchanted marketplace where aspiring idols and music warriors gather to showcase their talents, drawing fans from all corners of the city. \n\nPicture this: as we stroll down the lively streets, we can feel the pulse of K-pop resonating through the air, with street vendors serving delicious snacks and pop-up performances by talented artists. 🍡🎶 Myeongdong embodies the spirit of creativity and connection, making it a must-visit for any music lover looking to experience the essence of Seoul\'s pop culture! \n\nSo, grab your friends, channel your inner K-pop star, and let’s explore this amazing street together! The adventure awaits! 💖⚔️', '2025-11-18 02:57:07'),
	(836, 3, NULL, 'Myeongdong Cathedral', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to explore a place where history and spirituality meet the vibrant energy of K-pop? Welcome to Myeongdong Cathedral, the first Roman Catholic parish church in Korea and a stunning Gothic masterpiece! 🏰✨ This legendary site isn\'t just about its breathtaking architecture; it\'s also a sanctuary where we can connect with the spirits of the past, just like our favorite K-pop idols draw inspiration from their roots to create mesmerizing music. 🎤💖\n\nIn the world of Demon Hunters, Myeongdong Cathedral stands as a powerful beacon, where the echoes of martyrs resonate like the harmonies of a chart-topping ballad. Every May, the cathedral hosts a cultural festival that lights up the heart of Seoul, celebrating the unity of faith and culture—much like how K-pop brings fans together from all walks of life! 🎉🔥 So, fellow music lovers, let\'s visit this incredible site, feel the historical vibes, and soak in the magical energy that fuels both our beloved K-pop and the rich tapestry of Korean heritage! Let’s go! 🌙⚔️', '2025-11-18 02:57:30'),
	(837, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong Cathedral', 'Hey Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into a legendary spot in Seoul that pulses with both history and K-pop energy? Welcome to Myeongdong Cathedral, the very first Roman Catholic parish church in Korea and a stunning Gothic masterpiece! 🏰✨ This iconic landmark, completed in 1898, stands as a beacon of faith and culture, embodying the spirit of resilience, much like our beloved K-pop idols who rise to fame through hard work and dedication! \n\nIn the Demon Hunters universe, Myeongdong Cathedral would be like a sacred sanctuary where our music warriors gather to seek inspiration and strength from the martyrs enshrined in the basement sanctuary. 💖 The energy here is incredible, especially during the annual cultural festival every May, where the air vibrates with creativity and celebration, reminding us of the vibrant performances we see in K-pop! 🎤🔥 \n\nSo, fellow music lovers, let’s make sure to visit this historic gem, feel the powerful energy, and connect with the rich tapestry of Seoul\'s music culture! Let\'s go and experience the magic of Myeongdong Cathedral together! 🌙⚔️', '2025-11-18 02:57:46'),
	(838, 3, NULL, 'all place introduce me  drama seen Graduation', '🎬 Amazing! I found 20 filming locations from this drama! Each place has its own special story. Tap any location card below for detailed information! 💕✨', '2025-11-18 03:02:27'),
	(839, 3, NULL, 'tell me about Kyobo Bookstore Gangnam Branch', 'OMG Hunters! 🌟 Are you ready to dive into the enchanting world of K-Dramas and explore a legendary spot that perfectly captures the magic of storytelling? Today, we’re heading to the iconic **Kyobo Bookstore Gangnam Branch**! 📚✨ Right in front of Exit 8 of Sinnonhyeon Station, this place isn’t just a bookstore; it’s a treasure trove of dreams and emotions! \n\nIn the drama **졸업 (Graduation)**, our beloved main character finds solace among the shelves, choosing the perfect book that reflects their journey. It’s a scene that resonates with all of us who have felt lost yet found ourselves in the pages of a book. 💖 This location embodies the classic K-Drama theme of light vs. darkness, where the cozy reading corners symbolize hope and discovery amidst life’s challenges. It’s the perfect backdrop for those moments of introspection and growth that we see in so many dramas! \n\nImagine the stories that unfold in this vibrant space! Between the rows of books, we can feel the emotional energy of countless characters who’ve walked through these aisles, searching for their next adventure or a comforting escape. Plus, with its inviting cafe, we can sip on', '2025-11-18 03:04:59'),
	(840, 3, NULL, 'tell me about Kyobo Bookstore Gangnam Branch', 'OMG Hunters! 🎬💖 Are you ready to dive into the heart of K-Drama magic? Let me take you to the legendary Kyobo Bookstore Gangnam Branch, where the drama "졸업" (Graduation) unfolds in a captivating world of stories and dreams! ✨📚 This enchanting place, located right in front of Exit 8 of Sinnonhyeon Station, is where our beloved main character finds solace among the shelves, choosing books that spark joy and inspiration. Imagine yourself surrounded by that cozy reading atmosphere, a perfect backdrop for those intense moments of self-discovery and personal growth! 🌙💫\n\nThis bookstore isn’t just a filming location; it represents the emotional journey that we all experience in our lives, much like the light vs darkness theme that resonates throughout K-Dramas. It’s a sanctuary where dreams collide with reality, a place where we can escape into the pages of novels and find fragments of ourselves in every story. The soothing ambiance and the aroma of freshly brewed coffee create an inviting space for fellow drama lovers to relax and recharge, channeling that K-Drama energy! 🔥⚔️\n\nVisiting Kyobo Bookstore Gangnam Branch is like stepping into a realm', '2025-11-18 03:22:45'),
