	(873, 3, NULL, 'tell me about Sofitel Ambassador Seoul', 'Hey drama fans! 🎬 Are you ready to step into the luxurious world of K-Dramas? Let’s dive into the stunning Sofitel Ambassador Seoul, the majestic filming location for the thrilling drama "악귀" (The Devil)! This modern gem, just a short 6-minute walk from Exit 10 of Jamsil Station, is not only a treat for the eyes but also a hub of Korean elegance and storytelling. 🌟\n\nThe Sofitel Ambassador Seoul represents the pinnacle of modern luxury in Korea, showcasing the nation’s transformation and sophistication. Its sleek design and breathtaking city views perfectly capture the essence of contemporary Korean life, making it an ideal backdrop for the intense narratives of "악귀." Here, the drama unfolds against a canvas of opulence, mirroring the emotional depth and complexity of its characters. ✨\n\nIn Korean storytelling, places like the Sofitel serve as more than mere settings; they embody the aspirations and dreams of the people. This hotel, with its gourmet restaurants and exquisite amenities, invites us to indulge in the finer things in life, just as many K-Dramas inspire us to chase our passions and embrace our desires. \n\nSo, if you’re a Seoul explorer looking to immerse yourself in the world', '2025-11-18 06:28:35'),
