	(876, 3, NULL, 'tell me about Changdeokgung 1-gil', 'Hey Seoul explorers! 🌟 Let\'s dive into the enchanting world of Changdeokgung 1-gil! This charming street runs alongside the breathtaking Changdeokgung Palace, one of Seoul\'s most beautiful and historically rich sites. As we stroll along Changdeokgung 1-gil, we can feel the echoes of the past, with traditional hanok houses lining the way, giving us a glimpse into the Joseon Dynasty\'s architectural elegance. 🏛️ \n\nThe atmosphere here is a delightful blend of history and modernity. Locals often gather to enjoy the serene beauty of the palace gardens, especially during cherry blossom season when the blooms create a magical backdrop. 🌸 This street also connects us to the vibrant culture of Seoul, where we can find cozy cafes and artisanal shops that celebrate Korean craftsmanship. \n\nSo, as we embark on our adventure, let\'s not miss the chance to wander down Changdeokgung 1-gil and soak in the charm of this unique area! ✨🍽️', '2025-11-18 06:30:01'),
