	(1174, 3, NULL, 'compare namsan tower vs Lotte World', 'Both Namsan Tower and Lotte World offer unique experiences in Seoul, making them popular attractions for visitors. \n\nOption A: Namsan Tower  \n• Iconic panoramic views of the city  \n• Romantic atmosphere, especially at night  \n\nOption B: Lotte World  \n• Largest indoor theme park in the world  \n• Variety of entertainment options, including shopping and dining  \n\nIf you\'re looking for breathtaking views and a romantic setting, Namsan Tower is the way to go. However, for a fun-filled day with rides and attractions, Lotte World is the better choice.', '2025-11-20 01:34:53'),
