	(1202, 8, NULL, 'tell me about Korea University of Foreign Studies', '🏛️ Korea University of Foreign Studies: A Gateway to Global Communication! \n\nKorea University of Foreign Studies (KUFS) is renowned for its focus on languages and international studies. Established in 1954, it aims to cultivate global leaders through diverse language programs and cultural exchanges.\n\n📍 Location: The university is located at 107, Imun-ro, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul. \n\n⏰ Hours: The campus is open to visitors during regular school hours, but it\'s best to check for specific events.\n\n💡 Helpful Tip: Don\'t miss the chance to explore the university\'s unique language labs and cultural centers for a deeper understanding of global cultures!', '2025-11-20 03:04:09'),
	(1203, 8, NULL, 'tell me about Itaewon Children\'s Park', '🎬 Get ready to explore Itaewon Children\'s Park, a key filming location for "모범택시2" (Model Taxi 2)! 📺💜 This beautiful park is perfect for K-drama fans wanting to relive memorable moments from the show.\n\nSeveral iconic scenes were filmed right here, making it a must-visit for fans. ✨ The park\'s serene atmosphere allows you to immerse yourself in the drama\'s emotions while enjoying nature.\n\nHow to get there:\n\n• Address: 287-1 Itaewon-dong, Yongsan-gu, Seoul  \n• Access: Just a 10-minute walk from Exit 2 of Noksapyeong Station!\n\nDon\'t forget to bring your camera! 📸 The park\'s lush lawns and amusement facilities provide perfect backdrops for photos, especially during golden hour.', '2025-11-20 03:04:24'),
