	(1236, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong Cathedral', '🏛️ Discover Myeongdong Cathedral!\n\nMyeongdong Cathedral is Korea\'s first Roman Catholic parish church and the first Gothic building in the country. It holds significant historical value, designated as Historic site No. 285.\n\n📍 Address: 100-022 74, Myeongdong-gil, Jung-gu, Seoul  \n⏰ Hours: Open year-round, check local listings for specific times.\n\n💡 One helpful tip: Don’t miss the small sanctuary in the basement, where you can pay your respects to the martyrs.', '2025-11-20 07:22:24'),
