	(1238, 3, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong Cathedral', '🏛️ Discover Myeongdong Cathedral!\n\nMyeongdong Cathedral is Korea\'s first Roman Catholic parish church and the first Gothic building in the country. Designated as Historic Site No. 285, it holds significant cultural and historical value.\n\n📍 Address: 100-022 74, Myeongdong-gil, Jung-gu, Seoul  \n⏰ Hours: Open daily\n\n💡 A helpful tip: Don\'t miss the small sanctuary in the basement where you can pay your respects to the martyrs.', '2025-11-20 07:46:10'),
