	(1274, 8, NULL, 'tell me about Itaewon Children\'s Park', '**Model Taxi 2 - A Must-Visit for K-drama Fans! 🎬💜**\n\nItaewon Children\'s Park is a delightful spot where you can immerse yourself in nature while reminiscing about your favorite scenes from the drama! This park is not only a filming location but also a fantastic family-friendly area.\n\nThe park features various amusement facilities and large lawns, perfect for kids to run around and enjoy themselves! It\'s a serene escape in the bustling city center, allowing fans to connect with the drama\'s heartwarming moments.\n\nHow to get there:\n\n• Address: 287-1 Itaewon-dong, Yongsan-gu, Seoul  \n\n• Access: Just a 10-minute walk from Exit 2 of Noksapyeong Station!  \n\nCapture those special moments in front of the iconic spots, especially during the golden hour for that perfect lighting! 📺✨', '2025-11-20 08:12:51'),
