	(1276, 8, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', '🏛️ **N Seoul Tower at Night - A Must-See Landmark!**  \n\nN Seoul Tower is one of Seoul\'s most iconic attractions, especially stunning when illuminated at night. The panoramic views from the observatory offer a breathtaking perspective of the city.  \n\n📍 **Location:** 04340 105, Namsangongwon-gil, Yongsan-gu, Seoul  \n\n⏰ **Hours:** 10:00-22:30  \n\n💡 **Helpful Tip:** Don\'t forget to check out the locks of love on Namsan\'s iron railings for a romantic touch to your visit!  ', '2025-11-20 08:13:43'),
