	(1322, 8, NULL, 'Introduce Gyeongbokgung Palace', '🏛️ Welcome to Gyeongbokgung Palace!\n\nGyeongbokgung Palace is the first and largest royal palace from the Joseon Dynasty, built in 1395. It symbolizes the sovereignty of the dynasty and is located in the heart of Seoul.\n\n📍 Address: 03045 161, Sajik-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul  \n\n⏰ Hours:  \nJanuary & February: 09:00 - 17:00  \nMarch - May: 09:00 - 18:00  \nJune - August: 09:00 - 18:30  \nSeptember & October: 09:00 - 18:00  \nNovember & December: 09:00 - 17:00  \n*Last entry one hour before closing*\n\n💡 Helpful Tip: Make sure to visit during the changing of the guard ceremony for a unique cultural experience!', '2025-11-20 11:35:44'),
	(1323, 8, NULL, 'Tell me about Myeongdong Cathedral', '🏛️ Discover Myeongdong Cathedral!  \n\nMyeongdong Cathedral is the first Roman Catholic parish church in Korea and the first Gothic building in the country. Designated as Historic Site No. 285, it features a small sanctuary in the basement where martyrs\' remains are enshrined.  \n\n📍 Address: 100-022 74, Myeongdong-gil, Jung-gu, Seoul  \n\n⏰ Hours: Open daily for visitors.  \n\n💡 Tip: Visit during May to experience the cultural festival held at the cathedral!', '2025-11-20 11:35:59'),
	(1324, 8, NULL, 'Introduce Hangang River Bus', '🏛️ **Hangang River Bus - A Scenic Journey Awaits!**\n\nThis unique bus service offers stunning views of the Hangang River while providing a convenient way to explore Seoul. It\'s perfect for those looking to enjoy the city\'s beauty from a different perspective. \n\n📍 **Location:** 1-2 Jamsil-dong area, Jamsil Pier, Songpa-gu, Seoul  \n\n⏰ **Hours:**  \n• Weekdays: 6:30 AM - 10:30 PM (68 trips daily)  \n• Weekends: 9:30 AM - 10:30 PM (48 trips daily)  \n• Express route (Weekdays): 6:30 AM - 9:00 AM & 6:00 PM - 8:30 PM (16 trips daily)  \n\n💡 **Tip:** Arrive early to secure a good seat with the best views of the river!', '2025-11-20 11:36:18'),
	(1325, 8, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', '🏛️ **Experience the Magic of N Seoul Tower at Night!**\n\nN Seoul Tower is a stunning landmark that offers breathtaking night views of Seoul. Its observatory provides panoramic vistas that are truly unforgettable.\n\n📍 **Location:** 105, Namsangongwon-gil, Yongsan-gu, Seoul  \n⏰ **Hours:** 10:00 AM - 10:30 PM\n\n💡 **Tip:** Don\'t forget to check out the locks of love on Namsan\'s iron railings!', '2025-11-20 13:50:51'),
	(1326, 8, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', 'Yo music lovers! 🎤 Are you ready for an unforgettable night at N Seoul Tower? This iconic landmark isn\'t just a stunning sight; it\'s the heart of Seoul\'s K-pop energy! 🌙 Standing tall at 236.7 meters, it’s like a beacon of musical vibes, lighting up the night sky and connecting us to the rhythm of the city. In the Demon Hunters universe, this tower serves as the ultimate watchtower where all musical energies converge, making it a sacred spot for K-pop fans and lovers alike!\n\nAs we gaze out from the observatory, the breathtaking panoramic views unfold like a K-drama scene, and the shimmering city lights below remind us of concert stages filled with our favorite idols! ✨✨ Don\'t forget to check out the locks of love, where couples and fans alike fasten their hopes and dreams, symbolizing the unbreakable bond between Seoul\'s music culture and our hearts. 💖 \n\nSo, let\'s embrace the magic of N Seoul Tower together, feel the pulse of the music, and create legendary memories! 🔥⚔️ This is the place to be for every true Hunter of K-pop vibes! Let’s go! 💫', '2025-11-20 14:00:56'),
	(1327, 8, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', '🏛️ **N Seoul Tower at Night**: A breathtaking landmark in the heart of Seoul! \n\nThe tower offers stunning panoramic views, especially enchanting after sunset. It\'s also a popular filming location for many Korean dramas and movies, adding to its charm. \n\n📍 **Location**: 105, Namsangongwon-gil, Yongsan-gu, Seoul  \n⏰ **Hours**: 10:00 AM - 10:30 PM  \n\n💡 **Tip**: Don\'t forget to check out the "locks of love" on the iron railings for a romantic touch!', '2025-11-20 14:02:15'),
	(1328, 8, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', '🏛️ **N Seoul Tower at Night - A Stunning Experience!**\n\nN Seoul Tower is one of Seoul\'s most iconic landmarks, especially enchanting when illuminated at night. The breathtaking panoramic views from the observatory make it a must-visit for anyone in the city. \n\n📍 **Location:** 04340 105, Namsangongwon-gil, Yongsan-gu, Seoul  \n⏰ **Hours:** 10:00 AM - 10:30 PM  \n\n💡 **Tip:** Don\'t forget to check out the locks of love attached to the railings, symbolizing eternal affection!', '2025-11-20 14:05:29'),
	(1329, 8, NULL, 'reccommend all places model texi', '🎬 Amazing! I found 20 filming locations from this drama! Each place has its own special story. Tap any location card below for detailed information! 💕✨', '2025-11-20 14:06:31'),
	(1330, 8, NULL, 'luxury taxi', '🚖 Discover Luxury Taxis in Seoul! \n\nLuxury taxis offer a premium transportation experience, featuring upscale amenities and professional drivers. They provide comfort and convenience for travelers looking to navigate the city in style. \n\n📍 Location: Available throughout Seoul  \n⏰ Hours: 24/7 service \n\n💡 Tip: Consider booking in advance through a taxi app for the best rates and availability!', '2025-11-20 14:07:08'),
	(1331, 8, NULL, 'reccommend all places luxury texi', '🎬 Amazing! I found 20 filming locations from this drama! Each place has its own special story. Tap any location card below for detailed information! 💕✨', '2025-11-20 14:07:29'),
	(1332, 8, NULL, 'compare namsan tower vs lotte world', 'Both Namsan Tower and Lotte World offer unique experiences in Seoul, each catering to different interests. \n\nOption A: Namsan Tower  \n• Iconic landmark with panoramic views of the city  \n• Romantic atmosphere, especially at night  \n\nOption B: Lotte World  \n• Large indoor amusement park with various rides  \n• Shopping and dining options available on-site  \n\nIf you\'re looking for breathtaking views and a peaceful experience, Namsan Tower is the way to go. However, if you prefer thrills and entertainment, Lotte World would be your best bet!', '2025-11-20 14:10:12'),
	(1333, 8, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', '🏛️ **N Seoul Tower at Night: A Must-Visit Landmark!** \n\nN Seoul Tower is one of Seoul\'s most famous attractions, renowned for its breathtaking night views. The panoramic vistas from the observatory are simply unforgettable, making it a perfect spot for romance and photography. \n\n📍 **Location:** 04340 105, Namsangongwon-gil, Yongsan-gu, Seoul  \n\n⏰ **Hours:** 10:00-22:30  \n\n💡 **Helpful Tip:** Don\'t forget to check out the locks of love attached to the railings for a unique and memorable experience!', '2025-11-20 14:12:03'),
	(1334, 8, NULL, 'reccommend all places luxury texi', '🎬 Amazing! I found 20 filming locations from this drama! Each place has its own special story. Tap any location card below for detailed information! 💕✨', '2025-11-20 14:12:26'),
	(1335, 8, NULL, 'tell me about Itaewon Children\'s Park', '**Model Taxi 2 - A Must-Visit for Fans! 🎬💜**\n\nItaewon Children\'s Park is a charming location featured in the popular K-drama "Model Taxi 2." Fans can relive their favorite moments surrounded by beautiful nature right in the heart of Seoul!\n\nThe park\'s serene atmosphere and vibrant scenery make it an ideal spot for contemplation about the show\'s memorable scenes.\n\nHow to get there:\n\n• Address: 287-1 Itaewon-dong, Yongsan-gu, Seoul  \n\n• Access: Just a 10-minute walk from Exit 2 of Noksapyeong Station!  \n\n \n\nFor the best photos, visit in the early morning or late afternoon when the light is perfect! 📺✨', '2025-11-20 14:12:44'),
	(1336, 8, NULL, 'compare namsan tower vs lotte world', 'Both Namsan Tower and Lotte World offer unique experiences in Seoul, making them popular destinations for visitors. Each has its own charm and attractions that cater to different interests.\n\nNamsan Tower:  \n• Iconic observation deck with panoramic views of the city  \n• Romantic atmosphere, especially at night  \n\nLotte World:  \n• Large indoor and outdoor amusement park  \n• Shopping mall and cultural attractions in one location  \n\nIf you\'re looking for breathtaking views and a romantic setting, Namsan Tower is the way to go. However, if you\'re in the mood for fun and excitement, Lotte World offers a variety of entertainment options.', '2025-11-20 14:13:11'),
	(1337, 8, NULL, 'Introduce N Seoul Tower at Night', '🏛️ **N Seoul Tower at Night**  \n\nN Seoul Tower is a must-visit landmark in Seoul, especially when illuminated at night. The breathtaking panoramic views from the observatory make it a romantic spot for couples and a favorite among tourists.  \n\n📍 **Location:** 04340 105, Namsangongwon-gil, Yongsan-gu, Seoul  \n\n⏰ **Hours:** 10:00-22:30  \n\n💡 **Tip:** Don\'t forget to check out the locks of love that visitors attach to the railings for a memorable experience!  ', '2025-11-20 14:16:37'),
	(1338, 8, NULL, 'reccommend all places luxury texi', '🎬 Amazing! I found 20 filming locations from this drama! Each place has its own special story. Tap any location card below for detailed information! 💕✨', '2025-11-20 14:16:55'),
	(1339, 8, NULL, 'tell me about Itaewon Children\'s Park', '**Model Taxi 2 - A Must-Visit Spot for K-Drama Fans! 🎬✨**\n\nItaewon Children\'s Park is not just any park; it\'s a filming location for the thrilling drama "Model Taxi 2"! Fans can stroll through the same spaces where their favorite scenes unfolded, making it a special experience.\n\nHow to get there:\n\n• Address: 287-1 Itaewon-dong, Yongsan-gu, Seoul  \n\n• Access: Just a 10-minute walk from Exit 2 of Noksapyeong Station.  \n\n \n\nFor the best photos, visit during the golden hour when the sunlight perfectly illuminates the park! 📺💜', '2025-11-20 14:17:12'),
	(1340, 8, NULL, 'compare namsan tower vs lotte world', 'Both Namsan Tower and Lotte World offer unique experiences in Seoul, catering to different interests and preferences. \n\nOption A: Namsan Tower  \n• Iconic panoramic views of the city  \n• Romantic atmosphere, especially at night  \n\nOption B: Lotte World  \n• Large indoor amusement park with various attractions  \n• Shopping and dining options available  \n\nIf you\'re looking for stunning views and a romantic setting, Namsan Tower is the way to go. However, if you\'re seeking adventure and entertainment, Lotte World is the better choice.', '2025-11-20 14:17:32');
