	(1453, '정신병동에도 아침이 와요', '창신6나길', '서울 종로구 창신6나길 11 동대문역3번출구 도보11분', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cqEw70/btszMblz1tl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABVBhMMlGLVnt-T2Y9wsevMmRC6Ga6-FOPtNY7k9t8EF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kTSU%2BJAPeEs2UyAnUaPTGzCtFVM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cmKVQx/btszOODwxiR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACTQ27eIFO9fqD82EUvQMraxMDalIa8dSwhsu-XjR4Wx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vRDU%2B%2Bm29dhpw3sXxHzMoAgvbOA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mX8P4/btszKcZ8AdC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADiwPtArElg46i6NkDPCrKr9PnGC4B3DGNG8XTIxMNzD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vngkLzxs51NfXqcSELE03ALyQrU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zdLwi/btszLsH8ePs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHIay9Vord46XJP5Fvb_dB48W-6FPF-fz8thOpuXo9tt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=f2P71awZ0XIL', '서울 종로구 창신6나길 11', '37.57561', '127.0120784\r', '### 거리/골목 촬영지 정보\n\n**드라마 제목:** 정신병동에도 아침이 와요  \n**촬영지:** 창신6나길  \n**방문 팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 아기자기한 골목입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리/골목  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n창신6나길은 서울의 독특한 매력을 지닌 장소로, 드라마의 감성을 그대로 느낄 수 있습니다. 이곳에서는 아기자기한 골목과 함께 도시의 전경을 한눈에 바라볼 수 있어, 사진 찍기에도 최적의 장소입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해 보세요!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1454, '정신병동에도 아침이 와요', 'JOY187', '서울 강남구 선릉로152길 30 압구정로데오역4번출구 도보8분', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GzMxO/btszLoFthwA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGZ1WMs8qrPGY7PoMEuJ1P3e4b_Jjknobnbzp5TSyIKp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ywW%2B2IuUn1JgwPW1c7dxg1qFbdw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dANMyI/btszJKpdrae/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF1G6F3U5lj0wl09PkbLkDLj4KKx_j4YSqCsHKkyHAmc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4WGdsV07KnHKf2MlTiJlwRefcHw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bHGiqO/btszLloyghi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABG9Q04fnHlrM6rHLeNJhDAXdewuJV1sSkm1ZbaD4KVs/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pTfQ8TaI52sESAdsqLeapjgA8mc%3D\']', '서울 강남구 선릉로152길 30', '37.5241886', '127.0419229\r', '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 정신병동에도 아침이 와요\n- **촬영지:** JOY187\n- **방문팁:** 편안한 분위기에서 촬영된 아름다운 미용실을 경험해보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #JOY187\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 미용\n\n### 여행 포인트\nJOY187은 드라마 "정신병동에도 아침이 와요"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 미용실입니다. 이곳은 드라마 속 주요 장면들이 펼쳐진 곳으로, 방문객들은 실제로 드라마의 한 장면을 체험할 수 있습니다. 다양한 미용 서비스와 함께 커피를 즐길 수 있는 카페도 있어, 친구와 함께 방문하기에 좋은 장소입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 들러보세요!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1455, '정신병동에도 아침이 와요', '미켈란107', '서울 강남구 영동대로 602 봉은사역3번출구 바로앞', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uI7L4/btszLZS4oen/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMb6A2rZgGo_dC_PPTkQlFyx5sBfNhgkxtoRyw7MAJIZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2aD68NsAXzTpb2SUiS6srC2HIXU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dY5pWS/btszRU4MWSS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJqtwvsyBPp96lrDUimJW96sNQAdxPxGTcaiRelpy6pi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vdwYc16tDEN17PM8r%2F1IlnsIFCY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cHeIcq/btszRTdKYJA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGsciPTGGkKIE0DLbpMNpvoLrYAENJnlCz1Y0TVMmn34/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=x%2FnTRBwvNhOE0EpfsTh5SSWqMRI%3D\']', '서울 강남구 영동대로 602', '37.5148855', '127.0604126\r', '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 정신병동에도 아침이 와요\n- **촬영지**: 미켈란107\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼기에 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\n미켈란107은 현대적인 디자인과 세련된 외관으로 주목받는 건물입니다. 이곳은 드라마의 촬영지로 유명하여, 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지닙니다. 주변에는 다양한 카페와 식당이 있어 촬영지 탐방 후 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 특히 저녁에 조명이 켜진 모습을 감상하면 더욱 매력적입니다. 드라마의 순간들을 떠올리며 이곳을 방문해 보세요!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `k_contents_en` (`content_id`, `image_paths`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `writer`, `location_name`, `drama_name`, `address`, `category`, `keyword`, `trip_tip`) VALUES
	(0, 'images/2/23  /drama_132_location_17_img_1_1.jpg; images/2/23  /drama_132_location_17_img_1_2.jpg; images/2/23  /drama_132_location_17_img_2_1.jpg; images/2/23  /drama_132_location_17_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.556266, 126.979401, '황동혁', 'The building next to Namsan Pork Cutlet headquarters, 23rd', 'Squid Game 2', '46-5 Toegye-ro 6-gil, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', 'Tension, suspense, competition, relationships, cities', 'With the urgent storyline of Squid Game 2, this is a place where you can experience the realistic drama scene. There is also a famous Namsan pork cutlet nearby, so you can enjoy the feeling of a drama filming location while enjoying a meal. Don\'t forget to drink coffee at a unique cafe near Hoehyeon Station and think of vivid scenes from the set. Also, you can enjoy shopping or street food on the streets of Myeong-dong nearby and have a relaxing time different from the tension in the drama.'),
	(1, 'images/drama_71/BHC_4/drama_71_location_6_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_71/BHC_4/drama_71_location_6_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_71/BHC_4/drama_71_location_6_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.532380, 126.924415, '신화섭', 'BHC Chicken Yeouido Hangang Park No. 4', 'Heo\'s restaurant', '83-6 Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Friends, chicken, outdoor, Han River, date', 'If you want to enjoy a special moment at Yeouido Hangang Park, I highly recommend BHC Chicken Yeouido Hangang Park No. 4. Enjoy delicious chicken here, the filming location of the drama, and enjoy a wonderful view of the Han River. Nearby, there are Han River bike paths and cherry blossom paths, so it is good for a walk, and Yeouido Park is close, so it offers a variety of attractions. In addition, you can enjoy shopping and delicious food at the nearby Yeouido IFC Mall.'),
	(2, 'images/drama_77/BHC_4/drama_77_location_2_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_77/BHC_4/drama_77_location_2_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_77/BHC_4/drama_77_location_2_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_77/BHC_4/drama_77_location_2_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.532380, 126.924415, '김정은', 'BHC Chicken Yeouido Hangang Park No. 4', 'Potato Research Institute', '62, Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul, Yeouido-dong, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Date, couple, exercise, park, night view', 'Feel the sensibility of \'Potato Research Institute\' filmed at Yeouido Hangang Park. BHC Chicken Enjoying the beautiful scenery of the Han River with delicious chicken at Yeouido Hangang Park No. 4 is the best option. Visit the nearby Yeouido Park and enjoy a leisurely walk among flowers and trees, and capture precious moments with the famous Seoul night view in the background. In the evening, I recommend taking a photo with the night view of the Han River in the background!'),
	(3, 'images/drama_158/CGV/drama_158_location_9_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_158/CGV/drama_158_location_9_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_158/CGV/drama_158_location_9_img_2_1.jpg_x000D_', 37.561328, 126.985353, '김하늘', 'CGV Myeongdong Station Cine Library', 'Hi-Laki', '123, Toegye-ro, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'traffic/station/terminal', 'Movie theater, date, city, night', 'CGV Myeongdong Station Cine Library is a place with emotional scenes from "HiLaki." Watch the latest movie here and feel the feeling of love like the main character in the drama. There are various restaurants and cafes nearby, so it\'s good to enjoy a meal or coffee time. Don\'t miss the photo spots where you can feel the charm of dramas in the lively crowds of Myeong-dong!'),
	(4, 'images/drama_46/CU 2/drama_46_location_47_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_46/CU 2/drama_46_location_47_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_46/CU 2/drama_46_location_47_img_2_2.jpg; images/drama_46/CU 2/drama_46_location_47_img_3_1.jpg; images/drama_46/CU 2/drama_46_location_47_img_3_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.541482, 127.039749, '박지은', 'CU Seoul Forest Park No. 2', 'Our movie', '685-715 Seongsu-dong 1-ga, Seongdong-gu, Seoul', 'a park/forest/mountain', 'Date, couple, park, day, relaxation', 'Seoul Forest is a hidden gem-like space in the city, with peaceful trails and beautiful scenery attractive. Recall the scenes from the drama vividly while having a cup of coffee at CU Seoul Forest Park\'s second store. There are also various sculptures and bicycle rental services in the Seoul Forest, so you can have a good time riding a bike as well as a walk. Also, I recommend you to find special desserts on the nearby Seongsu-dong Cafe Street!'),
	(5, 'images/drama_180/CUYWCA/drama_180_location_27_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_180/CUYWCA/drama_180_location_27_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_180/CUYWCA/drama_180_location_27_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_180/CUYWCA/drama_180_location_27_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.564382, 126.986213, '김은숙', 'CU New Myeong-dong YWCA Branch', 'the queen of tears', '8-2 Myeongdong 11-gil, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Everyday life, couple, cafe, warm atmosphere', 'CU New Myung-dong YWCA is a place where emotional scenes were filmed in the drama \'Queen of Tears\', and if you visit here, you can enjoy a warm cafe time with your loved ones. The area is full of famous Myeong-dong shopping streets and delicious street food, providing the charm of shopping and gourmet food. Also, there are many photo zones where you can enjoy the beautiful night view of Myeong-dong, so it\'s perfect for taking pictures of your life!'),
	(6, 'images/drama_166/CU/drama_166_location_5_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_166/CU/drama_166_location_5_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_166/CU/drama_166_location_5_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_166/CU/drama_166_location_5_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.537881, 126.989627, '김수현', 'CU Itaewon Park Store', 'Graduation', '84, Noksapyeong-daero 40-na-gil, Yongsan-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Character, friendship, emotion, Itaewon, growth', 'CU Itaewon Park branch is a special place where you can capture the sensibility of the drama \'Graduation\' as it is. This place is packed with various and exotic cafes and restaurants, so you can spend your own special time in the background of the drama filming location. Enjoy a recent hot dessert with friends in Itaewon\'s unique atmosphere and have a time to share friendships like the main characters of the drama. It will be a good memory to look at delicious street food and various world dishes on the nearby Itaewon street.'),
	(7, 'images/drama_108/Fmk/drama_108_location_19_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_108/Fmk/drama_108_location_19_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.520837, 127.030548, '이승아', 'Fmk Maserati Gangnam Exhibition Center', 'Trunk', '217, Dosan-daero, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', 'luxury car, sophistication, city, dating', 'Fmk Maserati Gangnam Exhibition Hall combines modern architecture with luxurious vehicle displays, evoking spectacular scenes from the drama. Take pictures while feeling the charm of the car, and enjoy shopping and delicious food on nearby Apgujeong Rodeo Street. You can also complete the perfect dating course by visiting trendy cafes in Gangnam.'),
	(8, 'images/drama_52/GS25_2/drama_52_location_89_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_52/GS25_2/drama_52_location_89_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.509769, 126.995270, '김수현', 'GS25 Hangang Banpo 2nd Branch', 'an unknown Seoul', '40, Sinbanpo-ro 11-gil, Seocho-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', 'Convenience store, night view, Han River, small daily life, date', 'The GS25 Hangang Banpo 2nd branch is a place where attractive scenes of the drama unfold, which has a special meaning for drama fans. Enjoy a simple snack and drink while enjoying the beautiful night view of the Han River here. There is Han River Park near here, which is good for cycling or taking a walk, and the famous Banpo Bridge is also close, making it perfect for taking wonderful pictures. Feel the small happiness in everyday life like the main character of a drama!'),
	(9, 'images/drama_147/GS25 /drama_147_location_3_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_147/GS25 /drama_147_location_3_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.551596, 126.923129, '정유진', 'GS25 Hongdae Monster Branch', 'Is it a coincidence', '79 Wausan-ro, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', 'Date, snack, night view, couple, downtown', 'The GS25 Hongdae Monster branch appeared in a scene from "Is It a Coincidence" and became the setting for a lovely story. There are a variety of convenience foods and drinks here, so it\'s great to take a snapshot of a date while feeling the feel of the filming location. There are various famous restaurants and pretty cafes on Hongdae Street, so visit the filming location and enjoy a relaxing time in the wonderful scenery!'),
	(10, 'images/drama_220/SMT_HOUSE/drama_220_location_26_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_220/SMT_HOUSE/drama_220_location_26_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_220/SMT_HOUSE/drama_220_location_26_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.525424, 127.052015, '김규완', 'SMT HOUSE China Room Cheongdam', 'Kidnapping Day', '58 Apgujeong-ro 79-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Luxurious, fashionable, gourmet, dramatic, sophisticated', 'SMT HOUSE China Room Cheongdam is an attractive space in itself, but it is even more special because it is famous as the main filming location for the drama "Yug Day." This place, where you can enjoy the luxurious daily life and delicious Chinese cuisine of the main characters in the drama, satisfies your eyes and mouth with its sophisticated interior and delicious menu. There are many Korean restaurants and downtown shopping spots near the China Room, so you can walk around leisurely after eating, take pictures, or enjoy shopping. Make special memories by recreating a scene from a drama with friends or lovers!'),
	(11, 'images/drama_102/TYPE/drama_102_location_10_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_102/TYPE/drama_102_location_10_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_102/TYPE/drama_102_location_10_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.544964, 126.925357, '이희재', 'TYPE Hangang Branch', 'suspicious girl', '128 Tojeong-ro, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Date, couple, river, day, cafe', 'The TYPE Hangang branch is the main filming location of the drama "Suspicious Girl," and it is the perfect cafe where you can spend your time enjoying the beautiful scenery of the Hangang River. This place offers a variety of desserts and drinks, and couples often visit because there are many photo zones that are good to post on Instagram. There is Han River Park nearby, so it is good to take a walk, and taking pictures here will be an unforgettable memory. Also, there are many good restaurants in nearby Sangsu-dong, so you can enjoy various foods and enjoy the day.'),
	(12, 'images/drama_172/TYPE/drama_172_location_12_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_172/TYPE/drama_172_location_12_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_172/TYPE/drama_172_location_12_img_2_1.jpg_x000D_', 37.544964, 126.925357, '박지형', 'TYPE Hangang Branch', 'Let\'s carry Sunjae and run', '128 Tojeong-ro, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Date, couple, river, day, emotion, cafe', 'The TYPE Hangang branch is the perfect place to feel the emotional scenes of the drama. Enjoy the moment of love like the main character in the drama while taking a walk in the nearby Han River Park. In addition, you can enjoy a leisurely time with a cup of coffee at a cafe that boasts attractive interiors and a variety of menus. Experience a variety of food and shopping on the streets of Hongdae nearby, and imagine realistic scenes from the drama!'),
	(13, 'images/drama_242/TYPE/drama_242_location_6_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_242/TYPE/drama_242_location_6_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_242/TYPE/drama_242_location_6_img_2_1.jpg_x000D_', 37.544964, 126.925357, '김진명', 'TYPE Hangang Branch', 'a profitable fraud', '1285th floor, Tojeong-ro, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Cafes, dates, friends, social, modern', 'Enjoy the beneficial scam and have a relaxing time at the TYPE Han River branch. The interior of this place is cozy and modern, reminding us of conversations with the main characters in the drama. There is a Han River Park nearby, so I recommend it as a good walking course to enjoy the scenery of the Han River. Enjoy delicious desserts and meals at various restaurants and cafes nearby!'),
	(14, 'images/drama_9/location_22/drama_9_location_22_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_9/location_22/drama_9_location_22_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.519903, 127.050043, '신재민', 'Ganuda Gallery Cheongdam Branch', 'Good day, Eunsoo', '716 Samsung-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a museum/art gallery/exhibition', 'Art Gallery, Date, Sensibility, Couple', 'Ganuda Gallery Cheongdam Branch is famous for its romantic dating spots for its sensuous art exhibitions and atmosphere. It is also recommended to enjoy various works in the gallery and have a relaxing time at a trendy cafe in Cheongdam-dong. There are many high-end S-based restaurants nearby, so you can also enjoy delicious meals. Also, there are many good places to take pictures, so it is perfect for leaving wonderful memories.'),
	(15, 'images/drama_87/location_8/drama_87_location_8_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_87/location_8/drama_87_location_8_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.498584, 127.026223, '김지운', 'Nude Zone Building in Gangnam', 'a good-natured competition', '9, Seocho-daero 77-gil, Seocho-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', 'Business, Competition, City, Person, Modern', 'The Nude Zone Building in Gangnam is a modern architecture that vividly reminds us of the business scenes in the drama. There are many various cafes and restaurants near Gangnam Station, so you can finish your day with delicious meals after visiting the drama filming location. Nearby, there are also attractions such as Starfield COEX Mall and Seoul Arts Center, making it the best place to enjoy Seoul\'s culture and shopping at the same time. It will be an opportunity to feel the breath of a sophisticated city, not a picture of Seoul that is obvious to take.'),
	(16, 'images/drama_114/location_27/drama_114_location_27_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_114/location_27/drama_114_location_27_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_114/location_27/drama_114_location_27_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.517449, 127.040635, '이현주', 'Gangnam-gu Sign Language Interpretation Center', 'The phone you\'re calling right now', '343, Hakdong-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', 'call, emotion, communication, city, everyday life', 'The Gangnam-gu Sign Language Interpretation Center is the perfect place to think of famous scenes of dramas with emotional communication in modern architecture. It is located right in front of exit 3 of Gangnam-gu Office Station, so it is convenient to access. It is also a good choice to try bibimbap or tteokbokki, which are famous Korean foods, at nearby restaurants after visiting. Also, it\'s a great place to take pictures with a nice cityscape in the background, so recreate your favorite scene!'),
