	(181, 'images/drama_146/location_14/drama_146_location_14_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_146/location_14/drama_146_location_14_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_146/location_14/drama_146_location_14_img_2_1.jpg_x000D_', 37.509623, 126.964765, '이혜은', 'Banpo Hangang Park', 'a bad memory eraser', '2262 Hangang Nambicycle-gil, Seocho-gu, Seoul', 'a park/forest/mountain', 'park, day, bike, walk, date', 'Banpo Hangang Park is the best place to ride a bike or enjoy a walk on the weekend. There are many family visitors here as various trails and bicycle paths are well established. Enjoy picnics or savory snacks from famous nearby restaurants while enjoying the wonderful scenery of the nearby Han River. Also, it is famous as a place with a beautiful night view in summer, so I recommend you to create a romantic moment while enjoying the sunset in the evening!'),
	(182, 'images/drama_183/location_33/drama_183_location_33_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_183/location_33/drama_183_location_33_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.509769, 126.995270, '김영희', 'Banpo Hangang Park', 'wedding impossible', '40, Sinbanpo-ro 11-gil, Seocho-gu, Seoul', 'a park/forest/mountain', 'Date, couple, family, park, day', 'Banpo Hangang Park is an ideal dating place for Korean drama fans. Under the blue sky, you can enjoy beautiful scenery with the Han River in the background, and enjoy taking pictures while thinking of various scenes taken. The park has well-established bicycle paths and trails, so you can enjoy leisurely walking or riding a bicycle. There are also delicious Han River chicken and various street foods around, so enjoy delicious snacks and record your memories!'),
	(183, 'images/DNA/location_44/drama_138_location_44_img_1_1.jpg; images/DNA/location_44/drama_138_location_44_img_1_2.jpg; images/DNA/location_44/drama_138_location_44_img_2_1.jpg; images/DNA/location_44/drama_138_location_44_img_2_2.jpg; images/DNA/location_44/drama_138_location_44_img_3_1.jpg; images/DNA/location_44/drama_138_location_44_img_3_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.509623, 126.964765, '김하나', 'Banpo Hangang Park', 'DNA rubber', '2262 Hangang Nambicycle-gil, Seocho-gu, Seoul', 'a park/forest/mountain', 'Date, couple, day, river, park', 'Banpo Hangang Park is a place where romantic moments from the drama \'DNA Rubber\' were filmed, and it is perfect for enjoying the laid-back scenery of the Han River with a lover. Take a walk along the bike path in the park and enjoy the beautiful sunset, and leave a moment of love with the warm night view in the nearby moonlight garden. Also, you can enjoy chicken or picnic lunch boxes, a specialty of the Han River, at nearby restaurants. Make sure to bring your camera and take a picture of your life!'),
