	(187, 'images/  /location_35/drama_177_location_35_img_1_1.jpg; images/  /location_35/drama_177_location_35_img_1_2.jpg; images/  /location_35/drama_177_location_35_img_2_1.jpg; images/  /location_35/drama_177_location_35_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.512226, 126.997815, '최윤정', 'Banpo Hangang Park', 'Let\'s grab him by the collar', '649-1 Banpo-dong, Seocho-gu, Seoul', 'a lake/river/beach', 'Romance, dates, couples, everyday life, riverside', 'Banpo Hangang Park is the main background of the drama and the best place to whisper love. Inside the park, you can take a walk or ride a bike while enjoying the beautiful scenery of the Han River, especially don\'t miss the evening sunset. Nearby Sebit Island, there are various restaurants and cafes, so you can enjoy delicious meals and desserts. Also, if you leave a picture in the park, you can feel like a main character in a drama!'),
	(188, 'images/drama_46/location_49/drama_46_location_49_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_46/location_49/drama_46_location_49_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_46/location_49/drama_46_location_49_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_46/location_49/drama_46_location_49_img_2_2.jpg; images/drama_46/location_49/drama_46_location_49_img_3_1.jpg_x000D_', 37.509769, 126.995270, '한지혜', 'Banpo Hangang Park', 'Our movie', '115-5 Banpo-dong, Seocho-gu, Seoul', 'a park/forest/mountain', 'Love, couple, park, day, night view', 'Banpo Hangang Park is a place where lovely scenes from the drama "Our Movie" are unfolded, especially the night view in the evening. Don\'t forget to relax at the cafe in the park and have a conversation while looking at the Han River. Attractions such as Sebit Island, located nearby, are famous for their various photo spots, and experience exotic Korean food at restaurants near Seokchon Lake. Especially, it is recommended to create a special moment while watching the fountain show on summer nights.'),
