	(192, 'images/drama_52/location_88/drama_52_location_88_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_52/location_88/drama_52_location_88_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_52/location_88/drama_52_location_88_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_52/location_88/drama_52_location_88_img_2_2.jpg; images/drama_52/location_88/drama_52_location_88_img_3_1.jpg_x000D_', 37.512226, 126.997815, '미지의 서울 작가', 'Banpo Hangang Park', 'an unknown Seoul', '649-1 Banpo-dong, Seocho-gu, Seoul', 'a lake/river/beach', 'Date, night view, riverside, couple, picnic', 'Banpo Hangang Park is the perfect place to enjoy a leisurely atmosphere with the Han River in front of you. When the evening sunset is setting, enjoy a romantic date while enjoying the wonderful night view by the Han River. There are various street foods and cafes nearby, so you can take a leisurely walk and enjoy delicious snacks. Also, there are famous photo zones such as Sebitseom Island and Banpo Bridge nearby, so it is good for leaving beautiful memories.'),
