	(195, 'images/drama_156/location_39/drama_156_location_39_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_156/location_39/drama_156_location_39_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_156/location_39/drama_156_location_39_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.519665, 127.049431, '임성한', 'Count by Pyrenees Cheongdam Main Store', 'a woman who plays with someone', '715, Samseong-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Date, romance, interior design, cafe, Cheongdam, luxury', 'Earl Weipyrenche Cheongdam is a dessert cafe with a sophisticated interior and a luxurious atmosphere. The characters of the drama "Playing Woman" share an emotional scene here, where you can enjoy sweet desserts while feeling the sensibility. There are many high-end brand stores around the cafe, and it is also a great place to take wonderful pictures with the colorful street scenery of Cheongdam-dong in the background. There are many trendy restaurants and art galleries nearby, so I recommend it as a dating course.'),
