	(202, 'images/drama_52/5/drama_52_location_56_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_52/5/drama_52_location_56_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_52/5/drama_52_location_56_img_2_1.jpg_x000D_', 37.580163, 126.982205, '김하늘', 'Bukchon 5-ga-gil', 'an unknown Seoul', '12, Bukchon-ro 5-ga-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', 'Walking, Tradition, Culture, History, Photography, Exploration', 'Bukchon 5-ga-gil is famous for its beautiful hanok and tranquil alleyways, providing an experience that seems to solve questions in unknown Seoul one by one. Get out of your busy daily routine and feel the relaxation of a cup of tea at the traditional hanok cafe here. In particular, it has a variety of photo zones, making it the best place to take pictures of your life. Also, you can enjoy traditional Korean crafts or food in nearby Insa-dong, so visit together!'),
	(203, 'images/drama_137/12/drama_137_location_25_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_137/12/drama_137_location_25_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_137/12/drama_137_location_25_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_137/12/drama_137_location_25_img_2_2.jpg; images/drama_137/12/drama_137_location_25_img_3_1.jpg_x000D_', 37.582481, 126.985860, '장영실', 'Bukchon-ro 12-gil', 'Mom\'s friend\'s son', '24-1, Bukchon-ro 12-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', 'Romance, friendship, outing, confession, Seoul tradition', 'Bukchon-ro 12-gil is a traditional street lined with beautiful hanoks, and it is a good place to walk, recalling the love stories of the main characters in the drama. Take a leisurely walk along the road, leave pretty pictures, and enjoy refreshments at a traditional tea shop nearby. In addition, it is perfect for looking around together because it is close to Bukchon Hanok Village, and it is a place where you can feel the unique charm of Seoul.'),
