	(206, 'images/drama_52/5/drama_52_location_52_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_52/5/drama_52_location_52_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_52/5/drama_52_location_52_img_2_1.jpg_x000D_', 37.579131, 126.984214, '최진영', 'Bukchon-ro 5-gil', 'an unknown Seoul', '19-7, Bukchon-ro 5-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', 'Tradition, Alley, History, Café, Date', 'Bukchon-ro 5-gil is a beautiful alleyway lined with traditional Hanoks, and it is a place where you can reproduce a scene from the drama as it is. If you walk around here, there are various cafes and workshops, so it\'s good to enjoy a cup of coffee or look around traditional crafts. Nearby, there are good restaurants in Bukchon Hanok Village and Samcheong-dong, so you can have a perfect day to enjoy various foods and scenery together. There are also many good spots for taking pictures, so it\'s a great place to take a life shot!'),
	(207, 'images/drama_59/5/drama_59_location_19_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_59/5/drama_59_location_19_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_59/5/drama_59_location_19_img_2_1.jpg_x000D_', 37.579820, 126.981330, '김연신', 'Bukchon-ro 5-gil', 'Four Seasons Spring', '128-7 Sogyeok-dong, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', 'Dating, Alleyway, Tradition, Culture, Landscape', 'Bukchon-ro 5-gil is a charming alley that combines Seoul\'s tradition and modernity. Here, if you walk along the path that the main characters in the drama walked, you can see traditional Korean houses huddled together. Enjoy a traditional teahouse at a nearby hanok cafe, or leave memories in a photo zone that\'s good for taking pictures. In addition, Insa-dong, located nearby, will enjoy a variety of traditional crafts and unique foods, making it a more fulfilling trip.'),
	(208, 'images/drama_98/5/drama_98_location_2_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_98/5/drama_98_location_2_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_98/5/drama_98_location_2_img_2_1.jpg_x000D_', 37.579820, 126.981330, '이진욱', 'Bukchon-ro 5-gil', 'When the silver bell rings', '128-7 Sogyeok-dong, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', 'Dating, alley, hanok, emotion', 'Bukchon-ro 5-gil is a beautiful alley lined with traditional hanoks, the perfect place to remind you of the emotional scenes of the drama. If you walk around here, you can enjoy a special moment like the main character of the drama with the wonderful appearance of the hanok. Don\'t forget to spend a leisurely afternoon tasting traditional tea in Bukchon Hanok Village or Insa-dong, located nearby. It\'s also perfect for taking great pictures to post on Instagram!'),
	(209, 'images/drama_204/5/drama_204_location_22_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_204/5/drama_204_location_22_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_204/5/drama_204_location_22_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_204/5/drama_204_location_22_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.580947, 126.982187, '이정명', 'Bukchon-ro 5-na-gil', 'My man is Cupid', '10, Bukchon-ro 5-na-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', 'Romance, love, streets, cafes, traditions', 'Bukchon-ro 5-na-gil is an attractive street that combines traditional hanok and modern sensibility. Here, you can enjoy the sensibility of the drama, take a walk in beautiful alleys, and spend a leisurely time at various traditional tea houses or cafes nearby. Also, Bukchon Hanok Village and Cheonggyecheon Stream are close together, making it perfect for looking around while recalling the scenes in the drama. Enjoy authentic Korean food at the nearby restaurants!'),
	(210, 'images/drama_64/location_26/drama_64_location_26_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_64/location_26/drama_64_location_26_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.578829, 126.983102, '이창민', 'Bukchon Photo Gallery', 'Dear.M', '65, Yunbo Seon-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', 'Photo studio, memories, emotions, youth, friends, farewell', 'Bukchon Photo Studio is a place where you can feel the sensibility of the drama "Dear M." The interior of the photo studio is decorated with cute props, making it the best place to take various poses with friends and leave special memories. There is Bukchon Hanok Village nearby, so you can enjoy the traditional Korean beauty, and there are many cafes and restaurants along Bukchon-gil, so you can spend a leisurely time. You will be able to take a great photo in front of the photo studio!'),
	(211, 'images/drama_52/location_57/drama_52_location_57_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_52/location_57/drama_52_location_57_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_52/location_57/drama_52_location_57_img_2_1.jpg_x000D_', 37.580789, 126.981794, '김미래', 'a trip to Bukchon', 'an unknown Seoul', '28, Bukchon-ro 5-ga-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', 'Tradition, Village, Alley, Culture, Photography', 'Bukchon Travel is a place where you can feel the traditional charm of Seoul, and you can experience the sensibility of the drama as it is. Take a walk along the narrow and cute alleyways, and leave wonderful photos with the beauty of the hanok in the background. There are also many different cafes and galleries around, perfect for a quiet afternoon. If you want to enjoy traditional Korean food, make sure to visit a nearby Korean restaurant!'),
	(212, 'images/drama_87/location_11/drama_87_location_11_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_87/location_11/drama_87_location_11_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_87/location_11/drama_87_location_11_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_87/location_11/drama_87_location_11_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.494251, 127.028234, '김은희', 'Brain Map Psychological Test Center Gangnam Branch', 'a good-natured competition', '7, Gangnam-daero 53-gil, Seocho-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', 'Psychological counseling, counseling room, downtown, healing, professional', 'The Brainmap Psychological Test Center is a place that contains important moments in the drama, and is recommended for those who want to have a deep conversation. There are many hot places in Gangnam around the center, so it is good to look for delicious cafes or dessert stores after consultation. It\'s a two-minute walk from Gangnam Station Exit 5, so enjoy the various shopping attractions and street scenery around you and find a good spot to take pictures. In particular, having a relaxing time with a cup of coffee at a trendy cafe in Gangnam will add to the charm of traveling.'),
	(213, 'images/drama_206/location_18/drama_206_location_18_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_206/location_18/drama_206_location_18_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_206/location_18/drama_206_location_18_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_206/location_18/drama_206_location_18_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.561641, 126.991115, '김재연', 'Vita Cafe Namsan Square', 'My Demon', '173 Toegye-ro, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Cafes, dates, lovers, downtown, filming locations', 'Vita Cafe Namsan Square is where the touching scenes of the drama "My Demon" were filmed, perfect for enjoying a cup of coffee in a hot atmosphere with a lover. Along with the cozy interior of the cafe, there is a good photo zone for taking pictures, so you can reproduce the sensibility of the drama as it is. Namsan Tower and Myeongdong Shopping Street are close to each other, making it an attractive place to be included naturally in the travel course. Enjoy a special moment with delicious desserts and drinks!'),
	(214, 'images/drama_239/location_18/drama_239_location_18_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_239/location_18/drama_239_location_18_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_239/location_18/drama_239_location_18_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_239/location_18/drama_239_location_18_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.520222, 127.055446, '김은숙', 'Viladzidi Cheongdam', 'King the Land', '519, Hakdong-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Romance, posh, cafe, date, travel', 'Viladzidi Cheongdam, a beautiful cafe where the main characters enjoyed dating in King the Land, is famous for its romantic atmosphere. Here, you can enjoy a leisurely time while recalling the scene in the drama with a strong cup of coffee. There is also a high-end brand shopping street in Cheongdam-dong, which is great for relaxing in cafes after shopping. Also, there are many famous dessert shops nearby, so you can add to the taste of your trip with sweet snacks.'),
	(215, 'images/drama_12/ /drama_12_location_4_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_12/ /drama_12_location_4_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_12/ /drama_12_location_4_img_2_1.jpg_x000D_', 37.563171, 126.985409, '김영하', 'Salon de Marshall Myeongdong Branch', 'a hundred memories', '15 Myeongdong 10-gil, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Cafes, dates, romance, comfort, city', 'The Salon de Marshall Myeongdong branch is a romantic cafe, the perfect place to recreate the sweet moments in the drama A Hundred Memories. Enjoy luxurious desserts and coffee here and feel like you\'ve become the main character of a drama. There are Myeong-dong shopping streets and various street foods nearby, so you can organize a good schedule for shopping and delicious food together after a simple walk. Also, you can keep your memories even more special if you take wonderful pictures in the cozy interior of the cafe and post them on social media!'),
	(216, 'images/drama_64/ /drama_64_location_25_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_64/ /drama_64_location_25_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_64/ /drama_64_location_25_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.583956, 126.981825, '이재욱', 'Samcheong-dong Community Service Center Station', 'Dear.M', '80 Samcheong-dong, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', 'Friendship, Campus, Story, Warmth, Youth', 'The Samcheong-dong Community Center stop contains moments to explore the ultimate friendship of the drama "Dear M," so it will be a good memory to take pictures while remembering those scenes on the set. Near the stop, there are beautiful Samcheong-dong streets and Bukchon Hanok Village, where you can experience the traditional beauty of hanok. Also, I recommend enjoying delicious Korean food at nearby cafes and restaurants, and shopping for traditional crafts in nearby Insa-dong. Photos taken against the backdrop of cool murals and street art will be a perfect post on SNS.'),
	(217, 'images/drama_216/location_63/drama_216_location_63_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_216/location_63/drama_216_location_63_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_216/location_63/drama_216_location_63_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.509230, 127.067089, '임성한', 'Seoul Gangnam Police Station', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '11, Teheran-ro 114-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', 'Crime, entertainment, police, action, drama, Seoul', 'The Gangnam Police Station in Seoul is the main filming location of the drama "Strong Woman Gangnam Soon," and it is a place that shows the dynamic appearance of the police. There are many cafes and restaurants around the police station where you can enjoy the modern appearance and atmosphere of Seoul, so you can spend a leisurely time before and after visiting the filming location. There are also famous attractions such as Samsung Seoul Hospital and COEX nearby, so you can enjoy a variety of attractions and food. Make sure to take a picture, and the beautiful cityscape of Gangnam will be the background!'),
	(218, 'images/drama_82/location_32/drama_82_location_32_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_82/location_32/drama_82_location_32_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.495325, 127.032531, '기획/김석원', 'Three branches of Seoul Kkakdugi Gangnam Station', 'That\'s a black dragon', '17, Yeoksam-ro 7-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', '\\N', 'Dating, friends, food, good restaurants, downtown', 'Seoul Kkakdugi Gangnam Station Samjeom is a place where major scenes were filmed in the drama "He\'s a Black Dragon," and it is a must-visit place for drama fans. This place is especially loved by delicious drinkers who reinterpret various Korean traditional foods with a modern sense. There are lively streets, various cafes, and restaurants in Gangnam Station, making it the best place to go on a date with friends or enjoy a fun outing. After your visit, you can recall the impressive scenes of the drama and find good spots for photography.'),
	(219, 'images/drama_51/location_23/drama_51_location_23_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_51/location_23/drama_51_location_23_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_51/location_23/drama_51_location_23_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_51/location_23/drama_51_location_23_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.586158, 126.984877, '이선희', 'Samcheong-dong Post Office, Seoul', 'labor and labor', '109 Bukchon-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', 'Memories, conversations, friendships, everyday life, couples', 'Samcheong-dong Post Office in Seoul is an attractive place that harmonizes with cute alleys. It is also a place where the touching conversations that the main characters of the drama had come to mind. You can enjoy the beauty of traditional houses while walking through Bukchon Hanok Village located nearby, and it is also recommended to recreate the shooting scenes at various cafes on the Café Street in Samcheong-dong. In particular, you can make a perfect day by enjoying delicious sujebi at a nearby \'Samcheong-dong Sujebi\' restaurant.'),
