	(221, 'images/drama_158/location_21/drama_158_location_21_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_158/location_21/drama_158_location_21_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.545046, 127.040837, '정지우', 'Seoul Forest Outdoor Stage', 'Hi-Laki', '685-20 Seongsu-dong 1-ga, Seongdong-gu, Seoul', 'a park/forest/mountain', 'couples, romance, outdoors, music, nature', 'The Seoul Forest Outdoor Stage is the perfect place to recreate the romantic moment of the drama \'HiLaki.\' Make special memories here where the drama\'s main characters whisper their love. There are various bicycle paths and trails nearby, so you can enjoy nature leisurely, and there are many delicious cafes and restaurants nearby, so it is good to take pictures and finish the day with delicious meals. In particular, the beautiful nature spread out in the Seoul Forest makes it the best background to take a life shot!'),
	(222, 'images/drama_96/location_17/drama_96_location_17_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_96/location_17/drama_96_location_17_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_96/location_17/drama_96_location_17_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.543610, 127.042819, '송수윤', 'Seoul Forest (next to the mirror pond)', 'Ask the stars', '720, Seongsu-dong 1-ga, Seongdong-gu, Seoul', 'a park/forest/mountain', 'Parks, dates, couples, nature, relaxation', 'Seoul Forest is a space that provides comfortable healing in the city center, and you can enjoy a walk while thinking of the scene filmed next to the mirror pond. It is also famous for being a good place to take pictures with beautiful flowers and trees around the pond. It is also recommended to spend a leisurely time at various cafes and restaurants in Seongsu-dong nearby. It is a place to present a special moment to those who are tired of their daily lives.'),
	(223, 'images/drama_97/location_90/drama_97_location_90_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_97/location_90/drama_97_location_90_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.543610, 127.042819, '이상훈', 'Seoul Forest (sculpture park)', 'My perfect secretary', '720, Seongsu-dong 1-ga, Seongdong-gu, Seoul', 'a park/forest/mountain', 'Parks, couples, day, dates, nature', 'Seoul Forest is the perfect place to enjoy nature in the city center. Especially in sculpture parks, it is best to take a walk in sunny weather with various artworks. You can enjoy sensual coffee and desserts at the nearby Seongsu-dong Cafe, and don\'t miss the nearby Han River. It\'s a place where you can have a relaxing afternoon and take great life shots!'),
