	(225, 'images/  /IT/drama_238_location_15_img_1_1.jpg; images/  /IT/drama_238_location_15_img_1_2.jpg; images/  /IT/drama_238_location_15_img_2_1.jpg; images/  /IT/drama_238_location_15_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.550999, 127.044778, '서재경', 'Seoul Forest IT Castle', 'Watchmen of the Numbus Building Forest', '130 Gwangnaru-ro, Seongdong-gu, Seoul', 'a park/forest/mountain', 'work, surveillance, city, modern, nature, dialogue', 'Seoul Forest IT Castle is a wonderful place where you can feel the modern and urban atmosphere of the drama. Recalling the scenes that appeared in the drama, you can enjoy a leisurely walk in the beautiful scenery of the Seoul Forest. There are various cafes and restaurants around, so there are many good photo spots to enjoy a meal or take pictures near the filming location. In addition, you can enjoy picnics and biking in the nearby Seoul Forest!'),
	(226, 'images/drama_80/SK_V1_1/drama_80_location_30_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_80/SK_V1_1/drama_80_location_30_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.546671, 127.066125, '김대기', 'Seongsu SK V1 Center1', 'Treasure Island', '48 Achasan-ro 17-gil, Seongdong-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', 'Pleasant, modern, friends, couple, stage', 'Seongsu SK V1 Center1 is an attractive filming location with a modern architecture and large space. You can spend a leisurely time indoors, recalling the scenes in which the main characters in the drama talked. There are many trendy cafes and restaurants nearby, so you can enjoy food, so I recommend you to go out to Hongdae and Yeonnam-dong after visiting. There is also a photo zone that is great for taking wonderful life photos, so don\'t miss it!'),
	(227, 'images/drama_215/location_11/drama_215_location_11_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_215/location_11/drama_215_location_11_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_215/location_11/drama_215_location_11_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.546671, 127.066125, '이영주', 'Seongsu Nak Nak Nak', 'You\'re lovely today, too', '48 Achasan-ro 17-gil, Seongdong-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Cafes, dates, dogs, healing, mild weather', 'Seongsu Nak Nak is a warm cafe where you can spend time with your dog. Visit with your lovely dog for a special moment and have a relaxing time like a couple in the drama. There is Children\'s Grand Park nearby, so it is good for a walk and you can enjoy various street foods. Don\'t forget to take a picture with the beautiful scenery spread out outside the cafe\'s window!'),
