	(231, 'images/drama_186/location_67/drama_186_location_67_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_186/location_67/drama_186_location_67_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_186/location_67/drama_186_location_67_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_186/location_67/drama_186_location_67_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.546671, 127.066125, '박재범', 'Seongsu Nak Nak Nak', 'Dr. Slump', '48 Achasan-ro 17-gil, Seongdong-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Cafe, brunch, healing, friends, date', 'Seongsu Nak Nak is a place where you can enjoy sophisticated interior design and delicious brunch, reminding you of scenes where the main characters in the drama find small happiness. There are unique shops and galleries around the cafe, so you can enjoy shopping and cultural experiences together. In particular, take wonderful pictures on the mural street in Seongsu-dong, a popular photo spot. Before you leave, don\'t miss a simple meal at a famous tteokbokki restaurant nearby!'),
	(232, 'images/KR/location_26/drama_15_location_26_img_1_1.jpg; images/KR/location_26/drama_15_location_26_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.546578, 127.065847, '이효정', 'Seongsu Nak Nak Nak', 'Confidence Man KR', '280-1, Seongsu-dong 2-ga, Seongdong-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Cafes, dates, ice cream, atmosphere, youth', 'Seongsu Nak Nak is a special place where the main scenes in the drama "Confidence Man KR" were filmed. Modern and attractive, this cafe is loved by many people for its beautiful interior and diverse menu. Nearby, there are trendy shops and galleries in Seongsu-dong, making it a good place to take a walk and take pictures together. It\'s the perfect place to enjoy delicious ice cream in the cafe and to remind yourself of the scenes in the drama.'),
