	(286, 'images/drama_209/location_5/drama_209_location_5_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_209/location_5/drama_209_location_5_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.532380, 126.924415, '윤수정', 'Yeouido Hangang Park', 'the moon during the day', '62, Yeouido-ro, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'a park/forest/mountain', 'Date, couple, nature, park, relaxation', 'Yeouido Hangang Park is a place that reminds me of the sweet moments of the drama "The Moon Rising in the Day." You can enjoy a leisurely time here by riding a bicycle or enjoying the beautiful scenery along the Han River. There are many famous mobile restaurants and hot dessert cafes nearby, making it the perfect place to relax while enjoying delicious food. Also, the image of the Hangang Bridge and the sunset colored Hangang River is the best place to take pictures of your life.'),
	(287, 'images/drama_133/location_8/drama_133_location_8_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_133/location_8/drama_133_location_8_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_133/location_8/drama_133_location_8_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_133/location_8/drama_133_location_8_img_2_2.jpg; images/drama_133/location_8/drama_133_location_8_img_3_1.jpg; images/drama_133/location_8/drama_133_location_8_img_3_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.525212, 126.936318, '김재원', 'Yeouido Hangang Park', 'Gangmae Steel', '85, Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'a park/forest/mountain', 'Date, couple, family, park, day', 'Yeouido Hangang Park is a place where you can have a peaceful time while enjoying the beautiful scenery by the riverside. It is also good to walk along the Han River bike path or walking trail, recalling the touching scenes of the drama. Also, you can enjoy the view from the \'63 Building\' nearby, or enjoy dinner with the famous \'Chicken\' and \'Beer\' in Yeouido. The picture taken with the sunset of the Han River in the background will be an unforgettable memory!'),
