	(344, 'images/   /location_34/drama_240_location_34_img_1_1.jpg; images/   /location_34/drama_240_location_34_img_1_2.jpg; images/   /location_34/drama_240_location_34_img_2_1.jpg; images/   /location_34/drama_240_location_34_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.574511, 126.984625, '김재원', 'the house in Insa-dong', 'Please take care of me this time, too', '3, Insa-dong 12-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Tradition, friendship, conversation, eating out, warm atmosphere', 'Insa-dong House is a place that contains scenes of warm friendship and conversation in the drama, offering traditional Korean food and a neat atmosphere. There are many traditional tea houses and galleries nearby, so it\'s full of fun to look around. Also, Insa-dong Street itself is a famous tourist destination, so I recommend you to enjoy various street foods and souvenirs while walking on the street. Don\'t miss the famous photo spot, Insa-dong Ssamgil!'),
	(345, 'images/drama_76/ /drama_76_location_19_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_76/ /drama_76_location_19_img_1_2.jpg; images/drama_76/ /drama_76_location_19_img_2_1.jpg_x000D_', 37.489536, 127.008436, '김민주', 'Ink & Feather Gangnam Branch', 'Riding life', '105, Banpo-daero, Seocho-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Cafes, dates, couples, analog sensibilities, literature', 'Ink & Feather Gangnam branch is an attractive cafe with a cozy atmosphere and colorful books and emotional interiors. It\'s a great attraction here to enjoy coffee in a quiet space while recalling the main scenes of the drama. There are many popular beef stew restaurants and cafes offering various desserts around, so it\'s fun to explore delicious places. In particular, it is the perfect place to take special photos at the filming location with analog sensibilities here.'),
	(346, 'images/drama_158/location_24/drama_158_location_24_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_158/location_24/drama_158_location_24_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_158/location_24/drama_158_location_24_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.518507, 127.083144, '윤소희', 'Jamsil Hangang Park', 'Hi-Laki', '65, Hangaram-ro, Songpa-gu, Seoul', 'a lake/river/beach', 'Date, riverside, bike, walk, relax, day', 'Jamsil Hangang Park is a place where special scenes of Hi-Laki unfold. Ride a bike along the path where the main characters in the drama enjoy their outing, or enjoy a date with someone you love. Jamsil Sports Complex, a world-class stadium, is nearby, and it is also recommended to enjoy the view from the nearby Lotte World Tower. Don\'t forget to leave a nice picture here, too!'),
