	(424, 'images/drama_67/location_9/drama_67_location_9_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_67/location_9/drama_67_location_9_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.552849, 126.922722, '허재영', 'Hoyo Hongdae branch', 'Barney and brother', '20-11, Wausan-ro 21-gil, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Cafes, dates, friends, couples, young people', 'Hoyo Hongdae branch is a popular cafe that contains the sensibility of the drama "Bani and Oppa," and is filled with cute interiors and delicious menus. Recall the conversations and moments of the main characters in the drama and enjoy a cup of coffee. There are streets full of young culture unique to Hongdae and various restaurants, so you can add to the joy of visiting. I recommend it as a spot where you can take great pictures to show off on Instagram!'),
	(425, 'images/drama_179/ /drama_179_location_12_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_179/ /drama_179_location_12_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.551903, 126.917577, '수영 작가', 'Hotel The Designers Hongdae', 'Wonderful World', '86, Yanghwa-ro, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a hotel/dormitory', 'Emotional, daily life, morning, evening, healing', 'Hotel The Designers Hongdae is a place where you can feel unique sensibilities in Hongdae, a trendy area in Seoul. Various cafes and restaurants are adjacent here, so you can enjoy a delicious brunch in the morning and a cocktail in the evening. Also, nearby Hongdae Street is a good place to take pictures because it is full of street performances and artistic elements. Feel the emotions of the rooms where the main characters in the drama stayed, and create special moments!'),
	(426, 'images/  /location_26/drama_233_location_26_img_1_1.jpg; images/  /location_26/drama_233_location_26_img_1_2.jpg; images/  /location_26/drama_233_location_26_img_2_1.jpg; images/  /location_26/drama_233_location_26_img_2_2.jpg; images/  /location_26/drama_233_location_26_img_3_1.jpg; images/  /location_26/drama_233_location_26_img_3_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.524035, 127.048487, '김태희', 'Hotel Entra Gangnam', 'I\'ve been waiting for you for a long time', '508, Dosan-daero, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a hotel/dormitory', 'Romance, maturity, hotel, daily life, filming location', 'Hotel Entra Gangnam is a place full of emotional scenes from dramas, and you can feel a special atmosphere. There are many iconic cafes and high-end restaurants in Cheongdam-dong, so you can experience various gourmet foods. Also, it is close to Cheongdam Station, so transportation is convenient, and it is a perfect place to enjoy photography on the pretty streets nearby. Recall the movements of the main characters in the drama and create an unforgettable moment with your lover.'),
	(427, 'images/drama_225/ /drama_225_location_9_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_225/ /drama_225_location_9_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_225/ /drama_225_location_9_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.563147, 126.978363, '이지효', 'Hotel Thomas Myeongdong', 'Mask girl', '26, Sejong-daero 16-gil, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'a hotel/dormitory', 'Luxury, City, Night, Travel, Meeting', 'Hotel Thomas Myeong-dong is a famous place that contains the atmosphere of the drama "Mask Girl." It\'s also good to remember the scenes filmed here and enjoy a cup of coffee in a cozy cafe. There is a shopping street in Myeong-dong, where you can meet various Korean fashion items and enjoy delicious street food. Also, taking pictures with the beautiful night view around the city hall station is a must-go course for visitors!'),
	(428, 'images/drama_18/location_2/drama_18_location_2_img_1_1.jpg_x000D_', 37.556433, 126.926274, '임성한', 'Hongdae', 'Bulk up', '348-24 Seogyo-dong, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', 'Couple, youth, street art, music, night', 'Hongdae is a street full of the romance of youth, and it is a place where various street art and music performances are held. If you visit the filming location, you can freely travel around the streets, recalling the fresh moments of the main character in the drama. There are many delicious street food and trendy cafes nearby, so it\'s perfect for resting and feeling the sensibility of the past. Take pictures with your friends in the middle of Hongdae and keep wonderful memories!'),
	(429, 'images/drama_249/location_35/drama_249_location_35_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_249/location_35/drama_249_location_35_img_2_1.jpg; images/drama_249/location_35/drama_249_location_35_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.554736, 126.931544, '안상우', 'Hongik University Ding Street', 'Look, look, look, look', '25, Wausan-ro 32-gil, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', 'Date, couple, youth, freedom, street culture', 'It is a hot place where young people gather, with the main background of Hongik University\'s clinky Vora Deborah. There are a variety of street art and unique shops, so you can enjoy a lively atmosphere. Take a picture with your friends, remembering the scene, or enjoy a hearty meal at a nearby restaurant. I recommend you to enjoy music at a live cafe near Hongdae or take a walk along the forest path of Gyeongui Line!'),
	(430, 'images/drama_215/location_5/drama_215_location_5_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_215/location_5/drama_215_location_5_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.559528, 126.924795, '이현수', 'Hongik University Ding Street', 'You\'re lovely today, too', '50-4 Wausan-ro 35-gil, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', 'dating, couples, youth, street performances, shopping', 'It is a place where you can feel the free atmosphere and unique artistic sensibility of Hongdae, and you can reproduce the romantic atmosphere of the drama as it is. There are various cafes and restaurants around, so you can enjoy a leisurely time with delicious brunch, and feel the youthful sensibility while enjoying street performances. In particular, the murals and props shops here are exquisite photo spots, making them the perfect place to leave memories. It\'s close to Hongik University Station, so it\'s very accessible, so have fun feeling like you\'re the main character in the drama!'),
	(431, 'images/drama_31/location_20/drama_31_location_20_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_31/location_20/drama_31_location_20_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.548140, 126.920262, '이재현', 'Hongik University Red Road', 'My girlfriend is a manly man', '318-4 Sangsu-dong, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', 'Dating, Hot Place, Vintage, Youth, Street Art', 'Hongik University Red Road is a place where lively street culture and art are combined, and it is a path where couples in the drama walked affectionately. There are various galleries and delicious restaurants here, so it is also a good point to post pictures taken on social media. There are many delicious fusion foods and atmospheric cafes nearby, so you can spend a leisurely time with your friends or lovers. Also, enjoy the street art of young artists and feel hip!'),
	(432, 'images/2/2/drama_197_location_4_img_1_1.jpg; images/2/2/drama_197_location_4_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.555867, 126.923772, '김은숙', 'Hongik University Jopok Tteokbokki. Hongik University 2nd store', 'Soundtrack #2', '38, Hongik-ro 6-gil, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Tteokbokki, couple, night view, date, youth', 'Hongik University Jopok Tteokbokki Hongik University 2 is one of the hottest places where you can feel the emotions of Seoul best. You can eat spicy tteokbokki and have a good time thinking about the scenes in the drama. There are Hongdae streets, galleries, and various street foods nearby, so enjoy small shopping and artistic experiences together. Especially, don\'t forget to take a picture of the special night view in Hongdae\'s colorful neon signs when you visit at night!'),
	(433, 'images/drama_52/location_10/drama_52_location_10_img_1_1.jpg; images/drama_52/location_10/drama_52_location_10_img_1_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.566611, 126.917993, '정유선', 'Hongik University Chaeum Real Estate Agent Office', 'an unknown Seoul', '89 Yeonnam-ro, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', 'Daily life, love, friendship, hideout, romance', 'Hongik University Chaeum Real Estate Agent Office is the place where important scenes of the main characters\' communication and conflict were filmed in the drama "Unknown Seoul." It is also good to take pictures while feeling the emotions of the drama when visiting. There is an espresso bar and a unique art gallery nearby, making it perfect for enjoying art with a cup of coffee. Don\'t miss Hongdae\'s unique street art and various street performances!'),
	(434, 'images/  /location_11/drama_238_location_11_img_1_1.jpg; images/  /location_11/drama_238_location_11_img_2_1.jpg; images/  /location_11/drama_238_location_11_img_2_2.jpg_x000D_', 37.557560, 126.929169, '이종영', 'Hong Cafe Hongdae branch', 'Watchmen of the Numbus Building Forest', '28, Sinchon-ro, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', 'Cafe, date, friend, night, day', 'Hong Cafe Hongdae branch is loved for its unique interior and delicious coffee, and it is also famous as a filming location for dramas. You can talk with your friends or enjoy a romantic date in the cozy atmosphere of the cafe, recalling the scenes filmed here. There is also a space where various street foods and indie band performances representing Hongdae are held, making it a great photo spot. Have a great time feeling the lingering effects of the drama!');
INSERT INTO `k_contents_trans` (`content_id`, `drama_name`, `location_name`, `address`, `trip_tip`, `keyword`, `category`, `location_name_en`, `drama_name_en`, `address_en`, `category_en`, `keyword_en`, `image_url`, `image_url_list`, `thumbnail`, `second_image`, `third_image`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `drama_desc`, `trip_tip_en`) VALUES
	(1, '이혼보험', '종로1번가오피스텔', '서울 종로구 청계천로 67', '종로1번가오피스텔은 서울의 중심부에 위치하여 접근성이 뛰어나며 다양한 상업시설과 함께 현대적인 분위기를 제공합니다 드라마 팬이라면 촬영지에서 특별한 순간을 사진으로 남기며 주변 카페나 레스토랑에서 여유로운 시간을 즐길 수 있습니다 이곳은 촬영지 탐방뿐만 아니라 서울의 도시 경관을 감상하기에도 좋은 장소입니다', '#이혼보험 #종로1번가오피스텔 #촬영지 #현대건축 #서울여행', '기타/판별불가', 'Jongno 1st Street Opistel', 'divorce insurance', '67 Cheonggyecheon-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Divorce insurance #Jongro 1st Street Opistel #filming location #modern architecture #Seoultravel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/76Nm8/btsNKgV2Kls/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACEp3R_fxTNCuI6k4eFLV10t-ZwSExbFW0sq6-sZKiwx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nZd%2Br3Mhz7%2BZ8EJShkAwa4Q369k%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/76Nm8/btsNKgV2Kls/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACEp3R_fxTNCuI6k4eFLV10t-ZwSExbFW0sq6-sZKiwx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nZd%2Br3Mhz7%2BZ8EJShkAwa4Q369k%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/76Nm8/btsNKgV2Kls/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACEp3R_fxTNCuI6k4eFLV10t-ZwSExbFW0sq6-sZKiwx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nZd%2Br3Mhz7%2BZ8EJShkAwa4Q369k%3D', NULL, NULL, 37.5688672, 126.9851065, '### 이혼보험 촬영지: 종로1번가오피스텔\n\n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마 "이혼보험"의 주요 촬영지로, 현대적인 건축물과 함께 도심의 매력을 느낄 수 있습니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 종로1번가오피스텔은 서울의 중심부에 위치하여 접근성이 뛰어나며, 다양한 상업시설과 함께 현대적인 분위기를 제공합니다. 드라마 팬이라면 촬영지에서 특별한 순간을 사진으로 남기며, 주변 카페나 레스토랑에서 여유로운 시간을 즐길 수 있습니다. 이곳은 촬영지 탐방뿐만 아니라 서울의 도시 경관을 감상하기에도 좋은 장소입니다.', 'Jongno 1st Street Opistel is located in the heart of Seoul so it is highly accessible and offers a modern atmosphere with various commercial facilities If you are a drama fan you can take pictures of special moments at the filming location and enjoy your leisure time at nearby cafes and restaurants This is a great place not only to visit the filming location but also to appreciate the cityscape of Seoul'),
	(2, '이혼보험', '청구로', '서울 중구 신당동 229-41 동대문역사문화공원역3번출구 도보4분', '청구로는 드라마 이혼보험의 촬영지로 현대적인 분위기와 함께 여유로운 산책을 즐길 수 있는 장소입니다 이곳은 드라마 속 주인공들이 걷고 대화하는 장면들이 담긴 곳으로 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지니고 있습니다 거리 곳곳에는 벤치와 나무들이 있어 휴식을 취하며 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있습니다 다양한 카페와 상점들도 가까워 촬영지 탐방 후 여유로운 시간을 보내기에도 안성맞춤입니다', '#KdramaTrip, #StreetScene, #이혼보험, #촬영지, #청구로, #서울', '거리/골목/광장', 'at the request of', 'divorce insurance', '4 minutes walk from Exit 3 of Dongdaemun History and Culture Park Station 229-41 Sindang-dong, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip, #StreetScene, #divorceinsurance, #filming locations, #claimro, #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cMAueH/btsNLpYHd81/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALQanUkkE6mvQ07SApOCI14kWcmOv0LgSDncXvdT7-Rz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vOAJu3lsQk9JJVpQtPz6P%2F8Jwyw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/quzLI/btsNKyaI6W7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANPyD7darqZHveVxfuVKpoYHhYpI2nsHezLWoUaU_myx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TDw70gG0PCNiMK8HS5rEgeLR3C0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cMAueH/btsNLpYHd81/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALQanUkkE6mvQ07SApOCI14kWcmOv0LgSDncXvdT7-Rz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vOAJu3lsQk9JJVpQtPz6P%2F8Jwyw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/quzLI/btsNKyaI6W7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANPyD7darqZHveVxfuVKpoYHhYpI2nsHezLWoUaU_myx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TDw70gG0PCNiMK8HS5rEgeLR3C0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cMAueH/btsNLpYHd81/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALQanUkkE6mvQ07SApOCI14kWcmOv0LgSDncXvdT7-Rz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vOAJu3lsQk9JJVpQtPz6P%2F8Jwyw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/quzLI/btsNKyaI6W7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANPyD7darqZHveVxfuVKpoYHhYpI2nsHezLWoUaU_myx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TDw70gG0PCNiMK8HS5rEgeLR3C0%3D', NULL, 37.5635908, 127.0100928, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 이혼보험\n- **촬영지:** 청구로\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 거리로, 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 거리/골목\n\n### 여행 포인트\n청구로는 드라마 "이혼보험"의 촬영지로, 현대적인 분위기와 함께 여유로운 산책을 즐길 수 있는 장소입니다. 이곳은 드라마 속 주인공들이 걷고 대화하는 장면들이 담긴 곳으로, 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지니고 있습니다. 거리 곳곳에는 벤치와 나무들이 있어 휴식을 취하며 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있습니다. 다양한 카페와 상점들도 가까워, 촬영지 탐방 후 여유로운 시간을 보내기에도 안성맞춤입니다.', 'Cheongguro is the filming location of the drama Divorce Insurance and it is a place where you can enjoy a leisurely walk with a modern atmosphere It is a place where the main characters in the drama walk and talk and it has a special meaning for fans There are benches and trees all over the street so you can relax and feel the sensibility of the drama Various cafes and shops are also close making it perfect for relaxing time after visiting the filming location'),
	(3, '이혼보험', '볼링볼링', '서울 중구 청계천로 400 동묘앞역3번출구 도보6분', '볼링볼링은 이혼보험의 촬영지로 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 의미를 지닌 장소입니다 이곳에서는 볼링을 즐기며 드라마의 생생한 순간들을 떠올릴 수 있습니다 아늑한 분위기 속에서 친구들과 함께 즐거운 시간을 보내고 드라마 속 캐릭터들과의 연결을 느껴보세요 다양한 스낵과 음료도 준비되어 있어 볼링을 치며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다', '#볼링, #드라마촬영지, #친구와함께, #여유로운시간, #스낵과음료, #이혼보험', '기타/판별불가', 'Bowling, bowling', 'divorce insurance', '6 minutes walk from Exit 3 of 400 Dongmyo Station, Cheonggyecheon-ro, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Bowling, #dramaset, #withfriend, #relaxingtime, #snacks and drinks, #divorceinsurance', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/be7Y5s/btsM4RuIs5O/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIuBGJ2mNB8seTQ5BRmnJcPAoNTHe6do7RsP8htagYw-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=82eBWnGteXEjUNahlW8%2B64kswC8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/yK9NC/btsM4dZqrxG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANpNpiCp3GQvgEucYLngVrKBtjLhYaR-A2wB9ctODmQ-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8Y7TkCe6Dl5ktmA%2Bp2hEfBmHnGs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dex5rY/btsM3Z1mSiK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKceoVlFIrJKb01eLfpqR1JA0S1EOo-3yfU4ahxsaPaE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oHbtugGR02DXOCDEpw5c5RN36OU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cku49T/btsM18Yt5Zx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANOX629IIAhLHAwnMTGOkoW5Fxj2j-txWoqRij6q4m93/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OtnaPdtrqDhAbP18nYPav32YkqI%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/be7Y5s/btsM4RuIs5O/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIuBGJ2mNB8seTQ5BRmnJcPAoNTHe6do7RsP8htagYw-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=82eBWnGteXEjUNahlW8%2B64kswC8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/yK9NC/btsM4dZqrxG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANpNpiCp3GQvgEucYLngVrKBtjLhYaR-A2wB9ctODmQ-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8Y7TkCe6Dl5ktmA%2Bp2hEfBmHnGs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dex5rY/btsM3Z1mSiK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKceoVlFIrJKb01eLfpqR1JA0S1EOo-3yfU4ahxsaPaE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oHbtugGR02DXOCDEpw5c5RN36OU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cku49T/btsM18Yt5Zx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANOX629IIAhLHAwnMTGOkoW5Fxj2j-txWoqRij6q4m93/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OtnaPdtrqDhAbP18nYPav32YkqI%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/be7Y5s/btsM4RuIs5O/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIuBGJ2mNB8seTQ5BRmnJcPAoNTHe6do7RsP8htagYw-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=82eBWnGteXEjUNahlW8%2B64kswC8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/yK9NC/btsM4dZqrxG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANpNpiCp3GQvgEucYLngVrKBtjLhYaR-A2wB9ctODmQ-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8Y7TkCe6Dl5ktmA%2Bp2hEfBmHnGs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dex5rY/btsM3Z1mSiK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKceoVlFIrJKb01eLfpqR1JA0S1EOo-3yfU4ahxsaPaE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oHbtugGR02DXOCDEpw5c5RN36OU%3D', 37.5709778, 127.021434, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 이혼보험\n- **촬영지**: 볼링볼링\n- **방문팁**: 드라마 속 주요 장면을 즐기며, 볼링을 체험해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n볼링볼링은 이혼보험의 촬영지로, 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 의미를 지닌 장소입니다. 이곳에서는 볼링을 즐기며 드라마의 생생한 순간들을 떠올릴 수 있습니다. 아늑한 분위기 속에서 친구들과 함께 즐거운 시간을 보내고, 드라마 속 캐릭터들과의 연결을 느껴보세요. 다양한 스낵과 음료도 준비되어 있어, 볼링을 치며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다.', 'Bowling Bowling is the filming location of divorce insurance which has a special meaning for drama fans Here you can enjoy bowling and recall the vivid moments of the drama Have fun with your friends in a cozy atmosphere and feel the connection with the characters in the drama There are also a variety of snacks and drinks available so you can spend a leisurely time bowling'),
	(4, '이혼보험', '서울역사박물관', '서울 종로구 새문안로 55 광화문역1번출구 도보10분', '서울역사박물관은 서울의 과거와 현재를 아우르는 전시로 가득 차 있습니다 이곳에서는 서울의 역사적 사건과 문화유산을 통해 도시의 변천사를 이해할 수 있으며 가족 단위 방문객에게도 적합한 다양한 체험 프로그램이 마련되어 있습니다 또한 드라마 이혼보험의 촬영지로도 알려져 있어 팬들에게 특별한 의미를 지니고 있습니다 박물관 주변은 아름다운 경관과 함께 산책하기 좋은 공간이 많아 방문 후 여유롭게 주변을 탐방하는 것도 추천합니다', '#서울역사박물관, #이혼보험, #역사, #문화체험, #가족, #촬영지', '박물관/미술관/전시', 'Seoul Museum of History', 'divorce insurance', '10-minute walk from Exit 1 of Gwanghwamun Station, 55 Saemunan-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a museum/art gallery/exhibition', '#Seoul Museum of History, #divorceinsurance, #history, #culturalexperience, #family, #photography location', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/U7xyk/btsNcVi32k6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANgZITpW4_L_XEhomOQCRth5XUUGiTC1HsdsU26BhOah/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=f6we6GfqxxZp%2F%2FInt4fAy02NMzM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/q7TAv/btsNciyVq9X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOeijieod2WE1HPE81MORSZODtuSDbHeSR-rhdyxeRTM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sb4SIe7fa2zznvP3ZU4dlJ6gIDI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dJmAr8/btsNciZYklW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGabcndfkDeNjTzjXRFaO1iTzY-Lj6msIP_LAptVpUKa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Y2HY02vFXB4d68qJcyWhQ30aHDk%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/U7xyk/btsNcVi32k6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANgZITpW4_L_XEhomOQCRth5XUUGiTC1HsdsU26BhOah/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=f6we6GfqxxZp%2F%2FInt4fAy02NMzM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/q7TAv/btsNciyVq9X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOeijieod2WE1HPE81MORSZODtuSDbHeSR-rhdyxeRTM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sb4SIe7fa2zznvP3ZU4dlJ6gIDI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dJmAr8/btsNciZYklW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGabcndfkDeNjTzjXRFaO1iTzY-Lj6msIP_LAptVpUKa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Y2HY02vFXB4d68qJcyWhQ30aHDk%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/U7xyk/btsNcVi32k6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANgZITpW4_L_XEhomOQCRth5XUUGiTC1HsdsU26BhOah/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=f6we6GfqxxZp%2F%2FInt4fAy02NMzM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/q7TAv/btsNciyVq9X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOeijieod2WE1HPE81MORSZODtuSDbHeSR-rhdyxeRTM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sb4SIe7fa2zznvP3ZU4dlJ6gIDI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dJmAr8/btsNciZYklW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGabcndfkDeNjTzjXRFaO1iTzY-Lj6msIP_LAptVpUKa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Y2HY02vFXB4d68qJcyWhQ30aHDk%3D', 37.5707551, 126.9688336, '### 박물관 정보\n- **이름**: 서울역사박물관\n- **주소**: 서울 종로구 새문안로 55\n- **드라마**: 이혼보험\n- **방문팁**: 다양한 서울의 역사와 문화를 한눈에 볼 수 있는 곳입니다.\n\n### 여행 포인트\n서울역사박물관은 서울의 과거와 현재를 아우르는 전시로 가득 차 있습니다. 이곳에서는 서울의 역사적 사건과 문화유산을 통해 도시의 변천사를 이해할 수 있으며, 가족 단위 방문객에게도 적합한 다양한 체험 프로그램이 마련되어 있습니다. 또한, 드라마 "이혼보험"의 촬영지로도 알려져 있어 팬들에게 특별한 의미를 지니고 있습니다. 박물관 주변은 아름다운 경관과 함께 산책하기 좋은 공간이 많아, 방문 후 여유롭게 주변을 탐방하는 것도 추천합니다.', 'The Seoul Museum of History is full of exhibitions that encompass the past and present of Seoul Here you can understand the history of the city through historical events and cultural heritage in Seoul and there are various experience programs suitable for family visitors It is also known as the filming location for the drama Divorce Insurance which has a special meaning for fans There are many good places to take a walk with beautiful scenery around the museum so it is also recommended to take a leisurely tour around the museum after visiting'),
	(5, '이혼보험', '인왕산', '서울 종로구 옥인동 산 3-39', '인왕산은 서울의 아름다운 전경을 한눈에 담을 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다 특히 저녁 시간에 방문하면 화려하게 빛나는 도시의 야경을 즐길 수 있어 사진 촬영이나 데이트에 안성맞춤입니다 자연과 도시가 어우러진 이곳에서 잊지 못할 순간을 경험해보세요', '#KdramaTrip, #CityView, #야경, #데이트, #인왕산', '전망대', 'Inwangsan Mountain', 'divorce insurance', 'San 3-39, Okin-dong, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Observatory', '#KdramaTrip, #CityView, #Nightscape, #Date, #Inwangsan', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/y89u3/btsM2ISTaRT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHVLXsMa6xIJS4bIRp5J8VVxDu61ma-wD1W8matr2dTC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wExYLQa3I590bsUK%2B8nf8vXfP24%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cCM2B9/btsM3prvzs5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGsc1NbRYeJ2vHS4f5me9RBmJsZooKbQ_hSVmd4UHsJX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zs3BSs1OLrX9V1mHnrtUStqf1D4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/y89u3/btsM2ISTaRT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHVLXsMa6xIJS4bIRp5J8VVxDu61ma-wD1W8matr2dTC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wExYLQa3I590bsUK%2B8nf8vXfP24%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cCM2B9/btsM3prvzs5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGsc1NbRYeJ2vHS4f5me9RBmJsZooKbQ_hSVmd4UHsJX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zs3BSs1OLrX9V1mHnrtUStqf1D4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/y89u3/btsM2ISTaRT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHVLXsMa6xIJS4bIRp5J8VVxDu61ma-wD1W8matr2dTC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wExYLQa3I590bsUK%2B8nf8vXfP24%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cCM2B9/btsM3prvzs5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGsc1NbRYeJ2vHS4f5me9RBmJsZooKbQ_hSVmd4UHsJX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zs3BSs1OLrX9V1mHnrtUStqf1D4%3D', NULL, 37.5848006, 126.9581074, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 이혼보험\n- **촬영지:** 인왕산\n- **방문팁:** 인왕산에서 서울의 야경을 감상하며 특별한 순간을 만들어보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #CityView\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 전망대\n\n### 여행 포인트\n인왕산은 서울의 아름다운 전경을 한눈에 담을 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다. 특히 저녁 시간에 방문하면 화려하게 빛나는 도시의 야경을 즐길 수 있어, 사진 촬영이나 데이트에 안성맞춤입니다. 자연과 도시가 어우러진 이곳에서 잊지 못할 순간을 경험해보세요.', 'Inwangsan Mountain is the best place to have beautiful panoramic views of Seoul at a glance Especially if you visit during the evening you can enjoy the night view of the city which shines brilliantly making it perfect for photography or dating Experience an unforgettable moment in this place where nature and the city are in harmony'),
	(6, '이혼보험', 'HW컨벤션', '서울 종로구 자하문로 255 경복궁역3번출구 버스14분', 'HW컨벤션은 이혼보험의 촬영지로 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 이곳은 현대적인 디자인과 우아한 꽃 장식이 어우러져 있어 사진 촬영에 안성맞춤입니다 다양한 이벤트가 열리는 이 공간은 드라마 속 장면을 직접 느끼며 친구들과 함께 추억을 만들기에 좋은 장소입니다 방문 시 드라마의 매력을 느끼며 특별한 순간을 즐겨보세요', '#HW컨벤션, #이혼보험, #드라마촬영지, #서울여행, #사진명소', '기타/판별불가', 'HW Convention', 'divorce insurance', '14 minute bus from Exit 3 of Gyeongbokgung Station, 255, Jahamun-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#HW Convention, #divorceinsurance, #drama filming location, #Seoultravel, #photoattractions', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UXShk/btsNa8KZjly/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD8k1l0Kv3Wz1ehaK6zSiPexjv-jBn6YBkcH_7uzAV5Q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qx9zMK0tLBtGbQHnU3Q6x26Gp%2BU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0zvmK/btsNbgPzjTE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABaAtmP9VWBjCdqrQDOSIHxAvURHfmuGfym_QX2z8eYM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Cm3gV%2BeBsLgcqu8FbJ%2B05B%2FB9z4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/czGQtN/btsNbRhrZod/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMBP8Z-ghearLr466xUMkBaXL7GKf8ogv9E2Q6-yDx9R/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z%2Bt7O2ZsIkNDFDpqbhPhURQRxLU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bLqGij/btsNcLOk8eh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAER8tS0DmsZ-XHmgR5z5tSVcHxZgHnZ70r7x05c8q60L/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=E8gCinhqYmlhrsJEltbsVJstfNQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/SrmDL/btsNbKW814s/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHv8nLtdVaLXi6cftOsDvZ6PMonIG6YR2Wacz6z70Imc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qE%2BEyxtMjQ%2BG1XoC5c81TlVS8HQ%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UXShk/btsNa8KZjly/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD8k1l0Kv3Wz1ehaK6zSiPexjv-jBn6YBkcH_7uzAV5Q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qx9zMK0tLBtGbQHnU3Q6x26Gp%2BU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0zvmK/btsNbgPzjTE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABaAtmP9VWBjCdqrQDOSIHxAvURHfmuGfym_QX2z8eYM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Cm3gV%2BeBsLgcqu8FbJ%2B05B%2FB9z4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/czGQtN/btsNbRhrZod/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMBP8Z-ghearLr466xUMkBaXL7GKf8ogv9E2Q6-yDx9R/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z%2Bt7O2ZsIkNDFDpqbhPhURQRxLU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bLqGij/btsNcLOk8eh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAER8tS0DmsZ-XHmgR5z5tSVcHxZgHnZ70r7x05c8q60L/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=E8gCinhqYmlhrsJEltbsVJstfNQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/SrmDL/btsNbKW814s/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHv8nLtdVaLXi6cftOsDvZ6PMonIG6YR2Wacz6z70Imc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qE%2BEyxtMjQ%2BG1XoC5c81TlVS8HQ%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UXShk/btsNa8KZjly/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD8k1l0Kv3Wz1ehaK6zSiPexjv-jBn6YBkcH_7uzAV5Q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qx9zMK0tLBtGbQHnU3Q6x26Gp%2BU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0zvmK/btsNbgPzjTE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABaAtmP9VWBjCdqrQDOSIHxAvURHfmuGfym_QX2z8eYM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Cm3gV%2BeBsLgcqu8FbJ%2B05B%2FB9z4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/czGQtN/btsNbRhrZod/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMBP8Z-ghearLr466xUMkBaXL7GKf8ogv9E2Q6-yDx9R/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z%2Bt7O2ZsIkNDFDpqbhPhURQRxLU%3D', 37.5972169, 126.9620911, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 이혼보험\n- **촬영지**: HW컨벤션\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 중요한 장면들이 촬영된 장소로, 세련된 인테리어와 아름다운 꽃 장식이 인상적입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\nHW컨벤션은 이혼보험의 촬영지로, 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 이곳은 현대적인 디자인과 우아한 꽃 장식이 어우러져 있어, 사진 촬영에 안성맞춤입니다. 다양한 이벤트가 열리는 이 공간은 드라마 속 장면을 직접 느끼며, 친구들과 함께 추억을 만들기에 좋은 장소입니다. 방문 시 드라마의 매력을 느끼며 특별한 순간을 즐겨보세요.', 'HW Convention is the filming location for divorce insurance providing a special experience for drama fans This place is perfect for photography with a combination of modern design and elegant flower decorations This space where various events are held is a great place to feel the scenes in the drama firsthand and make memories with friends Enjoy special moments while feeling the charm of the drama when you visit'),
	(7, '이혼보험', '강남대로(2)', '서울 강남구 강남대로 626', '강남대로는 서울의 중심지 중 하나로 현대적인 건물과 다양한 상점들이 늘어서 있어 활기찬 분위기를 자아냅니다 드라마 이혼보험의 촬영지로 유명하며 이곳을 방문하면 드라마의 한 장면 속 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 느낄 수 있습니다 주변에는 맛집과 카페도 많아 촬영지를 둘러본 후 여유롭게 휴식을 취하기에도 좋은 장소입니다', '#이혼보험 #서울 #강남대로 #드라마촬영지 #카페투어 #쇼핑', '거리/골목/광장', 'Gangnam-daero (2)', 'divorce insurance', '626 Gangnam-daero, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Divorce insurance #Seoul #Gangnamdaero #DramaFilmingPlace #CafeTour #Shopping', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ea2RoR/btsNL8oKB0D/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMxR6NHYqAgXzwSMDtCsADDTqn6-z8jqEKTeOFl9Qh4F/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TU7RhXuOWKSWv4uhgSxyc1PjUnU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ea2RoR/btsNL8oKB0D/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMxR6NHYqAgXzwSMDtCsADDTqn6-z8jqEKTeOFl9Qh4F/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TU7RhXuOWKSWv4uhgSxyc1PjUnU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ea2RoR/btsNL8oKB0D/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMxR6NHYqAgXzwSMDtCsADDTqn6-z8jqEKTeOFl9Qh4F/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TU7RhXuOWKSWv4uhgSxyc1PjUnU%3D', NULL, NULL, 37.5177011, 127.0195716, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 이혼보험\n- **촬영지:** 강남대로(2)\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면이 촬영된 장소로, 다양한 카페와 쇼핑 공간이 있어 즐길 거리가 많습니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #강남구 #서울\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 거리\n\n### 여행 포인트\n강남대로는 서울의 중심지 중 하나로, 현대적인 건물과 다양한 상점들이 늘어서 있어 활기찬 분위기를 자아냅니다. 드라마 "이혼보험"의 촬영지로 유명하며, 이곳을 방문하면 드라마의 한 장면 속 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 느낄 수 있습니다. 주변에는 맛집과 카페도 많아, 촬영지를 둘러본 후 여유롭게 휴식을 취하기에도 좋은 장소입니다.', 'Gangnamdaero is one of the centers of Seoul and it creates a lively atmosphere with modern buildings and various stores It is famous as a filming location for the drama Divorce Insurance and if you visit here you can feel like you have become the main character in a scene of the drama There are many restaurants and cafes nearby so it is a good place to relax after looking around the filming location'),
	(8, '이혼보험', '강남역사거리', '서울 강남구 역삼동', '강남역사거리는 서울의 중심지 중 하나로 현대적인 건물과 활기찬 거리 풍경이 어우러져 있습니다 이곳은 다양한 문화와 상업이 혼합된 지역으로 드라마 팬들에게는 촬영지 탐방뿐만 아니라 쇼핑과 맛집 탐방을 동시에 즐길 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다 특히 교통이 편리하여 방문하기 쉽고 주변에는 인기 있는 카페와 레스토랑도 많아 하루 종일 즐길 거리가 가득합니다', '#이혼보험 #강남역사거리 #K드라마촬영지 #카페 #식당 #도시탐방', '거리/골목/광장', 'Gangnam Station Intersection', 'divorce insurance', 'Yeoksam-dong, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Divorce insurance #Gangnam Station Street #K-drama shooting location #café #restaurant #urban exploration', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCYKQm/btsNLuTlLMU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHxc4yEgMCa9UfmZKneQ9jMzwAqxOKtHAMg_0YTYGHT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZYOwnFJkGb03e98L1om5A2iWfU0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCYKQm/btsNLuTlLMU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHxc4yEgMCa9UfmZKneQ9jMzwAqxOKtHAMg_0YTYGHT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZYOwnFJkGb03e98L1om5A2iWfU0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCYKQm/btsNLuTlLMU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHxc4yEgMCa9UfmZKneQ9jMzwAqxOKtHAMg_0YTYGHT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZYOwnFJkGb03e98L1om5A2iWfU0%3D', NULL, NULL, 37.5000776, 127.0385419, '### 이혼보험 촬영지 정보\n\n**제목:** 이혼보험  \n**촬영지:** 강남역사거리  \n**방문팁:** 강남역사거리는 다양한 카페와 식당이 있어 드라마 촬영지 탐방 후 여유롭게 휴식을 취하기 좋은 장소입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리/골목  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n강남역사거리는 서울의 중심지 중 하나로, 현대적인 건물과 활기찬 거리 풍경이 어우러져 있습니다. 이곳은 다양한 문화와 상업이 혼합된 지역으로, 드라마 팬들에게는 촬영지 탐방뿐만 아니라 쇼핑과 맛집 탐방을 동시에 즐길 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다. 특히, 교통이 편리하여 방문하기 쉽고, 주변에는 인기 있는 카페와 레스토랑도 많아 하루 종일 즐길 거리가 가득합니다.', 'Gangnam Station Intersection is one of the centers of Seoul with modern buildings and vibrant street scenes This is a mixed area of various cultures and commerce and it is the best place for drama fans to enjoy shopping and restaurant tours at the same time as well as a tour of the filming location In particular the convenience of transportation makes it easy to visit and there are many popular cafes and restaurants around so there are many things to enjoy all day long'),
	(9, '이혼보험', '강남대로', '서울 강남구 강남대로 438', '강남대로는 현대적인 건물과 다양한 상점 카페가 어우러진 서울의 중심지입니다 이곳에서는 드라마의 주요 장면을 떠올리며 활기찬 도시의 분위기를 만끽할 수 있습니다 특히 길을 따라 늘어선 다양한 음식점과 쇼핑 명소는 방문객들에게 즐거운 경험을 제공합니다 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 촬영된 장면을 직접 느껴보는 것도 좋은 추억이 될 것입니다', '#강남 #거리풍경 #K드라마 #촬영지 #이혼보험 #도시여행', '거리/골목/광장', 'Gangnam-daero', 'divorce insurance', '438 Gangnam-daero, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Gangnam #Streetscape #Kdrama #FilmingPlace #Divorce Insurance #CityTravel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/w3qYB/btsNmfv9Zfp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPN6szzPcufwq43UYUDBxp0WNrJEZ-45NY6Ctb-wdCeL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2Fvs0JKEvKgu5GUDCErQhtT3TROU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/w3qYB/btsNmfv9Zfp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPN6szzPcufwq43UYUDBxp0WNrJEZ-45NY6Ctb-wdCeL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2Fvs0JKEvKgu5GUDCErQhtT3TROU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/w3qYB/btsNmfv9Zfp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPN6szzPcufwq43UYUDBxp0WNrJEZ-45NY6Ctb-wdCeL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2Fvs0JKEvKgu5GUDCErQhtT3TROU%3D', NULL, NULL, 37.501652, 127.0263751, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 이혼보험\n- **촬영지**: 강남대로\n- **방문팁**: 강남대로의 활기찬 거리 풍경을 즐기며 드라마 속 장면을 떠올려 보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #StreetScene\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 거리/골목\n\n### 여행 포인트\n강남대로는 현대적인 건물과 다양한 상점, 카페가 어우러진 서울의 중심지입니다. 이곳에서는 드라마의 주요 장면을 떠올리며, 활기찬 도시의 분위기를 만끽할 수 있습니다. 특히, 길을 따라 늘어선 다양한 음식점과 쇼핑 명소는 방문객들에게 즐거운 경험을 제공합니다. 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 촬영된 장면을 직접 느껴보는 것도 좋은 추억이 될 것입니다.', 'Gangnamdaero is the center of Seoul with modern buildings various stores and cafes Here you can recall the main scenes of the drama and enjoy the vibrant city atmosphere In particular various restaurants and shopping attractions along the street provide visitors with a pleasant experience If you are a drama fan it will be a good memory to feel the scenes filmed here'),
	(10, '이혼보험', '테헤란로', '서울 강남구 테헤란로 534', '테헤란로는 서울 강남구의 중심부로 고층 빌딩과 다양한 상업시설이 어우러져 있습니다 이곳은 현대적인 도시 풍경을 만끽할 수 있는 최적의 장소로 드라마 이혼보험의 촬영지로도 유명합니다 길을 따라 다양한 카페와 레스토랑이 있어 드라마의 분위기를 느끼며 휴식을 취하기에 좋습니다 특히 이곳에서의 산책은 서울의 활기찬 도시 생활을 직접 체험할 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다', '#KdramaTrip #StreetScene #현대적풍경 #여유로운산책 #강남구', '거리/골목/광장', 'Teheran Road', 'divorce insurance', '534 Teheran-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #StreetScene #ModernScene #RelaxedWalk #Gangnam-gu', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c2Styb/btsNr15c61i/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPRVOH3s1iGz2eWw26lXS8Ha93SKOG9H53oSvR7RZS_C/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=z1fevnIB%2Fbe5YdvBK74QoV%2FkTAI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cs1YtT/btsNKtniIYT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJWeRU0K2iKbX0_Ce7bJXCca-rQOxqRHD2yaBfJlTIVu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XuHxDWKZt%2BYvpiUlGFOO%2FIxcWkw%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c2Styb/btsNr15c61i/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPRVOH3s1iGz2eWw26lXS8Ha93SKOG9H53oSvR7RZS_C/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=z1fevnIB%2Fbe5YdvBK74QoV%2FkTAI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cs1YtT/btsNKtniIYT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJWeRU0K2iKbX0_Ce7bJXCca-rQOxqRHD2yaBfJlTIVu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XuHxDWKZt%2BYvpiUlGFOO%2FIxcWkw%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c2Styb/btsNr15c61i/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPRVOH3s1iGz2eWw26lXS8Ha93SKOG9H53oSvR7RZS_C/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=z1fevnIB%2Fbe5YdvBK74QoV%2FkTAI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cs1YtT/btsNKtniIYT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJWeRU0K2iKbX0_Ce7bJXCca-rQOxqRHD2yaBfJlTIVu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XuHxDWKZt%2BYvpiUlGFOO%2FIxcWkw%3D', NULL, 37.5082499, 127.0623918, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 이혼보험\n- **촬영지:** 테헤란로\n- **방문팁:** 테헤란로의 현대적인 풍경을 감상하며 여유로운 산책을 즐겨보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 거리/골목\n\n### 여행 포인트\n테헤란로는 서울 강남구의 중심부로, 고층 빌딩과 다양한 상업시설이 어우러져 있습니다. 이곳은 현대적인 도시 풍경을 만끽할 수 있는 최적의 장소로, 드라마 \'이혼보험\'의 촬영지로도 유명합니다. 길을 따라 다양한 카페와 레스토랑이 있어, 드라마의 분위기를 느끼며 휴식을 취하기에 좋습니다. 특히, 이곳에서의 산책은 서울의 활기찬 도시 생활을 직접 체험할 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다.', 'Teheranro is the center of Gangnamgu Seoul where highrise buildings and various commercial facilities are harmonized It is the best place to enjoy the modern cityscape and is also famous as a filming location for the drama Divorce Insurance There are various cafes and restaurants along the street so its great to relax while feeling the atmosphere of the drama In particular a walk here provides a chance to experience the vibrant city life of Seoul firsthand'),
	(11, '하이퍼나이프', '여의도한강공원', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 86-7 여의나루역3번출구 도보17분', '여의도한강공원은 서울의 대표적인 공원으로 한강을 따라 펼쳐진 넓은 잔디밭과 다양한 나무들이 어우러져 자연 속에서 편안한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 이곳에서는 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 평화로운 분위기 속에서 산책하거나 피크닉을 즐길 수 있어 많은 방문객들이 찾는 명소입니다 특히 한강의 경치를 배경으로 한 멋진 사진 촬영이 가능하여 인스타그램에 올리기에도 좋은 장소입니다', '#하이퍼나이프, #여의도한강공원, #한강, #산책, #피크닉, #사진촬영', '호수/강/해변', 'Yeouido Hangang Park', 'Hyperknife', '86-7 Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul, 17 minutes on foot from Exit 3 of Yeouido Station', 'a lake/river/beach', '#Hyperknife, #YeouidoHan River Park, #Han River, #walk, #picnic, #photoshoot', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/QQBYP/btsNfR1L9nY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMi30oWeoUuTr1CTrhTTI41ennP9My3RKE00AokjS5Dn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xwc6sE7B248erzgxlj6putdZDvg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vcT2e/btsNe6lcJCi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEFkeY6K4WTAcyAj7T8P9LR53Cc2d5lZ570BTG6SWHJt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EpZTxI%2BQatiY4JLvuLLv9PrAsfs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfUU7i/btsNfiS6FH4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJTHNvdGoKLbHqBuAktXMIzeN7pz5LW3_on-xNRfN_pV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PjxevC8uCVwffWZkZu%2Bt6gSrDrI%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/QQBYP/btsNfR1L9nY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMi30oWeoUuTr1CTrhTTI41ennP9My3RKE00AokjS5Dn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xwc6sE7B248erzgxlj6putdZDvg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vcT2e/btsNe6lcJCi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEFkeY6K4WTAcyAj7T8P9LR53Cc2d5lZ570BTG6SWHJt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EpZTxI%2BQatiY4JLvuLLv9PrAsfs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfUU7i/btsNfiS6FH4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJTHNvdGoKLbHqBuAktXMIzeN7pz5LW3_on-xNRfN_pV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PjxevC8uCVwffWZkZu%2Bt6gSrDrI%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/QQBYP/btsNfR1L9nY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMi30oWeoUuTr1CTrhTTI41ennP9My3RKE00AokjS5Dn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xwc6sE7B248erzgxlj6putdZDvg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vcT2e/btsNe6lcJCi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEFkeY6K4WTAcyAj7T8P9LR53Cc2d5lZ570BTG6SWHJt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EpZTxI%2BQatiY4JLvuLLv9PrAsfs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfUU7i/btsNfiS6FH4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJTHNvdGoKLbHqBuAktXMIzeN7pz5LW3_on-xNRfN_pV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PjxevC8uCVwffWZkZu%2Bt6gSrDrI%3D', 37.521192, 126.9418985, '### 여의도한강공원에서의 하이퍼나이프 촬영지 방문\n\n**방문 팁:** 여의도한강공원은 드라마 "하이퍼나이프"의 아름다운 배경으로, 한강의 멋진 경치를 감상하며 산책하기에 최적의 장소입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 여의도한강공원은 서울의 대표적인 공원으로, 한강을 따라 펼쳐진 넓은 잔디밭과 다양한 나무들이 어우러져 자연 속에서 편안한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 이곳에서는 드라마의 감성을 느끼며, 평화로운 분위기 속에서 산책하거나 피크닉을 즐길 수 있어 많은 방문객들이 찾는 명소입니다. 특히, 한강의 경치를 배경으로 한 멋진 사진 촬영이 가능하여, 인스타그램에 올리기에도 좋은 장소입니다.', 'Yeouido Hangang Park is a representative park in Seoul where you can spend a comfortable time in nature with a wide lawn along the Han River and various trees Here you can feel the sensibility of the drama and enjoy a walk or picnic in a peaceful atmosphere which is a popular attraction for many visitors In particular it is possible to take wonderful photos with the scenery of the Han River in the background so it is a good place to post on Instagram'),
	(12, '보물섬', '블러드러스트', '서울 마포구 동교로 183-11 홍대입구역1번출구 도보3분', '블러드러스트는 독특한 분위기와 세련된 인테리어로 유명한 타투샵으로 드라마 보물섬의 촬영지로 많은 팬들이 찾는 명소입니다 이곳에서는 다양한 예술 작품을 감상하며 타투 아티스트의 섬세한 작업을 가까이에서 볼 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 순간을 사진으로 남기기 좋은 장소이기도 합니다 타투에 대한 관심이 없더라도 이곳의 독특한 분위기와 예술적 감성을 만끽할 수 있어 방문할 가치가 충분합니다', '#타투샵, #드라마촬영지, #예술, #감성, #서울여행', '기타', 'Bloodrust', 'Treasure Island', '3 minutes walk from Exit 1 of Hongik University Station, 183-11 Donggyo-ro, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Tattoo Shop, #DramaFilmingPlace, #Art, #Sentimental, #SeoulTravel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cg6Z9U/btsMLwFdbco/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH00jIfVDLeoqOBvTgm4Gn6VRYm816QyF-1DQHkBJOwN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tiGCYOtQ%2BDXoOHqq1hCVnP4n9OU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GhCOf/btsMMJQQQhN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHg5D1gp6QmCYdrmEw1oNWcfX-purk9Joug_rmSpmWpS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ez54sAuKClnd9xQld2t8RKEsWfg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cg6Z9U/btsMLwFdbco/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH00jIfVDLeoqOBvTgm4Gn6VRYm816QyF-1DQHkBJOwN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tiGCYOtQ%2BDXoOHqq1hCVnP4n9OU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GhCOf/btsMMJQQQhN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHg5D1gp6QmCYdrmEw1oNWcfX-purk9Joug_rmSpmWpS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ez54sAuKClnd9xQld2t8RKEsWfg%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cg6Z9U/btsMLwFdbco/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH00jIfVDLeoqOBvTgm4Gn6VRYm816QyF-1DQHkBJOwN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tiGCYOtQ%2BDXoOHqq1hCVnP4n9OU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GhCOf/btsMMJQQQhN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHg5D1gp6QmCYdrmEw1oNWcfX-purk9Joug_rmSpmWpS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ez54sAuKClnd9xQld2t8RKEsWfg%3D', NULL, 37.55731189999999, 126.9212703, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 보물섬\n- **촬영지**: 블러드러스트\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마 속 감성을 느낄 수 있는 아늑한 공간입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n블러드러스트는 독특한 분위기와 세련된 인테리어로 유명한 타투샵으로, 드라마 "보물섬"의 촬영지로 많은 팬들이 찾는 명소입니다. 이곳에서는 다양한 예술 작품을 감상하며, 타투 아티스트의 섬세한 작업을 가까이에서 볼 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다. 드라마의 한 장면처럼, 특별한 순간을 사진으로 남기기 좋은 장소이기도 합니다. 타투에 대한 관심이 없더라도, 이곳의 독특한 분위기와 예술적 감성을 만끽할 수 있어 방문할 가치가 충분합니다.', 'Bloodrust is a tattoo shop famous for its unique atmosphere and sophisticated interior and it is a popular spot for many fans as a filming location for the drama Treasure Island Here you can appreciate a variety of works of art and provide an upclose look at the delicate work of tattoo artists Like a scene in a drama it is also a good place to take pictures of special moments Even if you are not interested in tattoos you can enjoy the unique atmosphere and artistic sensibility of this place so it is well worth visiting'),
	(13, '보물섬', '서강대교', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 83-1', '서강대교는 서울의 아름다운 경관을 감상할 수 있는 명소로 특히 밤에 조명이 켜지면 더욱 매력적입니다 드라마 보물섬의 촬영지로 알려져 있어 팬들에게 특별한 의미를 지니고 있으며 주변에는 다양한 카페와 레스토랑이 있어 드라마의 여운을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 이곳에서 사진을 찍으며 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 만끽해보세요', '#야경, #드라마촬영지, #발걸음, #감성여행', '기타/판별불가', 'Sogang Bridge', 'Treasure Island', '83-1 Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Night view, #drama shooting location, #footstep, #emotional trip', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dC5Nga/btsMEN0Bpai/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK9K0bZmgh9rJzbaNmY-GdonIr_fIuiUXHyFI14p-rnk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=D4FMVvA79GK7OoHR4rdjRdi4WqU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b6XOOC/btsMD2jWNHs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHRSEQZKsyVz0jn00zh_ejl_hlr1FvbCc8GkFASUEfRi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=etLh%2Ba0Ha9JrqcBYhRFqfffTkNA%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dC5Nga/btsMEN0Bpai/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK9K0bZmgh9rJzbaNmY-GdonIr_fIuiUXHyFI14p-rnk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=D4FMVvA79GK7OoHR4rdjRdi4WqU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b6XOOC/btsMD2jWNHs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHRSEQZKsyVz0jn00zh_ejl_hlr1FvbCc8GkFASUEfRi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=etLh%2Ba0Ha9JrqcBYhRFqfffTkNA%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dC5Nga/btsMEN0Bpai/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK9K0bZmgh9rJzbaNmY-GdonIr_fIuiUXHyFI14p-rnk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=D4FMVvA79GK7OoHR4rdjRdi4WqU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b6XOOC/btsMD2jWNHs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHRSEQZKsyVz0jn00zh_ejl_hlr1FvbCc8GkFASUEfRi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=etLh%2Ba0Ha9JrqcBYhRFqfffTkNA%3D', NULL, 37.5358539, 126.9247942, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 보물섬\n- **촬영지**: 서강대교\n- **방문팁**: 서강대교에서 멋진 야경을 감상하며 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n서강대교는 서울의 아름다운 경관을 감상할 수 있는 명소로, 특히 밤에 조명이 켜지면 더욱 매력적입니다. 드라마 "보물섬"의 촬영지로 알려져 있어 팬들에게 특별한 의미를 지니고 있으며, 주변에는 다양한 카페와 레스토랑이 있어 드라마의 여운을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 이곳에서 사진을 찍으며 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 만끽해보세요.', 'Sogang Bridge is a great place to enjoy the beautiful scenery of Seoul especially when the lights are on at night Known as the filming location for the drama Treasure Island it has a special meaning for fans and there are various cafes and restaurants around it so you can spend your time feeling the lingering effects of the drama Take a picture here and enjoy the feeling of being the main character in the drama'),
	(14, '보물섬', '원효대교', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 87-2', '원효대교는 서울의 대표적인 야경 명소 중 하나로 드라마 보물섬의 촬영지로도 알려져 있습니다 이곳에서는 한강의 아름다운 경치와 함께 도시의 화려한 불빛을 감상할 수 있습니다 특히 밤에 방문하면 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 로맨틱한 분위기를 즐길 수 있어 사진 촬영에도 좋은 장소입니다 다양한 카페와 식당도 근처에 있어 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다', '#야경 #한강 #로맨스 #촬영지 #서울 #보물섬', '기타/판별불가', 'Wonhyo Bridge', 'Treasure Island', '87-2 Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Night view #Han River #Romance #FilmingPlace #Seoul #Treasure Island', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/k5rnw/btsNaBla02M/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL8AOcaAmKfH7ZZfB9idp_YkFl-Dufyvfm7wQlzK07U4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iTlr4DwvC4RQ31rBKvDWyMIDchY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1E8Le/btsM99vX0Wy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANBITiFxw27YoX6BtMPKmRzk4N_RmKpahtK33VCqs8K8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IIZOT1U6cP7CNy%2B5YJqFOZmnZf4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/RjMqo/btsNal3XRQ6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACpNLL6IL8H-1b61dAXMC93YWJf5kQUyfgUHTBFYUtuG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Wk%2BVZN1swSBJ3jeYEBK1mpqr8bU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/yjZ7j/btsNay23j3L/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANsAXjMD6PewBwCHPjHQSOIDg8kEa3inAQInLISoOgE6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kxixZLLDvhrWR5Bb1W9ez0OTNS0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/k5rnw/btsNaBla02M/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL8AOcaAmKfH7ZZfB9idp_YkFl-Dufyvfm7wQlzK07U4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iTlr4DwvC4RQ31rBKvDWyMIDchY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1E8Le/btsM99vX0Wy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANBITiFxw27YoX6BtMPKmRzk4N_RmKpahtK33VCqs8K8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IIZOT1U6cP7CNy%2B5YJqFOZmnZf4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/RjMqo/btsNal3XRQ6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACpNLL6IL8H-1b61dAXMC93YWJf5kQUyfgUHTBFYUtuG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Wk%2BVZN1swSBJ3jeYEBK1mpqr8bU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/yjZ7j/btsNay23j3L/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANsAXjMD6PewBwCHPjHQSOIDg8kEa3inAQInLISoOgE6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kxixZLLDvhrWR5Bb1W9ez0OTNS0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/k5rnw/btsNaBla02M/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL8AOcaAmKfH7ZZfB9idp_YkFl-Dufyvfm7wQlzK07U4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iTlr4DwvC4RQ31rBKvDWyMIDchY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1E8Le/btsM99vX0Wy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANBITiFxw27YoX6BtMPKmRzk4N_RmKpahtK33VCqs8K8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IIZOT1U6cP7CNy%2B5YJqFOZmnZf4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/RjMqo/btsNal3XRQ6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACpNLL6IL8H-1b61dAXMC93YWJf5kQUyfgUHTBFYUtuG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Wk%2BVZN1swSBJ3jeYEBK1mpqr8bU%3D', 37.52522510000001, 126.9470524, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 보물섬\n- **촬영지:** 원효대교\n- **방문팁:** 야경이 아름다운 원효대교에서 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n원효대교는 서울의 대표적인 야경 명소 중 하나로, 드라마 \'보물섬\'의 촬영지로도 알려져 있습니다. 이곳에서는 한강의 아름다운 경치와 함께 도시의 화려한 불빛을 감상할 수 있습니다. 특히 밤에 방문하면 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 로맨틱한 분위기를 즐길 수 있어, 사진 촬영에도 좋은 장소입니다. 다양한 카페와 식당도 근처에 있어 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다.', 'Wonhyo Bridge is one of Seouls leading night view attractions and is also known as the filming location for the drama Treasure Island Here you can enjoy the beautiful scenery of the Han River and the colorful lights of the city Especially when you visit at night you can enjoy a romantic atmosphere while thinking of scenes in the drama so it is a good place for photography Various cafes and restaurants are also nearby so you can have a leisurely time'),
	(15, '보물섬', '더스테이트룸', '서울 중구 퇴계로 100 명동역4번출구 도보2분', '더스테이트룸은 드라마 보물섬의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적입니다 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 직접 느끼며 특별한 순간을 사진으로 남길 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다 친구나 가족과 함께 방문하여 드라마의 한 장면처럼 멋진 추억을 만들어 보세요', '#보물섬 #촬영지 #아늑한분위기 #사진촬영 #친구와가족 #추억', '카페/레스토랑', 'The State Room', 'Treasure Island', '2-minute walk from Exit 4 of Myeong-dong Station, 100 Toegye-ro, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Treasure Island #ShootingPlace #A cozy atmosphere #PhotoShooting #Friends and Family #Memories', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cFYAIF/btsNjPcb41N/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPbFaw1pW6turrNlVkS7lj7GvxGy6ofz2FQq1KUPlx5w/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WMPQGa9EufDagMYNr81cT%2F2uLfM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/r9NCi/btsNiZshHpW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPuIhpGhYOYv3qh-SxR8xQ4Ox0PnhVj22q45QKpAQkpE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DCvQ%2B4J8hTONTg8GYnpfiMY%2FHew%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/P9N6R/btsNa2JmgPv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHG9hFAmL-zXo8U9btua2RTUaGYPcGaGMZkELELDb251/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UUzGJ0hHJMqebqH0ro5ox6PHiDg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZGl6F/btsM9XJjzTj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMrSKIUgMedUAt_y2lpfzQY8_S-V1wbCVa-MsQdz1h0f/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tCmiput4L7O6sejh1id9S6rxWjU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bOUiKi/btsNbeWRJ0m/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACKlhjwKUb27WAZcA8QU0f_M1JG96FL47UXvM7acFDkB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Is9jy3C9HZhTCdOweeLyfjm6vqU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cFYAIF/btsNjPcb41N/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPbFaw1pW6turrNlVkS7lj7GvxGy6ofz2FQq1KUPlx5w/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WMPQGa9EufDagMYNr81cT%2F2uLfM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/r9NCi/btsNiZshHpW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPuIhpGhYOYv3qh-SxR8xQ4Ox0PnhVj22q45QKpAQkpE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DCvQ%2B4J8hTONTg8GYnpfiMY%2FHew%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/P9N6R/btsNa2JmgPv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHG9hFAmL-zXo8U9btua2RTUaGYPcGaGMZkELELDb251/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UUzGJ0hHJMqebqH0ro5ox6PHiDg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZGl6F/btsM9XJjzTj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMrSKIUgMedUAt_y2lpfzQY8_S-V1wbCVa-MsQdz1h0f/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tCmiput4L7O6sejh1id9S6rxWjU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bOUiKi/btsNbeWRJ0m/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACKlhjwKUb27WAZcA8QU0f_M1JG96FL47UXvM7acFDkB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Is9jy3C9HZhTCdOweeLyfjm6vqU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cFYAIF/btsNjPcb41N/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPbFaw1pW6turrNlVkS7lj7GvxGy6ofz2FQq1KUPlx5w/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WMPQGa9EufDagMYNr81cT%2F2uLfM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/r9NCi/btsNiZshHpW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPuIhpGhYOYv3qh-SxR8xQ4Ox0PnhVj22q45QKpAQkpE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DCvQ%2B4J8hTONTg8GYnpfiMY%2FHew%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/P9N6R/btsNa2JmgPv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHG9hFAmL-zXo8U9btua2RTUaGYPcGaGMZkELELDb251/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UUzGJ0hHJMqebqH0ro5ox6PHiDg%3D', 37.56017569999999, 126.9829169, '### 보물섬 촬영지: 더스테이트룸\n\n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 장소로, 분위기를 느끼며 사진 촬영하기 좋은 곳입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 더스테이트룸은 드라마 "보물섬"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적입니다. 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 직접 느끼며, 특별한 순간을 사진으로 남길 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다. 친구나 가족과 함께 방문하여 드라마의 한 장면처럼 멋진 추억을 만들어 보세요.', 'The State Room is the filming location for the drama Treasure Island and its stylish interior and cozy atmosphere are attractive It provides an opportunity to feel the sensibility of the drama directly here and to take pictures of special moments Visit with your friends or family and make wonderful memories like a scene in a drama'),
	(16, '보물섬', '느티나무설렁탕', '서울 중구 퇴계로71길 38 동대문역사문화공원역2번출구 도보6분', '느티나무설렁탕은 드라마 보물섬의 촬영지로 아늑한 분위기와 함께 전통적인 한국 음식을 제공합니다 이곳은 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 선사하며 맛있는 설렁탕과 함께 촬영지의 매력을 느낄 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다 주변의 아름다운 경치와 함께 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤입니다', '#KdramaTrip, #보물섬, #촬영지, #설렁탕, #서울맛집', '카페/레스토랑', 'Zelkova tree seolleongtang', 'Treasure Island', '6-minute walk from Exit 2 of Dongdaemun History and Culture Park Station, 38, Toegye-ro 71-gil, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Kdrama Trip, #Treasure Island, #FilmingPlace, #Seolleongtang, #SeoulFood Restaurant', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dMULOa/btsMDP58Lgu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALyCERkQsIcrjWs9ugqLNS9gI3l6NZYeDbtnzcluaUez/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VtgGGcRW3c92HWGZNPHFtHkuP80%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dkkP64/btsME5NsaZo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACJwMZBDBXiy0_WQCp-t15AyqeUZr27ZclMB6djeSdlc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PTmFMNtsvDF%2FG9hBsUVPPiBspKA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Fs6XG/btsMEVjZVhy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADkBi1ttKZ-H-kT2Rq-Ke944M10z7ekNh2mbSpv2-7kB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=S9s5lHe8QL1SKA6q8odqr8XiQRo%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dMULOa/btsMDP58Lgu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALyCERkQsIcrjWs9ugqLNS9gI3l6NZYeDbtnzcluaUez/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VtgGGcRW3c92HWGZNPHFtHkuP80%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dkkP64/btsME5NsaZo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACJwMZBDBXiy0_WQCp-t15AyqeUZr27ZclMB6djeSdlc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PTmFMNtsvDF%2FG9hBsUVPPiBspKA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Fs6XG/btsMEVjZVhy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADkBi1ttKZ-H-kT2Rq-Ke944M10z7ekNh2mbSpv2-7kB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=S9s5lHe8QL1SKA6q8odqr8XiQRo%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dMULOa/btsMDP58Lgu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALyCERkQsIcrjWs9ugqLNS9gI3l6NZYeDbtnzcluaUez/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VtgGGcRW3c92HWGZNPHFtHkuP80%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dkkP64/btsME5NsaZo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACJwMZBDBXiy0_WQCp-t15AyqeUZr27ZclMB6djeSdlc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PTmFMNtsvDF%2FG9hBsUVPPiBspKA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Fs6XG/btsMEVjZVhy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADkBi1ttKZ-H-kT2Rq-Ke944M10z7ekNh2mbSpv2-7kB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=S9s5lHe8QL1SKA6q8odqr8XiQRo%3D', 37.5664715, 127.0128881, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n- **제목**: 보물섬\n- **촬영지**: 느티나무설렁탕\n- **방문팁**: 드라마 촬영지의 감성을 느끼며 특별한 한 끼를 즐겨보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n느티나무설렁탕은 드라마 "보물섬"의 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기와 함께 전통적인 한국 음식을 제공합니다. 이곳은 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 선사하며, 맛있는 설렁탕과 함께 촬영지의 매력을 느낄 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다. 주변의 아름다운 경치와 함께 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤입니다.', 'Zelkova seolleongtang is the filming location for the drama Treasure Island which serves traditional Korean food with a cozy atmosphere This place provides a special experience for drama fans and is the best place to feel the charm of the filming location with delicious seolleongtang It is perfect for relaxing time with the beautiful scenery around you'),
	(17, '보물섬', '설가온', '서울 종로구 세종대로 175 광화문역8번출구 바로앞', '설가온은 드라마 보물섬의 촬영지로 아름다운 자연경관과 평화로운 분위기가 매력적인 곳입니다 이곳에서 드라마 속 주인공의 감정을 느끼며 다양한 사진을 남길 수 있는 포토존이 많아 팬들에게 인기가 높습니다 방문 시 드라마의 명장면을 떠올리며 여유로운 산책을 즐겨보세요', '#보물섬 #촬영지 #설가온 #드라마팬 #산책 #사진찍기', '기타/판별불가', 'snow-capped', 'Treasure Island', 'Right in front of Exit 8 of Gwanghwamun Station, 175 Sejong-daero, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Treasure Island #ShootingPlace #Sulgaon #DramaFan #Walk #TakingPhotos', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UsDn3/btsMSm3Nx7R/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAChCwrY1CfhMPOZL_5o0QKWEQS1x5B2x7juV2KuJG8u/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3dNq2drAvXtmgpovCtYKLMxkHaY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/36k9a/btsMTbNOQMc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG8DmSFiS-TGMyRssdA071nkARM5ZW7UeyON0Cv71_IS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1lfmP5A3vtW%2BieJ0sZpCPH0Rveg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cvnFeH/btsMSavElEo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFYb_2thOb7b0zuNWHzxFZFe7fwnjcFrId9_foKHsD82/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=e2Z%2BIDfUsElWitfSDNYFNUT6EaI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sjCxV/btsMTE3hmn5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAhpWZ26ebpsZRbG8IS6Qha5AzPjCs4RsSaw7nPG686a/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zYfmid13Kr9lJNNygZ8%2FTkzk%2F00%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfWLbB/btsMSPdraih/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALEqC1XcqTDaPgCnY7jyfifdRWeqqTd2ZMqw4uxD2enG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=G75cRQxwKET%2B7DyWp4FZaWd5wsw%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UsDn3/btsMSm3Nx7R/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAChCwrY1CfhMPOZL_5o0QKWEQS1x5B2x7juV2KuJG8u/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3dNq2drAvXtmgpovCtYKLMxkHaY%3D\', \'https