nds The lighting and the surrounding environment are well harmonized making it a great place for photography Spend a relaxing time feeling the emotions of the drama'),
	(36, '눈물의 여왕', '옥토버훼스트 종로점', '서울 종로구 종로5길 13 종각역1번출구 도보3분', '옥토버훼스트 종로점은 드라마 눈물의 여왕의 촬영지로 아늑하고 따뜻한 분위기를 자랑합니다 이곳은 다양한 메뉴와 함께 친구나 연인과 함께 편안한 시간을 보낼 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다 드라마의 감성을 그대로 느끼며 특별한 순간을 만들어보세요', '#눈물의여왕 #옥토버훼스트 #드라마촬영지 #카페 #여유로운시간', '카페/레스토랑', 'Oktoberhurst Jongno Branch', 'the queen of tears', '3-minute walk from Exit 1 of Jonggak Station, 13, Jongno 5-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#The Queen of Tears #Octoverfest #DramaShoot #Cafe #RelaxingTime', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/biiWH6/btsGqNe1T4m/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHO1_xlteY1jzRq2buO-KijDW0YUiR4VINfWNqCrHjsv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UkFUPRN%2Fcdh%2FCqVT77Wi7NzH%2FLU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bNsDE3/btsGqMUFF9b/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGpjpRzrsRms0MJofSbw267RNcKP-DCXHlMOUkY93ph0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NWRrC46KBE%2FH7vvHuP3cWH6l7Jw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cDWNOn/btsGqZM1pK6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADJ8EiSvt0c0WETOCBaxb7wb1hXekBuUJhRsoDPoVVVK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VqW%2FxYhY18%2FyyolxF6YwyUR4V9A%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/biiWH6/btsGqNe1T4m/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHO1_xlteY1jzRq2buO-KijDW0YUiR4VINfWNqCrHjsv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UkFUPRN%2Fcdh%2FCqVT77Wi7NzH%2FLU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bNsDE3/btsGqMUFF9b/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGpjpRzrsRms0MJofSbw267RNcKP-DCXHlMOUkY93ph0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NWRrC46KBE%2FH7vvHuP3cWH6l7Jw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cDWNOn/btsGqZM1pK6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADJ8EiSvt0c0WETOCBaxb7wb1hXekBuUJhRsoDPoVVVK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VqW%2FxYhY18%2FyyolxF6YwyUR4V9A%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/biiWH6/btsGqNe1T4m/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHO1_xlteY1jzRq2buO-KijDW0YUiR4VINfWNqCrHjsv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UkFUPRN%2Fcdh%2FCqVT77Wi7NzH%2FLU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bNsDE3/btsGqMUFF9b/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGpjpRzrsRms0MJofSbw267RNcKP-DCXHlMOUkY93ph0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NWRrC46KBE%2FH7vvHuP3cWH6l7Jw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cDWNOn/btsGqZM1pK6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADJ8EiSvt0c0WETOCBaxb7wb1hXekBuUJhRsoDPoVVVK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VqW%2FxYhY18%2FyyolxF6YwyUR4V9A%3D', 37.5710274, 126.9804951, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**이름:** 눈물의 여왕  \n**촬영지:** 옥토버훼스트 종로점  \n**방문팁:** 드라마 속 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n옥토버훼스트 종로점은 드라마 "눈물의 여왕"의 촬영지로, 아늑하고 따뜻한 분위기를 자랑합니다. 이곳은 다양한 메뉴와 함께 친구나 연인과 함께 편안한 시간을 보낼 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다. 드라마의 감성을 그대로 느끼며, 특별한 순간을 만들어보세요.', 'Oktoberhurst Jongno branch is the filming location of the drama Queen of Tears which boasts a cozy and warm atmosphere This is the best place to spend a comfortable time with friends or lovers with a variety of menus Feel the sensibility of the drama as it is and create a special moment'),
	(37, '눈물의 여왕', '광통교', '서울 종로구 서린동 1-11 종각역5번출구 도보3분', '광통교는 드라마 눈물의 여왕의 주요 촬영지로 아름다운 경관과 함께 잊지 못할 추억을 만들어줄 장소입니다 이곳에서 드라마의 감정이 담긴 순간들을 다시 떠올리며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 특히 저녁 시간대의 조명이 아름다워 사진 촬영에도 안성맞춤입니다', '#KdramaTrip, #눈물의여왕, #광통교, #산책, #감정적인장면', '기타', 'a wide-open bridge', 'the queen of tears', '3-minute walk from Exit 5 of Jonggak Station, 1-11, Seorin-dong, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Kdrama Trip, #Queen of Tears, #Gwangtonggyo, #walk, #emotional scenes', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nUfFb/btsGqXPg9Ot/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOJgM66Ygn_GJqd0BuOrEnwb75RG4PnqDQR9mAPEbUDt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PF6g%2BWVwVzdNbAO2tBF0DpgJOrM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YJHXD/btsGqgWnaYF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFd8VX3qC71bf27OvYe4n746Y0p9ZS86YjD1s_Pa9fKu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uW12864Rc9HSrQfHoX1Rnmy1z%2Fw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/deronD/btsGqlXC0Cp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABVAXlNedn40q642SVMvUKFJqY2Vuz79pYcyubLm5MOE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vl%2B4wUWlwAwZEhFYYHxGJtwvLA4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/csSNaP/btsGq9IJGxJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGbUuUAeuZ7byTjKG_zmqTWc5Mfa12lAJZfhE_8yd3VC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=e22514rHqtYubNzEaYr93LuGM%2BU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nUfFb/btsGqXPg9Ot/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOJgM66Ygn_GJqd0BuOrEnwb75RG4PnqDQR9mAPEbUDt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PF6g%2BWVwVzdNbAO2tBF0DpgJOrM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YJHXD/btsGqgWnaYF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFd8VX3qC71bf27OvYe4n746Y0p9ZS86YjD1s_Pa9fKu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uW12864Rc9HSrQfHoX1Rnmy1z%2Fw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/deronD/btsGqlXC0Cp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABVAXlNedn40q642SVMvUKFJqY2Vuz79pYcyubLm5MOE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vl%2B4wUWlwAwZEhFYYHxGJtwvLA4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/csSNaP/btsGq9IJGxJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGbUuUAeuZ7byTjKG_zmqTWc5Mfa12lAJZfhE_8yd3VC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=e22514rHqtYubNzEaYr93LuGM%2BU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nUfFb/btsGqXPg9Ot/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOJgM66Ygn_GJqd0BuOrEnwb75RG4PnqDQR9mAPEbUDt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PF6g%2BWVwVzdNbAO2tBF0DpgJOrM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YJHXD/btsGqgWnaYF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFd8VX3qC71bf27OvYe4n746Y0p9ZS86YjD1s_Pa9fKu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uW12864Rc9HSrQfHoX1Rnmy1z%2Fw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/deronD/btsGqlXC0Cp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABVAXlNedn40q642SVMvUKFJqY2Vuz79pYcyubLm5MOE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vl%2B4wUWlwAwZEhFYYHxGJtwvLA4%3D', 37.5694522, 126.9825551, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 눈물의 여왕\n- **촬영지**: 광통교\n- **방문팁**: 이곳에서 드라마의 감동적인 장면을 떠올리며 산책해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n광통교는 드라마 "눈물의 여왕"의 주요 촬영지로, 아름다운 경관과 함께 잊지 못할 추억을 만들어줄 장소입니다. 이곳에서 드라마의 감정이 담긴 순간들을 다시 떠올리며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 특히 저녁 시간대의 조명이 아름다워 사진 촬영에도 안성맞춤입니다.', 'Gwangtonggyo Bridge is the main filming location of the drama Queen of Tears and is a place to make unforgettable memories with beautiful scenery Here you can spend a leisurely time reminiscing about the moments of the dramas emotions In particular the lighting in the evening is beautiful making it perfect for photography'),
	(38, '눈물의 여왕', '아키라백', '서울 종로구 새문안로 97 12층 광화문역7번출구 도보1분', '아키라백은 드라마 눈물의 여왕의 촬영지로 현대적인 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 장소입니다 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들은 드라마의 감정선을 더욱 깊이 있게 전달하며 방문객들은 드라마의 주인공처럼 특별한 순간을 경험할 수 있습니다 또한 아름다운 조명과 세련된 디자인은 사진 촬영에도 적합하여 K드라마 팬들에게 인상적인 추억을 남길 수 있는 곳입니다', '#눈물의여왕, #촬영지, #드라마명장소, #K드라마, #아키라백, #서울', '기타/판별불가', 'Akira bag', 'the queen of tears', '1 minute walk from Exit 7 of Gwanghwamun Station on the 12th floor of 97 Saemunan-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Queen of Tears, #FilmingPlace, #DramaPlace, #K-Drama, #AkiraBag, #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bGL35J/btsFSckVHb9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABtLpN2pZsOh1peyOfRO0E2ebpd3vJEFV1BDuuFsWYhS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YDcsjnf%2BEo0SEyZHGGi%2B9%2B3YRLo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/chv2Si/btsFPJEPslG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK-fARy28Qn4j7Z3voZs9o5R5N8nuHhq4OyH4bjTrZzP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=518K3%2BVbm%2Fd2NAtHv8hfkFvJSJY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/buMJeJ/btsFPGVBRvn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE_gRcHq6MM4xlxTyT7FJXOMFnO4t4uoLDZMA052C10J/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Uw%2B5utl6%2FtLrcUQH%2Bvo5hBUPy54%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cvTT4B/btsFR1cHoZc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAj40JxiKlkPT0AWKRyyVcabjxdwMh2OumsZfq9rfyeQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JaAiUasxIo5gS4f%2B0srleov%2BvpM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bGL35J/btsFSckVHb9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABtLpN2pZsOh1peyOfRO0E2ebpd3vJEFV1BDuuFsWYhS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YDcsjnf%2BEo0SEyZHGGi%2B9%2B3YRLo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/chv2Si/btsFPJEPslG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK-fARy28Qn4j7Z3voZs9o5R5N8nuHhq4OyH4bjTrZzP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFO