he drama more deeply and visitors can experience special moments like the main characters of the drama In addition beautiful lighting and sophisticated design are suitable for photography so it is a place to leave impressive memories for Kdrama fans'),
	(39, '눈물의 여왕', '찰스 H', '서울 종로구 새문안로 97 12층 광화문역7번출구 도보1분', '찰스 H는 드라마 눈물의 여왕의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 특징입니다 이곳은 고급스러운 음료와 함께 특별한 순간을 만끽할 수 있는 장소로 드라마 팬들에게는 잊지 못할 경험이 될 것입니다 각종 음료와 안주를 즐기며 드라마 속 한 장면을 재현해보는 것도 좋은 아이디어입니다', '#KdramaTrip #카페 #눈물의여왕 #찰스H #고급스러운분위기', '카페/레스토랑', 'Charles H', 'the queen of tears', '1 minute walk from Exit 7 of Gwanghwamun Station on the 12th floor of 97 Saemunan-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#KdramaTrip #Cafe #QueenofTears #CharlesH #LuxuryAttention', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xNRum/btsFQuz7A54/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE3LX26a1CW5c84SIPaEmY4D0gMLM0YN7SLcPGz7XbUy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=V661pypnJ8VtXTI%2FMZtU4NjIF%2FA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bDoNt8/btsFOGaswQk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAETAC2pGaP-MxOy6oGVigb-b0_BCabql4csm3DspL1l6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=c%2BrDZ4liG%2BvqzXv1vPH8mvI4pXQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d4Jb1c/btsFPI6YTe6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACYy6NuAexhLJYInMWPK4m4FiGj2yB1faYS6d0UpiIyz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Q8v5dqAPXLdN7uqQHT1VDQwNC5k%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/QaaKd/btsFP1rHJzW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOGS6MHpgTK3wyj1dTBA5pfamAHwQztpgKhGkFJ7b2XR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dOpHxVBrWNKGPF660A3lm2Y%2FO5U%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xNRum/btsFQuz7A54/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE3LX26a1CW5c84SIPaEmY4D0gMLM0YN7SLcPGz7XbUy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=V661pypnJ8VtXTI%2FMZtU4NjIF%2FA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bDoNt8/btsFOGaswQk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAETAC2pGaP-MxOy6oGVigb-b0_BCabql4csm3DspL1l6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=c%2