	(112, '수상한 그녀', '클로리스 신촌점', '서울 서대문구 연세로4길 38 신촌역(2호선)2번출구 도보6분', '클로리스 신촌점은 드라마 수상한 그녀의 촬영지로 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 방문하는 재미가 쏠쏠합니다 아기자기한 인테리어와 편안한 분위기 속에서 친구들과 함께 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 다양한 메뉴를 즐기며 드라마의 여운을 만끽해보세요', '#수상한그녀, #클로리스신촌점, #촬영지, #KdramaTrip, #여유로운시간, #드라마카페', '기타', 'Cloris Shinchon Branch', 'suspicious girl', '6-minute walk from Exit 2 of Sinchon Station (Line 2) 38, Yonsei-ro 4-gil, Seodaemun-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Miss Granny, #ClorisNewtownstore, #FilmingPlace, #KdramaTrip, #RelaxingTime, #DramaCafé', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dm16To/btsLoo8pxZv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFGHHNOwe8Aolk01Kie7bmuo3uVOjmv-IuW2lVQlDzq2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FfdPXSoAYkP6gR0jN92wcfz%2Blug%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eaCU26/btsLonho37v/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEyXYyKHaLPIXqbCi9ZzyECw2b9plSFK8pOOwh-TeAYU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0nEOsFVcsxp0%2FTsTgXT8joQ7NBw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Dzrse/btsLoHs7SJQ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALygUZQ4HIpPrAKhzRERvgXqZT-gt2BOKQ47aZwb2IFA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=at4LoBKEP7xaH7nn%2FfFFtwgrTgk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bqdd14/btsLn5OP2O0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK7Obe6fMzihTV1I-IFXD9JN7cjZ9-8nmFUKJ9ocuIla/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=z2iYIdF8W73PJ%2FWE3oR4qanYvVA%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dm16To/btsLoo8pxZv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFGHHNOwe8Aolk01Kie7bmuo3uVOjmv-IuW2lVQlDzq2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FfdPXSoAYkP6gR0jN92wcfz%2Blug%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eaCU26/btsLonho37v/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEyXYyKHaLPIXqbCi9ZzyECw2b9plSFK8pOOwh-TeAYU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0nEOsFVcsxp0%2FTsTgXT8joQ7NBw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Dzrse/btsLoHs7SJQ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALygUZQ4HIpPrAKhzRERvgXqZT-gt2BOKQ47aZwb2IFA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=at4LoBKEP7xaH7nn%2FfFFtwgrTgk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bqdd14/btsLn5OP2O0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK7Obe6fMzihTV1I-IFXD9JN7cjZ9-8nmFUKJ9ocuIla/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=z2iYIdF8W73PJ%2FWE3oR4qanYvVA%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dm16To/btsLoo8pxZv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFGHHNOwe8Aolk01Kie7bmuo3uVOjmv-IuW2lVQlDzq2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FfdPXSoAYkP6gR0jN92wcfz%2Blug%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eaCU26/btsLonho37v/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEyXYyKHaLPIXqbCi9ZzyECw2b9plSFK8pOOwh-TeAYU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0nEOsFVcsxp0%2FTsTgXT8joQ7NBw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Dzrse/btsLoHs7SJQ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALygUZQ4HIpPrAKhzRERvgXqZT-gt2BOKQ47aZwb2IFA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=at4LoBKEP7xaH7nn%2FfFFtwgrTgk%3D', 37.5577402, 126.9387869, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 수상한 그녀\n- **촬영지**: 클로리스 신촌점\n- **방문팁**: 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보내보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n클로리스 신촌점은 드라마 "수상한 그녀"의 촬영지로, 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 방문하는 재미가 쏠쏠합니다. 아기자기한 인테리어와 편안한 분위기 속에서 친구들과 함께 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 다양한 메뉴를 즐기며 드라마의 여운을 만끽해보세요.', 'The Cloris Sinchon branch is the filming location of the drama Suspicious Girl and it is fun to visit while remembering the scenes filmed here You can spend a special time like a scene in a drama with your friends in a cute interior and comfortable atmosphere Enjoy a variety of menus and enjoy the lingering effects of the drama'),
	(113, '수상한 그녀', '도가방 이대점', '서울 서대문구 이화여대길 78 신촌역(경의중앙선)1번출구 도보3분', '이화여대길은 서울의 젊은 감성을 느낄 수 있는 곳으로 다양한 카페와 음식점들이 즐비해 있습니다 특히 도가방 이대점은 드라마 수상한 그녀의 촬영지로 유명하여 팬들에게는 특별한 방문 장소입니다 이곳에서 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올리며 여유롭게 산책하거나 맛있는 음식을 즐기는 시간을 가져보세요', '#수상한그녀 #도가방 #이화여대길 #드라마촬영지 #서울여행', '거리/골목/광장', 'Dogabang Ewha Womans University', 'suspicious girl', '3-minute walk from Exit 1 of Sinchon Station (Gyeongui Jungang Line) 78 Ewha Womans University-gil, Seodaemun-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Suspicious girl #Dogabang #Ihwa Women\'s University Road #DramaFilmingPlace #SeoulTravel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LnDYQ/btsLogifBQz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFDOaSYnTa4RVIu6OEXWI9-TUdwXkb46NOFKSf9dupIW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qFiDfYKZUoW2i53DhYzoqxU5X5M%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bv5DKR/btsLnkeSks5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQvbhlHw3-BG3rOx5EL7KDZOhE6ytz-zVoCIG-mgWJK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lwsIBXmdrqOwKhJTTaEy8h9asWM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dmxZpo/btsLoKpQSxz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKhmOSfVodeaf4ucVFAMlpgAl0u7uIz4FwVLV_5jA_4M/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Jiize9jq9FQngR%2F2VRidWxX35V8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LnDYQ/btsLogifBQz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFDOaSYnTa4RVIu6OEXWI9-TUdwXkb46NOFKSf9dupIW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qFiDfYKZUoW2i53DhYzoqxU5X5M%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bv5DKR/btsLnkeSks5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQvbhlHw3-BG3rOx5EL7KDZOhE6ytz-zVoCIG-mgWJK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lwsIBXmdrqOwKhJTTaEy8h9asWM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dmxZpo/btsLoKpQSxz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKhmOSfVodeaf4ucVFAMlpgAl0u7uIz4FwVLV_5jA_4M/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Jiize9jq9FQngR%2F2VRidWxX35V8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LnDYQ/btsLogifBQz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFDOaSYnTa4RVIu6OEXWI9-TUdwXkb46NOFKSf9dupIW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qFiDfYKZUoW2i53DhYzoqxU5X5M%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bv5DKR/btsLnkeSks5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQvbhlHw3-BG3rOx5EL7KDZOhE6ytz-zVoCIG-mgWJK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lwsIBXmdrqOwKhJTTaEy8h9asWM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dmxZpo/btsLoKpQSxz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKhmOSfVodeaf4ucVFAMlpgAl0u7uIz4FwVLV_5jA_4M/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Jiize9jq9FQngR%2F2VRidWxX35V8%3D', 37.5592966, 126.9441701, '### 거리 정보\n- **위치**: 이화여대길\n- **촬영지**: 도가방 이대점\n\n### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 수상한 그녀\n- **방문 팁**: 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요!\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #이화여대길\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 거리\n\n### 여행 포인트\n이화여대길은 서울의 젊은 감성을 느낄 수 있는 곳으로, 다양한 카페와 음식점들이 즐비해 있습니다. 특히 도가방 이대점은 드라마 "수상한 그녀"의 촬영지로 유명하여, 팬들에게는 특별한 방문 장소입니다. 이곳에서 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올리며 여유롭게 산책하거나 맛있는 음식을 즐기는 시간을 가져보세요.', 'Ewha Womans University Road is a place where you can feel the youthful sensibility of Seoul and there are many cafes and restaurants In particular the Dogabang Ewha Womans University branch is famous as the filming location for the drama Suspicious Her so it is a special place to visit for fans Take a leisurely walk or enjoy delicious food here recalling a scene from a drama'),
