**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #슬로우캘리\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 거리\n\n### 여행 포인트\n슬로우캘리는 드라마 "수상한 그녀"의 촬영지로 유명한 곳으로, 현대적인 분위기와 함께 다양한 상점들이 즐비해 있습니다. 이 거리에서는 드라마 속 주인공들이 걸었던 길을 따라 걸으며, 나만의 특별한 순간을 사진으로 남길 수 있습니다. 주변 카페와 상점에서 여유로운 시간을 보내며, 드라마의 감성을 체험해 보세요.', 'Slow Callie is famous as the filming location for the drama Miss Granny which is lined with various shops with a modern atmosphere On this street you can walk along the path that the main characters in the drama walked and take pictures of your own special moments Spend a leisurely time at nearby cafes and stores and experience the sensibility of the drama'),
	(115, '수상한 그녀', '땡큐', '서울 서대문구 이화여대7길 30 신촌역1번출구 위에서1분', '수상한 그녀의 촬영지는 독특한 분위기를 자랑하는 곳으로 드라마의 주요 장면들이 펼쳐진 장소입니다 이곳은 다양한 상점과 아기자기한 카페들이 있어 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라 일반 관광객에게도 매력적인 장소입니다 드라마 속 주인공의 감정이 스며든 이곳에서 사진을 찍으며 특별한 추억을 만들어 보세요', '#촬영지 #KdramaTrip #수상한그녀 #서울여행 #감성카페', '기타/판별불가', 'Thank you', 'suspicious girl', '1 minute above Sinchon Station Exit 1, 30, Ewha Womans University 7-gil, Seodaemun-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Filming location #KdramaTrip #SuspiciousShe #SeoulTravel #EmotionalCafe', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bj6vmf/btsLmNWbGqt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJVKY3rNIUtxBLgp0JwvdZ5u8fX2DLWXmkUE3T11VPTI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ejmbkaj%2FhQki4c7Ye2i%2B406KXoo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dZ15oa/btsLm5PLJKT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO8Z6k7IJPochwX_ok4AhnNpGqc02HOOJH9EmpR-BUXe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EF%2FfW6Q04FGjKv31UiCjk01D3GE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/birKdN/btsLozaOhx7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAssLncCM1x6s2jC1GdQDlUjwJV-Dpo4HtS68Jyc5_Jj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3sOjlMfrWat0FB9zGruhOBDYi%2Bk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/u6sPe/btsLm5hZTES/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA10temZlbYfZy4qSfUIWGcBfnfkzQmrMVLW1xNP2MSP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BF1fWmVnRiClCTyI%2FFz%2FjvgyX2A%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bj6vmf/btsLmNWbGqt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJVKY3rNIUtxBLgp0JwvdZ5u8fX2DLWXmkUE3T11VPTI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ejmbkaj%2FhQki4c7Ye2i%2B406KXoo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dZ15oa/btsLm5PLJKT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO8Z6k7IJPochwX_ok4AhnNpGqc02HOOJH9EmpR-BUXe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EF%2FfW6Q04FGjKv31UiCjk01D3GE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/birKdN/btsLozaOhx7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAssLncCM1x6s2jC1GdQDlUjwJV-Dpo4HtS68Jyc5_Jj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3sOjlMfrWat0FB9zGruhOBDYi%2Bk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/u6sPe/btsLm5hZTES/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA10temZlbYfZy4qSfUIWGcBfnfkzQmrMVLW1xNP2MSP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BF1fWmVnRiClCTyI%2FFz%2FjvgyX2A%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bj6vmf/btsLmNWbGqt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJVKY3rNIUtxBLgp0JwvdZ5u8fX2DLWXmkUE3T11VPTI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ejmbkaj%2FhQki4c7Ye2i%2B406KXoo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dZ15oa/btsLm5PLJKT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO8Z6k7IJPochwX_ok4AhnNpGqc02HOOJH9EmpR-BUXe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EF%2FfW6Q04FGjKv31UiCjk01D3GE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/birKdN/btsLozaOhx7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAssLncCM1x6s2jC1GdQDlUjwJV-Dpo4HtS68Jyc5_Jj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3sOjlMfrWat0FB9zGruhOBDYi%2Bk%3D', 37.5588126, 126.943937, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 수상한 그녀\n- **촬영지:** 땡큐\n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요!\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n"수상한 그녀"의 촬영지는 독특한 분위기를 자랑하는 곳으로, 드라마의 주요 장면들이 펼쳐진 장소입니다. 이곳은 다양한 상점과 아기자기한 카페들이 있어, 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라 일반 관광객에게도 매력적인 장소입니다. 드라마 속 주인공의 감정이 스며든 이곳에서 사진을 찍으며 특별한 추억을 만들어 보세요.', 'The filming location of Suspicious Her boasts a unique atmosphere where the main scenes of the drama unfold It has a variety of shops and cute cafes making it an attractive place not only for drama fans but also for ordinary tourists Make special memories by taking pictures here where the emotions of the main characters in the drama permeate'),
	(116, '수상한 그녀', '서울레코드', '서울 종로구 종로 154 종로3가역12번출구 도보2분', '서울레코드는 종로구에 위치한 활기찬 거리로 드라마 수상한 그녀의 촬영지로 유명합니다 이곳에서는 다양한 상점들이 늘어서 있어 쇼핑과 함께 지역 문화를 체험할 수 있습니다 특히 거리의 독특한 간판과 분위기는 사진 찍기 좋은 장소로 K드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 감성을 선사합니다 방문 시 주변 카페에서 휴식을 취하며 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것도 추천합니다', '#KdramaTrip #서울 #종로구 #수상한그녀 #쇼핑 #거리', '거리/골목/광장', 'Seoul Records', 'suspicious girl', '2-minute walk from Exit 12 of Jongno 3-ga Station, 154 Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #Seoul #Jongro-gu #SuspiciousShe #Shopping #Street', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ubp74/btsLWRCSybO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK4MQpeb11eT_wBfGliu5JTJl5w6sxcW2aGzh2Y7MUJs/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eumgG9VJRj%2FPlnLiMQ3lpIihaO0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vekCP/btsLVH1WjdV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK4Kl1L82hv2ZdLWNKa7ooicEzvlDuAkGS2uCvLQLofm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5EVvMw0keBagHxEksQM58v%2FXGH0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/38P0v/btsLWrdkWcn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIFPV7e55RFIS-O4jDt5MU3xxYPxHTP8tjSFR6theBMD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mZhiAjylaJ7DyDLmq%2FoJFyfKnBo%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ubp74/btsLWRCSybO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK4MQpeb11eT_wBfGliu5JTJl5w6sxcW2aGzh2Y7MUJs/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eumgG9VJRj%2FPlnLiMQ3lpIihaO0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vekCP/btsLVH1WjdV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK4Kl1L82hv2ZdLWNKa7ooicEzvlDuAkGS2uCvLQLofm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5EVvMw0keBagHxEksQM58v%2FXGH0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/38P0v/btsLWrdkWcn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIFPV7e55RFIS-O4jDt5MU3xxYPxHTP8tjSFR6theBMD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mZhiAjylaJ7DyDLmq%2FoJFyfKnBo%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ubp74/btsLWRCSybO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK4MQpeb11eT_wBfGliu5JTJl5w6sxcW2aGzh2Y7MUJs/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eumgG9VJRj%2FPlnLiMQ3lpIihaO0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vekCP/btsLVH1WjdV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK4Kl1L82hv2ZdLWNKa7ooicEzvlDuAkGS2uCvLQLofm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5EVvMw0keBagHxEksQM58v%2FXGH0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/38P0v/btsLWrdkWcn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIFPV7e55RFIS-O4jDt5MU3xxYPxHTP8tjSFR6theBMD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mZhiAjylaJ7DyDLmq%2FoJFyfKnBo%3D', 37.5702467, 126.994621, '### 수상한 그녀 촬영지: 서울레코드\n\n**방문 팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 주요 촬영지로, 다양한 상점과 거리 풍경을 즐길 수 있습니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 서울레코드는 종로구에 위치한 활기찬 거리로, 드라마 \'수상한 그녀\'의 촬영지로 유명합니다. 이곳에서는 다양한 상점들이 늘어서 있어 쇼핑과 함께 지역 문화를 체험할 수 있습니다. 특히, 거리의 독특한 간판과 분위기는 사진 찍기 좋은 장소로, K-드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 감성을 선사합니다. 방문 시 주변 카페에서 휴식을 취하며 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것도 추천합니다.\n\n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #서울 #종로구 #거리', 'Seoul Records is a lively street located in Jongnogu and is famous as the filming location for the drama Miss Granny There are various stores lined up here so you can experience the local culture while shopping In particular the unique signboards and atmosphere of the street are great places to take pictures giving Kdrama fans a special sensibility It is also recommended to relax at nearby cafes when visiting'),
	(117, '수상한 그녀', '한복클로젯', '서울 종로구 윤보선길 65 안국역1번출구 위에서1분', '한복클로젯은 드라마 수상한 그녀의 촬영지로 전통 한복을 체험하고 사진을 찍기 좋은 장소입니다 이곳은 아름다운 한옥과 현대적인 건축물이 어우러져 있어 다양한 배경으로 멋진 사진을 남길 수 있습니다 특히 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 한복을 입고 산책하기 좋은 거리입니다 드라마 팬이라면 놓치지 말아야 할 명소입니다', '#KdramaTrip #한복 #사진촬영 #서울여행 #수상한그녀 #전통문화', '기타', 'Hanbok Closet', 'suspicious girl', '1 minute above Exit 1 of Anguk Station, 65, Yunbo Seon-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#KdramaTrip #Hanbok #PhotoShooting #SeoulTravel #SuspiciousShe #TraditionalCulture', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cdmKra/btsLXT0UDha/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADAwV2mx8y9lsQXyK7kfP6jh-aQUsUfOfzebPuS2h7r0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xDC0L75BpNelpQryLima5g3m2CY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/2lpkx/btsLVMhUSYD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMqK1eZuxUO9Iri1cN6Ish1mv37ud_ArJGWYOQpbaZc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HuLnSbixCAPaOUtwntff6GmPQhw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vpMoz/btsLX7SaDBh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABWTai8DzhsKZOm-MqvOIHkIvcxQEsz7dQflo3K3atr5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CDagKWXGuEKGfED2AQw09udsi%2Fc%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cdmKra/btsLXT0UDha/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADAwV2mx8y9lsQXyK7kfP6jh-aQUsUfOfzebPuS2h7r0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xDC0L75BpNelpQryLima5g3m2CY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/2lpkx/btsLVMhUSYD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMqK1eZuxUO9Iri1cN6Ish1mv37ud_ArJGWYOQpbaZc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HuLnSbixCAPaOUtwntff6GmPQhw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vpMoz/btsLX7SaDBh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABWTai8DzhsKZOm-MqvOIHkIvcxQEsz7dQflo3K3atr5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CDagKWXGuEKGfED2AQw09udsi%2Fc%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cdmKra/btsLXT0UDha/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADAwV2mx8y9lsQXyK7kfP6jh-aQUsUfOfzebPuS2h7r0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xDC0L75BpNelpQryLima5g3m2CY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/2lpkx/btsLVMhUSYD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMqK1eZuxUO9Iri1cN6Ish1mv37ud_ArJGWYOQpbaZc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HuLnSbixCAPaOUtwntff6GmPQhw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vpMoz/btsLX7SaDBh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABWTai8DzhsKZOm-MqvOIHkIvcxQEsz7dQflo3K3atr5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CDagKWXGuEKGfED2AQw09udsi%2Fc%3D', 37.5788293, 126.9831021, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 수상한 그녀\n- **촬영지:** 한복클로젯\n- **방문팁:** 한복을 입고 특별한 사진을 남길 수 있는 장소입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n한복클로젯은 드라마 "수상한 그녀"의 촬영지로, 전통 한복을 체험하고 사진을 찍기 좋은 장소입니다. 이곳은 아름다운 한옥과 현대적인 건축물이 어우러져 있어, 다양한 배경으로 멋진 사진을 남길 수 있습니다. 특히, 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 한복을 입고 산책하기 좋은 거리입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 놓치지 말아야 할 명소입니다!', 'Hanbok Closet is the filming location for the drama Suspicious Girl which is a great place to experience and take pictures of traditional Hanboks This place is a combination of beautiful hanok and modern architecture so you can leave wonderful photos with various backgrounds In particular it is a good place to take a walk wearing hanbok while feeling the sensibility of the drama If youre a drama fan its a mustsee attraction'),
	(118, '수상한 그녀', '포토시그니처 소격동점', '서울 종로구 율곡로3길 73-1 안국역1번출구 위에서2분', '포토시그니처 소격동점은 아기자기한 카페와 상점들이 즐비한 거리로 드라마 수상한 그녀의 촬영지로 알려져 있습니다 이곳은 독특한 포토존이 많아 친구들과 함께 멋진 사진을 남기기 좋으며 주변의 다양한 먹거리를 즐길 수 있는 기회도 제공합니다 평화로운 분위기 속에서 산책하며 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요', '#KdramaTrip #수상한그녀 #포토존 #카페 #소격동 #사진찍기', '거리/골목/광장', 'Photo Signature Subtle Junction', 'suspicious girl', '2 minutes above Exit 1 of Anguk Station, 73-1, Yulgok-ro 3-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #SuspiciousHer #PhotoZone #Café #Sniffle #TakingPhotos', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bkYKxj/btsLVN8Z6UN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGJd4z0QduxizV7Akij6HLq3yURLrF4L52gHsT5I-liY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Sm11XnRYzefX9HjwCF2zv7HZrtc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bSqjS3/btsLVCs3yrn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJGVljykwVI7wxeLxR16wiDlxoXhk_6JYXiMvwD8G0bo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QE7whHDLHSZVSmgXeiFiqqLVSr4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lQB4r/btsLX7dAr1l/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPem6inc_SROx36b4ohedi3bTBs8ohr7uxTTbmwIL-In/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nsYUezyEfS%2F2Xb9hLGSZtoZFxBo%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bkYKxj/btsLVN8Z6UN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGJd4z0QduxizV7Akij6HLq3yURLrF4L52gHsT5I-liY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Sm11XnRYzefX9HjwCF2zv7HZrtc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bSqjS3/btsLVCs3yrn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJGVljykwVI7wxeLxR16wiDlxoXhk_6JYXiMvwD8G0bo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QE7whHDLHSZVSmgXeiFiqqLVSr4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lQB4r/btsLX7dAr1l/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPem6inc_SROx36b4ohedi3bTBs8ohr7uxTTbmwIL-In/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nsYUezyEfS%2F2Xb9hLGSZtoZFxBo%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bkYKxj/btsLVN8Z6UN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGJd4z0QduxizV7Akij6HLq3yURLrF4L52gHsT5I-liY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Sm11XnRYzefX9HjwCF2zv7HZrtc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bSqjS3/btsLVCs3yrn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJGVljykwVI7wxeLxR16wiDlxoXhk_6JYXiMvwD8G0bo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QE7whHDLHSZVSmgXeiFiqqLVSr4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lQB4r/btsLX7dAr1l/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPem6inc_SROx36b4ohedi3bTBs8ohr7uxTTbmwIL-In/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nsYUezyEfS%2F2Xb9hLGSZtoZFxBo%3D', 37.5789103, 126.9820136, '### 거리 정보\n- **제목**: 수상한 그녀\n- **촬영지**: 포토시그니처 소격동점\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마 촬영지로 유명하며, 다양한 포토존이 있어 사진 찍기에 좋습니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #태그\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 거리\n\n### 여행 포인트\n포토시그니처 소격동점은 아기자기한 카페와 상점들이 즐비한 거리로, 드라마 "수상한 그녀"의 촬영지로 알려져 있습니다. 이곳은 독특한 포토존이 많아 친구들과 함께 멋진 사진을 남기기 좋으며, 주변의 다양한 먹거리를 즐길 수 있는 기회도 제공합니다. 평화로운 분위기 속에서 산책하며 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.', 'PhotoSignature Sogyeokdong is a street full of cute cafes and shops known as the filming location for the drama Suspicious Her This place has many unique photo zones so its good to leave wonderful photos with friends and it also provides a chance to enjoy various foods around you Take a walk in a peaceful atmosphere and feel the sensibility of the drama'),
	(119, '수상한 그녀', '감고당길', '서울 종로구 송현동 57-1 안국역1번출구 위에서4분', '감고당길은 드라마 수상한 그녀의 촬영지로 아늑한 분위기와 아름다운 조명이 어우러진 곳입니다 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 속 주인공들의 이야기를 떠올리며 걷는 즐거움을 느낄 수 있습니다 특히 저녁 시간에 방문하면 더욱 로맨틱한 분위기를 만끽할 수 있어 K드라마 팬들에게는 놓칠 수 없는 명소입니다', '#KdramaTrip #StreetScene #수상한그녀 #드라마촬영지 #서울여행', '거리/골목/광장', 'Wrap it around and pull it', 'suspicious girl', '4 minutes above Exit 1 of Anguk Station, 57-1 Songhyeon-dong, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #StreetScene #SuspiciousShe #DramaShootPlace #SeoulTravel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/T9Yya/btsLmXqHcZP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ36EEo1d7VGyIZb9KaS-gLL7oVBP6_JddHQGtUSxBZV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QRu2dPQfcz%2Bq%2FGniC7qh6ltTCZ0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cqgLj8/btsLnXpZQu3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFIjsLLhTUirNpjwDavV3sitHRW4IZXdpjBmVw6sPGHm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=d981MREDJ2l7JrRQSaXIHuhWH78%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bXi9Oc/btsLpc7wVhe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFWYqOzQqvwJDnJc7msTSiJy8i3GOHgh9ot8v5Vw5URK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Zu26OSYQ121vKBd4KOUSugS%2BpaY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bE3f2z/btsLodMQd8f/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPcGMo0xWzJHfrerEM_3KQselE_gGJ8GTQXupLu_h1h4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8GCMaK2BH8yqQWIpcz%2F%2FteOOfj8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bDsUnB/btsLDLV4Tez/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHJoBiOgbNfZKzAZEjykPElU14bIg5jpyCB6bADPveKa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uKfXcEnM7Q7p%2BL6cM9EgFoV%2Brj4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eeSDt5/btsLCHGP60P/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKS1X5W7KakeHisWvlatuw0Lsaxab-UmgquKrxYaxcOi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nQ7QN88QSuVy5zp6p1xClxMjewY%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/T9Yya/btsLmXqHcZP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ36EEo1d7VGyIZb9KaS-gLL7oVBP6_JddHQGtUSxBZV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QRu2dPQfcz%2Bq%2FGniC7qh6ltTCZ0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cqgLj8/btsLnXpZQu3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFIjsLLhTUirNpjwDavV3sitHRW4IZXdpjBmVw6sPGHm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=d981MREDJ2l7JrRQSaXIHuhWH78%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bXi9Oc/btsLpc7wVhe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFWYqOzQqvwJDnJc7msTSiJy8i3GOHgh9ot8v5Vw5URK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Zu26OSYQ121vKBd4KOUSugS%2BpaY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bE3f2z/btsLodMQd8f/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPcGMo0xWzJHfrerEM_3KQselE_gGJ8GTQXupLu_h1h4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8GCMaK2BH8yqQWIpcz%2F%2FteOOfj8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bDsUnB/btsLDLV4Tez/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHJoBiOgbNfZKzAZEjykPElU14bIg5jpyCB6bADPveKa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uKfXcEnM7Q7p%2BL6cM9EgFoV%2Brj4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eeSDt5/btsLCHGP60P/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKS1X5W7KakeHisWvlatuw0Lsaxab-UmgquKrxYaxcOi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nQ7QN88QSuVy5zp6p1xClxMjewY%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/T9Yya/btsLmXqHcZP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ36EEo1d7VGyIZb9KaS-gLL7oVBP6_JddHQGtUSxBZV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QRu2dPQfcz%2Bq%2FGniC7qh6ltTCZ0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cqgLj8/btsLnXpZQu3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFIjsLLhTUirNpjwDavV3sitHRW4IZXdpjBmVw6sPGHm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=d981MREDJ2l7JrRQSaXIHuhWH78%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bXi9Oc/btsLpc7wVhe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFWYqOzQqvwJDnJc7msTSiJy8i3GOHgh9ot8v5Vw5URK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Zu26OSYQ121vKBd4KOUSugS%2BpaY%3D', 37.576434, 126.9827876, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 수상한 그녀\n- **촬영지:** 감고당길\n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책해보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 거리/골목\n\n### 여행 포인트\n감고당길은 드라마 "수상한 그녀"의 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기와 아름다운 조명이 어우러진 곳입니다. 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 속 주인공들의 이야기를 떠올리며 걷는 즐거움을 느낄 수 있습니다. 특히, 저녁 시간에 방문하면 더욱 로맨틱한 분위기를 만끽할 수 있어, K-드라마 팬들에게는 놓칠 수 없는 명소입니다.', 'Gomgodanggil is the filming location of the drama Suspicious Girl where the cozy atmosphere and beautiful lighting are combined If you visit here you can feel the joy of walking while remembering the stories of the main characters in the drama In particular you can enjoy a more romantic atmosphere when you visit in the evening making it a mustsee attraction for Kdrama fans'),
	(120, '수상한 그녀', '경성사진관', '서울 종로구 북촌로 67-4 안국역2번출구 위에서1분', '경성사진관은 드라마 수상한 그녀의 촬영지로 전통 한옥의 아름다움이 돋보이는 장소입니다 이곳에서는 한국의 전통 건축 양식을 경험할 수 있으며 드라마 속 감성을 느끼며 사진 촬영을 즐길 수 있습니다 주변의 조용한 정원과 함께 한적한 분위기 속에서 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소입니다 방문 시 드라마의 특정 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 추억을 만들어 보세요', '#한옥 #전통건축 #사진촬영 #드라마촬영지 #여행포인트', '스튜디오/세트장', 'Gyeongseong Photo Studio', 'suspicious girl', '1 minute above Exit 2 of Anguk Station, 67-4 Bukchon-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a studio/set', '#Hanok #TraditionalArchitecture #PhotoShooting #DramaShootingPlace #TravelPoint', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sNrtm/btsLnzCQTfA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP1cFGR0852fY-VPdMHqPvEwINciA_FuatOsqKxVdxZ8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=c0EM0x496LM2e2hLGd5rExp%2FnTI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/crDEfg/btsLncgPX0u/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL1uVGLSsnsvaX8y14SnGOVqO8K4ry-iXbShmTUUqR97/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EB9tnn1T6tWhWiK2jXR87TIcK2E%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pXiuC/btsLnmRhI0Y/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANhMwdF1v5ib2AAFEG-ORIYfIA6h7wtlOm3XYwZ9sGgR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zU2j6TUJMwKjE4Z2BJ6hx02%2Bdrc%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sNrtm/btsLnzCQTfA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP1cFGR0852fY-VPdMHqPvEwINciA_FuatOsqKxVdxZ8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=c0EM0x496LM2e2hLGd5rExp%2FnTI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/crDEfg/btsLncgPX0u/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL1uVGLSsnsvaX8y14SnGOVqO8K4ry-iXbShmTUUqR97/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EB9tnn1T6tWhWiK2jXR87TIcK2E%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pXiuC/btsLnmRhI0Y/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANhMwdF1v5ib2AAFEG-ORIYfIA6h7wtlOm3XYwZ9sGgR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zU2j6TUJMwKjE4Z2BJ6hx02%2Bdrc%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sNrtm/btsLnzCQTfA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP1cFGR0852fY-VPdMHqPvEwINciA_FuatOsqKxVdxZ8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=c0EM0x496LM2e2hLGd5rExp%2FnTI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/crDEfg/btsLncgPX0u/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL1uVGLSsnsvaX8y14SnGOVqO8K4ry-iXbShmTUUqR97/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EB9tnn1T6tWhWiK2jXR87TIcK2E%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pXiuC/btsLnmRhI0Y/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANhMwdF1v5ib2AAFEG-ORIYfIA6h7wtlOm3XYwZ9sGgR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zU2j6TUJMwKjE4Z2BJ6hx02%2Bdrc%3D', 37.582945, 126.9848271, '### 여행 포인트\n\n경성사진관은 드라마 "수상한 그녀"의 촬영지로, 전통 한옥의 아름다움이 돋보이는 장소입니다. 이곳에서는 한국의 전통 건축 양식을 경험할 수 있으며, 드라마 속 감성을 느끼며 사진 촬영을 즐길 수 있습니다. 주변의 조용한 정원과 함께, 한적한 분위기 속에서 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소입니다. 방문 시, 드라마의 특정 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 추억을 만들어 보세요.', 'Gyeongseong Photo Studio is the filming location for the drama Suspicious Girl which highlights the beauty of traditional hanok Here you can experience the traditional Korean architectural style and enjoy taking pictures while feeling the sensibility of the drama Along with the quiet gardens around its a great place to spend time in a quiet atmosphere When you visit make special memories by thinking of specific scenes in the drama'),
	(121, '수상한 그녀', '오후', '서울 종로구 자하문로9길 33 경복궁역2번출구 도보7분', '수상한 그녀는 다양한 감정과 이야기가 얽힌 드라마로 이 카페는 그 분위기를 잘 담고 있습니다 아늑한 인테리어와 편안한 좌석은 친구와의 대화나 혼자만의 시간을 보내기에 적합합니다 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 커피 한 잔과 함께 특별한 순간을 만끽해 보세요 KdramaTrip Cafe', '#수상한그녀, #카페, #감성, #여유, #드라마촬영지', '카페/레스토랑', 'afternoon', 'suspicious girl', '7-minute walk from Exit 2 of Gyeongbokgung Station, 33, Jahamun-ro 9-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Miss Granny, #Café, #Sentimental, #Relaxed, #DramaShootPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bNOGkP/btsLn8SjSVb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIrdaRC7CEY6IhPavNuAnIOgWsepGu-uqKY3RNkVsu8B/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X5dH3x1vXwMhm1tFAIRx2VKB4Qw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/biIciV/btsLpeYBoRv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA14580enTJEjE6sXwCE5mTnLv9Czr3H9MU_stb0_E1A/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=adU%2F3C0RkqSQx4JuE5KHqocarqw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0DS6C/btsLphnsVNS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABwBGE8MKVp9fMqaoQVSJcqSCM450f-R5zMxLYPrfW3c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1vhvchYrfMexUHMzQNRBI4I4QNg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/OL7st/btsLopzvgmN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHuXCmfw9rqlcMsnTsX-x16UTA04CZW44-wueNCoDLZC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=E2KNqhNvINXkjIIWrM6JGbN%2Fu44%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bNOGkP/btsLn8SjSVb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIrdaRC7CEY6IhPavNuAnIOgWsepGu-uqKY3RNkVsu8B/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X5dH3x1vXwMhm1tFAIRx2VKB4Qw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/biIciV/btsLpeYBoRv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA14580enTJEjE6sXwCE5mTnLv9Czr3H9MU_stb0_E1A/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=adU%2F3C0RkqSQx4JuE5KHqocarqw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0DS6C/btsLphnsVNS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABwBGE8MKVp9fMqaoQVSJcqSCM450f-R5zMxLYPrfW3c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1vhvchYrfMexUHMzQNRBI4I4QNg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/OL7st/btsLopzvgmN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHuXCmfw9rqlcMsnTsX-x16UTA04CZW44-wueNCoDLZC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=E2KNqhNvINXkjIIWrM6JGbN%2Fu44%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bNOGkP/btsLn8SjSVb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIrdaRC7CEY6IhPavNuAnIOgWsepGu-uqKY3RNkVsu8B/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X5dH3x1vXwMhm1tFAIRx2VKB4Qw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/biIciV/btsLpeYBoRv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA14580enTJEjE6sXwCE5mTnLv9Czr3H9MU_stb0_E1A/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=adU%2F3C0RkqSQx4JuE5KHqocarqw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0DS6C/btsLphnsVNS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABwBGE8MKVp9fMqaoQVSJcqSCM450f-R5zMxLYPrfW3c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1vhvchYrfMexUHMzQNRBI4I4QNg%3D', 37.5793439, 126.9692673, '### 수상한 그녀 촬영지: 오후 카페\n\n**방문팁:** 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 가져보세요.\n\n#### 여행 포인트\n"수상한 그녀"는 다양한 감정과 이야기가 얽힌 드라마로, 이 카페는 그 분위기를 잘 담고 있습니다. 아늑한 인테리어와 편안한 좌석은 친구와의 대화나 혼자만의 시간을 보내기에 적합합니다. 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며, 커피 한 잔과 함께 특별한 순간을 만끽해 보세요. #KdramaTrip #Cafe', 'Suspicious Girl is a drama with various emotions and stories and this cafe contains the atmosphere well The cozy interior and comfortable seating are perfect for conversation with friends or spending time alone Recall the scenes from the drama and enjoy the special moment with a cup of coffee KdramaTrip Cafe'),
	(122, '수상한 그녀', '재능교육 JCC크리에이티브센터', '서울 종로구 창경궁로35길 45 한성대입구역5번출구 도보7분', '재능교육 JCC크리에이티브센터는 현대적인 건축미와 창의적인 공간으로 유명합니다 이곳은 드라마 수상한 그녀의 촬영지로 방문객들은 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올리며 독특한 구조와 아름다운 경관을 즐길 수 있습니다 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤입니다', '#촬영지 #현대건축 #드라마장소 #재능교육 #사진스팟 #여유로운시간', '스튜디오/세트장', 'Talent Education JCC Creative Center', 'suspicious girl', '7-minute walk from Exit 5 of Hansung University Station, 45 Changgyeonggung-ro 35-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a studio/set', '#Filming location #Hyundaiarchitecture #DramaPlace #TalentEducation #PhotoSpot #RelaxingTime', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/slRA1/btsLn76VQCV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPLXBiXkHkgw1rOF-DrV-WLzzx1vicPXfidkblcRDQp2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=u91QxL7hw0RenuVS7CGZi8g7g2k%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FUtQy/btsLohVNRw6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEev6tEB-aoLiC7nyvlS6hJcZUg6B7aSO-Z5l6tQ2dt5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wByPOxbht7mLkpY19LkMPAwz5Y4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b349Ln/btsLzpMysWD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL0K43cG2X4u5m9Ocp0BG_Xtw8Lw2C2lcxpf9yND0Lae/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hC7EqRzysKgA%2FIrp3z1HHXjARg8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/RJyTX/btsLwLRlSnR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMOMgS9psLTqM2WOt0XAKq_GAESA0bX79YKY1CTt7OmO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=h3SzWNv8R9967Bd262mmoZKJEzA%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/slRA1/btsLn76VQCV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPLXBiXkHkgw1rOF-DrV-WLzzx1vicPXfidkblcRDQp2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=u91QxL7hw0RenuVS7CGZi8g7g2k%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FUtQy/btsLohVNRw6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEev6tEB-aoLiC7nyvlS6hJcZUg6B7aSO-Z5l6tQ2dt5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expir