	(123, '굿파트너', '마포소금구이', '서울 마포구 와우산로32길 32 홍대입구역6번출구 도보6분', '마포소금구이는 드라마 굿파트너의 주요 촬영지로 실제로 방문하면 드라마 속 장면들을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다 이곳은 전통적인 한식 메뉴를 제공하며 특히 소금구이와 함께하는 다양한 반찬이 인기입니다 아늑한 분위기에서 친구나 가족과 함께 소중한 시간을 보내기에 좋은 장소입니다 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 들러보세요', '#굿파트너 #소금구이 #한식 #아늑한분위기 #드라마촬영지 #맛집', '카페/레스토랑', 'Grilled Mapo salt', 'Good Partner', '6 minutes walk from Exit 6 of Hongik University Station, 32, Wausan-ro 32-gil, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Good partner #GrilledSalt #Korean Food #CozyAtmosphere #DramaShoot #Good Restaurant', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cB40DC/btsIIA4i7To/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE4vDfAKLPBHwfiAOm0jW-hNWQPNqg6xcXW8wZDxAJIH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=La5LpyfQlkEWGJK9UtPtyQnrseM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qO28V/btsIGrO0rn9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOuZ32xlpq1WjBIoGwfJ6HYnKR3YyyuuzOQOWCGowLSx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=d63zjWZKeBuPpHjMpDXUmITjBtM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bmfZhd/btsIG211n4P/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAf8vMKrrHx_UH-2mtmhNUaBPEBrVL2DuTOpHHibVENq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xIovjvrqiTgjD2F28p1BlW1iwms%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cB40DC/btsIIA4i7To/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE4vDfAKLPBHwfiAOm0jW-hNWQPNqg6xcXW8wZDxAJIH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=La5LpyfQlkEWGJK9UtPtyQnrseM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qO28V/btsIGrO0rn9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOuZ32xlpq1WjBIoGwfJ6HYnKR3YyyuuzOQOWCGowLSx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=d63zjWZKeBuPpHjMpDXUmITjBtM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bmfZhd/btsIG211n4P/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAf8vMKrrHx_UH-2mtmhNUaBPEBrVL2DuTOpHHibVENq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xIovjvrqiTgjD2F28p1BlW1iwms%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cB40DC/btsIIA4i7To/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE4vDfAKLPBHwfiAOm0jW-hNWQPNqg6xcXW8wZDxAJIH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=La5LpyfQlkEWGJK9UtPtyQnrseM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qO28V/btsIGrO0rn9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOuZ32xlpq1WjBIoGwfJ6HYnKR3YyyuuzOQOWCGowLSx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=d63zjWZKeBuPpHjMpDXUmITjBtM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bmfZhd/btsIG211n4P/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAf8vMKrrHx_UH-2mtmhNUaBPEBrVL2DuTOpHHibVENq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xIovjvrqiTgjD2F28p1BlW1iwms%3D', 37.5541244, 126.932885, '### 굿파트너 촬영지: 마포소금구이\n\n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 아늑한 분위기와 맛있는 음식이 매력적입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 마포소금구이는 드라마 "굿파트너"의 주요 촬영지로, 실제로 방문하면 드라마 속 장면들을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다. 이곳은 전통적인 한식 메뉴를 제공하며, 특히 소금구이와 함께하는 다양한 반찬이 인기입니다. 아늑한 분위기에서 친구나 가족과 함께 소중한 시간을 보내기에 좋은 장소입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 들러보세요! \n\n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe', 'Mapo Salt Grilling is the main filming location of the drama Good Partner and when you actually visit you can have a special experience by recalling the scenes in the drama This place offers traditional Korean food menus and a variety of side dishes are especially popular with grilled salt It is a great place to spend precious time with friends and family in a cozy atmosphere If youre a drama fan make sure to stop by'),
	(124, '굿파트너', '고기꾼김춘배 숲길직영점', '서울 마포구 서강로13길 31-2 홍대입구역6번출구 위에서2분', '고기꾼김춘배 숲길직영점은 드라마 굿파트너의 촬영지로 아늑한 분위기에서 다양한 고기 요리를 즐길 수 있는 매력적인 장소입니다 이곳은 자연과 가까운 환경 속에서 친구와의 소중한 시간을 보내기에 적합하며 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 선사합니다 편안한 인테리어와 맛있는 음식이 어우러져 방문객들에게 잊지 못할 경험을 제공합니다', '#고기, #맛집, #드라마촬영지, #친구와함께, #아늑한분위기', '카페/레스토랑', 'Meatman Kim Chunbae Forest Road Jikyeong Branch', 'Good Partner', '2 minutes above Exit 6 of Hongik University Station, 31-2 Seogang-ro 13-gil, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Meat, #famous restaurant, #drama set, #withfriend, #warmheartedness', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LoCLH/btsJDhDX63U/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN5quSaCl_3QIotKsc-WA0mS38DuyzDhmSZQ_Pp_IJsd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jkNl0VE8h24qidd20bRutP5NziA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/daHvLM/btsJCD8U2fT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPqNJswSNIolYi2mlHXHKuC_apH16Q7U-lhKXdx7AlaI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=r%2BOqiHIP523lV63jlqRmp2jMpX8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bVqiHi/btsJCTwJ5WK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMVxSA9hut0bjpmxZ2r3Rb7s3dyphjThTEqeXyDqjVP8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a1rVaFtEL%2FhEPcqwG0EocgylgPg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0OhNo/btsJDwAMx1S/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEU97hFfJAmNHUxoi5V0_lLpbAMjSoFgUREWr9ThQcWq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NQFYmEb4skInTRFrkjMCz2IJURI%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LoCLH/btsJDhDX63U/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN5quSaCl_3QIotKsc-WA0mS38DuyzDhmSZQ_Pp_IJsd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jkNl0VE8h24qidd20bRutP5NziA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/daHvLM/btsJCD8U2fT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPqNJswSNIolYi2mlHXHKuC_apH16Q7U-lhKXdx7AlaI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=r%2BOqiHIP523lV63jlqRmp2jMpX8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bVqiHi/btsJCTwJ5WK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMVxSA9hut0bjpmxZ2r3Rb7s3dyphjThTEqeXyDqjVP8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a1rVaFtEL%2FhEPcqwG0EocgylgPg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0OhNo/btsJDwAMx1S/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEU97hFfJAmNHUxoi5V0_lLpbAMjSoFgUREWr9ThQcWq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NQFYmEb4skInTRFrkjMCz2IJURI%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LoCLH/btsJDhDX63U/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN5quSaCl_3QIotKsc-WA0mS38DuyzDhmSZQ_Pp_IJsd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jkNl0VE8h24qidd20bRutP5NziA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/daHvLM/btsJCD8U2fT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPqNJswSNIolYi2mlHXHKuC_apH16Q7U-lhKXdx7AlaI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=r%2BOqiHIP523lV63jlqRmp2jMpX8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bVqiHi/btsJCTwJ5WK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMVxSA9hut0bjpmxZ2r3Rb7s3dyphjThTEqeXyDqjVP8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a1rVaFtEL%2FhEPcqwG0EocgylgPg%3D', 37.55425210000001, 126.9322002, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n- **이름**: 고기꾼김춘배 숲길직영점\n- **드라마 제목**: 굿파트너\n- **방문 팁**: 드라마 속 주인공들이 즐긴 맛있는 고기를 직접 맛볼 수 있는 곳입니다.\n\n### 여행 포인트\n고기꾼김춘배 숲길직영점은 드라마 "굿파트너"의 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기에서 다양한 고기 요리를 즐길 수 있는 매력적인 장소입니다. 이곳은 자연과 가까운 환경 속에서 친구와의 소중한 시간을 보내기에 적합하며, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 선사합니다. 편안한 인테리어와 맛있는 음식이 어우러져, 방문객들에게 잊지 못할 경험을 제공합니다.', 'Meatman Kim Chunbae Forest Road Jikyeong Branch is the filming location of the drama Good Partner and is an attractive place where you can enjoy various meat dishes in a cozy atmosphere This place is suitable for spending precious time with friends in an environment close to nature and provides special memories for drama fans The combination of comfortable interior design and delicious food provides visitors with an unforgettable experience'),
	(125, '굿파트너', '영재하숙', '서울 서대문구 연세로4길 75 신촌역1번출구 도보5분', '영재하숙은 드라마 굿파트너의 촬영지로 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 직접 체험할 수 있는 특별한 장소입니다 주변에는 아기자기한 카페와 먹거리가 많아 드라마의 분위기를 만끽하며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보길 추천합니다', '#촬영지 #드라마팬 #카페 #여유 #서울 #굿파트너', '기타/판별불가', 'Youngjae\'s boarding house', 'Good Partner', '5-minute walk from Exit 1 of Sinchon Station 75, Yonsei-ro 4-gil, Seodaemun-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Filming location #Dramafan #Cafe #Relaxed #Seoul #GoodPartner', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bza8Ui/btsJCYdElLC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAUjoxO1TSP6J-oXTzSzb4k7EGnYs_YlHbc2BVWecjF3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=R699BFFOY4oqm43APSFykrfIob4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dOD64P/btsJDHvn3cr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF79G6-ws77eigAEbTSkQYGLluVZnQptDcJHSaENHPtB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nVg5OsWUMP21xCb4%2FtjWOLMwUsY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dplp4L/btsJDWeEBxR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADBLOO83XTt_UX24qQaxzJVIgNHSDPA7HP46SMtXYKJG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TVEJeXHJLi18mqQ1TY%2Fq7LLT%2FTg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bza8Ui/btsJCYdElLC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAUjoxO1TSP6J-oXTzSzb4k7EGnYs_YlHbc2BVWecjF3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=R699BFFOY4oqm43APSFykrfIob4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dOD64P/btsJDHvn3cr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF79G6-ws77eigAEbTSkQYGLluVZnQptDcJHSaENHPtB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nVg5OsWUMP21xCb4%2FtjWOLMwUsY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dplp4L/btsJDWeEBxR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADBLOO83XTt_UX24qQaxzJVIgNHSDPA7HP46SMtXYKJG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TVEJeXHJLi18mqQ1TY%2Fq7LLT%2FTg%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bza8Ui/btsJCYdElLC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAUjoxO1TSP6J-oXTzSzb4k7EGnYs_YlHbc2BVWecjF3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=R699BFFOY4oqm43APSFykrfIob4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dOD64P/btsJDHvn3cr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF79G6-ws77eigAEbTSkQYGLluVZnQptDcJHSaENHPtB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nVg5OsWUMP21xCb4%2FtjWOLMwUsY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dplp4L/btsJDWeEBxR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADBLOO83XTt_UX24qQaxzJVIgNHSDPA7HP46SMtXYKJG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TVEJeXHJLi18mqQ1TY%2Fq7LLT%2FTg%3D', 37.5586931, 126.94054, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 굿파트너\n- **촬영지**: 영재하숙\n- **방문팁**: 드라마 속 주요 장면을 느끼며 커피 한 잔의 여유를 즐겨보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n영재하숙은 드라마 "굿파트너"의 촬영지로, 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 직접 체험할 수 있는 특별한 장소입니다. 주변에는 아기자기한 카페와 먹거리가 많아 드라마의 분위기를 만끽하며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보길 추천합니다.', 'The gifted boarding house is the filming location of the drama Good Partner and is a special place where you can experience the scenes filmed here firsthand There are many cute cafes and food around so you can enjoy the atmosphere of the drama and have a leisurely time If you are a drama fan I recommend you to visit'),
	(126, '굿파트너', '서강대교', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 83-1', '서강대교는 서울의 중심부를 가로지르는 주요 교통로로 드라마 굿파트너의 촬영지로도 유명합니다 이곳에서 차를 타고 지나치며 도심의 아름다운 풍경을 즐길 수 있으며 특히 일출이나 일몰 시간대에는 더욱 매력적인 사진을 찍을 수 있습니다 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 주인공들의 순간을 상상하며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있을 것입니다', '#KdramaTrip, #굿파트너, #서강대교, #서울경관, #드라마촬영지, #일출일몰', '교통/역/터미널', 'Sogang Bridge', 'Good Partner', '83-1 Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'traffic/station/terminal', '#Kdrama Trip, #GoodPartner, #Seogangdaegyo Bridge, #Seoulscape, #DramaShootingPlace, #SundayMall', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UD6Sn/btsIywvjFG6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANX6DYMbvaEHKCUNm5BSGouLkAaMcUEmEBYvlaplg3jD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ywn%2BPTACypLQE%2Fk4QrD23%2B9vRe0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b2P4Vg/btsIxFl2gbM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO1I-SNaxN65EXpc8IJySacFbA7exDT4ePQxRvUD8lTi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=186B%2FXgdl%2Bbf9SAxbk63R11ZNiA%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UD6Sn/btsIywvjFG6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANX6DYMbvaEHKCUNm5BSGouLkAaMcUEmEBYvlaplg3jD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ywn%2BPTACypLQE%2Fk4QrD23%2B9vRe0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b2P4Vg/btsIxFl2gbM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO1I-SNaxN65EXpc8IJySacFbA7exDT4ePQxRvUD8lTi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=186B%2FXgdl%2Bbf9SAxbk63R11ZNiA%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UD6Sn/btsIywvjFG6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANX6DYMbvaEHKCUNm5BSGouLkAaMcUEmEBYvlaplg3jD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ywn%2BPTACypLQE%2Fk4QrD23%2B9vRe0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b2P4Vg/btsIxFl2gbM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO1I-SNaxN65EXpc8IJySacFbA7exDT4ePQxRvUD8lTi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=186B%2FXgdl%2Bbf9SAxbk63R11ZNiA%3D', NULL, 37.5358539, 126.9247942, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 굿파트너\n- **촬영지**: 서강대교\n- **방문팁**: 서강대교에서 서울의 멋진 경관을 감상하며 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올려 보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Transit\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 교통/역\n\n### 여행 포인트\n서강대교는 서울의 중심부를 가로지르는 주요 교통로로, 드라마 "굿파트너"의 촬영지로도 유명합니다. 이곳에서 차를 타고 지나치며 도심의 아름다운 풍경을 즐길 수 있으며, 특히 일출이나 일몰 시간대에는 더욱 매력적인 사진을 찍을 수 있습니다. 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 주인공들의 순간을 상상하며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있을 것입니다.', 'The Seogang Bridge is a major transportation route across the center of Seoul and is also famous as a filming location for the drama Good Partner From here you can enjoy the beautiful scenery of the city center by car especially during sunrise or sunset If you are a drama fan you will be able to have a special experience here imagining the moments of the main characters'),
	(127, '굿파트너', '감고당길', '서울 종로구 송현동 34-2 안국역1번출구 위에서1분', '감고당길은 서울의 독특한 매력을 느낄 수 있는 거리로 드라마 속 장면을 직접 체험하며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 이곳은 조용하고 아늑한 분위기로 친구나 연인과 함께 걷기에 안성맞춤입니다 주변에는 다양한 카페와 식당이 있어 촬영지를 방문한 후 맛있는 음식을 즐길 수 있는 기회도 많습니다 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 들러보세요', '#굿파트너, #촬영지, #감고당길, #드라마팬, #서울여행, #밤풍경', '거리/골목/광장', 'Wrap it around and pull it', 'Good Partner', '1 minute above Exit 1 of Anguk Station, 34-2 Songhyeon-dong, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Good partner, #filming location, #gamgodanggil, #dramafans, #Seoultravel, #nightscape', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uxrwW/btsJDdPdEMm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO4eAw_SfxUZpXrJVptwshPhTPCUwzzjTL75eYgYZjTQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zmnOYHaUVEdGd%2FYh7oYFrAnGX9g%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1mKne/btsJD8zgCWs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHnT-_FQDhpBXDHPeLDPhq_F0Q1BfX8KtTuaeVOJjhcT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=aI8vY81b4pHi7MHQdN4AvlIfY%2Fw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bTrjDC/btsJDIuHjbI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKqHnZm9-jI2tiH93SP3NzvC0P3UGHykMiBEOcSsBpzx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FZKPWeuFbzoHO0i0YhYM24yq3wY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kEXIQ/btsJDQ67r6S/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANmPh2AaJwSbTnNFZ8CT9skHmjArmtd_DFDMwckGjjeS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dd7lDC1oM59cQ2mrUkkjC8Z%2FWxY%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uxrwW/btsJDdPdEMm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO4eAw_SfxUZpXrJVptwshPhTPCUwzzjTL75eYgYZjTQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zmnOYHaUVEdGd%2FYh7oYFrAnGX9g%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1mKne/btsJD8zgCWs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHnT-_FQDhpBXDHPeLDPhq_F0Q1BfX8KtTuaeVOJjhcT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=aI8vY81b4pHi7MHQdN4AvlIfY%2Fw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bTrjDC/btsJDIuHjbI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKqHnZm9-jI2tiH93SP3NzvC0P3UGHykMiBEOcSsBpzx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FZKPWeuFbzoHO0i0YhYM24yq3wY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kEXIQ/btsJDQ67r6S/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANmPh2AaJwSbTnNFZ8CT9skHmjArmtd_DFDMwckGjjeS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dd7lDC1oM59cQ2mrUkkjC8Z%2FWxY%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uxrwW/btsJDdPdEMm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO4eAw_SfxUZpXrJVptwshPhTPCUwzzjTL75eYgYZjTQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zmnOYHaUVEdGd%2FYh7oYFrAnGX9g%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1mKne/btsJD8zgCWs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHnT-_FQDhpBXDHPeLDPhq_F0Q1BfX8KtTuaeVOJjhcT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=aI8vY81b4pHi7MHQdN4AvlIfY%2Fw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bTrjDC/btsJDIuHjbI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKqHnZm9-jI2tiH93SP3NzvC0P3UGHykMiBEOcSsBpzx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FZKPWeuFbzoHO0i0YhYM24yq3wY%3D', 37.5779347, 126.9823293, '### 거리/골목 촬영지: 감고당길\n\n**방문팁:** 감고당길은 드라마 "굿파트너"의 주요 촬영지로, 아름다운 밤 풍경을 즐기며 산책하기 좋은 곳입니다. \n\n**여행 포인트:** 감고당길은 서울의 독특한 매력을 느낄 수 있는 거리로, 드라마 속 장면을 직접 체험하며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 이곳은 조용하고 아늑한 분위기로, 친구나 연인과 함께 걷기에 안성맞춤입니다. 주변에는 다양한 카페와 식당이 있어, 촬영지를 방문한 후 맛있는 음식을 즐길 수 있는 기회도 많습니다. 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 들러보세요! \n\n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene', 'Gomgodanggil is a street where you can feel the unique charm of Seoul and you can spend a leisurely time by experiencing the scenes in the drama firsthand This place has a quiet and cozy atmosphere perfect for walking with friends or lovers There are various cafes and restaurants around so there are many opportunities to enjoy delicious food after visiting the filming location If youre a drama fan make sure to stop by'),
	(128, '굿파트너', '르꼬숑', '서울 종로구 율곡로 83 안국역3번출구 도보2분', '르꼬숑은 드라마 굿파트너의 촬영지로 아름다운 경관과 함께 차분한 분위기를 제공합니다 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼기에 완벽한 장소로 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다 방문 시 주변의 자연을 감상하며 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것을 추천합니다', '#드라마촬영지, #굿파트너, #차분한분위기, #서울여행, #특별한경험', '기타/판별불가', 'Le Cocoon', 'Good Partner', '2-minute walk from Exit 3 of Anguk Station, 83, Yulgok-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Drama filming location, #GoodPartner, #CalmAtmosphere, #SeoulTravel, #SpecialExperience', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kLJ7F/btsIOmGZE4R/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGTZfirxoaZIszx218kTwns0Vy7XNYUvi40kL2CB-q78/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z3kk8jvyeA62gRRxaTtlKqB7%2FQ0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/yzOUB/btsIQpBVdLy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABfo72XMt2M59ouh_4o2SZ4Nr4NbGndpo2TOuE58pi5w/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lfpftF5LU%2BCbGBFcVa84rtWyhBw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d0HqQq/btsIPYY436b/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAyKOMLU5LveioZuK4bQmRi_CzTOs3fyyhsR4nsB4OaA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RINInquAz7Nh8%2BHTYOsmUuxzfZg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kLJ7F/btsIOmGZE4R/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGTZfirxoaZIszx218kTwns0Vy7XNYUvi40kL2CB-q78/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z3kk8jvyeA62gRRxaTtlKqB7%2FQ0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/yzOUB/btsIQpBVdLy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABfo72XMt2M59ouh_4o2SZ4Nr4NbGndpo2TOuE58pi5w/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lfpftF5LU%2BCbGBFcVa84rtWyhBw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d0HqQq/btsIPYY436b/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAyKOMLU5LveioZuK4bQmRi_CzTOs3fyyhsR4nsB4OaA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RINInquAz7Nh8%2BHTYOsmUuxzfZg%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kLJ7F/btsIOmGZE4R/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGTZfirxoaZIszx218kTwns0Vy7XNYUvi40kL2CB-q78/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z3kk8jvyeA62gRRxaTtlKqB7%2FQ0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/yzOUB/btsIQpBVdLy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABfo72XMt2M59ouh_4o2SZ4Nr4NbGndpo2TOuE58pi5w/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lfpftF5LU%2BCbGBFcVa84rtWyhBw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d0HqQq/btsIPYY436b/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAyKOMLU5LveioZuK4bQmRi_CzTOs3fyyhsR4nsB4OaA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RINInquAz7Nh8%2BHTYOsmUuxzfZg%3D', 37.577738, 126.9883615, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 굿파트너\n- **촬영지:** 르꼬숑\n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 주요 장면을 감상하며 특별한 시간을 보내세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n르꼬숑은 드라마 "굿파트너"의 촬영지로, 아름다운 경관과 함께 차분한 분위기를 제공합니다. 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼기에 완벽한 장소로, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다. 방문 시, 주변의 자연을 감상하며 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것을 추천합니다.', 'Le Cocoon is the filming location for the drama Good Partner which offers a calm atmosphere with beautiful scenery This is the perfect place to feel the sensibility of the drama and it will be a special experience for drama fans When visiting it is recommended to spend a leisurely time appreciating the nature around you'),
	(129, '굿파트너', '0914 도산플래그십', '서울 강남구 도산대로45길 15 압구정로데오역5번출구 도보12분', '0914 도산플래그십은 현대적인 인테리어와 고급스러운 패션 아이템으로 가득한 쇼핑 공간입니다 이곳에서는 다양한 브랜드의 독특한 제품들을 직접 체험할 수 있으며 드라마 굿파트너의 촬영지로도 유명해 팬들에게 특별한 방문지가 됩니다 편안한 쇼핑 환경에서 스타일리시한 아이템을 찾는 즐거움을 느껴보세요', '#굿파트너, #쇼핑, #패션, #서울, #고급스러운, #드라마촬영지', '쇼핑몰/백화점', '0914 Bankruptcy Flagship', 'Good Partner', '12 minutes walk from Exit 5 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 15 Dosan-daero 45-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'shopping mall/department store', '#Good partner, #shopping, #fashion, #Seoul, #luxury, #drama set', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Fjk0Y/btsIxYMGPvi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC8L_je0W-qhjh_1GRvx8v4xP3V__p4A4XE9wd0H_FQP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Wuvr0UfwOyO7HYtxu3dsEC3%2BfsU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bT5bqQ/btsIy2HhD3g/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJCBgUwvgTks0DFdbnNe2OxZbtSod0uFmrDRvnMZX26y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0LlJyoaYFCfmye4rRcDVim%2BD2OU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oaadG/btsIx47qKpp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOC_CgpoG8ZUK_c2QddtcG39v9OEmT3lERSU9I6WebtW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Up0Iq%2FX%2Fe%2B1IQtZ3Cl6HIYB7jSg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Fjk0Y/btsIxYMGPvi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC8L_je0W-qhjh_1GRvx8v4xP3V__p4A4XE9wd0H_FQP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Wuvr0UfwOyO7HYtxu3dsEC3%2BfsU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bT5bqQ/btsIy2HhD3g/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJCBgUwvgTks0DFdbnNe2OxZbtSod0uFmrDRvnMZX26y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0LlJyoaYFCfmye4rRcDVim%2BD2OU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oaadG/btsIx47qKpp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOC_CgpoG8ZUK_c2QddtcG39v9OEmT3lERSU9I6WebtW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Up0Iq%2FX%2Fe%2B1IQtZ3Cl6HIYB7jSg%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Fjk0Y/btsIxYMGPvi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC8L_je0W-qhjh_1GRvx8v4xP3V__p4A4XE9wd0H_FQP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Wuvr0UfwOyO7HYtxu3dsEC3%2BfsU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bT5bqQ/btsIy2HhD3g/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJCBgUwvgTks0DFdbnNe2OxZbtSod0uFmrDRvnMZX26y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0LlJyoaYFCfmye4rRcDVim%2BD2OU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oaadG/btsIx47qKpp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOC_CgpoG8ZUK_c2QddtcG39v9OEmT3lERSU9I6WebtW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Up0Iq%2FX%2Fe%2B1IQtZ3Cl6HIYB7jSg%3D', 37.52323130000001, 127.0351261, '### 쇼핑몰 정보\n\n- **제목**: 굿파트너\n- **촬영지**: 0914 도산플래그십\n- **방문팁**: 세련된 디자인의 매장에서 다양한 패션 아이템을 만나보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Mall\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 쇼핑몰\n\n### 여행 포인트\n0914 도산플래그십은 현대적인 인테리어와 고급스러운 패션 아이템으로 가득한 쇼핑 공간입니다. 이곳에서는 다양한 브랜드의 독특한 제품들을 직접 체험할 수 있으며, 드라마 \'굿파트너\'의 촬영지로도 유명해 팬들에게 특별한 방문지가 됩니다. 편안한 쇼핑 환경에서 스타일리시한 아이템을 찾는 즐거움을 느껴보세요.', '0914 Dosan Flagship is a shopping space full of modern interiors and luxurious fashion items Here you can experience unique products from various brands in person and it is also famous as a filming location for the drama Good Partner making it a special destination for fans Feel the joy of finding stylish items in a comfortable shopping environment'),
	(130, '굿파트너', '재경빌딩', '서울 강남구 남부순환로 2947 대치역2번출구 바로앞', '재경빌딩은 도시의 중심에 위치해 있어 드라마 굿파트너의 촬영지로 많은 팬들에게 사랑받고 있습니다 이곳은 현대적인 건축물로 주변의 다양한 카페와 상점들 덕분에 방문객들에게 편리한 접근성을 제공합니다 드라마의 주인공들이 이곳에서 펼치는 이야기를 떠올리며 사진을 찍거나 잠시 쉬어가기에 좋은 장소입니다 또한 인근 지역의 활기찬 분위기와 함께 도시의 매력을 느낄 수 있는 곳이기도 합니다', '#KdramaTrip, #CityBuilding, #굿파트너, #서울여행, #촬영지', '건물', 'Jaekyung Building', 'Good Partner', 'Right in front of Exit 2 of Daechi Station, 2947 Nambu Circulation-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Building', '#Kdrama Trip, #CityBuilding, #GoodPartner, #SeoulTravel, #FilmingPlaces', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qmgSE/btsJe4YBstB/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ6Ev86tEdp-mqeF07BrbsSdAOpWLHvnwACfqrM3NCeg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FI2Dr4%2FGqIEFqiukrbY9PmY19vc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ddyS03/btsJd1V3G5o/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFBmDZVC_A9awZZVsNM1DBriI5DwJq619aLjj6syHDuK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NANiXlEYcbfvdP2B1ctm9DdLBs0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1Doxw/btsJenYy0cF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOg-F7xdIxDADQ-0MqlnRRcBtmiy0zBi-4r6PVQKmrl-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=szhbJKyGP6eBTB79IuUrJE%2B7S6A%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qmgSE/btsJe4YBstB/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ6Ev86tEdp-mqeF07BrbsSdAOpWLHvnwACfqrM3NCeg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FI2Dr4%2FGqIEFqiukrbY9PmY19vc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ddyS03/btsJd1V3G5o/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFBmDZVC_A9awZZVsNM1DBriI5DwJq619aLjj6syHDuK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NANiXlEYcbfvdP2B1ctm9DdLBs0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1Doxw/btsJenYy0cF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOg-F7xdIxDADQ-0MqlnRRcBtmiy0zBi-4r6PVQKmrl-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=szhbJKyGP6eBTB79IuUrJE%2B7S6A%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qmgSE/btsJe4YBstB/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ6Ev86tEdp-mqeF07BrbsSdAOpWLHvnwACfqrM3NCeg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FI2Dr4%2FGqIEFqiukrbY9PmY19vc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ddyS03/btsJd1V3G5o/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFBmDZVC_A9awZZVsNM1DBriI5DwJq619aLjj6syHDuK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NANiXlEYcbfvdP2B1ctm9DdLBs0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1Doxw/btsJenYy0cF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOg-F7xdIxDADQ-0MqlnRRcBtmiy0zBi-4r6PVQKmrl-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=szhbJKyGP6eBTB79IuUrJE%2B7S6A%3D', 37.4945248, 127.062584, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 굿파트너\n- **촬영지:** 재경빌딩\n- **방문팁:** 재경빌딩은 현대적인 도시 풍경 속에서 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\n재경빌딩은 도시의 중심에 위치해 있어, 드라마 \'굿파트너\'의 촬영지로 많은 팬들에게 사랑받고 있습니다. 이곳은 현대적인 건축물로, 주변의 다양한 카페와 상점들 덕분에 방문객들에게 편리한 접근성을 제공합니다. 드라마의 주인공들이 이곳에서 펼치는 이야기를 떠올리며, 사진을 찍거나 잠시 쉬어가기에 좋은 장소입니다. 또한, 인근 지역의 활기찬 분위기와 함께 도시의 매력을 느낄 수 있는 곳이기도 합니다.', 'Located in the center of the city the Jaegyeong Building is loved by many fans as a filming location for the drama Good Partner It is a modern architecture providing convenient access to visitors thanks to the various cafes and shops around it It is a good place to take pictures or take a break recalling the stories of the main characters of the drama here It is also a place where you can feel the charm of the city along with the lively atmosphere of the nearby area'),
	(131, '졸업', '한화손해보험빌딩', '서울 영등포구 여의대로 56 여의도역3번출구 도보5분', '한화손해보험빌딩은 현대적인 건축미와 함께 드라마 졸업의 주요 촬영지로 알려져 있습니다 이곳에서 드라마의 감동적인 순간들을 떠올리며 주변의 다양한 카페와 상점들을 탐방하는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다 도시의 활기찬 분위기 속에서 특별한 사진을 남기기에 완벽한 장소입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #한화손해보험빌딩, #서울여행, #도시풍경, #모던건축, #졸업', '건물', 'Hanwha Insurance Building', 'Graduation', '5-minute walk from Exit 3 of Yeouido Station, 56, Yeouido-daero, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'Building', '#Drama filming location, #Hanwha Insurance Building, #SeoulTravel, #Cityscape, #ModernArchitecture, #graduation', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/L6x3P/btsHosGyMNS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPAo8pwNExEbo_Ryf7aQ9W_3bjDC8YKRxsTnNMWNTcfk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NlRvts0VwA%2BLDW8j8Rc%2BWg9VzH0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bsEoLG/btsHodpcsWU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK5KTIrJX9nPUQBQa1bEGDXbfU_9m_J_bJhLx8SMPkD3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rvYLln%2FA12Ud58DQVrdhMfF4FTA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/A7XZL/btsHnJIMFFn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOD4scE7BMbRmIcvf1Wlajh40TcUSKOfrJVwl5jWTiy4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FpjBQBgEVlXV9Lhgb2VpS0B4sv8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/L6x3P/btsHosGyMNS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPAo8pwNExEbo_Ryf7aQ9W_3bjDC8YKRxsTnNMWNTcfk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NlRvts0VwA%2BLDW8j8Rc%2BWg9VzH0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bsEoLG/btsHodpcsWU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK5KTIrJX9nPUQBQa1bEGDXbfU_9m_J_bJhLx8SMPkD3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rvYLln%2FA12Ud58DQVrdhMfF4FTA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/A7XZL/btsHnJIMFFn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOD4scE7BMbRmIcvf1Wlajh40TcUSKOfrJVwl5jWTiy4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FpjBQBgEVlXV9Lhgb2VpS0B4sv8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/L6x3P/btsHosGyMNS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPAo8pwNExEbo_Ryf7aQ9W_3bjDC8YKRxsTnNMWNTcfk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NlRvts0VwA%2BLDW8j8Rc%2BWg9VzH0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bsEoLG/btsHodpcsWU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK5KTIrJX9nPUQBQa1bEGDXbfU_9m_J_bJhLx8SMPkD3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rvYLln%2FA12Ud58DQVrdhMfF4FTA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/A7XZL/btsHnJIMFFn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOD4scE7BMbRmIcvf1Wlajh40TcUSKOfrJVwl5jWTiy4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FpjBQBgEVlXV9Lhgb2VpS0B4sv8%3D', 37.5239739, 126.9229578, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: 한화손해보험빌딩\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 중요한 장면들이 촬영된 장소로, 방문 시 주변 경관을 함께 즐길 수 있습니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\n한화손해보험빌딩은 현대적인 건축미와 함께 드라마 "졸업"의 주요 촬영지로 알려져 있습니다. 이곳에서 드라마의 감동적인 순간들을 떠올리며, 주변의 다양한 카페와 상점들을 탐방하는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다. 도시의 활기찬 분위기 속에서 특별한 사진을 남기기에 완벽한 장소입니다.', 'Hanwha Insurance Building is known for its modern architectural beauty as the main filming location for the drama Graduation It will also be a good experience to explore various cafes and shops around here recalling the touching moments of the drama It is the perfect place to take special pictures in the lively atmosphere of the city'),
	(132, '졸업', 'CU이태원공원점', '서울 용산구 녹사평대로40나길 84 이태원역1번출구 도보10분', 'CU이태원공원점은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 이곳에서의 순간들은 시청자들에게 특별한 기억으로 남습니다 이태원의 독특한 분위기를 느끼며 주변의 다양한 식당과 카페를 즐길 수 있는 좋은 위치에 있습니다 드라마 팬이라면 이곳을 방문해 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 여유로운 시간을 보내보세요', '#촬영지 #이태원 #드라마 #카페탐방 #졸업 #추억', '기타/판별불가', 'CU Itaewon Park Store', 'Graduation', '10-minute walk from Exit 1 of Itaewon Station, 84, Noksapyeong-daero 40-na-gil, Yongsan-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Filming location #Itaewon #Drama #CafeTravel #Graduation #Memories', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bwkxwZ/btsHKb0DMp9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGD795kaD1z2UruJxH0LbBQ7TjJGuHfg01RbkZfJ8prW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=GRHDqFvVXZ5ivxXMB%2FVefF4srlY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bj5ePm/btsHKGsirdE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABQMrJ7dMAaZV8y03PlZ4-gImDhLb-KtC59AzUTjaJsH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PORaGRm%2BGTVi%2FexZiUqPFyyIOW4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZocPh/btsHMxUWXSZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHy4jRIaIHfASoPzlHIZszlpH3-zrmy1_aFtny1bQ2hi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sA1fWoM%2BbwZqwqZB0xv4Cu%2FHJ6c%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bL8R1J/btsHLdQFgdp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFbaXE6qKcaqoeC6aNvmSH3c4Sk42Vh5rFmodokyWfe4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MmgPmouze79GJpk89e5eYmAcZdE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bwkxwZ/btsHKb0DMp9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGD795kaD1z2UruJxH0LbBQ7TjJGuHfg01RbkZfJ8prW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=GRHDqFvVXZ5ivxXMB%2FVefF4srlY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bj5ePm/btsHKGsirdE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABQMrJ7dMAaZV8y03PlZ4-gImDhLb-KtC59AzUTjaJsH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PORaGRm%2BGTVi%2FexZiUqPFyyIOW4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZocPh/btsHMxUWXSZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHy4jRIaIHfASoPzlHIZszlpH3-zrmy1_aFtny1bQ2hi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sA1fWoM%2BbwZqwqZB0xv4Cu%2FHJ6c%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bL8R1J/btsHLdQFgdp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFbaXE6qKcaqoeC6aNvmSH3c4Sk42Vh5rFmodokyWfe4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MmgPmouze79GJpk89e5eYmAcZdE%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bwkxwZ/btsHKb0DMp9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGD795kaD1z2UruJxH0LbBQ7TjJGuHfg01RbkZfJ8prW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=GRHDqFvVXZ5ivxXMB%2FVefF4srlY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bj5ePm/btsHKGsirdE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABQMrJ7dMAaZV8y03PlZ4-gImDhLb-KtC59AzUTjaJsH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PORaGRm%2BGTVi%2FexZiUqPFyyIOW4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZocPh/btsHMxUWXSZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHy4jRIaIHfASoPzlHIZszlpH3-zrmy1_aFtny1bQ2hi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sA1fWoM%2BbwZqwqZB0xv4Cu%2FHJ6c%3D', 37.5378807, 126.9896274, '### 졸업 - 촬영지 정보\n\n**촬영지:** CU이태원공원점  \n**방문팁:** 드라마의 감성을 느끼며, 주변의 다양한 카페와 상점을 탐방해보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 기타  \n\n### 여행 포인트\nCU이태원공원점은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 이곳에서의 순간들은 시청자들에게 특별한 기억으로 남습니다. 이태원의 독특한 분위기를 느끼며, 주변의 다양한 식당과 카페를 즐길 수 있는 좋은 위치에 있습니다. 드라마 팬이라면 이곳을 방문해 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 여유로운 시간을 보내보세요.', 'CU Itaewon Park is the filming location of the drama Graduation and its moments remain a special memory for viewers It is a great place to enjoy various restaurants and cafes around Itaewon while feeling the unique atmosphere of Itaewon If youre a drama fan visit here and spend your free time reminding you of the shot'),
	(133, '졸업', '이태원어린이공원', '서울 용산구 이태원동 290-9 이태원역1번출구 위에서1분', '이태원 어린이공원은 다양한 나무와 조용한 산책로가 있어 도심 속에서 자연을 만끽할 수 있는 곳입니다 드라마 졸업의 중요한 장면들이 촬영된 이곳은 방문객들에게 감성적인 분위기를 제공합니다 특히 저녁 시간대에는 조명이 켜져 더욱 아늑한 느낌을 주며 사진 촬영하기에도 좋은 장소입니다 주변에는 다양한 카페와 음식점도 있어 드라마 촬영지를 둘러본 후 여유롭게 휴식을 취하기에도 적합합니다', '#KdramaTrip #이태원 #졸업 #산책로 #느낌있는장소 #저녁산책', '공원/숲/산', 'Itaewon Children\'s Park', 'Graduation', '1 minute above Exit 1 of Itaewon Station 290-9 Itaewon-dong, Yongsan-gu, Seoul', 'a park/forest/mountain', '#KdramaTrip #Itaewon #graduation #walk #feelplace #eveningwalk', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cICOhZ/btsIirUSqNl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHWyRr2isVr1B0tIQSp-e4897AaX4JsJXAfe66ukI46k/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yQGngS3MovYA13wf2xycAT2hF1A%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cr99PD/btsIhcq4mB1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABZQKvGLTCs2N0Z4gj8aXehYl_-ZY9eXYK8O_vsG7bCp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=K1jb%2BXGBJtOoSRAPK88LcGPYTKU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bcxd4l/btsIjdaMoKJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA-S5MasAuBYgRSbHoF1ZAORs40Q0cX4-PwCl0EZH_o5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ieSYVFpqNvW9xWlv65qmAMzfCt0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cICOhZ/btsIirUSqNl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHWyRr2isVr1B0tIQSp-e4897AaX4JsJXAfe66ukI46k/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yQGngS3MovYA13wf2xycAT2hF1A%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cr99PD/btsIhcq4mB1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABZQKvGLTCs2N0Z4gj8aXehYl_-ZY9eXYK8O_vsG7bCp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=K1jb%2BXGBJtOoSRAPK88LcGPYTKU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bcxd4l/btsIjdaMoKJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA-S5MasAuBYgRSbHoF1ZAORs40Q0cX4-PwCl0EZH_o5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ieSYVFpqNvW9xWlv65qmAMzfCt0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cICOhZ/btsIirUSqNl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHWyRr2isVr1B0tIQSp-e4897AaX4JsJXAfe66ukI46k/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yQGngS3MovYA13wf2xycAT2hF1A%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cr99PD/btsIhcq4mB1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABZQKvGLTCs2N0Z4gj8aXehYl_-ZY9eXYK8O_vsG7bCp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=K1jb%2BXGBJtOoSRAPK88LcGPYTKU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bcxd4l/btsIjdaMoKJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA-S5MasAuBYgRSbHoF1ZAORs40Q0cX4-PwCl0EZH_o5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ieSYVFpqNvW9xWlv65qmAMzfCt0%3D', 37.5382279, 126.9891044, '### 이태원 어린이공원\n\n**촬영지**: 이태원 어린이공원  \n**방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.  \n**키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Park  \n**작가**: 미상  \n**카테고리**: 공원  \n\n**여행 포인트**: 이태원 어린이공원은 다양한 나무와 조용한 산책로가 있어 도심 속에서 자연을 만끽할 수 있는 곳입니다. 드라마 \'졸업\'의 중요한 장면들이 촬영된 이곳은, 방문객들에게 감성적인 분위기를 제공합니다. 특히 저녁 시간대에는 조명이 켜져 더욱 아늑한 느낌을 주며, 사진 촬영하기에도 좋은 장소입니다. 주변에는 다양한 카페와 음식점도 있어, 드라마 촬영지를 둘러본 후 여유롭게 휴식을 취하기에도 적합합니다.', 'Itaewon Childrens Park is a place where you can enjoy nature in the city center with various trees and quiet trails This place where important scenes from the drama Graduation were filmed provides an emotional atmosphere for visitors Especially in the evening the lights are turned on to make it feel more cozy and it is also a good place to take pictures There are also various cafes and restaurants nearby so it is also suitable for relaxing after looking around the filming location of the drama'),
	(134, '졸업', '남매집', '서울 중구 남대문로1길 41 시청역7번출구 도보3분', '남매집은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 아늑한 분위기와 맛있는 메뉴로 많은 이들의 사랑을 받고 있습니다 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 그대로 느낄 수 있는 장소로 친구나 가족과 함께 소중한 추억을 만들기에 적합합니다 카페 내부는 아기자기한 인테리어로 꾸며져 있으며 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보아야 할 명소입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #카페, #졸업, #여유, #추억', '카페/레스토랑', 'a brother-sister\'s house', 'Graduation', '3 minutes walk from Exit 7 of City Hall Station 41, Namdaemun-ro 1-gil, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Drama filming location, #café, #graduation, #relaxation, #memories', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HOAs9/btsHowhTFNd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIvjrvyA6U0KpyFH5PeI6tVt-tAFT1rmQfW7nfC8tDP7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zD17TCaaSw19bQLwA6ELqKFP4Dc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tzmDW/btsHosGyMXM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPYiBIPqRFNPWtb4K2ahJnLcsQFkSfXK7M4FYuAQYyjr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6Dx3i9ZZKdoiAN3qdHCzW%2B8bSaY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xE59q/btsHntTzCwt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACIX3d-PHLIuVRUHUNu9P0nUUkhwKF4L2r18Hir6bsk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zMZe8X7gNHlf7iqMMVvmO1Hvewk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kSLtx/btsHmVQyI1t/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJRWTe7el5L5s6PZrNqXBTKZ4MgoO4AVqK9Ty_JUL-uU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UcRRUnoU0CbxRqd2d0JiJOpTSB8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HOAs9/btsHowhTFNd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIvjrvyA6U0KpyFH5PeI6tVt-tAFT1rmQfW7nfC8tDP7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zD17TCaaSw19bQLwA6ELqKFP4Dc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tzmDW/btsHosGyMXM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPYiBIPqRFNPWtb4K2ahJnLcsQFkSfXK7M4FYuAQYyjr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6Dx3i9ZZKdoiAN3qdHCzW%2B8bSaY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xE59q/btsHntTzCwt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACIX3d-PHLIuVRUHUNu9P0nUUkhwKF4L2r18Hir6bsk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zMZe8X7gNHlf7iqMMVvmO1Hvewk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kSLtx/btsHmVQyI1t/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJRWTe7el5L5s6PZrNqXBTKZ4MgoO4AVqK9Ty_JUL-uU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UcRRUnoU0CbxRqd2d0JiJOpTSB8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HOAs9/btsHowhTFNd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIvjrvyA6U0KpyFH5PeI6tVt-tAFT1rmQfW7nfC8tDP7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zD17TCaaSw19bQLwA6ELqKFP4Dc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tzmDW/btsHosGyMXM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPYiBIPqRFNPWtb4K2ahJnLcsQFkSfXK7M4FYuAQYyjr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6Dx3i9ZZKdoiAN3qdHCzW%2B8bSaY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xE59q/btsHntTzCwt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACIX3d-PHLIuVRUHUNu9P0nUUkhwKF4L2r18Hir6bsk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zMZe8X7gNHlf7iqMMVvmO1Hvewk%3D', 37.5628737, 126.9771998, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: 남매집\n- **방문팁**: 드라마 속 감성을 느끼며 여유롭게 시간을 보내기 좋은 곳입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n남매집은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기와 맛있는 메뉴로 많은 이들의 사랑을 받고 있습니다. 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 그대로 느낄 수 있는 장소로, 친구나 가족과 함께 소중한 추억을 만들기에 적합합니다. 카페 내부는 아기자기한 인테리어로 꾸며져 있으며, 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보아야 할 명소입니다.', 'Sibling House is the filming location of the drama Graduation and is loved by many for its cozy atmosphere and delicious menu This is a place where you can feel the emotions of the drama as it is and it is suitable for making precious memories with friends and family The interior of the cafe is decorated with cute interiors and it is a mustvisit spot for drama fans'),
	(135, '졸업', '바나프레소 교육개발원사거리점', '서울 서초구 강남대로27길 7-21 양재역9번출구 도보8분', '바나프레소 교육개발원사거리점은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 아늑한 분위기에서 다양한 커피와 디저트를 즐길 수 있는 장소입니다 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 곳으로 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 카페 내부는 현대적인 디자인으로 편안한 좌석이 마련되어 있어 친구와의 대화나 혼자만의 시간을 보내기에 적합합니다 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 커피 한 잔의 여유를 즐겨보세요', '#졸업 #카페 #드라마촬영지 #커피 #서울 #여유', '카페/레스토랑', 'Banapresso Educational Development Institute Intersection', 'Graduation', '7-21 Gangnam-daero 27-gil, Seocho-gu, Seoul, 8 minutes walk from Exit 9 of Yangjae Station', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Graduation #Cafe #DramaShoot #Coffee #Seoul #Relaxed', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cl3pzb/btsIhK8F2XH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANWFTFHzCVn4A1ZfQII9h4vK5T7Hu9Xp9jrJ_Ky9hN8e/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vhYMOId3jg2BhC4uhcq2HzeaKow%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dtLiGe/btsIibre1vg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADhu-ia2Cj3oQjqHl7wkhW_mnyWKTlFsFBYNQGNPax79/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=z4YjtwR7siDHYJWKmUaDI0ee3aM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dOrsjc/btsIhdpY5uK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIWKoWBSv93vwv7XI01BJyrlAV79WAI5ZiwDoGIiJyY7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9%2FuGSa%2ByRapuJs7%2FlzcdYgfnpoE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/JxLoo/btsIinLHUD8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG8P1XZFn9Jg5uhBHB69QE4PZf_xPeN2CV7UTqDVzhpu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=06CFiLM473pN12z0oiFZnRHmDKU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cl3pzb/btsIhK8F2XH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANWFTFHzCVn4A1ZfQII9h4vK5T7Hu9Xp9jrJ_Ky9hN8e/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vhYMOId3jg2BhC4uhcq2HzeaKow%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dtLiGe/btsIibre1vg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADhu-ia2Cj3oQjqHl7wkhW_mnyWKTlFsFBYNQGNPax79/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=z4YjtwR7siDHYJWKmUaDI0ee3aM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dOrsjc/btsIhdpY5uK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIWKoWBSv93vwv7XI01BJyrlAV79WAI5ZiwDoGIiJyY7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9%2FuGSa%2ByRapuJs7%2FlzcdYgfnpoE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/JxLoo/btsIinLHUD8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG8P1XZFn9Jg5uhBHB69QE4PZf_xPeN2CV7UTqDVzhpu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=06CFiLM473pN12z0oiFZnRHmDKU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cl3pzb/btsIhK8F2XH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANWFTFHzCVn4A1ZfQII9h4vK5T7Hu9Xp9jrJ_Ky9hN8e/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vhYMOId3jg2BhC4uhcq2HzeaKow%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dtLiGe/btsIibre1vg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADhu-ia2Cj3oQjqHl7wkhW_mnyWKTlFsFBYNQGNPax79/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=z4YjtwR7siDHYJWKmUaDI0ee3aM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dOrsjc/btsIhdpY5uK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIWKoWBSv93vwv7XI01BJyrlAV79WAI5ZiwDoGIiJyY7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9%2FuGSa%2ByRapuJs7%2FlzcdYgfnpoE%3D', 37.4782625, 127.0380572, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n- **제목:** 졸업\n- **촬영지:** 바나프레소 교육개발원사거리점\n- **방문팁:** 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유롭게 커피를 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n바나프레소 교육개발원사거리점은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기에서 다양한 커피와 디저트를 즐길 수 있는 장소입니다. 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 곳으로, 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 카페 내부는 현대적인 디자인으로 편안한 좌석이 마련되어 있어, 친구와의 대화나 혼자만의 시간을 보내기에 적합합니다. 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 커피 한 잔의 여유를 즐겨보세요.', 'Banapresso Education Development Institute Street is the filming location of the drama Graduation and it is a place where you can enjoy various coffees and desserts in a cozy atmosphere This is where the main scenes of the drama were filmed providing fans with a special experience The interior of the cafe has a modern design with comfortable seating perfect for talking with friends or spending time alone Feel the sensibility of the drama and enjoy a cup of coffee'),
	(136, '졸업', '비앤테일러(이전 하기 전)', '서울 강남구 도산대로81길 31 압구정로데오역2번출구 도보9분', '비앤테일러는 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 다양한 패션 아이템으로 유명합니다 이곳에서는 드라마 속 주인공들이 착용했던 스타일을 직접 체험할 수 있으며 소중한 추억을 남길 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다 쇼핑과 함께 드라마의 매력을 느껴보세요', '#졸업, #쇼핑, #패션, #서울, #드라마촬영지', '쇼핑몰/백화점', 'B&Taylor (before relocation)', 'Graduation', '9 minutes walk from Exit 2 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 31, Dosan-daero 81-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'shopping mall/department store', '#Graduation, #Shopping, #Fashion, #Seoul, #DramaFilmingPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bN7AWp/btsHROqtFcf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMC2gtDagmtrYweQ3MavfPlaVpa7kz46oVAARpsGvvh2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Onf3tjuQDUGljzlkx7iUYo%2BOitM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bzj3dZ/btsHSVPzQo1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJPOlmuWYHbrDIBdBq7wx8UiT-wiItkeFdh0ovjqfjQh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nlZkYk6h6ukNBslQKFE7%2BJ42QlU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZEZix/btsHRo6KFm5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD2108cBbPXNoZ3HToj8XnedsL5biHEZ39uzws54GIRF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VgsRvswuaaYJKFHobYU7veJV%2FMI%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bN7AWp/btsHROqtFcf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMC2gtDagmtrYweQ3MavfPlaVpa7kz46oVAARpsGvvh2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Onf3tjuQDUGljzlkx7iUYo%2BOitM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bzj3dZ/btsHSVPzQo1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJPOlmuWYHbrDIBdBq7wx8UiT-wiItkeFdh0ovjqfjQh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nlZkYk6h6ukNBslQKFE7%2BJ42QlU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZEZix/btsHRo6KFm5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD2108cBbPXNoZ3HToj8XnedsL5biHEZ39uzws54GIRF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VgsRvswuaaYJKFHobYU7veJV%2FMI%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bN7AWp/btsHROqtFcf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMC2gtDagmtrYweQ3MavfPlaVpa7kz46oVAARpsGvvh2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Onf3tjuQDUGljzlkx7iUYo%2BOitM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bzj3dZ/btsHSVPzQo1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJPOlmuWYHbrDIBdBq7wx8UiT-wiItkeFdh0ovjqfjQh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nlZkYk6h6ukNBslQKFE7%2BJ42QlU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZEZix/btsHRo6KFm5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD2108cBbPXNoZ3HToj8XnedsL5biHEZ39uzws54GIRF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VgsRvswuaaYJKFHobYU7veJV%2FMI%3D', 37.5264128, 127.0470072, '### 졸업 촬영지: 비앤테일러\n\n**방문 팁:** 비앤테일러에서 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 특별한 쇼핑 경험을 즐겨보세요.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 비앤테일러는 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 다양한 패션 아이템으로 유명합니다. 이곳에서는 드라마 속 주인공들이 착용했던 스타일을 직접 체험할 수 있으며, 소중한 추억을 남길 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다. 쇼핑과 함께 드라마의 매력을 느껴보세요!', 'BTaylor is the filming location of the drama Graduation famous for its stylish interiors and various fashion items Here you can experience the style worn by the main characters in the drama and provide an opportunity to leave precious memories Enjoy the charm of the drama with shopping'),
	(137, '졸업', '깨비대왕', '서울 강남구 선릉로157길 23-3 압구정로데오역5번출구 도보4분', '깨비대왕은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 독특한 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 특징입니다 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 장소로 팬들에게는 잊지 못할 추억을 선사합니다 방문 시 드라마의 감정을 느끼며 사진을 찍거나 친구들과 함께 이야기를 나누기에 좋은 공간입니다 다양한 소품과 장식들이 잘 어우러져 있어 인스타그램에 올리기에도 완벽한 배경이 될 것입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #서울여행, #깨비대왕, #졸업, #아늑한공간, #사진명소', '기타/판별불가', 'King Kkaebi of Kkaebi', 'Graduation', '4 minutes walk from Exit 5 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 23-3 Seonneung-ro 157-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Drama filming location, #Seoultravel, #GoblinKing, #graduation, #friendlyspace, #photoattractions', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/OjS5f/btsH8DovRFn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL1kOnV5BK30F4K2yba0Y5q6r3uWmBVkefq7heGKtL85/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2F7SPFSY2PhmNiIIeMI5ToP7prhs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Uixll/btsH8jKCCD4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFryzi8L1DBfwH5lzrDhfCjzM3gjwPTfKrs4ZUEiBKLn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=upW4CtCGskrAiw3CiD8hAlAnIzQ%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/OjS5f/btsH8DovRFn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL1kOnV5BK30F4K2yba0Y5q6r3uWmBVkefq7heGKtL85/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2F7SPFSY2PhmNiIIeMI5ToP7prhs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Uixll/btsH8jKCCD4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFryzi8L1DBfwH5lzrDhfCjzM3gjwPTfKrs4ZUEiBKLn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=upW4CtCGskrAiw3CiD8hAlAnIzQ%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/OjS5f/btsH8DovRFn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL1kOnV5BK30F4K2yba0Y5q6r3uWmBVkefq7heGKtL85/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2F7SPFSY2PhmNiIIeMI5ToP7prhs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Uixll/btsH8jKCCD4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFryzi8L1DBfwH5lzrDhfCjzM3gjwPTfKrs4ZUEiBKLn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=upW4CtCGskrAiw3CiD8hAlAnIzQ%3D', NULL, 37.52598589999999, 127.0378994, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: 깨비대왕\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 특별한 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n깨비대왕은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 독특한 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 특징입니다. 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 장소로, 팬들에게는 잊지 못할 추억을 선사합니다. 방문 시, 드라마의 감정을 느끼며 사진을 찍거나, 친구들과 함께 이야기를 나누기에 좋은 공간입니다. 다양한 소품과 장식들이 잘 어우러져 있어, 인스타그램에 올리기에도 완벽한 배경이 될 것입니다.', 'The Great Ggaebi is the filming location of the drama Graduation which features unique interior design and a cozy atmosphere This is the place where the main scenes of the drama were filmed giving fans unforgettable memories When visiting it is a good place to take pictures while feeling the emotions of the drama or to talk with friends The combination of various props and decorations will make it the perfect background for Instagram'),
	(138, '졸업', '플르서라구뜨', '서울 강남구 압구정로46길 23 압구정로데오역5번출구 위에서4분', '플르서라구뜨는 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 세련된 카페와 상점들이 즐비한 거리입니다 이곳에서 느긋하게 커피를 마시며 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올려보세요 주변의 현대적인 분위기와 아기자기한 매력이 어우러져 사진 찍기에도 좋은 장소입니다 압구정로46길을 따라 걷다 보면 다양한 문화와 예술의 숨결을 느낄 수 있어 여행의 즐거움을 더해줍니다', '#KdramaTrip #압구정로46길 #로맨스 #여유 #산책 #카페', '거리/골목/광장', 'Flurratt', 'Graduation', '4 minutes above Exit 5 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 23, Apgujeong-ro 46-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #Apgujeong-ro 46-gil #Romance #Relax #Walk #Café', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/SDfDW/btsIifG642a/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKC7VsXCETUVxUq3iDTBzOVFqFb9S3FmoF89KpLDp8vD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Wme3cXeinhyDNtRaSGLAD7LKTfU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kNohY/btsIiVVHmQW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGTcty9POnRMnwTPMf2mrcfQrWqngvm9UiY7gxvY5nj8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7vQfDpl5yNWfR8PHGrTe9cf%2B2%2BQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cbOOJn/btsIhKU7LAN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJIB8gtYQ7QevZigBryK69PNeHloHNsLJ0BwV-VymtnX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7K%2Bx7ogwwKYpb259SDzTkSyw%2Fvs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qKx1e/btsIg0qT5YZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGpK13wupp5mQOy7W3Xh7WvY4BU0c_KYSbWNRhYF2BqQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IwiXScYcsUh7cIfXYGID6dijoKo%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/SDfDW/btsIifG642a/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKC7VsXCETUVxUq3iDTBzOVFqFb9S3FmoF89KpLDp8vD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Wme3cXeinhyDNtRaSGLAD7LKTfU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kNohY/btsIiVVHmQW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGTcty9POnRMnwTPMf2mrcfQrWqngvm9UiY7gxvY5nj8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7vQfDpl5yNWfR8PHGrTe9cf%2B2%2BQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cbOOJn/btsIhKU7LAN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJIB8gtYQ7QevZigBryK69PNeHloHNsLJ0BwV-VymtnX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7K%2Bx7ogwwKYpb259SDzTkSyw%2Fvs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qKx1e/btsIg0qT5YZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGpK13wupp5mQOy7W3Xh7WvY4BU0c_KYSbWNRhYF2BqQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IwiXScYcsUh7cIfXYGID6dijoKo%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/SDfDW/btsIifG642a/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKC7VsXCETUVxUq3iDTBzOVFqFb9S3FmoF89KpLDp8vD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Wme3cXeinhyDNtRaSGLAD7LKTfU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kNohY/btsIiVVHmQW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGTcty9POnRMnwTPMf2mrcfQrWqngvm9UiY7gxvY5nj8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7vQfDpl5yNWfR8PHGrTe9cf%2B2%2BQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cbOOJn/btsIhKU7LAN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJIB8gtYQ7QevZigBryK69PNeHloHNsLJ0BwV-VymtnX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7K%2Bx7ogwwKYpb259SDzTkSyw%2Fvs%3D', 37.5271629, 127.0364884, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 졸업\n- **촬영지:** 플르서라구뜨\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유롭게 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #압구정로46길\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 거리\n\n### 여행 포인트\n플르서라구뜨는 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 세련된 카페와 상점들이 즐비한 거리입니다. 이곳에서 느긋하게 커피를 마시며 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올려보세요. 주변의 현대적인 분위기와 아기자기한 매력이 어우러져, 사진 찍기에도 좋은 장소입니다. 압구정로46길을 따라 걷다 보면, 다양한 문화와 예술의 숨결을 느낄 수 있어 여행의 즐거움을 더해줍니다.', 'Placeroute is the filming location of the drama Graduation a street full of stylish cafes and shops Recall a scene from the drama while relaxing and drinking coffee here It is a great place to take pictures with the modern atmosphere and cute charm around it Walking along Apgujeongro 46gil you can feel the breath of various cultures and arts adding to the joy of traveling'),
	(139, '졸업', '안다즈 서울강남', '서울 강남구 논현로 854 압구정역3번출구 바로앞', '안다즈 서울강남은 세련된 디자인과 편안한 분위기로 유명합니다 이곳은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 멋진 도시 풍경을 배경으로 한 장면들이 인상적입니다 호텔 주변에는 다양한 카페와 레스토랑이 있어 식사나 여가를 즐기기에 좋은 위치에 있습니다 또한 교통이 편리하여 서울의 주요 명소로의 접근이 용이합니다', '#호텔 #촬영지 #세련됨 #편안함 #도시풍경 #KdramaTrip', '호텔/숙소', 'Andaz Seoul Gangnam', 'Graduation', 'Right in front of Exit 3 of Apgujeong Station, 854, Nonhyeon-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a hotel/dormitory', '#Hotel #FilmingPlace #Sophisticated #Comfortable #Cityscape #KdramaTrip', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Ixi7R/btsHJStro6z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALmU1z07uk0MDCMb0Xbn2hmU2zxVUJOr4KJ2cdeGI7IX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4vQSDgUhE60%2FV6vEwMuiqyy4VJE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bH0YdE/btsHLafuacm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOAU6MB1Kart_PKI_rKF6vzfv2roaTCJh3I4qEFXqO9J/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2B%2FWRyYClLFVwEbJLFcrKmYtHsMM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Ixi7R/btsHJStro6z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALmU1z07uk0MDCMb0Xbn2hmU2zxVUJOr4KJ2cdeGI7IX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4vQSDgUhE60%2FV6vEwMuiqyy4VJE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bH0YdE/btsHLafuacm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOAU6MB1Kart_PKI_rKF6vzfv2roaTCJh3I4qEFXqO9J/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2B%2FWRyYClLFVwEbJLFcrKmYtHsMM%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Ixi7R/btsHJStro6z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALmU1z07uk0MDCMb0Xbn2hmU2zxVUJOr4KJ2cdeGI7IX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4vQSDgUhE60%2FV6vEwMuiqyy4VJE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bH0YdE/btsHLafuacm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOAU6MB1Kart_PKI_rKF6vzfv2roaTCJh3I4qEFXqO9J/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2B%2FWRyYClLFVwEbJLFcrKmYtHsMM%3D', NULL, 37.5254187, 127.028869, '### 호텔 정보\n- **호텔명**: 안다즈 서울강남\n- **주소**: 서울 강남구 논현로 854\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Hotel\n\n### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: 안다즈 서울강남\n- **방문팁**: 현대적이고 세련된 분위기의 이 호텔에서 편안한 휴식을 즐겨보세요.\n\n### 여행 포인트\n안다즈 서울강남은 세련된 디자인과 편안한 분위기로 유명합니다. 이곳은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 멋진 도시 풍경을 배경으로 한 장면들이 인상적입니다. 호텔 주변에는 다양한 카페와 레스토랑이 있어, 식사나 여가를 즐기기에 좋은 위치에 있습니다. 또한, 교통이 편리하여 서울의 주요 명소로의 접근이 용이합니다.', 'Andaz Seoul Gangnam is famous for its sophisticated design and comfortable atmosphere This is the filming location of the drama Graduation and the scenes set in the wonderful cityscape are impressive There are various cafes and restaurants around the hotel so its a great place to enjoy meals or leisure Also the convenience of transportation makes it easy to access major attractions in Seoul'),
	(140, '졸업', '육구공', '서울 강남구 도산대로15길 16 신사역8번출구 도보7분', '육구공은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 아늑한 분위기와 독특한 인테리어가 매력적인 곳입니다 이곳에서 드라마의 한 장면처럼 친구나 연인과 함께 맛있는 음식을 즐기며 특별한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 촬영된 장소를 직접 방문하면 드라마의 감정을 더욱 깊이 느낄 수 있을 것입니다', '#촬영지 #카페 #친구 #연인 #아늑한분위기 #맛집', '카페/레스토랑', 'a meat ball', 'Graduation', '7-minute walk from Exit 8 of Sinsa Station, 16, Dosan-daero 15-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Filming location #Café #Friend #Lover #CozyAtmosphere #Nice Restaurant', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ejECtW/btsHtq4XLqa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKIcqTSmqaBeVtzJURioyn4k8SSDXplDiXISFiTvvnS-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CHwYtjcXskNxC66pT4iYJoAgQx8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dHkel7/btsHt0R0fJx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHJfre_0awFvaR6EwW7xjWL_47L2fhZz9GnsrVYNG_NV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BXAWuw0biLJ78a92yfchZ0eAnb0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ejECtW/btsHtq4XLqa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKIcqTSmqaBeVtzJURioyn4k8SSDXplDiXISFiTvvnS-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CHwYtjcXskNxC66pT4iYJoAgQx8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dHkel7/btsHt0R0fJx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHJfre_0awFvaR6EwW7xjWL_47L2fhZz9GnsrVYNG_NV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BXAWuw0biLJ78a92yfchZ0eAnb0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ejECtW/btsHtq4XLqa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKIcqTSmqaBeVtzJURioyn4k8SSDXplDiXISFiTvvnS-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CHwYtjcXskNxC66pT4iYJoAgQx8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dHkel7/btsHt0R0fJx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHJfre_0awFvaR6EwW7xjWL_47L2fhZz9GnsrVYNG_NV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BXAWuw0biLJ78a92yfchZ0eAnb0%3D', NULL, 37.5193159, 127.0240096, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: 육구공\n- **방문팁**: 이곳에서 드라마 속 감성을 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n육구공은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기와 독특한 인테리어가 매력적인 곳입니다. 이곳에서 드라마의 한 장면처럼 친구나 연인과 함께 맛있는 음식을 즐기며 특별한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 촬영된 장소를 직접 방문하면 드라마의 감정을 더욱 깊이 느낄 수 있을 것입니다.', 'Yukgugong is the filming location of the drama Graduation and it is a charming place with a cozy atmosphere and unique interior design Like a scene in a drama you can have a special time here while enjoying delicious food with your friends or lovers If you visit the filming location in person you will be able to feel the emotions of the drama more deeply'),
	(141, '졸업', '바나프레소 세관사거리점', '서울 강남구 언주로 702 학동역10번출구 도보5분', '바나프레소 세관사거리점은 현대적인 디자인과 아늑한 분위기로 많은 이들에게 사랑받는 카페입니다 이곳은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 유명해 팬들에게 특별한 의미를 지니고 있습니다 다양한 음료와 디저트를 제공하며 편안한 좌석이 마련되어 있어 친구와의 대화나 혼자만의 시간을 보내기에 좋은 장소입니다 주변의 아름다운 경관', '#카페 #졸업 #아늑한분위기 #서울 #드라마촬영지', '카페/레스토랑', 'Banapresso Customs and Excise Department Store', 'Graduation', '5-minute walk from Exit 10 of Hakdong Station, 702, Eonju-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Cafe #graduation #cozy atmosphere #Seoul #drama shooting location', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c9vxUl/btsHLben2Gl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJq7npD7r4SqKckaAk7r8l3XPEHob-yhHFl72OjIU2X1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jQsoZm%2BAbXLpPQ%2BYTdUYmPSRZXU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qnz6F/btsHJ7RC5wy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACiPZHs7RRyDuRGHYZwAlnTR54fXFMcRUeLLs-6QvQbf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fd%2FON89u3N4iOWuXIgV97am1dDk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/O8kpc/btsHKEVzbIY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE3zz2KcpYmSG16tPJ70sxKtOWsmNyBm2LVzHlEDGTwV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FL1gk4xvbHzRurWVbclftABdov4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bdVf7w/btsHLD9ly5w/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIDE6S_xcCCcmZZmtg3SAiJcc9YcYFSJ8qLIlN_aeJPt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jor5bw02JI2bGycncAf7oVIBAs8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c9vxUl/btsHLben2Gl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJq7npD7r4SqKckaAk7r8l3XPEHob-yhHFl72OjIU2X1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jQsoZm%2BAbXLpPQ%2BYTdUYmPSRZXU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qnz6F/btsHJ7RC5wy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACiPZHs7RRyDuRGHYZwAlnTR54fXFMcRUeLLs-6QvQbf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fd%2FON89u3N4iOWuXIgV97am1dDk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/O8kpc/btsHKEVzbIY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE3zz2KcpYmSG16tPJ70sxKtOWsmNyBm2LVzHlEDGTwV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FL1gk4xvbHzRurWVbclftABdov4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bdVf7w/btsHLD9ly5w/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIDE6S_xcCCcmZZmtg3SAiJcc9YcYFSJ8qLIlN_aeJPt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jor5bw02JI2bGycncAf7oVIBAs8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c9vxUl/btsHLben2Gl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJq7npD7r4SqKckaAk7r8l3XPEHob-yhHFl72OjIU2X1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jQsoZm%2BAbXLpPQ%2BYTdUYmPSRZXU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qnz6F/btsHJ7RC5wy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACiPZHs7RRyDuRGHYZwAlnTR54fXFMcRUeLLs-6QvQbf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fd%2FON89u3N4iOWuXIgV97am1dDk%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/O8kpc/btsHKEVzbIY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE3zz2KcpYmSG16tPJ70sxKtOWsmNyBm2LVzHlEDGTwV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FL1gk4xvbHzRurWVbclftABdov4%3D', 37.5158098, 127.0357433, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n- **이름**: 바나프레소 세관사거리점\n- **주소**: 서울 강남구 언주로 702\n- **카테고리**: #Cafe\n\n### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: 바나프레소 세관사거리점\n- **방문팁**: 아늑한 분위기에서 커피를 즐기며 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올려 보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가**: 미상\n\n### 여행 포인트\n바나프레소 세관사거리점은 현대적인 디자인과 아늑한 분위기로 많은 이들에게 사랑받는 카페입니다. 이곳은 드라마 \'졸업\'의 촬영지로 유명해, 팬들에게 특별한 의미를 지니고 있습니다. 다양한 음료와 디저트를 제공하며, 편안한 좌석이 마련되어 있어 친구와의 대화나 혼자만의 시간을 보내기에 좋은 장소입니다. 주변의 아름다운 경관', 'Banapresso Customs Street is a cafe loved by many for its modern design and cozy atmosphere This place is famous as the filming location for the drama Graduation and has a special meaning to fans It offers a variety of drinks and desserts and has a comfortable seat making it a great place to chat with friends or spend time alone a beautiful view of the surrounding area'),
	(142, '졸업', '교보문고 강남점', '서울 서초구 강남대로 465 신논현역8번출구 바로앞', '교보문고 강남점은 다양한 서적과 편안한 독서 공간으로 유명합니다 이곳은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 드라마 속 주인공이 책을 고르는 장면이 인상 깊게 담겨 있습니다 방문객들은 아늑한 분위기 속에서 독서를 즐기거나 카페에서 커피 한 잔과 함께 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 다양한 장르의 책들이 진열되어 있어 독서 애호가들에게 최적의 장소입니다', '#졸업 #도서관 #독서 #여유로운시간 #촬영지', '도서관/서점', 'Kyobo Bookstore Gangnam Branch', 'Graduation', 'Right in front of Exit 8 of Sinnonhyeon Station, 465, Gangnam-daero, Seocho-gu, Seoul', 'a library/bookshop', '#Graduation #Library #Reading #RelaxingTime #FilmingPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bbujkn/btsHS0pGODt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPc_y4RgkZqMdw37NixVjGQSwQoZgsz1Jpd6iEbf8t3Y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2OR7DbkDsjTRYgOwJgshdsu8MOE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kQzSa/btsHSEAp7PO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALyemJQ-1LDGDxItTGpk_8l7fIgOWajPD0INxG2IKWdb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=I13feBhpOlYwB1KtRajfoHQzVxc%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bbujkn/btsHS0pGODt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPc_y4RgkZqMdw37NixVjGQSwQoZgsz1Jpd6iEbf8t3Y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2OR7DbkDsjTRYgOwJgshdsu8MOE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kQzSa/btsHSEAp7PO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALyemJQ-1LDGDxItTGpk_8l7fIgOWajPD0INxG2IKWdb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=I13feBhpOlYwB1KtRajfoHQzVxc%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bbujkn/btsHS0pGODt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPc_y4RgkZqMdw37NixVjGQSwQoZgsz1Jpd6iEbf8t3Y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2OR7DbkDsjTRYgOwJgshdsu8MOE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kQzSa/btsHSEAp7PO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALyemJQ-1LDGDxItTGpk_8l7fIgOWajPD0INxG2IKWdb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=I13feBhpOlYwB1KtRajfoHQzVxc%3D', NULL, 37.50377539999999, 127.0240711, '### 도서관 촬영지 정보\n\n**제목:** 졸업  \n**촬영지:** 교보문고 강남점  \n**방문 팁:** 조용한 분위기에서 책을 읽으며 여유로운 시간을 즐겨보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Library  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 도서관  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n교보문고 강남점은 다양한 서적과 편안한 독서 공간으로 유명합니다. 이곳은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 드라마 속 주인공이 책을 고르는 장면이 인상 깊게 담겨 있습니다. 방문객들은 아늑한 분위기 속에서 독서를 즐기거나, 카페에서 커피 한 잔과 함께 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 다양한 장르의 책들이 진열되어 있어, 독서 애호가들에게 최적의 장소입니다.', 'Kyobo Bookstores Gangnam branch is famous for its various books and comfortable reading space This is the filming location of the drama Graduation and it is impressive to see the main character in the drama choosing a book Visitors can enjoy reading in a cozy atmosphere or have a relaxing time with a cup of coffee at a cafe Various genres of books are on display making it the best place for reading lovers'),
	(143, '졸업', '써브웨이 봉은사역점', '서울 강남구 봉은사로 627 봉은사역4번출구 도보4분', '써브웨이 봉은사역점은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 팬들에게 특별한 의미를 지닙니다 이곳은 드라마 속 주인공들이 대화하는 장면이 펼쳐진 장소로 방문객들은 그 순간을 재현하며 추억을 쌓을 수 있습니다 맛있는 샌드위치와 함께 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요', '#졸업 #드라마촬영지 #강남 #샌드위치 #카페 #추억', '카페/레스토랑', 'Subway Bongeun Station', 'Graduation', '627 Bongeunsa-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul, 4 minutes on foot from Exit 4 of Bongeunsa Station', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Graduation #DramaShoot #Gangnam #Sandwich #Cafe #Memories', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bHpV7T/btsH19NaM6z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0wP7HYnceHaWdC-L5k54yzWYADjPvC_meqxkDKZl_A/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jVjH1NWrxx92NI6%2Bbx7R2Q%2FW21E%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bJVDAx/btsH00KgxNf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOg4Sdktod4pynGu91ZhQDI0F8zTsj3f-oM5Tmsg8D3f/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XlCSyOBax3nmE6Q75CtW4m3Q0zw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NABlo/btsIg0YqojK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKGoTcuDPaoA57YZ8UjkSS1eUjWo99MNBe4m8iQLrOpV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UYl%2FiI93PhFLUAd%2F3GCWo%2FjMtAA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BMXEa/btsIgmt1msu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFwgo9lltZrNFpNDwz1b4T3xcYa_bZpjl1PGiLg_q2Qa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PE3PG8cJ2VjsDWmR3c0t%2BazYV%2BA%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bHpV7T/btsH19NaM6z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0wP7HYnceHaWdC-L5k54yzWYADjPvC_meqxkDKZl_A/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jVjH1NWrxx92NI6%2Bbx7R2Q%2FW21E%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bJVDAx/btsH00KgxNf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOg4Sdktod4pynGu91ZhQDI0F8zTsj3f-oM5Tmsg8D3f/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XlCSyOBax3nmE6Q75CtW4m3Q0zw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NABlo/btsIg0YqojK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKGoTcuDPaoA57YZ8UjkSS1eUjWo99MNBe4m8iQLrOpV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UYl%2FiI93PhFLUAd%2F3GCWo%2FjMtAA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BMXEa/btsIgmt1msu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFwgo9lltZrNFpNDwz1b4T3xcYa_bZpjl1PGiLg_q2Qa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PE3PG8cJ2VjsDWmR3c0t%2BazYV%2BA%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bHpV7T/btsH19NaM6z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0wP7HYnceHaWdC-L5k54yzWYADjPvC_meqxkDKZl_A/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jVjH1NWrxx92NI6%2Bbx7R2Q%2FW21E%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bJVDAx/btsH00KgxNf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOg4Sdktod4pynGu91ZhQDI0F8zTsj3f-oM5Tmsg8D3f/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XlCSyOBax3nmE6Q75CtW4m3Q0zw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NABlo/btsIg0YqojK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKGoTcuDPaoA57YZ8UjkSS1eUjWo99MNBe4m8iQLrOpV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UYl%2FiI93PhFLUAd%2F3GCWo%2FjMtAA%3D', 37.5153295, 127.0640535, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: 써브웨이 봉은사역점\n- **방문팁**: 다양한 샌드위치를 즐기며 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올려보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n써브웨이 봉은사역점은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 팬들에게 특별한 의미를 지닙니다. 이곳은 드라마 속 주인공들이 대화하는 장면이 펼쳐진 장소로, 방문객들은 그 순간을 재현하며 추억을 쌓을 수 있습니다. 맛있는 샌드위치와 함께 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.', 'Subway Bongeunsa Station is the filming location for the drama Graduation which has a special meaning for fans This is the place where the main characters in the drama talk and visitors can make memories by recreating the moment Feel the sensibility of the drama with delicious sandwiches'),
	(144, '졸업', '뮬리', '서울 강남구 논현로93길 6 역삼역6번출구 도보2분', '뮬리 카페는 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 현대적인 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적입니다 커다란 창문으로 들어오는 자연광과 함께 다양한 음료를 즐기며 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 이곳은 친구들과의 대화나 혼자만의 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소로 방문 시 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 만끽할 수 있습니다', '#카페 #졸업 #촬영지 #커피 #아늑한분위기', '카페/레스토랑', 'Mully', 'Graduation', '2-minute walk from Exit 6 of Yeoksam Station, Nonhyeon-ro 93-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Cafe #graduation #shoot #coffee #coffee #cozy atmosphere', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UhkQl/btsHnsHirpH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGNhwVyUUQskigx8GJRSYUyEEbexhcCFYxWgHNiQD6kS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=C%2F0feznYpTtaQx9mrJ1POd3%2B7iQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bOCmpu/btsHoJIazgS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHKnBr4LuZzJOodN5OS7c6BA3rYAGN4Cgcu8uV-YZswv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5aehD%2Bwchi2HIJbrKihMLpvrlvk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b55oGX/btsHl9hE7G9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEVBTng5FJH5qf5mrcH_sodzxTwS_rBatQ5lESZ7A4mL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MvWPuDFDe0zKpmBsUDbK%2F0OaPF4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UhkQl/btsHnsHirpH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGNhwVyUUQskigx8GJRSYUyEEbexhcCFYxWgHNiQD6kS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=C%2F0feznYpTtaQx9mrJ1POd3%2B7iQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bOCmpu/btsHoJIazgS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHKnBr4LuZzJOodN5OS7c6BA3rYAGN4Cgcu8uV-YZswv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5aehD%2Bwchi2HIJbrKihMLpvrlvk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b55oGX/btsHl9hE7G9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEVBTng5FJH5qf5mrcH_sodzxTwS_rBatQ5lESZ7A4mL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MvWPuDFDe0zKpmBsUDbK%2F0OaPF4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UhkQl/btsHnsHirpH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGNhwVyUUQskigx8GJRSYUyEEbexhcCFYxWgHNiQD6kS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=C%2F0feznYpTtaQx9mrJ1POd3%2B7iQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bOCmpu/btsHoJIazgS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHKnBr4LuZzJOodN5OS7c6BA3rYAGN4Cgcu8uV-YZswv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5aehD%2Bwchi2HIJbrKihMLpvrlvk%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b55oGX/btsHl9hE7G9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEVBTng5FJH5qf5mrcH_sodzxTwS_rBatQ5lESZ7A4mL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MvWPuDFDe0zKpmBsUDbK%2F0OaPF4%3D', 37.5021163, 127.0355525, '### 졸업 촬영지: 뮬리 카페\n\n**방문팁:** 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유롭게 커피를 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 뮬리 카페는 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 현대적인 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적입니다. 커다란 창문으로 들어오는 자연광과 함께 다양한 음료를 즐기며, 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 이곳은 친구들과의 대화나 혼자만의 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소로, 방문 시 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 만끽할 수 있습니다.', 'Muli Cafe is the filming location for the drama Graduation and its modern interior and cozy atmosphere are attractive You can enjoy a variety of drinks with natural light coming through a large window and have a special time like a scene in a drama This place is suitable for conversation with friends or spending time alone and when you visit you can enjoy the feeling of becoming a main character in a drama'),
	(145, '졸업', '빠완', '서울 강남구 선릉로86길 34 선릉역1번출구 도보5분', '빠완은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 아늑한 분위기와 독특한 인테리어가 매력적인 카페입니다 창밖으로 보이는 풍경과 함께 따뜻한 음료를 즐기며 드라마 속 주인공들이 느꼈던 감정을 체험할 수 있습니다 친구나 연인과 함께 방문하면 더욱 특별한 순간을 만들 수 있는 장소입니다', '#졸업 #카페 #드라마촬영지 #여유 #감성 #서울', '카페/레스토랑', 'Pawan', 'Graduation', '5-minute walk from Exit 1 of Seonneung Station, 34, Seonneung-ro 86-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Graduation #Cafe #DramaShoot #Relaxed #Sentimental #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b6iVt7/btsIjxz5X95/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALs0FAXUkS96Jc0tBjBIyS3RRHyvbVsKvw_XeY-_BU2x/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oVdzJg7MyPnpHZD8gS5Ya2MmK1U%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dOCnEH/btsIjKsCh0P/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACGZL3GSz1VM7jnapSYiXsjH5NVzhxNkK1sQr7eSmm8O/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=U2ti11rlPMvIcp%2FLkrhu%2BqOQARk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kzC3d/btsIhevDgSL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKoPqkib0BVSoLMls2tqF1fUltscv2NtuR51-sqzew3h/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VHoCZ48kEt0zlOTmsp67xLHvZ8g%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b6iVt7/btsIjxz5X95/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALs0FAXUkS96Jc0tBjBIyS3RRHyvbVsKvw_XeY-_BU2x/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oVdzJg7MyPnpHZD8gS5Ya2MmK1U%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dOCnEH/btsIjKsCh0P/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACGZL3GSz1VM7jnapSYiXsjH5NVzhxNkK1sQr7eSmm8O/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=U2ti11rlPMvIcp%2FLkrhu%2BqOQARk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kzC3d/btsIhevDgSL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKoPqkib0BVSoLMls2tqF1fUltscv2NtuR51-sqzew3h/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VHoCZ48kEt0zlOTmsp67xLHvZ8g%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b6iVt7/btsIjxz5X95/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALs0FAXUkS96Jc0tBjBIyS3RRHyvbVsKvw_XeY-_BU2x/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oVdzJg7MyPnpHZD8gS5Ya2MmK1U%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dOCnEH/btsIjKsCh0P/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACGZL3GSz1VM7jnapSYiXsjH5NVzhxNkK1sQr7eSmm8O/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=U2ti11rlPMvIcp%2FLkrhu%2BqOQARk%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kzC3d/btsIhevDgSL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKoPqkib0BVSoLMls2tqF1fUltscv2NtuR51-sqzew3h/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VHoCZ48kEt0zlOTmsp67xLHvZ8g%3D', 37.5037492, 127.0525701, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: 빠완\n- **방문 팁**: 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 즐기기에 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n빠완은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기와 독특한 인테리어가 매력적인 카페입니다. 창밖으로 보이는 풍경과 함께 따뜻한 음료를 즐기며 드라마 속 주인공들이 느꼈던 감정을 체험할 수 있습니다. 친구나 연인과 함께 방문하면 더욱 특별한 순간을 만들 수 있는 장소입니다.', 'Pawan is the filming location of the drama Graduation and it is a cafe with a cozy atmosphere and unique interior design You can enjoy a warm drink with the view outside the window and experience the emotions of the main characters in the drama It is a place where you can make a more special moment if you visit with a friend or lover'),
	(146, '졸업', 'CU매봉산점', '서울 강남구 남부순환로377길 6 매봉역1번출구 도보1분', 'CU매봉산점은 드라마 졸업의 중요한 촬영지로 일상의 소소한 순간을 담고 있는 장소입니다 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들은 캐릭터들의 감정을 더욱 깊이 있게 전달하며 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 만들어 줍니다 매장 내부는 다양한 상품들로 가득 차 있어 드라마의 분위기를 느끼며 쇼핑을 즐길 수 있는 좋은 기회입니다 친구들과 함께 방문하여 드라마의 명장면을 재현해보는 것도 추천합니다', '#졸업 #드라마촬영지 #CU매봉산점 #서울여행 #KdramaTrip', '기타/판별불가', 'CU Maebongsan Branch', 'Graduation', '1-minute walk from Exit 1 of Maebong Station, 6, Nambu Circulation-ro 377-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Graduation #DramaFilmingPlace #CU Maebongsan Branch #SeoulTravel #KdramaTrip', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bg0QdQ/btsHCu6dfXo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ8Ut47sts33G7bJXArKOYnxfOOlN_r_kQq49boul6ey/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QYoZrqpVtM5RnLNaLbhky4vw8xU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qSJKZ/btsHB8vHX3d/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGfa_VmK1jsAUwnqGMTTHr_GyFoIszQXT92IRQnrD9Xg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zbjKji%2Bb9%2Fe%2BxEzKSLbfbNzHH5Y%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bg0QdQ/btsHCu6dfXo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ8Ut47sts33G7bJXArKOYnxfOOlN_r_kQq49boul6ey/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QYoZrqpVtM5RnLNaLbhky4vw8xU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qSJKZ/btsHB8vHX3d/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGfa_VmK1jsAUwnqGMTTHr_GyFoIszQXT92IRQnrD9Xg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zbjKji%2Bb9%2Fe%2BxEzKSLbfbNzHH5Y%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bg0QdQ/btsHCu6dfXo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ8Ut47sts33G7bJXArKOYnxfOOlN_r_kQq49boul6ey/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QYoZrqpVtM5RnLNaLbhky4vw8xU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qSJKZ/btsHB8vHX3d/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGfa_VmK1jsAUwnqGMTTHr_GyFoIszQXT92IRQnrD9Xg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zbjKji%2Bb9%2Fe%2BxEzKSLbfbNzHH5Y%3D', NULL, 37.4869682, 127.0452155, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: CU매봉산점\n- **방문팁**: 이곳에서 드라마 속 장면을 직접 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\nCU매봉산점은 드라마 "졸업"의 중요한 촬영지로, 일상의 소소한 순간을 담고 있는 장소입니다. 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들은 캐릭터들의 감정을 더욱 깊이 있게 전달하며, 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 만들어 줍니다. 매장 내부는 다양한 상품들로 가득 차 있어, 드라마의 분위기를 느끼며 쇼핑을 즐길 수 있는 좋은 기회입니다. 친구들과 함께 방문하여 드라마의 명장면을 재현해보는 것도 추천합니다.', 'CU Maebongsan branch is an important filming location for the drama Graduation and contains small moments of everyday life The scenes filmed here convey the emotions of the characters more deeply and create special memories for fans The inside of the store is full of various products so its a great opportunity to enjoy shopping while feeling the atmosphere of the drama I also recommend you visit with your friends and recreate the famous scenes of the drama'),
	(147, '졸업', '논현로38길', '서울 강남구 논현로38길 46-3 매봉역4번출구 도보3분', '논현로38길은 드라마 졸업의 주요 촬영지로 도시의 생동감과 함께 감성적인 분위기를 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다 이곳에서는 주인공들이 진솔한 대화를 나누며 걸었던 길을 따라 걸으며 드라마의 감정을 직접 체험할 수 있습니다 주변에는 다양한 카페와 음식점이 있어 촬영지 탐방 후 여유롭게 휴식을 취하기에도 좋은 곳입니다', '#KdramaTrip #StreetScene #졸업 #로맨스 #서울 #여행', '거리/골목/광장', 'Nonhyeon-ro 38-gil', 'Graduation', '3 minutes walk from Exit 4 of Maebong Station, 46-3 Nonhyeon-ro 38-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #StreetScene #Graduation #Romance #Seoul #Travel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bqxlKH/btsHmE2lkbz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFUiBBqkDKVA7833EtuV37G01Hi5hbZSNbPTIqcWQTre/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QAf1IdtVtEKlhblvMri5jFXJ6jg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cU9wud/btsHl8bObDM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPdPGfNPwhokYuua6Wt-xZs_0aI8A6Mo8kORUSLUf1om/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kp%2F5h2vKBAqTZgnBWQPcPm7KKm0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/x1WLf/btsHmG6X52x/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGx6slbD98KRORKoM3fN0q6_UJ80DnYRe2qdI37xEJJN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rU%2BBFJp73GoXKMGrOa7yrP8UI%2FM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bqxlKH/btsHmE2lkbz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFUiBBqkDKVA7833EtuV37G01Hi5hbZSNbPTIqcWQTre/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QAf1IdtVtEKlhblvMri5jFXJ6jg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cU9wud/btsHl8bObDM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPdPGfNPwhokYuua6Wt-xZs_0aI8A6Mo8kORUSLUf1om/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kp%2F5h2vKBAqTZgnBWQPcPm7KKm0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/x1WLf/btsHmG6X52x/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGx6slbD98KRORKoM3fN0q6_UJ80DnYRe2qdI37xEJJN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rU%2BBFJp73GoXKMGrOa7yrP8UI%2FM%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bqxlKH/btsHmE2lkbz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFUiBBqkDKVA7833EtuV37G01Hi5hbZSNbPTIqcWQTre/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QAf1IdtVtEKlhblvMri5jFXJ6jg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cU9wud/btsHl8bObDM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPdPGfNPwhokYuua6Wt-xZs_0aI8A6Mo8kORUSLUf1om/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kp%2F5h2vKBAqTZgnBWQPcPm7KKm0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/x1WLf/btsHmG6X52x/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGx6slbD98KRORKoM3fN0q6_UJ80DnYRe2qdI37xEJJN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rU%2BBFJp73GoXKMGrOa7yrP8UI%2FM%3D', 37.4855857, 127.0454559, '### 거리/골목 촬영지 정보\n\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: 논현로38길\n- **방문팁**: 이곳에서 드라마 속 주인공들이 걸었던 길을 따라 산책해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #StreetScene\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 거리/골목\n\n### 여행 포인트\n논현로38길은 드라마 "졸업"의 주요 촬영지로, 도시의 생동감과 함께 감성적인 분위기를 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다. 이곳에서는 주인공들이 진솔한 대화를 나누며 걸었던 길을 따라 걸으며, 드라마의 감정을 직접 체험할 수 있습니다. 주변에는 다양한 카페와 음식점이 있어, 촬영지 탐방 후 여유롭게 휴식을 취하기에도 좋은 곳입니다.', 'Nonhyeonro 38gil is the main filming location of the drama Graduation a place where you can feel the liveliness of the city and the emotional atmosphere Here you can walk along the path where the main characters walked while having an honest conversation and experience the emotions of the drama firsthand There are various cafes and restaurants nearby so it is a good place to relax after visiting the filming location'),
	(148, '졸업', '샵노래연습장', '서울 강남구 선릉로64길 9 한티역1번출구 도보3분', '샵노래연습장은 드라마 졸업의 주요 촬영지로 다양한 노래 연습실과 아늑한 분위기가 특징입니다 이곳은 친구들과 함께 노래를 부르며 즐거운 시간을 보낼 수 있는 완벽한 장소이며 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 그 순간들을 공유할 수 있습니다 주변에는 다양한 음식점과 카페도 있어 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 식사나 음료를 즐기기에도 좋습니다', '#노래연습장, #추억, #K드라마, #강남, #친구, #촬영지', '기타', 'Shop singing studio', 'Graduation', '3-minute walk from Exit 1 of Hanti Station, 9 Seonneung-ro 64-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Song practice studio, #Memories, #K-drama, #Gangnam, #Friend, #FilmingPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pYQYJ/btsIaSLaj1q/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJoSRYWJi8vpMJzPueJQQrJEtQveKhcwUJrlCK8jhm_K/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JmacQkBWbM8B9iGQ8%2B0mACXrfFo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BfcZY/btsH946fGqy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF4UmdIV7dOYWT76dl17Rslq2UfDjwS1aARYwp8my8DZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QTNolpsd1NNwMDfX8R3d9eflN4c%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c76b7O/btsIaFSHwNC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFQIqQppH-AehQV0Wg9S75J1zWPA7C-FTBqhIa3FneT2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BorXAuP5vf1eOdEu3VZv2I%2BRr%2BQ%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pYQYJ/btsIaSLaj1q/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJoSRYWJi8vpMJzPueJQQrJEtQveKhcwUJrlCK8jhm_K/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JmacQkBWbM8B9iGQ8%2B0mACXrfFo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BfcZY/btsH946fGqy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF4UmdIV7dOYWT76dl17Rslq2UfDjwS1aARYwp8my8DZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QTNolpsd1NNwMDfX8R3d9eflN4c%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c76b7O/btsIaFSHwNC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFQIqQppH-AehQV0Wg9S75J1zWPA7C-FTBqhIa3FneT2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BorXAuP5vf1eOdEu3VZv2I%2BRr%2BQ%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pYQYJ/btsIaSLaj1q/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJoSRYWJi8vpMJzPueJQQrJEtQveKhcwUJrlCK8jhm_K/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JmacQkBWbM8B9iGQ8%2B0mACXrfFo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BfcZY/btsH946fGqy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF4UmdIV7dOYWT76dl17Rslq2UfDjwS1aARYwp8my8DZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QTNolpsd1NNwMDfX8R3d9eflN4c%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c76b7O/btsIaFSHwNC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFQIqQppH-AehQV0Wg9S75J1zWPA7C-FTBqhIa3FneT2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BorXAuP5vf1eOdEu3VZv2I%2BRr%2BQ%3D', 37.4980181, 127.0530367, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 졸업\n- **촬영지:** 샵노래연습장\n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 촬영된 장면을 재현하며 추억을 되새겨보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n샵노래연습장은 드라마 "졸업"의 주요 촬영지로, 다양한 노래 연습실과 아늑한 분위기가 특징입니다. 이곳은 친구들과 함께 노래를 부르며 즐거운 시간을 보낼 수 있는 완벽한 장소이며, 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 그 순간들을 공유할 수 있습니다. 주변에는 다양한 음식점과 카페도 있어, 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 식사나 음료를 즐기기에도 좋습니다.', 'The Shop Song Practice Center is the main filming location for the drama Graduation which features various song practice rooms and a cozy atmosphere This is the perfect place to have fun singing with your friends and you can share the moments while feeling the sensibility of the drama There are also various restaurants and cafes nearby so its good to enjoy a leisurely meal or drink after visiting the filming location'),
	(149, '졸업', '동궁상가 주차장', '서울 강남구 선릉로 318 한티역1번출구 위에서1분', '동궁상가 주차장은 드라마 졸업의 주요 촬영지로 도시의 한적한 분위기를 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다 이곳은 다양한 골목과 벽화가 있어 사진 찍기 좋은 스폿이기도 하며 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 공간입니다 주변 카페에서 커피 한 잔과 함께 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것도 추천합니다', '#거리 #촬영지 #졸업 #서울여행 #드라마팬 #추억', '거리/골목/광장', 'Donggung Shopping Center Parking Lot', 'Graduation', '1 minute above Exit 1 of Hanti Station, 318, Seonneung-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Street #FilmingPlace #Graduation #SeoulTravel #DramaFans #Memories', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/baGmmc/btsHCWH64m8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPg6S1gbSnIWMsvrlIHZIbPX73V_llLQYxEuj73ezR8z/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZbMNRkGydEg87kxKj4pW2OUHjA0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bq91mS/btsHB5MD0Zx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE3cmgk5yIxB9Xb8YXGAELaWpKTHE3mv0ja5Qa4QySS8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5H28n0Ac9edY8rD8xWcHTK3NuaE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/baGmmc/btsHCWH64m8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPg6S1gbSnIWMsvrlIHZIbPX73V_llLQYxEuj73ezR8z/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZbMNRkGydEg87kxKj4pW2OUHjA0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bq91mS/btsHB5MD0Zx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE3cmgk5yIxB9Xb8YXGAELaWpKTHE3mv0ja5Qa4QySS8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5H28n0Ac9edY8rD8xWcHTK3NuaE%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/baGmmc/btsHCWH64m8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPg6S1gbSnIWMsvrlIHZIbPX73V_llLQYxEuj73ezR8z/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZbMNRkGydEg87kxKj4pW2OUHjA0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bq91mS/btsHB5MD0Zx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE3cmgk5yIxB9Xb8YXGAELaWpKTHE3mv0ja5Qa4QySS8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5H28n0Ac9edY8rD8xWcHTK3NuaE%3D', NULL, 37.4980894, 127.0524088, '### 거리 촬영지 정보\n\n**제목:** 졸업  \n**촬영지:** 동궁상가 주차장  \n**방문 팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 조용한 장소입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #졸업  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n동궁상가 주차장은 드라마 "졸업"의 주요 촬영지로, 도시의 한적한 분위기를 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다. 이곳은 다양한 골목과 벽화가 있어 사진 찍기 좋은 스폿이기도 하며, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 공간입니다. 주변 카페에서 커피 한 잔과 함께 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것도 추천합니다.', 'The parking lot of Donggung Shopping Center is the main filming location of the drama Graduation and is a place where you can feel the quiet atmosphere of the city This is a good spot for taking pictures with various alleys and murals and it is a place where drama fans can leave special memories It is also recommended to spend a leisurely time with a cup of coffee at nearby cafes'),
	(150, '졸업', 'T world', '서울 강남구 선릉로 318 한티역1번출구 위에서1분', 'T world는 드라마 졸업의 주요 촬영지로 다양한 상점들이 즐비해 있어 방문객들에게 흥미로운 경험을 제공합니다 이곳은 현지의 분위기를 느끼며 여유롭게 산책하기 좋은 장소이며 주변의 맛있는 먹거리와 함께 즐길 수 있는 카페들도 많아 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라 일반 관광객에게도 추천할 만한 곳입니다', '#졸업 #드라마촬영지 #서울여행 #산책 #먹거리 #Tworld', '거리/골목/광장', 'T world', 'Graduation', '1 minute above Exit 1 of Hanti Station, 318, Seonneung-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Graduation #DramaFilmingPlace #SeoulTravel #Walk #Food #TWorld', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c9VqTz/btsHLs70tB2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJx_aM1TgKY3emcxfSsbvl2aHAMtL5tpM-ib1Xroepsq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yXa6%2FJ58zLPdjc6bkgvFuOWWh0g%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c2tOeb/btsHKTEUT77/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG46XfEkBplgmWczSf7tceGu4RcGYwnM1DYxfxniQyQz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Sehi37w%2Bxl7FT%2BZ1vt8lVqDIQIw%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c9VqTz/btsHLs70tB2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJx_aM1TgKY3emcxfSsbvl2aHAMtL5tpM-ib1Xroepsq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yXa6%2FJ58zLPdjc6bkgvFuOWWh0g%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c2tOeb/btsHKTEUT77/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG46XfEkBplgmWczSf7tceGu4RcGYwnM1DYxfxniQyQz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Sehi37w%2Bxl7FT%2BZ1vt8lVqDIQIw%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c9VqTz/btsHLs70tB2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJx_aM1TgKY3emcxfSsbvl2aHAMtL5tpM-ib1Xroepsq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yXa6%2FJ58zLPdjc6bkgvFuOWWh0g%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c2tOeb/btsHKTEUT77/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG46XfEkBplgmWczSf7tceGu4RcGYwnM1DYxfxniQyQz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Sehi37w%2Bxl7FT%2BZ1vt8lVqDIQIw%3D', NULL, 37.4980894, 127.0524088, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: T world\n- **방문팁**: 다양한 상점과 먹거리가 있어 한가롭게 산책하기 좋은 곳입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #태그\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 거리\n\n### 여행 포인트\nT world는 드라마 "졸업"의 주요 촬영지로, 다양한 상점들이 즐비해 있어 방문객들에게 흥미로운 경험을 제공합니다. 이곳은 현지의 분위기를 느끼며 여유롭게 산책하기 좋은 장소이며, 주변의 맛있는 먹거리와 함께 즐길 수 있는 카페들도 많아 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라 일반 관광객에게도 추천할 만한 곳입니다.', 'T world is the main filming location for the drama Graduation which is lined with various shops providing an interesting experience for visitors It is a good place to take a leisurely walk while feeling the local atmosphere and there are many cafes where you can enjoy delicious food around you so it is recommended not only for drama fans but also for ordinary tourists'),
	(151, '졸업', '호남식당', '서울 강남구 선릉로68길 12 한티역1번출구 위에서2분', '호남식당 주변은 다양한 상점과 식당들이 있어 활기찬 분위기를 자아냅니다 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 속 장면을 직접 느끼며 근처의 맛집을 탐방할 수 있는 좋은 기회가 됩니다 특히 주변 거리의 모습은 한국의 일상적인 풍경을 그대로 담고 있어 사진 촬영에도 적합한 장소입니다 드라마 팬이라면 놓치지 말아야 할 필수 코스입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #호남식당, #강남, #맛집탐방, #일상풍경, #사진촬영', '거리/골목/광장', 'Honam Restaurant', 'Graduation', '2 minutes above Exit 1 of Hanti Station, 12 Seonneung-ro 68-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Drama filming location, #HonamRestaurant, #Gangnam, #Delicious Restaurant Exploration, #DailyScenery, #PhotoShooting', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cXZQlG/btsHB8Jfowg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOCRNnmr6CGQ3s8Ed0gII0Gn9dPYvnmI9smZqECtFV_E/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hyQ2dsSgpOZwKx1nBrMKUU08oJc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/basbUY/btsHCsAKRt7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIRve1M0WV-jWJnHQSWHC2ozi6Ru-gcpa1Lkiq9eNHaS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iR%2FbVpqhLa6Z2xClObTDqer4qE4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ykLuN/btsHDhebGBd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOfjX5D0eEzxYSx1kT9PUjmo7CsmUqEcPSbCKFuIyXiN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=R3pvN4EAb0Ixcnf8JRKHAxlUuus%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pCA71/btsHCsOfq5j/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEh0Rac9Mi2UhiUwyztLjFzJ6iOWjmw_P_Qs6IqOMzVi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jrEh%2Ft8Jp7sPR9s%2Foap2ITJ9eTs%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cXZQlG/btsHB8Jfowg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOCRNnmr6CGQ3s8Ed0gII0Gn9dPYvnmI9smZqECtFV_E/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hyQ2dsSgpOZwKx1nBrMKUU08oJc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/basbUY/btsHCsAKRt7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIRve1M0WV-jWJnHQSWHC2ozi6Ru-gcpa1Lkiq9eNHaS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iR%2FbVpqhLa6Z2xClObTDqer4qE4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ykLuN/btsHDhebGBd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOfjX5D0eEzxYSx1kT9PUjmo7CsmUqEcPSbCKFuIyXiN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=R3pvN4EAb0Ixcnf8JRKHAxlUuus%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pCA71/btsHCsOfq5j/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEh0Rac9Mi2UhiUwyztLjFzJ6iOWjmw_P_Qs6IqOMzVi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jrEh%2Ft8Jp7sPR9s%2Foap2ITJ9eTs%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cXZQlG/btsHB8Jfowg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOCRNnmr6CGQ3s8Ed0gII0Gn9dPYvnmI9smZqECtFV_E/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hyQ2dsSgpOZwKx1nBrMKUU08oJc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/basbUY/btsHCsAKRt7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIRve1M0WV-jWJnHQSWHC2ozi6Ru-gcpa1Lkiq9eNHaS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iR%2FbVpqhLa6Z2xClObTDqer4qE4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ykLuN/btsHDhebGBd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOfjX5D0eEzxYSx1kT9PUjmo7CsmUqEcPSbCKFuIyXiN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=R3pvN4EAb0Ixcnf8JRKHAxlUuus%3D', 37.4990337, 127.0528074, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: 호남식당\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 거리\n\n### 여행 포인트\n호남식당 주변은 다양한 상점과 식당들이 있어 활기찬 분위기를 자아냅니다. 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 속 장면을 직접 느끼며, 근처의 맛집을 탐방할 수 있는 좋은 기회가 됩니다. 특히, 주변 거리의 모습은 한국의 일상적인 풍경을 그대로 담고 있어, 사진 촬영에도 적합한 장소입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 놓치지 말아야 할 필수 코스입니다.', 'There are various shops and restaurants around Honam Restaurant creating a lively atmosphere If you visit here it is a good opportunity to feel the scenes in the drama firsthand and explore nearby restaurants In particular the appearance of the surrounding streets captures the daily scenery of Korea as it is so it is a suitable place for photography If youre a drama fan its a must not miss course'),
	(152, '졸업', '세무회계 물결', '서울 강남구 선릉로68길 12', '세무회계 물결은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 이곳에서의 특별한 순간들을 경험할 수 있습니다 드라마 속 주인공들이 겪는 감정을 함께 느끼며 그들의 발자취를 따라가 보세요 이곳은 드라마 팬들에게 잊지 못할 추억을 선사하는 장소로 세심한 디테일이 살아 있는 공간입니다 방문 시 촬영지의 분위기를 만끽하며 인상 깊은 사진도 남겨보세요', '#드라마촬영지 #세무회계물결 #졸업 #감성 #추억 #서울', '기타/판별불가', 'a tax accounting wave', 'Graduation', '12, Seonneung-ro 68-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Drama filming location #taxaccounting #graduation #emotional #memories #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kSArL/btsHL5EHnRt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPbvToMNlVFkMGaJ_aSYfl-LR8sqJZEiGEfuAxNJp0jq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=A7zw5r84lyQOseJI2cjGrlmiM7c%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pXTj9/btsHLVPLvIv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN16uibqs7AVSsCpZvvQ8n0o7ePwPO7jt01bGwDpWzmo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6XcgA68QmEP2aQUuIUDeurC%2FF6Y%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/F7tVn/btsHMcKuh2O/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANjtmWGu33-i6GEUt7pCtGKgvs7D8d9dfxGCSJCKaqpX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=I1Fx3FYGQ4reUnymzFX5iAX1diQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ACHqn/btsHMO3wvq2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANMrB-w7Hs8T8aKP9mG6ZGq87IL_jQl5JaJF57zIPo0K/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8%2BkJSHMX9fHe7KQVfXIHqdyRU%2Fw%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kSArL/btsHL5EHnRt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPbvToMNlVFkMGaJ_aSYfl-LR8sqJZEiGEfuAxNJp0jq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=A7zw5r84lyQOseJI2cjGrlmiM7c%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pXTj9/btsHLVPLvIv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN16uibqs7AVSsCpZvvQ8n0o7ePwPO7jt01bGwDpWzmo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6XcgA68QmEP2aQUuIUDeurC%2FF6Y%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/F7tVn/btsHMcKuh2O/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANjtmWGu33-i6GEUt7pCtGKgvs7D8d9dfxGCSJCKaqpX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=I1Fx3FYGQ4reUnymzFX5iAX1diQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ACHqn/btsHMO3wvq2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANMrB-w7Hs8T8aKP9mG6ZGq87IL_jQl5JaJF57zIPo0K/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8%2BkJSHMX9fHe7KQVfXIHqdyRU%2Fw%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kSArL/btsHL5EHnRt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPbvToMNlVFkMGaJ_aSYfl-LR8sqJZEiGEfuAxNJp0jq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=A7zw5r84lyQOseJI2cjGrlmiM7c%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pXTj9/btsHLVPLvIv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN16uibqs7AVSsCpZvvQ8n0o7ePwPO7jt01bGwDpWzmo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6XcgA68QmEP2aQUuIUDeurC%2FF6Y%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/F7tVn/btsHMcKuh2O/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANjtmWGu33-i6GEUt7pCtGKgvs7D8d9dfxGCSJCKaqpX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=I1Fx3FYGQ4reUnymzFX5iAX1diQ%3D', 37.4990337, 127.0528074, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: 세무회계 물결\n- **방문팁**: 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 촬영지를 둘러보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n세무회계 물결은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 이곳에서의 특별한 순간들을 경험할 수 있습니다. 드라마 속 주인공들이 겪는 감정을 함께 느끼며, 그들의 발자취를 따라가 보세요. 이곳은 드라마 팬들에게 잊지 못할 추억을 선사하는 장소로, 세심한 디테일이 살아 있는 공간입니다. 방문 시, 촬영지의 분위기를 만끽하며 인상 깊은 사진도 남겨보세요.', 'The tax accounting wave is the filming location of the drama Graduation where you can experience special moments here Feel the emotions of the main characters in the drama together and follow in their footsteps This is a place that gives unforgettable memories to drama fans and it is a space with detailed details When you visit enjoy the atmosphere of the filming location and leave impressive photos'),
	(153, '졸업', '도곡로63길', '서울 강남구 도곡로 405 한티역2번출구 도보3분', '도곡로63길은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 이곳에서의 밤 풍경은 특히 매력적입니다 다양한 상점과 식당들이 줄지어 있어 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유롭게 산책하기에 좋습니다 화려한 조명과 함께 bustling한 거리의 분위기를 즐길 수 있으며 친구들과의 소중한 추억을 만들기에 완벽한 장소입니다', '#졸업 #촬영지 #드라마투어 #야경 #도곡로63길 #생동감', '거리/골목/광장', 'Dogok-ro 63-gil', 'Graduation', '3 minutes walk from Exit 2 of Hanti Station, 405, Dogok-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Graduation #FilmingPlace #DramaTour #Nightscape #Dogok-ro 63-gil #LivingFeeling', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cFtuoB/btsHl9hrN4v/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACBqxiAhoviz4Z0_BtWusC4Yd_Wb9BAzndmeFQUU3PYV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dw443ESwxKcZM%2F8vsVjZAQjKjM8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cFtuoB/btsHl9hrN4v/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACBqxiAhoviz4Z0_BtWusC4Yd_Wb9BAzndmeFQUU3PYV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dw443ESwxKcZM%2F8vsVjZAQjKjM8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cFtuoB/btsHl9hrN4v/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACBqxiAhoviz4Z0_BtWusC4Yd_Wb9BAzndmeFQUU3PYV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dw443ESwxKcZM%2F8vsVjZAQjKjM8%3D', NULL, NULL, 37.4974385, 127.0546376, '### 촬영지 정보\n\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: 도곡로63길\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면들이 펼쳐진 거리로, 밤에 방문하면 화려한 네온사인과 함께 생동감 넘치는 분위기를 느낄 수 있습니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #StreetScene\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 거리/골목\n\n### 여행 포인트\n도곡로63길은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 이곳에서의 밤 풍경은 특히 매력적입니다. 다양한 상점과 식당들이 줄지어 있어, 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유롭게 산책하기에 좋습니다. 화려한 조명과 함께 bustling한 거리의 분위기를 즐길 수 있으며, 친구들과의 소중한 추억을 만들기에 완벽한 장소입니다.', 'Dogokro 63rd Street is the filming location of the drama Graduation and the night scenery here is especially attractive Various shops and restaurants are lined up making it great for a leisurely walk while feeling the sensibility of the drama You can enjoy the bustling street atmosphere with colorful lights and it is the perfect place to make precious memories with friends'),
	(154, '졸업', '삼성로63길(1)', '서울 강남구 삼성로63길 9 한티역2번출구 위에서9분', '삼성로63길은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 현대적인 거리 풍경과 함께 아기자기한 상점들이 즐비한 곳입니다 이곳은 친구들과 함께 산책하며 소소한 일상을 즐기기에 적합한 장소로 다양한 카페와 음식점이 있어 방문객들에게 편안한 분위기를 제공합니다 특히 저녁 시간에는 조명이 켜진 거리의 모습이 더욱 매력적이니 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 걷는 시간을 가져보세요', '#드라마촬영지, #산책, #카페, #저녁산책, #강남, #아기자기한상점', '거리/골목/광장', '63 Gil, Samseong-ro (1)', 'Graduation', '9 minutes above Exit 2 of Hanti Station, 9 Samseong-ro 63-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Drama filming location, #walk, #café, #eveningwalk, #Gangnam, #cutestore', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfOP0o/btsHoHp20PG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALogmPY8w0ih42Ih6_A-tv__ZO0-cZRpmn7j7fgCIfhH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UIVrcfvz2%2BwpAEx%2BePvvUw2zmTQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xgnyy/btsHnurqNLQ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIiTjfL5r1U4mJ7QuoddXbmsvAdjB2x9TuQpnTvDIA5N/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=D%2FgMY%2F5c%2F1t6NJ69KPDY%2B8LULs8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfOP0o/btsHoHp20PG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALogmPY8w0ih42Ih6_A-tv__ZO0-cZRpmn7j7fgCIfhH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UIVrcfvz2%2BwpAEx%2BePvvUw2zmTQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xgnyy/btsHnurqNLQ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIiTjfL5r1U4mJ7QuoddXbmsvAdjB2x9TuQpnTvDIA5N/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=D%2FgMY%2F5c%2F1t6NJ69KPDY%2B8LULs8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfOP0o/btsHoHp20PG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALogmPY8w0ih42Ih6_A-tv__ZO0-cZRpmn7j7fgCIfhH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UIVrcfvz2%2BwpAEx%2BePvvUw2zmTQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xgnyy/btsHnurqNLQ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIiTjfL5r1U4mJ7QuoddXbmsvAdjB2x9TuQpnTvDIA5N/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=D%2FgMY%2F5c%2F1t6NJ69KPDY%2B8LULs8%3D', NULL, 37.4997715, 127.0593678, '### 여행 포인트\n\n삼성로63길은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 현대적인 거리 풍경과 함께 아기자기한 상점들이 즐비한 곳입니다. 이곳은 친구들과 함께 산책하며 소소한 일상을 즐기기에 적합한 장소로, 다양한 카페와 음식점이 있어 방문객들에게 편안한 분위기를 제공합니다. 특히 저녁 시간에는 조명이 켜진 거리의 모습이 더욱 매력적이니, 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 걷는 시간을 가져보세요.', 'Samseongro 63rd Street is the filming location of the drama Graduation which is lined with cute shops with modern street scenes This place is suitable for taking a walk with friends and enjoying small daily lives and there are various cafes and restaurants to provide a comfortable atmosphere for visitors Especially in the evening the appearance of the illuminated street is more attractive so take time to walk while feeling the sensibility of the drama'),
	(155, '졸업', '삼성로63길(2)', '서울 강남구 삼성로63길 11-6 한티역2번출구 위에서2분', '삼성로63길2은 드라마 졸업의 주요 촬영지로 아늑한 분위기와 독특한 골목길이 매력적인 장소입니다 이곳에서는 드라마 속 주인공들이 나눈 감정의 순간들을 떠올리며 실제로 그들의 발자취를 따라 걷는 즐거움을 느낄 수 있습니다 주변의 다양한 카페와 상점들도 함께 탐방하며 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 시간을 만들어보세요', '#드라마촬영지, #산책, #감성, #골목길, #커피, #추억', '거리/골목/광장', '63 Gil, Samseong-ro (2)', 'Graduation', '2 minutes above Exit 2 of Hanti Station, 11-6, Samseong-ro 63-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Drama filming location, #walk, #emotional, #alley street, #coffee, #memories', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bwMVNC/btsHTHXCUbR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK3CVqhZHoJ9Gr-N2jg6iyE1BhtGy7erIsaAggphKLuX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AVvE1Kvac%2FoG7JohQMNoeDt8T%2BU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xsOrb/btsHTBQM7tb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANWLisVetQBrZ2MRkL2Vym8IiqVO94NHFhro05rNqmsT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uXagXid27zOV%2BaXFo0WRbdnKhyQ%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bwMVNC/btsHTHXCUbR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK3CVqhZHoJ9Gr-N2jg6iyE1BhtGy7erIsaAggphKLuX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AVvE1Kvac%2FoG7JohQMNoeDt8T%2BU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xsOrb/btsHTBQM7tb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANWLisVetQBrZ2MRkL2Vym8IiqVO94NHFhro05rNqmsT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uXagXid27zOV%2BaXFo0WRbdnKhyQ%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bwMVNC/btsHTHXCUbR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK3CVqhZHoJ9Gr-N2jg6iyE1BhtGy7erIsaAggphKLuX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AVvE1Kvac%2FoG7JohQMNoeDt8T%2BU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xsOrb/btsHTBQM7tb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANWLisVetQBrZ2MRkL2Vym8IiqVO94NHFhro05rNqmsT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uXagXid27zOV%2BaXFo0WRbdnKhyQ%3D', NULL, 37.4994321, 127.0591987, '### 거리 촬영지 정보\n\n**제목:** 졸업  \n**촬영지:** 삼성로63길(2)  \n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #태그  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n삼성로63길(2)은 드라마 "졸업"의 주요 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기와 독특한 골목길이 매력적인 장소입니다. 이곳에서는 드라마 속 주인공들이 나눈 감정의 순간들을 떠올리며, 실제로 그들의 발자취를 따라 걷는 즐거움을 느낄 수 있습니다. 주변의 다양한 카페와 상점들도 함께 탐방하며, 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 시간을 만들어보세요.', 'Samseongro 63gil 2 is the main filming location for the drama Graduation and it is an attractive place with a cozy atmosphere and unique alleyways Here you can think of the emotional moments shared by the main characters in the drama and you can actually feel the joy of walking in their footsteps Explore various cafes and stores around you together and create a special time like a scene in a drama'),
	(156, '졸업', '두각 본관', '서울 강남구 도곡로77길 3 한티역2번출구 위에서3분', '두각 본관은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 현대적인 건축물과 세련된 분위기가 특징입니다 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 드라마 촬영지 탐방과 함께 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 특히 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 사진을 찍기 좋은 장소로 팬들에게는 잊지 못할 경험이 될 것입니다', '#KdramaTrip #촬영지 #두각본관 #졸업 #사진명소 #드라마팬', '기타/판별불가', 'the distinguished main building', 'Graduation', '3 minutes above Exit 2 of Hanti Station, 77-gil, Dogok-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#KdramaTrip #FilmingPlace #Department Headquarters #Graduation #PhotographyAttractions #DramaFan', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bHt5Zt/btsHCrBxXl5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADjA4sNFWtCyiuWeyPtPWHPO3HIVo7xyoPfuh14_m2Mo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VveawwfVI7tCxW0ydlyeZ6a45dQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cYpD8t/btsHCnMIF1w/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFPOHELpUs1Rtw51nekr3zIC9Fst8Ur1voFF6KeqN-7n/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nhYqHAVHGfz4a8tStXoBjqHvlmo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/61iTl/btsHB47HIp5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP48NWg0v5v8WkxTT7jPaxaLHHuoWJRY4PwZq8P4TEmF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OEQ9%2BzNsAVSRqoP0zPl7eisL8No%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bHt5Zt/btsHCrBxXl5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADjA4sNFWtCyiuWeyPtPWHPO3HIVo7xyoPfuh14_m2Mo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VveawwfVI7tCxW0ydlyeZ6a45dQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cYpD8t/btsHCnMIF1w/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFPOHELpUs1Rtw51nekr3zIC9Fst8Ur1voFF6KeqN-7n/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nhYqHAVHGfz4a8tStXoBjqHvlmo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/61iTl/btsHB47HIp5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP48NWg0v5v8WkxTT7jPaxaLHHuoWJRY4PwZq8P4TEmF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OEQ9%2BzNsAVSRqoP0zPl7eisL8No%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bHt5Zt/btsHCrBxXl5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADjA4sNFWtCyiuWeyPtPWHPO3HIVo7xyoPfuh14_m2Mo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VveawwfVI7tCxW0ydlyeZ6a45dQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cYpD8t/btsHCnMIF1w/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFPOHELpUs1Rtw51nekr3zIC9Fst8Ur1voFF6KeqN-7n/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nhYqHAVHGfz4a8tStXoBjqHvlmo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/61iTl/btsHB47HIp5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP48NWg0v5v8WkxTT7jPaxaLHHuoWJRY4PwZq8P4TEmF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OEQ9%2BzNsAVSRqoP0zPl7eisL8No%3D', 37.4984471, 127.0584639, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: 두각 본관\n- **방문팁**: 드라마의 주요 촬영지로, K-드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n두각 본관은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 현대적인 건축물과 세련된 분위기가 특징입니다. 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 드라마 촬영지 탐방과 함께 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 특히, 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 사진을 찍기 좋은 장소로, 팬들에게는 잊지 못할 경험이 될 것입니다.', 'The main hall of Jumyeong is the filming location of the drama Graduation which features modern architecture and a sophisticated atmosphere There are various cafes and shops around so you can spend a leisurely time with a tour of the drama filming location In particular it will be an unforgettable experience for fans as it is a good place to take pictures while feeling the sensibility of the drama'),
	(157, '졸업', '중앙대학교사범대학부속고', '서울 강남구 선릉로 207 도곡역1번출구 도보5분', '중앙대학교사범대학부속고는 아름다운 녹지와 현대적인 건물이 조화를 이루는 공간으로 드라마 팬들에게는 촬영지 탐방의 즐거움을 제공합니다 캠퍼스를 거닐며 드라마의 주요 장면들을 회상하고 여유로운 분위기 속에서 학창 시절의 추억을 떠올려보는 것도 좋습니다 친구들과 함께 방문하면 더욱 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #졸업, #캠퍼스, #학교, #서울', '학교/대학', 'Chung-Ang University College of Education Affiliated High School', 'Graduation', '5-minute walk from Exit 1 of Dogok Station, 207, Seonneung-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a school/college', '#Drama filming location, #graduation, #campus, #school, #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dpBsFF/btsHmBybUeT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL_qyie0z2dbO05nNvzVhMZRY9LIH-fSeT5wOfR-i9oZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=guyNh0XiqTd6%2BtKZu5GiSxTCysw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qaK7R/btsHl2JQ2r9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPIOmsDLT-mg6uFYrA0rQdMevgYn07el4zp5aMp-2WxE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mPg2BHkr4PG4rc37scvYG9pahE4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4UE8C/btsHR6LriNm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPi6j-Awe2WtK0YwAl25yTXvokY-HDd7LeVTNsPZ3ODU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FZwZ%2BP7SMj3L4kIwP4lV6ZaR62o%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dpBsFF/btsHmBybUeT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL_qyie0z2dbO05nNvzVhMZRY9LIH-fSeT5wOfR-i9oZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=guyNh0XiqTd6%2BtKZu5GiSxTCysw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qaK7R/btsHl2JQ2r9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPIOmsDLT-mg6uFYrA0rQdMevgYn07el4zp5aMp-2WxE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mPg2BHkr4PG4rc37scvYG9pahE4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4UE8C/btsHR6LriNm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPi6j-Awe2WtK0YwAl25yTXvokY-HDd7LeVTNsPZ3ODU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FZwZ%2BP7SMj3L4kIwP4lV6ZaR62o%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dpBsFF/btsHmBybUeT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL_qyie0z2dbO05nNvzVhMZRY9LIH-fSeT5wOfR-i9oZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=guyNh0XiqTd6%2BtKZu5GiSxTCysw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qaK7R/btsHl2JQ2r9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPIOmsDLT-mg6uFYrA0rQdMevgYn07el4zp5aMp-2WxE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mPg2BHkr4PG4rc37scvYG9pahE4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4UE8C/btsHR6LriNm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPi6j-Awe2WtK0YwAl25yTXvokY-HDd7LeVTNsPZ3ODU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FZwZ%2BP7SMj3L4kIwP4lV6ZaR62o%3D', 37.4920256, 127.0519949, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: 중앙대학교사범대학부속고\n- **방문팁**: 아름다운 캠퍼스를 거닐며 드라마 속 장면을 떠올려보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Campus\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 학교\n\n### 여행 포인트\n중앙대학교사범대학부속고는 아름다운 녹지와 현대적인 건물이 조화를 이루는 공간으로, 드라마 팬들에게는 촬영지 탐방의 즐거움을 제공합니다. 캠퍼스를 거닐며 드라마의 주요 장면들을 회상하고, 여유로운 분위기 속에서 학창 시절의 추억을 떠올려보는 것도 좋습니다. 친구들과 함께 방문하면 더욱 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다.', 'ChungAng University College of Education Annex High School is a space where beautiful green spaces and modern buildings are in harmony providing drama fans with the pleasure of visiting the filming location It is also good to walk around the campus and reminisce about the main scenes of the drama and recall memories of your school days in a relaxed atmosphere It will be a more special experience if you visit with your friends'),
	(158, '졸업', '도곡삼성래미안아파트109동', '서울 강남구 언주로 20 도곡역1번출구 도보7분', '도곡삼성래미안아파트109동은 드라마 졸업의 주요 촬영지로 이곳에서 펼쳐지는 다양한 감정선과 이야기들이 인상적입니다 아파트 단지 내의 조용한 분위기와 아름다운 조경은 드라마의 서정적인 장면과 잘 어우러져 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 장소입니다 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 속 주인공이 느꼈던 감정을 간접적으로 체험할 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다', '#아파트 #졸업 #서울여행 #감성 #드라마촬영지', '기타/판별불가', 'Dogok Samsung Raemian Apartment 109 Building', 'Graduation', '7-minute walk from Exit 1 of Dogok Station, 20, Eonju-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Apartment #graduation #Seoultrip #emotional #drama shooting location', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YZrcm/btsHtMGdqHY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABHwclRUSLEfXg_88iWR2jTup78b8fYaFzY7Mcb6eaF0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MB%2FkTT%2FGQFDdg1L65K5Qu98BpUs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UMguK/btsHtIDVM5U/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKQhsBMGU5InP6qZumEfKFCQGMJ68cEU72hGSNqJKFwf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nkyCl0lYQjxfje3lcaGsAuGTF5A%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/blhih2/btsHtxbwaHV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMzrYi2ZN3Z9mGOk5iuDsiaVSUDDCaXXvJNlOUeCLY9z/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=N4qhUmBB49O0SytR%2BlhR8b%2BymYk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/P5HO2/btsHtrbn5r0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPmf4Q059BkeBaA0y5mdl0o6aWGqdnanu-UfW25URCpG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jduufpLV8WynnQM9Zjnt4B9JNpE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YZrcm/btsHtMGdqHY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABHwclRUSLEfXg_88iWR2jTup78b8fYaFzY7Mcb6eaF0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MB%2FkTT%2FGQFDdg1L65K5Qu98BpUs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UMguK/btsHtIDVM5U/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKQhsBMGU5InP6qZumEfKFCQGMJ68cEU72hGSNqJKFwf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nkyCl0lYQjxfje3lcaGsAuGTF5A%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/blhih2/btsHtxbwaHV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMzrYi2ZN3Z9mGOk5iuDsiaVSUDDCaXXvJNlOUeCLY9z/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=N4qhUmBB49O0SytR%2BlhR8b%2BymYk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/P5HO2/btsHtrbn5r0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPmf4Q059BkeBaA0y5mdl0o6aWGqdnanu-UfW25URCpG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jduufpLV8WynnQM9Zjnt4B9JNpE%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YZrcm/btsHtMGdqHY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABHwclRUSLEfXg_88iWR2jTup78b8fYaFzY7Mcb6eaF0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MB%2FkTT%2FGQFDdg1L65K5Qu98BpUs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UMguK/btsHtIDVM5U/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKQhsBMGU5InP6qZumEfKFCQGMJ68cEU72hGSNqJKFwf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nkyCl0lYQjxfje3lcaGsAuGTF5A%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/blhih2/btsHtxbwaHV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMzrYi2ZN3Z9mGOk5iuDsiaVSUDDCaXXvJNlOUeCLY9z/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=N4qhUmBB49O0SytR%2BlhR8b%2BymYk%3D', 37.5055798, 127.0414738, '### 여행 포인트\n도곡삼성래미안아파트109동은 드라마 "졸업"의 주요 촬영지로, 이곳에서 펼쳐지는 다양한 감정선과 이야기들이 인상적입니다. 아파트 단지 내의 조용한 분위기와 아름다운 조경은 드라마의 서정적인 장면과 잘 어우러져, 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 장소입니다. 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 속 주인공이 느꼈던 감정을 간접적으로 체험할 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다.', 'Dogok Samsung Raemian Apartment 109 is the main filming location of the drama Graduation and various emotional lines and stories unfold here are impressive The quiet atmosphere and beautiful landscaping in the apartment complex harmonize well with the lyrical scenes of the drama making it a place for fans to leave special memories Visiting here gives you the opportunity to experience the emotions that the main character in the drama felt indirectly'),
	(159, '졸업', '대치역사거리', '서울 강남구 남부순환로 2947', '대치역사거리는 드라마 졸업의 주요 촬영지로 이곳에서의 장면들은 젊은이들의 고민과 성장 이야기를 잘 담아내고 있습니다 거리의 활기찬 분위기와 다양한 상점들이 어우러져 있어 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지닙니다 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 속 주인공들과 함께하는 듯한 기분을 느낄 수 있으며 주변 카페에서 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수도 있습니다', '#대치역사거리, #졸업, #K드라마, #청춘, #성장, #거리풍경', '거리/골목/광장', 'Daechi Station Intersection', 'Graduation', '2947 Nambu Circulation-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Daechi Station Intersection, #graduation, #Kdrama, #youth, #growth, #streetscape', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ctOVR2/btsHLyNNiAE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIwJV074JyYZQctECgTY7bkVbuH6j2kdhsLM9hH_F0M-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KCIUfdoYCe%2Fp4O4idAkHjnPyFso%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bJ3ncV/btsHLNKHfWK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPW20O9BMdmvrG8Y5RRA-8K2TUXC-dSuCL3yB3fj9it_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zOiayBQsztiSvEP5SCAuCZiQq44%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cjktrl/btsHKGMCmsn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALJ3fA5NTuM3cb_GbeDPPyq0u6TkZaGN8RiVELlI8n1J/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RuYq1kd%2BtKJKJRiLsk5zzr4NAlM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ctOVR2/btsHLyNNiAE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIwJV074JyYZQctECgTY7bkVbuH6j2kdhsLM9hH_F0M-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KCIUfdoYCe%2Fp4O4idAkHjnPyFso%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bJ3ncV/btsHLNKHfWK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPW20O9BMdmvrG8Y5RRA-8K2TUXC-dSuCL3yB3fj9it_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zOiayBQsztiSvEP5SCAuCZiQq44%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cjktrl/btsHKGMCmsn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALJ3fA5NTuM3cb_GbeDPPyq0u6TkZaGN8RiVELlI8n1J/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RuYq1kd%2BtKJKJRiLsk5zzr4NAlM%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ctOVR2/btsHLyNNiAE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIwJV074JyYZQctECgTY7bkVbuH6j2kdhsLM9hH_F0M-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KCIUfdoYCe%2Fp4O4idAkHjnPyFso%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bJ3ncV/btsHLNKHfWK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPW20O9BMdmvrG8Y5RRA-8K2TUXC-dSuCL3yB3fj9it_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zOiayBQsztiSvEP5SCAuCZiQq44%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cjktrl/btsHKGMCmsn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALJ3fA5NTuM3cb_GbeDPPyq0u6TkZaGN8RiVELlI8n1J/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RuYq1kd%2BtKJKJRiLsk5zzr4NAlM%3D', 37.4945248, 127.062584, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 졸업\n- **촬영지:** 대치역사거리\n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 촬영된 장면을 재현해보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 거리/골목\n\n### 여행 포인트\n대치역사거리는 드라마 "졸업"의 주요 촬영지로, 이곳에서의 장면들은 젊은이들의 고민과 성장 이야기를 잘 담아내고 있습니다. 거리의 활기찬 분위기와 다양한 상점들이 어우러져 있어, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지닙니다. 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 속 주인공들과 함께하는 듯한 기분을 느낄 수 있으며, 주변 카페에서 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수도 있습니다.', 'Daechi Station Street is the main filming location of the drama Graduation and the scenes here capture the stories of young peoples worries and growth The vibrant atmosphere of the street and various shops are harmonized which means a special meaning to drama fans If you visit here you can feel like you are with the main characters in the drama and you can also spend time leisurely at nearby cafes'),
	(160, '졸업', '제너스PC대치점', '서울 강남구 남부순환로 2935 대치역1번출구 바로앞', '제너스PC대치점은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 최신 게임 환경을 갖춘 PC방입니다 이곳은 친구들과 함께 게임을 즐기며 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 최적의 장소로 다양한 게임과 편안한 좌석이 마련되어 있어 오랜 시간 머물기에도 적합합니다 또한 간단한 스낵과 음료를 즐기며 게임에 몰입할 수 있는 환경이 조성되어 있어 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라 게임 애호가들에게도 매력적인 방문지입니다', '#PC방, #게임, #졸업, #친구, #오락, #편안한환경', '기타/판별불가', 'Jenners PC Daechi Branch', 'Graduation', 'Right in front of Exit 1 of Daechi Station, 2935, Nambu Circulation-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#PC room, #game, #graduation, #friend, #entertainment, #comfortable environment', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bw9crX/btsHuKnlNIo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEXaO0e0YhsjRjwW__OZamrR1yq9xIOEP_GjnmtDw-Sj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=c5WEWaP51axfcNtrIE8hGcA%2FYXc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bO6ypZ/btsHurhf1vy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO_8Fn2cLby7UU0z9ySVpHXP0WDvFbTTU-tV5VV9hV10/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=N3TosCcFj5Ry9uUt7%2BPOO43%2Bes0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bw9crX/btsHuKnlNIo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEXaO0e0YhsjRjwW__OZamrR1yq9xIOEP_GjnmtDw-Sj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=c5WEWaP51axfcNtrIE8hGcA%2FYXc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bO6ypZ/btsHurhf1vy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO_8Fn2cLby7UU0z9ySVpHXP0WDvFbTTU-tV5VV9hV10/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=N3TosCcFj5Ry9uUt7%2BPOO43%2Bes0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bw9crX/btsHuKnlNIo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEXaO0e0YhsjRjwW__OZamrR1yq9xIOEP_GjnmtDw-Sj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=c5WEWaP51axfcNtrIE8hGcA%2FYXc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bO6ypZ/btsHurhf1vy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO_8Fn2cLby7UU0z9ySVpHXP0WDvFbTTU-tV5VV9hV10/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=N3TosCcFj5Ry9uUt7%2BPOO43%2Bes0%3D', NULL, 37.4940247, 127.0613442, '### 여행 포인트\n제너스PC대치점은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 최신 게임 환경을 갖춘 PC방입니다. 이곳은 친구들과 함께 게임을 즐기며 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 최적의 장소로, 다양한 게임과 편안한 좌석이 마련되어 있어 오랜 시간 머물기에도 적합합니다. 또한, 간단한 스낵과 음료를 즐기며 게임에 몰입할 수 있는 환경이 조성되어 있어, 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라 게임 애호가들에게도 매력적인 방문지입니다.', 'Jenners PC Daechi branch is the filming location of the drama Graduation and is a PC room with the latest game environment This is the best place to enjoy games with friends and feel the sensibility of drama and there are various games and comfortable seats making it suitable for long stays In addition it is an attractive destination for not only drama fans but also game lovers as it has an environment where you can immerse yourself in the game while enjoying simple snacks and drinks'),
	(161, '졸업', '청실종합상가', '서울 강남구 남부순환로 2917 대치역1번출구 도보4분', '청실종합상가는 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 특히 야경이 매력적인 장소입니다 이곳에서는 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유롭게 산책할 수 있고 주변 카페에서 휴식을 취하기에도 좋은 위치입니다 드라마 팬이라면 놓치지 말아야 할 필수 방문지입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #청실종합상가, #야경, #산책로, #카페, #서울', '기타', 'Cheongsil General Shopping Center', 'Graduation', '4 minutes walk from Exit 1 of Daechi Station, 2917 Nambu Circulation-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Drama filming location, #CheongsilCommercial Complex, #Nightscape, #Walkroad, #Cafe, #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vEAVH/btsHmCKFkfo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIuGkqZ-HNBpZlw_HQH8ax-kHBrMaowemB2Obd8rgZqM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cf8X1es8mf0uA5tYuV1RZhsO%2BNU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pp7dm/btsHn5q4TWk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJAy73ezgBO7uhuvUwmXYnYePy4-92ktM7odXK3FLxux/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=f9gQpEaAN%2BlVaguSLVAR6Xmdwpc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xpK24/btsHmXtSAoi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABKAv8StkePglwnGzBDkUzfu3yMaudJxaSrPX1ZBNWG4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pNUddV4RzXJrWXXen32oxIqix8E%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vEAVH/btsHmCKFkfo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIuGkqZ-HNBpZlw_HQH8ax-kHBrMaowemB2Obd8rgZqM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cf8X1es8mf0uA5tYuV1RZhsO%2BNU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pp7dm/btsHn5q4TWk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJAy73ezgBO7uhuvUwmXYnYePy4-92ktM7odXK3FLxux/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=f9gQpEaAN%2BlVaguSLVAR6Xmdwpc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xpK24/btsHmXtSAoi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABKAv8StkePglwnGzBDkUzfu3yMaudJxaSrPX1ZBNWG4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pNUddV4RzXJrWXXen32oxIqix8E%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vEAVH/btsHmCKFkfo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIuGkqZ-HNBpZlw_HQH8ax-kHBrMaowemB2Obd8rgZqM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cf8X1es8mf0uA5tYuV1RZhsO%2BNU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pp7dm/btsHn5q4TWk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJAy73ezgBO7uhuvUwmXYnYePy4-92ktM7odXK3FLxux/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=f9gQpEaAN%2BlVaguSLVAR6Xmdwpc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xpK24/btsHmXtSAoi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABKAv8StkePglwnGzBDkUzfu3yMaudJxaSrPX1ZBNWG4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pNUddV4RzXJrWXXen32oxIqix8E%3D', 37.4931481, 127.0590766, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 졸업\n- **촬영지:** 청실종합상가\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마 촬영지로, 아름다운 야경을 감상할 수 있는 장소입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n청실종합상가는 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 특히 야경이 매력적인 장소입니다. 이곳에서는 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유롭게 산책할 수 있고, 주변 카페에서 휴식을 취하기에도 좋은 위치입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 놓치지 말아야 할 필수 방문지입니다.', 'Cheongsil General Shopping Center is the filming location of the drama Graduation and the night view is especially attractive Here you can take a leisurely walk while feeling the sensibility of the drama and it is a good place to relax at the nearby cafe If you are a drama fan it is a mustsee destination'),
	(162, '졸업', '래미안대치팰리스 정류장', '서울 강남구 남부순환로 2913 대치역1번출구 위에서1분', '래미안대치팰리스 정류장은 드라마 졸업의 주요 촬영지로 현대적인 도시 풍경과 조화를 이루는 아름다운 야경이 인상적입니다 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기 좋은 장소로 주변 카페에서 여유로운 시간을 보내기에도 적합합니다 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해 보세요', '#졸업, #야경, #드라마촬영지, #서울, #산책', '기타', 'Ramian Daechi Palace Station', 'Graduation', '1 minute above Exit 1 of Daechi Station, 2913, Nambu Circulation-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Graduation, #nightscape, #drama shooting location, #Seoul, #walk', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HZSqZ/btsHms9lGyG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB4RORJBf0EfrJ12Y-Lj4hVYW2yD-7KscdxjLqS4BJcN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qqG2mdGNkJZgS5mne%2BXFT3VcvzE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/buhiqK/btsHmSsUMSD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL-h-SeyUKV0Ehesl6sHGXfStxASgs_OaI9RwvbeyF7N/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qQiTz2cPoC618y6SQQjEBdmsGD8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GSOHM/btsHtvyec66/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADqSe8eyF0ySZ07nnWU7KhaplfzNlWkN-s7M_cUpIs7Y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6kawJ1OZ%2BMWklJkp5dIyHsWZhbM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Ch2ER/btsHuym3vZt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMMKO1-fLLyBKIjwl-iA0VBloZPkzlEN492LrPsRfDix/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KfLk7SiZzRcLrltILAdsDzipfhg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Dls1K/btsHtH6lWNV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAum-LzQAOxYPLrO2SioVmT7CWJkTgXzI_1HDjVWGmeX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BrlgpjbXisWahbL%2B%2FRS48Wg3FX8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cOjVPT/btsHvyGEUyh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAiWWBOZFQzxDv7AcU_c1ZhXHBpTISODly7eQ1ON-Hhi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qalidNaLZwi1%2F2Mteeg5v4l1TBE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kaka