	(163, '졸업', '재경빌딩', '서울 강남구 남부순환로 2947 대치역2번출구 바로앞', '재경빌딩은 서울의 번화한 거리에서 찾을 수 있는 현대적인 건축물로 드라마 졸업의 배경으로 유명합니다 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들은 도시의 활기찬 분위기를 잘 담고 있어 팬들에게는 특별한 의미가 있습니다 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 드라마 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 장소입니다', '#KdramaTrip #졸업 #재경빌딩 #서울여행 #도시풍경', '건물', 'Jaekyung Building', 'Graduation', 'Right in front of Exit 2 of Daechi Station, 2947 Nambu Circulation-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Building', '#KdramaTrip #graduation #Jaegyeong Building #SeoulTravel #urbanscape', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/o0eRx/btsHmUK4Y6X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMUx4nngQLtq88HkHKUwA5J5Myi2fWK3-zPJK5PEcfLT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=r73ca0vXSYaF6WOqcuY75IgjhOM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bilRpe/btsHmrWSWIc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANSNwHJmp2VTEFZcW4HGdfywliDJKLFpNxlzkmtJlfTD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DztE7%2FVm73tN6T7z7AX%2FYPIyh2k%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pdNc5/btsHRmgN0dd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALxgY__QtBurhYM4J44VinPqW8GzpjOb17XaMeZ23gtL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=J%2BTcMkJLyRe84tfhQyYmawshghc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/23Mi0/btsHSsmNYvI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA7fp9rHs7WZpreFeDTF344Fco318xzXUHLaomUJh4Y1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9P4W1jsZpWnHPFnqUaUdSVKBJWU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bzRWUz/btsH8F7N4Zi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEY92rwxLEb6enGnvtVo8S0LsULjqO7ixYNeo0HsMOoQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oHQhEzR9EDPbWdOMwcvm6XlVzsk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dnzWV6/btsH9GSdVV6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOYWjRBz1U5HhJPdDEiOxRLvyhO23Vha0nc5rgx13Coh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=A72HVOl5zmnRfn%2F3O2IKKDSwP98%3D,https://