gnature=Xuf8RLnVZCfz9PGMaqKFc12pP34%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/o0eRx/btsHmUK4Y6X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMUx4nngQLtq88HkHKUwA5J5Myi2fWK3-zPJK5PEcfLT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=r73ca0vXSYaF6WOqcuY75IgjhOM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bilRpe/btsHmrWSWIc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANSNwHJmp2VTEFZcW4HGdfywliDJKLFpNxlzkmtJlfTD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DztE7%2FVm73tN6T7z7AX%2FYPIyh2k%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pdNc5/btsHRmgN0dd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALxgY__QtBurhYM4J44VinPqW8GzpjOb17XaMeZ23gtL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=J%2BTcMkJLyRe84tfhQyYmawshghc%3D', 37.4945248, 127.062584, '### 건물: 재경빌딩\n**드라마 제목:** 졸업  \n**촬영지:** 재경빌딩  \n**방문 팁:** 이곳은 드라마 "졸업"의 주요 촬영지로, 현대적인 도시 풍경을 감상할 수 있습니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 건물  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n재경빌딩은 서울의 번화한 거리에서 찾을 수 있는 현대적인 건축물로, 드라마 "졸업"의 배경으로 유명합니다. 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들은 도시의 활기찬 분위기를 잘 담고 있어, 팬들에게는 특별한 의미가 있습니다. 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어, 드라마 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 장소입니다.', 'The Jaegyeong Building is a modern structure that can be found on the busy streets of Seoul and is famous for its setting in the drama Graduation The scenes shot here contain the lively atmosphere of the city which means a special meaning to fans There are various cafes and shops around so its a place where you can spend your time leisurely after visiting the filming location of the drama'),
	(164, '졸업', 'CU대치삼성점', '서울 강남구 도곡로 516 대치역3번출구 도보10분', 'CU대치삼성점은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 아늑한 분위기와 함께 다양한 간편식과 음료를 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다 이곳에서 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것도 좋습니다 주변의 다른 명소들과 함께 방문하면 더욱 알찬 여행이 될 것입니다', '#CU대치삼성점, #졸업, #드라마촬영지, #편안한장소, #여유로운시간', '기타/판별불가', 'CU Daechi Samsung Branch', 'Graduation', '10-minute walk from Exit 3 of Daechi Station, 516 Dogok-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#CU Daechi Samsung Branch, #graduation, #drama shooting location, #comfortable place, #relaxing time', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/n6AKS/btsHtqDNznI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIOZhT7sCrGFRO6zic-dIQak73XgjtMnPb18SkMvbp3H/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zK02%2B%2B32Zl92ye4wddtb69tbon0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ouBaj/btsHvwWmKnf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP_E0LZQJsWOBPX5foBdn4CnIEAqwyFRCy15dBM6ATfE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KcYOn98G%2B6Ik%2Fn2JCRJZdlJetBs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/VYlNq/btsHtj5T1z6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEEdeBnmZCKL4oOEN8av5VC8XVGIfqATXQPjHn7eJlbG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z9DbHwcjMR1SZg4Jg52KkaDlH6Q%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/p8aHX/btsHtNeiwSy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIdp-A6NAee_Ia3ue8nSCeh98V_ghgeI0rWm_Du82Ukv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0FZrTt7ZGC%2BkzC3TyfyYf5vIsN4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/n6AKS/btsHtqDNznI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIOZhT7sCrGFRO6zic-dIQak73XgjtMnPb18SkMvbp3H/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zK02%2B%2B32Zl92ye4wddtb69tbon0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ouBaj/btsHvwWmKnf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP_E0LZQJsWOBPX5foBdn4CnIEAqwyFRCy15dBM6ATfE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KcYOn98G%2B6Ik%2Fn2JCRJZdlJetBs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/VYlNq/btsHtj5T1z6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEEdeBnmZCKL4oOEN8av5VC8XVGIfqATXQPjHn7eJlbG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z9DbHwcjMR1SZg4Jg52KkaDlH6Q%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/p8aHX/btsHtNeiwSy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIdp-A6NAee_Ia3ue8nSCeh98V_ghgeI0rWm_Du82Ukv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0FZrTt7ZGC%2BkzC3TyfyYf5vIsN4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/n6AKS/btsHtqDNznI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIOZhT7sCrGFRO6zic-dIQak73XgjtMnPb18SkMvbp3H/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zK02%2B%2B32Zl92ye4wddtb69tbon0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ouBaj/btsHvwWmKnf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP_E0LZQJsWOBPX5foBdn4CnIEAqwyFRCy15dBM6ATfE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KcYOn98G%2B6Ik%2Fn2JCRJZdlJetBs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/VYlNq/btsHtj5T1z6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEEdeBnmZCKL4oOEN8av5VC8XVGIfqATXQPjHn7eJlbG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z9DbHwcjMR1SZg4Jg52KkaDlH6Q%3D', 37.4992034, 127.0630995, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: CU대치삼성점\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 장소로, 편안하게 앉아 주변을 감상해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\nCU대치삼성점은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기와 함께 다양한 간편식과 음료를 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다. 이곳에서 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것도 좋습니다. 주변의 다른 명소들과 함께 방문하면 더욱 알찬 여행이 될 것입니다.', 'CU Daechi Samsung branch is the filming location of the drama Graduation where you can enjoy a variety of snacks and drinks with a cozy atmosphere Its also good to spend a relaxing time here thinking about the scenes in the drama It will be a more fulfilling trip if you visit with other nearby attractions'),
	(165, '졸업', '서울베다니교회', '서울 강남구 삼성로62길 14 대치역3번출구 위에서6분', '서울베다니교회는 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 따뜻하고 아늑한 분위기를 자아냅니다 내부는 깔끔하게 정돈되어 있어 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 공간입니다 방문객들은 조용한 환경에서 기도하거나 생각에 잠길 수 있으며 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 장소입니다', '#졸업 #드라마촬영지 #조용한장소 #서울베다니교회 #KdramaTrip #Temple', '사찰/종교', 'Seoul Vedani Church', 'Graduation', '6 minutes above Exit 3 of Daechi Station, 14, Samseong-ro 62-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a temple/religion', '#Graduation #DramaFilmingPlace #QuietPlace #SeoulBedaniChurch #KdramaTrip #Temple', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bByxAo/btsH8mAQkay/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP7H-BPCfMJQPvjmpqC2YmSZCbn_xW9dxn29sVKGy6Af/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cP6GMOy1wXfguX8bdgXFoz32zZ8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/782WR/btsH8URbubh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJwT4_khIjLjyYmtTwQxBCe9m8L6LdHSsyGD3LMKq3IF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EzOiTTtvr8q9PHrniV6C5PGd%2F9c%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bByxAo/btsH8mAQkay/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP7H-BPCfMJQPvjmpqC2YmSZCbn_xW9dxn29sVKGy6Af/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cP6GMOy1wXfguX8bdgXFoz32zZ8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/782WR/btsH8URbubh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJwT4_khIjLjyYmtTwQxBCe9m8L6LdHSsyGD3LMKq3IF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EzOiTTtvr8q9PHrniV6C5PGd%2F9c%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bByxAo/btsH8mAQkay/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP7H-BPCfMJQPvjmpqC2YmSZCbn_xW9dxn29sVKGy6Af/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cP6GMOy1wXfguX8bdgXFoz32zZ8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/782WR/btsH8URbubh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJwT4_khIjLjyYmtTwQxBCe9m8L6LdHSsyGD3LMKq3IF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EzOiTTtvr8q9PHrniV6C5PGd%2F9c%3D', NULL, 37.4997608, 127.0619091, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 졸업\n- **촬영지:** 서울베다니교회\n- **방문팁:** 조용한 분위기에서 여유롭게 시간을 보내기 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Temple\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 사찰\n\n### 여행 포인트\n서울베다니교회는 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 따뜻하고 아늑한 분위기를 자아냅니다. 내부는 깔끔하게 정돈되어 있어, 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 공간입니다. 방문객들은 조용한 환경에서 기도하거나 생각에 잠길 수 있으며, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 장소입니다.', 'Vedani Church in Seoul is the filming location of the drama Graduation creating a warm and cozy atmosphere The interior is neatly organized so it is a space where you can spend your time feeling the sensibility of the drama Visitors can pray or indulge in thoughts in a quiet environment and it is a place to leave special memories for drama fans'),
	(166, '졸업', '하늘도시', '서울 강남구 삼성로 301 대치역3번출구 위에서5분', '하늘도시는 드라마 졸업의 주요 촬영지로 현대적인 도시 풍경과 함께 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 방문객들에게 매력적인 장소입니다 이곳은 특히 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유롭게 산책하기에 좋은 곳으로 주변의 아름다운 거리 풍경과 함께 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있습니다 다양한 사진 촬영 포인트가 많아 인스타그램에 올리기에도 적합합니다', '#드라마촬영지 #하늘도시 #산책 #서울여행 #K드라마', '거리/골목/광장', 'Sky City', 'Graduation', '5 minutes above Exit 3 of Daechi Station, 301, Samseong-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Drama filming location #Sky City #Walk #SeoulTravel #K-Drama', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bue4jf/btsIiglHFJX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADefHUZ1iQoTmL72HSdmscjilP90yoqcBxwLQL2bkZwR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BWzNVYyW3WIm8nOG344gCEIWerM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfss0P/btsIjbRzX7X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE-4gBW9CUHBL7eAz-t87eX3ZIKxbqzSVJxySX5UoO7Q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tlB6dCgFs9O%2F8p98UNJLun8zOH8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cb6gie/btsIiiqgn1U/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEnrVQ9Z6BcA6_rKAXwyrJGNDEqG9GmheVrYS7xk8I6p/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=r1A1N0wqX2U5TktqDOaKuS0E24U%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cnKYzV/btsIhdQ0Ic5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFtT-WFgR56Z8NRNgN_ajuOl5hoPwveqhBdY2f5CBjVS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=GknclzCj1%2F2FGhAcus79K8q%2F4sc%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bue4jf/btsIiglHFJX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADefHUZ1iQoTmL72HSdmscjilP90yoqcBxwLQL2bkZwR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BWzNVYyW3WIm8nOG344gCEIWerM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfss0P/btsIjbRzX7X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE-4gBW9CUHBL7eAz-t87eX3ZIKxbqzSVJxySX5UoO7Q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tlB6dCgFs9O%2F8p98UNJLun8zOH8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cb6gie/btsIiiqgn1U/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEnrVQ9Z6BcA6_rKAXwyrJGNDEqG9GmheVrYS7xk8I6p/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=r1A1N0wqX2U5TktqDOaKuS0E24U%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cnKYzV/btsIhdQ0Ic5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFtT-WFgR56Z8NRNgN_ajuOl5hoPwveqhBdY2f5CBjVS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=GknclzCj1%2F2FGhAcus79K8q%2F4sc%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bue4jf/btsIiglHFJX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADefHUZ1iQoTmL72HSdmscjilP90yoqcBxwLQL2bkZwR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BWzNVYyW3WIm8nOG344gCEIWerM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfss0P/btsIjbRzX7X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE-4gBW9CUHBL7eAz-t87eX3ZIKxbqzSVJxySX5UoO7Q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tlB6dCgFs9O%2F8p98UNJLun8zOH8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cb6gie/btsIiiqgn1U/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEnrVQ9Z6BcA6_rKAXwyrJGNDEqG9GmheVrYS7xk8I6p/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=r1A1N0wqX2U5TktqDOaKuS0E24U%3D', 37.499102, 127.0604069, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 졸업\n- **촬영지:** 하늘도시\n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책을 즐겨보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #태그\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 거리\n\n### 여행 포인트\n하늘도시는 드라마 "졸업"의 주요 촬영지로, 현대적인 도시 풍경과 함께 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 방문객들에게 매력적인 장소입니다. 이곳은 특히 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유롭게 산책하기에 좋은 곳으로, 주변의 아름다운 거리 풍경과 함께 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있습니다. 다양한 사진 촬영 포인트가 많아 인스타그램에 올리기에도 적합합니다.', 'Haneul City is the main filming location for the drama Graduation and it is an attractive place for visitors as it has various cafes and shops along with a modern cityscape This place is especially good for taking a leisurely walk while feeling the sensibility of the drama and you can make special memories with the beautiful street scenery around you It is also suitable for posting on Instagram because it has many different photo points'),
	(167, '졸업', '강남새천년온누리약국', '서울 강남구 도곡로 523 대치역4번출구 도보11분', '강남새천년온누리약국은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 강남의 복잡한 거리에서 독특한 매력을 발산합니다 주변에는 다양한 상점과 카페가 있어 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라 관광객들에게도 좋은 포토 스팟이 됩니다 이곳을 방문하면 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다', '#드라마촬영지, #강남, #온누리약국, #졸업, #K드라마, #포토스팟', '거리/골목/광장', 'Gangnam New Millennium Onnuri Pharmacy', 'Graduation', '11-minute walk from Exit 4 of Daechi Station, 523 Dogok-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Drama filming location, #Gangnam, #Onnuri Pharmacy, #graduation, #Kdrama, #photospot', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bEhULf/btsHmT6rD97/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJOo_vy55CB0SnnK5borjbcgp05Ih7mLz-1KqpPunQw3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tcW%2Bt80un%2FS8bwkkDJECYtaTggU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/di9ZkL/btsHmro2EKN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ9qs04utY1uku7JzHmkqljUtX4f0lLsNFebmhZxrFnX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Sh%2BTl5UnMn7nfoqNh7IJb52wQP8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FpB6d/btsHngtdnAt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHSIKWpGheUo1EcBWHjklXj8e8MSWerzuFeQVcbsDR8X/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=60UJLOsvGxWXjWeABWrtawVYYxs%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bEhULf/btsHmT6rD97/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJOo_vy55CB0SnnK5borjbcgp05Ih7mLz-1KqpPunQw3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tcW%2Bt80un%2FS8bwkkDJECYtaTggU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/di9ZkL/btsHmro2EKN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ9qs04utY1uku7JzHmkqljUtX4f0lLsNFebmhZxrFnX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Sh%2BTl5UnMn7nfoqNh7IJb52wQP8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FpB6d/btsHngtdnAt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHSIKWpGheUo1EcBWHjklXj8e8MSWerzuFeQVcbsDR8X/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=60UJLOsvGxWXjWeABWrtawVYYxs%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bEhULf/btsHmT6rD97/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJOo_vy55CB0SnnK5borjbcgp05Ih7mLz-1KqpPunQw3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tcW%2Bt80un%2FS8bwkkDJECYtaTggU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/di9ZkL/btsHmro2EKN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ9qs04utY1uku7JzHmkqljUtX4f0lLsNFebmhZxrFnX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Sh%2BTl5UnMn7nfoqNh7IJb52wQP8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FpB6d/btsHngtdnAt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHSIKWpGheUo1EcBWHjklXj8e8MSWerzuFeQVcbsDR8X/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=60UJLOsvGxWXjWeABWrtawVYYxs%3D', 37.5001569, 127.063734, '### 거리 촬영지 정보\n\n**제목:** 졸업  \n**촬영지:** 강남새천년온누리약국  \n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마 촬영지로, 팬들에게 인기 있는 장소입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #태그  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리\n\n### 여행 포인트\n강남새천년온누리약국은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 강남의 복잡한 거리에서 독특한 매력을 발산합니다. 주변에는 다양한 상점과 카페가 있어 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라 관광객들에게도 좋은 포토 스팟이 됩니다. 이곳을 방문하면 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다.', 'Gangnam New Millennium Onnuri Pharmacy is the filming location for the drama Graduation which gives off a unique charm on the complex streets of Gangnam There are various shops and cafes around making it a good photo spot not only for drama fans but also for tourists If you visit here you can have a special experience by thinking of a scene from a drama'),
	(168, '졸업', '카페아에르', '서울 강남구 도곡로 538 대치역4번출구 위에서4분', '카페아에르는 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 아늑한 분위기와 세련된 인테리어가 매력적인 공간입니다 이곳은 조용하고 편안한 환경을 제공하여 독서나 작업을 하기에 적합합니다 다양한 커피와 디저트를 즐기며 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 방문 시 드라마의 한 장면처럼 여유로운 시간을 보내보세요', '#졸업, #카페, #작업, #조용한곳, #서울, #휴식', '카페/레스토랑', 'Café aère', 'Graduation', '4 minutes above Exit 4 of Daechi Station, 538, Dogok-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Graduation, #café, #work, #quietplace, #Seoul, #resting', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Tbfs7/btsHBttBgEx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABkuESxxU-gc0b0AxPfnEME0FP9Djhbm_ZpSaAXIAgF5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EsflKe16o0dk9cfpCyT%2BaBBSfhg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/blm2iM/btsHBmBlg68/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFORK2ROdjZw_q4_FaxU59_8ZCZvi6A8PkA7tIRlx5AJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NEWPw9kODW5nNlAKk1vbKyzImU8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Tbfs7/btsHBttBgEx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABkuESxxU-gc0b0AxPfnEME0FP9Djhbm_ZpSaAXIAgF5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EsflKe16o0dk9cfpCyT%2BaBBSfhg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/blm2iM/btsHBmBlg68/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFORK2ROdjZw_q4_FaxU59_8ZCZvi6A8PkA7tIRlx5AJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NEWPw9kODW5nNlAKk1vbKyzImU8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Tbfs7/btsHBttBgEx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABkuESxxU-gc0b0AxPfnEME0FP9Djhbm_ZpSaAXIAgF5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EsflKe16o0dk9cfpCyT%2BaBBSfhg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/blm2iM/btsHBmBlg68/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFORK2ROdjZw_q4_FaxU59_8ZCZvi6A8PkA7tIRlx5AJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NEWPw9kODW5nNlAKk1vbKyzImU8%3D', NULL, 37.50024860000001, 127.0659925, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 졸업  \n**촬영지:** 카페아에르  \n**방문팁:** 조용한 분위기에서 작업하기 좋은 공간입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n카페아에르는 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기와 세련된 인테리어가 매력적인 공간입니다. 이곳은 조용하고 편안한 환경을 제공하여 독서나 작업을 하기에 적합합니다. 다양한 커피와 디저트를 즐기며 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 방문 시, 드라마의 한 장면처럼 여유로운 시간을 보내보세요.', 'Caffaeare is the filming location of the drama Graduation and it is an attractive space with a cozy atmosphere and sophisticated interior It offers a quiet and comfortable environment making it perfect for reading or working It offers a special experience where you can enjoy a variety of coffee and desserts and feel the sensibility of drama When you visit have a relaxing time like a scene in a drama'),
	(169, '졸업', '대치역 6번출구', '서울 강남구 대치동 398-4', '대치역 6번출구는 드라마 졸업의 주요 촬영지로 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 직접 체험할 수 있습니다 주변의 다양한 카페와 음식점에서 여유로운 시간을 보내며 드라마의 분위기를 만끽해 보세요 특히 저녁 시간대에는 조명이 아름답게 비춰져 특별한 사진을 남기기 좋은 장소입니다', '#졸업 #드라마촬영지 #대치역 #강남 #사진명소 #서울여행', '기타', 'Exit 6 of Daechi Station', 'Graduation', '398-4 Daechi-dong, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Graduation #DramaFilmingPlace #Daechi Station #Gangnam #PhotoAttractions #SeoulTravel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bP5bim/btsHMf8gtOA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACSPl3OME0VRHDIlTtD2agVLEP-FwNIMWFR4ThvOTybz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CFixJaGEU6nFQleCq4V14D%2BaxZU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/da3vzJ/btsHLaz4BNx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE3yK8mis763aP9XINRzg5wy34x-qKPLLHu6e8ZcYvw8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mo%2FzuyiLO7OMYy7ON5YP4QGZMJY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dxeScC/btsHLdKdieu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGYLebHrC6RKwUkO4ex0w1K31Jbfxadg_V7x6KZh_31P/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eTg1RbKkdGPPc%2F1Sd%2BCCMnr7IW8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bP5bim/btsHMf8gtOA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACSPl3OME0VRHDIlTtD2agVLEP-FwNIMWFR4ThvOTybz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CFixJaGEU6nFQleCq4V14D%2BaxZU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/da3vzJ/btsHLaz4BNx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE3yK8mis763aP9XINRzg5wy34x-qKPLLHu6e8ZcYvw8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mo%2FzuyiLO7OMYy7ON5YP4QGZMJY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dxeScC/btsHLdKdieu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGYLebHrC6RKwUkO4ex0w1K31Jbfxadg_V7x6KZh_31P/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eTg1RbKkdGPPc%2F1Sd%2BCCMnr7IW8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bP5bim/btsHMf8gtOA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACSPl3OME0VRHDIlTtD2agVLEP-FwNIMWFR4ThvOTybz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CFixJaGEU6nFQleCq4V14D%2BaxZU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/da3vzJ/btsHLaz4BNx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE3yK8mis763aP9XINRzg5wy34x-qKPLLHu6e8ZcYvw8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mo%2FzuyiLO7OMYy7ON5YP4QGZMJY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dxeScC/btsHLdKdieu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGYLebHrC6RKwUkO4ex0w1K31Jbfxadg_V7x6KZh_31P/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eTg1RbKkdGPPc%2F1Sd%2BCCMnr7IW8%3D', 37.4946274, 127.0640672, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: 대치역 6번출구\n- **방문팁**: 대치역 6번출구에서 드라마의 감성을 직접 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n대치역 6번출구는 드라마 "졸업"의 주요 촬영지로, 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 직접 체험할 수 있습니다. 주변의 다양한 카페와 음식점에서 여유로운 시간을 보내며 드라마의 분위기를 만끽해 보세요. 특히 저녁 시간대에는 조명이 아름답게 비춰져, 특별한 사진을 남기기 좋은 장소입니다.', 'Exit 6 of Daechi Station is the main filming location for the drama Graduation where you can experience the scenes filmed here firsthand Enjoy the atmosphere of the drama while enjoying a leisurely time at various cafes and restaurants around you Especially in the evening the lighting is beautiful making it a good place to take special pictures'),
	(170, '졸업', '레드175대치역점', '서울 강남구 남부순환로 2942 대치역7번출구 도보1분', '레드175대치역점은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 현대적인 인테리어와 편안한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다 다양한 메뉴가 준비되어 있어 식사나 간단한 다과를 즐기기에 좋으며 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있습니다 친구들과 함께 방문하여 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 이야기를 나누는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다', '#졸업 #카페 #데일리 #서울 #촬영지', '카페/레스토랑', 'Red175 Great Barrier Rebellion', 'Graduation', '1 minute walk from Exit 7 of Daechi Station, 2942 Nambu Circulation-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Graduation #Café #Daily #Seoul #FilmingPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bz7Xiv/btsH8VJkNXR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHEfPyjfvwJjtAhYWlVNYIWloCesf-3q9cAnppFresy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X5Sp0OrKjBTV3KQXJ6Iuzf1rl%2BU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cm3vRb/btsH9IoVgXv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOuf1eeRWKdcdmTa6pgeHA49EpalBkZNEUS-aGi4TMTP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FGzV6x3gk40IEOsmZTLw4XF2Bt0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bz7Xiv/btsH8VJkNXR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHEfPyjfvwJjtAhYWlVNYIWloCesf-3q9cAnppFresy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X5Sp0OrKjBTV3KQXJ6Iuzf1rl%2BU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cm3vRb/btsH9IoVgXv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOuf1eeRWKdcdmTa6pgeHA49EpalBkZNEUS-aGi4TMTP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FGzV6x3gk40IEOsmZTLw4XF2Bt0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bz7Xiv/btsH8VJkNXR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHEfPyjfvwJjtAhYWlVNYIWloCesf-3q9cAnppFresy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X5Sp0OrKjBTV3KQXJ6Iuzf1rl%2BU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cm3vRb/btsH9IoVgXv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOuf1eeRWKdcdmTa6pgeHA49EpalBkZNEUS-aGi4TMTP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FGzV6x3gk40IEOsmZTLw4XF2Bt0%3D', NULL, 37.4935818, 127.0623994, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: 레드175대치역점\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 아늑한 분위기로 친구와의 대화나 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 적합합니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n레드175대치역점은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 현대적인 인테리어와 편안한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다. 다양한 메뉴가 준비되어 있어 식사나 간단한 다과를 즐기기에 좋으며, 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있습니다. 친구들과 함께 방문하여 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 이야기를 나누는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다.', 'Red175 Daechi Station is the filming location of the drama Graduation and it is an attractive cafe with a modern interior and a comfortable atmosphere There are a variety of menus so its great to enjoy a meal or a simple refreshment and if youre a drama fan you can make special memories here It will also be a good experience to visit with your friends and talk about the scene that was filmed'),
	(171, '졸업', '삼성로', '서울 강남구 삼성로 150-2 대치역7번출구 위에서3분', '삼성로는 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 도시의 현대적이고 세련된 분위기를 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다 특히 밤에 조명이 켜진 거리에서의 산책은 특별한 경험을 선사합니다 주변의 카페와 상점들이 어우러져 있어 드라마의 장면을 떠올리며 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤입니다 이곳에서 촬영된 장면을 직접 느껴보면서 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 만끽해보세요', '#촬영지 #드라마관람 #산책 #서울 #밤 #세련된', '거리/골목', 'to Samsung', 'Graduation', '3 minutes above Exit 7 of Daechi Station, 150-2 Samseong-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley', '#Filming location #DramaWatching #Walk #Seoul #Night #Sophisticated', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b41Tf2/btsHDL604pS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMbL9XyWmqy45ihZjY5S-J5JW35xLFKkrnUUFKLgpzJ5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2lPLgOjTEqQhjsEne62DrF0j0GU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/q51W8/btsHBOkfx7l/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAqpth3Xue9XgzwHZjKZMcK_Ero00QB06t-o1yToZ-fX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=i%2BBXxwa0zGwk%2BK8qLf0hydR2R4c%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7TJg7/btsHBXBciPz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMPagX30jFhCoUnM4BdjC_5CIYb3r1k9YHzRmRvUio7m/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qF4VKdRdB99eFnkn5UuiAOKW7Uw%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b41Tf2/btsHDL604pS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMbL9XyWmqy45ihZjY5S-J5JW35xLFKkrnUUFKLgpzJ5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2lPLgOjTEqQhjsEne62DrF0j0GU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/q51W8/btsHBOkfx7l/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAqpth3Xue9XgzwHZjKZMcK_Ero00QB06t-o1yToZ-fX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=i%2BBXxwa0zGwk%2BK8qLf0hydR2R4c%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7TJg7/btsHBXBciPz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMPagX30jFhCoUnM4BdjC_5CIYb3r1k9YHzRmRvUio7m/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qF4VKdRdB99eFnkn5UuiAOKW7Uw%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b41Tf2/btsHDL604pS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMbL9XyWmqy45ihZjY5S-J5JW35xLFKkrnUUFKLgpzJ5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2lPLgOjTEqQhjsEne62DrF0j0GU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/q51W8/btsHBOkfx7l/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAqpth3Xue9XgzwHZjKZMcK_Ero00QB06t-o1yToZ-fX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=i%2BBXxwa0zGwk%2BK8qLf0hydR2R4c%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7TJg7/btsHBXBciPz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMPagX30jFhCoUnM4BdjC_5CIYb3r1k9YHzRmRvUio7m/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qF4VKdRdB99eFnkn5UuiAOKW7Uw%3D', 37.4924943, 127.0642462, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 졸업\n- **촬영지:** 삼성로\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 거리/골목\n\n### 여행 포인트\n삼성로는 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 도시의 현대적이고 세련된 분위기를 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다. 특히 밤에 조명이 켜진 거리에서의 산책은 특별한 경험을 선사합니다. 주변의 카페와 상점들이 어우러져 있어, 드라마의 장면을 떠올리며 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤입니다. 이곳에서 촬영된 장면을 직접 느껴보면서, 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 만끽해보세요.', 'Samseongro is the filming location of the drama Graduation where you can feel the modern and sophisticated atmosphere of the city Walking on the streets especially illuminated at night offers a special experience The nearby cafes and shops are harmonized making it perfect for relaxing time while recalling the scenes of the drama Feel the scene filmed here firsthand and enjoy the feeling of being the main character in the drama'),
	(172, '졸업', '선경아파트9동', '서울 강남구 삼성로 151 대치역8번출구 도보6분', '선경아파트9동은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들은 일상 속의 진솔한 감정을 담아내고 있습니다 아파트 주변은 조용하고 아늑한 분위기를 자아내어 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 장소입니다 드라마의 주인공들이 나누는 대화와 감정이 스며든 이 공간에서 방문객들은 마치 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 느낌을 받을 수 있습니다', '#드라마촬영지 #졸업 #아파트 #산책 #감성 #쉽고조용한', '기타/판별불가', 'Sunkyung Apartment 9 Building', 'Graduation', '6-minute walk from Exit 8 of Daechi Station, 151 Samseong-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Drama filming location #graduation #apartment #walk #emotional #easy and quiet', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cRnklg/btsHtdkdYBO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFtywM05rdFTDLpKNMNPBnl4aU3zpQ_9_Hnl-RDrazux/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tK1u9fvZu8cacd%2F5OyoY%2FgG8DfY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oXauC/btsHtttlzqG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANjp37hLuhXAYplt0etCITQCU6tjkBaG1Dbs2mDI5BNO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=SciKSN%2FLi6kZQfCqJm2ydRw%2Fyoc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kx0xv/btsHtSzxvrb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMzGyG45cNIRw3aQDuc_FP-QV3kpdBQv47LWqdwtNrgj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Xihzf0VkiZUAOBjIA8QjSj%2BEeCE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cRnklg/btsHtdkdYBO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFtywM05rdFTDLpKNMNPBnl4aU3zpQ_9_Hnl-RDrazux/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tK1u9fvZu8cacd%2F5OyoY%2FgG8DfY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oXauC/btsHtttlzqG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANjp37hLuhXAYplt0etCITQCU6tjkBaG1Dbs2mDI5BNO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=SciKSN%2FLi6kZQfCqJm2ydRw%2Fyoc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kx0xv/btsHtSzxvrb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMzGyG45cNIRw3aQDuc_FP-QV3kpdBQv47LWqdwtNrgj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Xihzf0VkiZUAOBjIA8QjSj%2BEeCE%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cRnklg/btsHtdkdYBO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFtywM05rdFTDLpKNMNPBnl4aU3zpQ_9_Hnl-RDrazux/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tK1u9fvZu8cacd%2F5OyoY%2FgG8DfY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oXauC/btsHtttlzqG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANjp37hLuhXAYplt0etCITQCU6tjkBaG1Dbs2mDI5BNO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=SciKSN%2FLi6kZQfCqJm2ydRw%2Fyoc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kx0xv/btsHtSzxvrb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMzGyG45cNIRw3aQDuc_FP-QV3kpdBQv47LWqdwtNrgj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Xihzf0VkiZUAOBjIA8QjSj%2BEeCE%3D', 37.4921261, 127.0625653, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: 선경아파트9동\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 곳으로, 조용한 산책을 즐기기에 좋습니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n선경아파트9동은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들은 일상 속의 진솔한 감정을 담아내고 있습니다. 아파트 주변은 조용하고 아늑한 분위기를 자아내어, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 장소입니다. 드라마의 주인공들이 나누는 대화와 감정이 스며든 이 공간에서, 방문객들은 마치 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 느낌을 받을 수 있습니다.', 'Sunkyung Apartment 9 is the filming location of the drama Graduation and the scenes filmed here capture the true feelings of everyday life The area around the apartment creates a quiet and cozy atmosphere making it a place to leave special memories for drama fans In this space where the conversations and emotions of the main characters of the drama permeate visitors can feel as if they have become the main characters in the drama'),
	(173, '졸업', 'CU대치은마동문점', '서울 강남구 영동대로 219 학여울역1번출구 도보6분', 'CU대치은마동문점은 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 현대적인 편의점의 매력을 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다 이곳은 다양한 간식과 음료를 구비하고 있어 드라마 속 주인공처럼 편안한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 촬영지의 독특한 분위기를 즐기며 사진도 찍고 드라마의 명장면을 떠올려보세요', '#편의점, #드라마촬영지, #감성, #간식, #주인공, #서울', '기타/판별불가', 'CU Daechi Eunma Dongmun Branch', 'Graduation', '6 minutes walk from Exit 1 of Hakyeoul Station, 219, Yeongdong-daero, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Convenience store, #drama shooting location, #emotional, #snack, #main character, #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/WZrj0/btsIhiRTzew/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFWPXHMM6xaFjfFQidka0xl3SsdNaX3hNxtJyTmfRKa0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Tk6kwx%2BI3w3MAGENjnXqIJSoG8s%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/2bBYV/btsIhfA5KlV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP5ni14d4m642eCBNbl1oS-CxQnpjBLEWtnQm4wUUXNW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=olAzTR9WAPzVnvDlG1vpNzTnrKk%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/WZrj0/btsIhiRTzew/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFWPXHMM6xaFjfFQidka0xl3SsdNaX3hNxtJyTmfRKa0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Tk6kwx%2BI3w3MAGENjnXqIJSoG8s%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/2bBYV/btsIhfA5KlV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP5ni14d4m642eCBNbl1oS-CxQnpjBLEWtnQm4wUUXNW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=olAzTR9WAPzVnvDlG1vpNzTnrKk%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/WZrj0/btsIhiRTzew/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFWPXHMM6xaFjfFQidka0xl3SsdNaX3hNxtJyTmfRKa0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Tk6kwx%2BI3w3MAGENjnXqIJSoG8s%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/2bBYV/btsIhfA5KlV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP5ni14d4m642eCBNbl1oS-CxQnpjBLEWtnQm4wUUXNW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=olAzTR9WAPzVnvDlG1vpNzTnrKk%3D', NULL, 37.4983564, 127.0682936, '### 졸업 촬영지 정보\n\n**촬영지**: CU대치은마동문점  \n**방문팁**: 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.\n\n#### 여행 포인트\nCU대치은마동문점은 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 현대적인 편의점의 매력을 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다. 이곳은 다양한 간식과 음료를 구비하고 있어, 드라마 속 주인공처럼 편안한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 촬영지의 독특한 분위기를 즐기며, 사진도 찍고 드라마의 명장면을 떠올려보세요.', 'CU Daechieunma Dongmun branch is the filming location of the drama Graduation and it is a place where you can feel the charm of a modern convenience store This place offers a variety of snacks and drinks so you can have a comfortable time like the main character in the drama Enjoy the unique atmosphere of the filming location take pictures and recall the famous scenes of the drama'),
	(174, '졸업', '필경재', '서울 강남구 광평로 205 수서역1번출구 도보9분', '필경재는 드라마 졸업의 촬영지로 전통적인 한국 건축 양식이 돋보이는 아름다운 사찰입니다 이곳은 도심 속에서 조용한 휴식을 제공하며 고즈넉한 풍경과 함께 사색의 시간을 즐기기에 안성맞춤입니다 방문객들은 사찰의 고요한 분위기 속에서 한국의 전통 문화를 느끼고 드라마 속 장면들을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다', '#졸업 #드라마촬영지 #사찰 #서울 #전통문화 #휴식', '사찰/종교', 'a must-have item', 'Graduation', '9 minutes walk from Exit 1 of Suseo Station, 205 Gwangpyeong-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a temple/religion', '#Graduation #DramaFilmingPlace #Test #Seoul #TraditionalCulture #Rest', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bFmVtp/btsHtZk1KA1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKitOEqwKBK9vfV6I9JhXQ9jJYFKBurShuwvOVgLhQJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MwTO4u3NO3bDV8T5fqktorlzzQE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zEW69/btsHt0KXBBn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADDxaEHEa027vGE0MUa9AD0J9-EbSscqCdvPAPVtbdGL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7bXMXnqf1XfU%2Becvi8NT1G%2BawFE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/PxSbk/btsHujwF6Fo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEm19-syT8aiHFUvAiymgTr1lFoZ78rlqVQjEJxBNqqd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7IjoEuRKop7uVDCM4yYkNcPg91w%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bq0z2y/btsHtJXfWSZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKdEuXg81IOqkZgVADszmHGZZnya_PMjNy1abdQAYjUX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YVaWJHpTtuX8xSzomLAOB7P%2BsoI%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bFmVtp/btsHtZk1KA1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKitOEqwKBK9vfV6I9JhXQ9jJYFKBurShuwvOVgLhQJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MwTO4u3NO3bDV8T5fqktorlzzQE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zEW69/btsHt0KXBBn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADDxaEHEa027vGE0MUa9AD0J9-EbSscqCdvPAPVtbdGL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7bXMXnqf1XfU%2Becvi8NT1G%2BawFE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/PxSbk/btsHujwF6Fo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEm19-syT8aiHFUvAiymgTr1lFoZ78rlqVQjEJxBNqqd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7IjoEuRKop7uVDCM4yYkNcPg91w%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bq0z2y/btsHtJXfWSZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKdEuXg81IOqkZgVADszmHGZZnya_PMjNy1abdQAYjUX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YVaWJHpTtuX8xSzomLAOB7P%2BsoI%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bFmVtp/btsHtZk1KA1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKitOEqwKBK9vfV6I9JhXQ9jJYFKBurShuwvOVgLhQJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MwTO4u3NO3bDV8T5fqktorlzzQE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zEW69/btsHt0KXBBn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADDxaEHEa027vGE0MUa9AD0J9-EbSscqCdvPAPVtbdGL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7bXMXnqf1XfU%2Becvi8NT1G%2BawFE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/PxSbk/btsHujwF6Fo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEm19-syT8aiHFUvAiymgTr1lFoZ78rlqVQjEJxBNqqd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7IjoEuRKop7uVDCM4yYkNcPg91w%3D', 37.48486980000001, 127.0952321, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 졸업\n- **촬영지**: 필경재\n- **방문팁**: 이 사찰은 고즈넉한 분위기 속에서 편안한 시간을 보낼 수 있는 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Temple\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 사찰\n\n### 여행 포인트\n필경재는 드라마 "졸업"의 촬영지로, 전통적인 한국 건축 양식이 돋보이는 아름다운 사찰입니다. 이곳은 도심 속에서 조용한 휴식을 제공하며, 고즈넉한 풍경과 함께 사색의 시간을 즐기기에 안성맞춤입니다. 방문객들은 사찰의 고요한 분위기 속에서 한국의 전통 문화를 느끼고, 드라마 속 장면들을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다.', 'Pilgyeongjae is the filming location of the drama Graduation a beautiful temple that features traditional Korean architecture It offers a quiet rest in the city center and is perfect for enjoying a time of contemplation with a tranquil landscape Visitors can feel Korean traditional culture in the tranquil atmosphere of the temple and have a special experience by recalling the scenes in the drama'),
	(175, '졸업', '나살던고향', '서울 송파구 백제고분로7길 24-7 잠실새내역4번출구 도보5분', '나살던고향의 카페는 드라마 졸업의 감성을 그대로 느낄 수 있는 아늑한 공간입니다 전통적인 인테리어와 따뜻한 조명이 어우러져 편안한 분위기를 자아내며 드라마 속 장면들을 떠올리게 합니다 친구와의 소중한 대화를 나누기에도 좋은 장소로 커피 한 잔과 함께 잊지 못할 추억을 만들어보세요', '#커피 #카페 #아늑한공간 #드라마촬영지 #친구와의대화 #졸업', '카페/레스토랑', 'My hometown', 'Graduation', '24-7, Baekje Gobun-ro 7-gil, Songpa-gu, Seoul, 5-minute walk from Exit 4 of Jamsil Saenae Station', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Coffee #Café #CozySpace #DramaShoot #Conversation with Friends #Graduation', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d36EEa/btsH9qIzK0C/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ3lVT7sT2uva-_BGIX3GHpXUK_Sq8_95mjGUITdpGX6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sHIFmdiuapd%2FrViYa%2Bkr5NRj78k%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/br1F0L/btsH70q4uRD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO5fB9hqSQmCQURKCj_eGM9WsrDNWZjJ0Y4jy9phylt6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=GXVXFHpCZM0FhNQ7fnHFv%2F7MPRg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bQkqa0/btsH8Mr0YTw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHlOlUKmveSr4_M7gexVYH0o2h6Irbp9MLwhFiTRu3dO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sgCMs7rxM4EQkPAva5H5T%2FZk5K4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oHumm/btsH873zHEY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFNYE6Da4Xlsj8Cov1p61lvx0yRsPQFY0TM2Y2zFL6-g/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zWz4sdNQ%2BoaPwPs2SUt0Hl4WVvY%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d36EEa/btsH9qIzK0C/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ3lVT7sT2uva-_BGIX3GHpXUK_Sq8_95mjGUITdpGX6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sHIFmdiuapd%2FrViYa%2Bkr5NRj78k%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/br1F0L/btsH70q4uRD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO5fB9hqSQmCQURKCj_eGM9WsrDNWZjJ0Y4jy9phylt6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=GXVXFHpCZM0FhNQ7fnHFv%2F7MPRg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bQkqa0/btsH8Mr0YTw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHlOlUKmveSr4_M7gexVYH0o2h6Irbp9MLwhFiTRu3dO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sgCMs7rxM4EQkPAva5H5T%2FZk5K4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oHumm/btsH873zHEY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFNYE6Da4Xlsj8Cov1p61lvx0yRsPQFY0TM2Y2zFL6-g/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zWz4sdNQ%2BoaPwPs2SUt0Hl4WVvY%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d36EEa/btsH9qIzK0C/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ3lVT7sT2uva-_BGIX3GHpXUK_Sq8_95mjGUITdpGX6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sHIFmdiuapd%2FrViYa%2Bkr5NRj78k%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/br1F0L/btsH70q4uRD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO5fB9hqSQmCQURKCj_eGM9WsrDNWZjJ0Y4jy9phylt6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=GXVXFHpCZM0FhNQ7fnHFv%2F7MPRg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bQkqa0/btsH8Mr0YTw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHlOlUKmveSr4_M7gexVYH0o2h6Irbp9MLwhFiTRu3dO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sgCMs7rxM4EQkPAva5H5T%2FZk5K4%3D', 37.5103438, 127.0817934, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 졸업\n- **촬영지:** 나살던고향\n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 특별한 커피 한 잔과 함께 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n나살던고향의 카페는 드라마 "졸업"의 감성을 그대로 느낄 수 있는 아늑한 공간입니다. 전통적인 인테리어와 따뜻한 조명이 어우러져 편안한 분위기를 자아내며, 드라마 속 장면들을 떠올리게 합니다. 친구와의 소중한 대화를 나누기에도 좋은 장소로, 커피 한 잔과 함께 잊지 못할 추억을 만들어보세요.', 'The cafe in my hometown is a cozy space where you can feel the sensibility of the drama Graduation The combination of traditional interior design and warm lighting creates a comfortable atmosphere and reminds people of scenes in the drama Make unforgettable memories with a cup of coffee as a great place to share precious conversations with friends'),
	(176, '7인의 부활', '신촌 스타광장', '서울 서대문구 연세로 19 신촌역2번출구 도보3분', '신촌 스타광장은 활기찬 분위기와 다양한 문화적 요소로 가득한 곳입니다 드라마 7인의 부활의 촬영지로 유명하며 특히 밤에 화려한 조명과 함께하는 광장의 풍경은 방문객들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 주변에는 맛있는 음식점과 카페들이 많아 드라마 촬영지를 탐방하며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 사진을 찍고 친구들과 이야기를 나누는 것도 좋은 추억이 될 것입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #신촌, #스타광장, #저녁, #문화체험', '거리/골목/광장', 'Sinchon Star Square', 'the resurrection of the septuagenarian', '3-minute walk from Exit 2 of Sinchon Station, 19, Yonsei-ro, Seodaemun-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Drama filming location, #Sinchon, #StarPlatz, #Evening, #CultureExperience', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c8P37i/btsGqjY6R6H/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANJOU5HuMRC6N-4T6KMYPMsuKsysePFgReHTuKgg8DWO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ut%2B1Cz8veATz4zSqGaLp4afbfgM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cQG5FS/btsGrcSfeZp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMhUTn4qNGzvC0eK9J5wLYoi6-BrzM0EdwY6Ss-D42qD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2Fa6qrnsGW2VpiEnQBtRapWoOyLQ%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c8P37i/btsGqjY6R6H/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANJOU5HuMRC6N-4T6KMYPMsuKsysePFgReHTuKgg8DWO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ut%2B1Cz8veATz4zSqGaLp4afbfgM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cQG5FS/btsGrcSfeZp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMhUTn4qNGzvC0eK9J5wLYoi6-BrzM0EdwY6Ss-D42qD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2Fa6qrnsGW2VpiEnQBtRapWoOyLQ%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c8P37i/btsGqjY6R6H/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANJOU5HuMRC6N-4T6KMYPMsuKsysePFgReHTuKgg8DWO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ut%2B1Cz8veATz4zSqGaLp4afbfgM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cQG5FS/btsGrcSfeZp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMhUTn4qNGzvC0eK9J5wLYoi6-BrzM0EdwY6Ss-D42qD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2Fa6qrnsGW2VpiEnQBtRapWoOyLQ%3D', NULL, 37.5573951, 126.9367331, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 7인의 부활\n- **촬영지**: 신촌 스타광장\n- **방문팁**: 신촌 스타광장은 다양한 음식점과 카페가 밀집해 있어 드라마 촬영지 탐방과 함께 즐길 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n신촌 스타광장은 활기찬 분위기와 다양한 문화적 요소로 가득한 곳입니다. 드라마 \'7인의 부활\'의 촬영지로 유명하며, 특히 밤에 화려한 조명과 함께하는 광장의 풍경은 방문객들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 주변에는 맛있는 음식점과 카페들이 많아 드라마 촬영지를 탐방하며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 사진을 찍고, 친구들과 이야기를 나누는 것도 좋은 추억이 될 것입니다.', 'Sinchon Star Square is a place full of lively atmosphere and various cultural elements It is famous as the filming location for the drama The Resurrection of the Seven and the scenery of the square especially with colorful lights at night provides visitors with a special experience There are many delicious restaurants and cafes around so you can spend a leisurely time exploring the filming location of the drama It will be a good memory to take pictures and talk with friends while feeling the sensitivity of the drama here'),
	(177, '7인의 부활', '서울마리나쪽', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 81-10 당산역4번출구 도보15분', '서울마리나쪽은 드라마 7인의 부활의 주요 촬영지로 한강의 아름다운 야경과 함께 드라마 속 감정을 그대로 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다 이 지역은 조용한 분위기 속에서 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 보내기 좋으며 특히 밤에 방문하면 화려한 조명과 함께 로맨틱한 분위기를 만끽할 수 있습니다 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 한번 들러보길 추천합니다', '#서울마리나 #강 #밤 #로맨틱 #산책', '기타', 'Around the Seoul Marina', 'the resurrection of the septuagenarian', '15 minutes walk from Exit 4 of Dangsan Station 81-10 Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Seoul Marina #Gang #Night #Romantic #Walk', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/DFZQZ/btsGBiTAItv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABONFO_ShanLNmpDVzGtE5yBAaGJMOY_Xy420PkVFNEQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Kn%2Bt7h8jVtrvlKK9YlTCGf7SGCY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tfSGx/btsGC3nje11/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMrmxu6Z8w7XJJoO-KpkPdWEsuR2kaRCDa7_x_cH7qMH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Q6OClsFsp06REooyKmYyq0U8Nt8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/N15DG/btsGCy19rE7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALFBVfEo7dL22WS0D-vE3o95yh6KAGTDJqPdIecdKuju/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TOfZKxOogeFSEQ0TkBRa%2BCoVig8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/DFZQZ/btsGBiTAItv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABONFO_ShanLNmpDVzGtE5yBAaGJMOY_Xy420PkVFNEQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Kn%2Bt7h8jVtrvlKK9YlTCGf7SGCY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tfSGx/btsGC3nje11/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMrmxu6Z8w7XJJoO-KpkPdWEsuR2kaRCDa7_x_cH7qMH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Q6OClsFsp06REooyKmYyq0U8Nt8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/N15DG/btsGCy19rE7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALFBVfEo7dL22WS0D-vE3o95yh6KAGTDJqPdIecdKuju/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TOfZKxOogeFSEQ0TkBRa%2BCoVig8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/DFZQZ/btsGBiTAItv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABONFO_ShanLNmpDVzGtE5yBAaGJMOY_Xy420PkVFNEQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Kn%2Bt7h8jVtrvlKK9YlTCGf7SGCY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tfSGx/btsGC3nje11/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMrmxu6Z8w7XJJoO-KpkPdWEsuR2kaRCDa7_x_cH7qMH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Q6OClsFsp06REooyKmYyq0U8Nt8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/N15DG/btsGCy19rE7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALFBVfEo7dL22WS0D-vE3o95yh6KAGTDJqPdIecdKuju/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TOfZKxOogeFSEQ0TkBRa%2BCoVig8%3D', 37.5357154, 126.9111664, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 7인의 부활\n- **촬영지**: 서울마리나쪽\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n서울마리나쪽은 드라마 "7인의 부활"의 주요 촬영지로, 한강의 아름다운 야경과 함께 드라마 속 감정을 그대로 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다. 이 지역은 조용한 분위기 속에서 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 보내기 좋으며, 특히 밤에 방문하면 화려한 조명과 함께 로맨틱한 분위기를 만끽할 수 있습니다. 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 한번 들러보길 추천합니다.', 'The Seoul Marina is the main filming location of the drama The Resurrection of the Seven People where you can feel the emotions of the drama as it is with the beautiful night view of the Han River This area is great for spending precious time with friends in a quiet atmosphere especially when you visit at night you can enjoy a romantic atmosphere with colorful lights If youre a drama fan I recommend you to visit'),
	(178, '7인의 부활', '여의도IFC', '서울 영등포구 국제금융로 10 여의도역3번출구 도보8분', '여의도IFC는 서울의 금융 중심지에 위치해 있어 현대적인 분위기를 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다 드라마 7인의 부활의 주요 촬영지로 세련된 외관과 다양한 편의시설이 마련되어 있어 방문객들에게 편리함을 제공합니다 주변에는 맛집과 카페도 많아 촬영지를 둘러본 후 여유로운 시간을 보내기에도 좋은 장소입니다 KdramaTrip', '#드라마촬영지, #여의도IFC, #현대건축, #맛집투어, #카페, #세련된분위기', '쇼핑몰/백화점', 'Yeouido IFC', 'the resurrection of the septuagenarian', '8 minutes walk from Exit 3 of Yeouido Station, 10 International Finance-ro, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'shopping mall/department store', '#Drama filming location, #YeouidoIFC, #ModernArchitecture, #RestaurantTour, #Café, #SophisticatedAttention', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/DvNZF/btsGeuMP3w1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAELiCWQ7Kko23IQikHCr7V8hVV3xm4VMWe_f7A_nTms_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=h4YISu4a%2B7ErZNKvSalFvY5RXAA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bmSALJ/btsGe8Jjb5p/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFEINIDp3l-m3F41XHa5ZBFAXfPvRQyaJPTqwHk3Jp27/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rMxG3%2F5aBKdiGf7JehMm4caJ3BM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cEIh1e/btsG0uY4Chb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEpb6dM4FToVFEh5OVUayvZihKVcF9TWmPq9noLE_TwE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=G9jF5fnMjcV8LJLvOF62cGnouwM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/AFlG5/btsGYMmEDuM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH3nNvnbzvJ2eiJ-aqcf1VEnl2c_qMc6LOZkhug7UFZn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=stwFapH9xprNBscmidluS04%2FgOk%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/DvNZF/btsGeuMP3w1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAELiCWQ7Kko23IQikHCr7V8hVV3xm4VMWe_f7A_nTms_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=h4YISu4a%2B7ErZNKvSalFvY5RXAA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bmSALJ/btsGe8Jjb5p/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFEINIDp3l-m3F41XHa5ZBFAXfPvRQyaJPTqwHk3Jp27/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rMxG3%2F5aBKdiGf7JehMm4caJ3BM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cEIh1e/btsG0uY4Chb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEpb6dM4FToVFEh5OVUayvZihKVcF9TWmPq9noLE_TwE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=G9jF5fnMjcV8LJLvOF62cGnouwM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/AFlG5/btsGYMmEDuM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH3nNvnbzvJ2eiJ-aqcf1VEnl2c_qMc6LOZkhug7UFZn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=stwFapH9xprNBscmidluS04%2FgOk%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/DvNZF/btsGeuMP3w1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAELiCWQ7Kko23IQikHCr7V8hVV3xm4VMWe_f7A_nTms_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=h4YISu4a%2B7ErZNKvSalFvY5RXAA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bmSALJ/btsGe8Jjb5p/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFEINIDp3l-m3F41XHa5ZBFAXfPvRQyaJPTqwHk3Jp27/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rMxG3%2F5aBKdiGf7JehMm4caJ3BM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cEIh1e/btsG0uY4Chb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEpb6dM4FToVFEh5OVUayvZihKVcF9TWmPq9noLE_TwE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=G9jF5fnMjcV8LJLvOF62cGnouwM%3D', 37.5249782, 126.9252984, '### 7인의 부활 촬영지: 여의도IFC\n\n**방문팁:** 여의도IFC는 현대적인 건축물로, 드라마 촬영지로 방문할 가치가 충분합니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 여의도IFC는 서울의 금융 중심지에 위치해 있어, 현대적인 분위기를 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다. 드라마 "7인의 부활"의 주요 촬영지로, 세련된 외관과 다양한 편의시설이 마련되어 있어 방문객들에게 편리함을 제공합니다. 주변에는 맛집과 카페도 많아 촬영지를 둘러본 후 여유로운 시간을 보내기에도 좋은 장소입니다. #KdramaTrip', 'Yeouido IFC is located in the financial center of Seoul so you can feel the modern atmosphere It is the main filming location of the drama The Resurrection of Seven People and has a sophisticated exterior and a variety of amenities to provide convenience to visitors There are many restaurants and cafes around so it is a good place to spend a leisurely time after looking around the filming location KdramaTrip'),
	(179, '7인의 부활', '여의도물빛광장', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 84-9', '여의도물빛광장은 서울의 현대적인 스카이라인을 배경으로 한 멋진 장소로 드라마 7인의 부활의 촬영지로 유명합니다 이곳은 특히 밤에 화려한 조명이 돋보이며 다양한 문화 행사와 공연이 열리는 공간입니다 주변의 고층 빌딩들과 함께 멋진 사진을 찍을 수 있어 많은 관광객들에게 사랑받고 있습니다 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요', '#여의도물빛광장 #야경 #촬영지 #문화행사 #K드라마 #서울', '거리/골목/광장', 'Yeouido Mulbit Square', 'the resurrection of the septuagenarian', '84-9 Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Yeouido Mulbit Square #Nightscape #FilmingPlace #Cultural Event #K-Drama #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IhxPg/btsGsroaA20/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGBBKc_6l51pf-Of1XzAD1dBErl6Fs77DOPiZpcXc8To/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=V5hz3V3PLB%2BaUPpL9Dcts%2BgQhd4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bcvl7Z/btsGrWvaRdd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHy7ySScEXTs1p3JbVnMcBATl85mGdswMkwUYwl_w6pe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=R78id0Trql2Za1ttNQYMaa1Zsmk%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IhxPg/btsGsroaA20/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGBBKc_6l51pf-Of1XzAD1dBErl6Fs77DOPiZpcXc8To/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=V5hz3V3PLB%2BaUPpL9Dcts%2BgQhd4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bcvl7Z/btsGrWvaRdd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHy7ySScEXTs1p3JbVnMcBATl85mGdswMkwUYwl_w6pe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=R78id0Trql2Za1ttNQYMaa1Zsmk%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IhxPg/btsGsroaA20/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGBBKc_6l51pf-Of1XzAD1dBErl6Fs77DOPiZpcXc8To/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=V5hz3V3PLB%2BaUPpL9Dcts%2BgQhd4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bcvl7Z/btsGrWvaRdd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHy7ySScEXTs1p3JbVnMcBATl85mGdswMkwUYwl_w6pe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=R78id0Trql2Za1ttNQYMaa1Zsmk%3D', NULL, 37.5312454, 126.9286863, '### 7인의 부활 촬영지 정보\n\n**제목:** 7인의 부활  \n**촬영지:** 여의도물빛광장  \n**방문 팁:** 야경이 아름다워 밤에 방문하는 것이 좋습니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 건물  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n여의도물빛광장은 서울의 현대적인 스카이라인을 배경으로 한 멋진 장소로, 드라마 "7인의 부활"의 촬영지로 유명합니다. 이곳은 특히 밤에 화려한 조명이 돋보이며, 다양한 문화 행사와 공연이 열리는 공간입니다. 주변의 고층 빌딩들과 함께 멋진 사진을 찍을 수 있어 많은 관광객들에게 사랑받고 있습니다. 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요.', 'Yeouido Mulbit Square is a wonderful place with Seouls modern skyline in the background and is famous as the filming location for the drama The Resurrection of the Seven This is a place where colorful lights especially stand out at night and various cultural events and performances are held It is loved by many tourists because you can take wonderful pictures with the surrounding skyscrapers If you are a drama fan make special memories here'),
	(180, '7인의 부활', '몬드리안서울이태원', '서울 용산구 장문로 23 이태원역4번출구 도보14분', '몬드리안서울이태원은 고급스러운 인테리어와 독특한 디자인으로 눈길을 끄는 호텔입니다 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들은 드라마의 매력을 한층 더해 주며 방문객들은 그 세련된 공간에서 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다 다양한 편의시설과 아름다운 도시 전망을 갖춘 이 호텔은 여행 중 편안한 휴식을 제공하며 인스타그램에 올리기 좋은 포토 스팟도 많아 많은 관광객들이 찾는 명소입니다', '#호텔 #몽드리안서울이태원 #세련된인테리어 #촬영지 #드라마장소 #인스타그래머블', '호텔/숙소', 'Mondrian Seoul Itaewon', 'the resurrection of the septuagenarian', '14-minute walk from Exit 4 of Itaewon Station, 23 Jangmun-ro, Yongsan-gu, Seoul', 'a hotel/dormitory', '#Hotel #MondrianSeoulItaewon #StyleInterior #FilmingPlace #DramaPlace #Instagramable', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HrJJJ/btsGq92EGkE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFAJS1RtIj6VpJd_tvcrnR-3FK70qpcZebQOjAY72HyF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iDSIC4tV1BCz37jqeOp7S0OtaKM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Cr3Q7/btsGpI6Bnlp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFdbAfFSZ612mdRV19Zpvrums2CiNc1oOE4FEiu4RvJA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Zvke0KlLArlwVE6%2FIXppLIsk74A%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tlIRC/btsGrcyiLgS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADa0YhCvXlAqsHQWiR7jEPnCX2lFKvGHogYQxe2dNUEF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Hu2P2xUzIEMOIbG0cloIcLwXe%2Fw%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HrJJJ/btsGq92EGkE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFAJS1RtIj6VpJd_tvcrnR-3FK70qpcZebQOjAY72HyF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iDSIC4tV1BCz37jqeOp7S0OtaKM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Cr3Q7/btsGpI6Bnlp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFdbAfFSZ612mdRV19Zpvrums2CiNc1oOE4FEiu4RvJA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Zvke0KlLArlwVE6%2FIXppLIsk74A%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tlIRC/btsGrcyiLgS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADa0YhCvXlAqsHQWiR7jEPnCX2lFKvGHogYQxe2dNUEF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Hu2P2xUzIEMOIbG0cloIcLwXe%2Fw%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HrJJJ/btsGq92EGkE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFAJS1RtIj6VpJd_tvcrnR-3FK70qpcZebQOjAY72HyF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iDSIC4tV1BCz37jqeOp7S0OtaKM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Cr3Q7/btsGpI6Bnlp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFdbAfFSZ612mdRV19Zpvrums2CiNc1oOE4FEiu4RvJA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Zvke0KlLArlwVE6%2FIXppLIsk74A%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tlIRC/btsGrcyiLgS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADa0YhCvXlAqsHQWiR7jEPnCX2lFKvGHogYQxe2dNUEF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Hu2P2xUzIEMOIbG0cloIcLwXe%2Fw%3D', 37.528963, 126.9932948, '### 호텔 촬영지: 몬드리안서울이태원\n\n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마 "7인의 부활"의 주요 촬영지로, 현대적이고 세련된 분위기를 즐길 수 있습니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 몬드리안서울이태원은 고급스러운 인테리어와 독특한 디자인으로 눈길을 끄는 호텔입니다. 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들은 드라마의 매력을 한층 더해 주며, 방문객들은 그 세련된 공간에서 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다. 다양한 편의시설과 아름다운 도시 전망을 갖춘 이 호텔은 여행 중 편안한 휴식을 제공하며, 인스타그램에 올리기 좋은 포토 스팟도 많아 많은 관광객들이 찾는 명소입니다.', 'Mondrian Seoul Itaewon is an eyecatching hotel with luxurious interior and unique design The scenes shot here add to the dramas appeal and visitors can have a special experience in the sophisticated space With a variety of amenities and beautiful city views the hotel offers a comfortable rest while traveling and there are many good photo spots to post on Instagram making it a popular attraction for many tourists'),
	(181, '7인의 부활', '백암박가네순대국', '서울 종로구 자하문로 35-2 경복궁역2번출구 도보5분', '백암박가네순대국은 드라마 7인의 부활의 촬영지로 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다 아늑한 분위기와 맛있는 순대국이 매력적인 이곳은 드라마 팬들에게 꼭 추천할 만한 장소입니다 드라마의 주인공들이 거닐었던 공간에서 나만의 이야기를 만들어보세요', '#드라마촬영지, #순대국, #서울, #맛집, #7인의부활', '카페/레스토랑', 'Baekam Bakga Four Soup Soup', 'the resurrection of the septuagenarian', '5-minute walk from Exit 2 of Gyeongbokgung Station, 35-2 Zahamun-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Drama filming location, #Sudukguk, #Seoul, #Restoration of #7 people', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/OC8eG/btsGeauvS16/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIvoKManmHoeHSwUZFpLCnyv0Q9FiQsCcFntxNSalCQT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EjJSQmODPA%2B3DAstmWdqjj6t4Ow%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lQBSH/btsGdRaSc9Z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKELxhTByR9JIsiJrHvXcogFGAcDtfXrNDl5AFwQVMZU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZTCdWQ3BO2%2BywRzp45AjbJO7C8E%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bhVU5j/btsGeQWkLBA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJKpGnEbgk2McC0hkAdFad27hc0aDE0mjuqrdASeCmtX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8DmgJbNzy0QkhWq6n4o9h4CxulQ%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/OC8eG/btsGeauvS16/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIvoKManmHoeHSwUZFpLCnyv0Q9FiQsCcFntxNSalCQT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EjJSQmODPA%2B3DAstmWdqjj6t4Ow%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lQBSH/btsGdRaSc9Z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKELxhTByR9JIsiJrHvXcogFGAcDtfXrNDl5AFwQVMZU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZTCdWQ3BO2%2BywRzp45AjbJO7C8E%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bhVU5j/btsGeQWkLBA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJKpGnEbgk2McC0hkAdFad27hc0aDE0mjuqrdASeCmtX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8DmgJbNzy0QkhWq6n4o9h4CxulQ%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/OC8eG/btsGeauvS16/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIvoKManmHoeHSwUZFpLCnyv0Q9FiQsCcFntxNSalCQT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EjJSQmODPA%2B3DAstmWdqjj6t4Ow%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lQBSH/btsGdRaSc9Z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKELxhTByR9JIsiJrHvXcogFGAcDtfXrNDl5AFwQVMZU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZTCdWQ3BO2%2BywRzp45AjbJO7C8E%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bhVU5j/btsGeQWkLBA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJKpGnEbgk2McC0hkAdFad27hc0aDE0mjuqrdASeCmtX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8DmgJbNzy0QkhWq6n4o9h4CxulQ%3D', 37.5792124, 126.9711303, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 7인의 부활\n- **촬영지**: 백암박가네순대국\n- **방문팁**: 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.\n\n### 여행 포인트\n백암박가네순대국은 드라마 "7인의 부활"의 촬영지로, 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다. 아늑한 분위기와 맛있는 순대국이 매력적인 이곳은 드라마 팬들에게 꼭 추천할 만한 장소입니다. 드라마의 주인공들이 거닐었던 공간에서 나만의 이야기를 만들어보세요.', 'Baekambakganesundeokguk is the filming location of the drama The Resurrection of the Seven People and if you visit here you can have a special experience by recalling the scenes in the drama Attracting from its cozy atmosphere and delicious sundaeguk it is a mustrecommend place for drama fans Create your own story in the space where the main characters of the drama walked'),
	(182, '7인의 부활', '스타스테이지', '서울 종로구 대학로12길 15 헤화역1번출구 도보2분', '스타스테이지는 드라마 7인의 부활의 촬영지로 이곳에서 다양한 장면들이 촬영되었습니다 관객과 배우가 가까이에서 소통할 수 있는 아늑한 공간이 특징이며 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 장소입니다 촬영 현장의 분위기를 느끼며 드라마의 매력을 다시 한 번 되새겨보세요', '#촬영지 #드라마 #서울 #대학로 #관객소통 #스타스테이지', '기타', 'Star stage', 'the resurrection of the septuagenarian', '2-minute walk from Exit 1 of Hehwa Station, 15, Daehak-ro 12-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Filming location #drama #Seoul #Daehak-ro #Audience Communication #Star Stage', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YjIvi/btsHbmHIIr4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANgpYs3e1sPPs6iFtxopVAQttcsggx3IMYsqkD_Wc7DO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BNC55q12%2Bm1ay1J50BQ3Y3oDsh0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c6dpvT/btsHbSFZPBY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALIZy4661wsRLFXKI6Lk0-m0liS2MkJabPc71FKHmFAR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UWaYTEua7LowUnnMR2FVix4Mvyk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/v0feI/btsHbUKBERR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKX-HgxPin-wxnBS-nWxpdqqr5-zqoG6J7L66hxBwRUk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=m0gB%2FBhAgTp%2FYX5hUL4bVyNdZ3I%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YjIvi/btsHbmHIIr4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANgpYs3e1sPPs6iFtxopVAQttcsggx3IMYsqkD_Wc7DO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BNC55q12%2Bm1ay1J50BQ3Y3oDsh0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c6dpvT/btsHbSFZPBY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALIZy4661wsRLFXKI6Lk0-m0liS2MkJabPc71FKHmFAR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UWaYTEua7LowUnnMR2FVix4Mvyk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/v0feI/btsHbUKBERR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKX-HgxPin-wxnBS-nWxpdqqr5-zqoG6J7L66hxBwRUk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=m0gB%2FBhAgTp%2FYX5hUL4bVyNdZ3I%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YjIvi/btsHbmHIIr4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANgpYs3e1sPPs6iFtxopVAQttcsggx3IMYsqkD_Wc7DO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BNC55q12%2Bm1ay1J50BQ3Y3oDsh0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c6dpvT/btsHbSFZPBY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALIZy4661wsRLFXKI6Lk0-m0liS2MkJabPc71FKHmFAR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UWaYTEua7LowUnnMR2FVix4Mvyk%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/v0feI/btsHbUKBERR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKX-HgxPin-wxnBS-nWxpdqqr5-zqoG6J7L66hxBwRUk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=m0gB%2FBhAgTp%2FYX5hUL4bVyNdZ3I%3D', 37.5827724, 127.0028475, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 7인의 부활\n- **촬영지**: 스타스테이지\n- **방문팁**: 드라마의 생생한 촬영 현장을 경험해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n스타스테이지는 드라마 "7인의 부활"의 촬영지로, 이곳에서 다양한 장면들이 촬영되었습니다. 관객과 배우가 가까이에서 소통할 수 있는 아늑한 공간이 특징이며, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 장소입니다. 촬영 현장의 분위기를 느끼며 드라마의 매력을 다시 한 번 되새겨보세요.', 'Star Stage is the filming location of the drama The Seven Resurrections where various scenes were filmed It features a cozy space where the audience and actors can communicate closely and it is a place where drama fans can leave special memories Feel the atmosphere of the filming site and reflect on the charm of the drama once again'),
	(183, '7인의 부활', '삼성해맞이공원', '서울 강남구 삼성동 79-1 청담역1번출구 도보9분', '삼성해맞이공원은 한강을 따라 펼쳐진 아름다운 경관과 함께 드라마 7인의 부활의 촬영지로 유명합니다 특히 야경이 아름다워 저녁 시간에 방문하면 멋진 풍경을 감상할 수 있습니다 공원 내의 전통적인 정자는 사진 촬영에 적합하며 여유로운 시간을 보내기 좋은 장소입니다 KdramaTrip Park', '#7인의부활 #드라마촬영지 #공원 #산책 #야경 #전통정자', '공원/숲/산', 'Samsung Sunrise Park', 'the resurrection of the septuagenarian', '9 minutes walk from Exit 1 of Cheongdam Station 79-1 Samseong-dong, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a park/forest/mountain', '#Resurrection of 7 people #DramaFilmingPlace #Park #Walk #Nightscape #TraditionalJeongja', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NRwLY/btsGB1jtVCw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANfpi4-TFWOWpC64htT5UVDCIsWXyWyzIRC7x_3TvkJL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ek%2BvYh7mhvQ8OZ8Gu0vhuGjwLJ8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/F2kyu/btsGBQWKkms/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA3LXOh5FSRXoGAnCSnd8sHcdBeg11VtVyQT68GPs18j/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ADyShZZCcDgDofRZb63cSetdwkw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cfsxYg/btsGAZfDU8W/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANf2kFzlnOmmoCbz3wkW0-Aw5QN81YzMdljObrDxa1dc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=62mJ8R%2FDpP9ytDjKHysJLJRUdJk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mhyfS/btsGAzaF52e/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADNSo--Z4RzXrbwEG7J-etKI8JMfQiDkVv6Xd0alTH4t/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WmnFI31%2BFTEAxVUk6eC5NYUEiA0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NRwLY/btsGB1jtVCw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANfpi4-TFWOWpC64htT5UVDCIsWXyWyzIRC7x_3TvkJL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ek%2BvYh7mhvQ8OZ8Gu0vhuGjwLJ8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/F2kyu/btsGBQWKkms/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA3LXOh5FSRXoGAnCSnd8sHcdBeg11VtVyQT68GPs18j/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ADyShZZCcDgDofRZb63cSetdwkw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cfsxYg/btsGAZfDU8W/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANf2kFzlnOmmoCbz3wkW0-Aw5QN81YzMdljObrDxa1dc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=62mJ8R%2FDpP9ytDjKHysJLJRUdJk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mhyfS/btsGAzaF52e/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADNSo--Z4RzXrbwEG7J-etKI8JMfQiDkVv6Xd0alTH4t/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WmnFI31%2BFTEAxVUk6eC5NYUEiA0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NRwLY/btsGB1jtVCw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANfpi4-TFWOWpC64htT5UVDCIsWXyWyzIRC7x_3TvkJL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ek%2BvYh7mhvQ8OZ8Gu0vhuGjwLJ8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/F2kyu/btsGBQWKkms/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA3LXOh5FSRXoGAnCSnd8sHcdBeg11VtVyQT68GPs18j/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ADyShZZCcDgDofRZb63cSetdwkw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cfsxYg/btsGAZfDU8W/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANf2kFzlnOmmoCbz3wkW0-Aw5QN81YzMdljObrDxa1dc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=62mJ8R%2FDpP9ytDjKHysJLJRUdJk%3D', 37.5209876, 127.0613961, '### 7인의 부활 촬영지: 삼성해맞이공원\n\n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 삼성해맞이공원은 한강을 따라 펼쳐진 아름다운 경관과 함께, 드라마 "7인의 부활"의 촬영지로 유명합니다. 특히 야경이 아름다워 저녁 시간에 방문하면 멋진 풍경을 감상할 수 있습니다. 공원 내의 전통적인 정자는 사진 촬영에 적합하며, 여유로운 시간을 보내기 좋은 장소입니다. #KdramaTrip #Park', 'Samsung Sunrise Park is famous as the filming location for the drama The Seven Resurrection with beautiful scenery along the Han River In particular the night view is beautiful so you can enjoy the wonderful scenery if you visit in the evening The traditional pavilion within the park is suitable for photography and it is a great place to spend leisurely time KdramaTrip Park'),
	(184, '7인의 탈출', 'IFC몰', '서울 영등포구 국제금융로 10 여의도역3번출구 도보8분', 'IFC몰은 현대적인 디자인과 다양한 상점들로 가득 차 있어 드라마 팬들이 촬영지를 직접 경험하며 특별한 시간을 보낼 수 있는 장소입니다 쇼핑을 즐기고 맛있는 음식을 맛보며 드라마 속 한 장면을 떠올려 보세요 또한 이곳은 편리한 교통 접근성 덕분에 쉽게 방문할 수 있어 많은 이들에게 사랑받고 있습니다', '#KdramaTrip #쇼핑 #식사 #복합문화공간 #서울 #촬영지', '쇼핑몰/백화점', 'IFC Mall', 'the escape of seven people', '8 minutes walk from Exit 3 of Yeouido Station, 10 International Finance-ro, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'shopping mall/department store', '#KdramaTrip #Shopping #Meals #ComplexCulturalSpace #Seoul #FilmingPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/l8xdn/btsyVbT4qNF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHoO4Q9v6yHHMKPkQc6gy6gST4F2rHfcAtKEl4QYZ7Pc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eRBuZO8LqRJYxNfH4x2aSzfY%2FLo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sQ6Kk/btsyQP5726s/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAzTmnwJBVHBXP6aJ_ol-IOnIm-F6_Wrce4JCNlafoZW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0QrD7EmJNMzLqeQcXFMxUv9EaL4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfwHqc/btsyWjRSeAe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADtdWoDOeMyBWJRUc4Gcqc0HSDkweBFl44pyy2w8QgeS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uAMinmjtZ5A5hiuOO1slLIihgmo%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/l8xdn/btsyVbT4qNF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHoO4Q9v6yHHMKPkQc6gy6gST4F2rHfcAtKEl4QYZ7Pc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eRBuZO8LqRJYxNfH4x2aSzfY%2FLo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sQ6Kk/btsyQP5726s/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAzTmnwJBVHBXP6aJ_ol-IOnIm-F6_Wrce4JCNlafoZW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0QrD7EmJNMzLqeQcXFMxUv9EaL4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfwHqc/btsyWjRSeAe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADtdWoDOeMyBWJRUc4Gcqc0HSDkweBFl44pyy2w8QgeS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uAMinmjtZ5A5hiuOO1slLIihgmo%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/l8xdn/btsyVbT4qNF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHoO4Q9v6yHHMKPkQc6gy6gST4F2rHfcAtKEl4QYZ7Pc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eRBuZO8LqRJYxNfH4x2aSzfY%2FLo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sQ6Kk/btsyQP5726s/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAzTmnwJBVHBXP6aJ_ol-IOnIm-F6_Wrce4JCNlafoZW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0QrD7EmJNMzLqeQcXFMxUv9EaL4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfwHqc/btsyWjRSeAe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADtdWoDOeMyBWJRUc4Gcqc0HSDkweBFl44pyy2w8QgeS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uAMinmjtZ5A5hiuOO1slLIihgmo%3D', 37.5249782, 126.9252984, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 7인의 탈출\n- **촬영지:** IFC몰\n- **방문팁:** IFC몰은 다양한 쇼핑과 식사를 즐길 수 있는 복합 문화 공간입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\nIFC몰은 현대적인 디자인과 다양한 상점들로 가득 차 있어, 드라마 팬들이 촬영지를 직접 경험하며 특별한 시간을 보낼 수 있는 장소입니다. 쇼핑을 즐기고, 맛있는 음식을 맛보며, 드라마 속 한 장면을 떠올려 보세요. 또한, 이곳은 편리한 교통 접근성 덕분에 쉽게 방문할 수 있어 많은 이들에게 사랑받고 있습니다.', 'The IFC Mall is filled with modern designs and various stores making it a place where drama fans can have a special time experiencing the filming location firsthand Enjoy shopping taste delicious food and think of a scene in the drama Also it is loved by many because it is easy to visit thanks to its convenient transportation accessibility'),
	(185, '7인의 탈출', '오리지널팬케이크하우스 이태원점', '서울 용산구 이태원로 153 이태원역1번출구 도보3분', '오리지널팬케이크하우스는 아늑한 분위기와 다양한 메뉴로 사랑받는 카페입니다 이곳은 드라마 7인의 탈출의 촬영지로 팬케이크와 함께 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 식사를 즐길 수 있습니다 친구들과 함께 방문해 사진을 찍고 드라마의 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 만끽해보세요 KdramaTrip Cafe', '#팬케이크 #카페 #드라마촬영지 #7인의탈출 #이태원 #친구와함께', '카페/레스토랑', 'Original Pancake House Itaewon Branch', 'the escape of seven people', '3 minutes walk from Exit 1 of Itaewon Station, 153 Itaewon-ro, Yongsan-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Pancake #Cafe #DramaShoot #Seven Escape #Itaewon #WithFriend', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/6oVeL/btsyuc6371C/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABC9f4klVGiTmz6wbBNlQT6KbCj0N_GpxBxYbelUklol/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Jm7WepxdnrqMdelz9pyYauA7JnA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qw2lQ/btsys2qV0Iu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJP5EWFiWdYdxfDWfF1JtYEdcvg0EOs5HrvAlKlyZN0G/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=w7jC7CvvQ4IUYAcJ%2BUmUOS9uImc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bi8nKV/btsyuiftajv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA09js7gCSYIS2gieWzXJehYb0oDDetvUwbXe5VShBzl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2Vk0Xi19q90EX00iA4GMQpEdYC0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/InLYK/btsytPkexxm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOHKswG3Gp0xH4uwFa_eDSG5I1aa6eZYeOCoHD0Fh2m7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eBpjdgRqCsuAcv%2BKGFBAHyaE5Cs%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/6oVeL/btsyuc6371C/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABC9f4klVGiTmz6wbBNlQT6KbCj0N_GpxBxYbelUklol/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Jm7WepxdnrqMdelz9pyYauA7JnA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qw2lQ/btsys2qV0Iu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJP5EWFiWdYdxfDWfF1JtYEdcvg0EOs5HrvAlKlyZN0G/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=w7jC7CvvQ4IUYAcJ%2BUmUOS9uImc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bi8nKV/btsyuiftajv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA09js7gCSYIS2gieWzXJehYb0oDDetvUwbXe5VShBzl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2Vk0Xi19q90EX00iA4GMQpEdYC0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/InLYK/btsytPkexxm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOHKswG3Gp0xH4uwFa_eDSG5I1aa6eZYeOCoHD0Fh2m7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eBpjdgRqCsuAcv%2BKGFBAHyaE5Cs%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/6oVeL/btsyuc6371C/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABC9f4klVGiTmz6wbBNlQT6KbCj0N_GpxBxYbelUklol/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Jm7WepxdnrqMdelz9pyYauA7JnA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qw2lQ/btsys2qV0Iu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJP5EWFiWdYdxfDWfF1JtYEdcvg0EOs5HrvAlKlyZN0G/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=w7jC7CvvQ4IUYAcJ%2BUmUOS9uImc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bi8nKV/btsyuiftajv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA09js7gCSYIS2gieWzXJehYb0oDDetvUwbXe5VShBzl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2Vk0Xi19q90EX00iA4GMQpEdYC0%3D', 37.534623, 126.9909915, '### 오리지널팬케이크하우스 이태원점\n\n**방문팁:** 드라마 촬영지인 이곳에서 팬케이크를 맛보며 특별한 순간을 경험해보세요.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 오리지널팬케이크하우스는 아늑한 분위기와 다양한 메뉴로 사랑받는 카페입니다. 이곳은 드라마 "7인의 탈출"의 촬영지로, 팬케이크와 함께 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 식사를 즐길 수 있습니다. 친구들과 함께 방문해 사진을 찍고, 드라마의 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 만끽해보세요. #KdramaTrip #Cafe', 'The original pancake house is a cafe loved for its cozy atmosphere and various menus This is the filming location of the drama The Seven Escape where you can enjoy a meal while thinking of the scene filmed with pancakes Visit with your friends take pictures and enjoy the feeling of being the main character of a drama KdramaTrip Cafe'),
	(186, '7인의 탈출', '라부티크블루', '서울 용산구 이태원로55길 45 한강진역1번출구 도보7분', '라부티크블루는 세련된 분위기와 독특한 건축 디자인으로 드라마 팬들에게 인기 있는 촬영지입니다 이곳은 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 방문객들이 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 장소입니다 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 촬영지의 매력을 느껴보세요', '#KdramaTrip #촬영지 #라부티크블루 #이태원 #세련된카페 #드라마팬', '기타', 'Labboutique blue', 'the escape of seven people', '7 minutes walk from Exit 1 of Hangangjin Station, 45, Itaewon-ro 55-gil, Yongsan-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#KdramaTrip #FilmingPlace #LaBoutiqueBlue #Itaewon #StyleCafe #DramaFan', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bx9lDm/btsyT2pMzhK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJrUt6VWP8eOeHNBNcvFtY3o0bXK3iOrz1FQ9MlQ6Y_R/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xNg10N3sbEI2Lk8Xk871DBz%2FDMM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bTCUG3/btsyPUUlFaR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJZGygKdxRqCZ5Thgefl_pvkG6P4bNKoZYGXPGMwo2fZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Mxm4rGYVu%2BvpWdwY2jVKeQd9i4Y%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/9u8lm/btsyUIR9Bce/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIkbAgBkkE4W5N23i61GSkE4Ao7tftPvGZX8MVT118be/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZsGSoNEuta0cHKfh4Yhw90%2FzM0k%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bx9lDm/btsyT2pMzhK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJrUt6VWP8eOeHNBNcvFtY3o0bXK3iOrz1FQ9MlQ6Y_R/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xNg10N3sbEI2Lk8Xk871DBz%2FDMM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bTCUG3/btsyPUUlFaR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJZGygKdxRqCZ5Thgefl_pvkG6P4bNKoZYGXPGMwo2fZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Mxm4rGYVu%2BvpWdwY2jVKeQd9i4Y%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/9u8lm/btsyUIR9Bce/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIkbAgBkkE4W5N23i61GSkE4Ao7tftPvGZX8MVT118be/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZsGSoNEuta0cHKfh4Yhw90%2FzM0k%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bx9lDm/btsyT2pMzhK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJrUt6VWP8eOeHNBNcvFtY3o0bXK3iOrz1FQ9MlQ6Y_R/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xNg10N3sbEI2Lk8Xk871DBz%2FDMM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bTCUG3/btsyPUUlFaR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJZGygKdxRqCZ5Thgefl_pvkG6P4bNKoZYGXPGMwo2fZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Mxm4rGYVu%2BvpWdwY2jVKeQd9i4Y%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/9u8lm/btsyUIR9Bce/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIkbAgBkkE4W5N23i61GSkE4Ao7tftPvGZX8MVT118be/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZsGSoNEuta0cHKfh4Yhw90%2FzM0k%3D', 37.5378645, 126.9989269, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 7인의 탈출\n- **촬영지**: 라부티크블루\n- **방문팁**: 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 촬영지를 탐방해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n라부티크블루는 세련된 분위기와 독특한 건축 디자인으로, 드라마 팬들에게 인기 있는 촬영지입니다. 이곳은 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 방문객들이 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 장소입니다. 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 촬영지의 매력을 느껴보세요.', 'Laboutique Blue is a popular filming location for drama fans with its sophisticated atmosphere and unique architectural design It is a place where visitors can spend their time leisurely with various cafes and shops Think of the scenes in the drama and feel the charm of the filming location'),
	(187, '7인의 탈출', '백암박가네순대국', '서울 종로구 자하문로 35-2 경복궁역2번출구 도보5분', '백암박가네순대국은 드라마 7인의 탈출의 촬영지로 아늑한 분위기와 함께 전통적인 순대국을 맛볼 수 있는 곳입니다 이곳은 드라마 속 주인공들이 나눈 대화와 감정을 떠올리게 해주며 식사를 하면서 드라마의 한 장면에 들어온 듯한 느낌을 받을 수 있습니다 특히 지역 특색을 살린 순대국은 여행객들에게 큰 인기를 끌고 있어 꼭 한번 방문해볼 만한 명소입니다', '#KdramaTrip, #순대국, #서울맛집, #드라마촬영지, #전통음식', '카페/레스토랑', 'Baekam Bakga Four Soup Soup', 'the escape of seven people', '5-minute walk from Exit 2 of Gyeongbokgung Station, 35-2 Zahamun-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#KdramaTrip, #Sudonguk, #Seoul Restaurant, #DramaShootPlace, #TraditionalFood', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/R2y1U/btszLXHFRds/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEcPF9o-7WD0LmUw6JDaHJ1PNnYdiY7q6HEg8R9mPQx8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IwmKhyxtNBcgf1lrN9LHuzGcuqc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1JIvv/btszKA7NynX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMyclMkAZ6HO5zL_pOl-Hc0P7SbFjIABXWIyR-4Px3dj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FPOHK%2FLnpbSI4rKHpd59l502pt8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rq6YV/btszI0TqGw3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHujoDlukhHUida2HcsfhdnjBjwSAzYrcpg2xk2orYU4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Igrug1XG80ie11Ewyvge9EGbu8U%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/84z1J/btszH7Zig3H/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADFfGPabVUYQeJgxFjvFO2_eujW3RXifqeWQ_ZPRsCQX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a40kT6oZ49gZkDRzoMaJlILA4wk%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/R2y1U/btszLXHFRds/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEcPF9o-7WD0LmUw6JDaHJ1PNnYdiY7q6HEg8R9mPQx8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IwmKhyxtNBcgf1lrN9LHuzGcuqc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1JIvv/btszKA7NynX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMyclMkAZ6HO5zL_pOl-Hc0P7SbFjIABXWIyR-4Px3dj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FPOHK%2FLnpbSI4rKHpd59l502pt8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rq6YV/btszI0TqGw3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHujoDlukhHUida2HcsfhdnjBjwSAzYrcpg2xk2orYU4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Igrug1XG80ie11Ewyvge9EGbu8U%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/84z1J/btszH7Zig3H/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADFfGPabVUYQeJgxFjvFO2_eujW3RXifqeWQ_ZPRsCQX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a40kT6oZ49gZkDRzoMaJlILA4wk%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/R2y1U/btszLXHFRds/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEcPF9o-7WD0LmUw6JDaHJ1PNnYdiY7q6HEg8R9mPQx8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IwmKhyxtNBcgf1lrN9LHuzGcuqc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1JIvv/btszKA7NynX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMyclMkAZ6HO5zL_pOl-Hc0P7SbFjIABXWIyR-4Px3dj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FPOHK%2FLnpbSI4rKHpd59l502pt8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rq6YV/btszI0TqGw3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHujoDlukhHUida2HcsfhdnjBjwSAzYrcpg2xk2orYU4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Igrug1XG80ie11Ewyvge9EGbu8U%3D', 37.5792124, 126.9711303, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 7인의 탈출  \n**촬영지:** 백암박가네순대국  \n**방문팁:** 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 맛있는 순대국을 즐겨보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n백암박가네순대국은 드라마 "7인의 탈출"의 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기와 함께 전통적인 순대국을 맛볼 수 있는 곳입니다. 이곳은 드라마 속 주인공들이 나눈 대화와 감정을 떠올리게 해주며, 식사를 하면서 드라마의 한 장면에 들어온 듯한 느낌을 받을 수 있습니다. 특히, 지역 특색을 살린 순대국은 여행객들에게 큰 인기를 끌고 있어, 꼭 한번 방문해볼 만한 명소입니다.', 'Baekambakgane Sundaeguk is the filming location of the drama The Seven Escape where you can taste traditional Sundaeguk with a cozy atmosphere This place reminds you of the conversations and emotions the main characters in the drama had and you can feel like you have entered a scene of the drama while eating In particular Sundaeguk which makes use of local characteristics is very popular with tourists so it is a mustvisit attraction'),
	(188, '7인의 탈출', '가나아트센터', '서울 종로구 평창30길 28', '가나아트센터는 현대 미술과 다양한 문화 행사로 유명한 장소입니다 이곳에서는 정기적으로 전시회와 공연이 열리며 예술을 사랑하는 이들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 드라마 7인의 탈출의 촬영지로도 알려져 있어 팬들에게는 더 큰 의미가 있는 곳입니다 방문 시 주변의 아름다운 경관과 함께 예술의 향기를 만끽해 보세요', '#KdramaTrip, #가나아트센터, #현대미술, #문화행사, #전시회, #7인의탈출', '기타/판별불가', 'Ghana Art Center', 'the escape of seven people', '28, Pyeongchang 30-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Kdrama Trip, #GanaArtCenter, #ModernArt, #CulturalEvents, #Exhibition, #Escapeof7people', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mBR9L/btszlIKHdeh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJSrA1cPaO6CbdqixN0HniiofNWPNb885c2FaJo3Q5pt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QRHHl3CBNUV3twnSR0ARXH60%2BeA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bMfLSc/btszk8iFZlv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHk7cNiQmueb5-08XCrmBuXPiO4OLFhnrjPdwKv118y_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ek3gSISJr%2FUHdiPZhiPKMwA5YpU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ICnxQ/btszMcxWTZm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALxNdWY9XhEY4PGaRZwdsu2TRsNqBnMB-ae84E-NcX27/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RMSfKPArTYT9Q5QR822WD%2Bd3DuU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cRA4mw/btszLlaXbOB/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADMMxkQ3VrdyyLOfG-GoJ8IguMks2Jxl-W893ppCuoZl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Vn8GxZBhotNbCy8SkbiNQ6OZBAM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dRSW1H/btszHRoTdAV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHpoy4scQST6v8N0Q51g1PXFrUteM-a4LuFB1K1cu1yn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=A4QmedyjfyAddV9QtPdUXu3CMYo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bgpmEz/btszH6F5dXJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABwoaS-j72QVjMNU5HxDB-fuktf0CClzY16jtLz_YQkC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KFcp2JAQRxXjHDzfjQoZ