ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BK5o%2FuDOG%2B3CblWtYJ784%2FyGSmo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cdiVEl/dJMb8Vs0q9Q/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM5fTdEVuaJU2kj7j_vPDen3Yqw6ZwexNCZlXZfdhus5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lHpmRKC02IsmNZAp9wbA8m10%2BRk%3D', 37.5725888, 127.021253, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 태풍상사\n- **촬영지**: 태광상사\n- **방문팁**: 드라마 촬영지인 태광상사에서 특별한 순간을 경험해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n태광상사는 드라마 "태풍상사"의 촬영지로, 다양한 장면이 펼쳐진 장소입니다. 이곳은 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지니며, 실제 촬영된 공간을 직접 방문함으로써 드라마의 매력을 더욱 깊게 느낄 수 있습니다. 주변의 독특한 상점들과 분위기를 즐기며, 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 만끽해보세요.', 'Taekwang Corporation is the filming location of the drama Taepung Corporation and it is the place where various scenes unfold This place has a special meaning for drama fans and you can feel the charm of the drama deeper by visiting the actual filmed space in person Enjoy the unique shops and atmosphere around you and feel like youve become a main character in a drama'),
	(324, '태풍상사', '신설동종합시장', '서울 종로구 난계로25길 46', '신설동종합시장은 전통과 현대가 어우러진 매력적인 장소로 다양한 상품과 음식들이 가득한 시장입니다 이곳은 드라마 태풍상사의 촬영지로도 유명하며 현지인들의 일상과 문화를 직접 체험할 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다 시장의 좁은 골목길을 따라 걸으며 다양한 상점들을 구경하고 맛있는 간식을 즐길 수 있는 좋은 장소입니다 활기찬 분위기 속에서 잊지 못할 추억을 만들어 보세요', '#KdramaTrip #신설동종합시장 #태풍상사 #서울여행 #전통시장 #현지문화', '거리/골목/광장', 'Sinseol-dong General Market', 'Typhoon Corporation', '46, Nangye-ro 25-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #NewSeol-dong Composite Market #Taepung Corporation #SeoulTravel #TraditionalMarket #LocalCulture', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YQ4DM/dJMb9NPkySU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOAZdlO42e8yLMnu3z-gAjYeITSVoiuBR6YQgXfVasNh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NkQRq73QVpU3HbWrbLwKMSX%2B0dc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mWGVi/dJMb9WFqDI0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJUSNkpPC7cgpBeRSwOFO-oavKlQXGtKCIgqb5hjfktb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DAV0sye1QW4DxjQh%2Fh0vnoTvvN8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5AtVq/dJMb9Lqrwv4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcnWU-VwmMi60pgcDhTY9ixFs01-jdhuhc0YSyoktnA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sWAq3E3n0%2FaFuGjsNwxAVsX4aJQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NPQMf/dJMb9NPkySW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABoS597A0KNEwxNiNjVed9UIqUe5A7SUElUTCsFc_Z1e/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZvWvIYL5lZMU%2FWmDRSFyE%2Bz%2BKtg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cxxqfL/dJMb8XYEYQ0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANveMDVHKz2i9NTKLNU2K5yJVw_gzbWYHpP5PAL50pBN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=SK5F0VDpIhJPT%2BCkY%2Bo%2B1oK%2B%2FeM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YQ4DM/dJMb9NPkySU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOAZdlO42e8yLMnu3z-gAjYeITSVoiuBR6YQgXfVasNh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NkQRq73QVpU3HbWrbLwKMSX%2B0dc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mWGVi/dJMb9WFqDI0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJUSNkpPC7cgpBeRSwOFO-oavKlQXGtKCIgqb5hjfktb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DAV0sye1QW4DxjQh%2Fh0vnoTvvN8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5AtVq/dJMb9Lqrwv4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcnWU-VwmMi60pgcDhTY9ixFs01-jdhuhc0YSyoktnA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sWAq3E3n0%2FaFuGjsNwxAVsX4aJQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NPQMf/dJMb9NPkySW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABoS597A0KNEwxNiNjVed9UIqUe5A7SUElUTCsFc_Z1e/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZvWvIYL5lZMU%2FWmDRSFyE%2Bz%2BKtg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cxxqfL/dJMb8XYEYQ0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANveMDVHKz2i9NTKLNU2K5yJVw_gzbWYHpP5PAL50pBN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=SK5F0VDpIhJPT%2BCkY%2Bo%2B1oK%2B%2FeM%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YQ4DM/dJMb9NPkySU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOAZdlO42e8yLMnu3z-gAjYeITSVoiuBR6YQgXfVasNh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NkQRq73QVpU3HbWrbLwKMSX%2B0dc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mWGVi/dJMb9WFqDI0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJUSNkpPC7cgpBeRSwOFO-oavKlQXGtKCIgqb5hjfktb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DAV0sye1QW4DxjQh%2Fh0vnoTvvN8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5AtVq/dJMb9Lqrwv4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcnWU-VwmMi60pgcDhTY9ixFs01-jdhuhc0YSyoktnA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sWAq3E3n0%2FaFuGjsNwxAVsX4aJQ%3D', 37.5724889, 127.0205703, '### 거리 정보\n- **촬영지**: 신설동종합시장\n- **드라마 제목**: 태풍상사\n- **방문 팁**: 다양한 상점들이 즐비한 신설동종합시장에서 현지의 생동감 넘치는 분위기를 만끽해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #신설동종합시장\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 거리\n\n### 여행 포인트\n신설동종합시장은 전통과 현대가 어우러진 매력적인 장소로, 다양한 상품과 음식들이 가득한 시장입니다. 이곳은 드라마 "태풍상사"의 촬영지로도 유명하며, 현지인들의 일상과 문화를 직접 체험할 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다. 시장의 좁은 골목길을 따라 걸으며 다양한 상점들을 구경하고, 맛있는 간식을 즐길 수 있는 좋은 장소입니다. 활기찬 분위기 속에서 잊지 못할 추억을 만들어 보세요.', 'Sinseoldong General Market is an attractive place that combines tradition and modernity and it is a market full of various products and foods It is also famous as a filming location for the drama Taepung Corporation and offers an opportunity to experience the daily lives and culture of locals firsthand It is a great place to walk along the narrow alleyways of the market see various stores and enjoy delicious snacks Make unforgettable memories in a lively atmosphere'),
	(325, '태풍상사', '수도학원', '서울 동대문구 보문로 6 신설동역1번출구 바로앞', '수도학원은 드라마 태풍상사의 주요 촬영지로 현대적인 건축물과 활기찬 분위기가 특징입니다 이곳은 학생들의 일상과 드라마의 스토리가 어우러진 장소로 팬들에게는 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다 주변 카페와 상점에서 드라마의 여운을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것도 추천합니다', '#캠퍼스, #드라마촬영지, #서울여행, #학생일상', '학교/대학', 'a water academy', 'Typhoon Corporation', 'Right in front of Exit 1 of Sinseol-dong Station, 6, Bomun-ro 6, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul', 'a school/college', '#Campus, #DramaFilmingPlaces, #SeoulTravel, #StudentDailyLife', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bIpSP6/btsQ5COmELm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANeZ-hUQgsQWnMt7ajPxsgPzRaWJTfbP4TBetH3scOuH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mnhpyYzwHp001JF2EjbYjpPObZ0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/G604R/btsQ511IwIp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAamI9TcqPZbiE7vkvaJNdU4xAIjiwx90JcOHtfWcHn4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0biJhHCf1FXkG53PnXWnweH9Thc%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bIpSP6/btsQ5COmELm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANeZ-hUQgsQWnMt7ajPxsgPzRaWJTfbP4TBetH3scOuH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mnhpyYzwHp001JF2EjbYjpPObZ0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/G604R/btsQ511IwIp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAamI9TcqPZbiE7vkvaJNdU4xAIjiwx90JcOHtfWcHn4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0biJhHCf1FXkG53PnXWnweH9Thc%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bIpSP6/btsQ5COmELm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANeZ-hUQgsQWnMt7ajPxsgPzRaWJTfbP4TBetH3scOuH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mnhpyYzwHp001JF2EjbYjpPObZ0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/G604R/btsQ511IwIp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAamI9TcqPZbiE7vkvaJNdU4xAIjiwx90JcOHtfWcHn4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0biJhHCf1FXkG53PnXWnweH9Thc%3D', NULL, 37.5761432, 127.0235482, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 태풍상사\n- **촬영지:** 수도학원\n- **방문팁:** 드라마의 배경이 된 수도학원에서 촬영의 흔적을 찾아보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Campus\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 학교\n\n### 여행 포인트\n수도학원은 드라마 "태풍상사"의 주요 촬영지로, 현대적인 건축물과 활기찬 분위기가 특징입니다. 이곳은 학생들의 일상과 드라마의 스토리가 어우러진 장소로, 팬들에게는 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다. 주변 카페와 상점에서 드라마의 여운을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것도 추천합니다.', 'The Capital Academy is the main filming location for the drama Taepung Corporation which features modern architecture and a lively atmosphere This is a place where the daily lives of students and the story of the drama are combined and it will be a special experience for fans It is also recommended to spend a leisurely time feeling the lingering effects of the drama at nearby cafes and stores'),
	(326, '태풍상사', '고산자로56길', '서울 동대문구 고산자로56길 13-1 고려대역4번출구 위에서1분', '고산자로56길은 드라마 태풍상사의 촬영지로 특유의 분위기를 자아내는 거리입니다 이곳은 다양한 건축물과 아늑한 골목길이 어우러져 있어 드라마 팬들에게는 잊지 못할 경험을 제공합니다 촬영된 장소를 직접 방문하여 드라마의 한 장면처럼 사진을 찍거나 주변의 소소한 매력을 탐방해보세요', '#KdramaTrip #태풍상사 #촬영지 #골목 #서울 #드라마팬', '거리/골목/광장', 'Gosanja-ro 56-gil', 'Typhoon Corporation', '1 minute above Exit 4 of Korea University Station, 13-1, Gosanja-ro 56-gil, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #Taepung Corporation #FilmingPlace #Alley #Seoul #DramaFan', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bPukru/dJMb9YiXG2L/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIq8maTHxRSgwkuqpwFsi6fgC-sL3uCkXFkosMGz92I5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WmBCH6Y5PoI3SFuZbj9EdlsqQkE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/C4ECq/dJMb9LYjz3X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGV0R67ZMO8yOrIScVG7unrcmqPbzY-HKdLv45DWura2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5Zvd6%2FRwl3KiwfOlejNBGcCIBZg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bPukru/dJMb9YiXG2L/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIq8maTHxRSgwkuqpwFsi6fgC-sL3uCkXFkosMGz92I5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WmBCH6Y5PoI3SFuZbj9EdlsqQkE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/C4ECq/dJMb9LYjz3X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGV0R67ZMO8yOrIScVG7unrcmqPbzY-HKdLv45DWura2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5Zvd6%2FRwl3KiwfOlejNBGcCIBZg%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bPukru/dJMb9YiXG2L/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIq8maTHxRSgwkuqpwFsi6fgC-sL3uCkXFkosMGz92I5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WmBCH6Y5PoI3SFuZbj9EdlsqQkE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/C4ECq/dJMb9LYjz3X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGV0R67ZMO8yOrIScVG7unrcmqPbzY-HKdLv45DWura2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5Zvd6%2FRwl3KiwfOlejNBGcCIBZg%3D', NULL, 37.5884107, 127.0379204, '### 거리/골목 촬영지 정보\n\n**제목:** 태풍상사  \n**촬영지:** 고산자로56길  \n**방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리/골목  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n고산자로56길은 드라마 "태풍상사"의 촬영지로, 특유의 분위기를 자아내는 거리입니다. 이곳은 다양한 건축물과 아늑한 골목길이 어우러져 있어, 드라마 팬들에게는 잊지 못할 경험을 제공합니다. 촬영된 장소를 직접 방문하여, 드라마의 한 장면처럼 사진을 찍거나 주변의 소소한 매력을 탐방해보세요.', 'Gosanjaro 56gil is the filming location of the drama Taepung Corporation and it is a street that creates a unique atmosphere This place is a combination of various architectural structures and cozy alleys providing an unforgettable experience for drama fans Visit the filming location in person take pictures like a scene in a drama or explore the small attractions around you'),
	(327, '태풍상사', '현대14차아파트', '서울 강남구 압구정로29길 57', '현대14차아파트는 드라마 태풍상사의 주요 촬영지로 현대적인 건축미와 함께 주변 경관이 어우러져 있습니다 이곳은 사진 촬영에 적합하며 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 주변의 조용한 환경과 함께 아파트 단지의 독특한 구조를 감상할 수 있어 방문객들에게 색다른 매력을 선사합니다', '#태풍상사 #촬영지 #서울 #아파트 #사진촬영 #드라마팬', '기타/판별불가', 'Hyundai 14th Apartment', 'Typhoon Corporation', '57 Apgujeong-ro 29-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Typhoon Corporation #FilmingPlace #Seoul #Apartment #PhotoShooting #DramaFan', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kPe2t/btsQ7PFNTRP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGXJL-rizydD0aOpJAYCRMYp8k8VuAK4BPKNvIhK2aq7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=SufSFzbBUKCZwNzG8cOK0YZ8sB4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bsXEcS/btsQ59FpODO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKfDAxWvhsovJTwxQf1g97POlcMKht00MEFA24N8TTw3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Jsi7QWJ56%2FBZ1MZf4TIiZ%2BQ30pw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/PcRFB/btsQ5h5dyHK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMB8pRqcCocJRqF16B5Csy3nlxdmmBEAbdr9qca26lRu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8FlzU3WsMT5nQ%2BYbg5uprBiSc3E%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b0CMfB/btsQ596sbbj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMHPseCvmzTbXpp6nQFmKY3sk9-Xc6ydWCmZArqGP2zf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JW4DM2o74AQMez8UuSrjoPK1a7k%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/TyHWx/btsQ59SVQeo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOxVnO3Oh6hO-LRLc-UWgx6hK-kZ14C5WOzk4ZPRogom/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=H9oRVivsYkH4jzPRIONtziT%2BlJI%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kPe2t/btsQ7PFNTRP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGXJL-rizydD0aOpJAYCRMYp8k8VuAK4BPKNvIhK2aq7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=SufSFzbBUKCZwNzG8cOK0YZ8sB4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakao