jeKWWI4XQAaHVPZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eDgWT4eWjsm9KQc5%2FXxQU5jLZEo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/MrnDm/btsmROjUx1K/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHymINkL5i6GuMaGsoKV77xP9-Kv7gvfaMx-qdmGKdw-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KKqyuhwQ9rr2a5keZvc%2Fv28P5i4%3D', 37.5222925, 126.9430071, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 킹더랜드\n- **촬영지:** 이마트24 한강파라다이스점\n- **방문팁:** 다양한 간편식과 스낵을 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n이마트24 한강파라다이스점은 드라마 "킹더랜드"의 촬영지로, 다양한 간편식과 스낵을 한곳에서 즐길 수 있는 매력적인 장소입니다. 특히, 드라마의 주요 장면을 떠올리며 쇼핑하는 재미가 쏠쏠합니다. 친구들과 함께 방문해 보는 것도 좋고, 드라마의 분위기를 느끼며 간편식과 음료를 즐기기에 안성맞춤입니다. 이곳에서의 소소한 경험이 특별한 추억으로 남을 것입니다.', 'EMart 24 is Han RiverThis branch is the filming location for the drama King the Land which is an attractive place to enjoy a variety of snacks and snacks in one place In particular shopping while recalling the main scenes of the drama is a lot of fun Its also good to visit with your friends and its perfect for enjoying convenience food and drinks while feeling the atmosphere of the drama A small experience here will remain as a special memory'),
	(333, '킹더랜드', '연남장', '서울 서대문구 연희로5길 22 홍대입구역3번출구 도보12분', '연남장 카페는 드라마 킹더랜드의 촬영지로 넓고 세련된 인테리어가 매력적입니다 큰 창문을 통해 자연광이 들어오는 공간은 아늑하면서도 현대적인 분위기를 자아내며 친구들과의 대화나 혼자만의 시간을 보내기에 적합합니다 다양한 음료와 디저트를 즐기며 드라마 속 주인공처럼 특별한 순간을 만끽해보세요', '#킹더랜드 #연남장 #카페 #드라마촬영지 #서울카페', '카페/레스토랑', 'Yeonmamjang (Leader\'s Clothes)', 'King the Land', '12 minutes walk from Exit 3 of Hongik University Station, Yeonhui-ro 5-gil, Seodaemun-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#King the Land #Yeonnam Dress #Cafe #DramaFilmingPlace #SeoulCafe', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HeYAI/btsozjCqojA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFJ2Du35KP6jEi8n2lllc-lFcvQQMAQ06x7ptC_p2g1V/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1zhAd9Z%2FivCQ0TODYG8LgOlHWy0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/C3YnI/btsozk2mpmr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOTNPvDOKhxCas3VbyNiRgre35wqUszz9vLOWiFLeZw2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fseDU6PJbYm%2FskBo5%2FwFDqQUAGo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Y0Dbu/btsoxxBjrtk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANzrNZ-Dmx4LVi_NupmRiZzRX-TOEXs3-JniK9DTtcjV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2xeqBmVjrekcnZPqUmO93aab%2FYI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCjX6K/btsoxGyoKMf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACaQh9zWCZ83coE1rFqVlvorVJclBSBdwezQQ6LUonrh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=f2UWG0f59tkYMFMzZiLQltaRqy8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HeYAI/btsozjCqojA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFJ2Du35KP6jEi8n2lllc-lFcvQQMAQ06x7ptC_p2g1V/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1zhAd9Z%2FivCQ0TODYG8LgOlHWy0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/C3YnI/btsozk2mpmr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOTNPvDOKhxCas3VbyNiRgre35wqUszz9vLOWiFLeZw2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fseDU6PJbYm%2FskBo5%2FwFDqQUAGo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Y0Dbu/btsoxxBjrtk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANzrNZ-Dmx4LVi_NupmRiZzRX-TOEXs3-JniK9DTtcjV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2xeqBmVjrekcnZPqUmO93aab%2FYI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCjX6K/btsoxGyoKMf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACaQh9zWCZ83coE1rFqVlvorVJclBSBdwezQQ6LUonrh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=f2UWG0f59tkYMFMzZiLQltaRqy8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HeYAI/btsozjCqojA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFJ2Du35KP6jEi8n2lllc-lFcvQQMAQ06x7ptC_p2g1V/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1zhAd9Z%2FivCQ0TODYG8LgOlHWy0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/C3YnI/btsozk2mpmr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOTNPvDOKhxCas3VbyNiRgre35wqUszz9vLOWiFLeZw2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fseDU6PJbYm%2FskBo5%2FwFDqQUAGo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Y0Dbu/btsoxxBjrtk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANzrNZ-Dmx4LVi_NupmRiZzRX-TOEXs3-JniK9DTtcjV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2xeqBmVjrekcnZPqUmO93aab%2FYI%3D', 37.5643511, 126.9275968, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 킹더랜드  \n**촬영지:** 연남장  \n**방문팁:** 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n연남장 카페는 드라마 "킹더랜드"의 촬영지로, 넓고 세련된 인테리어가 매력적입니다. 큰 창문을 통해 자연광이 들어오는 공간은 아늑하면서도 현대적인 분위기를 자아내며, 친구들과의 대화나 혼자만의 시간을 보내기에 적합합니다. 다양한 음료와 디저트를 즐기며 드라마 속 주인공처럼 특별한 순간을 만끽해보세요.', 'Yeonnamjang Cafe is the filming location for the drama King the Land and its spacious and stylish interior is attractive The space where natural light comes in through the large window creates a cozy and modern atmosphere and is suitable for conversation with friends or spending time alone Enjoy a variety of drinks and desserts and enjoy a special moment like the main character in the drama'),
	(334, '킹더랜드', '아키라백', '서울 종로구 새문안로 97 12층 광화문역7번출구 도보2분', '아키라백은 드라마 킹더랜드의 촬영지로 현대적이고 세련된 인테리어가 특징입니다 이곳에서는 드라마 속 주인공들이 거닐던 공간을 직접 체험할 수 있어 팬들에게 특별한 추억을 선사합니다 고급스러운 분위기 속에서 맛있는 음식을 즐기며 드라마의 감성을 느껴보는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다', '#킹더랜드 #촬영지 #고급레스토랑 #세련된분위기 #드라마체험 #서울맛집', '기타/판별불가', 'Akira bag', 'King the Land', '2-minute walk from Exit 7 of Gwanghwamun Station on the 12th floor of 97 Saemunan-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#King the Land #FilmingPlace #High-end Restaurant #Sophisticated atmosphere #Drama Experience #Seoul Restaurant', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bYfNK3/btslb6tFduR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEfDuWHzj3RMOooZ6kG1DH7Ssd28oo6Q0NxP_tQrk0mt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rEzPPSep7mLREA8Adhge%2BMUxWD0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bA0kIf/btslb5uLTze/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALgCZ6_E_jxqBdPl52d2cVlPJewb9lRpVf_75KhZnzuQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tJT5sRiAZb9UxSiTIs%2BqmOqE9mU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/doW6TB/btslpXa2PYX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAdW6E5BIgRE1g4aneENzXWOkPOCF74XZ_TvS3qy6sIU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YC%2B2URUlaUUMjwoz0x20eEtVU4Q%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BUQoJ/btsluggw0hB/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANjVB8tYbHQnB9TEEXapKHUoPW6wnPaWPu6xTU1X1R5t/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DJEfnI5F1kfCH8UnYPTVxrDerlQ%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bYfNK3/btslb6tFduR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEfDuWHzj3RMOooZ6kG1DH7Ssd28oo6Q0NxP_tQrk0mt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rEzPPSep7mLREA8Adhge%2BMUxWD0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bA0kIf/btslb5uLTze/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALgCZ6_E_jxqBdPl52d2cVlPJewb9lRpVf_75KhZnzuQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tJT5sRiAZb9UxSiTIs%2BqmOqE9mU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/doW6TB/btslpXa2PYX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAdW6E5BIgRE1g4aneENzXWOkPOCF74XZ_TvS3qy6sIU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YC%2B2URUlaUUMjwoz0x20eEtVU4Q%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BUQoJ/btsluggw0hB/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANjVB8tYbHQnB9TEEXapKHUoPW6wnPaWPu6xTU1X1R5t/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DJEfnI5F1kfCH8UnYPTVxrDerlQ%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bYfNK3/btslb6tFduR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEfDuWHzj3RMOooZ6kG1DH7Ssd28oo6Q0NxP_tQrk0mt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rEzPPSep7mLREA8Adhge%2BMUxWD0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bA0kIf/btslb5uLTze/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALgCZ6_E_jxqBdPl52d2cVlPJewb9lRpVf_75KhZnzuQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tJT5sRiAZb9UxSiTIs%2BqmOqE9mU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/doW6TB/btslpXa2PYX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAdW6E5BIgRE1g4aneENzXWOkPOCF74XZ_TvS3qy6sIU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YC%2B2URUlaUUMjwoz0x20eEtVU4Q%3D', 37.5707658, 126.9754208, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 킹더랜드\n- **촬영지**: 아키라백\n- **방문팁**: 드라마의 세련된 분위기를 느낄 수 있는 곳으로, 인테리어와 서비스가 뛰어난 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n아키라백은 드라마 "킹더랜드"의 촬영지로, 현대적이고 세련된 인테리어가 특징입니다. 이곳에서는 드라마 속 주인공들이 거닐던 공간을 직접 체험할 수 있어 팬들에게 특별한 추억을 선사합니다. 고급스러운 분위기 속에서 맛있는 음식을 즐기며, 드라마의 감성을 느껴보는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다.', 'Akira Bag is the filming location for the drama King the Land which features modern and sophisticated interiors Here you can experience the space where the main characters in the drama used to walk giving fans special memories It will be a good experience to enjoy delicious food and feel the sensibility of the drama in a luxurious atmosphere'),
	(335, '킹더랜드', '조선팰리스 서울 강남', '서울 강남구 테헤란로 231 역삼역8번출구 도보8분', '조선팰리스 서울 강남은 현대적인 디자인과 전통적인 요소가 조화를 이루는 고급 호텔입니다 넓고 세련된 객실과 다양한 편의시설이 마련되어 있어 편안한 휴식과 함께 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 드라마 킹더랜드의 촬영지로 유명해져 많은 팬들이 방문하고 있으며 아름다운 경관과 함께 멋진 사진을 남길 수 있는 곳입니다', '#킹더랜드 #조선팰리스 #서울 #호텔 #KdramaTrip #럭셔리', '호텔', 'Chosun Palace Seoul Gangnam', 'King the Land', '8 minutes walk from Exit 8 of Yeoksam Station, 231, Teheran-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Hotel', '#King the Land #ChosunPalace #Seoul #Hotel #KdramaTrip #Luxury', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ZoaFX/btskllqeouq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKfiuJd5unGE00YO8tfCYzaB7pWF3lu9-DobHj5mdnpw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8Ugb2JXo17h23evp5%2BGW9sW%2BKkM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LMvNL/btskgtQo405/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKFf71FMPkOvmMK_lzFpne1x1Ejfnp1Dq-7GkQYyX0XO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=20kRhHfqya74HH%2B4k88s3Xlq5hg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/m2zFQ/btskgGPYahm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALNJD3MviPrJZbzzagB_C2FyEFvyfKp3G1sdEycUEHIM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BOGg3CKkkFITcK8DsUKXYu9AbQU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GR9rk/btsm5rtLfLS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJLmRvn3__q-jLQlRfde2hhfIOt9BgakSLGve3rteqFk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PXYqFJrgmkhMk2%2F%2Bib%2FdpGtBSMg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c4ExHJ/btsmRntgZ0h/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALl7lsr7xRPRgJr_2OqDF8RCmzmEEU6PbYorTie3GKDS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cC%2FIukYkR1EvtMq4RmGHiORfZ6E%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bDDwFr/btsmYMef6p5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABAEaONUP0I4Hq6AqbLwxdboblC1fb0ndbE2Q6H2t-pK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fKK3K5ucqD1ae638OThn%2F