14799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=20kRhHfqya74HH%2B4k88s3Xlq5hg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/m2zFQ/btskgGPYahm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALNJD3MviPrJZbzzagB_C2FyEFvyfKp3G1sdEycUEHIM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BOGg3CKkkFITcK8DsUKXYu9AbQU%3D', 37.5032113, 127.0414917, '### 호텔 정보\n**호텔 이름:** 조선팰리스 서울 강남  \n**드라마 제목:** 킹더랜드  \n**촬영지:** 조선팰리스 서울 강남  \n**방문 팁:** 고급스러운 인테리어와 편안한 분위기를 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Hotel  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 호텔  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n조선팰리스 서울 강남은 현대적인 디자인과 전통적인 요소가 조화를 이루는 고급 호텔입니다. 넓고 세련된 객실과 다양한 편의시설이 마련되어 있어, 편안한 휴식과 함께 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 드라마 "킹더랜드"의 촬영지로 유명해져 많은 팬들이 방문하고 있으며, 아름다운 경관과 함께 멋진 사진을 남길 수 있는 곳입니다.', 'Joseon Palace Seoul Gangnam is a luxury hotel with a modern design and traditional elements in harmony Large and stylish rooms and a variety of amenities provide a comfortable rest and a special experience It has become famous as a filming location for the drama King the Land and is visited by many fans and it is a place where you can leave wonderful pictures with beautiful scenery'),
	(336, '킹더랜드', 'MCM 롯데면세점 월드타워점', '서울 송파구 올림픽로 300 에비뉴엘동 9F 잠실역2번출구 바로앞', 'MCM 롯데면세점 월드타워점은 고급스러운 쇼핑 경험을 제공하는 곳으로 다양한 브랜드의 상품을 한자리에서 만나볼 수 있습니다 이곳은 드라마 킹더랜드의 촬영지로 유명해져 많은 팬들이 방문하는 명소가 되었습니다 쇼핑뿐만 아니라 멋진 인테리어와 분위기를 즐기며 휴식을 취하기에도 좋은 장소입니다', '#킹더랜드 #쇼핑 #촬영지 #서울 #MCM #면세점', '쇼핑몰/백화점', 'MCM Lotte Duty Free World Tower Branch', 'King the Land', 'Just in front of Exit 2 of Jamsil Station, 9F, 300 Avenuel-dong, Olympic-ro, Songpa-gu, Seoul', 'shopping mall/department store', '#King the Land #Shopping #FilmingPlace #Seoul #MCM #Duty Free Shop', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dRzmPZ/btskhKxmIzh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMyHyTGF86ydtB8iNJL48NZq369eLMhqlBzcfgH_IMA4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7ICGiWuuwW7NhWOGxlZaqK9PGfA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IBSws/btskgvtXO0G/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAaoeNHENVnAhBMYmg0SbCGFlprxTG7-aICocfDUPpch/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ocpZGiUqAuSsiNZLDayDeuhwP64%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/V9pyE/btskgdG4jy6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJO_I297W8MLeQJiom8sl7iyvgXZd0mwzWNSy2yOyBWj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ExAv%2FgfgZrCB6o1yGXSySOhFYoc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dtCFj8/btskrmoDNxO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJevvwb7sy-ey-T2JnggBxi9mQueMEeq-pB7W0sgDIG0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Cwut2VpK1t1llEe9SfzjvRxWeCY%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dRzmPZ/btskhKxmIzh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMyHyTGF86ydtB8iNJL48NZq369eLMhqlBzcfgH_IMA4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7ICGiWuuwW7NhWOGxlZaqK9PGfA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IBSws/btskgvtXO0G/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAaoeNHENVnAhBMYmg0SbCGFlprxTG7-aICocfDUPpch/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ocpZGiUqAuSsiNZLDayDeuhwP64%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/V9pyE/btskgdG4jy6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJO_I297W8MLeQJiom8sl7iyvgXZd0mwzWNSy2yOyBWj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ExAv%2FgfgZrCB6o1yGXSySOhFYoc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dtCFj8/btskrmoDNxO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJevvwb7sy-ey-T2JnggBxi9mQueMEeq-pB7W0sgDIG0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Cwut2VpK1t1llEe9SfzjvRxWeCY%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dRzmPZ/btskhKxmIzh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMyHyTGF86ydtB8iNJL48NZq369eLMhqlBzcfgH_IMA4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7ICGiWuuwW7NhWOGxlZaqK9PGfA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IBSws/btskgvtXO0G/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAaoeNHENVnAhBMYmg0SbCGFlprxTG7-aICocfDUPpch/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ocpZGiUqAuSsiNZLDayDeuhwP64%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/V9pyE/btskgdG4jy6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJO_I297W8MLeQJiom8sl7iyvgXZd0mwzWNSy2yOyBWj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ExAv%2FgfgZrCB6o1yGXSySOhFYoc%3D', 37.5134449, 127.1041611, '### 촬영지 큐레이터\n\n**건물**: MCM 롯데면세점 월드타워점, 서울 송파구 올림픽로 300 에비뉴엘동 9F  \n**드라마**: 킹더랜드  \n**촬영지**: MCM 롯데면세점 월드타워점  \n**방문팁**: 세련된 쇼핑 공간에서 다양한 브랜드를 경험해보세요.  \n**키워드**: #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding  \n**작가**: 미상  \n**카테고리**: 건물  \n\n### 여행 포인트\nMCM 롯데면세점 월드타워점은 고급스러운 쇼핑 경험을 제공하는 곳으로, 다양한 브랜드의 상품을 한자리에서 만나볼 수 있습니다. 이곳은 드라마 "킹더랜드"의 촬영지로 유명해져 많은 팬들이 방문하는 명소가 되었습니다. 쇼핑뿐만 아니라, 멋진 인테리어와 분위기를 즐기며 휴식을 취하기에도 좋은 장소입니다.', 'MCM Lotte Duty Free World Tower branch offers a luxurious shopping experience where you can meet products of various brands in one place It became famous as a filming location for the drama King the Land and became a popular attraction for many fans Not only shopping but also a great place to relax enjoying the wonderful interior and atmosphere'),
	(337, '킹더랜드', '롯데월드', '서울 송파구 올림픽로 240 잠실역3번출구 도보8분', '롯데월드는 서울의 중심에서 즐길 수 있는 테마파크로 다양한 어트랙션과 쇼가 가득합니다 특히 밤에는 조명이 아름답게 빛나며 로맨틱한 분위기를 자아내어 데이트 장소로도 인기가 높습니다 드라마 킹더랜드의 촬영지로 알려져 있어 팬들에게는 더할 나위 없는 방문지가 될 것입니다 놀이기구를 타고 스릴을 느끼거나 여유롭게 산책하며 경치를 감상해 보세요', '#놀이공원, #데이트, #밤, #어트랙션, #킹더랜드, #서울', '테마파크/놀이공원', 'Lotte World.', 'King the Land', '8-minute walk from Exit 3 of Jamsil Station, 240 Olympic-ro, Songpa-gu, Seoul', 'a theme park / amusement park', '#Amusement Park, #Date, #Night, #Attraction, #King the Land, #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LCPQv/btspmhjg2jV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHcXdsuU1gudUZOE2agueQJEniRNnxVE2Y--Lb2I5twX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3lrQndyDTsjQYM1rTW6Y1bIFk50%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BQSWu/btspsWenmOa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHghC-zFDtPDS-Dka6iLjEKxeDqkMTBFM2MAFs6gdXuI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7Q3LCoXjtAsT75ojFujC8FsLy7w%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/skh0P/btspxcurVNZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD316D_VeSDS08HaVd4nYmmKrfHnqPPFs2kLDrW2tg2v/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FheO5XFTZ2np%2FNlWb0Ts2Xjz3lU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zlct9/btspjVVCBpX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAErGnFM6UNheII_rqUyn1G0ZsTCX0Z3J55MNX-w0gF1e/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tqyDP5iTktqDyhbERbsYSiEDWf0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LCPQv/btspmhjg2jV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHcXdsuU1gudUZOE2agueQJEniRNnxVE2Y--Lb2I5twX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3lrQndyDTsjQYM1rTW6Y1bIFk50%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BQSWu/btspsWenmOa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHghC-zFDtPDS-Dka6iLjEKxeDqkMTBFM2MAFs6gdXuI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7Q3LCoXjtAsT75ojFujC8FsLy7w%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/skh0P/btspxcurVNZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD316D_VeSDS08HaVd4nYmmKrfHnqPPFs2kLDrW2tg2v/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FheO5XFTZ2np%2FNlWb0Ts2Xjz3lU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zlct9/btspjVVCBpX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAErGnFM6UNheII_rqUyn1G0ZsTCX0Z3J55MNX-w0gF1e/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tqyDP5iTktqDyhbERbsYSiEDWf0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LCPQv/btspmhjg2jV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHcXdsuU1gudUZOE2agueQJEniRNnxVE2Y--Lb2I5twX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3lrQndyDTsjQYM1rTW6Y1bIFk50%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BQSWu/btspsWenmOa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHghC-zFDtPDS-Dka6iLjEKxeDqkMTBFM2MAFs6gdXuI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7Q3LCoXjtAsT75ojFujC8FsLy7w%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/skh0P/btspxcurVNZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD316D_VeSDS08HaVd4nYmmKrfHnqPPFs2kLDrW2tg2v/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FheO5XFTZ2np%2FNlWb0Ts2Xjz3lU%3D', 37.5112862, 127.0979392, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 킹더랜드\n- **촬영지:** 롯데월드\n- **방문팁:** 롯데월드에서 다양한 놀이기구와 야경을 즐기며 특별한 순간을 만들어 보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n롯데월드는 서울의 중심에서 즐길 수 있는 테마파크로, 다양한 어트랙션과 쇼가 가득합니다. 특히 밤에는 조명이 아름답게 빛나며, 로맨틱한 분위기를 자아내어 데이트 장소로도 인기가 높습니다. 드라마 \'킹더랜드\'의 촬영지로 알려져 있어 팬들에게는 더할 나위 없는 방문지가 될 것입니다. 놀이기구를 타고 스릴을 느끼거나, 여유롭게 산책하며 경치를 감상해 보세요.', 'Lotte World is a theme park that can be enjoyed in the center of Seoul and is full of various attractions and shows Especially at night the lights shine beautifully and create a romantic atmosphere making it popular as a dating place It is known as the filming location for the drama King the Land so it will be an perfect destination for fans Enjoy the thrill of the ride or take a leisurely walk and enjoy the scenery'),
	(338, '스틸러 : 일곱 개의 조선통보', '조선시대', '서울 마포구 홍익로3길 44 홍대입구역9번출구 도보8분', '드라마 스틸러  일곱 개의 조선통보는 조선시대의 다양한 문화적 요소를 잘 담아내고 있습니다 특히 등장인물들이 나누는 식사 장면은 당시의 음식 문화를 엿볼 수 있는 좋은 기회를 제공합니다 드라마 속 음식을 통해 조선시대의 맛을 느껴보는 것도 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다', '#조선시대 #문화 #음식 #드라마촬영지 #K드라마 #스틸러', '기타', 'the Chosun Dynasty era', 'Stiller: Seven Joseon Notifications', 'Hongik-ro 3-gil, Mapo-gu, Seoul, 44 Hongik University Station Exit 9 takes 8 minutes on foot', 'Guitar', '#Joseon Dynasty #Culture #Food #DramaFilmingPlace #K-Drama #Stealer', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mTadL/btr94uS4MHX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJXSHwx9Pyx6FouPRHJ2Au6D88XtJAPmAmSmkoNIQ9Jz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PdQKrukzTR5NJqLgOyg4iWX7VnU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cQjOg4/btr94wQMg5Y/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANsnT90FDcxAo60r7dZOB5aNEOsUgRcYydRO7a1hRYDn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fGNz50KrZ%2Fs%2BZx%2Bxs%2BCV1FqG9mQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/6VkG4/btsaepwrhiG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJoFQbKEtW1Umslew1SvRZzIhbERk61kKJpP4oQazyEi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vDCz3KggdEKroLCpg7TZ3mAporI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bxYzO5/btsaepQIkT5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHJ-pNvgcepRKFmP1WcoRsJgcJaFh1b7ke6MNssXQzJ_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8YIioJ3W0PEFk50p435plWhjICw%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mTadL/btr94uS4MHX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJXSHwx9Pyx6FouPRHJ2Au6D88XtJAPmAmSmkoNIQ9Jz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PdQKrukzTR5NJqLgOyg4iWX7VnU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cQjOg4/btr94wQMg5Y/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANsnT90FDcxAo60r7dZOB5aNEOsUgRcYydRO7a1hRYDn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fGNz50KrZ%2Fs%2BZx%2Bxs%2BCV1FqG9mQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/6VkG4/btsaepwrhiG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJoFQbKEtW1Umslew1SvRZzIhbERk61kKJpP4oQazyEi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vDCz3KggdEKroLCpg7TZ3mAporI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bxYzO5/btsaepQIkT5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHJ-pNvgcepRKFmP1WcoRsJgcJaFh1b7ke6MNssXQzJ_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8YIioJ3W0PEFk50p435plWhjICw%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mTadL/btr94uS4MHX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJXSHwx9Pyx6FouPRHJ2Au6D88XtJAPmAmSmkoNIQ9Jz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PdQKrukzTR5NJqLgOyg4iWX7VnU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cQjOg4/btr94wQMg5Y/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANsnT90FDcxAo60r7dZOB5aNEOsUgRcYydRO7a1hRYDn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fGNz50KrZ%2Fs%2BZx%2Bxs%2BCV1FqG9mQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/6VkG4/btsaepwrhiG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJoFQbKEtW1Umslew1SvRZzIhbERk61kKJpP4oQazyEi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vDCz3KggdEKroLCpg7TZ3mAporI%3D', 37.5526316, 126.9213974, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 스틸러 : 일곱 개의 조선통보\n- **촬영지**: 조선시대\n- **방문팁**: 이 드라마의 배경을 통해 조선시대의 문화와 풍습을 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n드라마 "스틸러 : 일곱 개의 조선통보"는 조선시대의 다양한 문화적 요소를 잘 담아내고 있습니다. 특히, 등장인물들이 나누는 식사 장면은 당시의 음식 문화를 엿볼 수 있는 좋은 기회를 제공합니다. 드라마 속 음식을 통해 조선시대의 맛을 느껴보는 것도 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다.', 'The drama Stealer Seven Joseon Tongbo captures various cultural elements of the Joseon Dynasty In particular the dining scenes shared by the characters provide a great opportunity to get a glimpse of the food culture of the time It will be a special experience to taste the Joseon Dynasty through the food in the drama'),
	(339, '스틸러 : 일곱 개의 조선통보', '국회의사당역,국민은행 정류장', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 1-6 국회의사당역1번출구 위에서1분', '국회의사당역과 국민은행 정류장은 드라마 스틸러  일곱 개의 조선통보의 중요한 촬영지로 이곳에서의 특별한 순간들을 경험할 수 있습니다 주변은 조용하고 아늑한 분위기로 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 잠시 쉬어가기 좋은 장소입니다 또한 다양한 대중교통 수단이 연결되어 있어 접근성이 뛰어난 편리한 위치에 있습니다', '#드라마촬영지, #국회의사당역, #여행, #편안한자리, #사람구경', '교통/역/터미널', 'National Assembly Station, Kookmin Bank Station', 'Stiller: Seven Joseon Notifications', '1-6 Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul, 1 minute above Exit 1 of the National Assembly Station', 'traffic/station/terminal', '#Drama filming location, #Parliament House Station, #Travel, #ConvenientPlace, #PeopleWatching', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/diOZMB/btsafegEHNj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJl2qjKKym0sJjOKvLAB1Lplg9pmkzhP2Tno1hCc9GOj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BvYikAAVpEJeJQsd6zJhMSO51bA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cB1mET/btsaeoYzBDp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH6Lqde_y9Gf-Ipyz-_vkTygTir_UM5mXpYIRAuIGLL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z3M9uo1MPMRg737LsPhICtOceHs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cI6gRi/btr94kiFJly/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKl3h9WlEZSBuyYA2wg4P4iXvNYh2EhSkecw47HYHgq1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xi0UbXppvxrZk8KKCwdD0hfEliI%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/diOZMB/btsafegEHNj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJl2qjKKym0sJjOKvLAB1Lplg9pmkzhP2Tno1hCc9GOj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BvYikAAVpEJeJQsd6zJhMSO51bA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cB1mET/btsaeoYzBDp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH6Lqde_y9Gf-Ipyz-_vkTygTir_UM5mXpYIRAuIGLL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z3M9uo1MPMRg737LsPhICtOceHs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cI6gRi/btr94kiFJly/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKl3h9WlEZSBuyYA2wg4P4iXvNYh2EhSkecw47HYHgq1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xi0UbXppvxrZk8KKCwdD0hfEliI%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/diOZMB/btsafegEHNj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJl2qjKKym0sJjOKvLAB1Lplg9pmkzhP2Tno1hCc9GOj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BvYikAAVpEJeJQsd6zJhMSO51bA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cB1mET/btsaeoYzBDp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH6Lqde_y9Gf-Ipyz-_vkTygTir_UM5mXpYIRAuIGLL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z3M9uo1MPMRg737LsPhICtOceHs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cI6gRi/btr94kiFJly/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKl3h9WlEZSBuyYA2wg4P4iXvNYh2EhSkecw47HYHgq1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xi0UbXppvxrZk8KKCwdD0hfEliI%3D', 37.5273906, 126.9185594, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 스틸러 : 일곱 개의 조선통보\n- **촬영지**: 국회의사당역, 국민은행 정류장\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 편안하게 앉아 사람들을 구경하기 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Transit\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 교통/역\n\n### 여행 포인트\n국회의사당역과 국민은행 정류장은 드라마 "스틸러 : 일곱 개의 조선통보"의 중요한 촬영지로, 이곳에서의 특별한 순간들을 경험할 수 있습니다. 주변은 조용하고 아늑한 분위기로, 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 잠시 쉬어가기 좋은 장소입니다. 또한, 다양한 대중교통 수단이 연결되어 있어 접근성이 뛰어난 편리한 위치에 있습니다.', 'The National Assembly Hall Station and Kookmin Bank Station are important filming locations for the drama Stealer Seven Joseon Notifications where you can experience special moments The surrounding area is a quiet and cozy atmosphere and it is a good place to take a break while feeling the sensibility of the drama In addition various public transportation methods are connected making it a convenient location with excellent accessibility'),
	(340, '스틸러 : 일곱 개의 조선통보', '일리카페 여의도점', '서울 영등포구 의사당대로 127 여의도역5번출구 도보4분', '일리카페 여의도점은 드라마 스틸러  일곱 개의 조선통보의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다 이곳에서는 신선한 커피와 함께 다양한 디저트를 맛볼 수 있어 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라 커피 애호가들에게도 좋은 선택이 될 것입니다 여의도의 아름다운 경치와 함께 특별한 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소입니다', '#드라마촬영지 #카페 #여의도 #스틸러 #커피 #디저트', '카페/레스토랑', 'Ili Cafe Yeouido Branch', 'Stiller: Seven Joseon Notifications', '4 minutes walk from Exit 5 of Yeouido Station, 127 Capitol-daero, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Drama filming location #Cafe #Yeouido #Stiller #Coffee #Dessert', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/yNAob/btsbVcHP2pl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHMUoQ3SF8TbOK9PgpeWaILTxY9Q6SHPxwupLGXevhlr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LEEGnhPor9C4t%2Frwjl%2FOD%2BnbCQY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vUw7v/btsbSErRQ9A/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJVHFRDYVH3A4S5MfKf-xc7RDJi3Ot3lvAED43JWqhA6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oa%2BVSmXw%2FzjuCV%2BLn0eERSdPzHo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bsUAyk/btsbQRSO5SZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFoQuBvOW5W4HI-NRLJmWyoxjCHbr17-VUaSDgFYKHHZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WpqHeNHONcl5TG0yw3IEy4Akri4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bC3JpY/btsdZ3WULqi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABR6EaXzJEq06ImJ6Bv3KD54i9W0IjUPXTjZvMyPItSF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=717GD3s0t3Glm1Gd8J25Zcy62iw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cMzFy4/btsdYhWHamS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIZdQQPWQWS350KfcGulsdm42im7C_59P6S-t-VCGlAf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MWgimtryvcV%2FF8tL%2Bk0EPFfS0Wg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/yNAob/btsbVcHP2pl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHMUoQ3SF8TbOK9PgpeWaILTxY9Q6SHPxwupLGXevhlr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LEEGnhPor9C4t%2Frwjl%2FOD%2BnbCQY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vUw7v/btsbSErRQ9A/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJVHFRDYVH3A4S5MfKf-xc7RDJi3Ot3lvAED43JWqhA6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oa%2BVSmXw%2FzjuCV%2BLn0eERSdPzHo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bsUAyk/btsbQRSO5SZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFoQuBvOW5W4HI-NRLJmWyoxjCHbr17-VUaSDgFYKHHZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WpqHeNHONcl5TG0yw3IEy4Akri4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bC3JpY/btsdZ3WULqi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABR6EaXzJEq06ImJ6Bv3KD54i9W0IjUPXTjZvMyPItSF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=717GD3s0t3Glm1Gd8J25Zcy62iw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cMzFy4/btsdYhWHamS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIZdQQPWQWS350KfcGulsdm42im7C_59P6S-t-VCGlAf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MWgimtryvcV%2FF8tL%2Bk0EPFfS0Wg%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/yNAob/btsbVcHP2pl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHMUoQ3SF8TbOK9PgpeWaILTxY9Q6SHPxwupLGXevhlr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LEEGnhPor9C4t%2Frwjl%2FOD%2BnbCQY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vUw7v/btsbSErRQ9A/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJVHFRDYVH3A4S5MfKf-xc7RDJi3Ot3lvAED43JWqhA6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oa%2BVSmXw%2FzjuCV%2BLn0eERSdPzHo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bsUAyk/btsbQRSO5SZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFoQuBvOW5W4HI-NRLJmWyoxjCHbr17-VUaSDgFYKHHZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WpqHeNHONcl5TG0yw3IEy4Akri4%3D', 37.5202418, 126.9263745, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 스틸러 : 일곱 개의 조선통보  \n**촬영지:** 일리카페 여의도점  \n**방문팁:** 편안한 분위기에서 다양한 커피와 디저트를 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n일리카페 여의도점은 드라마 "스틸러 : 일곱 개의 조선통보"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다. 이곳에서는 신선한 커피와 함께 다양한 디저트를 맛볼 수 있어, 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라 커피 애호가들에게도 좋은 선택이 될 것입니다. 여의도의 아름다운 경치와 함께 특별한 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소입니다.', 'Ili Cafe Yeouido is the filming location for the drama Stealer Seven Joseon Notifications and it is an attractive cafe with a sophisticated interior and a cozy atmosphere You can taste a variety of desserts with fresh coffee here which will be a good choice for coffee lovers as well as drama fans It is a perfect place to spend a special time with the beautiful scenery of Yeouido'),
	(341, '24시 헬스클럽', '자매근린공원', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 56 샛강역3번출구 도보3분', '자매근린공원은 드라마 24시 헬스클럽의 촬영지로 아름다운 경관과 함께 다양한 조명으로 꾸며져 있어 특히 저녁 시간에 방문하기 좋습니다 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 장소로 팬들이나 방문객들이 드라마 속 주인공들의 감정을 느끼며 산책하기에 적합합니다 공원 내의 산책로와 휴식 공간은 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다', '#24시헬스클럽, #촬영지, #자매근린공원, #드라마숨은장소, #산책', '기타/판별불가', 'Sister Neighborhood Park', '24:00 at the gym', '3-minute walk from Exit 3 of Saetgang Station, 56, Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#24:00 Health Club, #FilmingPlace, #Sister Neighborhood Park, #DramaHidePlace, #Walk', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/KQdrF/btsOiV3MnHn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPhLMCXDbw3-R_2S9JHWehTLXh3dNUZEq9278pMZYMeM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=N2uoq6qwxu2ZQmax%2BtdRWgDylZY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/6VNwp/btsOjqvrszH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKHWKwT7eAC4FvYIHrwQzuJee2LKjxck7riqFmcZ1xrQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hVJFa2uykoGapWpWPKfjuL8SoFA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4BljJ/btsOjteDC3s/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACgvwD7RRunKugqmjBPoTnxltv0uZ2XzOJ7fCxpOL2N3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RzCvnGSA6or2iejBFxR9nUHkoEk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/AeRFV/btsOiDvUlWu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADDfu9LnwPbmKcTqQPSoxKGq24UM96JVi1XY35qZ9dDg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sxvljMBkhvAykSjnlRsrbVmERF4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bUapQh/btsOpepw4a5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHDMDr0-AViP1JFPSFH52Fe4h9X0mGj2_pzPT-eKdV1s/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5NNxkQsqgTmAwVhPMmGdzSXCGAw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cAHwr2/btsOpXArXR2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAODjzezl8i5VzusIkBJyHVxKKiz-F-R2eFrst3u1t-Md/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&