etScene\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 거리/골목\n\n### 여행 포인트\n감고당길은 드라마 "엄마친구아들"의 촬영지로, 이곳에서 느낄 수 있는 특별한 분위기가 매력적입니다. 아기자기한 거리 풍경과 함께 드라마 속 감정을 체험해보세요. 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 산책하며 여유로운 시간을 보내기에도 좋습니다. 이곳에서의 순간들은 여러분의 여행에 특별한 추억을 더해줄 것입니다.', 'Gomgodanggil is the filming location of the drama Mother Friend Son and the special atmosphere you can feel here is attractive Experience the emotions in the drama with the cute street scenery There are various cafes and stores so its good for taking a walk and having a leisurely time Moments here will add special memories to your trip'),
	(378, '엄마친구아들', '감고당길 + 윤보선길', '서울 종로구 안국동 177-1 안국역1번출구 위에서1분', '감고당길과 윤보선길은 드라마 엄마친구아들의 주요 촬영지로 아기자기한 골목길과 고즈넉한 분위기가 매력적입니다 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 직접 느끼며 여유로운 산책을 즐기기에 적합한 장소로 주변의 아름다운 풍경과 함께 사진 촬영하기에도 좋은 포인트가 많습니다 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보세요', '#드라마촬영지, #산책, #골목길, #서울여행, #K드라마팬', '거리/골목/광장', 'Winding and pulling road + Yoon Bo Sun-gil', 'Mom\'s friend\'s son', '1 minute above Exit 1 of Anguk Station, 177-1, Anguk-dong, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Drama filming location, #walk, #alley street, #Seoul trip, #K-drama fan', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kJr4J/btsJelfZKOf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADc7d0njpTkLQuwf_yLPUvNNqOzzQKIwCrK9iO60Kp43/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=O6YkPl4RTFeif2jERWAVY3%2BrBBc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bffx3x/btsJfAQv63j/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIs0K3FmEj6B-Ub3qSgR-qu9qlDmALndR33ye-vNGiQz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vEcmKiogKceFXZaw6e4phCt47o4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/PAj59/btsJe8ggcxR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAd-71TBTjxEu5vkfpvY-fQ5YLfKp-uNUU2zURNG3aUZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=r1CQleOJAeQEm%2BG7aBzKJmZad0g%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kJr4J/btsJelfZKOf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADc7d0njpTkLQuwf_yLPUvNNqOzzQKIwCrK9iO60Kp43/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=O6YkPl4RTFeif2jERWAVY3%2BrBBc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bffx3x/btsJfAQv63j/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIs0K3FmEj6B-Ub3qSgR-qu9qlDmALndR33ye-vNGiQz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vEcmKiogKceFXZaw6e4phCt47o4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/PAj59/btsJe8ggcxR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAd-71TBTjxEu5vkfpvY-fQ5YLfKp-uNUU2zURNG3aUZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=r1CQleOJAeQEm%2BG7aBzKJmZad0g%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kJr4J/btsJelfZKOf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADc7d0njpTkLQuwf_yLPUvNNqOzzQKIwCrK9iO60Kp43/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=O6YkPl4RTFeif2jERWAVY3%2BrBBc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bffx3x/btsJfAQv63j/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIs0K3FmEj6B-Ub3qSgR-qu9qlDmALndR33ye-vNGiQz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vEcmKiogKceFXZaw6e4phCt47o4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/PAj59/btsJe8ggcxR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAd-71TBTjxEu5vkfpvY-fQ5YLfKp-uNUU2zURNG3aUZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=r1CQleOJAeQEm%2BG7aBzKJmZad0g%3D', 37.5773267, 126.9827497, '### 거리/골목 촬영지 정보\n\n**드라마 제목:** 엄마친구아들  \n**촬영지:** 감고당길 + 윤보선길  \n**방문 팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책을 즐겨보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리/골목  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n감고당길과 윤보선길은 드라마 "엄마친구아들"의 주요 촬영지로, 아기자기한 골목길과 고즈넉한 분위기가 매력적입니다. 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 직접 느끼며 여유로운 산책을 즐기기에 적합한 장소로, 주변의 아름다운 풍경과 함께 사진 촬영하기에도 좋은 포인트가 많습니다. 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보세요!', 'Gomgodanggil and Yoon Boseongil are the main filming locations for the drama Mothers Friends Son and their cute alleyways and tranquil atmosphere are attractive It is a suitable place to feel the sensibility of the drama firsthand and enjoy a leisurely walk and there are many good points to take pictures with the beautiful scenery around it If youre a drama fan please visit'),
	(379, '엄마친구아들', '보뜨플라워 앞', '서울 종로구 윤보선길 28 안국역1번출구 위에서2분', '보뜨플라워 앞은 드라마 엄마친구아들의 주요 촬영지로 아늑한 분위기와 독특한 골목길이 매력적입니다 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 그대로 느낄 수 있는 장소로 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 여유롭게 산책하기 좋습니다 주변 카페에서 한 잔의 커피를 즐기며 드라마 속 주인공들의 이야기에 빠져보세요', '#드라마촬영지, #엄마친구아들, #거리산책, #아늑한분위기, #서울여행', '거리/골목/광장', 'In front of the Botte Flower', 'Mom\'s friend\'s son', '2 minutes above Exit 1 of Anguk Station, 28, Yunbo Seon-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Drama filming location, #MomFriendsson, #Streetwalk, #A cozy atmosphere, #Seoultravel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/biq7fD/btsJoqUqQKY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL_6w4tbOaQOY6vRepNP0wuPzW1ZtHNEQngOGDKjW_aF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mGSf0Xfh1Gw0%2BJGMWJisrrkeZOk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GVfOq/btsJngLVQbI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHtjWgtYMcsbJDohRIzqWPyZJIUTrnW7_dk5E6TbGNzO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=I4vy%2FmOgZjcDEZ5G2eG9BXOIBQw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/peZ4n/btsJmm0ov77/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK16VvB_Z49taStndHKa-GPPvcDURlbQKF4sBJU52lJA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kieeDEClz6ZQ%2Bj7VnXpMO6GQp%2Bc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cwslTV/btsJnZQiNoS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKBg3a7eM3eL6xCzc-ZE5XZ7uaX7ViCqwKIJs_PRykSP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uu%2FL30h%2BdAwhkJZC0mOi3Vq%2BtcE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/biq7fD/btsJoqUqQKY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL_6w4tbOaQOY6vRepNP0wuPzW1ZtHNEQngOGDKjW_aF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mGSf0Xfh1Gw0%2BJGMWJisrrkeZOk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GVfOq/btsJngLVQbI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHtjWgtYMcsbJDohRIzqWPyZJIUTrnW7_dk5E6TbGNzO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&