있는 아기자기한 골목입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 거리/골목\n\n### 여행 포인트\n북촌로12길은 전통적인 한국의 매력을 느낄 수 있는 곳으로, 드라마 "엄마친구아들"의 촬영지로 유명합니다. 이곳은 아기자기한 한옥과 아름다운 골목길이 어우러져 있어, 사진 찍기 좋은 장소입니다. 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 이곳을 방문하면, 마치 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 만끽할 수 있습니다. 또한 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어, 여유롭게 산책하며 즐기기에도 좋습니다.', 'Bukchonro 12gil is a place where you can feel the charm of traditional Korea and is famous as a filming location for the drama Mother Friend and Son This place is a great place to take pictures with its cute hanok and beautiful alleyways If you visit this place where the main scenes of the drama are filmed you can enjoy the feeling of being the main character in the drama There are also various cafes and shops around so its good to take a leisurely walk and enjoy'),
	(385, '엄마친구아들', '창덕궁길', '서울 종로구 창덕궁길 45 안국역3번출구 도보8분', '창덕궁길은 고즈넉한 분위기 속에서 한국의 전통과 현대가 어우러진 매력을 지닌 장소입니다 드라마 엄마친구아들의 촬영지로 이곳을 걷다 보면 주인공들의 감정선이 느껴지는 듯한 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다 아름다운 경치와 함께 소중한 추억을 만들어보세요', '#KdramaTrip #엄마친구아들 #창덕궁길 #산책 #전통과현대', '거리/골목/광장', 'Changdeokgung Palace Road', 'Mom\'s friend\'s son', '8-minute walk from Exit 3 of Anguk Station, 45 Changdeokgung-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #MomFriendsSon #ChangdeokgungGil #Walk #Tradition and Modernity', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/btf1hM/btsJGKtqhhK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAncd-PJLaZP9k0DiO8GWFfVZiCcWn2TyXzGlKeBJAXF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=de%2B2gcSGV4jq%2FWM0RDWdOeJWF9g%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/86xvq/btsJGMq1J7e/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMe5I0cPN76yN3r9UG7vsJoB5iLJE2DgReKnhhD5KJD2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6sATqfQTaqGQvxMxvV9FhkUqQD4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pnMUo/btsJImxS1Ta/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM-vcU11Tp9lO8CeRdiAbtx4CAhsyAA-3AqaUADDwNS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5fOXCNssieMOA7IPpH3z8rSW6uw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eunYf7/btsJHrUcHnR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHlhNsDC73hCCYsuEd6appx0IRNmvgkE5OghLtGZ-pW2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=z2AcZB4CrInre8wn8y%2FhosiVFI0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/btf1hM/btsJGKtqhhK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAncd-PJLaZP9k0DiO8GWFfVZiCcWn2TyXzGlKeBJAXF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=de%2B2gcSGV4jq%2FWM0RDWdOeJWF9g%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/86xvq/btsJGMq1J7e/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMe5I0cPN76yN3r9UG7vsJoB5iLJE2DgReKnhhD5KJD2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6sATqfQTaqGQvxMxvV9FhkUqQD4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pnMUo/btsJImxS1Ta/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM-vcU11Tp9lO8CeRdiAbtx4CAhsyAA-3AqaUADDwNS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5fOXCNssieMOA7IPpH3z8rSW6uw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eunYf7/btsJHrUcHnR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHlhNsDC73hCCYsuEd6appx0IRNmvgkE5OghLtGZ-pW2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=z2AcZB4CrInre8wn8y%2FhosiVFI0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/btf1hM/btsJGKtqhhK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAncd-PJLaZP9k0DiO8GWFfVZiCcWn2TyXzGlKeBJAXF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=de%2B2gcSGV4jq%2FWM0RDWdOeJWF9g%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/86xvq/btsJGMq1J7e/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMe5I0cPN76yN3r9UG7vsJoB5iLJE2DgReKnhhD5KJD2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6sATqfQTaqGQvxMxvV9FhkUqQD4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pnMUo/btsJImxS1Ta/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM-vcU11Tp9lO8CeRdiAbtx4CAhsyAA-3AqaUADDwNS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5fOXCNssieMOA7IPpH3z8rSW6uw%3D', 37.5795434, 126.9891561, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 엄마친구아들\n- **촬영지:** 창덕궁길\n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책해보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 거리/골목\n\n### 여행 포인트\n창덕궁길은 고즈넉한 분위기 속에서 한국의 전통과 현대가 어우러진 매력을 지닌 장소입니다. 드라마 "엄마친구아들"의 촬영지로, 이곳을 걷다 보면 주인공들의 감정선이 느껴지는 듯한 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다. 아름다운 경치와 함께 소중한 추억을 만들어보세요.', 'Changdeokgunggil is a place with a charm that combines Korean tradition and modernity in a calm atmosphere It is the filming location of the drama Mother Friend Son and if you walk around here you can have a special experience as if you can feel the emotional lines of the main characters Make precious memories with beautiful scenery'),
	(386, '엄마친구아들', '볼링장 정류장', '서울 종로구 창덕궁1길 13 안국역3번출구 위에서2분', '볼링장 정류장은 드라마 엄마친구아들의 중요한 촬영지로 따뜻한 햇살 아래에서의 산책에 적합한 장소입니다 이곳은 평화로운 분위기와 아름다운 경치를 자랑하며 드라마의 한 장면처럼 느껴질 수 있는 곳입니다 주변의 아늑한 카페에서 잠시 쉬어가며 드라마의 주인공처럼 이곳의 매력을 만끽해보세요', '#KdramaTrip #정류장 #드라마촬영지 #산책 #서울', '거리/골목/광장', 'a bowling alley stop', 'Mom\'s friend\'s son', '2 minutes above Exit 3 of Anguk Station, 13, Changdeokgung 1-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #Stop #DramaFilmingPlace #Walk #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cUhdkv/btsI6easfQt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANmuzbDSrcphXs8XRq2YinqFnRCHK8B2DnyBb0BDr01U/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Y7K8jMNybR5jOs4cYlyaGN9a0cw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/stUwR/btsI7q1SCQi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF2V2nrMQT1qv2MR7t2KyjP4W-VerAf1RMTbyZP71WLT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WhtDKC7Frrm3U6OnAkDNcEZ%2FDH4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cUhdkv/btsI6easfQt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANmuzbDSrcphXs8XRq2YinqFnRCHK8B2DnyBb0BDr01U/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Y7K8jMNybR5jOs4cYlyaGN9a0cw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/stUwR/btsI7q1SCQi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF2V2nrMQT1qv2MR7t2KyjP4W-VerAf1RMTbyZP71WLT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WhtDKC7Frrm3U6OnAkDNcEZ%2FDH4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cUhdkv/btsI6easfQt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANmuzbDSrcphXs8XRq2YinqFnRCHK8B2DnyBb0BDr01U/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Y7K8jMNybR5jOs4cYlyaGN9a0cw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/stUwR/btsI7q1SCQi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF2V2nrMQT1qv2MR7t2KyjP4W-VerAf1RMTbyZP71WLT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WhtDKC7Frrm3U6OnAkDNcEZ%2FDH4%3D', NULL, 37.5790493, 126.9885408, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 엄마친구아들\n- **촬영지:** 볼링장 정류장\n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책해보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #정류장\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 거리\n\n### 여행 포인트\n볼링장 정류장은 드라마 "엄마친구아들"의 중요한 촬영지로, 따뜻한 햇살 아래에서의 산책에 적합한 장소입니다. 이곳은 평화로운 분위기와 아름다운 경치를 자랑하며, 드라마의 한 장면처럼 느껴질 수 있는 곳입니다. 주변의 아늑한 카페에서 잠시 쉬어가며, 드라마의 주인공처럼 이곳의 매력을 만끽해보세요.', 'The bowling alley stop is an important filming location for the drama Mom and Friends and is a good place for a walk in the warm sunshine This place boasts a peaceful atmosphere and beautiful scenery and it can feel like a scene from a drama Take a break from the cozy cafe nearby and enjoy the charm of this place like the main character of the drama'),
	(387, '엄마친구아들', '하우애니', '서울 종로구 계동길 73-1 안국역3번출구 위에서5분', '하우애니는 드라마 엄마친구아들의 주요 촬영지로 밤에 조명이 켜진 거리에서 특별한 분위기를 만끽할 수 있습니다 이곳은 다양한 카페와 상점들이 즐비해 있어 드라마 속 주인공들이 걷던 길을 따라 걸으며 사진을 찍거나 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있는 완벽한 장소입니다 드라마의 감동을 다시 느끼고 싶다면 꼭 방문해 보세요', '#드라마촬영지 #하우애니 #서울여행 #밤산책 #카페투어 #엄마친구아들', '거리/골목/광장', 'Howany', 'Mom\'s friend\'s son', '5 minutes above Exit 3 of Anguk Station, 73-1 Gye-dong-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Drama filming location #HowAnnie #SeoulTravel #Nightwalk #CaféTour #MomFriendsSon', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pnlVN/btsI7r7Nn6B/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALjjEzFKkNmKjM4z-iRJ8_vH3nUKWHOiN4LeYIF-TQ63/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zTx7gCd6h4%2Br%2FoyGRgAgKlc0hf0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bSeH4M/btsI6zlnqab/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOATisE9zR1VylJoYpffdvX_ZHW01C7xBxgOtVNFEblr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8peV1Tk6pnP5fj7uIUOKvzfcin8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GXrlN/btsI6e9ARkW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPryQ_5R6H89pVMYU2ADTDlnO9ge0Nr4W274XNBXRNDV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7T8GfolqjsGkk8mSy518ByvLgfk%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pnlVN/btsI7r7Nn6B/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALjjEzFKkNmKjM4z-iRJ8_vH3nUKWHOiN4LeYIF-TQ63/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zTx7gCd6h4%2Br%2FoyGRgAgKlc0hf0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bSeH4M/btsI6zlnqab/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOATisE9zR1VylJoYpffdvX_ZHW01C7xBxgOtVNFEblr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8peV1Tk6pnP5fj7uIUOKvzfcin8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GXrlN/btsI6e9ARkW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPryQ_5R6H89pVMYU2ADTDlnO9ge0Nr4W274XNBXRNDV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7T8GfolqjsGkk8mSy518ByvLgfk%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pnlVN/btsI7r7Nn6B/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALjjEzFKkNmKjM4z-iRJ8_vH3nUKWHOiN4LeYIF-TQ63/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zTx7gCd6h4%2Br%2FoyGRgAgKlc0hf0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bSeH4M/btsI6zlnqab/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOATisE9zR1VylJoYpffdvX_ZHW01C7xBxgOtVNFEblr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8peV1Tk6pnP5fj7uIUOKvzfcin8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GXrlN/btsI6e9ARkW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPryQ_5R6H89pVMYU2ADTDlnO9ge0Nr4W274XNBXRNDV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7T8GfolqjsGkk8mSy518ByvLgfk%3D', 37.5805543, 126.9866801, '### 거리 촬영지: 하우애니\n\n**방문 팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 하우애니는 드라마 "엄마친구아들"의 주요 촬영지로, 밤에 조명이 켜진 거리에서 특별한 분위기를 만끽할 수 있습니다. 이곳은 다양한 카페와 상점들이 즐비해 있어, 드라마 속 주인공들이 걷던 길을 따라 걸으며 사진을 찍거나 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있는 완벽한 장소입니다. 드라마의 감동을 다시 느끼고 싶다면 꼭 방문해 보세요! \n\n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #하우애니', 'Howany is the main filming location for the drama Mom and Friends Son where you can enjoy a special atmosphere on the illuminated streets at night With various cafes and shops lined up it is the perfect place for the main characters in the drama to walk along the path they used to walk and take pictures or have a relaxing time If you want to feel the inspiration of the drama again please visit'),
	(388, '엄마친구아들', '왕짱구식당', '서울 종로구 계동길 83 안국역3번출구 위에서1분', '왕짱구식당은 드라마 엄마친구아들의 촬영지로 아늑한 분위기와 독특한 인테리어가 매력적인 곳입니다 벽면을 가득 채운 다채로운 포스트잇은 방문객들에게 특별한 추억을 남기며 친구와의 소중한 대화를 나누기에 완벽한 장소입니다 맛있는 음식과 함께 드라마의 한 장면처럼 느껴보는 경험은 여행의 즐거움을 더해줄 것입니다', '#KdramaTrip #카페 #드라마촬영지 #서울맛집 #친구와함께 #여유로운시간', '카페/레스토랑', 'Wangjjanggu Restaurant', 'Mom\'s friend\'s son', '1 minute above Exit 3 of Anguk Station, 83 Gye-dong-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#KdramaTrip #Cafe #DramaShootPlace #Seoul Restaurant #WithFriend #RelaxingTime', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bwqHeP/btsI7sFo0HO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPXGYEe_GymFaCl5kQ2GbahPABqpxYp2wJEa5w1crjv2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yZ9L6ITs2CUntDmbA2rdaX93CpE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7DVTG/btsI7iweWvm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMTz2eOO7Qjyzr8w4B-kSUGfH2sGGybhqSsXQ0HqnuYT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FGhMvxfa30mLmn3vFrNzVIsed8k%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bY6xGp/btsI6vXuXa1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAl_notaTYZVWxMYRcjBTflZUySdIaJ42aJUyIXj0-85/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=SCf6ZLGbDVEvTUGxrIxTSuuJqTE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/evc3ns/btsI5MFhGnm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGK9-Sl4rbla_wia7iER89cmItHD-_MGBttoKz5dgLkx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4FOJyvw8lgi3bwFEoHXOOL%2Bw13E%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bwqHeP/btsI7sFo0HO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPXGYEe_GymFaCl5kQ2GbahPABqpxYp2wJEa5w1crjv2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yZ9L6ITs2CUntDmbA2rdaX93CpE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7DVTG/btsI7iweWvm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMTz2eOO7Qjyzr8w4B-kSUGfH2sGGybhqSsXQ0HqnuYT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FGhMvxfa30mLmn3vFrNzVIsed8k%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bY6xGp/btsI6vXuXa1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAl_notaTYZVWxMYRcjBTflZUySdIaJ42aJUyIXj0-85/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=SCf6ZLGbDVEvTUGxrIxTSuuJqTE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/evc3ns/btsI5MFhGnm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGK9-Sl4rbla_wia7iER89cmItHD-_MGBttoKz5dgLkx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4FOJyvw8lgi3bwFEoHXOOL%2Bw13E%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bwqHeP/btsI7sFo0HO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPXGYEe_GymFaCl5kQ2GbahPABqpxYp2wJEa5w1crjv2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yZ9L6ITs2CUntDmbA2rdaX93CpE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7DVTG/btsI7iweWvm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMTz2eOO7Qjyzr8w4B-kSUGfH2sGGybhqSsXQ0HqnuYT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FGhMvxfa30mLmn3vFrNzVIsed8k%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bY6xGp/btsI6vXuXa1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAl_notaTYZVWxMYRcjBTflZUySdIaJ42aJUyIXj0-85/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=SCf6ZLGbDVEvTUGxrIxTSuuJqTE%3D', 37.5811027, 126.9866712, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 엄마친구아들\n- **촬영지**: 왕짱구식당\n- **방문팁**: 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유롭게 시간을 보내보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n왕짱구식당은 드라마 "엄마친구아들"의 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기와 독특한 인테리어가 매력적인 곳입니다. 벽면을 가득 채운 다채로운 포스트잇은 방문객들에게 특별한 추억을 남기며, 친구와의 소중한 대화를 나누기에 완벽한 장소입니다. 맛있는 음식과 함께 드라마의 한 장면처럼 느껴보는 경험은 여행의 즐거움을 더해줄 것입니다.', 'Wangjjanggu Restaurant is the filming location of the drama Mother Friend and Son and it is a place with a cozy atmosphere and unique interior design The colorful postit filling the wall leaves special memories for visitors and is the perfect place to share precious conversations with friends The experience of feeling like a scene in a drama with delicious food will add to the joy of traveling'),
	(389, '엄마친구아들', '수연홈마트', '서울 종로구 계동길 99 안국역3번출구 위에서2분', '수연홈마트는 드라마 엄마친구아들의 촬영지로 현지의 신선한 농산물을 구입할 수 있는 매력적인 장소입니다 이곳은 지역 주민들이 자주 찾는 시장으로 다양한 식재료와 함께 정겨운 분위기를 느낄 수 있습니다 방문객들은 드라마의 한 장면을 재현하며 소소한 일상 속에서 특별한 경험을 할 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다', '#농산물 #장터 #서울여행 #드라마촬영지 #엄마친구아들', '시장/전통시장', 'Suyeon Home Mart', 'Mom\'s friend\'s son', '2 minutes above Exit 3 of Anguk Station 99, Gye-dong-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a market/traditional market', '#Agricultural products #marketplace #Seoultravel #DramaFilmingPlace #Mother and friend\'s son', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bwLtSB/btsI6VIp42N/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOF4jELsu_PYdkOgKifQ6SqIHCzbwtA0hzmsMJh3I_K1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=W3CUdMENHbMCGq34g2kRqMYfTFg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/DWRbh/btsI6lgLFcv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALgEIHjvMTLzdRHNNUaTuzZvxfdDrtTpypdueD7-fIL8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XEE141QddIcZrsD3SUlO1RNhyIs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/djo7td/btsI7JtHsZj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI4wB2F2eRWDFUzNO4vOhVwMcsF6nVR24Y_JhWN3abkj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X5Ww9PTfCd%2BGRy65hVbSo0irYVQ%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bwLtSB/btsI6VIp42N/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOF4jELsu_PYdkOgKifQ6SqIHCzbwtA0hzmsMJh3I_K1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=W3CUdMENHbMCGq34g2kRqMYfTFg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/DWRbh/btsI6lgLFcv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALgEIHjvMTLzdRHNNUaTuzZvxfdDrtTpypdueD7-fIL8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XEE141QddIcZrsD3SUlO1RNhyIs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/djo7td/btsI7JtHsZj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI4wB2F2eRWDFUzNO4vOhVwMcsF6nVR24Y_JhWN3abkj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X5Ww9PTfCd%2BGRy65hVbSo0irYVQ%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bwLtSB/btsI6VIp42N/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOF4jELsu_PYdkOgKifQ6SqIHCzbwtA0hzmsMJh3I_K1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=W3CUdMENHbMCGq34g2kRqMYfTFg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/DWRbh/btsI6lgLFcv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALgEIHjvMTLzdRHNNUaTuzZvxfdDrtTpypdueD7-fIL8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XEE141QddIcZrsD3SUlO1RNhyIs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/djo7td/btsI7JtHsZj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI4wB2F2eRWDFUzNO4vOhVwMcsF6nVR24Y_JhWN3abkj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X5Ww9PTfCd%2BGRy65hVbSo0irYVQ%3D', 37.58173980000001, 126.9866657, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 엄마친구아들\n- **촬영지**: 수연홈마트\n- **방문팁**: 다양한 지역 농산물을 저렴하게 구매할 수 있는 곳입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n수연홈마트는 드라마 "엄마친구아들"의 촬영지로, 현지의 신선한 농산물을 구입할 수 있는 매력적인 장소입니다. 이곳은 지역 주민들이 자주 찾는 시장으로, 다양한 식재료와 함께 정겨운 분위기를 느낄 수 있습니다. 방문객들은 드라마의 한 장면을 재현하며, 소소한 일상 속에서 특별한 경험을 할 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다.', 'Suyeon Home Mart is the filming location for the drama Mother Friend Son and is an attractive place to buy local fresh produce This is a market frequented by local residents and you can feel the friendly atmosphere with various ingredients Visitors recreate a scene from a drama providing an opportunity to have special experiences in a small daily life'),
	(390, '엄마친구아들', '풍년식품 앞', '서울 종로구 창덕궁길 127 안국역3번출구 위에서7분', '풍년식품 앞은 드라마 엄마친구아들의 주요 촬영지로 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다 이곳은 거리의 독특한 분위기와 함께 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라 관광객들에게도 매력적인 장소입니다 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 사진을 찍거나 주변의 맛집을 탐방하는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다', '#촬영지 #드라마팬 #산책 #카페탐방 #서울 #풍년식품', '거리/골목/광장', 'In front of a good year\'s food', 'Mom\'s friend\'s son', '7 minutes above Exit 3 of Anguk Station, 127, Changdeokgung-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#filming location #dramafan #walk #café tour #Seoul #richyearfood', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bqPqxe/btsJnrNgwhC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFFhAsP9KpzasFiSaSa6dTNRM0VyqEejUPuw-Z7pwRyy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UlAHVqeZgGHBPPqkCZke7H%2FIyjc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wKOEu/btsJm5KEmzI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANfun6RtYUQXpv5Y4ckaNxKfenwBcxRXvTd26llOq8S8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LKdKOT9pg%2BWH7f09FUPbn%2BNpLio%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bqPqxe/btsJnrNgwhC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFFhAsP9KpzasFiSaSa6dTNRM0VyqEejUPuw-Z7pwRyy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UlAHVqeZgGHBPPqkCZke7H%2FIyjc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wKOEu/btsJm5KEmzI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANfun6RtYUQXpv5Y4ckaNxKfenwBcxRXvTd26llOq8S8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LKdKOT9pg%2BWH7f09FUPbn%2BNpLio%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bqPqxe/btsJnrNgwhC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFFhAsP9KpzasFiSaSa6dTNRM0VyqEejUPuw-Z7pwRyy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UlAHVqeZgGHBPPqkCZke7H%2FIyjc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wKOEu/btsJm5KEmzI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANfun6RtYUQXpv5Y4ckaNxKfenwBcxRXvTd26llOq8S8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LKdKOT9pg%2BWH7f09FUPbn%2BNpLio%3D', NULL, 37.5828837, 126.9888764, '### 거리 정보\n- **촬영지**: 풍년식품 앞\n- **방문팁**: 이곳에서 드라마의 생생한 장면을 체험해보세요!\n\n### 여행 포인트\n풍년식품 앞은 드라마 “엄마친구아들”의 주요 촬영지로, 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다. 이곳은 거리의 독특한 분위기와 함께 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어, 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라 관광객들에게도 매력적인 장소입니다. 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 사진을 찍거나, 주변의 맛집을 탐방하는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다.\n\n### 키워드\n#KdramaTrip #엄마친구아들', 'The front of Pungnyun Food is the main filming location of the drama Mother Friend Son and it is a good place to take a walk while feeling the sensibility of the drama It is an attractive place not only for drama fans but also for tourists as there are various cafes and shops along with the unique atmosphere of the street It will also be a good experience to take pictures while thinking of the scene that was filmed or to explore nearby restaurants'),
	(391, '엄마친구아들', '궁중음식연구원', '서울 종로구 창덕궁5길 16 안국역3번출구 위에서2분', '궁중음식연구원은 전통 한옥의 아름다움과 함께 한국의 고유한 음식 문화를 체험할 수 있는 장소입니다 이곳은 드라마 촬영지로도 유명해 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 기회가 됩니다 다양한 전통 음식 체험 프로그램이 마련되어 있어 가족이나 친구와 함께 방문하기에 적합합니다 주변 경치도 아름다워 산책하기에도 좋은 곳입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #한옥, #전통음식, #가족, #친구, #산책', '기타', 'the Royal Institute of Food and Rural Affairs', 'Mom\'s friend\'s son', '2 minutes above Exit 3 of Anguk Station, 16, Changdeokgung 5-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Drama filming location, #Hanok, #traditionalfood, #family, #friend, #walk', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uz5N9/btsJotp0KNO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOhNR-dhSSMIntEXgJsimvinlVOW4iU0R073XqH6xBHT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X2CBokyx%2FDrm%2B%2F3K8AVyHUUQTrM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/crX3ur/btsJnW0jFCR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAV1auLnJ7-ZmEwIzqAvOtlnljFHrPybFfpAQ7jTiBnY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ew65yf%2FWct5T04uMb5R4Zl16wNU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uz5N9/btsJotp0KNO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOhNR-dhSSMIntEXgJsimvinlVOW4iU0R073XqH6xBHT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X2CBokyx%2FDrm%2B%2F3K8AVyHUUQTrM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/crX3ur/btsJnW0jFCR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAV1auLnJ7-ZmEwIzqAvOtlnljFHrPybFfpAQ7jTiBnY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ew65yf%2FWct5T04uMb5R4Zl16wNU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uz5N9/btsJotp0KNO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOhNR-dhSSMIntEXgJsimvinlVOW4iU0R073XqH6xBHT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X2CBokyx%2FDrm%2B%2F3K8AVyHUUQTrM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/crX3ur/btsJnW0jFCR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAV1auLnJ7-ZmEwIzqAvOtlnljFHrPybFfpAQ7jTiBnY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ew65yf%2FWct5T04uMb5R4Zl16wNU%3D', NULL, 37.5835841, 126.9892675, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 엄마친구아들\n- **촬영지**: 궁중음식연구원\n- **방문팁**: 드라마 속 아름다운 한옥을 배경으로 사진을 찍어보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n궁중음식연구원은 전통 한옥의 아름다움과 함께 한국의 고유한 음식 문화를 체험할 수 있는 장소입니다. 이곳은 드라마 촬영지로도 유명해, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 기회가 됩니다. 다양한 전통 음식 체험 프로그램이 마련되어 있어, 가족이나 친구와 함께 방문하기에 적합합니다. 주변 경치도 아름다워 산책하기에도 좋은 곳입니다.', 'The Royal Food Research Institute is a place where you can experience Koreas unique food culture along with the beauty of traditional hanok It is also famous as a filming location for dramas so it is an opportunity for drama fans to leave special memories There are various traditional food experience programs which are perfect for visiting with family or friends The surrounding scenery is also beautiful so its a good place to take a walk'),
	(392, '엄마친구아들', '라파지블', '서울 종로구 옥인3길 2 경복궁역3번출구 버스7분', '라파지블은 이 드라마의 매력적인 배경으로 다양한 카페와 상점들이 즐비해 있어 드라마 속 장면들을 실감 나게 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다 이 지역을 탐방하며 촬영된 장소들을 직접 보고 드라마의 감성을 만끽해보세요 특히 드라마 속 주요 장면이 촬영된 카페에서 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다', '#카페 #드라마촬영지 #종로구 #서울 #여행 #감성', '기타', 'Raphazible', 'Mom\'s friend\'s son', '7-minute bus from Exit 3 of Gyeongbokgung Station, Okin 3-gil 2, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Cafe #DramaFilmingPlace #Jongro-gu #Seoul #Travel #Emotional', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mlRiu/btsJElFAfAz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGOECVGJTaXjWTQGPV1dUv5Apgax3CllbwrgXnjPWTbT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gOid%2F5%2Fb6dIoqmpXguepE6X%2BC50%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bIpr0k/btsJEqfJD8Y/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEjJ0fv1WMbWBBOubclG27yaQTfvodT6q_LWagAnlavk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oE%2FFiXHdpM0HkDXWsB5nkzb0S4Y%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tDjL9/btsJDIBqSrT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABk19gS5cXhOGlVeKHCJ5Jf2-c7HGf_iVuVtlJr2PMTT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UMYIU%2Fmk65yY21vOf%2FMvGD9Myf8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cyQ9zL/btsJQmx9xuP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPXwTAMAE1l-UmDm9RDE4tF1F3DcjU1tc4tVx-9uO2O1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=o2gUtr1QN80Bt3mlgkhajUVcCUI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cv0Onw/btsJPPgEAjK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAk9xf3qKsKVc5kAHU7c_p_cIHyChBfDo9sgg8COj3_P/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ahYRbtDTV52nwItR%2FMoIcVoMJIY%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mlRiu/btsJElFAfAz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGOECVGJTaXjWTQGPV1dUv5Apgax3CllbwrgXnjPWTbT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gOid%2F5%2Fb6dIoqmpXguepE6X%2BC50%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bIpr0k/btsJEqfJD8Y/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEjJ0fv1WMbWBBOubclG27yaQTfvodT6q_LWagAnlavk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oE%2FFiXHdpM0HkDXWsB5nkzb0S4Y%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tDjL9/btsJDIBqSrT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABk19gS5cXhOGlVeKHCJ5Jf2-c7HGf_iVuVtlJr2PMTT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UMYIU%2Fmk65yY21vOf%2FMvGD9Myf8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cyQ9zL/btsJQmx9xuP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPXwTAMAE1l-UmDm9RDE4tF1F3DcjU1tc4tVx-9uO2O1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=o2gUtr1QN80Bt3mlgkhajUVcCUI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cv0Onw/btsJPPgEAjK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAk9xf3qKsKVc5kAHU7c_p_cIHyChBfDo9sgg8COj3_P/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ahYRbtDTV52nwItR%2FMoIcVoMJIY%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mlRiu/btsJElFAfAz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGOECVGJTaXjWTQGPV1dUv5Apgax3CllbwrgXnjPWTbT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gOid%2F5%2Fb6dIoqmpXguepE6X%2BC50%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bIpr0k/btsJEqfJD8Y/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEjJ0fv1WMbWBBOubclG27yaQTfvodT6q_LWagAnlavk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oE%2FFiXHdpM0HkDXWsB5nkzb0S4Y%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tDjL9/btsJDIBqSrT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABk19gS5cXhOGlVeKHCJ5Jf2-c7HGf_iVuVtlJr2PMTT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UMYIU%2Fmk65yY21vOf%2FMvGD9Myf8%3D', 37.5810531, 126.9663948, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 엄마친구아들\n- **촬영지**: 라파지블\n- **방문팁**: 드라마의 주요 촬영지를 방문해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n라파지블은 이 드라마의 매력적인 배경으로, 다양한 카페와 상점들이 즐비해 있어 드라마 속 장면들을 실감 나게 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다. 이 지역을 탐방하며 촬영된 장소들을 직접 보고, 드라마의 감성을 만끽해보세요. 특히, 드라마 속 주요 장면이 촬영된 카페에서 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다.', 'Raphazible is the attractive background of this drama and it is a place where you can feel the scenes in the drama realistically with various cafes and shops Explore this area see the filmed places for yourself and enjoy the sensibility of the drama In particular it will be a good experience to spend a leisurely time in a cafe where the main scenes in the drama are filmed'),
	(393, '엄마친구아들', '청운공원', '서울 종로구 청운동 7-6 경복궁역3번출구 버스20분', '청운공원은 드라마 엄마친구아들의 감정적인 장면들이 촬영된 장소로 방문객들에게 잊지 못할 추억을 선사합니다 아름다운 자연 경관과 조용한 분위기 속에서 사랑과 우정의 이야기를 떠올리며 여유롭게 산책할 수 있는 곳입니다 이곳은 특히 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 의미가 있는 장소로 촬영된 장면을 재현해보는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다', '#청운공원 #엄마친구아들 #드라마촬영지 #산책 #사랑과우정', '공원/숲/산', 'Cheongun Park', 'Mom\'s friend\'s son', 'Bus 20 minutes from Exit 3 of Gyeongbokgung Station, 7-6 Cheongun-dong, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a park/forest/mountain', '#Cheongwoon Park #MomFriendsSon #DramaShoot #Walk #Love and Friendship', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oyCVt/btsJouvFyXh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHX8jFGtYUYm0O-3xmICNVH27CcwFh4_5vhFGGkzDdjd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TLXjUvuvQS50M1nN3YtNSNKEVjU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bqOuM6/btsJmalA5Hb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIQjunnkklAyzmDA0buLWEdkx8Pb2LLHKScLrTgvTvFQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LwznTNgCMnGoDt1X71f8R3u7IoY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/T1zkj/btsI7rzWNu5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIYLndlOVKgA3j7E710JC3TPGVVjIw_-y7hNHrvWc9lJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QkIEWB34v%2Fma23GmpHeNNOq81N0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/If8D9/btsI787JapT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO9RspOeechbsy0DOfrE8yIyQFphB46yR0V0e882kZDM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2DfeaSNIE5NWxChyDapb1ED%2FcH0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c2wQ4a/btsI8ncvCk7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG6VSoQIRn7fYEIWEw60ah2_kAIr1DiEKObCopjxNsoL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QjONITYuHFeDYVaEZWQwLMrdTUE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oyCVt/btsJouvFyXh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHX8jFGtYUYm0O-3xmICNVH27CcwFh4_5vhFGGkzDdjd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signa