if youre the main character in a drama'),
	(414, '오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다', '29펍 3호점', '서울 서초구 강남대로 445 신논현역7번출구 도보2분', '29펍 3호점은 드라마 오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다의 촬영지로 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지닌 장소입니다 아늑한 분위기와 다양한 메뉴가 있어 친구들과 함께 방문하기에 적합하며 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 이곳에서 맛있는 음료와 함께 드라마의 감동을 다시 한 번 느껴보세요', '#드라마촬영지 #카페 #친구모임 #감성카페 #여유로운시간', '카페/레스토랑', 'Pub #3', 'I\'ve been waiting for you for a long time', '2-minute walk from Exit 7 of Sinnonhyeon Station, 445 Gangnam-daero, Seocho-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Drama filming location #Cafe #FriendsMeeting #SentimentalCafe #RelaxingTime', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/AYlrZ/btspFLZBC9l/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOAoeyxQtOb_D4MCH8wcyQP_Qjuflv4hMBemaOhgkrah/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0QMhaQwSmM2CkZ7uY3K%2Ferdb7fM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bbUeaE/btspH1nwLfu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEXzOXjwtcAEnYyOLdM-RDHNYMhfXrugRhykoDXAMOLf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fSUu27AAUtQppMHjB%2FLl5kxgIuU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c8CEoe/btspHZQPMMW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD40g0_jgMHb6uJQI1yy1gqSnFgm8nIkppca2i4YZu1l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DGhrvx6Wij2bitPCzUjH3rftygg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/AYlrZ/btspFLZBC9l/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOAoeyxQtOb_D4MCH8wcyQP_Qjuflv4hMBemaOhgkrah/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0QMhaQwSmM2CkZ7uY3K%2Ferdb7fM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bbUeaE/btspH1nwLfu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEXzOXjwtcAEnYyOLdM-RDHNYMhfXrugRhykoDXAMOLf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fSUu27AAUtQppMHjB%2FLl5kxgIuU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c8CEoe/btspHZQPMMW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD40g0_jgMHb6uJQI1yy1gqSnFgm8nIkppca2i4YZu1l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DGhrvx6Wij2bitPCzUjH3rftygg%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/AYlrZ/btspFLZBC9l/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOAoeyxQtOb_D4MCH8wcyQP_Qjuflv4hMBemaOhgkrah/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0QMhaQwSmM2CkZ7uY3K%2Ferdb7fM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bbUeaE/btspH1nwLfu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEXzOXjwtcAEnYyOLdM-RDHNYMhfXrugRhykoDXAMOLf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fSUu27AAUtQppMHjB%2FLl5kxgIuU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c8CEoe/btspHZQPMMW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD40g0_jgMHb6uJQI1yy1gqSnFgm8nIkppca2i4YZu1l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DGhrvx6Wij2bitPCzUjH3rftygg%3D', 37.5019979, 127.0252595, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n- **제목**: 오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다\n- **촬영지**: 29펍 3호점\n- **방문팁**: 이곳에서 드라마의 특별한 순간을 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n29펍 3호점은 드라마 "오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다"의 촬영지로, 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지닌 장소입니다. 아늑한 분위기와 다양한 메뉴가 있어 친구들과 함께 방문하기에 적합하며, 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 이곳에서 맛있는 음료와 함께 드라마의 감동을 다시 한 번 느껴보세요.', 'Pub No 3 is the filming location of the drama Ive been waiting for you for a long time and it has a special meaning for fans It has a cozy atmosphere and a variety of menus so its perfect for visiting with friends and you can spend a leisurely time thinking about the scenes in the drama Feel the excitement of the drama with delicious drinks here once again'),
	(415, '오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다', '홍우제2빌딩', '서울 서초구 서초대로78길 22 강남역6번출구 도보3분', '홍우제2빌딩은 드라마 오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다의 주요 촬영지로 현대적인 건축물의 매력을 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다 이곳에서 드라마의 감정을 생생하게 느끼며 주변 카페에서 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것도 추천합니다 다양한 사진 촬영 포인트가 있어 팬들에게는 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #현대건축, #서울여행, #K드라마, #홍우제2빌딩', '기타/판별불가', 'Hongwoo Building 2', 'I\'ve been waiting for you for a long time', '3-minute walk from Exit 6 of Gangnam Station, 22, Seocho-daero 78-gil, Seocho-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Drama filming location, #HyundaiArchitecture, #SeoulTravel, #K-Drama, #HongwooSecond Building', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nvfv5/btspFLyyGlj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF_vHGOEPd0aKH3Djp_GjRrfwDvBPFxr57OuNQ6JEuRG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=c9HSGE70dchIvfb9MgJZ8iEH5YU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7DHiM/btspUiaixgA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAObl2amSk2MPouF1fjSOg9gkImT2jA-V0-8OQjA1-g0l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=v9DLZypCU30%2BUQxq3%2BYMBxxJwBI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/SkUpm/btspUnWPqNS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANjhn4_n5lLvW7aO0u0NLgrC-fGwhL5Z5t-SinmZWJqb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MvBiKxdgWogsieKYeDTglrqiwH0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nvfv5/btspFLyyGlj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF_vHGOEPd0aKH3Djp_GjRrfwDvBPFxr57OuNQ6JEuRG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=c9HSGE70dchIvfb9MgJZ8iEH5YU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7DHiM/btspUiaixgA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAObl2amSk2MPouF1fjSOg9gkImT2jA-V0-8OQjA1-g0l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=v9DLZypCU30%2BUQxq3%2BYMBxxJwBI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/SkUpm/btspUnWPqNS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANjhn4_n5lLvW7aO0u0NLgrC-fGwhL5Z5t-SinmZWJqb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2