	(416, '오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다', '한우다이닝 울릉', '서울 서초구 서운로 135 강남역6번출구 위에서4분', '한우다이닝 울릉은 드라마 오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다의 촬영지로 현대적인 분위기와 함께 맛있는 한우를 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다 넓고 편안한 창가 자리에서 자연광을 받으며 식사를 즐기는 경험은 특별합니다 드라마의 주인공들이 앉았던 자리에서 같은 음식을 맛보며 그들의 감정을 느껴보는 것도 좋은 추억이 될 것입니다', '#한우 #식사 #드라마촬영지 #서울 #레스토랑 #감정', '카페/레스토랑', 'Korean Beef Dining Ulleung', 'I\'ve been waiting for you for a long time', '4 minutes above exit 6 of Gangnam Station 135, Sewoon-ro, Seocho-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Korean beef #meal #drama set #Seoul #restaurant #emotional', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uc8bv/btsqQ9xjL7J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACrMr44l_ar7XzHcOCKZoT9O6EO8rIs1BMQ_3a56JNB3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Pa2V5L3E5R3zRto39FGm%2BA%2FPyX8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bT0O1G/btsqT3iy3rG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJHgUyTdF5OTkLjJjOCgeHCHLGcw1H4bFxze5Gjnm0xV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=h4H1wYGbBX0yc1w2Ft0KiC4SGeo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/EB7fF/btsqVPK7NEx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOWBJxOGCwhCvUCR8nZTfz3mIl8Om86lslpG8pR3u1nk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=g3AQLFDpLhOVZswvF7w%2BJd3tAY0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bliJ0h/btsqLks8eAP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACrETZM1ZZiq_dnRUmi85rE5i_eXtwAChCPPost-zFYw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9dd4HgScqy3OOr2XC3F%2FMJa41MQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xinfy/btsqSabqcHC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHPTJKWxgXL3BGWIeq1sA-bY3iP9MUrtafv-zlOWbnNg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EQ2xyQAOW1KETiKGTaoBf11j4Vg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uc8bv/btsqQ9xjL7J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACrMr44l_ar7XzHcOCKZoT9O6EO8rIs1BMQ_3a56JNB3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Pa2V5L3E5R3zRto39FGm%2BA%2FPyX8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bT0O1G/btsqT3iy3rG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJHgUyTdF5OTkLjJjOCgeHCHLGcw1H4bFxze5Gjnm0xV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=h4H1wYGbBX0yc1w2Ft0KiC4SGeo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/EB7fF/btsqVPK7NEx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOWBJxOGCwhCvUCR8nZTfz3mIl8Om86lslpG8pR3u1nk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=g3AQLFDpLhOVZswvF7w%2BJd3tAY0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bliJ0h/btsqLks8eAP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACrETZM1ZZiq_dnRUmi85rE5i_eXtwAChCPPost-zFYw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9dd4HgScqy3OOr2XC3F%2FMJa41MQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xinfy/btsqSabqcHC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHPTJKWxgXL3BGWIeq1sA-bY3iP9MUrtafv-zlOWbnNg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EQ2xyQAOW1KETiKGTaoBf11j4Vg%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uc8bv/btsqQ9xjL7J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACrMr44l_ar7XzHcOCKZoT9O6EO8rIs1BMQ_3a56JNB3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Pa2V5L3E5R3zRto39FGm%2BA%2FPyX8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bT0O1G/btsqT3iy3rG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJHgUyTdF5OTkLjJjOCgeHCHLGcw1H4bFxze5Gjnm0xV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=h4H1wYGbBX0yc1w2Ft0KiC4SGeo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/EB7fF/btsqVPK7NEx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOWBJxOGCwhCvUCR8nZTfz3mIl8Om86lslpG8pR3u1nk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=g3AQLFDpLhOVZswvF7w%2BJd3tAY0%3D', 37.4955227, 127.0245489, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다  \n**촬영지:** 한우다이닝 울릉  \n**방문팁:** 맛있는 한우를 즐기며 드라마의 한 장면을 재현해보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n한우다이닝 울릉은 드라마 "오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다"의 촬영지로, 현대적인 분위기와 함께 맛있는 한우를 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다. 넓고 편안한 창가 자리에서 자연광을 받으며 식사를 즐기는 경험은 특별합니다. 드라마의 주인공들이 앉았던 자리에서 같은 음식을 맛보며, 그들의 감정을 느껴보는 것도 좋은 추억이 될 것입니다.', 'Korean Beef Dining Ulleung is the filming location of the drama Ive Been Waiting for You for a Long Time where you can enjoy delicious Korean beef with a modern atmosphere The experience of enjoying a meal under natural light in a spacious and comfortable window seat is special It will be a good memory to taste the same food and feel their emotions in the seats where the main characters of the drama sat'),
	(417, '오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다', '카페 시그니처', '서울 강남구 봉은사로 218 언주역5번출구 도보2분', '카페 시그니처는 현대적인 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 장소가 됩니다 넓은 창문으로 들어오는 자연광과 식물들이 어우러져 편안한 느낌을 주며 다양한 음료와 디저트를 즐기기에 최적의 공간입니다 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 이곳에서 주인공들이 나눈 대화와 감정을 떠올리며 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요', '#카페 #드라마촬영지 #서울 #아늑한 #디저트 #편안한', '카페/레스토랑', 'Cafe signature', 'I\'ve been waiting for you for a long time', '2-minute walk from Exit 5 of Unju Station, 218, Bongeunsa-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Cafe #DramaFilmingPlace #Seoul #Cozy #Dessert #Relaxed', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ckvwqj/btssMDbLzAV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJxBR3DHI3RSW5DvwpT24LTSXywSvdnuHFFkiMVTmdJu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=61xPSaiC6sYjG%2BURUboH6C1J5Ac%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bBCUNv/btssGkxzZbv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAiUo5NRGoO4LjdKxlbSkXvhluT6Hxs2_TFt1D7Jpq3i/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=R5%2FHNu5%2BmLBXQwZTMcgOYR4oGto%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tG7ab/btssLEhFPvd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALbjFU7XTW7wmfYmP_oRS0YjZE8roLsZTD-_drp4wsKH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JZ6gTT%2BA9sVwp%2FWFf%2FDRku%2FCfdM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ckvwqj/btssMDbLzAV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJxBR3DHI3RSW5DvwpT24LTSXywSvdnuHFFkiMVTmdJu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=61xPSaiC6sYjG%2BURUboH6C1J5Ac%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bBCUNv/btssGkxzZbv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAiUo5NRGoO4LjdKxlbSkXvhluT6Hxs2_TFt1D7Jpq3i/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=R5%2FHNu5%2BmLBXQwZTMcgOYR4oGto%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tG7ab/btssLEhFPvd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALbjFU7XTW7wmfYmP_oRS0YjZE8roLsZTD-_drp4wsKH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JZ6gTT%2BA9sVwp%2FWFf%2FDRku%2FCfdM%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ckvwqj/btssMDbLzAV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJxBR3DHI3RSW5DvwpT24LTSXywSvdnuHFFkiMVTmdJu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=61xPSaiC6sYjG%2BURUboH6C1J5Ac%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bBCUNv/btssGkxzZbv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAiUo5NRGoO4LjdKxlbSkXvhluT6Hxs2_TFt1D7Jpq3i/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=R5%2FHNu5%2BmLBXQwZTMcgOYR4oGto%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tG7ab/btssLEhFPvd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALbjFU7XTW7wmfYmP_oRS0YjZE8roLsZTD-_drp4wsKH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JZ6gTT%2BA9sVwp%2FWFf%2FDRku%2FCfdM%3D', 37.5077127, 127.0359717, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**카페 이름:** 카페 시그니처  \n**드라마 제목:** 오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다  \n**방문 팁:** 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n카페 시그니처는 현대적인 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 장소가 됩니다. 넓은 창문으로 들어오는 자연광과 식물들이 어우러져 편안한 느낌을 주며, 다양한 음료와 디저트를 즐기기에 최적의 공간입니다. 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 이곳에서, 주인공들이 나눈 대화와 감정을 떠올리며 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요.', 'The cafe signature is a special place for drama fans with its modern interior and cozy atmosphere Natural light and plants coming through the wide window make you feel comfortable and it is the perfect place to enjoy a variety of drinks and desserts Here where the main scenes of the drama were filmed make special memories by recalling the conversations and emotions the main characters had'),
	(418, '오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다', '오름곰탕(폐점)', '서울 강남구 삼성로95길 23 선릉역10번출구 도보9분', '오름곰탕은 드라마 오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다의 촬영지로 특별한 분위기를 자아내는 장소입니다 이곳은 폐점된 상태지만 여전히 드라마 팬들에게는 소중한 추억을 간직한 곳입니다 드라마의 장면을 떠올리며 이곳을 방문하면 마치 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 느낄 수 있습니다 주변 환경도 아늑해 사진 촬영이나 여유로운 산책에 적합한 장소입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #폐점, #추억, #서울, #강남, #감성', '기타/판별불가', 'Oreum Gomtang (closed)', 'I\'ve been waiting for you for a long time', '9 minutes walk from Exit 10 of Seonneung Station, 23, Samseong-ro 95-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Drama filming location, #Closed, #Memories, #Seoul, #Gangnam, #Emotional', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dacnET/btspRJm6Mt7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKa4D74uQ8VAk2B_e8NoQre7sDR_jRPioCh9jKFOvjnp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=F8DIv857hBfiQ1fkc5MidXvDegQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/m4z5p/btspVNopatb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANf9DuHakCMgn4KsNS_Lbe_LEUSjgTB1qC8a6jQ8rFya/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uVsrduHnoThuuKkGvSBr5kaUE%2Fo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ccCSMM/btsp0RcOeQN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKTkF37YCCr3X_a5z2hXV605I6fxemB8NsQF4sx-ZNrn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gQqYtvXmlbuwUOMbZlf12wdYN0c%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/7iYLj/btsp0DlfjL1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAj8I-62KgExYFvvwzdnyjPaINlFYwCx3SaPf750x8Kj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KyvhjsaXSpMGDAyEN%2FDvosWUo8A%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dacnET/btspRJm6Mt7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKa4D74uQ8VAk2B_e8NoQre7sDR_jRPioCh9jKFOvjnp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=F8DIv857hBfiQ1fkc5MidXvDegQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/m4z5p/btspVNopatb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANf9DuHakCMgn4KsNS_Lbe_LEUSjgTB1qC8a6jQ8rFya/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uVsrduHnoThuuKkGvSBr5kaUE%2Fo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ccCSMM/btsp0RcOeQN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKTkF37YCCr3X_a5z2hXV605I6fxemB8NsQF4sx-ZNrn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gQqYtvXmlbuwUOMbZlf12wdYN0c%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/7iYLj/btsp0DlfjL1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAj8I-62KgExYFvvwzdnyjPaINlFYwCx3SaPf750x8Kj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KyvhjsaXSpMGDAyEN%2FDvosWUo8A%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dacnET/btspRJm6Mt7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKa4D74uQ8VAk2B_e8NoQre7sDR_jRPioCh9jKFOvjnp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=F8DIv857hBfiQ1fkc5MidXvDegQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/m4z5p/btspVNopatb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANf9DuHakCMgn4KsNS_Lbe_LEUSjgTB1qC8a6jQ8rFya/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uVsrduHnoThuuKkGvSBr5kaUE%2Fo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ccCSMM/btsp0RcOeQN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKTkF37YCCr3X_a5z2hXV605I6fxemB8NsQF4sx-ZNrn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gQqYtvXmlbuwUOMbZlf12wdYN0c%3D', 37.5074425, 127.0539355, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다\n- **촬영지**: 오름곰탕(폐점)\n- **방문팁**: 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n오름곰탕은 드라마 "오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다"의 촬영지로, 특별한 분위기를 자아내는 장소입니다. 이곳은 폐점된 상태지만, 여전히 드라마 팬들에게는 소중한 추억을 간직한 곳입니다. 드라마의 장면을 떠올리며 이곳을 방문하면, 마치 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 느낄 수 있습니다. 주변 환경도 아늑해, 사진 촬영이나 여유로운 산책에 적합한 장소입니다.', 'Oreum Gomtang is the filming location of the drama Ive been waiting for you for a long time and its a place that creates a special atmosphere It is closed but it is still a place with precious memories for drama fans If you visit here thinking about the scenes of the drama you can feel like a main character The surrounding environment is also cozy making it a perfect place for taking photos or relaxing walks'),
	(419, '오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다', '해리슨테일러 청담본점', '서울 강남구 삼성로 719 청담역8번출구 도보2분', '해리슨테일러 청담본점은 드라마 오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 장소입니다 이곳에서 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 순간을 경험하며 친구나 연인과 함께 소중한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 커피 한 잔과 함께 드라마의 여운에 것은 이곳을 방문하는 또 다른 즐거움이 될 것입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #청담동, #카페, #아늑한분위기, #주말데이트', '카페/레스토랑', 'Harrison Taylor Cheongdam Headquarters', 'I\'ve been waiting for you for a long time', '2-minute walk from Exit 8 of Cheongdam Station, 719, Samseong-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Drama filming location, #Cheongdam-dong, #Cafe, #CozyAtmosphere, #WeekendDate', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/JK9xI/btsqLlD16ry/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKs3DQ4NoV1rH1UFKYG1R7XkAyDbtYHYrwiLSBzKDpi7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=W%2FL83Glv5%2Bnt1BG0B784mwECoLc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rH16t/btsqILDPnGS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADRmAyvY4UGhINyX3DqdOHqOQeaMXhHxCMO4zwmGvWbn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YMFgWqQCAvUUL18yVhN%2Bqs6s8xc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cImFcJ/btsqJFiYuS7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMJvRxtgsT-16N9Zers3KwbywFNqqV4SND0xJWSvarjD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=REs9yR0kkgHSauftksUBtPW9WDw%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/JK9xI/btsqLlD16ry/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKs3DQ4NoV1rH1UFKYG1R7XkAyDbtYHYrwiLSBzKDpi7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=W%2FL83Glv5%2Bnt1BG0B784mwECoLc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rH16t/btsqILDPnGS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADRmAyvY4UGhINyX3DqdOHqOQeaMXhHxCMO4zwmGvWbn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YMFgWqQCAvUUL18yVhN%2Bqs6s8xc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cImFcJ/btsqJFiYuS7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMJvRxtgsT-16N9Zers3KwbywFNqqV4SND0xJWSvarjD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=REs9yR0kkgHSauftksUBtPW9WDw%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/JK9xI/btsqLlD16ry/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKs3DQ4NoV1rH1UFKYG1R7XkAyDbtYHYrwiLSBzKDpi7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=W%2FL83Glv5%2Bnt1BG0B784mwECoLc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rH16t/btsqILDPnGS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADRmAyvY4UGhINyX3DqdOHqOQeaMXhHxCMO4zwmGvWbn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YMFgWqQCAvUUL18yVhN%2Bqs6s8xc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cImFcJ/btsqJFiYuS7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMJvRxtgsT-16N9Zers3KwbywFNqqV4SND0xJWSvarjD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=REs9yR0kkgHSauftksUBtPW9WDw%3D', 37.5199744, 127.0492517, '### 드라마 정보\n**제목:** 오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다  \n**촬영지:** 해리슨테일러 청담본점  \n**방문팁:** 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 가져보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 기타  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n해리슨테일러 청담본점은 드라마 "오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 장소입니다. 이곳에서 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 순간을 경험하며, 친구나 연인과 함께 소중한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 커피 한 잔과 함께 드라마의 여운에浸る 것은 이곳을 방문하는 또 다른 즐거움이 될 것입니다.', 'Harrison Taylor Cheongdam headquarters is the filming location of the drama Ive been waiting for you for a long time and its an attractive place with its sophisticated interior and cozy atmosphere You can experience special moments like a scene in a drama here and spend precious time with friends or lovers  to the lingering effects of the drama with a cup of coffee will be another pleasure to visit here'),
