4514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lY2eHrGnkK3C%2FeY%2B2WLQnugUfKs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ESNUP/btspK3FHgCP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEpf9g17SaUd4xK_538V9S7l16huD9SaUwZmQ-PTGNJu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2nFcOdWvU03u0AjuyeCoMLBG3mc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/chTYjr/btspNhi2u7F/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATfZo-a_Tjn7fXMTQjnLALicCbJyRfilSppWrqHg5KA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UBuAeKZ3LUKAsudQFa5FhJY46xY%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bvAsAa/btspUhJb5qS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALIjcOSsWndyW-7Z5GRX_CDLcbau45QAzPGW_AgB8p4l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HpibMismUM3hoNrW2Z4qaLhKj3Q%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Eta4a/btspFMEcR6V/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABtD1Vywh-AtOndlxmP37LLPMHH1FA6p9sZmzUrpZlD9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lY2eHrGnkK3C%2FeY%2B2WLQnugUfKs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ESNUP/btspK3FHgCP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEpf9g17SaUd4xK_538V9S7l16huD9SaUwZmQ-PTGNJu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2nFcOdWvU03u0AjuyeCoMLBG3mc%3D', 37.5232373, 127.0451654, '### 청담순대국\n\n**주소:** 서울 강남구 삼성로149길 30  \n**장르:** 카페/레스토랑  \n**드라마 제목:** 오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다  \n**방문 팁:** 이곳에서 맛있는 순대국을 즐기며 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n#### 여행 포인트\n청담순대국은 드라마 "오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다"의 촬영지로, 진한 국물의 순대국이 매력적인 곳입니다. 이곳은 아늑한 분위기 속에서 맛있는 음식을 즐길 수 있어, 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라 모든 방문객에게 추천할 만한 장소입니다. 드라마의 한 장면처럼 편안한 시간을 보내며, 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요.', 'Cheongdam Sundaeguk is the filming location of the drama Ive Been Waiting for You for a Long Time and the Sundaeguk of rich soup is an attractive place This place is a recommended place for all visitors as well as drama fans because you can enjoy delicious food in a cozy atmosphere Have a relaxing time like a scene in a drama and make special memories'),
	(421, '오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다', '라이카카메라 청담', '서울 강남구 도산대로 420 청담역8번출구 위에서5분', '라이카카메라 청담은 세련된 디자인과 고급 카메라들이 전시된 공간으로 사진 애호가들에게 매력적인 장소입니다 이곳은 드라마의 촬영지로도 유명하며 카메라에 대한 다양한 정보와 체험을 제공해 방문객들을 끌어들입니다 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 순간을 기록할 수 있는 기회를 놓치지 마세요', '#K드라마 #촬영지탐방 #사진애호가 #서울여행 #카메라 #청담', '기타', 'Leica camera, Cheongdam', 'I\'ve been waiting for you for a long time', '5 minutes above Exit 8 of Cheongdam Station, 420 Dosan-daero, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#K-drama #shooting #photosophisticated #Seoultravel #camera #Cheongdam', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/3RG2G/btspRhQlpPI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIjpJnYG5x_jbXigZM5eJlWOH2x8Cp2WJYZaEX5rWMuJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=T3PHtENeNn9TaXzPktZGqNmE4xc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bOoESq/btspUm4IJhw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOl9JWaEceY9MFCM_yNtFMRVdG_7U_I7Vsl-kVTFxbb6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iNL2sdGH98V9mOfaJF2XT95zPVo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/crIqZY/btspTKdFONm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFphBHqAvgJ8B_HnAevHvEx8D9-uwTVqOeuQ_9LVGDfW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qDBWS0rXgbWSWaqYYSnjnCRmRvs%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/3RG2G/btspRhQlpPI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIjpJnYG5x_jbXigZM5eJlWOH2x8Cp2WJYZaEX5rWMuJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=T3PHtENeNn9TaXzPktZGqNmE4xc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bOoESq/btspUm4IJhw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOl9JWaEceY9MFCM_yNtFMRVdG_7U_I7Vsl-kVTFxbb6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iNL2sdGH98V9mOfaJF2XT95zPVo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/crIqZY/btspTKdFONm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFphBHqAvgJ8B_HnAevHvEx8D9-uwTVqOeuQ_9LVGDfW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qDBWS0rXgbWSWaqYYSnjnCRmRvs%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/3RG2G/btspRhQlpPI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIjpJnYG5x_jbXigZM5eJlWOH2x8Cp2WJYZaEX5rWMuJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=T3PHtENeNn9TaXzPktZGqNmE4xc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bOoESq/btspUm4IJhw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOl9JWaEceY9MFCM_yNtFMRVdG_7U_I7Vsl-kVTFxbb6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iNL2sdGH98V9mOfaJF2XT95zPVo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/crIqZY/btspTKdFONm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFphBHqAvgJ8B_HnAevHvEx8D9-uwTVqOeuQ_9LVGDfW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qDBWS0rXgbWSWaqYYSnjnCRmRvs%3D', 37.5230411, 127.0419873, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다\n- **촬영지**: 라이카카메라 청담\n- **방문팁**: 카메라에 대한 깊은 지식을 얻고 싶다면 꼭 방문해 보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n라이카카메라 청담은 세련된 디자인과 고급 카메라들이 전시된 공간으로, 사진 애호가들에게 매력적인 장소입니다. 이곳은 드라마의 촬영지로도 유명하며, 카메라에 대한 다양한 정보와 체험을 제공해 방문객들을 끌어들입니다. 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 순간을 기록할 수 있는 기회를 놓치지 마세요.', 'Leica Camera Cheongdam is a space where sophisticated designs and highend cameras are displayed making it an attractive place for photo lovers It is also famous as a filming location for the drama and it attracts visitors by providing various information and experiences about the camera Dont miss the opportunity to record a special moment like a scene in a drama'),
	(422, '오랫동안 당신을 기다렸습니다', '호텔엔트라 강남', '서울 강남구 도산대로 508 청담역9번출구 도보10분', '호텔엔트라 강남은 세련된 인테리어와 뛰어난 전망으로 많은 여행객들에게 사랑받는 곳입니다 이곳은 드라마 촬영지로도 유명하여 팬들에게는 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 편리한 위치 덕분에 강남의 다양한 명소를 쉽게 탐방할 수 있으며 고급스러운 서비스와 함께 편안한 숙박을 즐길 수 있습니다', '#KdramaTrip #호텔 #강남 #드라마촬영지 #편안한숙박', '호텔/숙소', 'Hotel Entra Gangnam', 'I\'ve been waiting for you for a long time', '10 minutes walk from Exit 9 of Cheongdam Station, 508, Dosan-daero, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a hotel/dormitory', '#KdramaTrip #Hotel #Gangnam #DramaFilmingPlace #Relaxed Accommodation', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/biHqbs/btssBsbREq8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACKRlY0AUrmv_6t4y5r0VOR6dEFVYjxFgeZLI8TuvxiU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=trUFefhpEth0IDr4oW5akgQ64Zs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/MG2In/btssGvTlMR1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHXcpzqPkbG8v5bXs96CRPciaE0AbKuljk8SHTuH1jzQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Dymadp6NSXUyhBfdxTEndB3peEM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dkV4fR/btssGwLrQ4L/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGvp3DSnzmh7AfOccuC0vjIpGteeOTQsgztDHxghztEV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=i5yHdWeEemPD82XjYiP1u9FAWc0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bG11Ub/btssGBy3HFB/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO2F0ZBkuQoRsUUtkOajPrk02wxz8UJZJ6v41VdckLsz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=g18QMVfe5yPtiy8eio1UDocUXw8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ApGG0/btssIozpgjA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFohG23PLrSz6OqoctnDwnQ_PEAcpNeOMyeY6jHSgUbL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Qi6EQjJpvLxeloMbUc6ynuUa4yY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/3WeeI/btssBsXcriY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN5TJziT25vvee0W9MEGTiSQnicR6opovjueJOSQBgHn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signatur