	(436, '지금 거신 전화는', '이앤갤러리', '서울 종로구 평창길 224', '이앤갤러리는 아름다운 경치와 현대적인 건축이 조화를 이루는 곳으로 드라마 지금 거신 전화는의 촬영지로 유명합니다 이곳은 넓은 정원과 멋진 전망을 제공하여 방문객들이 편안한 시간을 보낼 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다 드라마 팬이라면 이 특별한 장소에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 여유로운 산책을 즐겨보세요', '#촬영지 #드라마명소 #현대건축 #정원 #쉬어가기 #풍경', '박물관/미술관/전시', 'E&Gallery', 'The phone you\'re calling right now', '224, Pyeongchang-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a museum/art gallery/exhibition', '#Shooting location #dramaattractions #modern architecture #garden #resting #landscape', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lED36/btsK2dHkepi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMY3sGsEubR4yyErLk_OVGPtK5qrx_pFoXBDuU1qj5cP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cTIc2I5KeLNDK4ku3%2FhMgO5vL%2Fo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bebhLm/btsK2uouSDg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHuUD8jJicXoYzlJUYoAjX89pO8DTy3aCt4v_X5JzWJK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hJtAEYwdHW9DCsxUW38Cg1fNHpo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/VM3TT/btsK4bVqXfr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABbc8j3F468vrIEwAiXJL5tsvxOKTSp2iQQ9WZKd-9iU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tfrkM%2B9nOiHEWfpQWhu2v1eQits%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/2VHOZ/btsLjmwgNVm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOagJ2QRbGCxoLXcos_eC9Cbe35wfB-IWza5qbaJaVkR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1v7IpAprZ7l6xNTZI%2BtWNgyux88%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bO9oow/btsLhZbstaL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACjZ_RiHdFqcq6QpMU8kXc4ZkVT_MleTHDQGkwhFL5vt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qF%2Fz0mg3aE5HOAwZtaSxO8fV%2BhU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/y2yGX/btsLDJSH2Iv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHylPuSuzgVSGJdojVV4snUARp1NSpFtv-hywcty-bjP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9wW6hWXPV%2F49%2F32sXkGVVVAaImg%