ing in a peaceful atmosphere If youre a drama fan feel the charm of the filming location and dont miss the opportunity to leave a special photo'),
	(446, '지금 거신 전화는', '조선팰리스 강남', '서울 강남구 테헤란로 231 역삼역8번출구 도보8분', '조선팰리스 강남은 현대적인 디자인과 고급스러운 시설을 갖춘 호텔로 편안한 휴식 공간과 다양한 편의시설을 제공합니다 드라마 지금 거신 전화는의 촬영지로 유명하여 팬들에게는 특별한 경험을 선사하는 장소입니다 멋진 로비와 아늑한 분위기는 방문객들에게 잊지 못할 순간을 만들어 줄 것입니다', '#호텔 #KdramaTrip #조선팰리스 #편안한분위기 #고급스러운디자인', '호텔', 'Chosun Palace Gangnam', 'The phone you\'re calling right now', '8 minutes walk from Exit 8 of Yeoksam Station, 231, Teheran-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Hotel', '#Hotel #KdramaTrip #ChosunPalace #Comfortable #LuxuryDesign', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/buz2qL/btsK1Kr9F1E/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPzA0MaADonuwWcsrTNLxoNyN4a-Pb72gjyNLm0V0zbr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2Biwi9A39vGr0IwYAmXIwGWuuEw0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/X8cgP/btsK2yxulhB/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJfX9NBTC4xwTNebV6mxRAXdTYhg6IlQ1CWcXqci0oTQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4BNq7Dte%2BG0eVSNdfsRDJHyQO%2BU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cScDmC/btsK2z4fMbM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJx7oS4e9fju69TTXsqLNmYrIQNmqyh9sDPgH1wtDWgS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7i70uk8cT8Ny%2FtI8oKKSacxsdJs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4NQ7P/btsK2dHkdWh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOIWFz_vW6v7MnWcAcvJILAhKEHJTIM_OTSVUXcSCgcv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iaheVs2OhK7h91zprSHhwmiO8Iw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dgAwT6/btsK3lRJptY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMGQOcxJUgvEqEe7xJ0SJAq308fRZmphVcZsm_wWC7N/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9AyCMQXa3MqqoKcw51b3%2BJg4Zos%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ewbEF9/btsK2nwbSzH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACon9NsjpQ--E6poQmuP3PDKApvh4qoh63ueZshkNNa7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ej357kJkF4VZFT2G6CWR