ies with friends and it is a mustvisit spot for drama fans It has a variety of phototaking points so its also great for leaving wonderful memories on Instagram'),
	(533, '소용없어 거짓말', '연남장', '서울 서대문구 연희로5길 22 홍대입구역3번출구 도보12분', '연남장은 드라마 소용없어 거짓말의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다 넓은 창으로 들어오는 자연광이 아늑한 느낌을 더해주며 다양한 메뉴를 즐길 수 있어 친구들과의 대화나 혼자만의 시간을 보내기에 적합합니다 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올리며 이곳에서 특별한 순간을 만들어보세요', '#소용없어거짓말 #연남장 #카페 #서울 #드라마촬영지 #여유로운시간', '카페/레스토랑', 'Yeonmamjang (Leader\'s Clothes)', 'It\'s no use lying', '12 minutes walk from Exit 3 of Hongik University Station, Yeonhui-ro 5-gil, Seodaemun-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#It\'s no use lying #YeonnamDress #Cafe #Seoul #DramaShootPlace #RelaxedTime', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/INJmb/btspGLjU1Kz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOT7oO4ggtvJWQDO_7KTz_K53tYqtFQkZFxue5C0DKQO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ETtQsGks94sohXEIuUGIs7VAOk4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ZjLP1/btspMjNZMcb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKCKpFMxjbeD0fQDEJl_W5-Fm6jJHNCmcw1zhaExSU2d/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KQatKjaEa8J6WLRNKIVfLads1SY%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/INJmb/btspGLjU1Kz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOT7oO4ggtvJWQDO_7KTz_K53tYqtFQkZFxue5C0DKQO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ETtQsGks94sohXEIuUGIs7VAOk4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ZjLP1/btspMjNZMcb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKCKpFMxjbeD0fQDEJl_W5-Fm6jJHNCmcw1zhaExSU2d/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KQatKjaEa8J6WLRNKIVfLads1SY%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/INJmb/btspGLjU1Kz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOT7oO4ggtvJWQDO_7KTz_K53tYqtFQkZFxue5C0DKQO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ETtQsGks94sohXEIuUGIs7VAOk4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ZjLP1/btspMjNZMcb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKCKpFMxjbeD0fQDEJl_W5-Fm6jJHNCmcw1zhaExSU2d/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KQatKjaEa8J6WLRNKIVfLads1SY%3D', NULL, 37.5643511, 126.9275968, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n- **제목:** 소용없어 거짓말\n- **촬영지:** 연남장\n- **방문팁:** 드라마의 분위기를 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보내세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n연남장은 드라마 "소용없어 거짓말"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다. 넓은 창으로 들어오는 자연광이 아늑한 느낌을 더해주며, 다양한 메뉴를 즐길 수 있어 친구들과의 대화나 혼자만의 시간을 보내기에 적합합니다. 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올리며 이곳에서 특별한 순간을 만들어보세요.', 'Yeonnamjang is the filming location of the drama Lies for No Use and it is an attractive cafe with a stylish interior and a cozy atmosphere The natural light coming through the wide window adds a cozy feeling and you can enjoy a variety of menus making it perfect for talking with friends or spending time alone Make a special moment here by recalling a scene from a drama'),
	(534, '소용없어 거짓말', '마포소금구이', '서울 마포구 와우산로32길 36 홍대입구역6번출구 도보6분', '마포소금구이는 드라마 소용없어 거짓말의 촬영지로 아늑한 분위기에서 다양한 고기 요리를 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다 이곳은 특히 소금구이로 유명하며 식사와 함께 드라마의 감성을 느껴볼 수 있는 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서의 식사가 더욱 의미 있을 것입니다', '#드라마촬영지 #소금구이 #맛집 #마포 #한국음식', '카페/레스토랑', 'Grilled Mapo salt', 'It\'s no use lying', '36 Wausan-ro 32-gil, Mapo-gu, Seoul, 6 minutes walk from Hongik University Station Exit 6', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Drama filming location #Grilled salt #Restaurant #Mapo #KoreanFood', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bTyKtO/btssk0GgXij/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADz6Km3y2HLMOuQrTj2KJarfgbKHGIySh6w7oBxwrt9o/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=b2JSYlwN9KV9BWlMGrJ30Y8zitU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/W0jDW/btssDM60gN8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFYaW2UANRU4D63uXopGfeTg2v7CUiJspeWVIb3XJYn-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EfpVhlVLkGPSOtLKWlphzq1x1JE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/7zdYY/btsshmpxu9T/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKeaYoQpTJsgLoBXTsg5B_jPGHpU7CM-G5pSeT9bYzhF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=W1FnupsFIPhI5DaOwv3JXK61p6E%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b4RcyZ/btssDLAf2wx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJvdjVNHz9znLinBRcpd8jVc4Jz4zGyCWk98K_9JWT7r/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=381abZJehz8RpIvv4NWSp3NL%2Fsg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bTyKtO/btssk0GgXij/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADz6Km3y2HLMOuQrTj2KJarfgbKHGIySh6w7oBxwrt9o/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=b2JSYlwN9KV9BWlMGrJ30Y8zitU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/W0jDW/btssDM60gN8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFYaW2UANRU4D63uXopGfeTg2v7CUiJspeWVIb3XJYn-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EfpVhlVLkGPSOtLKWlphzq1x1JE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/7zdYY/btsshmpxu9T/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKeaYoQpTJsgLoBXTsg5B_jPGHpU7CM-G5pSeT9bYzhF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=W1FnupsFIPhI5DaOwv3JXK61p6E%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b4RcyZ/btssDLAf2wx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJvdjVNHz9znLinBRcpd8jVc4Jz4zGyCWk98K_9JWT7r/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=381abZJehz8RpIvv4NWSp3NL%2Fsg%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bTyKtO/btssk0GgXij/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADz6Km3y2HLMOuQrTj2KJarfgbKHGIySh6w7oBxwrt9o/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=b2JSYlwN9KV9BWlMGrJ30Y8zitU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/W0jDW/btssDM60gN8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFYaW2UANRU4D63uXopGfeTg2v7CUiJspeWVIb3XJYn-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EfpVhlVLkGPSOtLKWlphzq1x1JE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/7zdYY/btsshmpxu9T/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKeaYoQpTJsgLoBXTsg5B_jPGHpU7CM-G5pSeT9bYzhF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=W1FnupsFIPhI5DaOwv3JXK61p6E%3D', 37.5546038, 126.9323172, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 소용없어 거짓말  \n**촬영지:** 마포소금구이  \n**방문팁:** 이곳에서 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 식사를 즐겨보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n마포소금구이는 드라마 "소용없어 거짓말"의 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기에서 다양한 고기 요리를 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다. 이곳은 특히 소금구이로 유명하며, 식사와 함께 드라마의 감성을 느껴볼 수 있는 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서의 식사가 더욱 의미 있을 것입니다.', 'Mapo Salt Grilling is the filming location of the drama Lies for No Use and it is a place where you can enjoy various meat dishes in a cozy atmosphere This place is especially famous for grilled salt and it offers a special experience where you can feel the sensibility of drama with your meal If youre a drama fan your meal here will be more meaningful'),
	(535, '소용없어 거짓말', '느티나무설렁탕', '서울 중구 퇴계로71길 38 동대문역사문화공원역2번출구 도보6분', '느티나무설렁탕은 드라마 소용없어 거짓말의 촬영지로 극 중 주인공들이 중요한 대화를 나누는 장소로 등장합니다 이곳은 아늑한 분위기와 함께 전통적인 설렁탕을 맛볼 수 있어 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다 드라마의 감동적인 순간들을 떠올리며 식사를 즐기고 친구들과의 소중한 추억을 만들어보세요', '#식사 #드라마촬영지 #전통음식 #소중한추억 #아늑한분위기', '카페/레스토랑', 'Zelkova tree seolleongtang', 'It\'s no use lying', '6-minute walk from Exit 2 of Dongdaemun History and Culture Park Station, 38, Toegye-ro 71-gil, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Meals #DramaFilmingPlace #TraditionalFood #PreciousMemories #A cozy atmosphere', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/biLCav/btsqLwyCqo1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIPB-8ukcm5M75H_7CKeTUy5nKdpu9gzM8-Z6TZLXq9t/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lyqolgKTFUJuyPLt5JHKlB4RqLw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FKES2/btsqLSO71oZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABfSXwl0G-nb8ah6fWvKtE6IQArX-XCUcQC2qFpBO8oS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ukysUY6GYRPXLy6tTPmhJk4HG8k%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bGQEF1/btsqJqNciBX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHEEDkBF4chiYj6jRfe7EqV1WFCzNljEzXNd0t_dLxdC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pGo%2FB5htSXEplu5wk%2BxUOSoukfw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7r6L8/btsqJRpKlNS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEoQa__tzOlZLFRNq_NP1j47jJWcJ2y_Hag-7JlEKanp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sgfori%2BwoONgDNZMD1T%2Fn9hbPGU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/biLCav/btsqLwyCqo1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIPB-8ukcm5M75H_7CKeTUy5nKdpu9gzM8-Z6TZLXq9t/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lyqolgKTFUJuyPLt5JHKlB4RqLw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FKES2/btsqLSO71oZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABfSXwl0G-nb8ah6fWvKtE6IQArX-XCUcQC2qFpBO8oS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expi