n characters in the drama Enjoy a cool beer with a variety of menus and have a relaxing time like a scene in a drama'),
	(616, '일타스캔들', '이도', '서울 강남구 논현로75길 7 역삼역2번출구 도보8분', '이도에 위치한 이 카페는 드라마 일타스캔들의 촬영지로 아늑한 분위기와 세련된 인테리어가 매력적입니다 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 커피 한 잔을 즐기기에 완벽한 장소로 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 곳입니다 조용한 분위기 속에서 친구와의 대화나 혼자만의 시간을 가지기에 이상적이며 드라마의 한 장면처럼 사진을 찍어보는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다', '#일타스캔들, #카페, #서울, #드라마촬영지, #이도, #커피', '카페/레스토랑', 'two feet', 'a one-stroke scandal', '8 minutes walk from Exit 2 of Yeoksam Station, 7, Nonhyeon-ro 75-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Ilta Scandal, #Cafe, #Seoul, #DramaShoot, #Ido, #Coffee', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dwPGJF/btr1CK9n66C/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHDs2-_f9DMbjeY6cloVZoiepQ9DrLpmp7Uq3H9rnxfy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pMTfSR7OEk6S0LVXIDPmidlwc2E%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bOoy5N/btr1EdKk0A3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGrBc1iNPCgMGpoCOXBUi7N8hbW1AAwHiC3E-1FSYiGI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pi05VAD7FR9xirOCCWX3xEgsSPc%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dwPGJF/btr1CK9n66C/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHDs2-_f9DMbjeY6cloVZoiepQ9DrLpmp7Uq3H9rnxfy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pMTfSR7OEk6S0LVXIDPmidlwc2E%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bOoy5N/btr1EdKk0A3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGrBc1iNPCgMGpoCOXBUi7N8hbW1AAwHiC3E-1FSYiGI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pi05VAD7FR9xirOCCWX3xEgsSPc%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dwPGJF/btr1CK9n66C/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHDs2-_f9DMbjeY6cloVZoiepQ9DrLpmp7Uq3H9rnxfy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pMTfSR7OEk6S0LVXIDPmidlwc2E%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bOoy5N/btr1EdKk0A3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGrBc1iNPCgMGpoCOXBUi7N8hbW1AAwHiC3E-1FSYiGI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pi05VAD7FR9xirOCCWX3xEgsSPc%3D', NULL, 37.4964124, 127.0382631, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n- **제목**: 일타스캔들\n- **촬영지**: 이도\n- **방문팁**: 드라마 속 주인공들이 앉았던 자리에 앉아보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n이도에 위치한 이 카페는 드라마 "일타스캔들"의 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기와 세련된 인테리어가 매력적입니다. 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 커피 한 잔을 즐기기에 완벽한 장소로, 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 곳입니다. 조용한 분위기 속에서 친구와의 대화나 혼자만의 시간을 가지기에 이상적이며, 드라마의 한 장면처럼 사진을 찍어보는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다.', 'Located in Ido this cafe is the filming location for the drama Ilta Scandal and its cozy atmosphere and sophisticated interior are attractive It is the perfect place to enjoy a cup of coffee while feeling the sensibility of the drama and it is a place to leave special memories for fans It is ideal for talking with friends or having alone time in a quiet atmosphere and taking pictures like a scene in a drama will be a good experience'),
	(617, '일타스캔들', '이타닉가든', '서울 강남구 테헤란로 231 역삼역8번출구 도보8분', '이타닉가든은 세련된 디자인과 현대적인 시설이 돋보이는 장소로 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 선사하는 곳입니다 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 카페에서 제공하는 다양한 음료와 디저트를 즐길 수 있습니다 주변의 아름다운 경관과 조화를 이루는 이 공간은 친구들과의 만남이나 조용한 휴식을 취하기에 적합합니다 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 순간을 만들어보세요', '#카페 #드라마촬영지 #현대적 #편안한휴식 #서울여행', '카페/레스토랑', 'Itanik Garden', 'a one-stroke scandal', '8 minutes walk from Exit 8 of Yeoksam Station, 231, Teheran-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Café #DramaFilmingPlace #Modern #RelaxedRest #Travel to Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cfHHlz/btrZ5kreGDr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALxhuovCNTY8QujQ18MEmy5LYdfcHtaWulkKVq0osD-W/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1RU8Ju%2FFALsnozbWT1wpUz2mGpE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/crYmaX/btrZ2AumvQi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ3-58BlWKAqlZn81Svo0zLHpAvc3KpO_o3kRWZL19sA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9G9XNeKW383FfgoNpvFxmZh%2FTx0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bk8txe/btrZ6JqKCpt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD2neRXGCT8GMoj2RNvatqHiy7h4MqseGLRS6LMIxELm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7lC1vHYlk5nO38yxkeUkOzWgNsg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4iuVb/btrZYSox4Fv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFootSMWMRyk9qk_t8BYeWCh9Y2xUAVMpR90zse8NQVc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BzHcZYphQ5Ae9q1Gd0knbJSzIuU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cfHHlz/btrZ5kreGDr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALxhuovCNTY8QujQ18MEmy5LYdfcHtaWulkKVq0osD-W/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1RU8Ju%2FFALsnozbWT1wpUz2mGpE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/crYmaX/btrZ2AumvQi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ3-58BlWKAqlZn81Svo0zLHpAvc3KpO_o3kRWZL19sA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9G9XNeKW383FfgoNpvFxmZh%2FTx0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bk8txe/btrZ6JqKCpt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD2neRXGCT8GMoj2RNvatqHiy7h4MqseGLRS6LMIxELm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7lC1vHYlk5nO38yxkeUkOzWgNsg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4iuVb/btrZYSox4Fv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFootSMWMRyk9qk_t8BYeWCh9Y2xUAVMpR90zse8NQVc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BzHcZYphQ5Ae9q1Gd0knbJSzIuU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cfHHlz/btrZ5kreGDr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALxhuovCNTY8QujQ18MEmy5LYdfcHtaWulkKVq0osD-W/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1RU8Ju%2FFALsnozbWT1wpUz2mGpE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/crYmaX/btrZ2AumvQi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ3-58BlWKAqlZn81Svo0zLHpAvc3KpO_o3kRWZL19sA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9G9XNeKW383FfgoNpvFxmZh%2FTx0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bk8txe/btrZ6JqKCpt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD2neRXGCT8GMoj2RNvatqHiy7h4MqseGLRS6LMIxELm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7lC1vHYlk5nO38yxkeUkOzWgNsg%3D', 37.5032113, 127.0414917, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 일타스캔들\n- **촬영지**: 이타닉가든\n- **방문팁**: 현대적인 분위기의 카페에서 편안한 시간을 즐겨보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n이타닉가든은 세련된 디자인과 현대적인 시설이 돋보이는 장소로, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 선사하는 곳입니다. 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며, 카페에서 제공하는 다양한 음료와 디저트를 즐길 수 있습니다. 주변의 아름다운 경관과 조화를 이루는 이 공간은 친구들과의 만남이나 조용한 휴식을 취하기에 적합합니다. 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 순간을 만들어보세요.', 'Itanik Garden stands out for its sophisticated design and modern facilities providing special memories for drama fans You can remember the scenes filmed here and enjoy various drinks and desserts provided by the cafe In harmony with the beautiful scenery around you this space is perfect for meeting friends or taking a quiet rest Make a special moment like a scene in a drama'),
	(618, '일타스캔들', 'BONGS', '서울특별시 강남구 선릉로 418 선릉역2번출구 도보4분', 'BONGS는 드라마 일타스캔들의 촬영지로 드라마의 매력을 직접 체험할 수 있는 장소입니다 이곳은 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 편안한 분위기에서 여유로운 산책을 즐기기에 좋습니다 드라마의 팬이라면 주요 장면을 떠올리며 방문하는 재미가 있을 것입니다 촬영지 주변의 독특한 풍경과 문화를 함께 느껴보세요', '#일타스캔들 #드라마촬영지 #BONGS #서울여행 #강남 #KdramaTrip', '거리/골목/광장', 'BONGS', 'a one-stroke scandal', '4 minutes walk from Exit 2 of Seonneung Station, 418 Seonneung-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Ilta Scandal #DramaFilmingPlace #BONGS #SeoulTravel #Gangnam #KdramaTrip', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bv86ol/btrZ2z3fn3D/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIMPTZ1PxTB9vJuitaCf041RtSVvBn7zvddydrR5RweK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WZCex1efiUFTbPsphC%2F42RHvtyA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mgjAn/btrZ5jFPtPt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPIc7axAJtAxH4ANmljKoqOEl3twIs7s_AawvoOPtFyc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OmMpAwW4MCcxJ1%2BMlEvZIsWPask%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bvmAd9/btrZ67yaW4k/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAZ9MXJRM5bgyoPolgfy_fSc8vFtaP2ZXMSkqu-0OtpH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a0Xc1tE%2BKlvyvB5qKF3q5pdXqeY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cKftXo/btrZNKLFBfO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKqOUzbL3xIZXbHhF1WLJlDSQMZHIMaM-qxr5WDrkcG4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lA3O73OJ1Csm2FssLpAXFhmuMI8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bv86ol/btrZ2z3fn3D/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIMPTZ1PxTB9vJuitaCf041RtSVvBn7zvddydrR5RweK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WZCex1efiUFTbPsphC%2F42RHvtyA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mgjAn/btrZ5jFPtPt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPIc7axAJtAxH4ANmljKoqOEl3twIs7s_AawvoOPtFyc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OmMpAwW4MCcxJ1%2BMlEvZIsWPask%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bvmAd9/btrZ67yaW4k/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAZ9MXJRM5bgyoPolgfy_fSc8vFtaP2ZXMSkqu-0OtpH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a0Xc1tE%2BKlvyvB5qKF3q5pdXqeY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cKftXo/btrZNKLFBfO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKqOUzbL3xIZXbHhF1WLJlDSQMZHIMaM-qxr5WDrkcG4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lA3O73OJ1Csm2FssLpAXFhmuMI8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bv86ol/btrZ2z3fn3D/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIMPTZ1PxTB9vJuitaCf041RtSVvBn7zvddydrR5RweK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WZCex1efiUFTbPsphC%2F42RHvtyA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mgjAn/btrZ5jFPtPt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPIc7axAJtAxH4ANmljKoqOEl3twIs7s_AawvoOPtFyc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OmMpAwW4MCcxJ1%2BMlEvZIsWPask%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bvmAd9/btrZ67yaW4k/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAZ9MXJRM5bgyoPolgfy_fSc8vFtaP2ZXMSkqu-0OtpH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a0Xc1tE%2BKlvyvB5qKF3q5pdXqeY%3D', 37.502253, 127.0503185, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 일타스캔들\n- **촬영지:** BONGS\n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 주요 장면을 직접 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #태그\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 거리\n\n### 여행 포인트\nBONGS는 드라마 "일타스캔들"의 촬영지로, 드라마의 매력을 직접 체험할 수 있는 장소입니다. 이곳은 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 편안한 분위기에서 여유로운 산책을 즐기기에 좋습니다. 드라마의 팬이라면 주요 장면을 떠올리며 방문하는 재미가 있을 것입니다. 촬영지 주변의 독특한 풍경과 문화를 함께 느껴보세요.', 'BONGS is the filming location of the drama Ilta Scandal where you can experience the charm of the drama firsthand There are various cafes and shops here so its great to enjoy a leisurely walk in a comfortable atmosphere If you are a fan of a drama it will be fun to visit while thinking of the main scenes Feel the unique scenery and culture around the filming location together'),
	(619, '일타스캔들', 'KB우준타워', '서울 강남구 테헤란로 447 선릉역10번출구 도보10분', 'KB우준타워는 현대적이고 세련된 디자인으로 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 장소로 각인될 것입니다 이곳은 다양한 상점과 카페가 있어 드라마 촬영지 탐방과 함께 여유로운 시간을 즐기기에 적합합니다 주변의 도시 풍경과 함께 사진을 찍으며 드라마의 한 장면처럼 느껴보세요', '#KdramaTrip, #드라마촬영지, #서울여행, #현대건축, #도시풍경', '건물', 'KB Woojun Tower', 'a one-stroke scandal', '10-minute walk from Exit 10 of Seonneung Station, 447, Teheran-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Building', '#Kdrama Trip, #DramaFilmingPlace, #SeoulTravel, #ModernArchitecture, #Urbanscape', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qFAfs/btr0Hu8LLWs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKldyx-FgKqiVhleG3yY1gv2wk4vY20FWI4fkQR5woCC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sZLEJ2J433IZDYBG1PXBH%2BRvS%2F4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uXnmc/btr0NIxVWCw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEI1Eq4in2wMzOGll9fQ65rc3FyOcwzfRFaVg8grvMmH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uYyIGPGmlVyErclNEpAsBr%2BW4tI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cVuPuX/btr0NHFL62X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACnKuEJ_ay3prsWT6B_R2WiHSS23t2l_gjh__p6xy5Xq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zMWLYr6vjuSBLifVE18i%2BTPRMjs%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qFAfs/btr0Hu8LLWs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKldyx-FgKqiVhleG3yY1gv2wk4vY20FWI4fkQR5woCC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sZLEJ2J433IZDYBG1PXBH%2BRvS%2F4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uXnmc/btr0NIxVWCw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEI1Eq4in2wMzOGll9fQ65rc3FyOcwzfRFaVg8grvMmH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uYyIGPGmlVyErclNEpAsBr%2BW4tI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cVuPuX/btr0NHFL62X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACnKuEJ_ay3prsWT6B_R2WiHSS23t2l_gjh__p6xy5Xq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zMWLYr6vjuSBLifVE18i%2BTPRMjs%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qFAfs/btr0Hu8LLWs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKldyx-FgKqiVhleG3yY1gv2wk4vY20FWI4fkQR5woCC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sZLEJ2J433IZDYBG1PXBH%2BRvS%2F4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uXnmc/btr0NIxVWCw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEI1Eq4in2wMzOGll9fQ65rc3FyOcwzfRFaVg8grvMmH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uYyIGPGmlVyErclNEpAsBr%2BW4tI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cVuPuX/btr0NHFL62X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACnKuEJ_ay3prsWT6B_R2WiHSS23t2l_gjh__p6xy5Xq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zMWLYr6vjuSBLifVE18i%2BTPRMjs%3D', 37.5072075, 127.0560352, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 일타스캔들\n- **촬영지**: KB우준타워\n- **방문팁**: 현대적인 도시 풍경 속에서 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\nKB우준타워는 현대적이고 세련된 디자인으로, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 장소로 각인될 것입니다. 이곳은 다양한 상점과 카페가 있어 드라마 촬영지 탐방과 함께 여유로운 시간을 즐기기에 적합합니다. 주변의 도시 풍경과 함께 사진을 찍으며 드라마의 한 장면처럼 느껴보세요.', 'KB Woojun Tower will be imprinted as a special place for drama fans with its modern and sophisticated design It has a variety of shops and cafes making it perfect for enjoying a leisurely time with a tour of drama filming locations Take a picture with the surrounding cityscape and feel like a scene from a drama'),
	(620, '일타스캔들', '크레센도428', '서울 강남구 봉은사로 428 선정릉역3번출구 도보4분', '크레센도428은 드라마 일타스캔들의 촬영지로 독특한 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 공간입니다 이곳에서 드라마의 주요 장면을 떠올리며 친구들과 함께 사진을 찍거나 이야기를 나누기 좋은 장소입니다 다양한 음료와 디저트를 즐기며 편안한 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤입니다 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보세요', '#일타스캔들 #촬영지 #드라마카페 #서울 #강남 #여유로운시간', '기타', 'Crescendo 428', 'a one-stroke scandal', '4 minutes walk from Exit 3 of Seonneung Station, 428 Bongeunsa-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Ilta Scandal #FilmingPlace #DramaCafe #Seoul #Gangnam #RelaxedTime', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eJ9H3v/btr1POrSqrl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK0-WNScpLTZ0QG6Y9qJuA1jAcnmfnwtNs2bMeTMBh7c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JF%2B35rsOGrKdupduvK6UnNSgSwE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cw5tEl/btr1TS1P4GS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAwbvUhtEBxweF0Io2wt-k7tCrjBKqSZGMVupMu25128/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AmPsNgoBSX9kMqv5%2FGt%2FPyuU2fU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/CqQhO/btr1Xy883pq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACm3bFvn9gGEFfLeeABg51SO21D_9y58OdJIv5NBp0ct/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=p3eg0BVL6LgtqmsnsvaSq%2BJhKpM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LWO59/btr1156nN03/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMujSACbI_3DpPkPN6n_WB101OUklhdOfgvlUbmTkw3y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2Ftr2gQ3PXimTYbMWgOcx5XpCbpU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eJ9H3v/btr1POrSqrl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK0-WNScpLTZ0QG6Y9qJuA1jAcnmfnwtNs2bMeTMBh7c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JF%2B35rsOGrKdupduvK6UnNSgSwE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cw5tEl/btr1TS1P4GS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAwbvUhtEBxweF0Io2wt-k7tCrjBKqSZGMVupMu25128/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AmPsNgoBSX9kMqv5%2FGt%2FPyuU2fU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/CqQhO/btr1Xy883pq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACm3bFvn9gGEFfLeeABg51SO21D_9y58OdJIv5NBp0ct/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=p3eg0BVL6LgtqmsnsvaSq%2BJhKpM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LWO59/btr1156nN03/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMujSACbI_3DpPkPN6n_WB101OUklhdOfgvlUbmTkw3y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2Ftr2gQ3PXimTYbMWgOcx5XpCbpU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eJ9H3v/btr1POrSqrl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK0-WNScpLTZ0QG6Y9qJuA1jAcnmfnwtNs2bMeTMBh7c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JF%2B35rsOGrKdupduvK6UnNSgSwE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cw5tEl/btr1TS1P4GS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAwbvUhtEBxweF0Io2wt-k7tCrjBKqSZGMVupMu25128/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AmPsNgoBSX9kMqv5%2FGt%2FPyuU2fU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/CqQhO/btr1Xy883pq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACm3bFvn9gGEFfLeeABg51SO21D_9y58OdJIv5NBp0ct/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=p3eg0BVL6LgtqmsnsvaSq%2BJhKpM%3D', 37.510815, 127.0469058, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 일타스캔들\n- **촬영지:** 크레센도428\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있는 장소입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n크레센도428은 드라마 "일타스캔들"의 촬영지로, 독특한 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 공간입니다. 이곳에서 드라마의 주요 장면을 떠올리며, 친구들과 함께 사진을 찍거나 이야기를 나누기 좋은 장소입니다. 다양한 음료와 디저트를 즐기며, 편안한 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보세요!', 'Crescendo 428 is the filming location of the drama Ilta Scandal which is an attractive space with its unique interior and cozy atmosphere It is a good place to take pictures or talk with friends recalling the main scenes of the drama here Enjoy a variety of drinks and desserts and its perfect for a relaxing time If youre a drama fan please visit'),
	(621, '일타스캔들', '씨티은행', '서울 강남구 테헤란로 508 삼성역4번출구 도보8분', '씨티은행 주변은 현대적인 건물과 아름다운 조경이 어우러진 곳으로 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 의미가 있는 장소입니다 테헤란로의 활기찬 분위기를 느끼며 다양한 카페와 식당에서 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 드라마의 매력을 느끼며 촬영지에서의 특별한 순간을 즐겨보세요', '#드라마촬영지, #씨티은행, #서울여행, #강남구, #일타스캔들', '거리/골목/광장', 'Citibank', 'a one-stroke scandal', '8 minutes walk from Exit 4 of Samsung Station, 508, Teheran-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Drama filming location, #CTBank, #SeoulTravel, #Gangnam-gu, #IltaScandal', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bP7hj6/btrZ4buuRXC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKuJR8ItziQXdIg0GA2EdlsJI_10_V7DfdjE6O-g06N-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BrHWmDI5EYC%2FhoG%2BJ9iDXqOCTGk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bd54s1/btrZ7aICIM7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN1exlaqPMtT2qFHdfi8j3gv8Nf8cyHuDbKgDeCShjeg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6xzOYXO4q2hK4WRM5rPr9i8NZBc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/boxa7y/btrZPTvbPXq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGnZCoUsP7XIW5IaSP9eVm02tLr0U_piiSMuijPHn5z6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pm23A7wHyv4fhi1qGYwNsphip9c%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bP7hj6/btrZ4buuRXC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKuJR8ItziQXdIg0GA2EdlsJI_10_V7DfdjE6O-g06N-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BrHWmDI5EYC%2FhoG%2BJ9iDXqOCTGk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bd54s1/btrZ7aICIM7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN1exlaqPMtT2qFHdfi8j3gv8Nf8cyHuDbKgDeCShjeg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6xzOYXO4q2hK4WRM5rPr9i8NZBc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/boxa7y/btrZPTvbPXq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGnZCoUsP7XIW5IaSP9eVm02tLr0U_piiSMuijPHn5z6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pm23A7wHyv4fhi1qGYwNsphip9c%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bP7hj6/btrZ4buuRXC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKuJR8ItziQXdIg0GA2EdlsJI_10_V7DfdjE6O-g06N-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BrHWmDI5EYC%2FhoG%2BJ9iDXqOCTGk%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bd54s1/btrZ7aICIM7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN1exlaqPMtT2qFHdfi8j3gv8Nf8cyHuDbKgDeCShjeg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6xzOYXO4q2hK4WRM5rPr9i8NZBc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/boxa7y/btrZPTvbPXq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGnZCoUsP7XIW5IaSP9eVm02tLr0U_piiSMuijPHn5z6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pm23A7wHyv4fhi1qGYwNsphip9c%3D', 37.5067097, 127.0580401, '### 일타스캔들 촬영지 정보\n\n**촬영지:** 씨티은행  \n**방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 주요 장면을 감상하며, 드라마 팬들과 함께 인증샷을 남겨보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #서울 #강남구 #테헤란로  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n씨티은행 주변은 현대적인 건물과 아름다운 조경이 어우러진 곳으로, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 의미가 있는 장소입니다. 테헤란로의 활기찬 분위기를 느끼며, 다양한 카페와 식당에서 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 드라마의 매력을 느끼며 촬영지에서의 특별한 순간을 즐겨보세요.', 'The area around Citibank is a combination of modern buildings and beautiful landscaping a special place for drama fans You can feel the lively atmosphere of Teheranro and spend your time leisurely in various cafes and restaurants Feel the charm of the drama and enjoy the special moments on set'),
