키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리/골목  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n삼성로86길은 드라마 "일타스캔들"의 주요 촬영지로, 활기찬 도시 풍경과 함께 다양한 상점들이 즐비해 있어 방문객들에게 매력적인 경험을 제공합니다. 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들은 드라마의 긴박한 순간을 그대로 재현하며, 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있는 장소입니다. 주변 카페와 음식점에서 잠시 쉬어가며 드라마의 분위기를 만끽해 보세요.', 'Samseongro 86gil is the main filming location for the drama Ilta Scandal and it is lined with various shops with vibrant cityscapes providing an attractive experience for visitors The scenes filmed here reproduce the urgent moments of the drama as they are and it is a place where fans can make special memories Take a break from nearby cafes and restaurants and enjoy the atmosphere of the drama'),
	(623, '일타스캔들', 'CU역삼건화점', '서울 강남구 논현로64길 18 한티역7번출구 버스7분', 'CU역삼건화점은 드라마 일타스캔들의 촬영지로 실제로 방문하면 드라마 속 장면들이 생생하게 떠오릅니다 주변에는 다양한 편의시설이 있어 간편하게 음료나 간식을 구매할 수 있으며 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들어 보실 수 있습니다 촬영지 주변의 분위기를 느끼며 사진도 찍고 드라마의 주인공처럼 산책을 즐겨보세요', '#일타스캔들 #촬영지 #드라마투어 #서울여행 #CU역삼건화점 #특별한추억', '기타/판별불가', 'CU Station Samgyeopsal Store', 'a one-stroke scandal', 'Bus 7 Minute Outlet 7 at Hanti Station, 18, Nonhyeon-ro 64-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Ilta Scandal #FilmingPlace #DramaTour #SeoulTravel #CU StationTriple #Special Memories', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cejDr8/btrZPUrSCmG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFli2BVjmegyAuXeEkPJaTx49AzKluCaqK3qGJDo29qw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1po77mPmvgKzdZUBdXp6YvAMNbc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mGYaD/btrZIgjAGbx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACHEsyTxPNSJ64Ji4CZK8zs2hEFQN_QidV3arAAtGOkS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bdwX%2BONfGE60TxsD6yCBzMWLQoE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bxbwjs/btrZIJr1Umk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOGoCPmPlpe8XJUcSm2gbrqtWTXzM_f4YMLxCnynec6h/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lkhJnxwO7Fbhen7XYPiB3UXzFcw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bGp7tA/btrZPT0OlZg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIgnTcp4wc2von8rR_80jK4crQeZfKvO0RicyzWengmx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=y%2FvUN3NClbdeYeyG2aU3RKzhIIE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cejDr8/btrZPUrSCmG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFli2BVjmegyAuXeEkPJaTx49AzKluCaqK3qGJDo29qw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1po77mPmvgKzdZUBdXp6YvAMNbc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mGYaD/btrZIgjAGbx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACHEsyTxPNSJ64Ji4CZK8zs2hEFQN_QidV3arAAtGOkS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bdwX%2BONfGE60TxsD6yCBzMWLQoE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bxbwjs/btrZIJr1Umk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOGoCPmPlpe8XJUcSm2gbrqtWTXzM_f4YMLxCnynec6h/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lkhJnxwO7Fbhen7XYPiB3UXzFcw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bGp7tA/btrZPT0OlZg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIgnTcp4wc2von8rR_80jK4crQeZfKvO0RicyzWengmx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=y%2FvUN3NClbdeYeyG2aU3RKzhIIE%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cejDr8/btrZPUrSCmG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFli2BVjmegyAuXeEkPJaTx49AzKluCaqK3qGJDo29qw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1po77mPmvgKzdZUBdXp6YvAMNbc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mGYaD/btrZIgjAGbx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACHEsyTxPNSJ64Ji4CZK8zs2hEFQN_QidV3arAAtGOkS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bdwX%2BONfGE60TxsD6yCBzMWLQoE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bxbwjs/btrZIJr1Umk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOGoCPmPlpe8XJUcSm2gbrqtWTXzM_f4YMLxCnynec6h/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lkhJnxwO7Fbhen7XYPiB3UXzFcw%3D', 37.493472, 127.0419025, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 일타스캔들\n- **촬영지:** CU역삼건화점\n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 주요 장면을 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\nCU역삼건화점은 드라마 "일타스캔들"의 촬영지로, 실제로 방문하면 드라마 속 장면들이 생생하게 떠오릅니다. 주변에는 다양한 편의시설이 있어 간편하게 음료나 간식을 구매할 수 있으며, 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들어 보실 수 있습니다. 촬영지 주변의 분위기를 느끼며 사진도 찍고, 드라마의 주인공처럼 산책을 즐겨보세요.', 'CU Station Samgeonhwa branch is the filming location of the drama Ilta Scandal and when you actually visit the scenes in the drama come to mind vividly There are various amenities around so you can easily purchase drinks or snacks and if you are a drama fan you can make special memories here Feel the atmosphere around the filming location take pictures and enjoy a walk like the main character of the drama'),
	(624, '일타스캔들', '윤성빌딩', '서울 강남구 도곡로 423 한티역2번출구 도보5분', '윤성빌딩은 드라마 일타스캔들의 촬영지로 현대적인 도시 풍경과 함께 다양한 상점들이 즐비한 거리입니다 이곳은 드라마 속 주인공들이 뛰어다니는 모습이 생생하게 떠오르는 장소로 방문객들은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책할 수 있습니다 주변의 카페와 음식점도 많아 드라마 촬영지 탐방 후 여유롭게 휴식을 취하기 좋은 곳입니다', '#KdramaTrip, #CityBuilding, #서울, #일타스캔들, #촬영지, #체험', '거리/골목/광장', 'Yunseong Building', 'a one-stroke scandal', '5 minutes walk from Exit 2 of Hanti Station, 423, Dogok-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip, #CityBuilding, #Seoul, #IltaScandal, #FilmingPlace, #Experience', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCbhxq/btrZNu1iqe4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFi8OIrMjM6f0VyR1Cw0Iv0-45UnrviJNvIW6VbVtsug/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ViDo4u9dl2i%2BlkE%2FkSpd%2BgvDvLs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oApFh/btrZQdZewZm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK0QZD8AykXi89SSM0cF7cyFqSiFWIAc_REWgBQtzjx_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ct%2B0NTl2HlUk3tth1oP5AA%2FXByg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dq3AfI/btrZJ2EJnvy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKwt7aDyBJlji0Q-Ks5LYAwcTVNj9BKC5qXKdKqj6AHN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ppJBUmfudpLkVX6fo6wRVQxOEuE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCbhxq/btrZNu1iqe4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFi8OIrMjM6f0VyR1Cw0Iv0-45UnrviJNvIW6VbVtsug/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ViDo4u9dl2i%2BlkE%2FkSpd%2BgvDvLs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oApFh/btrZQdZewZm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK0QZD8AykXi89SSM0cF7cyFqSiFWIAc_REWgBQtzjx_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ct%2B0NTl2HlUk3tth1oP5AA%2FXByg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dq3AfI/btrZJ2EJnvy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKwt7aDyBJlji0Q-Ks5LYAwcTVNj9BKC5qXKdKqj6AHN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ppJBUmfudpLkVX6fo6wRVQxOEuE%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCbhxq/btrZNu1iqe4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFi8OIrMjM6f0VyR1Cw0Iv0-45UnrviJNvIW6VbVtsug/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ViDo4u9dl2i%2BlkE%2FkSpd%2BgvDvLs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oApFh/btrZQdZewZm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK0QZD8AykXi89SSM0cF7cyFqSiFWIAc_REWgBQtzjx_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ct%2B0NTl2HlUk3tth1oP5AA%2FXByg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dq3AfI/btrZJ2EJnvy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKwt7aDyBJlji0Q-Ks5LYAwcTVNj9BKC5qXKdKqj6AHN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ppJBUmfudpLkVX6fo6wRVQxOEuE%3D', 37.497826, 127.0567677, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 일타스캔들\n- **촬영지:** 윤성빌딩\n- **방문팁:** 드라마의 주요 장면을 직접 체험해보세요!\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\n윤성빌딩은 드라마 "일타스캔들"의 촬영지로, 현대적인 도시 풍경과 함께 다양한 상점들이 즐비한 거리입니다. 이곳은 드라마 속 주인공들이 뛰어다니는 모습이 생생하게 떠오르는 장소로, 방문객들은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책할 수 있습니다. 주변의 카페와 음식점도 많아, 드라마 촬영지 탐방 후 여유롭게 휴식을 취하기 좋은 곳입니다.', 'The Yunseong Building is the filming location for the drama Ilta Scandal a street full of various shops with a modern urban landscape This is a place where the main characters in the drama are vividly reminded of running around and visitors can take a walk while feeling the sensibility of the drama There are many cafes and restaurants nearby so it is a good place to relax after visiting the drama filming location'),
	(625, '일타스캔들', '두각', '서울 강남구 도곡로77길 3 한티역2번출구 위에서3분', '일타스캔들은 현대적인 도시 풍경 속에서 펼쳐지는 이야기로 두각의 매력적인 촬영지는 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 이곳에서는 드라마 속 장면을 재현하며 친구들과 함께 즐거운 시간을 보낼 수 있는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 방문하기에 좋습니다 특히 드라마의 명장면을 떠올리며 그 분위기를 만끽하는 것은 잊지 못할 추억이 될 것입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #서울여행, #카페탐방, #일타스캔들, #특별한순간, #추억', '기타/판별불가', 'one\'s distinguished position', 'a one-stroke scandal', '3 minutes above Exit 2 of Hanti Station, 77-gil, Dogok-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Drama filming location, #Seoultravel, #CaféTravel, #IltaScandal, #SpecialMoments, #Memories', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LCFLL/btr01UjVeFH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACxzXl35x3HRDIb1BExNZYaNTCmK0FcmQInqyT7itbgN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ansIpKbwpqvm34HKQRXQAX9gmoc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dqgd2t/btr0Obz8vzH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADJBF2JVM7-Ziqu9MQleih5J9Z7mPS4NlXWCPP00QE2w/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZS3ooR%2FXUBvTxIqowoqaJZ42%2BMs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/baYnnD/btr0Hzh0oAC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJVc7TO3iURlOkFqHYVbJrNJv6YDf9KSiIdbIr-1i7uW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KTWs1Dh96TMZOp%2FnhJi26Z%2BFHXE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LCFLL/btr01UjVeFH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACxzXl35x3HRDIb1BExNZYaNTCmK0FcmQInqyT7itbgN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ansIpKbwpqvm34HKQRXQAX9gmoc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dqgd2t/btr0Obz8vzH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADJBF2JVM7-Ziqu9MQleih5J9Z7mPS4NlXWCPP00QE2w/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZS3ooR%2FXUBvTxIqowoqaJZ42%2BMs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/baYnnD/btr0Hzh0oAC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJVc7TO3iURlOkFqHYVbJrNJv6YDf9KSiIdbIr-1i7uW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KTWs1Dh96TMZOp%2FnhJi26Z%2BFHXE%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LCFLL/btr01UjVeFH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACxzXl35x3HRDIb1BExNZYaNTCmK0FcmQInqyT7itbgN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ansIpKbwpqvm34HKQRXQAX9gmoc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dqgd2t/btr0Obz8vzH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADJBF2JVM7-Ziqu9MQleih5J9Z7mPS4NlXWCPP00QE2w/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZS3ooR%2FXUBvTxIqowoqaJZ42%2BMs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/baYnnD/btr0Hzh0oAC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJVc7TO3iURlOkFqHYVbJrNJv6YDf9KSiIdbIr-1i7uW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KTWs1Dh96TMZOp%2FnhJi26Z%2BFHXE%3D', 37.4984471, 127.0584639, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 일타스캔들\n- **촬영지:** 두각\n- **방문팁:** 드라마 촬영지에서의 특별한 순간을 사진으로 남겨보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n일타스캔들은 현대적인 도시 풍경 속에서 펼쳐지는 이야기로, 두각의 매력적인 촬영지는 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 이곳에서는 드라마 속 장면을 재현하며, 친구들과 함께 즐거운 시간을 보낼 수 있는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 방문하기에 좋습니다. 특히, 드라마의 명장면을 떠올리며 그 분위기를 만끽하는 것은 잊지 못할 추억이 될 것입니다.', 'Ilta Scandal is a story that unfolds in a modern urban landscape and the attractive filming location of Myeongdae provides a special experience for drama fans There are various cafes and shops where you can recreate scenes in the drama and have a good time with your friends so its great to visit In particular it will be an unforgettable memory to remember the famous scenes of the drama and enjoy the atmosphere'),
	(626, '일타스캔들', '성창빌딩', '서울 강남구 도곡로 510 한티역2번출구 위에서7분', '성창빌딩은 드라마 일타스캔들의 상징적인 배경으로 드라마 팬들에게는 필수 방문지입니다 이곳은 현대적인 건축물과 함께 주변의 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 촬영지 탐방 후 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 장소입니다 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 특별한 순간을 만들어보세요', '#일타스캔들 #성창빌딩 #KdramaTrip #촬영지 #사진찍기', '건물', 'Seongchang Building', 'a one-stroke scandal', '7 minutes above Exit 2 of Hanti Station, 510 Dogok-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Building', '#Ilta Scandal #Seongchang Building #KdramaTrip #ShootingPlace #TakingPhotos', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/enUQ5n/btrZKxdpreh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMrqm4-XMva0crvOjcpjbaIn6sGDxEV35Bgmd8w-XEVR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ybqr9ATXsZxSd%2BufhhysCAc59ZY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eQT8KA/btrZPUk69oa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPtsw8dR8nihnoCliVbHiCHD8McrcXTyvp6uFS4RuIfc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4f1RGWiA3HbLrIakn872Wjh00rY%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/enUQ5n/btrZKxdpreh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMrqm4-XMva0crvOjcpjbaIn6sGDxEV35Bgmd8w-XEVR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ybqr9ATXsZxSd%2BufhhysCAc59ZY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eQT8KA/btrZPUk69oa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPtsw8dR8nihnoCliVbHiCHD8McrcXTyvp6uFS4RuIfc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4f1RGWiA3HbLrIakn872Wjh00rY%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/enUQ5n/btrZKxdpreh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMrqm4-XMva0crvOjcpjbaIn6sGDxEV35Bgmd8w-XEVR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ybqr9ATXsZxSd%2BufhhysCAc59ZY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eQT8KA/btrZPUk69oa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPtsw8dR8nihnoCliVbHiCHD8McrcXTyvp6uFS4RuIfc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4f1RGWiA3HbLrIakn872Wjh00rY%3D', NULL, 37.4989119, 127.0619546, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 일타스캔들\n- **촬영지:** 성창빌딩\n- **방문팁:** 성창빌딩은 드라마의 주요 촬영지로, 그곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 사진을 찍어보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\n성창빌딩은 드라마 "일타스캔들"의 상징적인 배경으로, 드라마 팬들에게는 필수 방문지입니다. 이곳은 현대적인 건축물과 함께 주변의 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어, 촬영지 탐방 후 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 장소입니다. 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 특별한 순간을 만들어보세요.', 'The Seongchang Building is the iconic background of the drama Ilta Scandal and it is a mustvisit destination for drama fans It is a place where you can spend your time leisurely after visiting the filming site with various cafes and shops around it along with modern architecture Feel the sensibility of the drama and create a special moment'),
	(627, '일타스캔들', '노브랜드버거 대치대원빌딩점', '서울 강남구 남부순환로 2947 대치역2번출구 바로앞', '노브랜드버거 대치대원빌딩점은 드라마 일타스캔들의 주요 촬영지로 현대적인 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적입니다 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 맛있는 버거와 감자튀김을 즐길 수 있습니다 편안한 좌석과 함께 친구나 연인과의 대화에 적합한 공간으로 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 방문 경험이 될 것입니다', '#일타스캔들 #촬영지 #부엌 #버거 #강남 #드라마팬', '카페/레스토랑', 'No Brand Burger Daedaewon Building Branch', 'a one-stroke scandal', 'Right in front of Exit 2 of Daechi Station, 2947 Nambu Circulation-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Ilta Scandal #FilmingPlace #Kitchen #Burger #Gangnam #DramaFan', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/btlhet/btr1pXgJn69/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOF-SCuQHpu8SDVQrwHS-0tSUopiw83cKMD9HNoAu-73/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XVEsztNYL2r37bFID%2FTPvV4Ap%2Fg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCHZjt/btr06VSoyPV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACQszEc7jz5QC8Wm7UvpwX8ZX0r-AkdbNfTgbWiHeC-d/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=stBzsRwc76qxiXPIUA9y3xwGcYo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Kwz2g/btr1vrIwAoZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALEGgdCijdm9vB7O1NV_2iyssw-nz3_KnQZJQJv0sVzM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TEeeJbQxc8dZznXHTk7yTelRcfE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/btlhet/btr1pXgJn69/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOF-SCuQHpu8SDVQrwHS-0tSUopiw83cKMD9HNoAu-73/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XVEsztNYL2r37bFID%2FTPvV4Ap%2Fg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCHZjt/btr06VSoyPV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACQszEc7jz5QC8Wm7UvpwX8ZX0r-AkdbNfTgbWiHeC-d/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=stBzsRwc76qxiXPIUA9y3xwGcYo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Kwz2g/btr1vrIwAoZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALEGgdCijdm9vB7O1NV_2iyssw-nz3_KnQZJQJv0sVzM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TEeeJbQxc8dZznXHTk7yTelRcfE%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/btlhet/btr1pXgJn69/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOF-SCuQHpu8SDVQrwHS-0tSUopiw83cKMD9HNoAu-73/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XVEsztNYL2r37bFID%2FTPvV4Ap%2Fg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCHZjt/btr06VSoyPV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACQszEc7jz5QC8Wm7UvpwX8ZX0r-AkdbNfTgbWiHeC-d/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=stBzsRwc76qxiXPIUA9y3xwGcYo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Kwz2g/btr1vrIwAoZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALEGgdCijdm9vB7O1NV_2iyssw-nz3_KnQZJQJv0sVzM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TEeeJbQxc8dZznXHTk7yTelRcfE%3D', 37.4945248, 127.062584, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 일타스캔들\n- **촬영지**: 노브랜드버거 대치대원빌딩점\n- **방문팁**: 드라마 속 주인공들이 앉았던 자리에서 버거를 즐겨보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\n노브랜드버거 대치대원빌딩점은 드라마 "일타스캔들"의 주요 촬영지로, 현대적인 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적입니다. 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 맛있는 버거와 감자튀김을 즐길 수 있습니다. 편안한 좌석과 함께 친구나 연인과의 대화에 적합한 공간으로, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 방문 경험이 될 것입니다.', 'No Brand Burger Daechi Daewon Building is the main filming location for the drama Ilta Scandal and its modern interior and cozy atmosphere are attractive Here you can enjoy delicious burgers and fries while feeling the sensibility of the drama With comfortable seating and a space suitable for conversation with friends or lovers it will be a special visiting experience for drama fans'),
	(628, '일타스캔들', '슈퍼키친', '서울 강남구 남부순환로 2927 대치역1번출구 도보2분', '슈퍼키친은 드라마 일타스캔들의 주요 촬영지로 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 장소입니다 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 속 장면들을 떠올리며 실제 촬영된 분위기를 체험할 수 있습니다 주변 카페와 맛집도 함께 즐기며 드라마의 여운을 느껴보세요', '#드라마촬영지, #강남, #일타스캔들, #맛집, #슈퍼키친', '기타/판별불가', 'Super Kitchen', 'a one-stroke scandal', '2 minutes walk from Exit 1 of Daechi Station, 2927 Nambu Circulation-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Drama filming location, #Gangnam, #IltaScandal, #Delicious Restaurant, #SuperKitchen', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bqqfwF/btr02z9KmHb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJQlnYw7HCjMdrnYhoLioJxnigyXG6y8URRSGU2xqkNm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UJ7KdTEnWRWSBLF8cEudyLZphV8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bbNtoN/btr1bk5biWt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP_zBkHxgCv_H5t7KcLXlcDrFVTsi49iD2DcEOkVXWs7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=aItSSixWAKV5Znr4wO39%2FuOsIP8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cv6vZB/btr1nxhZiZ1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIDVSDlKVXe6ini-qNb2CgytC0c0cP-BwkQF2pyieFSw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Q1ZyTT9MNVhO5UVaSJqmO41n6QE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c2vkEM/btr0WeLBENA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAON2Amz4acH_aVFUCqmEI_w-gxZ6cfTHj2_XYm1-r-yf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mjFmD0nXqaZeLfsLlhruGlIwWe0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bqqfwF/btr02z9KmHb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJQlnYw7HCjMdrnYhoLioJxnigyXG6y8URRSGU2xqkNm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UJ7KdTEnWRWSBLF8cEudyLZphV8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bbNtoN/btr1bk5biWt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP_zBkHxgCv_H5t7KcLXlcDrFVTsi49iD2DcEOkVXWs7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=aItSSixWAKV5Znr4wO39%2FuO