	(629, '일타스캔들', '연금매점 정류장', '서울 강남구 일원동 703-2 대모산입구역6번출구 도보5분', '연금매점 정류장은 드라마 일타스캔들의 주요 촬영지로 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 이곳에서 드라마의 감동적인 순간들을 떠올리며 다양한 각도에서 사진을 찍어보세요 주변의 분위기를 만끽하며 드라마 속 주인공처럼 멋진 순간을 만들어보는 것도 좋습니다 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보길 추천합니다', '#일타스캔들 #드라마촬영지 #서울여행 #강남 #사진촬영 #감성여행', '기타/판별불가', 'a pension store stop', 'a one-stroke scandal', '703-2 Daemosan Entrance Station Exit 6 of Ilwon-dong, Gangnam-gu, Seoul, 5 minutes on foot', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Ilta Scandal #DramaFilmingPlace #SeoulTravel #Gangnam #PhotoShooting #EmotionalTravel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bDEgkF/btr1Vdrggz2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABgd3wh5B4-4HQHVv1tzJbthXoxAIuoHnPa2zNDvOWBQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wzpfoWYwh9qUCSbmOUu7gpOuHCo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/2ziXw/btr1Uu05hZY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIjaz6N2eHP13zqLGnS8DEHK9IxxIb4N-3YDT46kjODS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1UK6wSWae%2Fv%2BqUBEcUUn1KjDofE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bt61Bn/btr1UufIkE3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKi6H11IO5qVp0AvhL8U--uEW8VDCj-47iKG-AWnfrU4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HwM%2Fae2ul359DeyQN6%2BV%2BZBtFHk%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bDEgkF/btr1Vdrggz2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABgd3wh5B4-4HQHVv1tzJbthXoxAIuoHnPa2zNDvOWBQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wzpfoWYwh9qUCSbmOUu7gpOuHCo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/2ziXw/btr1Uu05hZY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIjaz6N2eHP13zqLGnS8DEHK9IxxIb4N-3YDT46kjODS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1UK6wSWae%2Fv%2BqUBEcUUn1KjDofE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bt61Bn/btr1UufIkE3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKi6H11IO5qVp0AvhL8U--uEW8VDCj-47iKG-AWnfrU4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HwM%2Fae2ul359DeyQN6%2BV%2BZBtFHk%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bDEgkF/btr1Vdrggz2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABgd3wh5B4-4HQHVv1tzJbthXoxAIuoHnPa2zNDvOWBQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wzpfoWYwh9qUCSbmOUu7gpOuHCo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/2ziXw/btr1Uu05hZY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIjaz6N2eHP13zqLGnS8DEHK9IxxIb4N-3YDT46kjODS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1UK6wSWae%2Fv%2BqUBEcUUn1KjDofE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bt61Bn/btr1UufIkE3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKi6H11IO5qVp0AvhL8U--uEW8VDCj-47iKG-AWnfrU4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HwM%2Fae2ul359DeyQN6%2BV%2BZBtFHk%3D', 37.4884996, 127.0744486, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 일타스캔들\n- **촬영지**: 연금매점 정류장\n- **방문팁**: 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 사진을 찍어보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n연금매점 정류장은 드라마 "일타스캔들"의 주요 촬영지로, 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 이곳에서 드라마의 감동적인 순간들을 떠올리며, 다양한 각도에서 사진을 찍어보세요. 주변의 분위기를 만끽하며, 드라마 속 주인공처럼 멋진 순간을 만들어보는 것도 좋습니다. 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보길 추천합니다!', 'The Pension Shop stop is the main filming location for the drama Ilta Scandal providing fans with a special experience Recall the touching moments of the drama here and take pictures from different angles It is also good to enjoy the atmosphere around you and create a wonderful moment like the main character in the drama If youre a drama fan I recommend you to visit'),
	(630, '일타스캔들', '대청초옆', '서울 강남구 양재대로55길 28 대청역6번출구 버스7분', '대청초옆은 푸른 나무들로 둘러싸인 평화로운 공원으로 드라마 일타스캔들의 촬영지로 유명합니다 이곳은 산책로가 잘 조성되어 있어 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤입니다 다양한 식물과 나무들이 어우러져 자연을 만끽할 수 있으며 사진 촬영에도 좋은 장소입니다 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요', '#일타스캔들 #산책 #자연 #공원 #촬영지 #서울', '공원/숲/산', 'Next to Daecheongcho', 'a one-stroke scandal', 'Bus 7 minutes from Exit 6 of Daecheong Station, 28, Yangjae-daero 55-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a park/forest/mountain', '#Ilta Scandal #Walk #Nature #Park #FilmingPlace #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cI8y3O/btr07zBLsPX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPR0tUbY_r7wyUlE4dccK35RhMRYRYDcEK1EgHfaPtsF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZBgMdD3W5JwwrCXjF3mtRsgvBhw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rrB5z/btr01U0vdqr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFF2wqpDAln8rWgauYK76JoOFDTFUYCaWx4ltGRqC6zJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4lpM%2BBXFVVbL4v55iiQ740SEiS4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bAfp76/btr01UTIFUC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOR-YUIK989h2O2uSKKfXuKNRVBIHSRFDRrCfQha1cZu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BtC6j2zrWEr3EdFpWi%2FqRopWLpI%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cI8y3O/btr07zBLsPX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPR0tUbY_r7wyUlE4dccK35RhMRYRYDcEK1EgHfaPtsF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZBgMdD3W5JwwrCXjF3mtRsgvBhw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rrB5z/btr01U0vdqr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFF2wqpDAln8rWgauYK76JoOFDTFUYCaWx4ltGRqC6zJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4lpM%2BBXFVVbL4v55iiQ740SEiS4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bAfp76/btr01UTIFUC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOR-YUIK989h2O2uSKKfXuKNRVBIHSRFDRrCfQha1cZu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BtC6j2zrWEr3EdFpWi%2FqRopWLpI%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cI8y3O/btr07zBLsPX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPR0tUbY_r7wyUlE4dccK35RhMRYRYDcEK1EgHfaPtsF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZBgMdD3W5JwwrCXjF3mtRsgvBhw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rrB5z/btr01U0vdqr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFF2wqpDAln8rWgauYK76JoOFDTFUYCaWx4ltGRqC6zJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4lpM%2BBXFVVbL4v55iiQ740SEiS4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bAfp76/btr01UTIFUC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOR-YUIK989h2O2uSKKfXuKNRVBIHSRFDRrCfQha1cZu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BtC6j2zrWEr3EdFpWi%2FqRopWLpI%3D', 37.4928354, 127.0879259, '### 공원 정보\n\n**제목:** 일타스캔들  \n**촬영지:** 대청초옆  \n**방문팁:** 자연 속에서 편안한 산책을 즐길 수 있는 장소입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Park  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 공원  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n대청초옆은 푸른 나무들로 둘러싸인 평화로운 공원으로, 드라마 "일타스캔들"의 촬영지로 유명합니다. 이곳은 산책로가 잘 조성되어 있어, 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤입니다. 다양한 식물과 나무들이 어우러져 자연을 만끽할 수 있으며, 사진 촬영에도 좋은 장소입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요.', 'Next to Daecheongcho is a peaceful park surrounded by green trees famous as the filming location for the drama Ilta Scandal This place has wellestablished trails making it perfect for relaxing time Various plants and trees harmonize to enjoy nature and it is a great place for photography If you are a drama fan make special memories here'),
	(631, '일타스캔들', '개암빌딩', '서울 강남구 양재대로55길 15 대청역6번출구 위에서3분', '개암빌딩은 드라마 일타스캔들의 주요 촬영지로 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 직접 체험할 수 있습니다 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 드라마의 분위기를 만끽하며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다 특히 드라마 팬이라면 이곳을 방문해 촬영된 장소를 배경으로 사진을 남기는 것도 좋은 추억이 될 것입니다', '#KdramaTrip, #개암빌딩, #촬영지, #드라마팬, #서울여행', '건물', 'Gaeam Building', 'a one-stroke scandal', '3 minutes above exit 6 of Daecheong Station, 15 Yangjae-daero 55-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Building', '#Kdrama Trip, #Gaeam Building, #FilmingPlace, #DramaFan, #SeoulTravel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bzCyX0/btr1fOriNAY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALUPY-YZ975IxA41fjtxT1-NWYgs0DRfpWrKHDd53nG1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8IBFfOuEcGEPoB32PjY0pKIjjtY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/KI4M8/btr06XJnxqa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANemAGcZCJwgBqC8tQk9yHmvFcLJmmIpE-CVbtaKLhw9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=l4%2BumNumTGbb4r4GhyOrE%2BiSOOM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Yk9zL/btr1f1RKJFC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK69-DmkZzVoeN061MfIfo14e-U7NFBfp716Y_BeoTId/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=GHNKmAM4%2FiXQQBblA3jIk4hPKHw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b8b7dW/btr1fPKudMp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMLE6Poc4s8yBN02NPz79UOz1EpT79P-EBWETrtMW7Ct/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4H3VAy51EtTzPiicQFOShfggzSU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bzCyX0/btr1fOriNAY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALUPY-YZ975IxA41fjtxT1-NWYgs0DRfpWrKHDd53nG1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8IBFfOuEcGEPoB32PjY0pKIjjtY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/KI4M8/btr06XJnxqa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANemAGcZCJwgBqC8tQk9yHmvFcLJmmIpE-CVbtaKLhw9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=l4%2BumNumTGbb4r4GhyOrE%2BiSOOM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Yk9zL/btr1f1RKJFC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK69-DmkZzVoeN061MfIfo14e-U7NFBfp716Y_BeoTId/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=GHNKmAM4%2FiXQQBblA3jIk4hPKHw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b8b7dW/btr1fPKudMp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMLE6Poc4s8yBN02NPz79UOz1EpT79P-EBWETrtMW7Ct/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4H3VAy51EtTzPiicQFOShfggzSU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bzCyX0/btr1fOriNAY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALUPY-YZ975IxA41fjtxT1-NWYgs0DRfpWrKHDd53nG1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8IBFfOuEcGEPoB32PjY0pKIjjtY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/KI4M8/btr06XJnxqa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANemAGcZCJwgBqC8tQk9yHmvFcLJmmIpE-CVbtaKLhw9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=l4%2BumNumTGbb4r4GhyOrE%2BiSOOM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Yk9zL/btr1f1RKJFC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK69-DmkZzVoeN061MfIfo14e-U7NFBfp716Y_BeoTId/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=GHNKmAM4%2FiXQQBblA3jIk4hPKHw%3D', 37.4918891, 127.0874845, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 일타스캔들\n- **촬영지**: 개암빌딩\n- **방문팁**: 드라마 속 감성을 느끼며 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\n개암빌딩은 드라마 "일타스캔들"의 주요 촬영지로, 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 직접 체험할 수 있습니다. 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어, 드라마의 분위기를 만끽하며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다. 특히, 드라마 팬이라면 이곳을 방문해 촬영된 장소를 배경으로 사진을 남기는 것도 좋은 추억이 될 것입니다.', 'Gaeam Building is the main filming location for the drama Ilta Scandal where you can experience the scenes filmed here firsthand There are various cafes and shops around so its the best place to spend a leisurely time while enjoying the atmosphere of the drama In particular if you are a drama fan it will be a good memory to visit here and leave a picture with the filming location in the background'),
	(632, '일타스캔들', '올림픽로', '서울 송파구 올림픽로 145 잠실새내역7번출구 바로앞', '올림픽로는 현대적인 건물과 아름다운 거리 풍경이 어우러진 곳으로 드라마 일타스캔들의 촬영지로 유명합니다 이곳에서는 서울의 활기찬 도시 생활을 경험할 수 있으며 주변 카페와 상점에서 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 특히 드라마의 명장면을 떠올리며 산책하기 좋은 장소로 추천합니다', '#드라마촬영지, #올림픽로, #서울여행, #거리풍경, #일타스캔들', '거리/골목/광장', 'to the Olympics', 'a one-stroke scandal', 'Right in front of Exit 7 of Jamsil Saenae Station, 145 Olympic-ro, Songpa-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Drama filming location, #OlympicRoad, #SeoulTravel, #Streetscape, #IltaScandal', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/XqVVk/btrZ6h8TbvJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANEZ-cnZX_FKxXeK2RIsDDOnqHw2vV5Jx1A8rub_4uY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=M3FiWTfsBZzGtLlpF40u%2BOw0928%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/VAdxT/btrZPSQqenl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMznkMjOYCNFFQLQL9YAqOC3hLSqtG8RPHyYpIjhZ6vH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mAyKeHKh41%2BXnYugVlNGVByPeMI%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/XqVVk/btrZ6h8TbvJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANEZ-cnZX_FKxXeK2RIsDDOnqHw2vV5Jx1A8rub_4uY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=M3FiWTfsBZzGtLlpF40u%2BOw0928%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/VAdxT/btrZPSQqenl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMznkMjOYCNFFQLQL9YAqOC3hLSqtG8RPHyYpIjhZ6vH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mAyKeHKh41%2BXnYugVlNGVByPeMI%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/XqVVk/btrZ6h8TbvJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANEZ-cnZX_FKxXeK2RIsDDOnqHw2vV5Jx1A8rub_4uY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=M3FiWTfsBZzGtLlpF40u%2BOw0928%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/VAdxT/btrZPSQqenl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMznkMjOYCNFFQLQL9YAqOC3hLSqtG8RPHyYpIjhZ6vH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mAyKeHKh41%2BXnYugVlNGVByPeMI%3D', NULL, 37.5119932, 127.087026, '### 거리/골목 | 2개 | #StreetScene\n\n**드라마 정보**  \n- **제목**: 일타스캔들  \n- **촬영지**: 올림픽로  \n- **방문팁**: 올림픽로를 따라 걸으며 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.  \n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #StreetScene  \n- **작가**: 미상  \n- **카테고리**: 거리/골목  \n\n### 여행 포인트  \n올림픽로는 현대적인 건물과 아름다운 거리 풍경이 어우러진 곳으로, 드라마 \'일타스캔들\'의 촬영지로 유명합니다. 이곳에서는 서울의 활기찬 도시 생활을 경험할 수 있으며, 주변 카페와 상점에서 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 특히, 드라마의 명장면을 떠올리며 산책하기 좋은 장소로 추천합니다.', 'Olympic Road is a place where modern buildings and beautiful street scenes are combined and it is famous as a filming location for the drama Ilta Scandal Here you can experience the vibrant city life of Seoul and have a leisurely time at nearby cafes and shops In particular I recommend it as a good place to take a walk while thinking of the famous scenes of the drama'),
	(633, '멜로무비', '메가박스 신촌', '서울 서대문구 신촌역로 30', '메가박스 신촌은 현대적인 분위기와 편안한 좌석을 갖춘 영화관으로 다양한 장르의 영화를 상영합니다 이곳에서 친구들과 함께 영화를 관람하며 팝콘과 음료를 즐기면 특별한 하루를 보낼 수 있습니다 또한 신촌의 다양한 카페와 음식점이 가까워 영화 관람 후에도 즐길 거리가 많아 더욱 매력적인 장소입니다', '#멜로무비 #메가박스신촌 #영화관 #데이트 #여행 #신촌', '기타/판별불가', 'Megabox Shinchon', 'Melo Movie', '30, Sinchon Station-ro, Seodaemun-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#MeloMovie #MegaboxSinchon #MovieMovie #Date #Travel #Sinchon', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bDj4Se/btsMjFQnrGA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACb3lTFLIVIVY8-UskZ867kNtxjqewrGifKXmIteqyBh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MrlNWtR1RQp22GNvV2%2BvG%2FN6KZg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c6R6KF/btsMkqZeBXa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI5-h6fViZDsY1UtZmumY3cQndpre2HBFAIKgHJqAVmj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3U7fVokm8o7TYxc%2F%2FrS32cnMDC8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Nxgta/btsMkxD5Gig/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFP4Rm7yfyggYmfskIBZtMaA851E-_pKm1qdgk6nRveZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=V23ch%2F6O%2FTHKlXGW5VSls%2BDAhso%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ryfCv/btsMllXahJq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOBu7C0d-QReInF0Ka8tOh6lykrGXO6Ds1goUNPYop3c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dVQEfj7HqACkqdWz0OBTLNO7Hvk%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bDj4Se/btsMjFQnrGA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACb3lTFLIVIVY8-UskZ867kNtxjqewrGifKXmIteqyBh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MrlNWtR1RQp22GNvV2%2BvG%2FN6KZg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c6R6KF/btsMkqZeBXa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI5-h6fViZDsY1UtZmumY3cQndpre2HBFAIKgHJqAVmj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3U7fVokm8o7TYxc%2F%2FrS32cnMDC8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Nxgta/btsMkxD5Gig/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFP4Rm7yfyggYmfskIBZtMaA851E-_pKm1qdgk6nRveZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=V23ch%2F6O%2FTHKlXGW5VSls%2BDAhso%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ryfCv/btsMllXahJq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOBu7C0d-QReInF0Ka8tOh6lykrGXO6Ds1goUNPYop3c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dVQEfj7HqACkqdWz0OBTLNO7Hvk%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bDj4Se/btsMjFQnrGA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACb3lTFLIVIVY8-UskZ867kNtxjqewrGifKXmIteqyBh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MrlNWtR1RQp22GNvV2%2BvG%2FN6KZg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c6R6KF/btsMkqZeBXa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI5-h6fViZDsY1UtZmumY3cQndpre2HBFAIKgHJqAVmj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3U7fVokm8o7TYxc%2F%2FrS32cnMDC8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Nxgta/btsMkxD5Gig/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFP4Rm7yfyggYmfskIBZtMaA851E-_pKm1qdgk6nRveZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=V23ch%2F6O%2FTHKlXGW5VSls%2BDAhso%3D', 37.5597943, 126.9419176, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 멜로무비\n- **촬영지**: 메가박스 신촌\n- **방문팁**: 다양한 영화와 함께 특별한 시간을 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n메가박스 신촌은 현대적인 분위기와 편안한 좌석을 갖춘 영화관으로, 다양한 장르의 영화를 상영합니다. 이곳에서 친구들과 함께 영화를 관람하며 팝콘과 음료를 즐기면 특별한 하루를 보낼 수 있습니다. 또한, 신촌의 다양한 카페와 음식점이 가까워 영화 관람 후에도 즐길 거리가 많아 더욱 매력적인 장소입니다.', 'Megabox Sinchon is a movie theater with a modern atmosphere and comfortable seating showing various genres of movies You can have a special day here by watching movies with your friends and enjoying popcorn and drinks In addition Sinchons various cafes and restaurants are close so there are many things to enjoy after watching a movie making it a more attractive place'),
	(634, '멜로무비', '사루카메', '서울 마포구 연남로 15 홍대입구역3번출구 도보6분', '사루카메는 드라마 멜로무비의 촬영지로 현대적이면서도 따뜻한 분위기를 자랑합니다 이곳은 드라마 속 주인공들이 나누던 감정적인 순간들을 떠올리게 하며 다양한 메뉴와 아늑한 인테리어로 많은 이들에게 사랑받고 있습니다 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보아야 할 장소로 친구나 연인과 함께 특별한 시간을 보내기에 적합합니다', '#커피 #드라마촬영지 #아늑한분위기 #감성 #연인 #친구', '카페/레스토랑', 'red-collar fish', 'Melo Movie', '6 minutes walk from Exit 3 of Hongik University Station, 15 Yeonnam-ro, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Coffee #DramaShoot #CozyAtmosphere #Sentimental #Lover #Friend', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Kl6mO/btsMmbNYhvo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMoNPGVqnJ7YWk_N4s1Ib-a6XhOM0tJJnpFG9EdDxA3e/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=D8FGBz774iIl%2BLf1rQ%2FjLcmBYZA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bT9YxW/btsMl9vO8Dr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANFUbxbX4gHZcN1vXWpBj1LvVXea14AqonhBM1PWQUjo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=U1%2B4xAr1MCRBKoRkE5VJKv3vSeU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Kl6mO/btsMmbNYhvo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMoNPGVqnJ7YWk_N4s1Ib-a6XhOM0tJJnpFG9EdDxA3e/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=D8FGBz774iIl%2BLf1rQ%2FjLcmBYZA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bT9YxW/btsMl9vO8Dr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANFUbxbX4gHZcN1vXWpBj1LvVXea14AqonhBM1PWQUjo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=U1%2B4xAr1MCRBKoRkE5VJKv3vSeU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Kl6mO/btsMmbNYhvo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMoNPGVqnJ7YWk_N4s1Ib-a6XhOM0tJJnpFG9EdDxA3e/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=D8FGBz774iIl%2BLf1rQ%2FjLcmBYZA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bT9YxW/btsMl9vO8Dr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANFUbxbX4gHZcN1vXWpBj1LvVXea14AqonhBM1PWQUjo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=U1%2B4xAr1MCRBKoRkE5VJKv3vSeU%3D', NULL, 37.5610583, 126.9226564, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 멜로무비  \n**촬영지:** 사루카메  \n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기에서 커피를 즐기며 촬영 장면을 회상할 수 있습니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n사루카메는 드라마 "멜로무비"의 촬영지로, 현대적이면서도 따뜻한 분위기를 자랑합니다. 이곳은 드라마 속 주인공들이 나누던 감정적인 순간들을 떠올리게 하며, 다양한 메뉴와 아늑한 인테리어로 많은 이들에게 사랑받고 있습니다. 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보아야 할 장소로, 친구나 연인과 함께 특별한 시간을 보내기에 적합합니다.', 'Sarukame is the filming location for the drama Melo Movie which boasts a modern yet warm atmosphere This place reminds me of the emotional moments shared by the main characters in the drama and is loved by many for its diverse menu and cozy interior This is a mustvisit place for drama fans and it is perfect for spending a special time with friends or lovers'),
	(635, '멜로무비', '제이에스스토어', '서울 마포구 와우산로29길 48-24 홍대입구역6번출구 도보2분', 'JS STORE는 현대적인 디자인과 다양한 상품으로 가득한 쇼핑 공간입니다 드라마 멜로무비의 촬영지로 알려져 있어 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 방문객들은 독특한 소품과 기념품을 찾으며 즐거운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 쇼핑 후에는 인근 카페에서 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것도 좋습니다', '#쇼핑 #드라마촬영지 #멜로무비 #서울 #JSSTORE #기념품', '쇼핑몰', 'JS Store', 'Melo Movie', '48-24 Wausan-ro 29-gil, Mapo-gu, Seoul, 2 minutes walk from Exit 6 of Hongdae Entrance Station', 'Shopping mall', '#Shopping #DramaFilmingPlace #MeloMovie #Seoul #JSSSTORE #Souvenirs', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rRgN7/btsMjG2AEgl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACzfjCsRM2ko98XKLkYHZYtil4yXX5X1c9jEEBRUiBP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YVC0kZxbgp9vJH1ZksbXc8VwkeE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cgnquT/btsMkLaEV3l/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABEHusEP5x1K9fhTyrGUuy4eOoiwtkMxwFC6Iu6w_ssJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kQ58PafuBMm8OeJ9W%2FzctcmaDFU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bSaezf/btsMkaPChU1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALj_hZUEUGCWQEZvnADyktBgAsX5bYG2TiET7pU4DkS7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CWvfMfepPGS7B2ikI2Rqy0RWwA4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rRgN7/btsMjG2AEgl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACzfjCsRM2ko98XKLkYHZYtil4yXX5X1c9jEEBRUiBP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YVC0kZxbgp9vJH1ZksbXc8VwkeE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cgnquT/btsMkLaEV3l/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABEHusEP5x1K9fhTyrGUuy4eOoiwtkMxwFC6Iu6w_ssJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kQ58PafuBMm8OeJ9W%2FzctcmaDFU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bSaezf/btsMkaPChU1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALj_hZUEUGCWQEZvnADyktBgAsX5bYG2TiET7pU4DkS7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CWvfMfepPGS7B2ikI2Rqy0RWwA4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rRgN7/btsMjG2AEgl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACzfjCsRM2ko98XKLkYHZYtil4yXX5X1c9jEEBRUiBP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YVC0kZxbgp9vJH1ZksbXc8VwkeE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cgnquT/btsMkLaEV3l/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABEHusEP5x1K9fhTyrGUuy4eOoiwtkMxwFC6Iu6w_ssJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kQ58PafuBMm8OeJ9W%2FzctcmaDFU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bSaezf/btsMkaPChU1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALj_hZUEUGCWQEZvnADyktBgAsX5bYG2TiET7pU4DkS7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CWvfMfepPGS7B2ikI2Rqy0RWwA4%3D', 37.5563094, 126.928093, '### 쇼핑몰 정보\n\n**쇼핑몰:** JS STORE  \n**주소:** 서울 마포구 와우산로29길 48-24  \n**드라마:** 멜로무비  \n**촬영지:** 제이에스스토어  \n**방문팁:** 다양한 상품을 구경하며 편안한 쇼핑을 즐겨보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Mall  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 쇼핑몰  \n\n### 여행 포인트\nJS STORE는 현대적인 디자인과 다양한 상품으로 가득한 쇼핑 공간입니다. 드라마 "멜로무비"의 촬영지로 알려져 있어, 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 방문객들은 독특한 소품과 기념품을 찾으며 즐거운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 쇼핑 후에는 인근 카페에서 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것도 좋습니다.', 'JS STORE is a shopping space full of modern designs and a variety of products Known as the filming location for the drama Melo Movie it offers fans a special experience Visitors can have a great time looking for unique props and souvenirs After shopping its also good to spend some free time at a nearby cafe'),
	(636, '멜로무비', '굿즈마인', '서울 중구 퇴계로20길 67 명동역２번출구 도보８분', '굿즈마인은 아기자기한 카페와 상점들이 모여 있어 드라마의 한 장면처럼 느껴지는 특별한 공간입니다 이곳에서는 다양한 먹거리와 쇼핑을 즐길 수 있으며 드라마 팬이라면 촬영지에서 사진을 남기기에도 안성맞춤입니다 특히 여유로운 분위기 속에서 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 보낼 수 있어 방문할 가치가 충분합니다', '#KdramaTrip, #굿즈마인, #촬영지, #카페, #산책, #드라마감성', '거리/골목/광장', 'Goods Main', 'Melo Movie', '8 minutes walk from Exit 2 of Myeong-dong Station, 67, Toegye-ro 20-gil, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip, #GoodsMine, #FilmingPlace, #Café, #Walk, #DramaSensitivity', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/3uyd0/btsMjRvIK8E/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMeU_Revm41ov16Cei5XdzmgD5RXIYurIYlTtZvYkp8w/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mbTSiEChoM5H0aGMmZl4ofklFwg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dw85O4/btsMi4vMGdp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHls9ZVILUQUghLtEhc2ilMmOYTB9hHz-o3SksT-Bl15/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=s87YaSfi%2BfsQR3db71TMOAbExR8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dDQWzM/btsMjI0a8Cu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG1DEE2v_Zm5isamb18Fz-gLWIv0ivaUPt1Y5-CkVAaW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cTxE8MOSkfkzFpxHNZJZm34PO4I%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xg4Fl/btsMiHgypV5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI8osgC4viaGWoHR-d-MRN3eZtYRhr8IJyV068Hyz0PL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=w5qDO2DEs3qqvdzchrDwa9iKR9E%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/3uyd0/btsMjRvIK8E/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMeU_Revm41ov16Cei5XdzmgD5RXIYurIYlTtZvYkp8w/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mbTSiEChoM5H0aGMmZl4ofklFwg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dw85O4/btsMi4vMGdp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHls9ZVILUQUghLtEhc2ilMmOYTB9hHz-o3SksT-Bl15/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=s87YaSfi%2BfsQR3db71TMOAbExR8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dDQWzM/btsMjI0a8Cu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG1DEE2v_Zm5isamb18Fz-gLWIv0ivaUPt1Y5-CkVAaW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cTxE8MOSkfkzFpxHNZJZm34PO4I%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xg4Fl/btsMiHgypV5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI8osgC4viaGWoHR-d-MRN3eZtYRhr8IJyV068Hyz0PL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=w5qDO2DEs3qqvdzchrDwa9iKR9E%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/3uyd0/btsMjRvIK8E/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMeU_Revm41ov16Cei5XdzmgD5RXIYurIYlTtZvYkp8w/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mbTSiEChoM5H0aGMmZl4ofklFwg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dw85O4/btsMi4vMGdp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHls9ZVILUQUghLtEhc2ilMmOYTB9hHz-o3SksT-Bl15/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=s87YaSfi%2BfsQR3db71TMOAbExR8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dDQWzM/btsMjI0a8Cu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG1DEE2v_Zm5isamb18Fz-gLWIv0ivaUPt1Y5-CkVAaW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cTxE8MOSkfkzFpxHNZJZm34PO4I%3D', 37.5579984, 126.9867557, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 멜로무비\n- **촬영지**: 굿즈마인\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #굿즈마인\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 거리\n\n### 여행 포인트\n굿즈마인은 아기자기한 카페와 상점들이 모여 있어 드라마의 한 장면처럼 느껴지는 특별한 공간입니다. 이곳에서는 다양한 먹거리와 쇼핑을 즐길 수 있으며, 드라마 팬이라면 촬영지에서 사진을 남기기에도 안성맞춤입니다. 특히, 여유로운 분위기 속에서 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 보낼 수 있어 방문할 가치가 충분합니다.', 'Goods Main is a special space that feels like a scene in a drama with cute cafes and shops You can enjoy a variety of food and shopping here and if youre a drama fan its perfect for taking pictures at the filming location In particular it is worth visiting because you can spend precious time with your friends in a relaxed atmosphere'),
	(637, '멜로무비', '대명빌딩앞', '서울 종로구 삼일대로 391 종각역12번출구 도보3분', '대명빌딩앞은 서울의 활기찬 도시 풍경을 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다 이곳은 다양한 상점과 음식점이 즐비해 있어 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라 관광객들에게도 인기가 많습니다 특히 밤에는 네온사인이 반짝이며 독특한 분위기를 연출합니다 드라마 촬영지로서의 매력과 함께 주변의 다양한 먹거리와 볼거리를 즐길 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다', '#촬영지 #도시풍경 #네온사인 #사진찍기 #식도락 #드라마팬', '거리/골목/광장', 'In front of Daemyung Building', 'Melo Movie', '3-minute walk from Exit 12 of Jonggak Station 391, Samil-daero, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Shooting location #Urbanscape #NeonSign #TakingPhotos #Edition #DramaFan', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cpUdOG/btsMjNND0Nc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGJBcqMDkfI6hCm6HJE2vMiWXDKtqR7ocvxMatg1GXN-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6c%2FjAp6u97IbJhAKooqg%2FZ17PlA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b2xlTB/btsMkWJx7Ba/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABBJg-hIOGeWCmwic1PPVgw0frPdCTvuLyso0ysBvxJn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pu53qKqYsUS5Fg7RFoNW42HMZ20%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/o0y0E/btsMi0Ha8vk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKY6Qm7Ws2Xtq27tEDJoRyEuEouX6ITvDyJQm5M99vEz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ob2Hya8AA1e9JwBKKFwn%2FitcG84%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dgUaKv/btsMiJSWGHM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGqgcGU_WZIfJchgLEMcxiHY-li3qclr6qaY9XsXBjE1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=C5DShutwcK6EwpeiEX0YdVF7KDg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cpUdOG/btsMjNND0Nc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGJBcqMDkfI6hCm6HJE2vMiWXDKtqR7ocvxMatg1GXN-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6c%2FjAp6u97IbJhAKooqg%2FZ17PlA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b2xlTB/btsMkWJx7Ba/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABBJg-hIOGeWCmwic1PPVgw0frPdCTvuLyso0ysBvxJn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pu53qKqYsUS5Fg7RFoNW42HMZ20%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/o0y0E/btsMi0Ha8vk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKY6Qm7Ws2Xtq27tEDJoRyEuEouX6ITvDyJQm5M99vEz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ob2Hya8AA1e9JwBKKFwn%2FitcG84%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dgUaKv/btsMiJSWGHM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGqgcGU_WZIfJchgLEMcxiHY-li3qclr6qaY9XsXBjE1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=C5DShutwcK6EwpeiEX0YdVF7KDg%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cpUdOG/btsMjNND0Nc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGJBcqMDkfI6hCm6HJE2vMiWXDKtqR7ocvxMatg1GXN-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6c%2FjAp6u97IbJhAKooqg%2FZ17PlA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b2xlTB/btsMkWJx7Ba/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABBJg-hIOGeWCmwic1PPVgw0frPdCTvuLyso0ysBvxJn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pu53qKqYsUS5Fg7RFoNW42HMZ20%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/o0y0E/btsMi0Ha8vk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKY6Qm7Ws2Xtq27tEDJoRyEuEouX6ITvDyJQm5M99vEz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ob2Hya8AA1e9JwBKKFwn%2FitcG84%3D', 37.5695112, 126.9873915, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 멜로무비\n- **촬영지:** 대명빌딩앞\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면이 촬영된 장소로, 분위기를 만끽하며 사진을 찍기 좋은 곳입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\n대명빌딩앞은 서울의 활기찬 도시 풍경을 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다. 이곳은 다양한 상점과 음식점이 즐비해 있어, 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라 관광객들에게도 인기가 많습니다. 특히 밤에는 네온사인이 반짝이며, 독특한 분위기를 연출합니다. 드라마 촬영지로서의 매력과 함께, 주변의 다양한 먹거리와 볼거리를 즐길 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다.', 'The front of Daemyung Building is a place where you can feel the vibrant cityscape of Seoul It is popular not only with drama fans but also with tourists as it is full of various shops and restaurants Especially at night neon signs sparkle and create a unique atmosphere In addition to its charm as a filming location for dramas it is the best place to enjoy various foods and attractions around it'),
	(638, '멜로무비', '청계천로', '서울 종로구 관철동 37-9 종각역12번출구 위에서3분', '청계천로는 서울의 활기찬 거리 풍경을 감상할 수 있는 완벽한 장소입니다 화려한 네온사인과 다양한 상점들이 어우러져 있어 드라마 속 장면을 실제로 체험하며 산책하기에 좋습니다 특히 저녁 시간에는 더욱 아름다운 야경을 즐길 수 있어 사진 찍기에도 최적의 환경을 제공합니다 이곳에서 멜로무비의 감성을 느끼며 특별한 순간을 만들어보세요', '#KdramaTrip #StreetScene #멜로무비 #서울 #산책 #야경', '거리/골목/광장', 'Cheonggyecheonro-ro', 'Melo Movie', '3 minutes above exit 12 of Jonggak Station, 37-9 Pengul-dong, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #StreetScene #MeloMovie #Seoul #Walk #Nightscape', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c6DvPv/btsMkuGMR3q/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABYSoCln-DYmWS66QjLSCTEgvIPaC4Rs64XQekee1l5X/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5WtKcqUL0MyB0xQ5e54YPElmtcY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sUlkH/btsMkYN98p0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJGqkN_zJNwxSpOqMXg3YTzDxL4mNioqc5oUJK2LDhmk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QJr4NoMNEwsTHlCPQGtpSBwOIE8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c6DvPv/btsMkuGMR3q/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABYSoCln-DYmWS66QjLSCTEgvIPaC4Rs64XQekee1l5X/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5WtKcqUL0MyB0xQ5e54YPElmtcY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sUlkH/btsMkYN98p0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJGqkN_zJNwxSpOqMXg3YTzDxL4mNioqc5oUJK2LDhmk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QJr4NoMNEwsTHlCPQGtpSBwOIE8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c6DvPv/btsMkuGMR3q/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABYSoCln-DYmWS66QjLSCTEgvIPaC4Rs64XQekee1l5X/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5WtKcqUL0MyB0xQ5e54YPElmtcY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sUlkH/btsMkYN98p0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJGqkN_zJNwxSpOqMXg3YTzDxL4mNioqc5oUJK2LDhmk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QJr4NoMNEwsTHlCPQGtpSBwOIE8%3D', NULL, 37.5682211, 126.9877711, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 멜로무비\n- **촬영지:** 청계천로\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 거리/골목\n\n### 여행 포인트\n청계천로는 서울의 활기찬 거리 풍경을 감상할 수 있는 완벽한 장소입니다. 화려한 네온사인과 다양한 상점들이 어우러져 있어, 드라마 속 장면을 실제로 체험하며 산책하기에 좋습니다. 특히 저녁 시간에는 더욱 아름다운 야경을 즐길 수 있어, 사진 찍기에도 최적의 환경을 제공합니다. 이곳에서 멜로무비의 감성을 느끼며 특별한 순간을 만들어보세요.', 'Cheonggyecheonro is the perfect place to enjoy the vibrant street scenery of Seoul The colorful neon sign and various stores are harmonized making it great for a walk while actually experiencing the scenes in the drama Especially in the evening you can enjoy a more beautiful night view providing an optimal environment for taking pictures Feel the sensibility of MeloMovie here and create a special moment'),
	(639, '멜로무비', '씨네큐브광화문', '서울 종로구 새문안로 68 광화문역6번출구 도보7분', '씨네큐브광화문은 현대적인 영화관으로 최신 영화는 물론 다양한 특별 상영회를 제공합니다 이곳에서 멜로무비와 같은 드라마가 촬영되어 팬들에게는 특별한 의미가 있는 장소입니다 주변에는 다양한 카페와 레스토랑이 있어 영화 관람 후 여유로운 시간을 보내기에도 적합합니다 영화와 함께하는 특별한 경험을 원하신다면 이곳을 방문해보세요', '#씨네큐브광화문, #멜로무비, #영화관, #특별상영, #드라마촬영지, #영화애호가', '기타/판별불가', 'CineCube Gwanghwamun Gate', 'Melo Movie', '7-minute walk from Exit 6 of Gwanghwamun Station, 68 Saemunan-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#CineCube Gwanghwamun, #MeloMovie, #MovieMovie, #Special Screening, #DramaFilmingPlace, #MovieFavorite', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qS5CE/btsMkWiBhtS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANVap-vTl3Ei_COCZgzKSA_AByYXyLZmJyuOzhugw6vj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ekKKdg6kz7o74DaOoRFmz7C9r58%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bmn9Si/btsMkuz8qv6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJefFCfKCrDCkyDzvenTKtUCdcGRWecrP4jU0h9Cy0pO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2moU1vJBnJrweEZ1Fl%2FcDT0rb08%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cvcdwi/btsMlhGONs8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN5ucEldL7cJq_TpblAIxFpQ2DngZQMysghfYlGkV4_7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=q7ESyWj5%2BfShR0dvV64mzUBuMQA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ZyAwx/btsMjEqfOE6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK9a5dHLzMdQ_X-OLC_akhCrpdShb1Xe00s_0fzpIL3g/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fRr9dq7Q9CUU03PG2snQCBoTnbo%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qS5CE/btsMkWiBhtS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANVap-vTl3Ei_COCZgzKSA_AByYXyLZmJyuOzhugw6vj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ekKKdg6kz7o74DaOoRFmz7C9r58%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bmn9Si/btsMkuz8qv6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJefFCfKCrDCkyDzvenTKtUCdcGRWecrP4jU0h9Cy0pO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2moU1vJBnJrweEZ1Fl%2FcDT0rb08%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cvcdwi/btsMlhGONs8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN5ucEldL7cJq_TpblAIxFpQ2DngZQMysghfYlGkV4_7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=q7ESyWj5%2BfShR0dvV64mzUBuMQA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ZyAwx/btsMjEqfOE6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK9a5dHLzMdQ_X-OLC_akhCrpdShb1Xe00s_0fzpIL3g/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fRr9dq7Q9CUU03PG2snQCBoTnbo%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qS5CE/btsMkWiBhtS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANVap-vTl3Ei_COCZgzKSA_AByYXyLZmJyuOzhugw6vj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ekKKdg6kz7o74DaOoRFmz7C9r58%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bmn9Si/btsMkuz8qv6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJefFCfKCrDCkyDzvenTKtUCdcGRWecrP4jU0h9Cy0pO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2moU1vJBnJrweEZ1Fl%2FcDT0rb08%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cvcdwi/btsMlhGONs8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN5ucEldL7cJq_TpblAIxFpQ2DngZQMysghfYlGkV4_7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=q7ESyWj5%2BfShR0dvV64mzUBuMQA%3D', 37.5697279, 126.9722881, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 멜로무비\n- **촬영지**: 씨네큐브광화문\n- **방문팁**: 다양한 영화 상영과 특별 이벤트가 자주 열리는 곳으로, 영화 애호가라면 꼭 방문해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n씨네큐브광화문은 현대적인 영화관으로, 최신 영화는 물론 다양한 특별 상영회를 제공합니다. 이곳에서 멜로무비와 같은 드라마가 촬영되어, 팬들에게는 특별한 의미가 있는 장소입니다. 주변에는 다양한 카페와 레스토랑이 있어, 영화 관람 후 여유로운 시간을 보내기에도 적합합니다. 영화와 함께하는 특별한 경험을 원하신다면 이곳을 방문해보세요.', 'CineCube Gwanghwamun is a modern cinema offering a variety of special screenings as well as the latest films Dramas like MeloMovie are filmed here which means a lot to fans There are various cafes and restaurants around so it is also suitable for relaxing time after watching movies If you want a special experience with the movie visit here'),
	(640, '멜로무비', '경희대학교 서울캠퍼스', '서울 동대문구 경희대로 26 회기역1번출구 버스11분', '경희대학교 서울캠퍼스는 아름다운 건축물과 넓은 녹지로 유명한 곳입니다 드라마 멜로무비의 촬영지로 학생들의 활기찬 모습과 함께 학문과 예술이 어우러진 캠퍼스를 경험할 수 있습니다 특히 봄철에는 화사한 꽃들이 만개해 사진 찍기 좋은 장소로 손꼽힙니다 다양한 포토존이 마련되어 있어 친구들과 함께 방문하면 더욱 즐거운 추억을 만들 수 있습니다', '#캠퍼스, #드라마촬영지, #경희대학교, #멜로무비, #사진찍기좋은곳', '학교/대학', 'Kyung Hee University Seoul Campus', 'Melo Movie', 'Bus 11 minutes from Exit 1 of Hoegi Station, 26, Gyeonghui-daero, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul', 'a school/college', '#Campus, #drama shooting location, #Kyunghee University, #MeloMovie, #Good place to take pictures', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bJsnP3/btsMk0rCZH9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADTIvUsR4t554_M5jQQw0QDo3Zs7gznDKoIy79-Zlwpy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pcMYG2uLlK6Bfgqf%2BaOferwKEt8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/btwV5N/btsMjLWKNuA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJjJr9dwJ58JWixXtvQFKaVMR0fKJO5-BptPS-3Qj2YA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jMbEXog3B%2B2owxIv8N7Sel4lfDE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UGKvK/btsMjKp6QpS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG5_bZhboF7WI-KHo1Iqi65mwCAP3bYS5wwjZ-9scxK5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=37yikponuejllZcePWj%2BYqGfOlw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/biHSSq/btsMiJSWCBy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFJiNJfQy7GBigT8SJsl0KP1HLiGW41JMVoJrCBUrzWL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=74iY6AAaAuPROMqA78VlBQpNWzI%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bJsnP3/btsMk0rCZH9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADTIvUsR4t554_M5jQQw0QDo3Zs7gznDKoIy79-Zlwpy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pcMYG2uLlK6Bfgqf%2BaOferwKEt8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/btwV5N/btsMjLWKNuA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJjJr9dwJ58JWixXtvQFKaVMR0fKJO5-BptPS-3Qj2YA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jMbEXog3B%2B2owxIv8N7Sel4lfDE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UGKvK/btsMjKp6QpS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG5_bZhboF7WI-KHo1Iqi65mwCAP3bYS5wwjZ-9scxK5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=37yikponuejllZcePWj%2BYqGfOlw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/biHSSq/btsMiJSWCBy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFJiNJfQy7GBigT8SJsl0KP1HLiGW41JMVoJrCBUrzWL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=74iY6AAaAuPROMqA78VlBQpNWzI%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bJsnP3/btsMk0rCZH9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADTIvUsR4t554_M5jQQw0QDo3Zs7gznDKoIy79-Zlwpy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pcMYG2uLlK6Bfgqf%2BaOferwKEt8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/btwV5N/btsMjLWKNuA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJjJr9dwJ58JWixXtvQFKaVMR0fKJO5-BptPS-3Qj2YA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jMbEXog3B%2B2owxIv8N7Sel4lfDE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UGKvK/btsMjKp6QpS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG5_bZhboF7WI-KHo1Iqi65mwCAP3bYS5wwjZ-9scxK5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=37yikponuejllZcePWj%2BYqGfOlw%3D', 37.5967122, 127.0513948, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 멜로무비  \n- **촬영지:** 경희대학교 서울캠퍼스  \n- **방문팁:** 캠퍼스 곳곳에서 다양한 사진을 찍어보세요!  \n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Campus  \n- **작가:** 미상  \n- **카테고리:** 학교  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n경희대학교 서울캠퍼스는 아름다운 건축물과 넓은 녹지로 유명한 곳입니다. 드라마 "멜로무비"의 촬영지로, 학생들의 활기찬 모습과 함께 학문과 예술이 어우러진 캠퍼스를 경험할 수 있습니다. 특히 봄철에는 화사한 꽃들이 만개해 사진 찍기 좋은 장소로 손꼽힙니다. 다양한 포토존이 마련되어 있어 친구들과 함께 방문하면 더욱 즐거운 추억을 만들 수 있습니다.', 'Kyung Hee University Seoul Campus is famous for its beautiful architecture and large green spaces As a filming location for the drama Melo Movie you can experience a campus that combines academics and art with the lively appearance of students Especially in spring bright flowers are in full bloom making it one of the best places to take pictures There are various photo zones so you can make more enjoyable memories if you visit with your friends'),
	(641, '멜로무비', '서울시립대학교', '서울 동대문구 서울시립대로 163', '서울시립대학교는 아름다운 캠퍼스를 자랑하며 다양한 건물과 자연이 조화를 이루고 있습니다 특히 학생들이 자주 모이는 공간에서 편안한 분위기를 느낄 수 있습니다 자전거를 타고 다니는 학생들 벤치에 앉아 대화하는 커플들을 보며 드라마 속 한 장면처럼 여유로운 시간을 즐길 수 있습니다 이곳은 K드라마 팬들에게는 꼭 방문해야 할 장소입니다', '#KdramaTrip #Campus #서울시립대학교 #멜로무비 #산책 #자연', '학교/대학', 'University of Seoul', 'Melo Movie', '163 University of Seoul, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul', 'a school/college', '#KdramaTrip #Campus #University of Seoul #MeloMovie #Walk #Nature', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bFxQzy/btsMj6fAmEP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHVyPYLeCcWqHr_poXwACpMc_GpepudEUVYzAaU_RZw3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jStY8bS67%2BGRRHe2UWtkVi%2FVPZ4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c2E1VD/btsMlkRxEhJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP7FWelt3xfn2Xp7r_cNhAyqsomSm14jyzuf-a7dgiXM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xkQyQS71efYyNaRJwrZH1LE4YZU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lRR9J/btsMlnOd7kn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPh8UCrAhm9UNbjTg7paZDVOxy-97YSW6icmPkYI91Aq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bSXfpCXuOBWUxVeDLg38R2Yy8lA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bm0mV2/btsMlOq6NUk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABPMmzKTHvPuKi7uK_mTtisRvjr2SwVxqbCYxdSA3opi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X5rU97ZTjWH67cD281NeIOBTZBo%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bFxQzy/btsMj6fAmEP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHVyPYLeCcWqHr_poXwACpMc_GpepudEUVYzAaU_RZw3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jStY8bS67%2BGRRHe2UWtkVi%2FVPZ4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c2E1VD/btsMlkRxEhJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP7FWelt3xfn2Xp7r_cNhAyqsomSm14jyzuf-a7dgiXM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xkQyQS71efYyNaRJwrZH1LE4YZU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lRR9J/btsMlnOd7kn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPh8UCrAhm9UNbjTg7paZDVOxy-97YSW6icmPkYI91Aq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bSXfpCXuOBWUxVeDLg38R2Yy8lA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bm0mV2/btsMlOq6NUk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABPMmzKTHvPuKi7uK_mTtisRvjr2SwVxqbCYxdSA3opi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X5rU97ZTjWH67cD281NeIOBTZBo%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bFxQzy/btsMj6fAmEP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHVyPYLeCcWqHr_poXwACpMc_GpepudEUVYzAaU_RZw3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jStY8bS67%2BGRRHe2UWtkVi%2FVPZ4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c2E1VD/btsMlkRxEhJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP7FWelt3xfn2Xp7r_cNhAyqsomSm14jyzuf-a7dgiXM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xkQyQS71efYyNaRJwrZH1LE4YZU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lRR9J/btsMlnOd7kn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPh8UCrAhm9UNbjTg7paZDVOxy-97YSW6icmPkYI91Aq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bSXfpCXuOBWUxVeDLg38R2Yy8lA%3D', 37.5834233, 127.0600271, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 멜로무비\n- **촬영지**: 서울시립대학교\n- **방문팁**: 캠퍼스의 아름다운 풍경을 감상하며 산책해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Campus\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 학교\n\n### 여행 포인트\n서울시립대학교는 아름다운 캠퍼스를 자랑하며, 다양한 건물과 자연이 조화를 이루고 있습니다. 특히, 학생들이 자주 모이는 공간에서 편안한 분위기를 느낄 수 있습니다. 자전거를 타고 다니는 학생들, 벤치에 앉아 대화하는 커플들을 보며, 드라마 속 한 장면처럼 여유로운 시간을 즐길 수 있습니다. 이곳은 K-드라마 팬들에게는 꼭 방문해야 할 장소입니다.', 'University of Seoul boasts a beautiful campus with various buildings and nature in harmony In particular you can feel a comfortable atmosphere in a space where students often gather Students riding bicycles watching couples sitting on benches talking and enjoying a leisurely time like a scene in a drama This is a mustvisit place for Kdrama fans'),
	(642, '멜로무비', '마포껍데기', '서울 동대문구 사가정로 221', '마포껍데기는 드라마 멜로무비의 촬영지로 이곳에서 다양한 한국 요리를 즐길 수 있습니다 아늑한 분위기와 함께 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소입니다 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 맛있는 음식을 즐기는 특별한 경험을 해보세요', '#멜로, #친구, #한국요리, #아늑한분위기, #촬영지', '카페/레스토랑', 'Mapo shell', 'Melo Movie', '221, Sagasang-ro, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Melo, #Friend, #KoreanCooking, #A cozy atmosphere, #FilmingStreet', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1Lvxy/btsMkuUlzzS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH9_aI2db5IKcImqoqOVRnbh-_PKgxWlnnWtInNCBcGl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qXId%2FsdXQfOaPTYXdPSSrNaGtuI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/TxncR/btsMiZ2t4Od/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOEOZQcJj_wqQJzjJUP-JF4P8NQN0qT2t1EKYTnV1bC6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=54nH0qONJrT15RxPca8pMwC0Mes%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/q5lJA/btsMkB6KXii/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOpjvjVpMAUdqktZ_ynScTplRjoSW_Oyke3CI7ImWQIS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pm1eUZPi%2FvINxY8AOVx2fNqcIps%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1Lvxy/btsMkuUlzzS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH9_aI2db5IKcImqoqOVRnbh-_PKgxWlnnWtInNCBcGl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qXId%2FsdXQfOaPTYXdPSSrNaGtuI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/TxncR/btsMiZ2t4Od/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOEOZQcJj_wqQJzjJUP-JF4P8NQN0qT2t1EKYTnV1bC6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=54nH0qONJrT15RxPca8pMwC0Mes%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/q5lJA/btsMkB6KXii/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOpjvjVpMAUdqktZ_ynScTplRjoSW_Oyke3CI7ImWQIS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pm1eUZPi%2FvINxY8AOVx2fNqcIps%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1Lvxy/btsMkuUlzzS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH9_aI2db5IKcImqoqOVRnbh-_PKgxWlnnWtInNCBcGl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qXId%2FsdXQfOaPTYXdPSSrNaGtuI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/TxncR/btsMiZ2t4Od/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOEOZQcJj_wqQJzjJUP-JF4P8NQN0qT2t1EKYTnV1bC6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=54nH0qONJrT15RxPca8pMwC0Mes%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/q5lJA/btsMkB6KXii/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOpjvjVpMAUdqktZ_ynScTplRjoSW_Oyke3CI7ImWQIS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pm1eUZPi%2FvINxY8AOVx2fNqcIps%3D', 37.5789151, 127.069693, '### 여행 포인트\n마포껍데기는 드라마 "멜로무비"의 촬영지로, 이곳에서 다양한 한국 요리를 즐길 수 있습니다. 아늑한 분위기와 함께 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소입니다. 드라마의 감성을 느끼며, 맛있는 음식을 즐기는 특별한 경험을 해보세요.', 'Mapo Shell is the filming location for the drama Melo Movie where you can enjoy various Korean dishes It is a perfect place to spend precious time with friends with a cozy atmosphere Have a special experience of feeling the emotions of the drama and enjoying delicious food'),
	(643, '멜로무비', '사가정로', '서울 동대문구 장안동 99-16', '사가정로는 드라마 멜로무비의 촬영지로 독특한 분위기를 자아내는 거리입니다 이곳은 조용한 골목길과 은은한 조명이 어우러져 있어 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 걷기 좋은 장소입니다 주변 카페나 상점에서 여유롭게 시간을 보내며 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다', '#KdramaTrip #StreetScene #멜로무비 #사가정로 #산책 #드라마촬영지', '거리/골목/광장', 'in private households', 'Melo Movie', '99-16 Jangan-dong, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #StreetScene #MeloMovie #Sagajamro #Walk #DramaFilmingPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cIOhiX/btsMkuIkGbJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACfqOV_UMoBpNRJt8ahuxoSAs3JASthNKJVQDw6KNu7X/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=O1Rz48lspY0x9ETlORMRNY4C6CE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/boihNi/btsMloAzbhC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB2ejtTQDsbVeBNNt9IU18uSkdbUogowXt-0VyKBIU6Q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EJBBcQcl6Sb17U9pVzw178PYwH4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mt3Mz/btsMlpMZGcS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJziNQGs8Leq7KD4CiB1z6euO7HJQ1zxTDiBPek4ma1f/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=f56RjxKDK720jsBngq7oRfF8E1g%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cIOhiX/btsMkuIkGbJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACfqOV_UMoBpNRJt8ahuxoSAs3JASthNKJVQDw6KNu7X/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=O1Rz48lspY0x9ETlORMRNY4C6CE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/boihNi/btsMloAzbhC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB2ejtTQDsbVeBNNt9IU18uSkdbUogowXt-0VyKBIU6Q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EJBBcQcl6Sb17U9pVzw178PYwH4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mt3Mz/btsMlpMZGcS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJziNQGs8Leq7KD4CiB1z6euO7HJQ1zxTDiBPek4ma1f/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=f56RjxKDK720jsBngq7oRfF8E1g%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cIOhiX/btsMkuIkGbJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACfqOV_UMoBpNRJt8ahuxoSAs3JASthNKJVQDw6KNu7X/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=O1Rz48lspY0x9ETlORMRNY4C6CE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/boihNi/btsMloAzbhC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB2ejtTQDsbVeBNNt9IU18uSkdbUogowXt-0VyKBIU6Q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EJBBcQcl6Sb17U9pVzw178PYwH4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mt3Mz/btsMlpMZGcS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJziNQGs8Leq7KD4CiB1z6euO7HJQ1zxTDiBPek4ma1f/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=f56RjxKDK720jsBngq7oRfF8E1g%3D', 37.5790593, 127.0700451, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 멜로무비\n- **촬영지:** 사가정로\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기에 완벽한 장소입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 거리/골목\n\n### 여행 포인트\n사가정로는 드라마 "멜로무비"의 촬영지로, 독특한 분위기를 자아내는 거리입니다. 이곳은 조용한 골목길과 은은한 조명이 어우러져 있어, 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 걷기 좋은 장소입니다. 주변 카페나 상점에서 여유롭게 시간을 보내며, 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다.', 'Sagangro is the filming location of the drama Melo Movie and it is a street that creates a unique atmosphere This place is a good place to walk while feeling the sensibility of the drama with quiet alleyways and subtle lighting You can spend your time leisurely at nearby cafes and stores and have a special experience as if you have become a main character in a drama'),
	(644, '노 웨이 아웃 : 더 룰렛', '낙원순대할머니', '서울 종로구 삼일대로 428 낙원빌딩 지하1층 종로3가역5번출구 도보2분', '낙원순대할머니는 드라마 노 웨이 아웃  더 룰렛의 촬영지로 전통적인 한국식 순대를 맛볼 수 있는 아늑한 공간입니다 이곳은 소박한 인테리어와 따뜻한 분위기로 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 다양한 메뉴와 함께 현지인들이 자주 찾는 맛집으로 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 보내기에 적합합니다 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 맛있는 음식을 즐길 수 있는 이곳은 꼭 방문해볼 가치가 있습니다', '#KdramaTrip #순대 #맛집 #촬영지 #전통음식 #서울', '카페/레스토랑', 'Grandmother of Paradise Sondae', 'No Way Out: The Roulette', '2 minutes walk from Exit 5 of Jongno 3-ga Station, B1F, Nakwon Building, 428 Samil-daero, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#KdramaTrip #Sundae #Delicious Restaurant #FilmingPlace #TraditionalFood #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/btieMS/btsIYaLHhE0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPjudENPrLBFQKPCWjJ9z6m2HslbrDgRbjkQoksc1kB_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=C9NybJJ88B%2BO1OiqgFd6%2B5mNyRQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Dv7DD/btsIW3fxO1v/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOQEAqxSxtgM5X6ysXAM3gN1-Ejn7lhB8JRncNya0ucb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kFItJIO2qcxxfQmy4LClsrtFloU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bMmvsm/btsIW3s4TUD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABN78WfvKo8eM3ACs_d-P304QhCrYOMFhudwjNLAm9VX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FIO87w2Cvhe04AAByI6WWQPBZBc%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/btieMS/btsIYaLHhE0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPjudENPrLBFQKPCWjJ9z6m2HslbrDgRbjkQoksc1kB_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=C9NybJJ88B%2BO1OiqgFd6%2B5mNyRQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Dv7DD/btsIW3fxO1v/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOQEAqxSxtgM5X6ysXAM3gN1-Ejn7lhB8JRncNya0ucb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kFItJIO2qcxxfQmy4LClsrtFloU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bMmvsm/btsIW3s4TUD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABN78WfvKo8eM3ACs_d-P304QhCrYOMFhudwjNLAm9VX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FIO87w2Cvhe04AAByI6WWQPBZBc%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/btieMS/btsIYaLHhE0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPjudENPrLBFQKPCWjJ9z6m2HslbrDgRbjkQoksc1kB_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=C9NybJJ88B%2BO1OiqgFd6%2B5mNyRQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Dv7DD/btsIW3fxO1v/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOQEAqxSxtgM5X6ysXAM3gN1-Ejn7lhB8JRncNya0ucb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kFItJIO2qcxxfQmy4LClsrtFloU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bMmvsm/btsIW3s4TUD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABN78WfvKo8eM3ACs_d-P304QhCrYOMFhudwjNLAm9VX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FIO87w2Cvhe04AAByI6WWQPBZBc%3D', 37.5722166, 126.9876448, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n- **제목**: 노 웨이 아웃 : 더 룰렛\n- **촬영지**: 낙원순대할머니\n- **방문팁**: 이곳에서 현지의 정취를 느끼며 맛있는 순대를 꼭 맛보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n낙원순대할머니는 드라마 "노 웨이 아웃 : 더 룰렛"의 촬영지로, 전통적인 한국식 순대를 맛볼 수 있는 아늑한 공간입니다. 이곳은 소박한 인테리어와 따뜻한 분위기로, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 다양한 메뉴와 함께 현지인들이 자주 찾는 맛집으로, 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 보내기에 적합합니다. 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 맛있는 음식을 즐길 수 있는 이곳은 꼭 방문해볼 가치가 있습니다.', 'Nakwon Sundae Grandmother is the filming location for the drama No Way Out The Roulette a cozy place where you can taste traditional Korean sundae With its simple interior and warm atmosphere it provides a special experience for drama fans It is a restaurant frequented by locals along with a variety of menus and is suitable for spending precious time with friends This place where you can enjoy delicious food while recalling the scenes in the drama is worth visiting'),
	(645, '선재 업고 튀어', '알페로', '서울 마포구 홍익로5길 32 홍대입구역9번출구 도보5분', '알페로는 드라마 선재 업고 튀어의 촬영지로 독특한 분위기와 아름다운 경관을 자랑합니다 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면이 촬영된 장소로 팬들에게는 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다 주변의 다양한 카페와 상점들도 함께 즐길 수 있어 드라마 촬영지 탐방에 적합한 장소입니다 KdramaTrip StreetScene', '#드라마촬영지, #알페로, #홍대, #여행, #카페투어', '거리/골목/광장', 'Alpero', 'Let\'s carry Sunjae and run', 'Hongik-ro 5-gil 32, Mapo-gu, Seoul, 5 minutes on foot from Exit 9 of Hongdae Entrance Station', 'a street/alley/square', '#Drama filming location, #Alpero, #Hongdae, #Travel, #CafeTour', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b40eZj/btsGHb0bAB1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANklejmK08Jb0m0qqldftpaGdkMwCH-wI2FlWKV1LOpz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yKBrNnq7tJm4jCNpiXfnmCnDm%2Fo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cvdRBh/btsGGXA8Fk9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEgmXfSdkZTy95RJASyeeY0dBQHRiU__ug08YKt2yxCa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RZqp5WmET3o8SdQuCvHkWm1F25Y%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b40eZj/btsGHb0bAB1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANklejmK08Jb0m0qqldftpaGdkMwCH-wI2FlWKV1LOpz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yKBrNnq7tJm4jCNpiXfnmCnDm%2Fo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cvdRBh/btsGGXA8Fk9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEgmXfSdkZTy95RJASyeeY0dBQHRiU__ug08YKt2yxCa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RZqp5WmET3o8SdQuCvHkWm1F25Y%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b40eZj/btsGHb0bAB1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANklejmK08Jb0m0qqldftpaGdkMwCH-wI2FlWKV1LOpz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yKBrNnq7tJm4jCNpiXfnmCnDm%2Fo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cvdRBh/btsGGXA8Fk9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEgmXfSdkZTy95RJASyeeY0dBQHRiU__ug08YKt2yxCa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RZqp5WmET3o8SdQuCvHkWm1F25Y%3D', NULL, 37.5537834, 126.9205693, '### 거리/골목 촬영지: 알페로\n\n**방문팁:** 알페로에서 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 알페로는 드라마 "선재 업고 튀어"의 촬영지로, 독특한 분위기와 아름다운 경관을 자랑합니다. 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면이 촬영된 장소로, 팬들에게는 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다. 주변의 다양한 카페와 상점들도 함께 즐길 수 있어, 드라마 촬영지 탐방에 적합한 장소입니다. #KdramaTrip #StreetScene', 'Alpero is the filming location of the drama Bounce on the back of Seonjae which boasts a unique atmosphere and beautiful scenery This is the place where the main scenes of the drama were filmed and it will be a special experience for fans Various cafes and shops around can also be enjoyed together making it a suitable place for exploring drama filming locations KdramaTrip StreetScene'),
	(646, '선재 업고 튀어', '성산로22길', '서울 서대문구 성산로22길 22 신촌역2번출구 도보12분', '성산로22길은 드라마 선재 업고 튀어의 촬영지로 독특한 분위기를 자아내는 매력적인 장소입니다 이곳은 푸른 식물들이 어우러진 벽과 조명이 어우러져 아늑한 감성을 느낄 수 있습니다 드라마의 한 장면처럼 사진을 찍으며 특별한 순간을 기록해보세요 이곳은 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라 평화로운 거리의 풍경을 즐기고 싶은 모든 이들에게 추천할 만한 장소입니다', '#KdramaTrip #StreetScene #아늑함 #촬영지 #특별한순간', '거리/골목/광장', 'Seongsan-ro 22-gil', 'Let\'s carry Sunjae and run', '12 minutes walk from Exit 2 of Sinchon Station, 22, Seongsan-ro 22-gil, Seodaemun-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #StreetScene #Cozy #FilmingPlace #SpecialMoment', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ciKnXm/btsGupTfVfe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0n9AorgNkRKx4rzD8Z0o22_n1ZQrZAojbCzSuWAIpE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hM5OupLJAK8wLoqRG9ycZ8u2zyY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Zb1VC/btsGt8YDndY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACfNDF2Xo_nIJPuY7WLkKtaTCugENb19ecESz8XLvy0V/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wH9sJ%2FKVrchR%2Fi3%2BOnf4JV96Te0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ds6t9a/btsGuNl8KSg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL7uulFyUk2ICG3uzjA7I2NmdYMZGtrcRh3J-CZRbLNm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ps7kM6UYmxY72kMoDWXS40iK1q0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/MA4RK/btsGvrQC85c/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMYk35CKl-kA__I8j4gRIELsv_eCwvDo_K2cLZA7-jAs/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dnfLe0kqHXlWQhszHq9pelcPuZ4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ciKnXm/btsGupTfVfe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0n9AorgNkRKx4rzD8Z0o22_n1ZQrZAojbCzSuWAIpE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hM5OupLJAK8wLoqRG9ycZ8u2zyY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Zb1VC/btsGt8YDndY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACfNDF2Xo_nIJPuY7WLkKtaTCugENb19ecESz8XLvy0V/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wH9sJ%2FKVrchR%2Fi3%2BOnf4JV96Te0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ds6t9a/btsGuNl8KSg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL7uulFyUk2ICG3uzjA7I2NmdYMZGtrcRh3J-CZRbLNm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ps7kM6UYmxY72kMoDWXS40iK1q0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/MA4RK/btsGvrQC85c/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMYk35CKl-kA__I8j4gRIELsv_eCwvDo_K2cLZA7-jAs/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dnfLe0kqHXlWQhszHq9pelcPuZ4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ciKnXm/btsGupTfVfe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0n9AorgNkRKx4rzD8Z0o22_n1ZQrZAojbCzSuWAIpE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hM5OupLJAK8wLoqRG9ycZ8u2zyY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Zb1VC/btsGt8YDndY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACfNDF2Xo_nIJPuY7WLkKtaTCugENb19ecESz8XLvy0V/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wH9sJ%2FKVrchR%2Fi3%2BOnf4JV96Te0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ds6t9a/btsGuNl8KSg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL7uulFyUk2ICG3uzjA7I2NmdYMZGtrcRh3J-CZRbLNm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ps7kM6UYmxY72kMoDWXS40iK1q0%3D', 37.5598915, 126.9340445, '### 거리/골목 촬영지 정보\n\n**제목:** 선재 업고 튀어  \n**촬영지:** 성산로22길  \n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 아늑한 골목입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리/골목  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n성산로22길은 드라마 "선재 업고 튀어"의 촬영지로, 독특한 분위기를 자아내는 매력적인 장소입니다. 이곳은 푸른 식물들이 어우러진 벽과 조명이 어우러져 아늑한 감성을 느낄 수 있습니다. 드라마의 한 장면처럼 사진을 찍으며 특별한 순간을 기록해보세요. 이곳은 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라, 평화로운 거리의 풍경을 즐기고 싶은 모든 이들에게 추천할 만한 장소입니다.', 'Seongsanro 22gil is the filming location of the drama Bounce With Seonjae which is an attractive place to create a unique atmosphere Here you can feel a cozy sensibility by combining walls and lights that are harmonized with green plants Record special moments while taking pictures like a scene in a drama This is a recommended place not only for drama fans but also for anyone who wants to enjoy the peaceful streetscape'),
	(647, '선재 업고 튀어', '동대문디자인플라자', '서울 중구 을지로 281 동대문역사문화공원역1번출구 바로앞', '동대문디자인플라자는 현대적인 건축물과 다양한 문화 콘텐츠가 어우러진 공간입니다 드라마 선재 업고 튀어의 촬영지로 유명하며 이곳에서는 다양한 전시와 이벤트가 열립니다 특히 야경이 아름다워 저녁에 방문하면 더욱 멋진 풍경을 감상할 수 있습니다 맛있는 길거리 음식도 즐기며 활기찬 분위기를 만끽해보세요', '#선재업고튀어 #동대문디자인플라자 #문화행사 #야경 #서울여행 #KdramaTrip', '기타', 'Dongdaemun Design Plaza', 'Let\'s carry Sunjae and run', 'Right in front of Exit 1 of Dongdaemun History and Culture Park Station, 281, Eulji-ro, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Pre-sale and up-and-out #DongdaemunDesignPlaza #CulturalEvents #Nightscape #SeoulTravel #KdramaTrip', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cHzh74/btsGt9omBgJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF3rCKzBTv36qp1AYSW7n-bgBdJom3zcyABTGFDJwJmq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oz0aAk10sH39H2vW48m8q%2BrXWMw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bjwN83/btsGrexwJfL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKSsyCi0yBrzvGzszRXVW944_jLFS5-53hFJKjotNDYA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JkNinPuj2iuqwf2BOINVJFgbswo%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cHzh74/btsGt9omBgJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF3rCKzBTv36qp1AYSW7n-bgBdJom3zcyABTGFDJwJmq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oz0aAk10sH39H2vW48m8q%2BrXWMw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bjwN83/btsGrexwJfL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKSsyCi0yBrzvGzszRXVW944_jLFS5-53hFJKjotNDYA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JkNinPuj2iuqwf2BOINVJFgbswo%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cHzh74/btsGt9omBgJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF3rCKzBTv36qp1AYSW7n-bgBdJom3zcyABTGFDJwJmq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oz0aAk10sH39H2vW48m8q%2BrXWMw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bjwN83/btsGrexwJfL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKSsyCi0yBrzvGzszRXVW944_jLFS5-53hFJKjotNDYA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JkNinPuj2iuqwf2BOINVJFgbswo%3D', NULL, 37.5660286, 126.9954924, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 선재 업고 튀어\n- **촬영지**: 동대문디자인플라자\n- **방문팁**: 다양한 문화 행사와 전시가 열리는 곳으로, 방문 시 최신 이벤트를 체크해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n동대문디자인플라자는 현대적인 건축물과 다양한 문화 콘텐츠가 어우러진 공간입니다. 드라마 "선재 업고 튀어"의 촬영지로 유명하며, 이곳에서는 다양한 전시와 이벤트가 열립니다. 특히, 야경이 아름다워 저녁에 방문하면 더욱 멋진 풍경을 감상할 수 있습니다. 맛있는 길거리 음식도 즐기며, 활기찬 분위기를 만끽해보세요.', 'Dongdaemun Design Plaza is a space that combines modern architecture and various cultural contents It is famous as the filming location for the drama Bounce With Seonjae where various exhibitions and events are held In particular the night view is beautiful so you can enjoy a more wonderful scenery if you visit in the evening Enjoy delicious street food and enjoy the lively atmosphere'),
	(648, '선재 업고 튀어', '남도분식 익선점', '서울 종로구 수표로28길 33 종로3가역4번출구 도보3분', '남도분식 익선점은 드라마 선재 업고 튀어의 촬영지로 아늑한 분위기와 다양한 분식 메뉴가 매력적인 곳입니다 이곳에서 드라마 속 주인공들이 즐긴 음식을 맛보며 그들의 이야기에 몰입할 수 있는 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다 또한 인테리어는 따뜻하고 친근한 느낌을 주어 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 보내기에도 적합합니다', '#KdramaTrip, #맛집, #분식, #촬영지, #서울여행, #아늑한카페', '카페/레스토랑', 'a branch of the Southern District', 'Let\'s carry Sunjae and run', '3-minute walk from Exit 4 of Jongno 3-ga Station, 33, Supyo-ro 28-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Kdrama Trip, #Delicious Restaurant, # Snack, #FilmingPlace, #SeoulTravel, #CozyCafé', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZsX8U/btsGR3n6YYU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPkSraNrShOZiTtuxWOf1Witq6JsiTCNdyBNdM0qsBvm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tVT5fNICPh1R%2F27Iim9oR3Xc0dY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bUlIiL/btsGQZGTfzJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN6Cs5ONAAg6_Y54KiSeNuSkwnRu6yhmpuizhLEKbWaZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=w0ng3eXtYyAL%2BZAb3Q033yLoyfI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rE4hT/btsGS6kg9As/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPJ93QnpHpCzA3yfhQDAeYzSM9bkl-rRT0MGU3y8vtey/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yj6CKxsqkLHrSxwyjL2Hbk268Cs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NWbXE/btsGSRARBwS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM5A0Du4sUYu7LEdVpkc9AhWP2w1pMKAEsdrDyMTcIDI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qj5eMoJpyWkKy0yLgdgS12q7z78%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZsX8U/btsGR3n6YYU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPkSraNrShOZiTtuxWOf1Witq6JsiTCNdyBNdM0qsBvm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tVT5fNICPh1R%2F27Iim9oR3Xc0dY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bUlIiL/btsGQZGTfzJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN6Cs5ONAAg6_Y54KiSeNuSkwnRu6yhmpuizhLEKbWaZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=w0ng3eXtYyAL%2BZAb3Q033yLoyfI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rE4hT/btsGS6kg9As/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPJ93QnpHpCzA3yfhQDAeYzSM9bkl-rRT0MGU3y8vtey/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yj6CKxsqkLHrSxwyjL2Hbk268Cs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NWbXE/btsGSRARBwS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM5A0Du4sUYu7LEdVpkc9AhWP2w1pMKAEsdrDyMTcIDI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qj5eMoJpyWkKy0yLgdgS12q7z78%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZsX8U/btsGR3n6YYU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPkSraNrShOZiTtuxWOf1Witq6JsiTCNdyBNdM0qsBvm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tVT5fNICPh1R%2F27Iim9oR3Xc0dY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bUlIiL/btsGQZGTfzJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN6Cs5ONAAg6_Y54KiSeNuSkwnRu6yhmpuizhLEKbWaZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=w0ng3eXtYyAL%2BZAb3Q033yLoyfI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rE4hT/btsGS6kg9As/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPJ93QnpHpCzA3yfhQDAeYzSM9bkl-rRT0MGU3y8vtey/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yj6CKxsqkLHrSxwyjL2Hbk268Cs%3D', 37.5731516, 126.9900958, '### 카페/레스토랑\n- **이름**: 남도분식 익선점\n- **드라마 정보**\n  - **제목**: 선재 업고 튀어\n  - **촬영지**: 남도분식 익선점\n  - **방문팁**: 드라마 속 주인공들이 즐기는 맛있는 음식을 경험해보세요.\n  - **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n  - **작가**: 미상\n  - **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n남도분식 익선점은 드라마 "선재 업고 튀어"의 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기와 다양한 분식 메뉴가 매력적인 곳입니다. 이곳에서 드라마 속 주인공들이 즐긴 음식을 맛보며, 그들의 이야기에 몰입할 수 있는 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다. 또한, 인테리어는 따뜻하고 친근한 느낌을 주어 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 보내기에도 적합합니다.', 'The Namdo Bunsik Ikseon branch is the filming location of the drama Bounce With Seonjae and it is a place where the cozy atmosphere and various snack menus are attractive Here you can taste the food enjoyed by the main characters in the drama and have a special experience to immerse themselves in their stories Also the interior feels warm and friendly making it suitable for spending precious time with friends'),
	(649, '선재 업고 튀어', '쇠고집', '서울 종로구 인사동3길 5-2 종로3가역5번출구 도보5분', '쇠고집은 드라마 선재 업고 튀어의 촬영지로 전통과 현대가 조화를 이루는 아름다운 공간입니다 이곳에서는 다양한 한국 요리를 즐길 수 있으며 아늑한 분위기 속에서 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 특히 촬영지의 독특한 인테리어와 조명은 방문객들에게 인상적인 경험을 제공합니다', '#드라마촬영지 #전통과현대 #한국요리 #아늑한분위기 #특별한경험', '카페/레스토랑', 'an iron-clad man', 'Let\'s carry Sunjae and run', '5-minute walk from Exit 5 of Jongno 3-ga Station, 5-2 Insa-dong 3-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Drama filming location #tradition and modernity #Korean cuisine #cozy atmosphere #special experience', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c3kSIQ/btsGE6dN1qK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALyVCgTo49mygIeki3zZpls6mN4VMCv1sucByBCA38sy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2L6KPEKffrLyG5RVbVy6XMg0Ioo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d7eBuK/btsGCyWCIf6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKGbDlJ35sNbVB8qo6YJGV6s0I4I54H-0N1c236erGSa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BlOxT3yzTShO4lzGBF%2B2uRLQSNs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bBtG0q/btsGCbtTcYW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACkVkYTE198Uw5S-5zYvnw6DI4rQEEH3al_MaoLz5qof/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lVeYZtaAvOZgYJPuslJnluyQea0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c3kSIQ/btsGE6dN1qK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALyVCgTo49mygIeki3zZpls6mN4VMCv1sucByBCA38sy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2L6KPEKffrLyG5RVbVy6XMg0Ioo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d7eBuK/btsGCyWCIf6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKGbDlJ35sNbVB8qo6YJGV6s0I4I54H-0N1c236erGSa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BlOxT3yzTShO4lzGBF%2B2uRLQSNs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bBtG0q/btsGCbtTcYW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACkVkYTE198Uw5S-5zYvnw6DI4rQEEH3al_MaoLz5qof/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lVeYZtaAvOZgYJPuslJnluyQea0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c3kSIQ/btsGE6dN1qK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALyVCgTo49mygIeki3zZpls6mN4VMCv1sucByBCA38sy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2L6KPEKffrLyG5RVbVy6XMg0Ioo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d7eBuK/btsGCyWCIf6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKGbDlJ35sNbVB8qo6YJGV6s0I4I54H-0N1c236erGSa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BlOxT3yzTShO4lzGBF%2B2uRLQSNs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bBtG0q/btsGCbtTcYW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACkVkYTE198Uw5S-5zYvnw6DI4rQEEH3al_MaoLz5qof/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lVeYZtaAvOZgYJPuslJnluyQea0%3D', 37.571805, 126.9863723, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 선재 업고 튀어\n- **촬영지:** 쇠고집\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마 촬영지로, 독특한 분위기를 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n쇠고집은 드라마 "선재 업고 튀어"의 촬영지로, 전통과 현대가 조화를 이루는 아름다운 공간입니다. 이곳에서는 다양한 한국 요리를 즐길 수 있으며, 아늑한 분위기 속에서 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 특히, 촬영지의 독특한 인테리어와 조명은 방문객들에게 인상적인 경험을 제공합니다.', 'Soegojip is the filming location of the drama Bounce With Seonjae a beautiful space where tradition and modernity harmonize Here you can enjoy various Korean dishes and have a special time like a scene from a drama in a cozy atmosphere In particular the unique interior and lighting of the filming location provide an impressive experience for visitors'),
	(650, '선재 업고 튀어', '복정우물앞', '서울 종로구 삼청로4길 12-1 안국역1번출구 도보13분', '복정우물앞은 드라마 선재 업고 튀어의 촬영지로 고즈넉한 분위기와 아름다운 조명이 어우러져 특별한 시간을 보낼 수 있는 장소입니다 이곳에서는 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 사진을 찍거나 주변을 산책하며 여유로운 시간을 즐길 수 있습니다 특히 밤에 방문하면 더욱 매력적인 풍경을 경험할 수 있습니다', '#선재업고튀어, #드라마촬영지, #복정우물, #아늑한장소, #야경, #서울여행', '기타', 'In front of the well of Bokjeong', 'Let\'s carry Sunjae and run', '13 minutes walk from Exit 1 of Anguk Station, 12-1, Samcheong-ro 4-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Pre-release, go and run, #drama shooting location, #bokjeong well, # cozy place, #nightscape, #Seoul trip', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b0KM9h/btsGwa8Aw7V/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAuq2Op9CMZ_XcpYwJwV5zfywNbcV2nBk5_9B_rqkNAi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EE0yrEJpCm5EX2vJyN8B%2Fx3QLu8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/u3dOW/btsGxDWmAeg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANK8uOwa5uTaXUYWsFrWH93jSMwMeDAi71WW5c5VuqN7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JsZrufOYHzR1KxZVfHsgQMK1Yoo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cziCGQ/btsGuoGL4xy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEt27ag_9ptoK2lx5BhSduAlWQprkLRIvFGdB7oieQAc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fngo3ieTf5MzBFZwnXfFNxUgIpY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dhv910/btsGw7ccHyX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGDkwtyRN4M7IiubRdOnvD0-9KeAXViJvv46HtuuOcRt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1zxpfzmY4zVDRHZfnimzVr33SDA%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b0KM9h/btsGwa8Aw7V/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAuq2Op9CMZ_XcpYwJwV5zfywNbcV2nBk5_9B_rqkNAi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EE0yrEJpCm5EX2vJyN8B%2Fx3QLu8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/u3dOW/btsGxDWmAeg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANK8uOwa5uTaXUYWsFrWH93jSMwMeDAi71WW5c5VuqN7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JsZrufOYHzR1KxZVfHsgQMK1Yoo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cziCGQ/btsGuoGL4xy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEt27ag_9ptoK2lx5BhSduAlWQprkLRIvFGdB7oieQAc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fngo3ieTf5MzBFZwnXfFNxUgIpY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dhv910/btsGw7ccHyX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGDkwtyRN4M7IiubRdOnvD0-9KeAXViJvv46HtuuOcRt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1zxpfzmY4zVDRHZfnimzVr33SDA%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b0KM9h/btsGwa8Aw7V/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAuq2Op9CMZ_XcpYwJwV5zfywNbcV2nBk5_9B_rqkNAi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EE0yrEJpCm5EX2vJyN8B%2Fx3QLu8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/u3dOW/btsGxDWmAeg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANK8uOwa5uTaXUYWsFrWH93jSMwMeDAi71WW5c5VuqN7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JsZrufOYHzR1KxZVfHsgQMK1Yoo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cziCGQ/btsGuoGL4xy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEt27ag_9ptoK2lx5BhSduAlWQprkLRIvFGdB7oieQAc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fngo3ieTf5MzBFZwnXfFNxUgIpY%3D', 37.5821203, 126.9820305, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 선재 업고 튀어\n- **촬영지**: 복정우물앞\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 아늑한 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n복정우물앞은 드라마 "선재 업고 튀어"의 촬영지로, 고즈넉한 분위기와 아름다운 조명이 어우러져 특별한 시간을 보낼 수 있는 장소입니다. 이곳에서는 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 사진을 찍거나, 주변을 산책하며 여유로운 시간을 즐길 수 있습니다. 특히 밤에 방문하면 더욱 매력적인 풍경을 경험할 수 있습니다.', 'Bokjeong Well is the filming location of the drama Bounce on your back and it is a place where you can spend a special time with a calm atmosphere and beautiful lighting Here you can feel the sensibility of the drama and take pictures take a walk around and enjoy a leisurely time You can experience a more attractive landscape especially if you visit at night'),
	(651, '선재 업고 튀어', '중앙고등학교', '서울 종로구 창덕궁길 164 안국역3번출구 도보12분', '중앙고등학교는 드라마 선재 업고 튀어의 촬영지로 아름다운 캠퍼스와 고풍스러운 건축물이 매력적인 장소입니다 이곳은 학생들의 활기찬 일상과 함께 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 최적의 공간으로 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 만들어줄 것입니다 학교 주변의 조경과 분위기를 만끽하며 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 여유로운 시간을 보내보세요', '#KdramaTrip #Campus #드라마촬영지 #서울여행 #고등학교 #산책', '학교/대학', 'Central High School', 'Let\'s carry Sunjae and run', '12-minute walk from Exit 3 of Anguk Station, 164 Changdeokgung-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a school/college', '#KdramaTrip #Campus #DramaShootingPlace #SeoulTravel #High School #Walk', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FyJGT/btsGuIKEqW5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKhXzGTHxg36KJhhcUchhY619Jh5LukkchUK0SudQdOG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=g4mggQ5Q6bESro7Nu72wdVxP590%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/XSHkC/btsGsg9yaVA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB3cJP1vxrz0Al5pdqy2LC-bNFCSMnvVDU8ifAXXfmVk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YKD1PRGK7pWVWqZDfi6s1zVfMGo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/URSsv/btsGvrPk4cM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAqkBdySSrvlsce6Epsy88QDRSFkkGjelNBSc2aBgdIB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uJIIagrN%2FH8xjEGbJn1pCmCdqaA%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FyJGT/btsGuIKEqW5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKhXzGTHxg36KJhhcUchhY619Jh5LukkchUK0SudQdOG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=g4mggQ5Q6bESro7Nu72wdVxP590%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/XSHkC/btsGsg9yaVA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB3cJP1vxrz0Al5pdqy2LC-bNFCSMnvVDU8ifAXXfmVk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YKD1PRGK7pWVWqZDfi6s1zVfMGo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/URSsv/btsGvrPk4cM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAqkBdySSrvlsce6Epsy88QDRSFkkGjelNBSc2aBgdIB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uJIIagrN%2FH8xjEGbJn1pCmCdqaA%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FyJGT/btsGuIKEqW5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKhXzGTHxg36KJhhcUchhY619Jh5LukkchUK0SudQdOG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=g4mggQ5Q6bESro7Nu72wdVxP590%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/XSHkC/btsGsg9yaVA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB3cJP1vxrz0Al5pdqy2LC-bNFCSMnvVDU8ifAXXfmVk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YKD1PRGK7pWVWqZDfi6s1zVfMGo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/URSsv/btsGvrPk4cM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAqkBdySSrvlsce6Epsy88QDRSFkkGjelNBSc2aBgdIB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uJIIagrN%2FH8xjEGbJn1pCmCdqaA%3D', 37.5840946, 126.986866, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 선재 업고 튀어\n- **촬영지**: 중앙고등학교\n- **방문팁**: 이곳에서 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 산책해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Campus\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 학교\n\n### 여행 포인트\n중앙고등학교는 드라마 "선재 업고 튀어"의 촬영지로, 아름다운 캠퍼스와 고풍스러운 건축물이 매력적인 장소입니다. 이곳은 학생들의 활기찬 일상과 함께 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 최적의 공간으로, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 만들어줄 것입니다. 학교 주변의 조경과 분위기를 만끽하며, 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 여유로운 시간을 보내보세요.', 'ChungAng High School is the filming location of the drama Bounce With Seonjae and it is an attractive place for beautiful campuses and antique architecture This is the best space for students to feel the emotions of the drama along with their lively daily lives and it will make special memories for drama fans Enjoy the landscaping and atmosphere around the school and spend your time reminding you of the scenes in the drama');
INSERT INTO `k_contents_trans` (`content_id`, `drama_name`, `location_name`, `address`, `trip_tip`, `keyword`, `category`, `location_name_en`, `drama_name_en`, `address_en`, `category_en`, `keyword_en`, `image_url`, `image_url_list`, `thumbnail`, `second_image`, `third_image`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `drama_desc`, `trip_tip_en`) VALUES
	(652, '선재 업고 튀어', '고려사이버대학교 인촌관', '서울 종로구 창덕궁길 164', '고려사이버대학교 인촌관은 현대적인 건축물과 자연이 어우러진 곳으로 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 방문지가 됩니다 주변의 아름다운 풍경과 함께 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 캠퍼스 내에서 산책하며 다양한 포토존을 찾아보는 것도 추천합니다', '#드라마촬영지, #캠퍼스, #사진촬영, #자연, #현대건축, #여유로운시간', '학교/대학', 'Inchon Hall, Korea Cyber University', 'Let\'s carry Sunjae and run', '164, Changdeokgung-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a school/college', '#Drama filming location, #campus, #photography, #nature, #modern architecture, #relaxingtime', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d4req7/btsGCv6FTBN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE8Px9NLViwNT7CqXB6l85rZeRQ0JHji12Whd05TVlLp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=O3aBZRozNrCt9VKzAr0rjlkKCxQ%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d4req7/btsGCv6FTBN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE8Px9NLViwNT7CqXB6l85rZeRQ0JHji12Whd05TVlLp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=O3aBZRozNrCt9VKzAr0rjlkKCxQ%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d4req7/btsGCv6FTBN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE8Px9NLViwNT7CqXB6l85rZeRQ0JHji12Whd05TVlLp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=O3aBZRozNrCt9VKzAr0rjlkKCxQ%3D', NULL, NULL, 37.5840946, 126.986866, '### 고려사이버대학교 인촌관\n\n**방문팁:** 고려사이버대학교 인촌관은 드라마 촬영지로 유명하며, 아름다운 캠퍼스에서 사진 촬영하기에 좋은 장소입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 고려사이버대학교 인촌관은 현대적인 건축물과 자연이 어우러진 곳으로, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 방문지가 됩니다. 주변의 아름다운 풍경과 함께 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 캠퍼스 내에서 산책하며 다양한 포토존을 찾아보는 것도 추천합니다.', 'Inchon Hall of Korea Cyber University is a combination of modern architecture and nature making it a special destination for drama fans You can spend a leisurely time recalling the scenes in the drama with the beautiful scenery around you It is also recommended to take a walk on campus and look for various photo zones'),
	(653, '선재 업고 튀어', '삼일대로32길', '서울 종로구 삼일대로32길 31-8 안국역4번출구 도보5분', '삼일대로32길은 드라마 선재 업고 튀어의 매력적인 배경으로 도시의 일상적인 풍경과 함께 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다 이곳에서는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 촬영지 탐방 후 여유롭게 휴식을 취하기에도 좋습니다 특히 드라마의 특정 장면을 재현하며 사진을 찍기 좋은 포인트가 많아 팬들에게는 필수 방문 코스입니다', '#촬영지 #골목 #드라마투어 #서울여행 #카페 #상점', '거리/골목/광장', 'Samil-daero 32nd-gil', 'Let\'s carry Sunjae and run', '5-minute walk from Exit 4 of Anguk Station, 31-8 Samil-daero 32-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Shooting location #Alley #DramaTour #SeoulTravel #Cafe #Shop', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bhdQ97/btsGu39Xn2R/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANDlWjwU0eFPL-2V2rOYgaisAne00DKHJ0mgU2w-bEJa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KLYRjFHNYEtY19v6U7Hr38ahEfw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ba6lJB/btsGvvrC4Id/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGaQ5-UJkDO-MhQLg_O83OdKFZdfSoO4JEyiqaWilgNc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=k6alJW0BGpV0aHyxdTGjVnT%2B6uY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zIyYM/btsGvTe3MCY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACwPWGK_5hyXA3QLzni3nv1UQlPHi3Phh25iyWJnALEm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MQuSuIp9tqnZOPYEhKu3M2MLP0c%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/byNs6I/btsGvqRKyhW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFMguzmea1rYKkccFlZf4gn1XIAEri7LsWkma1f4C2HS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CRDBU8uUF5Y2cGXYAkR4vIOYi6A%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bhdQ97/btsGu39Xn2R/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANDlWjwU0eFPL-2V2rOYgaisAne00DKHJ0mgU2w-bEJa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KLYRjFHNYEtY19v6U7Hr38ahEfw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ba6lJB/btsGvvrC4Id/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGaQ5-UJkDO-MhQLg_O83OdKFZdfSoO4JEyiqaWilgNc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=k6alJW0BGpV0aHyxdTGjVnT%2B6uY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zIyYM/btsGvTe3MCY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACwPWGK_5hyXA3QLzni3nv1UQlPHi3Phh25iyWJnALEm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MQuSuIp9tqnZOPYEhKu3M2MLP0c%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/byNs6I/btsGvqRKyhW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFMguzmea1rYKkccFlZf4gn1XIAEri7LsWkma1f4C2HS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CRDBU8uUF5Y2cGXYAkR4vIOYi6A%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bhdQ97/btsGu39Xn2R/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANDlWjwU0eFPL-2V2rOYgaisAne00DKHJ0mgU2w-bEJa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KLYRjFHNYEtY19v6U7Hr38ahEfw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ba6lJB/btsGvvrC4Id/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGaQ5-UJkDO-MhQLg_O83OdKFZdfSoO4JEyiqaWilgNc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=k6alJW0BGpV0aHyxdTGjVnT%2B6uY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zIyYM/btsGvTe3MCY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACwPWGK_5hyXA3QLzni3nv1UQlPHi3Phh25iyWJnALEm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MQuSuIp9tqnZOPYEhKu3M2MLP0c%3D', 37.5757493, 126.988795, '### 거리/골목 촬영지 정보\n\n**제목:** 선재 업고 튀어  \n**촬영지:** 삼일대로32길  \n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 생생한 촬영 현장을 경험할 수 있는 장소입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리/골목  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n삼일대로32길은 드라마 "선재 업고 튀어"의 매력적인 배경으로, 도시의 일상적인 풍경과 함께 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다. 이곳에서는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 촬영지 탐방 후 여유롭게 휴식을 취하기에도 좋습니다. 특히, 드라마의 특정 장면을 재현하며 사진을 찍기 좋은 포인트가 많아 팬들에게는 필수 방문 코스입니다.', 'Samildaero 32gil is an attractive background of the drama Bungee with Seonjae on your back where you can feel the sensibility of the drama along with the daily scenery of the city There are various cafes and shops here so its good to relax after visiting the filming location In particular it is a mustvisit course for fans as there are many good points to take pictures while reproducing certain scenes of the drama'),
	(654, '선재 업고 튀어', 'CU종로신영점', '서울 종로구 세검정로6길 104 불광역2번출구 버스16분', 'CU종로신영점은 드라마 선재 업고 튀어의 촬영지로 젊은이들이 모여 즐거운 시간을 보내는 장소입니다 이곳은 편안한 분위기와 다양한 간식들로 가득해 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 친구들과 함께 방문하면 더욱 즐거운 시간을 보낼 수 있을 것입니다', '#KdramaTrip #선재업고튀어 #CU종로신영점 #촬영지 #드라마팬 #소셜미디어', '기타/판별불가', 'CU Jongro New Young Branch', 'Let\'s carry Sunjae and run', 'Bus 16 minutes from Exit 2 of Bulgwang Station, 104 Segeom-ro 6-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#KdramaTrip #Pre-releaseUpGoStopping #CUJongro Shinyoung Branch #FilmingPlace #DramaFan #SocialMedia', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nEkK8/btsGS5ZX9BC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM4DC7Z3TMg_PU_IsoKH2TJlDqg2PAVmuClph-EQMRet/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xisPomgLM0bPgTbTimsU1LTu9hk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dk0g1R/btsGThMEDHO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPIuPxuk4NUc4tqmcmHEWEKnzqYwRQd7SAaeieV6L_a9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pHEGoEQ860rzsSbg7BzhJKpffz0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bvY00A/btsGTGL9AhO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMaphQWR199gDZGaJPPEkdhYiyFlGfcwO_iTqZNDj96T/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MpgZiKSqI778qGnqXwS3efVgS7k%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nEkK8/btsGS5ZX9BC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM4DC7Z3TMg_PU_IsoKH2TJlDqg2PAVmuClph-EQMRet/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xisPomgLM0bPgTbTimsU1LTu9hk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dk0g1R/btsGThMEDHO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPIuPxuk4NUc4tqmcmHEWEKnzqYwRQd7SAaeieV6L_a9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pHEGoEQ860rzsSbg7BzhJKpffz0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bvY00A/btsGTGL9AhO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMaphQWR199gDZGaJPPEkdhYiyFlGfcwO_iTqZNDj96T/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MpgZiKSqI778qGnqXwS3efVgS7k%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nEkK8/btsGS5ZX9BC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM4DC7Z3TMg_PU_IsoKH2TJlDqg2PAVmuClph-EQMRet/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xisPomgLM0bPgTbTimsU1LTu9hk%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dk0g1R/btsGThMEDHO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPIuPxuk4NUc4tqmcmHEWEKnzqYwRQd7SAaeieV6L_a9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pHEGoEQ860rzsSbg7BzhJKpffz0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bvY00A/btsGTGL9AhO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMaphQWR199gDZGaJPPEkdhYiyFlGfcwO_iTqZNDj96T/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MpgZiKSqI778qGnqXwS3efVgS7k%3D', 37.6016295, 126.9618036, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 선재 업고 튀어\n- **촬영지**: CU종로신영점\n- **방문팁**: 이곳에서 드라마 속 장면을 재현해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\nCU종로신영점은 드라마 "선재 업고 튀어"의 촬영지로, 젊은이들이 모여 즐거운 시간을 보내는 장소입니다. 이곳은 편안한 분위기와 다양한 간식들로 가득해, 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 친구들과 함께 방문하면 더욱 즐거운 시간을 보낼 수 있을 것입니다.', 'CU Jongro Shinyoung Branch is the filming location of the drama Bounce on your back and is a place where young people gather and have a good time This place is filled with a comfortable atmosphere and a variety of snacks providing a special experience for drama fans You will have a lot of fun if you visit with your friends while remembering the scene that was filmed'),
	(655, '선재 업고 튀어', '서울시립대학교 인문학관', '서울 동대문구 서울시립대로 163 회기역2번출구 도보14분', '서울시립대학교 인문학관은 현대적인 건축과 아름다운 자연이 조화를 이루는 곳입니다 이곳은 드라마 선재 업고 튀어의 촬영지로 학생들의 활기찬 일상과 다양한 학문적 활동을 엿볼 수 있는 장소입니다 캠퍼스를 거닐며 드라마 속 주인공들의 발자취를 따라가 보세요 또한 인근의 카페나 도서관에서 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것도 추천합니다', '#학교, #캠퍼스, #드라마촬영지, #서울, #학생생활', '학교/대학', 'University of Seoul Museum of Humanities', 'Let\'s carry Sunjae and run', '14-minute walk from Exit 2 of Syegi Station, 163 University of Seoul, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul', 'a school/college', '#School, #campus, #drama shooting location, #Seoul, #studentlife', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCZ2RX/btsHhsT4MQV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEkz9sw40WZ3b6mIaZG38pt-L4gGwl5Vd0FZoPfTWqs7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IXuIa3na6VqsD0GViEwOOP0UHhE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bOQwAG/btsHcpkPCyK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAChpgwx1Tb9suqrd4u72wVVHAECdwWBWplJ3pKHmW1me/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7lxjS7MWz4l98%2Fsn7lB6HYOzweE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/I2yjT/btsHgePGvdV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACHryr2miv1kIqWEg_CqhwVEXJmtJhluUcFU7e2Dtahv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BZeTdaZckOCq3tcbK4bEWshNbI8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCZ2RX/btsHhsT4MQV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEkz9sw40WZ3b6mIaZG38pt-L4gGwl5Vd0FZoPfTWqs7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IXuIa3na6VqsD0GViEwOOP0UHhE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bOQwAG/btsHcpkPCyK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAChpgwx1Tb9suqrd4u72wVVHAECdwWBWplJ3pKHmW1me/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7lxjS7MWz4l98%2Fsn7lB6HYOzweE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/I2yjT/btsHgePGvdV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACHryr2miv1kIqWEg_CqhwVEXJmtJhluUcFU7e2Dtahv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BZeTdaZckOCq3tcbK4bEWshNbI8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCZ2RX/btsHhsT4MQV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEkz9sw40WZ3b6mIaZG38pt-L4gGwl5Vd0FZoPfTWqs7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IXuIa3na6VqsD0GViEwOOP0UHhE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bOQwAG/btsHcpkPCyK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAChpgwx1Tb9suqrd4u72wVVHAECdwWBWplJ3pKHmW1me/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7lxjS7MWz4l98%2Fsn7lB6HYOzweE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/I2yjT/btsHgePGvdV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACHryr2miv1kIqWEg_CqhwVEXJmtJhluUcFU7e2Dtahv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BZeTdaZckOCq3tcbK4bEWshNbI8%3D', 37.5834233, 127.0600271, '### 학교 촬영지 정보\n- **제목**: 선재 업고 튀어\n- **촬영지**: 서울시립대학교 인문학관\n- **방문팁**: 다양한 학문과 문화가 어우러지는 캠퍼스를 즐겨보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Campus\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 학교\n\n### 여행 포인트\n서울시립대학교 인문학관은 현대적인 건축과 아름다운 자연이 조화를 이루는 곳입니다. 이곳은 드라마 "선재 업고 튀어"의 촬영지로, 학생들의 활기찬 일상과 다양한 학문적 활동을 엿볼 수 있는 장소입니다. 캠퍼스를 거닐며 드라마 속 주인공들의 발자취를 따라가 보세요. 또한, 인근의 카페나 도서관에서 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것도 추천합니다.', 'The University of Seoul Humanities Museum is a place where modern architecture and beautiful nature are in harmony This is the filming location of the drama Bounce with Sunjae where students can get a glimpse of their vibrant daily lives and various academic activities Walk through campus and follow in the footsteps of the main characters in the drama It is also recommended to spend a leisurely time at nearby cafes or libraries'),
	(656, '선재 업고 튀어', '상상플래닛', '서울 성동구 뚝섬로13길 38 성수역3번출구 도보7분', '상상플래닛은 드라마 선재 업고 튀어의 촬영지로 많은 팬들이 찾는 명소입니다 이곳은 현대적인 건축물과 세련된 디자인이 어우러져 있어 드라마 속 장면을 직접 느낄 수 있는 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 시간을 보내기에도 좋은 장소입니다', '#KdramaTrip #상상플래닛 #촬영지 #선재업고튀어 #팬명소 #서울', '기타/판별불가', 'Imagination Planet', 'Let\'s carry Sunjae and run', '7-minute walk from Exit 3 of Seongsu Station, 38, Ttukseom-ro 13-gil, Seongdong-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#KdramaTrip #ImaginationPlanet #FilmingPlane #Pre-release #FanAttractions #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/3VNYK/btsHul3AybU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK0otcVGZIGLc4U9YvSBHNjp2sjEwVhjg_MXnN41eCgw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XdwRsnM5nXm5kCaJ%2Fq7lEWrT%2BCQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cc0BpE/btsHvynp46s/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADoCZaQ-v2jt5O53XV_A209tXkRTJt3bjvub6dEU4_3q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Vd93O5T9gQPsw73GZtVtH4BjmU0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/3VNYK/btsHul3AybU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK0otcVGZIGLc4U9YvSBHNjp2sjEwVhjg_MXnN41eCgw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XdwRsnM5nXm5kCaJ%2Fq7lEWrT%2BCQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cc0BpE/btsHvynp46s/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADoCZaQ-v2jt5O53XV_A209tXkRTJt3bjvub6dEU4_3q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Vd93O5T9gQPsw73GZtVtH4BjmU0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/3VNYK/btsHul3AybU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK0otcVGZIGLc4U9YvSBHNjp2sjEwVhjg_MXnN41eCgw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XdwRsnM5nXm5kCaJ%2Fq7lEWrT%2BCQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cc0BpE/btsHvynp46s/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADoCZaQ-v2jt5O53XV_A209tXkRTJt3bjvub6dEU4_3q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Vd93O5T9gQPsw73GZtVtH4BjmU0%3D', NULL, 37.5414197, 127.0581953, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 선재 업고 튀어\n- **촬영지:** 상상플래닛\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 주요 촬영지로, 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n상상플래닛은 드라마 "선재 업고 튀어"의 촬영지로 많은 팬들이 찾는 명소입니다. 이곳은 현대적인 건축물과 세련된 디자인이 어우러져 있어, 드라마 속 장면을 직접 느낄 수 있는 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 시간을 보내기에도 좋은 장소입니다.', 'Sangsang Planet is a popular spot for many fans as the filming location for the drama Bounce With Sunjae This place is a combination of modern architecture and sophisticated design providing a special experience where you can feel the scenes in the drama firsthand There are various cafes and shops nearby so it is a good place to spend time leisurely after visiting the filming location'),
	(657, '선재 업고 튀어', '성수낙낙', '서울 성동구 아차산로17길 48 성수역4번출구 버스9분', '성수낙낙은 밤에 특히 매력적인 장소로 아름다운 조명과 함께 산책하기 좋은 분위기를 제공합니다 이곳은 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 여유로운 시간을 즐기기에 적합합니다 드라마의 한 장면처럼 로맨틱한 순간을 만끽할 수 있는 완벽한 장소입니다', '#로맨틱 #야경 #산책 #데이트 #카페', '거리/골목/광장', 'Seongsu Nak Nak Nak', 'Let\'s carry Sunjae and run', 'Bus 9 minutes from Exit 4 of Seongsu Station, 48, Achasan-ro 17-gil, Seongdong-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Romantic #nightscape #walk #date #café', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bKlHJ8/btsG4xH6MGc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACidxvNbxxUQ72on79ArMzy-bsEaJMO4u5L8tsBX51p9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=w3sJ6vrOInk2QQW4cJ58437kchM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4GMRs/btsGZVYFi2z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIQkpSXN5TH1kZTVyH2YRWF92XZ15VQoJ--OlVQSjBAL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iO%2B6SP57NnFMU%2FzJv%2BEPM1WUqPs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HmYtw/btsG3yOeH6a/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACGn15yRosg7LtEXwnNBzw9stUQAa-XFTyPIjTomxuRa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8Ntb22SHN%2Bk97JWDGpgsPrLs6Vg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bYIoB2/btsG13BqPem/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALGVE4-TUMJsP3P_rRDB4dxybZ5UiCGI5Ob7q9ESCvmq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2skruekW7MkzvKo%2FGPVPyT%2BTOw4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bKlHJ8/btsG4xH6MGc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACidxvNbxxUQ72on79ArMzy-bsEaJMO4u5L8tsBX51p9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=w3sJ6vrOInk2QQW4cJ58437kchM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4GMRs/btsGZVYFi2z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIQkpSXN5TH1kZTVyH2YRWF92XZ15VQoJ--OlVQSjBAL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iO%2B6SP57NnFMU%2FzJv%2BEPM1WUqPs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HmYtw/btsG3yOeH6a/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACGn15yRosg7LtEXwnNBzw9stUQAa-XFTyPIjTomxuRa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8Ntb22SHN%2Bk97JWDGpgsPrLs6Vg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bYIoB2/btsG13BqPem/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALGVE4-TUMJsP3P_rRDB4dxybZ5UiCGI5Ob7q9ESCvmq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2skruekW7MkzvKo%2FGPVPyT%2BTOw4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bKlHJ8/btsG4xH6MGc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACidxvNbxxUQ72on79ArMzy-bsEaJMO4u5L8tsBX51p9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=w3sJ6vrOInk2QQW4cJ58437kchM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4GMRs/btsGZVYFi2z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIQkpSXN5TH1kZTVyH2YRWF92XZ15VQoJ--OlVQSjBAL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iO%2B6SP57NnFMU%2FzJv%2BEPM1WUqPs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HmYtw/btsG3yOeH6a/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACGn15yRosg7LtEXwnNBzw9stUQAa-XFTyPIjTomxuRa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8Ntb22SHN%2Bk97JWDGpgsPrLs6Vg%3D', 37.5466713, 127.0661249, '### 거리: 성수낙낙\n**드라마 정보**  \n- **제목**: 선재 업고 튀어  \n- **촬영지**: 성수낙낙  \n- **방문팁**: 조명이 아름다운 저녁 시간에 방문해 보세요.  \n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #성수낙낙  \n- **작가**: 미상  \n- **카테고리**: 거리  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n성수낙낙은 밤에 특히 매력적인 장소로, 아름다운 조명과 함께 산책하기 좋은 분위기를 제공합니다. 이곳은 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 여유로운 시간을 즐기기에 적합합니다. 드라마의 한 장면처럼 로맨틱한 순간을 만끽할 수 있는 완벽한 장소입니다.', 'Seongsu Nak Nak is a particularly attractive place at night providing a nice atmosphere for a walk with beautiful lighting This place has a variety of cafes and shops so its perfect for enjoying a leisurely time Its the perfect place to enjoy a romantic moment like a scene in a drama'),
	(658, '선재 업고 튀어', '아크레도 청담점', '서울 강남구 압구정로 410 압구정로데오역3번출구 도보3분', '아크레도 청담점은 드라마 선재 업고 튀어의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다 드라마의 특정 장면을 떠올리며 커피 한 잔과 함께 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 완벽한 장소입니다 주변의 아름다운 거리 풍경과 함께 드라마의 감성을 만끽해 보세요', '#드라마촬영지, #카페, #서울관광, #커피, #청담동, #여유로운시간', '카페/레스토랑', 'Acredo Cheongdam Branch', 'Let\'s carry Sunjae and run', '410 Apgujeong-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul, 3 minutes walk from Apgujeong Rodeo Station Exit 3', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Drama filming location, #Cafe, #SeoulTourism, #Coffee, #Cheongdam-dong, #RelaxedTime', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/O4GAw/btsHE92iTha/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABVPWCly6Qfi_cPlKW_9b-qHqbA8S_3UGuXykLsSMREp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LDK9XQ5OzRb4VA5TBRFZTXAkmvk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4Vjga/btsHGTX6SoT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHiS8MbogMuOk7oU_Y2a3X3vuxlwzKKsma4rYpoKrzlG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=N1OldFxvesRfJxX4vPUKglUUp2o%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GXt1w/btsHEm2uIAs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIZ3MmeTCC8o9TP_036aUIsk3aMQu6BipKlvHqF-17cn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4YiRE2LB1pECNGdS%2FcVMU8xLv%2Bg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Im6qz/btsHES0NrWE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJKNesF_Lti5yS9CVy43ucNNyC4Gta9bmcNVnGB43HZR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hGGQ3T7uTUTv1uCAuGtKoVE9xzo%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/O4GAw/btsHE92iTha/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABVPWCly6Qfi_cPlKW_9b-qHqbA8S_3UGuXykLsSMREp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LDK9XQ5OzRb4VA5TBRFZTXAkmvk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4Vjga/btsHGTX6SoT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHiS8MbogMuOk7oU_Y2a3X3vuxlwzKKsma4rYpoKrzlG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=N1OldFxvesRfJxX4vPUKglUUp2o%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GXt1w/btsHEm2uIAs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIZ3MmeTCC8o9TP_036aUIsk3aMQu6BipKlvHqF-17cn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4YiRE2LB1pECNGdS%2FcVMU8xLv%2Bg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Im6qz/btsHES0NrWE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJKNesF_Lti5yS9CVy43ucNNyC4Gta9bmcNVnGB43HZR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hGGQ3T7uTUTv1uCAuGtKoVE9xzo%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/O4GAw/btsHE92iTha/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABVPWCly6Qfi_cPlKW_9b-qHqbA8S_3UGuXykLsSMREp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LDK9XQ5OzRb4VA5TBRFZTXAkmvk%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4Vjga/btsHGTX6SoT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHiS8MbogMuOk7oU_Y2a3X3vuxlwzKKsma4rYpoKrzlG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=N1OldFxvesRfJxX4vPUKglUUp2o%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GXt1w/btsHEm2uIAs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIZ3MmeTCC8o9TP_036aUIsk3aMQu6BipKlvHqF-17cn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4YiRE2LB1pECNGdS%2FcVMU8xLv%2Bg%3D', 37.52723659999999, 127.0416602, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 선재 업고 튀어\n- **촬영지**: 아크레도 청담점\n- **방문팁**: 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유롭게 커피를 즐겨보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n아크레도 청담점은 드라마 "선재 업고 튀어"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다. 드라마의 특정 장면을 떠올리며 커피 한 잔과 함께 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 완벽한 장소입니다. 주변의 아름다운 거리 풍경과 함께 드라마의 감성을 만끽해 보세요.', 'The Acredo Cheongdam branch is the filming location of the drama Bounce With Sunjae and it is a cafe with a stylish interior and a cozy atmosphere Its the perfect place to spend a leisurely time with a cup of coffee while recalling a specific scene in a drama Enjoy the sensibility of the drama with the beautiful street scenery around you'),
	(659, '선재 업고 튀어', '29펍 4호점', '서울 강남구 강남대로110길 14 신논현역4번출구 도보4분', '29펍 4호점은 드라마 선재 업고 튀어의 촬영지로 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 이곳은 아늑한 분위기 속에서 다양한 음료를 즐길 수 있으며 드라마의 인기 장면을 생생하게 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다 친구들과 함께 방문하면 더욱 즐거운 추억을 만들 수 있습니다', '#펍 #dramaLocation #친구와함께 #서울여행 #선재업고튀어', '기타/판별불가', '29 Pub 4', 'Let\'s carry Sunjae and run', '4-minute walk from Exit 4 of Sinnonhyeon Station, 14, Gangnam-daero 110-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Pub #dramaLocation #WithFriend #SeoulTravel #Pre-release and run', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bvzZnF/btsG4TFuKtk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMAT2wkL1v79PhuKqHdscFT0j0VRgsY04tosEJWImblO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XhEjqhAtEqMC7%2Fiq1F1ZOEFqb%2FI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bi2b2p/btsG3PcwS2z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOCeBkwgpO1ugSc7m5Px-qFnXjblWMN0CmvrVjhe0efw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ea57sdCMJLy8H7xvj7QOuBAVIPs%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bvzZnF/btsG4TFuKtk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMAT2wkL1v79PhuKqHdscFT0j0VRgsY04tosEJWImblO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XhEjqhAtEqMC7%2Fiq1F1ZOEFqb%2FI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bi2b2p/btsG3PcwS2z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOCeBkwgpO1ugSc7m5Px-qFnXjblWMN0CmvrVjhe0efw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ea57sdCMJLy8H7xvj7QOuBAVIPs%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bvzZnF/btsG4TFuKtk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMAT2wkL1v79PhuKqHdscFT0j0VRgsY04tosEJWImblO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XhEjqhAtEqMC7%2Fiq1F1ZOEFqb%2FI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bi2b2p/btsG3PcwS2z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOCeBkwgpO1ugSc7m5Px-qFnXjblWMN0CmvrVjhe0efw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ea57sdCMJLy8H7xvj7QOuBAVIPs%3D', NULL, 37.5037581, 127.0260654, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 선재 업고 튀어\n- **촬영지**: 29펍 4호점\n- **방문팁**: 다양한 음료와 함께 즐거운 시간을 보낼 수 있는 곳입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n29펍 4호점은 드라마 "선재 업고 튀어"의 촬영지로, 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 이곳은 아늑한 분위기 속에서 다양한 음료를 즐길 수 있으며, 드라마의 인기 장면을 생생하게 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다. 친구들과 함께 방문하면 더욱 즐거운 추억을 만들 수 있습니다.', 'The 29th pub No 4 is the filming location of the drama Bounce With Sunjae and offers fans a special experience This is a place where you can enjoy various drinks in a cozy atmosphere and feel the popular scenes of the drama vividly If you visit with your friends you can make more enjoyable memories'),
	(660, '닥터슬럼프', '신한은행 앞', '서울 마포구 양화로 111 홍대입구역1번출구 도보7분', '신한은행 앞은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 다양한 장면이 촬영된 장소로 서울 마포구의 활기찬 거리 풍경을 감상할 수 있습니다 이곳은 낮과 밤 모두 매력적인 분위기를 자아내며 주변 카페나 음식점에서 여유롭게 시간을 보내기에도 적합합니다 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있습니다', '#닥터슬럼프 #촬영지 #서울 #마포구 #거리 #사진명소', '거리/골목/광장', 'In front of Shinhan Bank', 'Dr. Slump', 'Hongik University Station Exit 1, 111 Yanghwa-ro, Mapo-gu, Seoul, 7 minutes walk', 'a street/alley/square', '#Dr. Slump #FilmingPlace #Seoul #Mapo-gu #Street #PhotographyPlot', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/k4mle/btsEFN11EOw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD4wDrGA7YwU43b7m7sD56UULPIuk6OW105wb1qm7LWe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X%2FqKOaIMIsMQJiRHc6SoeV1sYRo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/brlmo4/btsEKC50KPU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPZNPgXApbwno3w-oCYLFgP-rkKsPeTtiRCYFml3hEaB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6WoR5ORMPiY%2Bg%2BOcpai4%2F2FPX3k%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0rGmo/btsEKDRnEaU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHXEIMFjdxTq_oDXARUvyiDWjcoIq7dr3HuonFjSTsi-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uN309%2FuhDg3D7pHQ%2FVZygt1i5yA%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/k4mle/btsEFN11EOw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD4wDrGA7YwU43b7m7sD56UULPIuk6OW105wb1qm7LWe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X%2FqKOaIMIsMQJiRHc6SoeV1sYRo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/brlmo4/btsEKC50KPU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPZNPgXApbwno3w-oCYLFgP-rkKsPeTtiRCYFml3hEaB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6WoR5ORMPiY%2Bg%2BOcpai4%2F2FPX3k%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0rGmo/btsEKDRnEaU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHXEIMFjdxTq_oDXARUvyiDWjcoIq7dr3HuonFjSTsi-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uN309%2FuhDg3D7pHQ%2FVZygt1i5yA%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/k4mle/btsEFN11EOw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD4wDrGA7YwU43b7m7sD56UULPIuk6OW105wb1qm7LWe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X%2FqKOaIMIsMQJiRHc6SoeV1sYRo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/brlmo4/btsEKC50KPU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPZNPgXApbwno3w-oCYLFgP-rkKsPeTtiRCYFml3hEaB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6WoR5ORMPiY%2Bg%2BOcpai4%2F2FPX3k%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0rGmo/btsEKDRnEaU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHXEIMFjdxTq_oDXARUvyiDWjcoIq7dr3HuonFjSTsi-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uN309%2FuhDg3D7pHQ%2FVZygt1i5yA%3D', 37.5537858, 126.9190121, '### 거리 촬영지 정보\n\n**제목:** 닥터슬럼프  \n**촬영지:** 신한은행 앞  \n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면이 촬영된 곳으로, 분위기를 만끽하며 사진을 찍기 좋은 장소입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #서울 #마포구 #양화로  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n신한은행 앞은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 다양한 장면이 촬영된 장소로, 서울 마포구의 활기찬 거리 풍경을 감상할 수 있습니다. 이곳은 낮과 밤 모두 매력적인 분위기를 자아내며, 주변 카페나 음식점에서 여유롭게 시간을 보내기에도 적합합니다. 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있습니다.', 'The front of Shinhan Bank is the place where various scenes of the drama Doctor Slump were filmed and you can enjoy the vibrant street scenes of Mapogu Seoul This place creates an attractive atmosphere both day and night and is also suitable for relaxing in nearby cafes and restaurants If you are a drama fan you can leave a special memory by recalling the scene filmed here'),
	(661, '닥터슬럼프', '카페공명 연남점', '서울 마포구 연희로 11 홍대입구역3번출구 도보4분', '카페공명 연남점은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 촬영지로 감성적인 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로 많은 사랑을 받고 있습니다 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 장소로 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 카페에서 제공하는 다양한 음료와 디저트를 즐기며 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 느껴보세요 친구들과의 담소나 혼자만의 시간을 보내기에 적합한 공간입니다', '#닥터슬럼프 #카페공명 #서울카페 #드라마촬영지 #감성카페', '카페/레스토랑', 'Cafe Gongjin Yeonnam Branch', 'Dr. Slump', 'Hongik University Station Exit 3 of Yeonhui-ro 11, Mapo-gu, Seoul, 4 minutes on foot', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Dr. Slump #CafeResonance #SeoulCafe #DramaFilmingPlace #EmotionalCafe', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bpstJ4/btsEtuUFlGk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKwmFtyFJUnyWOjtVGK-tAwd5TQjNwK5DDTXkjb5lqpB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=js5%2BpeLbnziIV4VZJK6tDJa9Nd8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/djakxh/btsEnSbfsZI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB9xvPAwu5zmnuKa1QgYYwtiiE1nEY5VudDKqZfAC26G/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BVp2Zo5dXojKHg%2FvUyIXHCFIuB8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dH6PBE/btsEnRwARcn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIuBU2L0envGcd5tmDXT3TTkR2ZvC-AcZWlhFxVsIr7I/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9vuhAuyFIQDwbk%2BDiDxv4Ur9NWA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bHEKW3/btsEmDlzoxH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGl02_hE2SIpib3PFHvxohPtBpr7wbaZP7LfinRZYxFt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cDh1vPJGck8Np0dbjEhmEW5yvaU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bpstJ4/btsEtuUFlGk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKwmFtyFJUnyWOjtVGK-tAwd5TQjNwK5DDTXkjb5lqpB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=js5%2BpeLbnziIV4VZJK6tDJa9Nd8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/djakxh/btsEnSbfsZI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB9xvPAwu5zmnuKa1QgYYwtiiE1nEY5VudDKqZfAC26G/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BVp2Zo5dXojKHg%2FvUyIXHCFIuB8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dH6PBE/btsEnRwARcn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIuBU2L0envGcd5tmDXT3TTkR2ZvC-AcZWlhFxVsIr7I/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9vuhAuyFIQDwbk%2BDiDxv4Ur9NWA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bHEKW3/btsEmDlzoxH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGl02_hE2SIpib3PFHvxohPtBpr7wbaZP7LfinRZYxFt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cDh1vPJGck8Np0dbjEhmEW5yvaU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bpstJ4/btsEtuUFlGk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKwmFtyFJUnyWOjtVGK-tAwd5TQjNwK5DDTXkjb5lqpB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=js5%2BpeLbnziIV4VZJK6tDJa9Nd8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/djakxh/btsEnSbfsZI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB9xvPAwu5zmnuKa1QgYYwtiiE1nEY5VudDKqZfAC26G/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BVp2Zo5dXojKHg%2FvUyIXHCFIuB8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dH6PBE/btsEnRwARcn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIuBU2L0envGcd5tmDXT3TTkR2ZvC-AcZWlhFxVsIr7I/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9vuhAuyFIQDwbk%2BDiDxv4Ur9NWA%3D', 37.5599071, 126.9262452, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**닥터슬럼프 | 카페공명 연남점**\n\n- **제목:** 닥터슬럼프\n- **촬영지:** 카페공명 연남점\n- **방문팁:** 드라마 속 분위기를 만끽하며 여유로운 시간을 보내세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n카페공명 연남점은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 촬영지로, 감성적인 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로 많은 사랑을 받고 있습니다. 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 장소로, 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 카페에서 제공하는 다양한 음료와 디저트를 즐기며, 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 느껴보세요. 친구들과의 담소나 혼자만의 시간을 보내기에 적합한 공간입니다.', 'Caf Resonance Yeonnam Branch is the filming location of the drama Dr Slump and is loved for its emotional interior and cozy atmosphere This is the place where the main scenes of the drama were filmed providing fans with a special experience Enjoy the variety of drinks and desserts provided by the cafe and feel like you are the main character in the drama It is a suitable space for chatting with friends or spending time alone'),
	(662, '닥터슬럼프', 'CGV연남점', '서울 마포구 양화로 186 홍대입구역4번출구 바로앞', 'CGV연남점은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 촬영지로 영화 상영 전후에 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 특별한 장소입니다 이곳은 현대적인 분위기와 다양한 편의시설이 갖춰져 있어 친구나 연인과 함께 방문하기에 적합합니다 또한 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 그 순간을 재현해보는 것도 즐거운 경험이 될 것입니다 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 한번 들러보세요', '#영화관, #촬영지, #드라마팬, #데이트, #여행', '스튜디오/세트장', 'CGV Yeonnam Branch', 'Dr. Slump', 'Right in front of Exit 4 of Hongik University Station, 186 Yanghwa-ro, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a studio/set', '#Movie theater, #filming locations, #dramafans, #date, #travel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cTfbvo/btsEYBtUugK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKdVEx70U79J2dmQbvLAhWxZp_mr_OXD-xoYwlqgj2Ib/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9GvLchtqiCn85vQDkKTf8g4hbls%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/y5E1H/btsE0g97YC8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKsz92RkxCn-ipo1mzvjZzBFBiN0DY8k587pv0AaF1cl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PgGvuWblAFkj4Ik6kGWQc2aWaJI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCONsU/btsEYVTaMOc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMPV7YMNBYRGyuS7fUDUiqcikfrIFQxaXlRavgO6rdar/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LIdDEbQXyslkrxEldhznr9HNRVE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/baNs5T/btsEYNARI0J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB-gOaS8jAZGKC4BjITf2ASpMwplXhAMU78x5Qq9oqs_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pSYHM5J9JyExZX5RqaR%2Fbb3R8XE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cTfbvo/btsEYBtUugK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKdVEx70U79J2dmQbvLAhWxZp_mr_OXD-xoYwlqgj2Ib/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9GvLchtqiCn85vQDkKTf8g4hbls%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/y5E1H/btsE0g97YC8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKsz92RkxCn-ipo1mzvjZzBFBiN0DY8k587pv0AaF1cl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PgGvuWblAFkj4Ik6kGWQc