	(663, '닥터슬럼프', '신촌 인생네컷 앞', '서울 서대문구 연세로 20 신촌역3번출구 도보3분', '신촌 인생네컷 앞은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 주요 촬영지로 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 장소입니다 이곳에서는 드라마 속 캐릭터들과의 만남처럼 느껴질 수 있는 사진 촬영이 가능하며 주변 카페와 상점들도 함께 즐길 수 있어 하루를 알차게 보낼 수 있습니다 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 친구들과 함께 방문해 보세요', '#KdramaTrip #신촌 #닥터슬럼프 #사진촬영 #드라마촬영지', '기타/판별불가', 'In front of Sinchon Life Four Cut', 'Dr. Slump', '3-minute walk from Exit 3 of Sinchon Station, 20, Yonsei-ro, Seodaemun-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#KdramaTrip #Sinchon #Dr.Slump #PhotoShooting #DramaShootingPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IsCH5/btsFh8qtTJg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPCfW_myLGtC1yuncOSGVJ8B07QJ1pkZbATIuNCGfzMA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HlfQVTcy8W0SYic%2FEf0k4Lj21Sc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IK0Bt/btsFjUSM1Ub/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKPi79rArd6JuEjN7o263NHm5-L7N6guwGoWFSUesgaL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rNjd5urNGzusLFcPr4lVPhl%2FQ2U%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cBpv3e/btsFf5nYRUW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANMwJu13SR3NqCCfWBXgZ66aNln-2cFF4pRDJ03HlTAX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Q59cHIpL%2FgpEg8PYyPELKvq4mqw%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IsCH5/btsFh8qtTJg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPCfW_myLGtC1yuncOSGVJ8B07QJ1pkZbATIuNCGfzMA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HlfQVTcy8W0SYic%2FEf0k4Lj21Sc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IK0Bt/btsFjUSM1Ub/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKPi79rArd6JuEjN7o263NHm5-L7N6guwGoWFSUesgaL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rNjd5urNGzusLFcPr4lVPhl%2FQ2U%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cBpv3e/btsFf5nYRUW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANMwJu13SR3NqCCfWBXgZ66aNln-2cFF4pRDJ03HlTAX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Q59cHIpL%2FgpEg8PYyPELKvq4mqw%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IsCH5/btsFh8qtTJg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPCfW_myLGtC1yuncOSGVJ8B07QJ1pkZbATIuNCGfzMA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HlfQVTcy8W0SYic%2FEf0k4Lj21Sc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IK0Bt/btsFjUSM1Ub/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKPi79rArd6JuEjN7o263NHm5-L7N6guwGoWFSUesgaL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rNjd5urNGzusLFcPr4lVPhl%2FQ2U%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cBpv3e/btsFf5nYRUW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANMwJu13SR3NqCCfWBXgZ66aNln-2cFF4pRDJ03HlTAX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Q59cHIpL%2FgpEg8PYyPELKvq4mqw%3D', 37.5575384, 126.9371516, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 닥터슬럼프\n- **촬영지:** 신촌 인생네컷 앞\n- **방문팁:** 드라마 속 장면을 재현하며 사진을 찍어보세요!\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n신촌 인생네컷 앞은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 주요 촬영지로, 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 장소입니다. 이곳에서는 드라마 속 캐릭터들과의 만남처럼 느껴질 수 있는 사진 촬영이 가능하며, 주변 카페와 상점들도 함께 즐길 수 있어 하루를 알차게 보낼 수 있습니다. 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 친구들과 함께 방문해 보세요!', 'Sinchon Life Four Cut is the main filming location for the drama Dr Slump and it is a place where fans can leave special memories Here you can take pictures that can feel like meeting the characters in the drama and you can enjoy the cafes and shops around you together so you can spend the day well Feel the sensibility of the drama and visit with your friends'),
	(664, '닥터슬럼프', '고바우 앞', '서울 서대문구 명물1길 22 신촌역3번출구 위에서1분', '고바우 앞은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 상징적인 촬영지로 현대적인 서울의 분위기와 함께 아기자기한 골목길의 매력을 동시에 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다 이곳은 다양한 카페와 맛집이 인접해 있어 드라마 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 식사나 커피를 즐기기에 안성맞춤입니다 또한 거리의 독특한 풍경은 사진 촬영에 좋은 장소로 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다', '#닥터슬럼프 #촬영지 #서대문구 #서울 #거리 #고바우', '거리/골목/광장', 'In front of Gobau', 'Dr. Slump', '1 minute above Sinchon Station Exit 3, 22, Myeongmul 1-gil, Seodaemun-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Dr. Slump #FilmingPlace #Seodaemun-gu #Seoul #Street #Gobau', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bcUUqT/btsFhoNTNZw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGmtHWHNJOX5WwMISosGCDSXE8yFqzCZ_Xuk219GemNi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=g9SFyf9p04J5mc4vpXcROlSs2fc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cjmhBd/btsFh8DZC61/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAER7JqD9VWLa90XL0Lueom6-_6YTz9_aNJnFMvFN0kUj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=h%2FTXqaOEhNra6bzu0leS9KVlj%2F0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bELrDq/btsFkHFIOFe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADH7eIg23DGHpfV5c7h6kOwYHNG8tnCGzwRKOm0QDb-Q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AqputGcZAuYZfEsQMmav6jEfeHo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d6jbpl/btsFffxES5v/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA-TYvG0uRAzvVWXP384quT8gMFlVnzQ2KkGjL_YgTKh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oGvmLt4KffGWvzipWclR14XiKxA%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bcUUqT/btsFhoNTNZw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGmtHWHNJOX5WwMISosGCDSXE8yFqzCZ_Xuk219GemNi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=g9SFyf9p04J5mc4vpXcROlSs2fc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cjmhBd/btsFh8DZC61/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAER7JqD9VWLa90XL0Lueom6-_6YTz9_aNJnFMvFN0kUj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=h%2FTXqaOEhNra6bzu0leS9KVlj%2F0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bELrDq/btsFkHFIOFe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADH7eIg23DGHpfV5c7h6kOwYHNG8tnCGzwRKOm0QDb-Q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AqputGcZAuYZfEsQMmav6jEfeHo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d6jbpl/btsFffxES5v/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA-TYvG0uRAzvVWXP384quT8gMFlVnzQ2KkGjL_YgTKh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oGvmLt4KffGWvzipWclR14XiKxA%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bcUUqT/btsFhoNTNZw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGmtHWHNJOX5WwMISosGCDSXE8yFqzCZ_Xuk219GemNi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=g9SFyf9p04J5mc4vpXcROlSs2fc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cjmhBd/btsFh8DZC61/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAER7JqD9VWLa90XL0Lueom6-_6YTz9_aNJnFMvFN0kUj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=h%2FTXqaOEhNra6bzu0leS9KVlj%2F0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bELrDq/btsFkHFIOFe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADH7eIg23DGHpfV5c7h6kOwYHNG8tnCGzwRKOm0QDb-Q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AqputGcZAuYZfEsQMmav6jEfeHo%3D', 37.558406, 126.9373268, '### 거리 촬영지 정보\n\n**제목:** 닥터슬럼프  \n**촬영지:** 고바우 앞  \n**방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 주요 장면을 감상하며 카메라에 담아보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #서울 #서대문구 #명물1길  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n고바우 앞은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 상징적인 촬영지로, 현대적인 서울의 분위기와 함께 아기자기한 골목길의 매력을 동시에 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다. 이곳은 다양한 카페와 맛집이 인접해 있어 드라마 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 식사나 커피를 즐기기에 안성맞춤입니다. 또한, 거리의 독특한 풍경은 사진 촬영에 좋은 장소로, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다.', 'The front of Gobau is the iconic filming location of the drama Dr Slump where you can feel the charm of cute alleyways at the same time with the modern atmosphere of Seoul This place is close to various cafes and restaurants so it is perfect for enjoying a leisurely meal or coffee after visiting the filming location of the drama In addition the unique scenery of the street is a great place for photography giving drama fans a chance to leave special memories'),
	(665, '닥터슬럼프', '세븐일레븐 신촌원룸점', '서울 서대문구 성산로22길 22 신촌역3번출구 위에서7분', '세븐일레븐 신촌원룸점은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 촬영지로 등장인물들이 나누는 소소한 대화와 일상적인 순간들이 담긴 장소입니다 이곳에서 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 다양한 간식과 음료를 즐기며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 친구들과 함께 방문하면 더욱 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있을 것입니다', '#닥터슬럼프 #드라마촬영지 #서울 #편안한시간 #세븐일레븐 #소소한대화', '기타/판별불가', '7-ELEVEN Sinchon One Room Branch', 'Dr. Slump', '7 minutes above Sinchon Station Exit 3, 22, Seongsan-ro 22-gil, Seodaemun-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Dr. Slump #DramaFilmingPlace #Seoul #ComfortableTime #SevenEleven #SmallConversation', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eoUtMx/btsEHIew4On/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABoR3ul9bdGn8R6J-PScNR3PITPyiu4mXHwNF0pdiJYa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HOPMKL5usKogvmrHbUJPMj%2B0atg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Z7c8m/btsEEHVM3pw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEPcf_Ge9YbgkQTxpzSGql0BvuXZMnSD4yQkoT19Zk-l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DlcxoNYb6CR%2Ft8GyIJoJVNfgwL0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bvzaXM/btsEGOzktwK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM6e2_feOFf24_mLeWQCUXKNl1xjixJAY5TNusu_KU38/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rcN5%2BRwNgayqmXtI8GIxtmP%2FWBM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eoUtMx/btsEHIew4On/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABoR3ul9bdGn8R6J-PScNR3PITPyiu4mXHwNF0pdiJYa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HOPMKL5usKogvmrHbUJPMj%2B0atg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Z7c8m/btsEEHVM3pw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEPcf_Ge9YbgkQTxpzSGql0BvuXZMnSD4yQkoT19Zk-l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DlcxoNYb6CR%2Ft8GyIJoJVNfgwL0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bvzaXM/btsEGOzktwK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM6e2_feOFf24_mLeWQCUXKNl1xjixJAY5TNusu_KU38/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rcN5%2BRwNgayqmXtI8GIxtmP%2FWBM%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eoUtMx/btsEHIew4On/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABoR3ul9bdGn8R6J-PScNR3PITPyiu4mXHwNF0pdiJYa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HOPMKL5usKogvmrHbUJPMj%2B0atg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Z7c8m/btsEEHVM3pw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEPcf_Ge9YbgkQTxpzSGql0BvuXZMnSD4yQkoT19Zk-l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DlcxoNYb6CR%2Ft8GyIJoJVNfgwL0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bvzaXM/btsEGOzktwK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM6e2_feOFf24_mLeWQCUXKNl1xjixJAY5TNusu_KU38/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rcN5%2BRwNgayqmXtI8GIxtmP%2FWBM%3D', 37.5598915, 126.9340445, '### 기타 | 2개 | #Unclear\n\n**닥터슬럼프**  \n**촬영지:** 세븐일레븐 신촌원룸점  \n**방문팁:** 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 편안한 시간을 보내세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 기타  \n\n#### 여행 포인트\n세븐일레븐 신촌원룸점은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 촬영지로, 등장인물들이 나누는 소소한 대화와 일상적인 순간들이 담긴 장소입니다. 이곳에서 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며, 다양한 간식과 음료를 즐기며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 친구들과 함께 방문하면 더욱 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있을 것입니다.', '7Eleven Shinchon One Room is the filming location of the drama Dr Slump which contains small conversations and everyday moments that the characters share Here you can think of the scenes in the drama enjoy a variety of snacks and drinks and have a relaxing time If you visit with your friends you will be able to make more special memories'),
	(666, '닥터슬럼프', '신승반점 여의도점', '서울 영등포구 국제금융로2길 32 여의도역3번출구 도보2분', '신승반점 여의도점은 아늑한 분위기와 맛있는 중식 메뉴로 유명합니다 드라마 팬이라면 촬영된 장소에서 주인공들의 이야기를 떠올리며 식사를 즐길 수 있는 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다 이곳은 여의도에 위치해 있어 접근성도 뛰어나며 친구나 가족과 함께 방문하기에 좋은 장소입니다 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 맛있는 음식을 즐겨보세요', '#촬영지 #맛집 #중식 #여의도 #닥터슬럼프 #드라마팬', '카페/레스토랑', 'New Seung Banjeom Yeouido Branch', 'Dr. Slump', '2-minute walk from Exit 3 of Yeouido Station, 32, Gukje Financial Road 2-gil, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Filming location #famous restaurant #Chinese food #Yeouido #Dr.Slump #Dr.Fan', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5cg3J/btsEYMPvpur/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEQHn_UnPZr-l5vkTkhdWJTOqBb6KhmmdGTbsvc6cKn2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=53r0lSj1Hm%2FQ7iH%2B0lw5C8NViiI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/RIaLL/btsE3oT6lbH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACqcarEy33Pwo00bGpWp9DyFpLLsqXjWaCMbhp9XxjMC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lt0vUS8HzsvblDsRdVPQWluj0kA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c30tWs/btsE0kdCSC6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI5eLaNTjoRBdZYy2n63bdrgKtvkxDfuErLq2mBL7wls/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TX%2Fp0meog342Me6FLk0aYu9xFHY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bK89e4/btsEYJMbRc2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0_ptJw41DBGsIvcQfHL9rzXrJstA9YJmc82fPVYZAD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IXulF%2B0Lr2ANUaixTkIL1C15YzQ%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5cg3J/btsEYMPvpur/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEQHn_UnPZr-l5vkTkhdWJTOqBb6KhmmdGTbsvc6cKn2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=53r0lSj1Hm%2FQ7iH%2B0lw5C8NViiI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/RIaLL/btsE3oT6lbH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACqcarEy33Pwo00bGpWp9DyFpLLsqXjWaCMbhp9XxjMC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lt0vUS8HzsvblDsRdVPQWluj0kA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c30tWs/btsE0kdCSC6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI5eLaNTjoRBdZYy2n63bdrgKtvkxDfuErLq2mBL7wls/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TX%2Fp0meog342Me6FLk0aYu9xFHY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bK89e4/btsEYJMbRc2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0_ptJw41DBGsIvcQfHL9rzXrJstA9YJmc82fPVYZAD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IXulF%2B0Lr2ANUaixTkIL1C15YzQ%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5cg3J/btsEYMPvpur/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEQHn_UnPZr-l5vkTkhdWJTOqBb6KhmmdGTbsvc6cKn2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=53r0lSj1Hm%2FQ7iH%2B0lw5C8NViiI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/RIaLL/btsE3oT6lbH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACqcarEy33Pwo00bGpWp9DyFpLLsqXjWaCMbhp9XxjMC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lt0vUS8HzsvblDsRdVPQWluj0kA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c30tWs/btsE0kdCSC6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI5eLaNTjoRBdZYy2n63bdrgKtvkxDfuErLq2mBL7wls/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TX%2Fp0meog342Me6FLk0aYu9xFHY%3D', 37.5238184, 126.9241796, '### 닥터슬럼프 촬영지 방문 팁\n신승반점 여의도점은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 촬영지로, 실제로 드라마 속 장면을 체험할 수 있는 곳입니다.\n\n### 여행 포인트\n신승반점 여의도점은 아늑한 분위기와 맛있는 중식 메뉴로 유명합니다. 드라마 팬이라면 촬영된 장소에서 주인공들의 이야기를 떠올리며 식사를 즐길 수 있는 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다. 이곳은 여의도에 위치해 있어 접근성도 뛰어나며, 친구나 가족과 함께 방문하기에 좋은 장소입니다. 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 맛있는 음식을 즐겨보세요!', 'New Seung Ban Branch Yeouido branch is famous for its cozy atmosphere and delicious Chinese menu If you are a drama fan you can have a special experience where you can enjoy a meal while thinking of the stories of the main characters at the filming location This place is located in Yeouido so its very accessible and its a great place to visit with friends and family Feel the sensibility of the drama and enjoy delicious food'),
	(667, '닥터슬럼프', '오륜빌딩', '서울 영등포구 국제금융로8길 34 여의도역5번출구 도보8분', '오륜빌딩은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 중요한 촬영지로 도시의 현대적인 분위기를 잘 담고 있습니다 이곳은 다양한 상업 공간과 함께 주변의 활기찬 거리 풍경이 어우러져 있어 방문객들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 드라마의 팬이라면 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 사진을 찍고 주변 카페에서 휴식을 취하는 것도 좋은 방법입니다', '#닥터슬럼프 #오륜빌딩 #촬영지 #서울 #K드라마 #도시풍경', '건물', 'Oryun Building', 'Dr. Slump', '8 minutes walk from Exit 5 of Yeouido Station, 34, International Financial Road 8-gil, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'Building', '#Dr. Slump #OryunBuilding #FilmingPlace #Seoul #Kdrama #Cityscape', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bLXYxZ/btsFRjryEoP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOU6rKA-BMdSjM2jpXVoNd7lPh2qKu4wNXyKZYUbB5vM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PCBDueCRAj2vjyY04KXE%2FWs0IoE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b6aWMF/btsFSbsXLa9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOfCyAJAcxV8oUPCRW_vbRD4zc8VFteFOo6vPPX70Odr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WiiDL%2FnZ1KV14ScD0X366HOUMe4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bLXYxZ/btsFRjryEoP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOU6rKA-BMdSjM2jpXVoNd7lPh2qKu4wNXyKZYUbB5vM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PCBDueCRAj2vjyY04KXE%2FWs0IoE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b6aWMF/btsFSbsXLa9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOfCyAJAcxV8oUPCRW_vbRD4zc8VFteFOo6vPPX70Odr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WiiDL%2FnZ1KV14ScD0X366HOUMe4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bLXYxZ/btsFRjryEoP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOU6rKA-BMdSjM2jpXVoNd7lPh2qKu4wNXyKZYUbB5vM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PCBDueCRAj2vjyY04KXE%2FWs0IoE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b6aWMF/btsFSbsXLa9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOfCyAJAcxV8oUPCRW_vbRD4zc8VFteFOo6vPPX70Odr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WiiDL%2FnZ1KV14ScD0X366HOUMe4%3D', NULL, 37.5202046, 126.9272642, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 닥터슬럼프\n- **촬영지**: 오륜빌딩\n- **방문팁**: 이곳에서 드라마의 주요 장면을 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\n오륜빌딩은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 중요한 촬영지로, 도시의 현대적인 분위기를 잘 담고 있습니다. 이곳은 다양한 상업 공간과 함께 주변의 활기찬 거리 풍경이 어우러져 있어, 방문객들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 드라마의 팬이라면 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 사진을 찍고, 주변 카페에서 휴식을 취하는 것도 좋은 방법입니다.', 'The Oryun Building is an important filming location for the drama Dr Slump which captures the modern atmosphere of the city It is a combination of various commercial spaces and vibrant street scenes around it providing a special experience for visitors If youre a fan of dramas its also a good idea to take pictures thinking about the scenes that were filmed here and to relax at a nearby cafe'),
	(668, '닥터슬럼프', '국민은행 여의도영업부', '서울 영등포구 국제금융로8길 26 여의도역5번출구 위에서3분', '국민은행 여의도영업부는 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 촬영지로 드라마의 특정 장면을 기억하며 방문할 수 있는 장소입니다 이곳은 현대적인 디자인과 편리한 시설을 갖추고 있어 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다 촬영 당시의 분위기를 느끼며 여유롭게 주변을 둘러보는 것도 좋은 방법입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #여의도, #국민은행, #닥터슬럼프, #사진찍기, #기억의장소', '기타/판별불가', 'Kookmin Bank\'s Yeouido Sales Department', 'Dr. Slump', '3 minutes above Exit 5 of Yeouido Station, 26, International Financial Road 8-gil, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Drama filming location, #Yeouido, #KookminBank, #Dr.Slump, #TakingPhotos, #Place of Memory', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wYgCJ/btsFuISgfFf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB5Exeqv9XsODwiUj6tz1clTdu2-NZIV2h21TXi5uy9g/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BwGqo9GQ0DcdzQcV1T7Mh5lMUrU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cxMWnZ/btsFsqqRrVw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL-c_iT3eOuyrDfM0D5NAGxBbQ0YnNV4XCplSTn48YHQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MfIZvrCvGZgqqF1jfE%2BYjeqxfO8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NybnR/btsFnXJ7jKX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO-4AUXfD-agYPxlbawWSKpUuHyT9pkBrAs4SIpkcK4H/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=v7ccyKtQPJUs78HojitDuJTvsv4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wYgCJ/btsFuISgfFf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB5Exeqv9XsODwiUj6tz1clTdu2-NZIV2h21TXi5uy9g/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BwGqo9GQ0DcdzQcV1T7Mh5lMUrU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cxMWnZ/btsFsqqRrVw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL-c_iT3eOuyrDfM0D5NAGxBbQ0YnNV4XCplSTn48YHQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MfIZvrCvGZgqqF1jfE%2BYjeqxfO8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NybnR/btsFnXJ7jKX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO-4AUXfD-agYPxlbawWSKpUuHyT9pkBrAs4SIpkcK4H/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=v7ccyKtQPJUs78HojitDuJTvsv4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wYgCJ/btsFuISgfFf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB5Exeqv9XsODwiUj6tz1clTdu2-NZIV2h21TXi5uy9g/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BwGqo9GQ0DcdzQcV1T7Mh5lMUrU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cxMWnZ/btsFsqqRrVw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL-c_iT3eOuyrDfM0D5NAGxBbQ0YnNV4XCplSTn48YHQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MfIZvrCvGZgqqF1jfE%2BYjeqxfO8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NybnR/btsFnXJ7jKX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO-4AUXfD-agYPxlbawWSKpUuHyT9pkBrAs4SIpkcK4H/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=v7ccyKtQPJUs78HojitDuJTvsv4%3D', 37.5208742, 126.9278871, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 닥터슬럼프\n- **촬영지:** 국민은행 여의도영업부\n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 주요 장면을 떠올리며 사진을 찍어보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n국민은행 여의도영업부는 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 촬영지로, 드라마의 특정 장면을 기억하며 방문할 수 있는 장소입니다. 이곳은 현대적인 디자인과 편리한 시설을 갖추고 있어, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다. 촬영 당시의 분위기를 느끼며, 여유롭게 주변을 둘러보는 것도 좋은 방법입니다.', 'Kookmin Banks Yeouido sales department is the filming location of the drama Doctor Slump where you can remember and visit certain scenes of the drama It has modern design and convenient facilities so it will be a special experience for drama fans It is also a good way to feel the atmosphere at the time of shooting and look around'),
	(669, '닥터슬럼프', '서린빌딩 앞', '서울 영등포구 여의대방로65길 17 여의도역5번출구 위에서4분', '서린빌딩 앞은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 상징적인 배경으로 현대적인 도시 풍경과 함께 드라마 속 캐릭터들의 유쾌한 순간들이 생생하게 떠오르는 장소입니다 주변에는 다양한 식당과 카페가 있어 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 음식을 즐기며 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 들러보아야 할 명소입니다', '#닥터슬럼프 #촬영지 #서울 #도시풍경 #포토존 #드라마팬', '기타/판별불가', 'In front of Seorin Building', 'Dr. Slump', '4 minutes above Exit 5 of Yeouido Station, 17, Yeouido Daebang-ro 65-gil, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Dr. Slump #FilmingPlace #Seoul #Cityscape #PhotoZone #DramaFan', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oXWxl/btsFpQcHUNF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALyhsQztn3J5LNqOFhQnfaEPSUcU3Qp6uVNn3d3wftN-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UoAGToZ%2F2S27eGy0j36%2FoqIXcFQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GwPSF/btsFoIeKlh5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAETxcIefKEZCi-fMMc8mRENGgmZuua-XfK5Izm7L0W4M/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PDltn8nr%2BaJpEdBgSntWqiqPsa8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kKdWL/btsFt5teXhV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAefQo9u_AzKFJSBFkj23iUQgbxjfUrtWOH9ZWikoex2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BCAETL%2FdBH5vgofB%2F30NT%2Bhh67k%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oXWxl/btsFpQcHUNF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALyhsQztn3J5LNqOFhQnfaEPSUcU3Qp6uVNn3d3wftN-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UoAGToZ%2F2S27eGy0j36%2FoqIXcFQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GwPSF/btsFoIeKlh5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAETxcIefKEZCi-fMMc8mRENGgmZuua-XfK5Izm7L0W4M/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PDltn8nr%2BaJpEdBgSntWqiqPsa8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kKdWL/btsFt5teXhV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAefQo9u_AzKFJSBFkj23iUQgbxjfUrtWOH9ZWikoex2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BCAETL%2FdBH5vgofB%2F30NT%2Bhh67k%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oXWxl/btsFpQcHUNF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALyhsQztn3J5LNqOFhQnfaEPSUcU3Qp6uVNn3d3wftN-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UoAGToZ%2F2S27eGy0j36%2FoqIXcFQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GwPSF/btsFoIeKlh5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAETxcIefKEZCi-fMMc8mRENGgmZuua-XfK5Izm7L0W4M/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PDltn8nr%2BaJpEdBgSntWqiqPsa8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kKdWL/btsFt5teXhV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAefQo9u_AzKFJSBFkj23iUQgbxjfUrtWOH9ZWikoex2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BCAETL%2FdBH5vgofB%2F30NT%2Bhh67k%3D', 37.51970060000001, 126.9292808, '### 닥터슬럼프 촬영지: 서린빌딩 앞\n\n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 장소로, 팬들이 사진을 찍기 좋은 포토존입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 서린빌딩 앞은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 상징적인 배경으로, 현대적인 도시 풍경과 함께 드라마 속 캐릭터들의 유쾌한 순간들이 생생하게 떠오르는 장소입니다. 주변에는 다양한 식당과 카페가 있어 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 음식을 즐기며 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 들러보아야 할 명소입니다. \n\n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding', 'The front of the Seorin Building is the iconic background of the drama Dr Slump a place where pleasant moments of the characters in the drama come to life with a modern cityscape There are various restaurants and cafes around so you can enjoy your time while enjoying food after visiting the filming location Its a mustsee spot for drama fans'),
	(670, '닥터슬럼프', '두일빌딩 앞', '서울 영등포구 여의대방로67길 9 여의도역5번출구 위에서4분', '두일빌딩 앞은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 상징적인 촬영지로 다양한 상점과 음식점이 즐비해 있어 방문객들이 드라마의 분위기를 느끼며 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 장소입니다 주변의 활기찬 거리 풍경과 함께 드라마 속 장면들을 떠올리며 사진을 찍기에도 좋은 곳입니다 KdramaTrip CityBuilding', '#닥터슬럼프 #촬영지 #여유시간 #상점 #음식점 #사진촬영', '거리/골목/광장', 'In front of the Duil Building', 'Dr. Slump', '4 minutes above Exit 5 of Yeouido Station, 9, Yeouido-daero 67-gil, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Dr. Slump #FilmingPlace #RelaxingTime #Restaurant #Restaurant #Photoshoot', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lD7nW/btsFsaaFEFq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALbxV_OMpXKdvFPUg5s-F7sAynyce5JKpUsEyfJ7stf7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=W4LiEhDZCfsUEmrUSXHXZ6HDJZw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/PKZcS/btsFs0MqtvM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKiOMNmctS1BFkowTfRC35iazR2FQCE4mcLyC-Ye3yN6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iG3Y%2BrL5qH6dSucQvLMQFzFTqb8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lD7nW/btsFsaaFEFq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALbxV_OMpXKdvFPUg5s-F7sAynyce5JKpUsEyfJ7stf7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=W4LiEhDZCfsUEmrUSXHXZ6HDJZw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/PKZcS/btsFs0MqtvM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKiOMNmctS1BFkowTfRC35iazR2FQCE4mcLyC-Ye3yN6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iG3Y%2BrL5qH6dSucQvLMQFzFTqb8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lD7nW/btsFsaaFEFq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALbxV_OMpXKdvFPUg5s-F7sAynyce5JKpUsEyfJ7stf7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=W4LiEhDZCfsUEmrUSXHXZ6HDJZw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/PKZcS/btsFs0MqtvM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKiOMNmctS1BFkowTfRC35iazR2FQCE4mcLyC-Ye3yN6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iG3Y%2BrL5qH6dSucQvLMQFzFTqb8%3D', NULL, 37.5195547, 126.9305168, '**닥터슬럼프 촬영지: 두일빌딩 앞**\n\n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면이 촬영된 장소로, 팬들에게 특별한 의미가 있는 곳입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 두일빌딩 앞은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 상징적인 촬영지로, 다양한 상점과 음식점이 즐비해 있어 방문객들이 드라마의 분위기를 느끼며 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 장소입니다. 주변의 활기찬 거리 풍경과 함께 드라마 속 장면들을 떠올리며 사진을 찍기에도 좋은 곳입니다. #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding', 'The front of the Duil Building is an iconic filming location for the drama Dr Slump and it is a place where visitors can spend their time feeling the atmosphere of the drama as there are many shops and restaurants It is also a great place to take pictures while recalling the scenes in the drama along with the lively street scenery around KdramaTrip CityBuilding'),
	(671, '닥터슬럼프', '여의도따로국밥', '서울 영등포구 여의대방로69길 28 여의도역5번출구 위에서4분', '여의도따로국밥은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 촬영지로 실제로 방문하면 드라마 속 장면들을 떠올리며 식사를 즐길 수 있습니다 이곳은 아늑한 분위기와 맛있는 국밥으로 유명하며 다양한 메뉴를 제공해 친구나 가족과 함께하기 좋은 장소입니다 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 한번 방문해 보세요', '#KdramaTrip #국밥 #여의도 #맛집 #촬영지 #친구모임', '카페/레스토랑', 'Yeouido separate rice soup', 'Dr. Slump', '4 minutes above Exit 5 of Yeouido Station, 28, Yeouido-daebang-ro 69-gil, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#KdramaTrip #SoupBowl #Yeouido #Delicious Restaurant #FilmingPlace #FriendsMeeting', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cC0osL/btsElKFjni8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK_MvI5WEPb8qM4zOgxsFshfXQ30hD_jsZOJfGe09a8y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RjHYuBtBlgfjgsOE6prg2Wgczg4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/y8vFF/btsEj7OfDav/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO27UhcxBi68s-BPzcoSsJgsyzs1AU6R-6pwXcTHBlx-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qdvIzs6k0xSeRDHtoNEBSHQVvC8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LNWfI/btsEngDaOnQ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG0R-1hJ2zSgmLyMWr7bGsuezRidPVUDhoAsXk78ENSZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qLatC5yOyLwmhTHjIEDdDlHqUcM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/26pKL/btsEmCfVIpJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMwin41Xzl3eK56GNQHRp50qsjylC6oNL2gLDOU92bYB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XgSol1WP%2F1rjCqINnlfXDZ57yFo%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cC0osL/btsElKFjni8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK_MvI5WEPb8qM4zOgxsFshfXQ30hD_jsZOJfGe09a8y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RjHYuBtBlgfjgsOE6prg2Wgczg4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/y8vFF/btsEj7OfDav/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO27UhcxBi68s-BPzcoSsJgsyzs1AU6R-6pwXcTHBlx-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qdvIzs6k0xSeRDHtoNEBSHQVvC8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LNWfI/btsEngDaOnQ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG0R-1hJ2zSgmLyMWr7bGsuezRidPVUDhoAsXk78ENSZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qLatC5yOyLwmhTHjIEDdDlHqUcM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/26pKL/btsEmCfVIpJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMwin41Xzl3eK56GNQHRp50qsjylC6oNL2gLDOU92bYB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XgSol1WP%2F1rjCqINnlfXDZ57yFo%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cC0osL/btsElKFjni8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK_MvI5WEPb8qM4zOgxsFshfXQ30hD_jsZOJfGe09a8y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RjHYuBtBlgfjgsOE6prg2Wgczg4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/y8vFF/btsEj7OfDav/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO27UhcxBi68s-BPzcoSsJgsyzs1AU6R-6pwXcTHBlx-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qdvIzs6k0xSeRDHtoNEBSHQVvC8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LNWfI/btsEngDaOnQ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG0R-1hJ2zSgmLyMWr7bGsuezRidPVUDhoAsXk78ENSZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qLatC5yOyLwmhTHjIEDdDlHqUcM%3D', 37.5214552, 126.9301999, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n- **닥터슬럼프** | **여의도따로국밥**\n- **방문팁:** 드라마 속 주인공들이 앉았던 테이블에 앉아보세요!\n\n### 여행 포인트\n여의도따로국밥은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 촬영지로, 실제로 방문하면 드라마 속 장면들을 떠올리며 식사를 즐길 수 있습니다. 이곳은 아늑한 분위기와 맛있는 국밥으로 유명하며, 다양한 메뉴를 제공해 친구나 가족과 함께하기 좋은 장소입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 한번 방문해 보세요! \n\n### 키워드\n#KdramaTrip #Cafe', 'Yeouido Soup is the filming location of the drama Dr Slump and when you actually visit you can enjoy a meal while recalling the scenes in the drama This place is famous for its cozy atmosphere and delicious rice soup and offers a variety of menus making it a great place to spend time with friends and family If youre a drama fan make sure to visit'),
	(672, '닥터슬럼프', '샛강다리', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 신길역2번출구 도보5분', '샛강다리는 서울의 현대적인 스카이라인과 푸른 자연이 조화를 이루는 아름다운 장소입니다 이곳은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 촬영지로 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 산책하기에 좋은 곳입니다 주변에는 다양한 산책로와 자전거 도로가 있어 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 적합하며 도심 속에서 자연을 느낄 수 있는 특별한 경험을 제공합니다', '#닥터슬럼프, #산책, #서울여행, #자연, #샛강다리, #드라마촬영지', '기타/판별불가', 'the bridge of a new river', 'Dr. Slump', '5-minute walk from Exit 2 of Singil Station, Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Dr. Slump, #Walk, #SeoulTravel, #Nature, #Saegang Bridge, #DramaFilmingPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bjQiyI/btsD5zidHSk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI6oMXo6aS76LxQEpx-boRY_cPTphBBJGkLGQM_pVqte/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1TJlVptDhlqWr9GFi0uDJZ6%2FmN8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rdu0Z/btsD4rEOi6q/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALdsoSI5VBSIi2QQyYlBi81yI4qLoddY42vdLfC5SgC0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ARa5vhMVraAeoAEK9%2Bc%2FW%2BsKG9k%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bGCjpO/btsD3aRyhsY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKeEJNYBEkG5v7p01CUpQQOB20-P9bmPZvdYwecNeeTt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=S1QEzC%2B8n4KdpdeEm23R937bkP4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bjQiyI/btsD5zidHSk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI6oMXo6aS76LxQEpx-boRY_cPTphBBJGkLGQM_pVqte/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1TJlVptDhlqWr9GFi0uDJZ6%2FmN8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rdu0Z/btsD4rEOi6q/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALdsoSI5VBSIi2QQyYlBi81yI4qLoddY42vdLfC5SgC0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ARa5vhMVraAeoAEK9%2Bc%2FW%2BsKG9k%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bGCjpO/btsD3aRyhsY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKeEJNYBEkG5v7p01CUpQQOB20-P9bmPZvdYwecNeeTt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=S1QEzC%2B8n4KdpdeEm23R937bkP4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bjQiyI/btsD5zidHSk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI6oMXo6aS76LxQEpx-boRY_cPTphBBJGkLGQM_pVqte/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1TJlVptDhlqWr9GFi0uDJZ6%2FmN8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rdu0Z/btsD4rEOi6q/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALdsoSI5VBSIi2QQyYlBi81yI4qLoddY42vdLfC5SgC0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ARa5vhMVraAeoAEK9%2Bc%2FW%2BsKG9k%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bGCjpO/btsD3aRyhsY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKeEJNYBEkG5v7p01CUpQQOB20-P9bmPZvdYwecNeeTt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=S1QEzC%2B8n4KdpdeEm23R937bkP4%3D', 37.5292257, 126.9293831, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 닥터슬럼프\n- **촬영지:** 샛강다리\n- **방문팁:** 샛강다리에서 도심의 자연을 만끽하며 산책해보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n샛강다리는 서울의 현대적인 스카이라인과 푸른 자연이 조화를 이루는 아름다운 장소입니다. 이곳은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 촬영지로, 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 산책하기에 좋은 곳입니다. 주변에는 다양한 산책로와 자전거 도로가 있어 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 적합하며, 도심 속에서 자연을 느낄 수 있는 특별한 경험을 제공합니다.', 'Saetgang Bridge is a beautiful place where Seouls modern skyline and green nature harmonize This is the filming location of the drama Dr Slump which is a great place to take a walk while thinking about the scenes in the drama There are various trails and bicycle paths around making it suitable for leisurely time and it provides a special experience to feel nature in the city center'),
	(673, '닥터슬럼프', '퇴계로68길', '서울 중구 퇴계로68길 20 동대문역사문화공원역3번출구 도보4분', '퇴계로68길은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 촬영지로 아기자기한 골목과 독특한 상점들이 매력적인 곳입니다 이곳을 방문하면 드라마의 한 장면 속 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 느낄 수 있으며 다양한 카페와 상점에서 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 특히 저녁 시간에 방문하면 조명이 켜진 거리의 아름다움을 만끽할 수 있어 더욱 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다', '#닥터슬럼프 #골목 #드라마촬영지 #서울 #카페 #산책', '거리/골목/광장', 'Toegye-ro 68-gil', 'Dr. Slump', '4-minute walk from Exit 3 of Dongdaemun History and Culture Park Station, 20, Toegye-ro 68-gil, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Dr. Slump #Alley #DramaFilmingPlace #Seoul #Cafe #Walk', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/X5iRq/btsEZbuKgP8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHPq3VKuqWKFLicq_qJgfZzXaJPhVgVBovOMHbf0wULi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=el8K6QM06u65VxhhDWJQfMh5iZU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/OvBEq/btsEZTURgim/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEIt_Ta5misi8TXoDIPXgLZX_P_cq2I1whRGbCPvEJUw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7JOKueBTWIsUrdoBLOquNJ2ZZ%2Bc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wePkA/btsE0gvxGP2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB327DfiGJpyhq2SKl_xASNwEsYb0DKgnDhJbTArbcCC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ii%2FW4MoglU8UNfFpQCvPPra%2FaYc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kCK9t/btsEYKxzGnz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE3V_L3Ugy9m_OdQ_oTbrrISW3Ec5h84pGdwo-GLgi_D/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a8vzw3BLyFjQqtGqAp5wW%2B%2FJ2MU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/X5iRq/btsEZbuKgP8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHPq3VKuqWKFLicq_qJgfZzXaJPhVgVBovOMHbf0wULi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=el8K6QM06u65VxhhDWJQfMh5iZU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/OvBEq/btsEZTURgim/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEIt_Ta5misi8TXoDIPXgLZX_P_cq2I1whRGbCPvEJUw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7JOKueBTWIsUrdoBLOquNJ2ZZ%2Bc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wePkA/btsE0gvxGP2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB327DfiGJpyhq2SKl_xASNwEsYb0DKgnDhJbTArbcCC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ii%2FW4MoglU8UNfFpQCvPPra%2FaYc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kCK9t/btsEYKxzGnz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAE3V_L3Ugy9m_OdQ_oTbrrISW3Ec5h84pGdwo-GLgi_D/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a8vzw3BLyFjQqtGqAp5wW%2B%2FJ2MU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/X5iRq/btsEZbuKgP8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHPq3VKuqWKFLicq_qJgfZzXaJPhVgVBovOMHbf0wULi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=el8K6QM06u65VxhhDWJQfMh5iZU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/OvBEq/btsEZTURgim/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEIt_Ta5misi8TXoDIPXgLZX_P_cq2I1whRGbCPvEJUw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7JOKueBTWIsUrdoBLOquNJ2ZZ%2Bc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wePkA/btsE0gvxGP2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB327DfiGJpyhq2SKl_xASNwEsYb0DKgnDhJbTArbcCC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ii%2FW4MoglU8UNfFpQCvPPra%2FaYc%3D', 37.5635996, 127.0097885, '### 거리/골목 촬영지: 닥터슬럼프 - 퇴계로68길\n\n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 퇴계로68길은 드라마 \'닥터슬럼프\'의 촬영지로, 아기자기한 골목과 독특한 상점들이 매력적인 곳입니다. 이곳을 방문하면 드라마의 한 장면 속 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 느낄 수 있으며, 다양한 카페와 상점에서 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 특히, 저녁 시간에 방문하면 조명이 켜진 거리의 아름다움을 만끽할 수 있어 더욱 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다. \n\n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene', 'Toegyero 68gil is the filming location of the drama Dr Slump and it is a charming place with cute alleys and unique shops If you visit here you can feel like you have become the main character in a scene of the drama and you can spend a leisurely time in various cafes and shops In particular if you visit in the evening you will be able to enjoy the beauty of the illuminated streets which will be a more special experience'),
	(674, '닥터슬럼프', '광희문교회 앞', '서울 중구 청구로22길 21 동대문역사문화공원역3번출구 위에서1분', '광희문교회 앞은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 촬영지로 현대적인 건물과 자연이 어우러진 아름다운 거리입니다 이곳에서는 드라마 속 주인공들이 지나갔던 길을 따라 걸으며 감성을 느끼고 사진을 찍기에 좋은 장소입니다 주변에는 카페와 상점들이 있어 여유롭게 시간을 보내기에도 적합합니다', '#KdramaTrip #닥터슬럼프 #거리촬영지 #서울 #광희문교회 #감성사진', '거리/골목/광장', 'In front of Gwanghuimun Church', 'Dr. Slump', '1 minute above Exit 3 of Dongdaemun History and Culture Park Station, 21 Cheonggu-ro 22-gil, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #Dr.Slump #StreetShootingPlace #Seoul #GwanghuimunChurch #EmotionalPhotography', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IULMz/btsEFe6Eqzg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPVnd9HYPwqIF2epdEQxpW8xPZeQiLfYZvB2u8pma1fn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WmpRpm38rSlFs9rx09N9dA%2FOJrE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dEY4E9/btsEEvgYM71/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOfrF_oUVqZvXKE9LBFquszCFd2OODmGqtZ_UuMwH4zH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BvUDt7Vmlk2lqQp4P8NZGMKUL0I%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bbZO5J/btsEKFn78EN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPRsrtEaCjI5L2qJC9mUMkOiGI-8mQmPLRD4Spz5fAWl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=G2zgrCxT%2BlvKQZjmhzJR3u1y7As%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/t0NPX/btsEKDDQF0p/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMEh8BtYoYlo2TPYG_obk39ifuIXPUsvyfIW4oOrZ0sm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NE%2Faqm8TGO4G%2BqHix2DbA5OhU9M%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IULMz/btsEFe6Eqzg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPVnd9HYPwqIF2epdEQxpW8xPZeQiLfYZvB2u8pma1fn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WmpRpm38rSlFs9rx09N9dA%2FOJrE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dEY4E9/btsEEvgYM71/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOfrF_oUVqZvXKE9LBFquszCFd2OODmGqtZ_UuMwH4zH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BvUDt7Vmlk2lqQp4P8NZGMKUL0I%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bbZO5J/btsEKFn78EN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPRsrtEaCjI5L2qJC9mUMkOiGI-8mQmPLRD4Spz5fAWl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=G2zgrCxT%2BlvKQZjmhzJR3u1y7As%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/t0NPX/btsEKDDQF0p/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMEh8BtYoYlo2TPYG_obk39ifuIXPUsvyfIW4oOrZ0sm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NE%2Faqm8TGO4G%2BqHix2DbA5OhU9M%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IULMz/btsEFe6Eqzg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPVnd9HYPwqIF2epdEQxpW8xPZeQiLfYZvB2u8pma1fn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WmpRpm38rSlFs9rx09N9dA%2FOJrE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dEY4E9/btsEEvgYM71/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOfrF_oUVqZvXKE9LBFquszCFd2OODmGqtZ_UuMwH4zH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BvUDt7Vmlk2lqQp4P8NZGMKUL0I%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bbZO5J/btsEKFn78EN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPRsrtEaCjI5L2qJC9mUMkOiGI-8mQmPLRD4Spz5fAWl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=G2zgrCxT%2BlvKQZjmhzJR3u1y7As%3D', 37.5631478, 127.0107414, '### 거리 촬영지 큐레이터\n\n**닥터슬럼프**  \n**촬영지:** 광희문교회 앞  \n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 장소로, 감성적인 거리 풍경을 즐길 수 있습니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #닥터슬럼프  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n광희문교회 앞은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 촬영지로, 현대적인 건물과 자연이 어우러진 아름다운 거리입니다. 이곳에서는 드라마 속 주인공들이 지나갔던 길을 따라 걸으며, 감성을 느끼고 사진을 찍기에 좋은 장소입니다. 주변에는 카페와 상점들이 있어 여유롭게 시간을 보내기에도 적합합니다.', 'The front of Gwanghuimun Church is the filming location of the drama Dr Slump a beautiful street with modern buildings and nature Here it is a good place to walk along the path that the main characters in the drama have passed feel the emotions and take pictures There are cafes and shops nearby so it is also suitable for spending time leisurely'),
	(675, '닥터슬럼프', '청구로', '서울 중구 청구로 134-1 동대문역사문화공원역3번출구 위에서1분', '청구로는 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 주요 촬영지로 현대적인 건물과 아기자기한 거리 풍경이 조화를 이루는 곳입니다 이 지역은 다양한 카페와 상점들로 둘러싸여 있어 드라마의 장면을 재현하며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있는 완벽한 장소입니다 특히 드라마의 주요 장면을 떠올리며 산책하거나 사진을 찍기에 좋은 위치입니다', '#닥터슬럼프 #청구로 #KdramaTrip #StreetScene #드라마촬영지', '거리/골목/광장', 'at the request of', 'Dr. Slump', '1 minute above Exit 3 of Dongdaemun History and Culture Park Station, 134-1, Cheonggu-ro, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Dr. Slump #Claim #KdramaTrip #StreetScene #DramaShootPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c5eFp4/btsFQdyOsVm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMFSh4okTegxRvkM2OKDuAK1msaP1jDksaUnk4UOE45V/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=316nJX5TKzLzM%2F1hcO22pXQAdhk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YNOZW/btsFTe34lVq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPYKbAnKGahAu0X6XqYqFTw91bYUeUFJdZFkUGfwBUNX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uTdl%2FRTUORBAnrvXNvlnpJ536ms%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/u2JKB/btsFTfIFqy0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGIe6kEUnkdn39NTEb8bzFbT4CCD5RMaqMF3Fr7i3wpr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nx8EblbueQKM1%2B1dnEBALASeaSc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dolu0O/btsFQgWIVJP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH48uK12YIxFDYIqzOHYGBMIEpo_Rfnje5hCQmcauuUm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gZA3fDfMAq5V%2BjoxUB2urnU7bmU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c5eFp4/btsFQdyOsVm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMFSh4okTegxRvkM2OKDuAK1msaP1jDksaUnk4UOE45V/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=316nJX5TKzLzM%2F1hcO22pXQAdhk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YNOZW/btsFTe34lVq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPYKbAnKGahAu0X6XqYqFTw91bYUeUFJdZFkUGfwBUNX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uTdl%2FRTUORBAnrvXNvlnpJ536ms%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/u2JKB/btsFTfIFqy0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGIe6kEUnkdn39NTEb8bzFbT4CCD5RMaqMF3Fr7i3wpr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nx8EblbueQKM1%2B1dnEBALASeaSc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dolu0O/btsFQgWIVJP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH48uK12YIxFDYIqzOHYGBMIEpo_Rfnje5hCQmcauuUm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gZA3fDfMAq5V%2BjoxUB2urnU7bmU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c5eFp4/btsFQdyOsVm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMFSh4okTegxRvkM2OKDuAK1msaP1jDksaUnk4UOE45V/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=316nJX5TKzLzM%2F1hcO22pXQAdhk%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YNOZW/btsFTe34lVq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPYKbAnKGahAu0X6XqYqFTw91bYUeUFJdZFkUGfwBUNX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uTdl%2FRTUORBAnrvXNvlnpJ536ms%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/u2JKB/btsFTfIFqy0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGIe6kEUnkdn39NTEb8bzFbT4CCD5RMaqMF3Fr7i3wpr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nx8EblbueQKM1%2B1dnEBALASeaSc%3D', 37.5637327, 127.0103604, '### 닥터슬럼프 촬영지 정보\n\n- **제목:** 닥터슬럼프\n- **촬영지:** 청구로\n- **방문 팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책해보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 거리/골목\n\n### 여행 포인트\n청구로는 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 주요 촬영지로, 현대적인 건물과 아기자기한 거리 풍경이 조화를 이루는 곳입니다. 이 지역은 다양한 카페와 상점들로 둘러싸여 있어, 드라마의 장면을 재현하며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있는 완벽한 장소입니다. 특히, 드라마의 주요 장면을 떠올리며 산책하거나 사진을 찍기에 좋은 위치입니다.', 'Cheongguro is the main filming location for the drama Dr Slump where modern buildings and cute street scenes harmonize The area is surrounded by various cafes and shops making it the perfect place to spend your leisure time recreating scenes from dramas In particular it is a good place to take a walk or take pictures while thinking of the main scenes of the drama'),
	(676, '닥터슬럼프', '갤러리카페소연', '서울 종로구 서순라길 149 종로3가역7번출구 도보8분', '갤러리카페소연은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 촬영지로 유명한 장소입니다 이곳은 아늑하고 세련된 인테리어로 편안한 분위기에서 커피 한 잔을 즐기며 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있습니다 다양한 음료와 디저트를 제공하며 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다', '#닥터슬럼프, #카페, #촬영지, #서울, #드라마속장면', '카페/레스토랑', 'Gallery Cafe Soyeon', 'Dr. Slump', '8-minute walk from Exit 7 of Jongno 3-ga Station, 149 Seosunra-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Dr. Slump, #Café, #FilmingPlace, #Seoul, #SceneInTheDrama', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vcgpN/btsEEGQjBsV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL-aNGGnLk2b1sYc0FDE0yTKjX9XJj8bN_ppKx4d2ged/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zcxlHpAys7W0dVZDnOBUCr%2B0Yx4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bUfKqc/btsEHFWzrdA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPARh8qBzD25LBpddKYuocI3NMCXmXndk3j3o8jqbT8D/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bqkt5i3rSU1Rf2Wr%2BUIC4wH2Tpg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bivNR5/btsEEKZnmtn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANv1z5r6DFLa8znyq7m0GxjaKewwn-55TZ2NsGe_g7Zl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yxX1xDVg2EzpmbYwKbf2gvE2LLs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Q6TVr/btsEI9XqWkJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEM5qXa1jlhAuVO7nCq3k0XP5R5MCloWPGnheazlGxoH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dRfjZ%2BzvbcTqfgAXWPthCwJAPPo%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vcgpN/btsEEGQjBsV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL-aNGGnLk2b1sYc0FDE0yTKjX9XJj8bN_ppKx4d2ged/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zcxlHpAys7W0dVZDnOBUCr%2B0Yx4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bUfKqc/btsEHFWzrdA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPARh8qBzD25LBpddKYuocI3NMCXmXndk3j3o8jqbT8D/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bqkt5i3rSU1Rf2Wr%2BUIC4wH2Tpg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bivNR5/btsEEKZnmtn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANv1z5r6DFLa8znyq7m0GxjaKewwn-55TZ2NsGe_g7Zl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yxX1xDVg2EzpmbYwKbf2gvE2LLs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Q6TVr/btsEI9XqWkJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEM5qXa1jlhAuVO7nCq3k0XP5R5MCloWPGnheazlGxoH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dRfjZ%2BzvbcTqfgAXWPthCwJAPPo%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vcgpN/btsEEGQjBsV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL-aNGGnLk2b1sYc0FDE0yTKjX9XJj8bN_ppKx4d2ged/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zcxlHpAys7W0dVZDnOBUCr%2B0Yx4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bUfKqc/btsEHFWzrdA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPARh8qBzD25LBpddKYuocI3NMCXmXndk3j3o8jqbT8D/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bqkt5i3rSU1Rf2Wr%2BUIC4wH2Tpg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bivNR5/btsEEKZnmtn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANv1z5r6DFLa8znyq7m0GxjaKewwn-55TZ2NsGe_g7Zl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yxX1xDVg2EzpmbYwKbf2gvE2LLs%3D', 37.5768121, 126.9916803, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n- **제목:** 닥터슬럼프\n- **촬영지:** 갤러리카페소연\n- **방문팁:** 아늑한 분위기에서 드라마 속 장면을 체험해보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n갤러리카페소연은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 촬영지로 유명한 장소입니다. 이곳은 아늑하고 세련된 인테리어로, 편안한 분위기에서 커피 한 잔을 즐기며 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있습니다. 다양한 음료와 디저트를 제공하며, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다.', 'Gallery Cafe Soyeon is famous as the filming location for the drama Dr Slump This is a cozy and sophisticated interior where you can enjoy a cup of coffee in a comfortable atmosphere and feel the sensibility of the drama We offer a variety of drinks and desserts and it will be a special experience for drama fans'),
	(677, '닥터슬럼프', '청와대로 신무문쪽', '서울 종로구 세종로 1-52 광화문역2번출구 버스10분', '청와대로 이어지는 신무문쪽은 아름다운 나무와 조경이 조화를 이루는 거리입니다 이곳에서 촬영된 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 장면들은 이 지역의 매력을 잘 담고 있습니다 산책하면서 드라마의 주인공들이 걸었던 길을 따라 걸어보는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다 주변의 역사적인 건물들과 함께 멋진 사진을 남기기에도 적합한 장소입니다', '#로맨스, #산책, #청와대, #드라마촬영지, #역사적인건물', '거리/골목/광장', 'To Cheong Wa Dae', 'Dr. Slump', 'Bus 10 minutes from Exit 2 of Gwanghwamun Station, 1-52 Sejong-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Romance, #walk, #Cheong Wa Dae, #drama set, #historic building', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/78qqN/btsFspZC0on/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKKOcwmFc-uTsyJwtgFA0rpl6br9YHz_zp-o_gtRSCb4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pl1QWU056wGDjH%2B23rvRvS8wetA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/7iPrN/btsFm3cyEbF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIvpICg42inVOKuPQLrFDiJLuY7LK97YsKWGdrzRfATh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=e1f1npy3ohX9WBuh%2BNOCMVEvW%2FU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/78qqN/btsFspZC0on/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKKOcwmFc-uTsyJwtgFA0rpl6br9YHz_zp-o_gtRSCb4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pl1QWU056wGDjH%2B23rvRvS8wetA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/7iPrN/btsFm3cyEbF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIvpICg42inVOKuPQLrFDiJLuY7LK97YsKWGdrzRfATh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=e1f1npy3ohX9WBuh%2BNOCMVEvW%2FU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/78qqN/btsFspZC0on/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKKOcwmFc-uTsyJwtgFA0rpl6br9YHz_zp-o_gtRSCb4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pl1QWU056wGDjH%2B23rvRvS8wetA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/7iPrN/btsFm3cyEbF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIvpICg42inVOKuPQLrFDiJLuY7LK97YsKWGdrzRfATh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=e1f1npy3ohX9WBuh%2BNOCMVEvW%2FU%3D', NULL, 37.5836613, 126.9775467, '**거리**: 청와대로 신무문쪽  \n**드라마 제목**: 닥터슬럼프  \n**방문 팁**: 이곳은 드라마 속 로맨틱한 장면이 촬영된 장소로, 산책하며 여유로운 시간을 즐기기 좋습니다.  \n**키워드**: #KdramaTrip  \n\n**여행 포인트**: 청와대로 이어지는 신무문쪽은 아름다운 나무와 조경이 조화를 이루는 거리입니다. 이곳에서 촬영된 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 장면들은 이 지역의 매력을 잘 담고 있습니다. 산책하면서 드라마의 주인공들이 걸었던 길을 따라 걸어보는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다. 주변의 역사적인 건물들과 함께 멋진 사진을 남기기에도 적합한 장소입니다.', 'Sinmun Gate which leads to Cheong Wa Dae is a street where beautiful trees and landscaping harmonize The scenes in the drama Dr Slump filmed here show the charm of the region well It will be a good experience to walk along the path that the main characters of the drama walked while taking a walk It is also a great place to take wonderful pictures with the historic buildings around'),
	(678, '닥터슬럼프', '킴스부띠끄 삼청점', '서울 종로구 북촌로5가길 19 안국역1번출구 도보11분', '킴스부띠끄 삼청점은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 촬영지로 세련된 분위기와 다양한 패션 아이템으로 가득한 쇼핑몰입니다 이곳에서는 드라마 속 주인공들이 착용했던 스타일리시한 의상들을 직접 눈으로 확인할 수 있으며 아기자기한 카페와 함께 쇼핑과 휴식을 동시에 즐길 수 있습니다 특히 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들어보는 것도 좋습니다', '#KdramaTrip #닥터슬럼프 #쇼핑 #패션 #삼청동 #카페', '쇼핑몰', 'Kim\'s Butique Samcheong Branch', 'Dr. Slump', '11-minute walk from Exit 1 of Anguk Station, 19, Bukchon-ro 5-ga-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Shopping mall', '#KdramaTrip #Dr.Slump #Shopping #Fashion #Samcheongdong #Café', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eLei9H/btsFmiH2mpt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGT5xsHoWM7CLVHos8j3DlDZ5rIHEYJ97wmnTj2eOrNM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OKOWSmafy6ZlvqTQuiph38LEBpg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Knbip/btsFp9wpbB7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK4JraOlDLOEeh9I65SH0LUSNDGbTtmsCpZFY8OHkTrc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QUCo4%2Bw0VTcuZXFfLPLj%2B71bQsI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bE4NDP/btsFsZGKgxv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGFFyMIEPtog61N_fZQLKP1EmyH04uK2HjHX7pAupvq2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z1aEaXz7igftlqU78vF5boqVVUA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Fmji9/btsFwBZDztZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADTfdP86J8iOTbRsZcUPjeulGcGudQxGUkfjt73MxSIa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oBlDeOQy%2FabSgzYEcUom8S2bZJ4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eLei9H/btsFmiH2mpt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGT5xsHoWM7CLVHos8j3DlDZ5rIHEYJ97wmnTj2eOrNM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OKOWSmafy6ZlvqTQuiph38LEBpg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Knbip/btsFp9wpbB7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK4JraOlDLOEeh9I65SH0LUSNDGbTtmsCpZFY8OHkTrc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QUCo4%2Bw0VTcuZXFfLPLj%2B71bQsI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bE4NDP/btsFsZGKgxv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGFFyMIEPtog61N_fZQLKP1EmyH04uK2HjHX7pAupvq2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z1aEaXz7igftlqU78vF5boqVVUA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Fmji9/btsFwBZDztZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADTfdP86J8iOTbRsZcUPjeulGcGudQxGUkfjt73MxSIa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oBlDeOQy%2FabSgzYEcUom8S2bZJ4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eLei9H/btsFmiH2mpt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGT5xsHoWM7CLVHos8j3DlDZ5rIHEYJ97wmnTj2eOrNM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OKOWSmafy6ZlvqTQuiph38LEBpg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Knbip/btsFp9wpbB7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK4JraOlDLOEeh9I65SH0LUSNDGbTtmsCpZFY8OHkTrc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QUCo4%2Bw0VTcuZXFfLPLj%2B71bQsI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bE4NDP/btsFsZGKgxv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGFFyMIEPtog61N_fZQLKP1EmyH04uK2HjHX7pAupvq2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z1aEaXz7igftlqU78vF5boqVVUA%3D', 37.5803933, 126.9818669, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 닥터슬럼프\n- **촬영지:** 킴스부띠끄 삼청점\n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 쇼핑하며 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Mall\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 쇼핑몰\n\n### 여행 포인트\n킴스부띠끄 삼청점은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 촬영지로, 세련된 분위기와 다양한 패션 아이템으로 가득한 쇼핑몰입니다. 이곳에서는 드라마 속 주인공들이 착용했던 스타일리시한 의상들을 직접 눈으로 확인할 수 있으며, 아기자기한 카페와 함께 쇼핑과 휴식을 동시에 즐길 수 있습니다. 특히, 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들어보는 것도 좋습니다.', 'Kims Butique Samcheong Branch is the filming location of the drama Dr Slump a shopping mall full of sophisticated atmosphere and various fashion items Here you can see the stylish costumes worn by the main characters in the drama with your own eyes and you can enjoy shopping and relaxation at the same time with a cute cafe In particular if you are a fan of dramas it is also good to make special memories here'),
	(679, '닥터슬럼프', '이음더플레이스', '서울 종로구 북촌로5나길 30 안국역1번출구 위에서3분', '이음더플레이스는 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 촬영지로 아름다운 자연과 함께 아늑한 분위기를 제공합니다 촬영된 장소에서 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 주변의 다양한 카페와 식당도 함께 즐길 수 있어 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해볼 만한 명소입니다', '#닥터슬럼프, #촬영지, #이음더플레이스, #드라마팬, #아늑한분위기, #여유로운시간', '기타/판별불가', 'Eom the Place', 'Dr. Slump', '3 minutes above Exit 1 of Anguk Station, 30, Bukchon-ro 5-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Dr. Slump, #FilmingPlace, #DramaFans, #CozyAtmosphere, #RelaxingTime', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bgd27i/btsFRisGrBe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL9MWZQ0pzIZ8U1Cpp6rLxRQk9IljEHxch3zRebEw3ie/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UdJpWnae1dW%2BaQ813XkUSEeQvi0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dkA8FH/btsFTeiFV15/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALy-YYGpD2-XuBCVYoabEee8bvGyoAMa32n90UEDBDmn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hIGwNZG2lM70sH%2BncNok2W1Zu8I%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/XILUL/btsFQdMmHvJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG4zorB5fWXBJVyJpCeBqbTqXDYIbz5mQ5hHtsSO3z7i/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MMIKL31j%2B44XEivj5undUXJiwjE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bGLXfV/btsFQvTxiaF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADqT1MM-OopWpmXjTy_TKMbBfC-LKH5nUVzinorfh7Bz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=A8XE5QahJtUcGlh4eaOmE%2BqQe%2FE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bgd27i/btsFRisGrBe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL9MWZQ0pzIZ8U1Cpp6rLxRQk9IljEHxch3zRebEw3ie/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UdJpWnae1dW%2BaQ813XkUSEeQvi0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dkA8FH/btsFTeiFV15/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALy-YYGpD2-XuBCVYoabEee8bvGyoAMa32n90UEDBDmn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hIGwNZG2lM70sH%2