Qlb0vgKYhNgrPrlajhU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bkOv4n/btsFGJwDRAa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcPugXvgfGl3Hnf91VdEPQzXfStijgVOAEdCyevmsh3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=h8pimWoOIGvQVluljBqWhwfpTPs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lVkFo/btsFGmPvkBu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANf1xeMcNKf9XU1a2AE_k4koeDQTCvqS5FAS6wtVWTm2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=piVqh%2BO87XQAzq13nPe7SwbuSyI%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bMp08S/btsFDDyasfw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF7fFEJqvczO7Q6pgxMPlk8mNiEKUYL1nMlsBbCXoz7y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Nmi1VyJmKP2Rj8f7xD6scQo5p3s%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/2dl94/btsFHoeI87e/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMo1erSkI6chwadyaG38x2EdICzpVjwTy_L-zAEgyvOj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7esM%2BiVHQlb0vgKYhNgrPrlajhU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bkOv4n/btsFGJwDRAa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAcPugXvgfGl3Hnf91VdEPQzXfStijgVOAEdCyevmsh3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=h8pimWoOIGvQVluljBqWhwfpTPs%3D', 37.5791714, 126.9887859, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 닥터슬럼프  \n**촬영지:** 비원손칼국수  \n**방문팁:** 드라마 속 주인공들이 즐기는 칼국수를 꼭 맛보세요!  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n비원손칼국수는 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기에서 맛있는 칼국수를 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다. 이곳은 드라마 속 주인공들의 일상적인 대화와 소소한 순간들이 담긴 장소로, 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지닙니다. 식사와 함께 드라마의 감성을 느끼며, 친구와의 소중한 시간을 보내기 좋은 장소입니다.', 'Biwon Son Kalguksu is the filming location of the drama Dr Slump where you can enjoy delicious Kalguksu in a cozy atmosphere It is a place where the daily conversations and small moments of the main characters in the drama are contained and it has a special meaning to fans It is a good place to feel the sensibility of the drama with meals and spend precious time with friends'),
	(681, '닥터슬럼프', '서울중앙고등학교', '서울 종로구 창덕궁길 164 안국역3번출구 위에서10분', '서울중앙고등학교는 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 촬영지로 고풍스러운 건축물과 푸르른 자연이 어우러져 있어 방문객들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 이곳은 넓은 잔디밭과 잘 가꿔진 정원이 있어 친구들과 함께 산책하거나 사진을 찍기에 안성맞춤입니다 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 학교의 역사와 아름다움을 동시에 즐길 수 있는 좋은 기회가 될 것입니다', '#KdramaTrip #Campus #슬럼프 #서울중앙고등학교 #드라마촬영지 #산책', '학교/대학', 'Seoul Central High School', 'Dr. Slump', '10 minutes above Exit 3 of Anguk Station, 164 Changdeokgung-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a school/college', '#KdramaTrip #Campus #Slump #SeoulCentral High School #DramaShootPlace #Walk', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/W1K8g/btsD3qMWtjG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEOkr7LwLhfwAm04MX06ZvAk7B_lTwkb-uXIiIdknFji/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=aGF6IW7VhNlDTmoei8TP%2B3iWLE0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cqvuXL/btsD4u2pjaR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJuGXhMsKaJ2EsG0MT5rOyrDfpbspgnpaD7oNMGqoV8C/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=skpW2VghUMsfOwl2c7Ou%2BXlNrxk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/y9uVk/btsD4IM1Wfb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANSHAj4giiNYBgVChaFlIDNDsTAk_5q17UgzH0aTuMJi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6aaYodD7DIwaMa4nWq5fULVtVhI%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/W1K8g/btsD3qMWtjG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEOkr7LwLhfwAm04MX06ZvAk7B_lTwkb-uXIiIdknFji/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=aGF6IW7VhNlDTmoei8TP%2B3iWLE0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cqvuXL/btsD4u2pjaR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJuGXhMsKaJ2EsG0MT5rOyrDfpbspgnpaD7oNMGqoV8C/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=skpW2VghUMsfOwl2c7Ou%2BXlNrxk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/y9uVk/btsD4IM1Wfb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANSHAj4giiNYBgVChaFlIDNDsTAk_5q17UgzH0aTuMJi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6aaYodD7DIwaMa4nWq5fULVtVhI%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/W1K8g/btsD3qMWtjG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEOkr7LwLhfwAm04MX06ZvAk7B_lTwkb-uXIiIdknFji/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=aGF6IW7VhNlDTmoei8TP%2B3iWLE0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cqvuXL/btsD4u2pjaR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJuGXhMsKaJ2EsG0MT5rOyrDfpbspgnpaD7oNMGqoV8C/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=skpW2VghUMsfOwl2c7Ou%2BXlNrxk%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/y9uVk/btsD4IM1Wfb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANSHAj4giiNYBgVChaFlIDNDsTAk_5q17UgzH0aTuMJi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6aaYodD7DIwaMa4nWq5fULVtVhI%3D', 37.5840946, 126.986866, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 닥터슬럼프\n- **촬영지:** 서울중앙고등학교\n- **방문팁:** 캠퍼스 내의 아름다운 경치를 감상하며 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Campus\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 학교\n\n### 여행 포인트\n서울중앙고등학교는 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 촬영지로, 고풍스러운 건축물과 푸르른 자연이 어우러져 있어 방문객들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 이곳은 넓은 잔디밭과 잘 가꿔진 정원이 있어 친구들과 함께 산책하거나 사진을 찍기에 안성맞춤입니다. 드라마의 감성을 느끼며, 학교의 역사와 아름다움을 동시에 즐길 수 있는 좋은 기회가 될 것입니다.', 'Seoul Central High School is the filming location of the drama Dr Slump which offers visitors a special experience with its combination of antique architecture and green nature It has a large lawn and a wellgroomed garden making it perfect for taking a walk or taking pictures with your friends It will be a great opportunity to feel the sensibility of the drama and enjoy the history and beauty of the school at the same time'),
	(682, '닥터슬럼프', '주정형외과의원', '서울 동대문구 서울시립대로 50 청량리역3번출구 도보11분', '주정형외과의원은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 상징적인 촬영지로 현대적인 도시 풍경과 함께 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다 이 지역은 다양한 음식점과 카페가 밀집해 있어 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 주변을 탐방하기에 좋은 장소입니다 특히 야경이 아름다워 저녁 시간에 방문하면 더욱 매력적인 순간을 경험할 수 있습니다', '#닥터슬럼프 #촬영지 #주정형외과의원 #서울여행 #KdramaTrip #야경', '거리/골목/광장', 'an orthopedic surgeon', 'Dr. Slump', '11-minute walk from Exit 3 of Cheongnyangni Station, 50, University of Seoul, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Dr. Slump #FilmingPlace #DramaSurgical Clinic #SeoulTravel #KdramaTrip #Nightscape', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mfKXo/btsEmT2xeU7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADwaMe3pIf7lOom6tmCB-9kSxitJmJc0Ayf9Qkmelc5y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eMN1zpwBc7TBRFmkGzyh32i4weE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cucY8X/btsEj6uSNqV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACsshWglc-3f8eIFoLJejcqUnFGs232YRjOr-4-GdH-D/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fyVTIxZtC%2F7xep5fw03RZQLVvog%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mfKXo/btsEmT2xeU7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADwaMe3pIf7lOom6tmCB-9kSxitJmJc0Ayf9Qkmelc5y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eMN1zpwBc7TBRFmkGzyh32i4weE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cucY8X/btsEj6uSNqV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACsshWglc-3f8eIFoLJejcqUnFGs232YRjOr-4-GdH-D/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fyVTIxZtC%2F7xep5fw03RZQLVvog%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mfKXo/btsEmT2xeU7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADwaMe3pIf7lOom6tmCB-9kSxitJmJc0Ayf9Qkmelc5y/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eMN1zpwBc7TBRFmkGzyh32i4weE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cucY8X/btsEj6uSNqV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACsshWglc-3f8eIFoLJejcqUnFGs232YRjOr-4-GdH-D/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fyVTIxZtC%2F7xep5fw03RZQLVvog%3D', NULL, 37.5756915, 127.0475978, '### 거리 촬영지 큐레이터\n\n**닥터슬럼프**  \n**촬영지:** 주정형외과의원  \n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면이 촬영된 장소로, 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #닥터슬럼프  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n주정형외과의원은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 상징적인 촬영지로, 현대적인 도시 풍경과 함께 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다. 이 지역은 다양한 음식점과 카페가 밀집해 있어 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 주변을 탐방하기에 좋은 장소입니다. 특히, 야경이 아름다워 저녁 시간에 방문하면 더욱 매력적인 순간을 경험할 수 있습니다.', 'Jujeong Orthopedic Clinic is an iconic filming location for the drama Dr Slump where you can feel the sensibility of the drama along with the modern cityscape This area is a good place to explore the surroundings leisurely after visiting the filming location as various restaurants and cafes are concentrated In particular the night view is beautiful so you can experience more attractive moments if you visit in the evening'),
	(683, '닥터슬럼프', '오로라베이커리카페 성수점', '서울 성동구 아차산로 126 성수역3번출구 도보2분', '오로라베이커리카페 성수점은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적입니다 이곳은 커피와 베이커리가 유명하며 드라마의 한 장면처럼 친구와의 소중한 대화를 나누기 좋은 장소입니다 커피 한 잔과 함께 여유로운 시간을 보내며 드라마의 주인공들이 느꼈던 감정을 함께 경험해보세요', '#닥터슬럼프, #카페, #드라마촬영지, #커피, #베이커리, #여유로운시간', '카페/레스토랑', 'Aurora Bakery Cafe Seongsu Branch', 'Dr. Slump', '2-minute walk from Exit 3 of Seongsu Station, 126 Achasan-ro, Seongdong-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Dr. Slump, #Cafe, #DramaShoot, #Coffee, #Bakery, #RelaxingTime', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kSbfe/btsFDUtmPLE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOA04ShXcj7iY0iY0rXwqwcch-ch3GUzOH7FFlbiWl4R/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OVjFbjmBd29u4whIdth5owD%2F9BM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FkUeQ/btsFENmXO84/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHvKGXiweuGy0fZGfNY7gu6LFhjkjAYlwUgTSZeHo73k/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2rTgWzE2ClPCHHDf6YOqAJYs2Zw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/F2OVB/btsFFKXnsCR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIUbq5bmziAxqGI66ekiBi84Qv1S2WqFlhMAAN-LsTtL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Tfm0cwHievQ08z8c926OOb%2Bjizg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kSbfe/btsFDUtmPLE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOA04ShXcj7iY0iY0rXwqwcch-ch3GUzOH7FFlbiWl4R/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OVjFbjmBd29u4whIdth5owD%2F9BM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FkUeQ/btsFENmXO84/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHvKGXiweuGy0fZGfNY7gu6LFhjkjAYlwUgTSZeHo73k/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2rTgWzE2ClPCHHDf6YOqAJYs2Zw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/F2OVB/btsFFKXnsCR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIUbq5bmziAxqGI66ekiBi84Qv1S2WqFlhMAAN-LsTtL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Tfm0cwHievQ08z8c926OOb%2Bjizg%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kSbfe/btsFDUtmPLE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOA04ShXcj7iY0iY0rXwqwcch-ch3GUzOH7FFlbiWl4R/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OVjFbjmBd29u4whIdth5owD%2F9BM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FkUeQ/btsFENmXO84/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHvKGXiweuGy0fZGfNY7gu6LFhjkjAYlwUgTSZeHo73k/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2rTgWzE2ClPCHHDf6YOqAJYs2Zw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/F2OVB/btsFFKXnsCR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIUbq5bmziAxqGI66ekiBi84Qv1S2WqFlhMAAN-LsTtL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Tfm0cwHievQ08z8c926OOb%2Bjizg%3D', 37.5434075, 127.0582301, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n- **제목:** 닥터슬럼프\n- **촬영지:** 오로라베이커리카페 성수점\n- **방문팁:** 드라마 속 감성을 느끼며 여유롭게 커피 한 잔을 즐겨보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n오로라베이커리카페 성수점은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적입니다. 이곳은 커피와 베이커리가 유명하며, 드라마의 한 장면처럼 친구와의 소중한 대화를 나누기 좋은 장소입니다. 커피 한 잔과 함께 여유로운 시간을 보내며, 드라마의 주인공들이 느꼈던 감정을 함께 경험해보세요.', 'The Aurora Bakery Cafe Seongsu branch is the filming location for the drama Dr Slump and its stylish interior and cozy atmosphere are attractive This place is famous for coffee and bakery and it is a good place to have precious conversations with friends like a scene in a drama Enjoy a relaxing time with a cup of coffee and experience the emotions the dramas main characters felt'),
	(684, '닥터슬럼프', '뽑기의신 신사역점', '서울 서초구 강남대로101길 20 신사역5번출구 도보1분', '뽑기의신 신사역점은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 촬영지로 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 직접 경험할 수 있습니다 아기자기한 게임기와 독특한 분위기가 어우러져 있어 친구들과 함께 방문하기에 안성맞춤입니다 주변에는 다양한 먹거리가 있어 촬영지 탐방 후 간단한 식사를 즐기기에도 좋습니다 이곳에서의 특별한 순간을 사진으로 남겨보세요', '#닥터슬럼프 #촬영지 #게임카페 #사진명소 #친구와함께 #신사역', '기타', 'the Shinshin Station of drawing', 'Dr. Slump', '1 minute walk from Exit 5 of Sinsa Station, 20, Gangnam-daero 101-gil, Seocho-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Dr. Slump #FilmingPlace #GameCafe #PhotoAttractions #WithFriend #Sinsa Station', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zCo1V/btsEWgcH9F5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGOf4kQ4dFCfvOG8pJaAtnLDVpdoYJhkVahYKt6Q74Sz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BPlylpmNUe0Wk6308n7SMUE17II%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wQCiz/btsEZQXTivf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACoaRuDCHPOQpAQ13Hz2O5Xs9ufKITqp-b1Plo47k-a1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mtwD%2FYxyrARbDKKpahFh%2BkbINkg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bGxScQ/btsEZmvYHE2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO9ZhsYAAU5SGOZ_o45tQZl2wPArgvnpn0mi32vB_KZD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eJHz9xGPmJmJzY5IIpMnmnIdXyE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nFUhI/btsE2A7VTZi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMZ4c75w8cgBVnP4KgBSUJrJO0bZ_bGp8x1a2NabWk_o/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=i9r7L2u50wsdXunqsx7dVJqTLB0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zCo1V/btsEWgcH9F5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGOf4kQ4dFCfvOG8pJaAtnLDVpdoYJhkVahYKt6Q74Sz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BPlylpmNUe0Wk6308n7SMUE17II%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wQCiz/btsEZQXTivf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACoaRuDCHPOQpAQ13Hz2O5Xs9ufKITqp-b1Plo47k-a1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mtwD%2FYxyrARbDKKpahFh%2BkbINkg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bGxScQ/btsEZmvYHE2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO9ZhsYAAU5SGOZ_o45tQZl2wPArgvnpn0mi32vB_KZD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eJHz9xGPmJmJzY5IIpMnmnIdXyE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nFUhI/btsE2A7VTZi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMZ4c75w8cgBVnP4KgBSUJrJO0bZ_bGp8x1a2NabWk_o/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=i9r7L2u50wsdXunqsx7dVJqTLB0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zCo1V/btsEWgcH9F5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGOf4kQ4dFCfvOG8pJaAtnLDVpdoYJhkVahYKt6Q74Sz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BPlylpmNUe0Wk6308n7SMUE17II%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wQCiz/btsEZQXTivf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACoaRuDCHPOQpAQ13Hz2O5Xs9ufKITqp-b1Plo47k-a1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mtwD%2FYxyrARbDKKpahFh%2BkbINkg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bGxScQ/btsEZmvYHE2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO9ZhsYAAU5SGOZ_o45tQZl2wPArgvnpn0mi32vB_KZD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eJHz9xGPmJmJzY5IIpMnmnIdXyE%3D', 37.5169307, 127.0184376, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 닥터슬럼프\n- **촬영지:** 뽑기의신 신사역점\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 주요 촬영지로, 분위기를 느끼며 사진을 찍기 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n뽑기의신 신사역점은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 촬영지로, 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 직접 경험할 수 있습니다. 아기자기한 게임기와 독특한 분위기가 어우러져 있어, 친구들과 함께 방문하기에 안성맞춤입니다. 주변에는 다양한 먹거리가 있어 촬영지 탐방 후 간단한 식사를 즐기기에도 좋습니다. 이곳에서의 특별한 순간을 사진으로 남겨보세요!', 'The Shin Sinsa Station of the drawing is the filming location of the drama Dr Slump where you can experience the scenes filmed here firsthand With a cute game console and a unique atmosphere its perfect for visiting with friends There are various foods around so its good to enjoy a simple meal after visiting the filming location Take a picture of your special moment here'),
	(685, '닥터슬럼프', '도산대로', '서울 강남구 도산대로 145 신사역8번출구 도보6분', '도산대로는 현대적인 도시 풍경과 함께 다양한 카페와 레스토랑이 즐비한 곳으로 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 산책을 즐기기에 완벽한 장소입니다 특히 저녁 시간에는 화려한 조명과 함께 활기찬 분위기를 만끽할 수 있어 드라마 팬들에게는 잊지 못할 경험이 될 것입니다 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 마치 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 느껴보세요', '#도산대로 #닥터슬럼프 #밤거리 #KdramaTrip #StreetScene #서울', '거리/골목/광장', 'in bankruptcy', 'Dr. Slump', '6-minute walk from Exit 8 of Sinsa Station, 145 Dosan-daero, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '##Dr.Slump #NightStreet #KdramaTrip #StreetScene #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BM3xn/btsD1lZXbmH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPMnp5nCpADH5Jxry0he_2fY7m6IYgLGxg62CpDg5UYP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=M4TbzDvWuu0hB6R8Uvmgv48CRnU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/T2vLF/btsD3N80Zos/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFM_DkGSzYnnsisX_9yZh-ZvWbeG55YkZchbRyD95UYR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CKPm0UIoLmiL%2FZUAV%2FqBXpJYcvM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kJqOB/btsD2w1nuZf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGfPDvM7xL4aZFgS8v3-Puu-DZlMWpP3X_W2y8-HZ3nP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2%2BjYBGK7wWvjjjvAkG%2FPVTJY5fU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BM3xn/btsD1lZXbmH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPMnp5nCpADH5Jxry0he_2fY7m6IYgLGxg62CpDg5UYP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=M4TbzDvWuu0hB6R8Uvmgv48CRnU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/T2vLF/btsD3N80Zos/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFM_DkGSzYnnsisX_9yZh-ZvWbeG55YkZchbRyD95UYR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CKPm0UIoLmiL%2FZUAV%2FqBXpJYcvM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kJqOB/btsD2w1nuZf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGfPDvM7xL4aZFgS8v3-Puu-DZlMWpP3X_W2y8-HZ3nP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2%2BjYBGK7wWvjjjvAkG%2FPVTJY5fU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BM3xn/btsD1lZXbmH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPMnp5nCpADH5Jxry0he_2fY7m6IYgLGxg62CpDg5UYP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=M4TbzDvWuu0hB6R8Uvmgv48CRnU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/T2vLF/btsD3N80Zos/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFM_DkGSzYnnsisX_9yZh-ZvWbeG55YkZchbRyD95UYR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CKPm0UIoLmiL%2FZUAV%2FqBXpJYcvM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kJqOB/btsD2w1nuZf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGfPDvM7xL4aZFgS8v3-Puu-DZlMWpP3X_W2y8-HZ3nP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2%2BjYBGK7wWvjjjvAkG%2FPVTJY5fU%3D', 37.5185356, 127.0244178, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 닥터슬럼프\n- **촬영지:** 도산대로\n- **방문팁:** 도산대로의 밤거리를 걸으며 드라마 속 장면을 떠올려 보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 거리/골목\n\n### 여행 포인트\n도산대로는 현대적인 도시 풍경과 함께 다양한 카페와 레스토랑이 즐비한 곳으로, 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 산책을 즐기기에 완벽한 장소입니다. 특히 저녁 시간에는 화려한 조명과 함께 활기찬 분위기를 만끽할 수 있어, 드라마 팬들에게는 잊지 못할 경험이 될 것입니다. 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며, 마치 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 느껴보세요.', 'Dosandaero is a place full of various cafes and restaurants along with a modern urban landscape and it is the perfect place to enjoy a leisurely walk while feeling the sensibility of the drama Especially in the evening you can enjoy a lively atmosphere with colorful lights which will be an unforgettable experience for drama fans Think of the scenes shot here and feel like youve become the main character'),
	(686, '닥터슬럼프', '29펍 4호점', '서울 강남구 강남대로110길 14 신논현역4번출구 도보2분', '29펍 4호점은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 매력적인 촬영지로 현대적이고 세련된 인테리어가 특징입니다 바 뒤에 늘어선 다양한 음료들이 시선을 사로잡으며 아늑한 조명 아래에서 친구들과의 대화나 혼자만의 시간을 즐기기에 안성맞춤입니다 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 특별한 순간을 만들어 보세요', '#KdramaTrip, #카페, #닥터슬럼프, #강남, #촬영지, #힐링', '카페/레스토랑', '29 Pub 4', 'Dr. Slump', '2-minute walk from Exit 4 of Sinnonhyeon Station, 14, Gangnam-daero 110-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Kdrama Trip, #Cafe, #Dr.Slump, #Gangnam, #FilmingPlace, #Healing', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/RmOFF/btsD4G9vDjN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGIhIYgbonSgAo1jqW-puHxYGmCmrdBI3oA5BhJW7UbL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Yx%2BYt3cRF%2BnJgnVH0un%2FbRMmpWs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ray15/btsD4THDHeS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEn3uw3J0wuvVWHC1D64GLiiNZuM-m2g74IdEWfHOdJs/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=264g3ZavoHJFHFAv4CFMATn9JXk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pgRZC/btsD4RQAQpk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEFv0N0prJ5JcY5Ns2ZwN-BcWFJfPt3w5f4w_hb2Jzvd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TnkACp6WjccYS6jRpZlD7xigI%2BM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/RmOFF/btsD4G9vDjN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGIhIYgbonSgAo1jqW-puHxYGmCmrdBI3oA5BhJW7UbL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Yx%2BYt3cRF%2BnJgnVH0un%2FbRMmpWs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ray15/btsD4THDHeS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEn3uw3J0wuvVWHC1D64GLiiNZuM-m2g74IdEWfHOdJs/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=264g3ZavoHJFHFAv4CFMATn9JXk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pgRZC/btsD4RQAQpk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEFv0N0prJ5JcY5Ns2ZwN-BcWFJfPt3w5f4w_hb2Jzvd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TnkACp6W