	(687, '닥터슬럼프', '오브제성형외과의원', '서울 강남구 테헤란로4길 5 강남역1번출구 도보2분', '오브제성형외과의원은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 주요 촬영지로 현대적이고 세련된 인테리어가 특징입니다 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들은 드라마의 매력을 더해주며 팬들에게는 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 방문 시 드라마의 분위기를 느끼며 사진을 찍는 것도 좋은 추억이 될 것입니다', '#닥터슬럼프 #서울 #촬영지 #K드라마 #성형외과 #사진찍기', '기타/판별불가', 'an objet plastic surgeon', 'Dr. Slump', '2-minute walk from Exit 1 of Gangnam Station, 5, Teheran-ro 4-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Dr. Slump #Seoul #FilmingPlace #Kdrama #PlasticSurgical #TakingPhotographs', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/brPvky/btsD7kE43LE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABht7kts-DZf-eHdAOlBKeqzbBtFWXSgUE1-dXCjbTW9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bwBYmFjm0qdb5J5RASLr%2FlmYptc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ebXhrp/btsD8zaYC53/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALpf-kaZLEOBYPlQAUHgRcWcaZEz9eUNFX2VjXE5uAht/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DqE9n54JtHscWocmEbZCnLRKrWE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bGI9l6/btsD4r5QXxF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEQ42MKV5r9aD1Sr-KqahDGRilKS16B9a_PIzAzORo5t/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=p2lnZheNGIW7vAluZAFIXQibt4o%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/brPvky/btsD7kE43LE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABht7kts-DZf-eHdAOlBKeqzbBtFWXSgUE1-dXCjbTW9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bwBYmFjm0qdb5J5RASLr%2FlmYptc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ebXhrp/btsD8zaYC53/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALpf-kaZLEOBYPlQAUHgRcWcaZEz9eUNFX2VjXE5uAht/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DqE9n54JtHscWocmEbZCnLRKrWE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bGI9l6/btsD4r5QXxF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEQ42MKV5r9aD1Sr-KqahDGRilKS16B9a_PIzAzORo5t/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=p2lnZheNGIW7vAluZAFIXQibt4o%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/brPvky/btsD7kE43LE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABht7kts-DZf-eHdAOlBKeqzbBtFWXSgUE1-dXCjbTW9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bwBYmFjm0qdb5J5RASLr%2FlmYptc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ebXhrp/btsD8zaYC53/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALpf-kaZLEOBYPlQAUHgRcWcaZEz9eUNFX2VjXE5uAht/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DqE9n54JtHscWocmEbZCnLRKrWE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bGI9l6/btsD4r5QXxF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEQ42MKV5r9aD1Sr-KqahDGRilKS16B9a_PIzAzORo5t/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=p2lnZheNGIW7vAluZAFIXQibt4o%3D', 37.4979351, 127.0299673, '### 닥터슬럼프 촬영지 정보\n\n- **제목:** 닥터슬럼프\n- **촬영지:** 오브제성형외과의원\n- **방문팁:** 촬영지에서 드라마의 주요 장면을 생생하게 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n오브제성형외과의원은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 주요 촬영지로, 현대적이고 세련된 인테리어가 특징입니다. 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들은 드라마의 매력을 더해주며, 팬들에게는 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 방문 시 드라마의 분위기를 느끼며 사진을 찍는 것도 좋은 추억이 될 것입니다.', 'The Objet Plastic Surgery Clinic is the main filming location for the drama Dr Slump featuring modern and sophisticated interiors The scenes filmed here add to the dramas appeal and provide fans with a special experience It will also be a good memory to take pictures while feeling the atmosphere of the drama when visiting'),
	(688, '닥터슬럼프', '정겨운오뎅집 삼성점 앞', '서울 강남구 테헤란로81길 56 삼성중앙역5번출구 도보6분', '정겨운오뎅집 삼성점 앞은 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 촬영지로 아늑한 분위기와 맛있는 오뎅이 매력적인 곳입니다 이곳은 촬영 장면의 생생함을 느낄 수 있는 장소로 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보길 추천합니다 주변의 다양한 가게들도 함께 탐방하며 색다른 경험을 즐길 수 있습니다', '#닥터슬럼프 #오뎅 #촬영지 #강남 #맛집', '거리/골목/광장', 'In front of Samsung branch of a friendly fish cake shop', 'Dr. Slump', '6-minute walk from Exit 5 of Samsung Jungang Station, 56, Teheran-ro 81-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Dr. Slump #Odeng #FilmingPlace #Gangnam #FoodPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/czmKfI/btsFFNUj6wi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGwg_xxLL8FVrZJVl4qadDIfgz6yAlpHBpou5aRfkWlQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nE5qa1%2BpFKlxe%2Bn8kve6b6pSGKI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bx6O2e/btsFFl47q2u/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABr9KSynxe4j3IDHbo6xa2fIf-3qOdNuGFIxpEBtRq4N/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MvNrcOPCeMh%2F1D0u74cyrHQQUlo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/buLAwB/btsFEMPoovR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABqYZewRN84n2G1PzLgUiDZh4-icaNVxVVIrCulC-dWb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=klPKhaqwhde3NohAyaa2JyQFtNo%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/czmKfI/btsFFNUj6wi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGwg_xxLL8FVrZJVl4qadDIfgz6yAlpHBpou5aRfkWlQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nE5qa1%2BpFKlxe%2Bn8kve6b6pSGKI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bx6O2e/btsFFl47q2u/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABr9KSynxe4j3IDHbo6xa2fIf-3qOdNuGFIxpEBtRq4N/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MvNrcOPCeMh%2F1D0u74cyrHQQUlo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/buLAwB/btsFEMPoovR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABqYZewRN84n2G1PzLgUiDZh4-icaNVxVVIrCulC-dWb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=klPKhaqwhde3NohAyaa2JyQFtNo%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/czmKfI/btsFFNUj6wi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGwg_xxLL8FVrZJVl4qadDIfgz6yAlpHBpou5aRfkWlQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nE5qa1%2BpFKlxe%2Bn8kve6b6pSGKI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bx6O2e/btsFFl47q2u/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABr9KSynxe4j3IDHbo6xa2fIf-3qOdNuGFIxpEBtRq4N/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MvNrcOPCeMh%2F1D0u74cyrHQQUlo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/buLAwB/btsFEMPoovR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABqYZewRN84n2G1PzLgUiDZh4-icaNVxVVIrCulC-dWb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=klPKhaqwhde3NohAyaa2JyQFtNo%3D', 37.5101796, 127.0560234, '### 거리 촬영지 큐레이터\n\n**닥터슬럼프**  \n**촬영지:** 정겨운오뎅집 삼성점 앞  \n**방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 오뎅을 즐겨보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #닥터슬럼프  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리  \n\n#### 여행 포인트\n정겨운오뎅집 삼성점 앞은 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기와 맛있는 오뎅이 매력적인 곳입니다. 이곳은 촬영 장면의 생생함을 느낄 수 있는 장소로, 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보길 추천합니다. 주변의 다양한 가게들도 함께 탐방하며 색다른 경험을 즐길 수 있습니다.', 'The front of the Samsung branch of the friendly fish cake shop is the filming location of the drama Dr Slump and the cozy atmosphere and delicious fish cake are attractive This is a place where you can feel the vividness of the shooting scene and if you are a fan of dramas I recommend you to visit You can enjoy a different experience by exploring various stores around you together'),
	(689, '닥터슬럼프', '소노펠리체 컨벤션', '서울 강남구 테헤란로87길 22 삼성역5번출구 도보6분', '소노펠리체 컨벤션은 현대적인 디자인과 우아한 분위기로 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 매력적인 촬영지로 알려져 있습니다 이곳은 다양한 이벤트와 컨벤션이 열리는 장소로 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험을 선사합니다 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 주변을 탐방하고 아름다운 경관을 감상하며 사진도 남겨보세요', '#닥터슬럼프 #촬영지 #소노펠리체 #서울 #드라마투어 #이벤트', '기타', 'Sonopelice Convention', 'Dr. Slump', '6-minute walk from Exit 5 of Samseong Station, 22 Teheran-ro 87-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Dr. Slump #FilmingPlace #Sonofelice #Seoul #DramaTour #Event', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bnoudD/btsD3FXxOWj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPV7lAVKQW_xcI3eeEcPxdaV-qU1wlSYa8nUIq0p76y3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bO9lIbHS%2FpU3qOjOwXZ5zen7BkU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lMc0W/btsD2Igh004/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALVx9MVjBF39XbeY6bMvAnJTM7cakkCceoDeANlxbLM4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7f%2Fpq5fnZw2pL6C3c0opHCbfmVQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bzRSW9/btsD3NHVqwv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANSF2Px7xP2YIb4GdPENlYN7aIPVcPQ_YF6HYxumxRwH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DiUmxCAZjtNskiZnL02FgYwmqlE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qrIaN/btsD3mqqIVj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA49gEhjJGZf5JStTdmKudRzm20xCbYKPEVHoGX1032l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5HaowjqGDD1%2FgaM445t8RQRti4A%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bnoudD/btsD3FXxOWj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPV7lAVKQW_xcI3eeEcPxdaV-qU1wlSYa8nUIq0p76y3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bO9lIbHS%2FpU3qOjOwXZ5zen7BkU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lMc0W/btsD2Igh004/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALVx9MVjBF39XbeY6bMvAnJTM7cakkCceoDeANlxbLM4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7f%2Fpq5fnZw2pL6C3c0opHCbfmVQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bzRSW9/btsD3NHVqwv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANSF2Px7xP2YIb4GdPENlYN7aIPVcPQ_YF6HYxumxRwH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DiUmxCAZjtNskiZnL02FgYwmqlE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qrIaN/btsD3mqqIVj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA49gEhjJGZf5JStTdmKudRzm20xCbYKPEVHoGX1032l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5HaowjqGDD1%2FgaM445t8RQRti4A%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bnoudD/btsD3FXxOWj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPV7lAVKQW_xcI3eeEcPxdaV-qU1wlSYa8nUIq0p76y3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bO9lIbHS%2FpU3qOjOwXZ5zen7BkU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lMc0W/btsD2Igh004/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALVx9MVjBF39XbeY6bMvAnJTM7cakkCceoDeANlxbLM4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7f%2Fpq5fnZw2pL6C3c0opHCbfmVQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bzRSW9/btsD3NHVqwv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANSF2Px7xP2YIb4GdPENlYN7aIPVcPQ_YF6HYxumxRwH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DiUmxCAZjtNskiZnL02FgYwmqlE%3D', 37.5095909, 127.0592738, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 닥터슬럼프\n- **촬영지**: 소노펠리체 컨벤션\n- **방문팁**: 드라마의 주요 장면을 감상하며 촬영지를 탐방해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n소노펠리체 컨벤션은 현대적인 디자인과 우아한 분위기로, 드라마 \'닥터슬럼프\'의 매력적인 촬영지로 알려져 있습니다. 이곳은 다양한 이벤트와 컨벤션이 열리는 장소로, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험을 선사합니다. 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 주변을 탐방하고, 아름다운 경관을 감상하며 사진도 남겨보세요.', 'With its modern design and elegant atmosphere the Sonopelice Convention is known as a charming filming location for the drama Dr Slump This is a place where various events and conventions are held giving drama fans a special experience Explore the surroundings remember the scenes taken enjoy the beautiful scenery and leave pictures'),
	(690, '닥터슬럼프', '롯데호텔월드 도림', '서울 송파구 올림픽로 240 32층 잠실역3번출구 바로앞', '롯데호텔월드 도림은 현대적인 디자인과 고급스러운 분위기로 유명합니다 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 촬영지로 선택된 이곳은 멋진 인테리어와 함께 편안한 숙박 경험을 제공합니다 호텔 내부의 넓고 세련된 복도는 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리게 하며 방문객들에게 특별한 감성을 선사합니다 다양한 시설과 서비스를 갖춘 이 호텔은 여행 중 편안한 휴식을 취할 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다', '#KdramaTrip, #닥터슬럼프, #호텔, #촬영지, #고급스러움, #서울', '호텔/숙소', 'Lotte Hotel World Dorim', 'Dr. Slump', 'Right in front of Exit 3 of Jamsil Station, 32nd floor, 240 Olympic-ro, Songpa-gu, Seoul', 'a hotel/dormitory', '#KdramaTrip, #Dr.Slump, #Hotel, #FilmingPlace, #luxury, #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7DNt4/btsFm3RdLNC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMRQUQeQHdLwT2tfSkhpmOCr3dQq2qmYoKBzAuCPZIHP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=U6mBtKoAH%2F8nnRSWn0YCPs9FixU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b4qo9o/btsFmkyQofq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANbeZUZ09vxQAGFrgbHX7Ca4mziLVbTqJynSHjuU2nF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bTSJiz3zmFI%2BcVjlyT3tHr%2BHWxI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cvtD4v/btsFpQp4acH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM2_O_g0PyLHfQGnWrGMEjPgYc9SkXhGsaOIq3XpKupG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=py4tvSoIJuYkv1902wSedfiMkMo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LnG0C/btsFpRbqga8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHpz91Jo8AswlHgG6M8SD1D2Wzf916WKRMRq9p7VTD1n/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kAzuK85EXDR4OQd6DQ5VdJMheT4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7DNt4/btsFm3RdLNC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMRQUQeQHdLwT2tfSkhpmOCr3dQq2qmYoKBzAuCPZIHP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=U6mBtKoAH%2F8nnRSWn0YCPs9FixU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b4qo9o/btsFmkyQofq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANbeZUZ09vxQAGFrgbHX7Ca4mziLVbTqJynSHjuU2nF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bTSJiz3zmFI%2BcVjlyT3tHr%2BHWxI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cvtD4v/btsFpQp4acH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM2_O_g0PyLHfQGnWrGMEjPgYc9SkXhGsaOIq3XpKupG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=py4tvSoIJuYkv1902wSedfiMkMo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LnG0C/btsFpRbqga8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHpz91Jo8AswlHgG6M8SD1D2Wzf916WKRMRq9p7VTD1n/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kAzuK85EXDR4OQd6DQ5VdJMheT4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7DNt4/btsFm3RdLNC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMRQUQeQHdLwT2tfSkhpmOCr3dQq2qmYoKBzAuCPZIHP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=U6mBtKoAH%2F8nnRSWn0YCPs9FixU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b4qo9o/btsFmkyQofq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANbeZUZ09vxQAGFrgbHX7Ca4mziLVbTqJynSHjuU2nF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bTSJiz3zmFI%2BcVjlyT3tHr%2BHWxI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cvtD4v/btsFpQp4acH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM2_O_g0PyLHfQGnWrGMEjPgYc9SkXhGsaOIq3XpKupG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=py4tvSoIJuYkv1902wSedfiMkMo%3D', 37.5112862, 127.0979392, '### 호텔 정보\n- **제목**: 닥터슬럼프\n- **촬영지**: 롯데호텔월드 도림\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마 속 화려한 장면을 그대로 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Hotel\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 호텔\n\n### 여행 포인트\n롯데호텔월드 도림은 현대적인 디자인과 고급스러운 분위기로 유명합니다. 드라마 \'닥터슬럼프\'의 촬영지로 선택된 이곳은, 멋진 인테리어와 함께 편안한 숙박 경험을 제공합니다. 호텔 내부의 넓고 세련된 복도는 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리게 하며, 방문객들에게 특별한 감성을 선사합니다. 다양한 시설과 서비스를 갖춘 이 호텔은 여행 중 편안한 휴식을 취할 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다.', 'Lotte Hotel World Dorim is famous for its modern design and luxurious atmosphere Chosen as the filming location for the drama Dr Slump it offers a comfortable accommodation experience with great interiors The spacious and sophisticated hallways inside the hotel remind visitors of scenes in the drama and provide special sensibilities With a variety of facilities and services this hotel is the best place to relax while traveling'),
	(691, '닥터슬럼프', '라티튜드32', '서울 송파구 잠실로 209 잠실역10번출구 도보6분', '라티튜드32는 현대적인 인테리어와 환상적인 야경으로 유명한 카페입니다 드라마 닥터슬럼프의 촬영지로 이곳에서의 식사는 단순한 식사를 넘어 드라마의 한 장면에 들어선 듯한 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 아늑한 분위기 속에서 여유로운 시간을 보내며 친구나 연인과 함께 소중한 추억을 만들어보세요', '#닥터슬럼프 #야경 #카페 #레스토랑 #서울 #특별한경험', '카페/레스토랑', 'Latitude 32', 'Dr. Slump', '6 minutes walk from Exit 10 of Jamsil Station, 209, Jamsil-ro, Songpa-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Dr. Slump #Nightscape #Café #Restaurant #Seoul #SpecialExperience', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cVDHoT/btsD0FEx9mA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD3xd2IoE3F5XDb7rK1x2q7jJTNEED2SRYvkuBza-fd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CaQgrZyTnF1YjRWGbNDPdW1986k%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5XiEk/btsD0FqWUJm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH1K-JOrNfpSZeGV_eWV5vJy1bZLniVqgL5nV-Bx1uSg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8vtE3T5FiKASwryIxuu6iNT50ho%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xHCEg/btsFpQKjpRX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACGOn3svCowBCFCxDKnJwyeHIIuQ1MYd1tQACQzCPTM0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bnZKwny0gOCtl0fkVoE7wjqNH1g%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cV25Hm/btsFs2DhQ2Z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP0tQL5B6CjQSFjeIUHd7HLONVrh4S3sezAmgD2fWH1w/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cUTqIEtH4efjs7eeWIQpKO6k6b4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cVDHoT/btsD0FEx9mA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD3xd2IoE3F5XDb7rK1x2q7jJTNEED2SRYvkuBza-fd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CaQgrZyTnF1YjRWGbNDPdW1986k%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5XiEk/btsD0FqWUJm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH1K-JOrNfpSZeGV_eWV5vJy1bZLniVqgL5nV-Bx1uSg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8vtE3T5FiKASwryIxuu6iNT50ho%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xHCEg/btsFpQKjpRX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACGOn3svCowBCFCxDKnJwyeHIIuQ1MYd1tQACQzCPTM0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bnZKwny0gOCtl0fkVoE7wjqNH1g%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cV25Hm/btsFs2DhQ2Z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP0tQL5B6CjQSFjeIUHd7HLONVrh4S3sezAmgD2fWH1w/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cUTqIEtH4efjs7eeWIQpKO6k6b4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cVDHoT/btsD0FEx9mA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD3xd2IoE3F5XDb7rK1x2q7jJTNEED2SRYvkuBza-fd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CaQgrZyTnF1YjRWGbNDPdW1986k%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5XiEk/btsD0FqWUJm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH1K-JOrNfpSZeGV_eWV5vJy1bZLniVqgL5nV-Bx1uSg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8vtE3T5FiKASwryIxuu6iNT50ho%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xHCEg/btsFpQKjpRX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACGOn3svCowBCFCxDKnJwyeHIIuQ1MYd1tQACQzCPTM0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bnZKwny0gOCtl0fkVoE7wjqNH1g%3D', 37.5138825, 127.1064002, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n- **제목:** 닥터슬럼프\n- **촬영지:** 라티튜드32\n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 멋진 야경과 함께 드라마의 분위기를 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n라티튜드32는 현대적인 인테리어와 환상적인 야경으로 유명한 카페입니다. 드라마 "닥터슬럼프"의 촬영지로, 이곳에서의 식사는 단순한 식사를 넘어 드라마의 한 장면에 들어선 듯한 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 아늑한 분위기 속에서 여유로운 시간을 보내며, 친구나 연인과 함께 소중한 추억을 만들어보세요.', 'Latitude 32 is a cafe famous for its modern interior and fantastic night view As the filming location for the drama Dr Slump the meal here offers a special experience that feels like entering a scene in the drama beyond just a meal Spend a relaxing time in a cozy atmosphere and make precious memories with friends or lovers'),
	(692, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '신촌토끼굴 앞 광장', '서울 서대문구 대신동 143-28 신촌역2번출구(경의중앙선) 도보2분', '신촌토끼굴 앞 광장은 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 상징적인 촬영지로 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다 주변에는 다양한 카페와 음식점이 있어 드라마 촬영 후 여유롭게 시간을 보내기에도 좋은 장소입니다', '#힘쎈여자강남순, #촬영지, #신촌, #드라마팬, #사진찍기좋은곳', '거리/골목/광장', 'The square in front of the rabbit hole in Sinchon', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', 'Exit 2 of Sinchon Station (Gyeongui Jungang Line) 143-28, Daeshin-dong, Seodaemun-gu, Seoul, 2 minutes on foot', 'a street/alley/square', '#Strong Woman Gangnam Soon, #FilmingPlace, #Sinchon, #DramaFan, #Good Place to Take a Photo', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4Fcmt/btsA1e2q3Ux/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHhcrRKs6wcIbnp_mb1N-tTejcVofpmGM6DvnK1-QxnV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=k72RUtzOQiBlEfA44BnZC32NyR4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/brbRxl/btsATX1FexX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI2p8M92zFQuatzwlRmj9T7haGwXG5bTL-uDIC7xIcze/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FZOlGH5MqFIPxk%2BzvQd9rhYhlCU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bVPGld/btsASJb6TrJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABHIXGpetf0VkVyCJgrlgOfnDST1guwqZW827pusrKEr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=drGeV6sRyMuiWKieXDc50WEO9oQ%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4Fcmt/btsA1e2q3Ux/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHhcrRKs6wcIbnp_mb1N-tTejcVofpmGM6DvnK1-QxnV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=k72RUtzOQiBlEfA44BnZC32NyR4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/brbRxl/btsATX1FexX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI2p8M92zFQuatzwlRmj9T7haGwXG5bTL-uDIC7xIcze/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FZOlGH5MqFIPxk%2BzvQd9rhYhlCU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bVPGld/btsASJb6TrJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABHIXGpetf0VkVyCJgrlgOfnDST1guwqZW827pusrKEr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=drGeV6sRyMuiWKieXDc50WEO9oQ%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4Fcmt/btsA1e2q3Ux/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHhcrRKs6wcIbnp_mb1N-tTejcVofpmGM6DvnK1-QxnV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=k72RUtzOQiBlEfA44BnZC32NyR4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/brbRxl/btsATX1FexX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI2p8M92zFQuatzwlRmj9T7haGwXG5bTL-uDIC7xIcze/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FZOlGH5MqFIPxk%2BzvQd9rhYhlCU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bVPGld/btsASJb6TrJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABHIXGpetf0VkVyCJgrlgOfnDST1guwqZW827pusrKEr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=drGeV6sRyMuiWKieXDc50WEO9oQ%3D', 37.5605884, 126.9409905, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 힘쎈여자 강남순\n- **촬영지**: 신촌토끼굴 앞 광장\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 주요 촬영지로, 팬들이 방문해 사진을 찍기 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n신촌토끼굴 앞 광장은 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 상징적인 촬영지로, 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다. 주변에는 다양한 카페와 음식점이 있어 드라마 촬영 후 여유롭게 시간을 보내기에도 좋은 장소입니다.', 'The square in front of the rabbit hole in Sinchon is the iconic filming location of the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon and if you visit here you can have a special experience by recalling the scenes in the drama There are various cafes and restaurants nearby so it is a good place to spend time leisurely after filming a drama'),
	(693, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '서강대교', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 83-2', '서강대교는 서울의 아름다운 야경을 감상할 수 있는 명소로 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 긴장감 넘치는 장면들이 촬영된 장소입니다 이곳에서 강남의 화려한 스카이라인을 배경으로 드라마의 주인공처럼 스릴 넘치는 순간을 만끽해 보세요 다리 위에서 바라보는 한강의 경치는 더욱 특별한 경험을 선사합니다', '#야경 #드라마촬영지 #서울관광 #강남 #한강 #스릴', '교통/역/터미널', 'Sogang Bridge', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '83-2 Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'traffic/station/terminal', '#Night view #DramaFilmingPlace #SeoulTourism #Gangnam #Han River #Thrill', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0dqSA/btsytOlB8CI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANH4HGrJcohu0AWpYRhusdE1OJy9TIZ64ThwnEDN5LFJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PILHRRhIhk%2BM3eLjxJWNOzsLg40%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/3rrnm/btsyuKC010A/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHzhG0s1yLjzGPAMyk-FskBEUh6M0rd0L1t7hSd7qxSB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dgfvQNv5YwKyPrEyjezvBSg5piE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0dqSA/btsytOlB8CI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANH4HGrJcohu0AWpYRhusdE1OJy9TIZ64ThwnEDN5LFJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PILHRRhIhk%2BM3eLjxJWNOzsLg40%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/3rrnm/btsyuKC010A/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHzhG0s1yLjzGPAMyk-FskBEUh6M0rd0L1t7hSd7qxSB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dgfvQNv5YwKyPrEyjezvBSg5piE%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0dqSA/btsytOlB8CI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANH4HGrJcohu0AWpYRhusdE1OJy9TIZ64ThwnEDN5LFJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PILHRRhIhk%2BM3eLjxJWNOzsLg40%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/3rrnm/btsyuKC010A/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHzhG0s1yLjzGPAMyk-FskBEUh6M0rd0L1t7hSd7qxSB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dgfvQNv5YwKyPrEyjezvBSg5piE%3D', NULL, 37.5385603, 126.9256982, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 힘쎈여자 강남순\n- **촬영지:** 서강대교\n- **방문팁:** 서강대교에서 멋진 야경을 감상하며 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올려보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Transit\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 교통/역\n\n### 여행 포인트\n서강대교는 서울의 아름다운 야경을 감상할 수 있는 명소로, 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 긴장감 넘치는 장면들이 촬영된 장소입니다. 이곳에서 강남의 화려한 스카이라인을 배경으로 드라마의 주인공처럼 스릴 넘치는 순간을 만끽해 보세요. 다리 위에서 바라보는 한강의 경치는 더욱 특별한 경험을 선사합니다.', 'Sogang Bridge is a place where you can enjoy the beautiful night view of Seoul and it is a place where tense scenes of the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon were filmed Enjoy a thrilling moment like the main character of a drama against the backdrop of Gangnams colorful skyline here The view of the Han River from the bridge provides a more special experience'),
	(694, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '국회앞 지하보도', '서울 영등포구 여의대로 38 여의도역2번출구 도보2분', '국회앞 지하보도는 도시의 복잡함 속에서 독특한 분위기를 제공하는 장소입니다 드라마의 배경이 된 이곳은 실제로도 많은 사람들의 이야기가 얽혀 있는 공간으로 촬영 당시의 감정을 느끼며 산책하기 좋은 곳입니다 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요', '#강남순 #촬영지 #드라마팬 #산책 #독특한분위기 #기억', '거리/골목/광장', 'an underground report in front of the National Assembly', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '2-minute walk from Exit 2 of Yeouido Station 38, Yeouido-daero, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Gangnam Soon #FilmingPlace #DramaFan #Walk #UniqueAttention #Memory', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5EGY4/btsywiM9EXl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0yUHYkiqyJOeGmAXx-Hch8w9gpYsSHyF-8D2jyY-dP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=V5yDYZeMiK6V7opGJrX4ff6GJWU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bSjG2E/btsyBkDFFJr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEpqT6XOU2ckZ6vQQbrB1cdqgAYLapbQyrgoRoXkS2Qb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CRi7ZVRgRuVAr9CWE%2BlPZCOn16s%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5EGY4/btsywiM9EXl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0yUHYkiqyJOeGmAXx-Hch8w9gpYsSHyF-8D2jyY-dP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=V5yDYZeMiK6V7opGJrX4ff6GJWU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bSjG2E/btsyBkDFFJr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEpqT6XOU2ckZ6vQQbrB1cdqgAYLapbQyrgoRoXkS2Qb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CRi7ZVRgRuVAr9CWE%2BlPZCOn16s%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5EGY4/btsywiM9EXl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0yUHYkiqyJOeGmAXx-Hch8w9gpYsSHyF-8D2jyY-dP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=V5yDYZeMiK6V7opGJrX4ff6GJWU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bSjG2E/btsyBkDFFJr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEpqT6XOU2ckZ6vQQbrB1cdqgAYLapbQyrgoRoXkS2Qb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CRi7ZVRgRuVAr9CWE%2BlPZCOn16s%3D', NULL, 37.5230582, 126.9213308, '### 힘쎈여자 강남순 촬영지: 국회앞 지하보도\n\n**방문 팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 주요 촬영지로, 다양한 장면을 감상하며 드라마의 분위기를 느낄 수 있습니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 국회앞 지하보도는 도시의 복잡함 속에서 독특한 분위기를 제공하는 장소입니다. 드라마의 배경이 된 이곳은 실제로도 많은 사람들의 이야기가 얽혀 있는 공간으로, 촬영 당시의 감정을 느끼며 산책하기 좋은 곳입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요.', 'The underground sidewalk in front of the National Assembly is a place that provides a unique atmosphere in the complexity of the city This place which is the background of the drama is actually a space where many peoples stories are intertwined and it is a good place to take a walk while feeling the emotions at the time of filming If you are a drama fan make special memories here'),
	(695, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '여의도물빛무대 옆', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 83-6 여의나루역2번출구 도보14분', '여의도물빛무대 옆은 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 주요 촬영지로 한강을 배경으로 한 멋진 풍경을 제공합니다 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 그대로 느낄 수 있는 장소로 여유롭게 산책하거나 사진을 찍기에 좋은 곳입니다 주변에는 다양한 카페와 레스토랑도 있어 드라마 촬영지를 방문한 후 편안한 시간을 보내기에도 적합합니다', '#여의도 #한강 #드라마촬영지 #산책 #사진촬영 #힘쎈여자강남순', '호수/강/해변', 'Next to the water stage in Yeouido', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '83-6 Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul, 14 minutes on foot from Exit 2 of Yeouido Station', 'a lake/river/beach', '#Yeouido #Han River #DramaFilmingPlace #Walk #Photoshoot #StrongWomen GangnamSoon', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4joj9/btsxqvHxEOZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAtpc_rd426asqkxtD1zsoxUZZE11nu2gVs0kAHAoqrZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WUOuwtVQaTORHu1WsWPYpenQF%2Fw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/be1N9p/btsxqyKUkc3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHY4aPFSzoK3PAPO3He1uG2PYptf1ZAZMjkS2wH94YK7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WBvVy9q1bWryaU1V3kqtgqaOe8o%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/boElI4/btsxh6BQi44/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIecWS_2uFsuPQ4M_gnGt7dEvOyCpfstGHtJXbsUb9fi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=96Sd11yNzhsW76aHo9ZE5yWMHJc%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4joj9/btsxqvHxEOZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAtpc_rd426asqkxtD1zsoxUZZE11nu2gVs0kAHAoqrZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WUOuwtVQaTORHu1WsWPYpenQF%2Fw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/be1N9p/btsxqyKUkc3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHY4aPFSzoK3PAPO3He1uG2PYptf1ZAZMjkS2wH94YK7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WBvVy9q1bWryaU1V3kqtgqaOe8o%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/boElI4/btsxh6BQi44/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIecWS_2uFsuPQ4M_gnGt7dEvOyCpfstGHtJXbsUb9fi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=96Sd11yNzhsW76aHo9ZE5yWMHJc%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4joj9/btsxqvHxEOZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAtpc_rd426asqkxtD1zsoxUZZE11nu2gVs0kAHAoqrZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WUOuwtVQaTORHu1WsWPYpenQF%2Fw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/be1N9p/btsxqyKUkc3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHY4aPFSzoK3PAPO3He1uG2PYptf1ZAZMjkS2wH94YK7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WBvVy9q1bWryaU1V3kqtgqaOe8o%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/boElI4/btsxh6BQi44/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIecWS_2uFsuPQ4M_gnGt7dEvOyCpfstGHtJXbsUb9fi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=96Sd11yNzhsW76aHo9ZE5yWMHJc%3D', 37.5323795, 126.9244149, '### 힘쎈여자 강남순 촬영지 정보\n\n**촬영지:** 여의도물빛무대 옆  \n**방문 팁:** 아름다운 한강의 경치를 감상하며 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 기타  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n여의도물빛무대 옆은 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 주요 촬영지로, 한강을 배경으로 한 멋진 풍경을 제공합니다. 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 그대로 느낄 수 있는 장소로, 여유롭게 산책하거나 사진을 찍기에 좋은 곳입니다. 주변에는 다양한 카페와 레스토랑도 있어, 드라마 촬영지를 방문한 후 편안한 시간을 보내기에도 적합합니다.', 'Next to the Yeouido Mulbit Stage is the main filming location for the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon which offers a wonderful view set on the Han River This is a place where you can feel the sensibility of the drama as it is and it is a good place to take a leisurely walk or take pictures There are also various cafes and restaurants nearby so it is also suitable for relaxing time after visiting drama filming locations'),
	(696, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '서머셋펠리스 서울', '서울 종로구 율곡로2길 7 안국역6번출구 도보6분', '서머셋펠리스 서울은 아름다운 정원과 현대적인 건축물이 어우러져 있어 드라마의 분위기를 그대로 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 차분한 분위기 속에서 휴식을 취하거나 사진을 남기기에 좋은 곳입니다 특히 가을철에는 단풍이 아름답게 물들어 더욱 매력적입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #힐링, #정원, #가을경치, #서머셋펠리스, #서울', '기타/판별불가', 'Somerset Palace Seoul', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '6-minute walk from Exit 6 of Anguk Station, 7, Yulgok-ro 2-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Drama filming location, #healing, #Garden, #AutumnScene, #SummersetFelice, #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bJ51SK/btsywxiRVmu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKyF9qHdXaGJd3JqlFahzzWzwo9auiX7BBt_zhwjPiyD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qcaANNuN1Tk16hEbfks3bS8bq5Q%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bx7YJZ/btsytZ8hwgr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB5_qpy8VZaO8xwM8caSuFYS5Wn0jce8XrKtgA5FhEnN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=SVZRQplLCUNDdDIw%2FaSJqEOuwTo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xDuSZ/btsyn01EVHC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPqqgdjjh2T5vVprNfN8nyPy1z6UGc7mKVTygNxR-2uy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iRzKJ8rq1KnYCb6ZspiHzyBXw%2FU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bJ51SK/btsywxiRVmu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKyF9qHdXaGJd3JqlFahzzWzwo9auiX7BBt_zhwjPiyD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qcaANNuN1Tk16hEbfks3bS8bq5Q%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bx7YJZ/btsytZ8hwgr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB5_qpy8VZaO8xwM8caSuFYS5Wn0jce8XrKtgA5FhEnN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=SVZRQplLCUNDdDIw%2FaSJqEOuwTo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xDuSZ/btsyn01EVHC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPqqgdjjh2T5vVprNfN8nyPy1z6UGc7mKVTygNxR-2uy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iRzKJ8rq1KnYCb6ZspiHzyBXw%2FU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bJ51SK/btsywxiRVmu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKyF9qHdXaGJd3JqlFahzzWzwo9auiX7BBt_zhwjPiyD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qcaANNuN1Tk16hEbfks3bS8bq5Q%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bx7YJZ/btsytZ8hwgr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB5_qpy8VZaO8xwM8caSuFYS5Wn0jce8XrKtgA5FhEnN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=SVZRQplLCUNDdDIw%2FaSJqEOuwTo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xDuSZ/btsyn01EVHC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPqqgdjjh2T5vVprNfN8nyPy1z6UGc7mKVTygNxR-2uy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iRzKJ8rq1KnYCb6ZspiHzyBXw%2FU%3D', 37.57509599999999, 126.9812249, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 힘쎈여자 강남순\n- **촬영지**: 서머셋펠리스 서울\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 매력을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n서머셋펠리스 서울은 아름다운 정원과 현대적인 건축물이 어우러져 있어, 드라마의 분위기를 그대로 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다. 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며, 차분한 분위기 속에서 휴식을 취하거나 사진을 남기기에 좋은 곳입니다. 특히, 가을철에는 단풍이 아름답게 물들어 더욱 매력적입니다.', 'Somerset Palace Seoul is a place where you can feel the atmosphere of the drama as it is with beautiful gardens and modern architecture It is a good place to relax or take pictures in a calm atmosphere recalling the scenes taken here In particular autumn leaves are beautifully colored in autumn making them more attractive'),
	(697, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '유목민몽골', '서울 중구 을지로44길 19 2층 동대문역사문화공원역12번출구 도보2분', '유목민몽골은 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 촬영지로 몽골의 전통적인 느낌을 살린 독특한 인테리어가 특징입니다 이곳에서는 몽골 전통 요리를 제공하며 아늑한 분위기 속에서 친구나 연인과 함께 특별한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 더욱 특별한 경험을 할 수 있을 것입니다', '#몽골요리, #KdramaTrip, #독특한분위기, #카페, #드라마촬영지', '카페/레스토랑', 'nomadic Mongolia', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '2-minute walk from Exit 12 of Dongdaemun History and Culture Park Station, 192 Euljiro 44-gil, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Mongolian cuisine, #KdramaTrip, #Unique atmosphere, #Café, #DramaShootPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCbb8w/btszLp5ImMQ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPWDgWDD0qDAxj7G-O-79lZNZy-P0CfaKnJbUWUwVYpS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KmreZXjEtQOidnni1lKEOswohNU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/F6wYF/btszJZAhmQp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADi7aJNnM1N5HejzSGl-KhCj-kr_dR03P9_Zg5jn1VwR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bVW6LYQAseuedsEZvnEcl5qYf9A%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/caqtAg/btszKbG7PZ6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGg7lL53s23QaltvkBpCRlE-u5b8kpHq7K73KhOSiocS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ecoi%2FezdAKWmqP3uLhE9anMJEAE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UbMen/btszLp5ImBD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK7HrlPNnLLcbhMyMtiAm_AgDqJxhvMCy-fYr6khh9nO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eiOYhUZeJOuHMb1rc0DlHPQ51uY%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCbb8w/btszLp5ImMQ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPWDgWDD0qDAxj7G-O-79lZNZy-P0CfaKnJbUWUwVYpS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KmreZXjEtQOidnni1lKEOswohNU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/F6wYF/btszJZAhmQp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADi7aJNnM1N5HejzSGl-KhCj-kr_dR03P9_Zg5jn1VwR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bVW6LYQAseuedsEZvnEcl5qYf9A%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/caqtAg/btszKbG7PZ6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGg7lL53s23QaltvkBpCRlE-u5b8kpHq7K73KhOSiocS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ecoi%2FezdAKWmqP3uLhE9anMJEAE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UbMen/btszLp5ImBD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK7HrlPNnLLcbhMyMtiAm_AgDqJxhvMCy-fYr6khh9nO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eiOYhUZeJOuHMb1rc0DlHPQ51uY%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCbb8w/btszLp5ImMQ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPWDgWDD0qDAxj7G-O-79lZNZy-P0CfaKnJbUWUwVYpS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KmreZXjEtQOidnni1lKEOswohNU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/F6wYF/btszJZAhmQp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADi7aJNnM1N5HejzSGl-KhCj-kr_dR03P9_Zg5jn1VwR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bVW6LYQAseuedsEZvnEcl5qYf9A%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/caqtAg/btszKbG7PZ6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGg7lL53s23QaltvkBpCRlE-u5b8kpHq7K73KhOSiocS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ecoi%2FezdAKWmqP3uLhE9anMJEAE%3D', 37.5651822, 127.0065861, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 힘쎈여자 강남순  \n**촬영지:** 유목민몽골  \n**방문팁:** 독특한 분위기를 즐기며 다양한 몽골 요리를 맛볼 수 있습니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n유목민몽골은 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 촬영지로, 몽골의 전통적인 느낌을 살린 독특한 인테리어가 특징입니다. 이곳에서는 몽골 전통 요리를 제공하며, 아늑한 분위기 속에서 친구나 연인과 함께 특별한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 더욱 특별한 경험을 할 수 있을 것입니다.', 'Nomadic Mongolia is the filming location for the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon featuring a unique interior that takes advantage of the traditional Mongolian feeling Here we serve traditional Mongolian dishes and you can spend a special time with your friends or lovers in a cozy atmosphere If you are a drama fan you will be able to have a more special experience by recalling the scenes filmed here'),
	(698, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '신남원추어탕', '서울 동대문구 하정로 22 신설동역9번출구 도보2분', '신남원추어탕은 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 촬영지로 팬들에게 특별한 의미를 지니고 있습니다 이곳은 드라마 속 주인공들이 펼치는 다양한 사건들이 벌어진 장소로 실제로 방문하면 드라마의 한 장면처럼 느껴질 수 있습니다 주변의 분위기와 함께 맛있는 음식을 즐기며 드라마의 감성을 만끽해보세요', '#촬영지 #KdramaTrip #드라마맛집 #전통음식 #서울여행', '기타', 'Sinnamwon chueotang (sweet pepper soup)', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '2-minute walk from Exit 9 of Sinseol-dong Station, 22 Hajeong-ro, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Filming location #KdramaTrip #DramaRestaurant #TraditionalFood #SeoulTravel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cHoAHq/btsxvHmtViM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKAZvHMaBL6lJNNPuK8K5TNFXepUSK5piNGphoy8FdZ_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HhJbC%2BiOGn2B2wOXzCNuYTaSZJY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bAOTAf/btsxqapZnKP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOfDzZVj98M6jP5F27_rWkwwoSdwiUZ-WmAiCsNwZNLx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gSupA17%2BXd3y4Pd7BXTNKDpwjS8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bNFpya/btsxtoAJGSS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOW_OuTHjECmeSFFL3gEYwuvc6PbIfdfa7WSUjbW_M3E/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7mSG%2B6Dzrb5MtK5U7buuIOtKs6k%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cHoAHq/btsxvHmtViM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKAZvHMaBL6lJNNPuK8K5TNFXepUSK5piNGphoy8FdZ_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HhJbC%2BiOGn2B2wOXzCNuYTaSZJY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bAOTAf/btsxqapZnKP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOfDzZVj98M6jP5F27_rWkwwoSdwiUZ-WmAiCsNwZNLx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gSupA17%2BXd3y4Pd7BXTNKDpwjS8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bNFpya/btsxtoAJGSS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOW_OuTHjECmeSFFL3gEYwuvc6PbIfdfa7WSUjbW_M3E/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7mSG%2B6Dzrb5MtK5U7buuIOtKs6k%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cHoAHq/btsxvHmtViM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKAZvHMaBL6lJNNPuK8K5TNFXepUSK5piNGphoy8FdZ_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HhJbC%2BiOGn2B2wOXzCNuYTaSZJY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bAOTAf/btsxqapZnKP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOfDzZVj98M6jP5F27_rWkwwoSdwiUZ-WmAiCsNwZNLx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gSupA17%2BXd3y4Pd7BXTNKDpwjS8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bNFpya/btsxtoAJGSS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOW_OuTHjECmeSFFL3gEYwuvc6PbIfdfa7WSUjbW_M3E/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7mSG%2B6Dzrb5MtK5U7buuIOtKs6k%3D', 37.5729744, 127.026964, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 힘쎈여자 강남순\n- **촬영지**: 신남원추어탕\n- **방문팁**: 이곳에서 드라마의 생생한 촬영 현장을 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n신남원추어탕은 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 촬영지로, 팬들에게 특별한 의미를 지니고 있습니다. 이곳은 드라마 속 주인공들이 펼치는 다양한 사건들이 벌어진 장소로, 실제로 방문하면 드라마의 한 장면처럼 느껴질 수 있습니다. 주변의 분위기와 함께 맛있는 음식을 즐기며, 드라마의 감성을 만끽해보세요.', 'Sinnamwon Cheotang is the filming location of the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon which has a special meaning for fans This is the place where various events of the main characters in the drama took place and if you actually visit it can feel like a scene in the drama Enjoy delicious food with the atmosphere around you and enjoy the sensibility of the drama'),
	(699, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '서울한방진흥센터', '서울 동대문구 약령중앙로 26 제기동역2번출구 도보4분', '서울한방진흥센터는 한국 전통 한방의 다양한 매력을 체험할 수 있는 공간입니다 이곳에서는 한방 관련 전시와 체험 프로그램이 마련되어 있어 방문객들이 한방의 역사와 문화를 깊이 이해할 수 있습니다 드라마의 촬영지로서 특별한 감성을 느끼며 아름다운 건축물과 정원을 구경하는 것도 큰 즐거움이 될 것입니다', '#한방 #전통문화 #서울 #드라마촬영지 #체험 #관광', '기타/판별불가', 'Seoul Oriental Medicine Promotion Center', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '4 minutes walk from Exit 2 of Jegi-dong Station, 26, Yakryeong-Jungang-ro, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#oriental medicine #traditionalculture #Seoul #drama shooting location #experience #tourism', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/T7pcV/btsyzcMxlcR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHsr3eM5S_DopChgaR-pWKiyYJ67nZsSEien4lMoNuX9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MQ%2BwkBcQekRX6ZznBmA2fiXyTVw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ReNSC/btsyugWzcE0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABSmmdSW3GH88_155_ralpZRg1r6yJkt4y4ksTPPDIVy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wEaJQgq3pqTQXQjl42%2B7neXWFUo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/RrffG/btsyudZNPWA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJBVRVb5om339npjvX3EoYl-2rkBYlnrN6JZeBDTSlSr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OvnbwZpL42AbKegTNn9l48yzzOQ%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/T7pcV/btsyzcMxlcR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHsr3eM5S_DopChgaR-pWKiyYJ67nZsSEien4lMoNuX9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MQ%2BwkBcQekRX6ZznBmA2fiXyTVw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ReNSC/btsyugWzcE0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABSmmdSW3GH88_155_ralpZRg1r6yJkt4y4ksTPPDIVy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wEaJQgq3pqTQXQjl42%2B7neXWFUo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/RrffG/btsyudZNPWA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJBVRVb5om339npjvX3EoYl-2rkBYlnrN6JZeBDTSlSr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OvnbwZpL42AbKegTNn9l48yzzOQ%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/T7pcV/btsyzcMxlcR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHsr3eM5S_DopChgaR-pWKiyYJ67nZsSEien4lMoNuX9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MQ%2BwkBcQekRX6ZznBmA2fiXyTVw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ReNSC/btsyugWzcE0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABSmmdSW3GH88_155_ralpZRg1r6yJkt4y4ksTPPDIVy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wEaJQgq3pqTQXQjl42%2B7neXWFUo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/RrffG/btsyudZNPWA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJBVRVb5om339npjvX3EoYl-2rkBYlnrN6JZeBDTSlSr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OvnbwZpL42AbKegTNn9l48yzzOQ%3D', 37.5806549, 127.0376267, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 힘쎈여자 강남순\n- **촬영지**: 서울한방진흥센터\n- **방문팁**: 드라마의 촬영지를 방문하여 한국 전통 한방의 매력을 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n서울한방진흥센터는 한국 전통 한방의 다양한 매력을 체험할 수 있는 공간입니다. 이곳에서는 한방 관련 전시와 체험 프로그램이 마련되어 있어, 방문객들이 한방의 역사와 문화를 깊이 이해할 수 있습니다. 드라마의 촬영지로서 특별한 감성을 느끼며, 아름다운 건축물과 정원을 구경하는 것도 큰 즐거움이 될 것입니다.', 'The Seoul Oriental Medicine Promotion Center is a space where you can experience the various charms of Korean traditional oriental medicine There are oriental medicinerelated exhibitions and experience programs here so visitors can deeply understand the history and culture of oriental medicine As a filming location for the drama it will be a great pleasure to feel a special sensibility and see the beautiful architecture and gardens'),
	(700, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '서울시립대학교 창공관', '서울 동대문구 서울시립대로 163', '서울시립대학교 창공관은 드라마의 주요 촬영지로 아름다운 캠퍼스 풍경과 함께 학문과 예술이 어우러진 공간입니다 이곳은 드라마 속 주인공들의 일상적인 모습이 담긴 장소로 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 곳입니다 캠퍼스를 거닐며 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요', '#KdramaTrip, #캠퍼스, #서울시립대학교, #촬영지, #힘쎈여자강남순', '학교/대학', 'University of Seoul Changgongwan', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '163 University of Seoul, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul', 'a school/college', '#KdramaTrip, #Campus, #University of Seoul, #FilmingPlace, #StrongWomen GangnamSoon', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/CRRSI/btsyzcTi3P8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB3gHF0vtG6SzpsvOzU7VJx2ajbSp5hqYi-DSPwNJ8VO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cWb5ZmFWfFslegEjayKEQmCgk6c%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d3qDYK/btsywxQW7XY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANcPB9zwSvfzJPI-WzQ_liBpHXMZ-EvLU3UYH_8EnVzV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gSOSskVCTOQw4oCq3EEaUE2ftsc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/z3SaR/btsysrdGq8j/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKyp6Ra5RUEazp_xgkGtCcHk4Dj7V4lj0j9SHFh8_tbF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fjrLIVHKdyf2BqFQYLk6pHfvgRM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/CRRSI/btsyzcTi3P8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB3gHF0vtG6SzpsvOzU7VJx2ajbSp5hqYi-DSPwNJ8VO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cWb5ZmFWfFslegEjayKEQmCgk6c%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d3qDYK/btsywxQW7XY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANcPB9zwSvfzJPI-WzQ_liBpHXMZ-EvLU3UYH_8EnVzV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gSOSskVCTOQw4oCq3EEaUE2ftsc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/z3SaR/btsysrdGq8j/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKyp6Ra5RUEazp_xgkGtCcHk4Dj7V4lj0j9SHFh8_tbF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fjrLIVHKdyf2BqFQYLk6pHfvgRM%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/CRRSI/btsyzcTi3P8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB3gHF0vtG6SzpsvOzU7VJx2ajbSp5hqYi-DSPwNJ8VO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cWb5ZmFWfFslegEjayKEQmCgk6c%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d3qDYK/btsywxQW7XY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANcPB9zwSvfzJPI-WzQ_liBpHXMZ-EvLU3UYH_8EnVzV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gSOSskVCTOQw4oCq3EEaUE2ftsc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/z3SaR/btsysrdGq8j/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKyp6Ra5RUEazp_xgkGtCcHk4Dj7V4lj0j9SHFh8_tbF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fjrLIVHKdyf2BqFQYLk6pHfvgRM%3D', 37.5834233, 127.0600271, '### 학교 촬영지 정보\n\n**드라마 정보**  \n- **제목:** 힘쎈여자 강남순  \n- **촬영지:** 서울시립대학교 창공관  \n- **방문팁:** 다양한 촬영지와 캠퍼스를 함께 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.  \n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Campus  \n- **작가:** 미상  \n- **카테고리:** 학교  \n\n### 여행 포인트  \n서울시립대학교 창공관은 드라마의 주요 촬영지로, 아름다운 캠퍼스 풍경과 함께 학문과 예술이 어우러진 공간입니다. 이곳은 드라마 속 주인공들의 일상적인 모습이 담긴 장소로, 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 곳입니다. 캠퍼스를 거닐며 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.', 'Changgonggwan in University of Seoul is the main filming location of the drama and it is a space where academics and art are combined with beautiful campus scenery This is a place where the daily lives of the main characters in the drama can leave special memories for fans Walk around the campus and feel the sensibility of the drama'),
	(701, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '서울시립대학교 전농관', '서울 동대문구 서울시립대로 163 청량리역3번출구 도보17분', '서울시립대학교 전농관은 현대적인 건축물과 넓은 캠퍼스를 자랑하며 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 다양한 장면이 촬영되었습니다 이곳에서 학생들의 활기찬 일상과 함께 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요 캠퍼스 내 여러 포토존이 있어 사진 찍기에도 좋은 장소입니다', '#대학 #캠퍼스 #드라마촬영지 #서울 #학생 #전농관', '학교/대학', 'a former farmhouse in University of Seoul', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '17 minutes walk from Exit 3 of Cheongnyangni Station, 163 University of Seoul, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul', 'a school/college', '#University #Campus #DramaFilmingPlace #Seoul #Student #Jeonnonggwan', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rfJEH/btsysIGMfob/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPYD7i8hCOkTUSVeEpnhY0GJIX2Fj4UyssWuF-9YLVER/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tsc2PsMuZhz1GeXiHOPtx0gGE%2BQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mo88B/btsytaJvZdz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANbs03lyk3WlNCM9G0OqamnO2d7BMmuHTaGmUYMBfH80/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FZR6873wxAlTeMIoie4YLPcZhqw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ctZY4s/btsyChz2gLX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHsQpjJlx5FCeFh2hzxvC2vDuinklt5wRn_5H2fHHXw7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5p60GC7oJb1xcvYVjCWxcZGGNkk%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rfJEH/btsysIGMfob/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPYD7i8hCOkTUSVeEpnhY0GJIX2Fj4UyssWuF-9YLVER/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tsc2PsMuZhz1GeXiHOPtx0gGE%2BQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mo88B/btsytaJvZdz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANbs03lyk3WlNCM9G0OqamnO2d7BMmuHTaGmUYMBfH80/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FZR6873wxAlTeMIoie4YLPcZhqw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ctZY4s/btsyChz2gLX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHsQpjJlx5FCeFh2hzxvC2vDuinklt5wRn_5H2fHHXw7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5p60GC7oJb1xcvYVjCWxcZGGNkk%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rfJEH/btsysIGMfob/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPYD7i8hCOkTUSVeEpnhY0GJIX2Fj4UyssWuF-9YLVER/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tsc2PsMuZhz1GeXiHOPtx0gGE%2BQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mo88B/btsytaJvZdz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANbs03lyk3WlNCM9G0OqamnO2d7BMmuHTaGmUYMBfH80/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FZR6873wxAlTeMIoie4YLPcZhqw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ctZY4s/btsyChz2gLX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHsQpjJlx5FCeFh2hzxvC2vDuinklt5wRn_5H2fHHXw7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5p60GC7oJb1xcvYVjCWxcZGGNkk%3D', 37.5834233, 127.0600271, '### 힘쎈여자 강남순 촬영지: 서울시립대학교 전농관\n\n**방문팁:** 서울시립대학교 전농관은 드라마의 주요 촬영지로, 대학의 생동감 넘치는 분위기를 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 서울시립대학교 전농관은 현대적인 건축물과 넓은 캠퍼스를 자랑하며, 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 다양한 장면이 촬영되었습니다. 이곳에서 학생들의 활기찬 일상과 함께 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요. 캠퍼스 내 여러 포토존이 있어 사진 찍기에도 좋은 장소입니다.', 'University of Seoul Jeonnongwan boasts modern architecture and a large campus and various scenes of the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon were filmed Feel the sensibility of the drama with the students lively daily lives here There are several photo zones on campus so its also a good place to take pictures'),
	(702, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '서울시립대학교 대강당', '서울 동대문구 서울시립대로 163 청량리역3번출구 도보17분', '서울시립대학교 대강당은 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 여러 장면이 촬영된 장소로 이곳에서의 경험은 드라마 팬들에게 잊지 못할 추억을 선사합니다 대강당은 넓고 웅장한 공간으로 드라마의 긴장감 넘치는 순간을 생생하게 떠올리게 합니다 방문 시 주변의 아름다운 캠퍼스와 함께 대강당의 구조와 분위기를 즐기며 사진 촬영을 해보는 것도 좋은 아이디어입니다', '#힘쎈여자강남순 #서울시립대학교 #대강당 #촬영지 #드라마팬 #추억', '기타/판별불가', 'University of Seoul Grand Auditorium', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '17 minutes walk from Exit 3 of Cheongnyangni Station, 163 University of Seoul, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Strong Woman Gangnam Soon #University of Seoul #Daegangdang #FilmingPlace #DramaFan #Memories', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lsejl/btszJKvUPAg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADEipZfrIHPbXFbmrnY7LPD3XPoMX5ZC9n7NpeGpZ-XU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PlSjs6iMyOjxoL8EcHRS1lhHI8w%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b5zWL7/btszKfCuTZJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAjG1aQyZ-DQy5iT7ywIsZlwJvxRMCVtgFUVHLe9DLhB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ycSDVITzd8T11FK1oEs7dEIq%2FoU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/drGVr2/btszKBZxnTe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANr55LOdtaXKGsyUrbPCWG9fyCWzaMyj1kSbEg4wnib2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0h9ZvKc85fP2oLaqJQMejPMNld4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lsejl/btszJKvUPAg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADEipZfrIHPbXFbmrnY7LPD3XPoMX5ZC9n7NpeGpZ-XU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PlSjs6iMyOjxoL8EcHRS1lhHI8w%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b5zWL7/btszKfCuTZJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAjG1aQyZ-DQy5iT7ywIsZlwJvxRMCVtgFUVHLe9DLhB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ycSDVITzd8T11FK1oEs7dEIq%2FoU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/drGVr2/btszKBZxnTe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANr55LOdtaXKGsyUrbPCWG9fyCWzaMyj1kSbEg4wnib2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0h9ZvKc85fP2oLaqJQMejPMNld4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lsejl/btszJKvUPAg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADEipZfrIHPbXFbmrnY7LPD3XPoMX5ZC9n7NpeGpZ-XU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PlSjs6iMyOjxoL8EcHRS1lhHI8w%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b5zWL7/btszKfCuTZJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAjG1aQyZ-DQy5iT7ywIsZlwJvxRMCVtgFUVHLe9DLhB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ycSDVITzd8T11FK1oEs7dEIq%2FoU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/drGVr2/btszKBZxnTe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANr55LOdtaXKGsyUrbPCWG9fyCWzaMyj1kSbEg4wnib2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0h9ZvKc85fP2oLaqJQMejPMNld4%3D', 37.5834233, 127.0600271, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 힘쎈여자 강남순\n- **촬영지:** 서울시립대학교 대강당\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 중요한 장면들이 촬영된 장소로, 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n서울시립대학교 대강당은 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 여러 장면이 촬영된 장소로, 이곳에서의 경험은 드라마 팬들에게 잊지 못할 추억을 선사합니다. 대강당은 넓고 웅장한 공간으로, 드라마의 긴장감 넘치는 순간을 생생하게 떠올리게 합니다. 방문 시, 주변의 아름다운 캠퍼스와 함께 대강당의 구조와 분위기를 즐기며 사진 촬영을 해보는 것도 좋은 아이디어입니다.', 'The University of Seoul auditorium is the place where several scenes of the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon were filmed and the experience here gives unforgettable memories to drama fans The grand auditorium is a large and magnificent space vividly reminding us of the tense moments of the drama When visiting it is also a good idea to take pictures while enjoying the structure and atmosphere of the auditorium along with the beautiful campus around'),
	(703, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '강남역11번출구 앞', '서울 강남구 강남대로 406 강남역11번출구 바로앞', '강남역 11번 출구 앞은 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 상징적인 촬영지로 이곳을 방문하면 드라마의 감성을 그대로 느낄 수 있습니다 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 드라마의 분위기 속에서 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 친구들과 함께 사진을 찍거나 드라마의 명장면을 떠올리며 산책하기에 안성맞춤인 장소입니다', '#힘쎈여자강남순 #강남역 #드라마촬영지 #서울여행 #사진명소', '거리/골목/광장', 'In front of Gangnam Station Exit 11', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', 'Right in front of Exit 11 of Gangnam Station, 406, Gangnam-daero, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Strong Woman Gangnam Soon #Gangnam Station #DramaFilmingPlace #SeoulTravel #PhotoAttractions', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bJ4W2e/btsxvITqf67/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAhKJS1HAtFLqkAGv8o6KaLUrGzeAmdu9dCtrn0C7MWZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tz3NiLjGRiyk0e2qesjyQQRvZkQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cMz7Ec/btsxH1E1vZV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP5bZHRvuYKlWxX1TJCLY-Cn6HDyKWvfNeShW3tvYq9e/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OQvgb%2F91vKl%2BsiWruRbSf0fqBO4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bJ4W2e/btsxvITqf67/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAhKJS1HAtFLqkAGv8o6KaLUrGzeAmdu9dCtrn0C7MWZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tz3NiLjGRiyk0e2qesjyQQRvZkQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cMz7Ec/btsxH1E1vZV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP5bZHRvuYKlWxX1TJCLY-Cn6HDyKWvfNeShW3tvYq9e/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OQvgb%2F91vKl%2BsiWruRbSf0fqBO4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bJ4W2e/btsxvITqf67/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAhKJS1HAtFLqkAGv8o6KaLUrGzeAmdu9dCtrn0C7MWZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tz3NiLjGRiyk0e2qesjyQQRvZkQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cMz7Ec/btsxH1E1vZV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP5bZHRvuYKlWxX1TJCLY-Cn6HDyKWvfNeShW3tvYq9e/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OQvgb%2F91vKl%2BsiWruRbSf0fqBO4%3D', NULL, 37.4990329, 127.0276653, '### 거리 촬영지 정보\n\n**제목:** 힘쎈여자 강남순  \n**촬영지:** 강남역 11번 출구 앞  \n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면이 촬영된 장소로, 분위기를 느끼며 사진을 찍기 좋은 곳입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #강남역 #서울  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n강남역 11번 출구 앞은 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 상징적인 촬영지로, 이곳을 방문하면 드라마의 감성을 그대로 느낄 수 있습니다. 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 드라마의 분위기 속에서 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 친구들과 함께 사진을 찍거나, 드라마의 명장면을 떠올리며 산책하기에 안성맞춤인 장소입니다.', 'Exit 11 of Gangnam Station is the iconic filming location of the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon and you can feel the sensibility of the drama as it is if you visit here There are various cafes and shops around so you can spend a leisurely time in the atmosphere of the drama It is the perfect place to take pictures with friends or take a walk thinking of the famous scenes of the drama'),
	(704, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '달래해장 강남역점', '서울 강남구 강남대로94길 20 강남역12번출구 도보4분', '달래해장 강남역점은 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 촬영지로 실제로 많은 사람들이 찾는 인기 있는 식당입니다 다양한 해장국 메뉴와 함께 아늑한 분위기를 즐길 수 있어 친구나 가족과 함께 방문하기에 적합합니다 맛있는 음식을 즐기며 드라마 속 장면을 떠올려보는 특별한 경험을 해보세요', '#촬영지, #맛집, #해장국, #가족, #친구', '카페/레스토랑', 'Dallae Haejang Gangnam Station', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '4 minutes walk from Exit 12 of Gangnam Station, 20, Gangnam-daero 94-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Filming location, #famous restaurant, #Hangoverguk, #family, #friend', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/R1Tht/btszH8w3Xgn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOgNeQFEtPkWKvIvIqSRLUKvUBQF-1l1ZO3f9vNDI7pO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=g5rChizGXXoqNqS120G8%2FPff2TE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/drjlfJ/btszJHeVdMs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADQXs_URQPiHvKx41igOSA2SWb9JA-7if6gdO1j-YDGg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2j12oUtbuLWCOEb%2F6aYYh%2FpQwR4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HonAQ/btszHFWeym2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKOTGM-rAWI49vHLunWLk-qtIbgfUwa5VOaa-SyJ9syG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YF2DnJ%2BailE0nsmYdVs4cxn72AU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BrKyF/btsAsA5Ueq5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMbAtY3IpCjGAgakrdrgp7t6k6ygBLUn8tR6eSj5gUop/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4kYK5xGmMyzWCpVpWKbZmgTV1x0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/672An/btsAsA5Uedl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOlypc35F8_B_LX8DfzGSMeUBu8r4zaUlfKY2pM4Egde/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FEgHe6UsVoXAFxk2j8xGUnRaZIQ%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/R1Tht/btszH8w3Xgn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOgNeQFEtPkWKvIvIqSRLUKvUBQF-1l1ZO3f9vNDI7pO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=g5rChizGXXoqNqS120G8%2FPff2TE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/drjlfJ/btszJHeVdMs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADQXs_URQPiHvKx41igOSA2SWb9JA-7if6gdO1j-YDGg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2j12oUtbuLWCOEb%2F6aYYh%2FpQwR4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HonAQ/btszHFWeym2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKOTGM-rAWI49vHLunWLk-qtIbgfUwa5VOaa-SyJ9syG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YF2DnJ%2BailE0nsmYdVs4cxn72AU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BrKyF/btsAsA5Ueq5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMbAtY3IpCjGAgakrdrgp7t6k6ygBLUn8tR6eSj5gUop/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4kYK5xGmMyzWCpVpWKbZmgTV1x0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/672An/btsAsA5Uedl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOlypc35F8_B_LX8DfzGSMeUBu8r4zaUlfKY2pM4Egde/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FEgHe6UsVoXAFxk2j8xGUnRaZIQ%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/R1Tht/btszH8w3Xgn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOgNeQFEtPkWKvIvIqSRLUKvUBQF-1l1ZO3f9vNDI7pO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=g5rChizGXXoqNqS120G8%2FPff2TE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/drjlfJ/btszJHeVdMs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADQXs_URQPiHvKx41igOSA2SWb9JA-7if6gdO1j-YDGg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2j12oUtbuLWCOEb%2F6aYYh%2FpQwR4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HonAQ/btszHFWeym2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKOTGM-rAWI49vHLunWLk-qtIbgfUwa5VOaa-SyJ9syG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YF2DnJ%2BailE0nsmYdVs4cxn72AU%3D', 37.4994554, 127.0290208, '### 달래해장 강남역점\n\n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마 촬영지로 유명하니, 촬영 장소를 직접 경험해보세요!\n\n**여행 포인트:** 달래해장 강남역점은 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 촬영지로, 실제로 많은 사람들이 찾는 인기 있는 식당입니다. 다양한 해장국 메뉴와 함께 아늑한 분위기를 즐길 수 있어, 친구나 가족과 함께 방문하기에 적합합니다. 맛있는 음식을 즐기며 드라마 속 장면을 떠올려보는 특별한 경험을 해보세요.', 'Dahul Haejang Gangnam Station is the filming location of the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon and it is actually a popular restaurant that many people visit You can enjoy a cozy atmosphere with a variety of hangover soup menus making it perfect for visiting with friends or family Have a special experience of enjoying delicious food and recalling scenes from dramas'),
	(705, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '더채플앳논현', '서울 강남구 논현로 549 언주역7번출구 도보4분', '더채플앳논현은 현대적인 건축미와 세련된 분위기를 자랑하는 공간으로 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 촬영지로 유명합니다 이곳은 특별한 이벤트와 결혼식 등 다양한 용도로 사용되며 방문객들은 아름다운 외관과 함께 특별한 순간을 만끽할 수 있습니다 주변의 다양한 카페와 레스토랑도 함께 즐기기 좋은 여행지입니다', '#KdramaTrip #드라마촬영지 #세련된건축 #결혼식장소 #특별한이벤트', '기타/판별불가', 'The Chapel at Nonhyeon', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '4 minutes walk from Exit 7 of Unju Station, 549, Nonhyeon-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#KdramaTrip #DramaShootingPlace #StyleArchitecture #WeddingPlace #SpecialEvents', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b0lTCY/btsxp6uiyUI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIrg3jntAsnuSAKwHQ-daacwzW6MqSPaQUluLVipwfHv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=abymazAhnCv06kyPvQF1XDa%2FAjA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bewJ1N/btsxH2KwrWD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK_WM9NgMWzempfCzfOLZabQO587pT7HVvxE2O3Gache/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3vWCVVO3w4OP0PM9AWymXDR623k%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b0lTCY/btsxp6uiyUI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIrg3jntAsnuSAKwHQ-daacwzW6MqSPaQUluLVipwfHv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=abymazAhnCv06kyPvQF1XDa%2FAjA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bewJ1N/btsxH2KwrWD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK_WM9NgMWzempfCzfOLZabQO587pT7HVvxE2O3Gache/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3vWCVVO3w4OP0PM9AWymXDR623k%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b0lTCY/btsxp6uiyUI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIrg3jntAsnuSAKwHQ-daacwzW6MqSPaQUluLVipwfHv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=abymazAhnCv06kyPvQF1XDa%2FAjA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bewJ1N/btsxH2KwrWD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK_WM9NgMWzempfCzfOLZabQO587pT7HVvxE2O3Gache/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3vWCVVO3w4OP0PM9AWymXDR623k%3D', NULL, 37.5052473, 127.034484, '### 힘쎈여자 강남순 촬영지: 더채플앳논현\n\n**방문팁:** 이곳은 독특한 건축 디자인과 함께 드라마의 매력을 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 더채플앳논현은 현대적인 건축미와 세련된 분위기를 자랑하는 공간으로, 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 촬영지로 유명합니다. 이곳은 특별한 이벤트와 결혼식 등 다양한 용도로 사용되며, 방문객들은 아름다운 외관과 함께 특별한 순간을 만끽할 수 있습니다. 주변의 다양한 카페와 레스토랑도 함께 즐기기 좋은 여행지입니다. \n\n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding', 'The Chapel at Nonhyeon is a space that boasts modern architectural beauty and sophisticated atmosphere and is famous as the filming location for the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon It is used for a variety of purposes such as special events and weddings and visitors can enjoy special moments with beautiful appearances It is a good travel destination to enjoy various cafes and restaurants around'),
	(706, '힘쎈여자 강남순', 'C27', '서울 강남구 도산대로15길 39 신사역8번출구 도보10분', '드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 촬영지인 C27은 독특한 외관과 분위기로 관람객을 매료시키는 장소입니다 이곳은 드라마의 중요한 장면들이 촬영된 곳으로 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지니고 있습니다 촬영지 주변은 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 드라마의 여운을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있는 좋은 장소입니다', '#촬영지 #드라마 #강남 #카페 #여행 #팬스팟', '기타/판별불가', 'C27', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '10-minute walk from Exit 8 of Sinsa Station, 39, Dosan-daero 15-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#filming location #drama #Gangnam #café #travel #fanspot', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/JK48L/btsAbokyeQJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFsGT12EDtenLjeFQh9mQCOE_K4hObZOtg2MCHPMpN33/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=P%2FnnqgViHtanAEO%2BeolhiHLhZ9A%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7rcLC/btsAbcEkglW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA6X8MyFB3vlngEB1B6NtlhY5eHRTRHluhzYtxMTkBjc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UbYeDgDIdzq1pIlK42C9fcWFDE0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/djeSRW/btsz8qjTFTa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANbowS5U9I4Z4Ej2BiV9luy28kRUdQOdFPZenoXBD4fk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pD2xJ1QzcS80tvKmNjsIaasVk3Y%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LUgFd/btsAzdbUPGu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKbmsqucc2przb0xi0LBdt8GONmv-8fu9hlVuyGQeDue/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=c3Up59dTKGcwbSKY1olB46UzFlU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/AjVOi/btsAzC3KtbI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPIYQazzbwShuG375MGuB6-v6DMqUJItUPPfq8MNOKuT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=j6PWTL4Wavh%2BqdUEECtgKxLjSlw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ba0I8o/btsAxZk29mc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC96xXAuBo7j7iTwZ7-TjGWPhH2kf0Oc4Ef47LfcRqkB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BDiE8sOwZIwQdHzGuXknKk1ZnO0%3D', 