low_referer=&signature=UbYeDgDIdzq1pIlK42C9fcWFDE0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/djeSRW/btsz8qjTFTa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANbowS5U9I4Z4Ej2BiV9luy28kRUdQOdFPZenoXBD4fk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pD2xJ1QzcS80tvKmNjsIaasVk3Y%3D', 37.5207485, 127.0232442, '### 여행 포인트\n\n드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 촬영지인 C27은 독특한 외관과 분위기로 관람객을 매료시키는 장소입니다. 이곳은 드라마의 중요한 장면들이 촬영된 곳으로, 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지니고 있습니다. 촬영지 주변은 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어, 드라마의 여운을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있는 좋은 장소입니다.', 'C27 the filming location of the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon is a place that attracts visitors with its unique appearance and atmosphere This is where important scenes of the drama were filmed and it has a special meaning to fans There are various cafes and shops around the filming location so it is a good place to spend your time feeling the lingering effects of the drama'),
	(707, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '오엔 앞', '서울 강남구 압구정로11길 37-30 압구정역6번출구 위에서2분', '오엔 앞은 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 촬영지로 드라마의 주요 장면을 감상할 수 있는 장소입니다 이곳은 아름다운 야경과 함께 여유로운 산책을 즐길 수 있어 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 주변의 다양한 카페와 음식점에서 휴식을 취하며 드라마의 매력을 한층 더 느껴보세요', '#드라마촬영지, #강남, #산책, #야경, #카페, #힘쎈여자강남순', '기타', 'In front of O.N', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '2 minutes above exit 6 of Apgujeong Station, 37-30 Apgujeong-ro 11-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Drama filming location, #Gangnam, #walk, #nightscape, #café, #stronggirlsGangnamsoon', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bnxn8R/btsxkFDYBxj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC5n4xLj3EjIA6xvrxGptDGYX3VvCDIVGwYtlY1KgB5k/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3Cj%2B%2BI%2Fc7eG7ldZKyuoB96TUlRI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wnLcB/btsxsmJ7p5D/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANIqDSktod_v7FJTuJR_98chbKhTduu4clRKyEtJrMME/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3JjVpZzZ6%2F2INf9MMcvCbTkA8Jc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bgT1Op/btsxqtwpKGS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM9qkCG9dPqLSIqaMKtRaKUEcTOVwyeu-nz9HiHF2G9l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mToJn%2FhFg1V3n8zemNcXVgOErlU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bnxn8R/btsxkFDYBxj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC5n4xLj3EjIA6xvrxGptDGYX3VvCDIVGwYtlY1KgB5k/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3Cj%2B%2BI%2Fc7eG7ldZKyuoB96TUlRI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wnLcB/btsxsmJ7p5D/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANIqDSktod_v7FJTuJR_98chbKhTduu4clRKyEtJrMME/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3JjVpZzZ6%2F2INf9MMcvCbTkA8Jc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bgT1Op/btsxqtwpKGS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM9qkCG9dPqLSIqaMKtRaKUEcTOVwyeu-nz9HiHF2G9l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mToJn%2FhFg1V3n8zemNcXVgOErlU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bnxn8R/btsxkFDYBxj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC5n4xLj3EjIA6xvrxGptDGYX3VvCDIVGwYtlY1KgB5k/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3Cj%2B%2BI%2Fc7eG7ldZKyuoB96TUlRI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wnLcB/btsxsmJ7p5D/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANIqDSktod_v7FJTuJR_98chbKhTduu4clRKyEtJrMME/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3JjVpZzZ6%2F2INf9MMcvCbTkA8Jc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bgT1Op/btsxqtwpKGS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM9qkCG9dPqLSIqaMKtRaKUEcTOVwyeu-nz9HiHF2G9l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mToJn%2FhFg1V3n8zemNcXVgOErlU%3D', 37.5273455, 127.0178679, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 힘쎈여자 강남순\n- **촬영지**: 오엔 앞\n- **방문팁**: 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n오엔 앞은 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 촬영지로, 드라마의 주요 장면을 감상할 수 있는 장소입니다. 이곳은 아름다운 야경과 함께 여유로운 산책을 즐길 수 있어, 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 주변의 다양한 카페와 음식점에서 휴식을 취하며 드라마의 매력을 한층 더 느껴보세요.', 'Oen is the filming location of the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon where you can enjoy the main scenes of the drama This place offers a special experience for drama fans as they can enjoy a leisurely walk with a beautiful night view Take a break at various cafes and restaurants around you and feel the charm of the drama even more'),
	(708, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '압구정토끼굴', '서울 강남구 압구정동 압구정로데오역1번출구 도보5분', '압구정토끼굴은 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 촬영지로 독특한 그래피티 아트가 가득한 터널입니다 이곳은 서울의 트렌디한 분위기를 느낄 수 있는 장소로 사진 촬영이나 산책을 즐기기에 적합합니다 다양한 예술 작품과 함께 도시의 생동감을 만끽할 수 있어 드라마 팬뿐 아니라 일반 관광객에게도 추천할 만한 명소입니다', '#압구정토끼굴, #그래피티, #사진촬영, #산책, #예술, #드라마촬영지', '거리/골목/광장', 'Apgujeong rabbit hole', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', 'Apgujeong Rodeo Station Exit 1 of Apgujeong-dong, Gangnam-gu, Seoul, 5 minutes on foot', 'a street/alley/square', '#Apgujeong Rabbit Cave, #Graphy, #PhotoShoot, #Walk, #Art, #DramaShootPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cZiDHf/btsxrmp31Tf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHqqk3XwjV54KtQP2FY2RkgA9Czd1m2ImjRInWTh_tyV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ma8Wok6YaJgf0G%2FsOsXMb%2F2HELc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cHkU7p/btsxieUdfqy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM1j07JKxFY2JIPlcvY_2CAfCcO9tJ_1KfBHq9zwoRJp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=n%2BKbAVbXnpsPNSXV7rvn%2FM4tOqQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LYQ3f/btsxsRJ3rnj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALW0o-VKVTTIOfOLE5c4xmEPsxIWwgIel8DUyVbU9ep6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6Dp1paXimuXKvjv2iOOGBTeShOY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vI6dk/btsxvFh5Pyy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF2bBvhCAQY4XjvrGvnV5uG24JbcBld9DjSZy8zR5LPU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hxHnEfVNeItHyvJcaY1M6TTmcsc%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cZiDHf/btsxrmp31Tf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHqqk3XwjV54KtQP2FY2RkgA9Czd1m2ImjRInWTh_tyV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ma8Wok6YaJgf0G%2FsOsXMb%2F2HELc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cHkU7p/btsxieUdfqy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM1j07JKxFY2JIPlcvY_2CAfCcO9tJ_1KfBHq9zwoRJp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=n%2BKbAVbXnpsPNSXV7rvn%2FM4tOqQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LYQ3f/btsxsRJ3rnj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALW0o-VKVTTIOfOLE5c4xmEPsxIWwgIel8DUyVbU9ep6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6Dp1paXimuXKvjv2iOOGBTeShOY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vI6dk/btsxvFh5Pyy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF2bBvhCAQY4XjvrGvnV5uG24JbcBld9DjSZy8zR5LPU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hxHnEfVNeItHyvJcaY1M6TTmcsc%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cZiDHf/btsxrmp31Tf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHqqk3XwjV54KtQP2FY2RkgA9Czd1m2ImjRInWTh_tyV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ma8Wok6YaJgf0G%2FsOsXMb%2F2HELc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cHkU7p/btsxieUdfqy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM1j07JKxFY2JIPlcvY_2CAfCcO9tJ_1KfBHq9zwoRJp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=n%2BKbAVbXnpsPNSXV7rvn%2FM4tOqQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LYQ3f/btsxsRJ3rnj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALW0o-VKVTTIOfOLE5c4xmEPsxIWwgIel8DUyVbU9ep6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6Dp1paXimuXKvjv2iOOGBTeShOY%3D', 37.5271478, 127.0334517, '### 여행 포인트\n\n압구정토끼굴은 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 촬영지로, 독특한 그래피티 아트가 가득한 터널입니다. 이곳은 서울의 트렌디한 분위기를 느낄 수 있는 장소로, 사진 촬영이나 산책을 즐기기에 적합합니다. 다양한 예술 작품과 함께 도시의 생동감을 만끽할 수 있어, 드라마 팬뿐 아니라 일반 관광객에게도 추천할 만한 명소입니다.', 'Apgujeong Rabbit Cave is the filming location of the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon and it is a tunnel full of unique graffiti art This is a place where you can feel the trendy atmosphere of Seoul which is perfect for taking photos or enjoying a walk It is a recommended attraction not only for drama fans but also for ordinary tourists as you can enjoy the liveliness of the city along with various artworks'),
	(709, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '한양아파트 81동 뒷길', '서울 강남구 압구정동 508 압구정로데오역1번출구 위에서1분', '한양아파트 81동 뒷길은 드라마 속 주인공의 일상적인 모습을 담아낸 장소로 고즈넉한 분위기와 아름다운 가로수들이 어우러져 있습니다 이곳은 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 추억을 선사하며 사진 촬영을 하거나 여유롭게 산책하기에 적합합니다 주변의 자연경관과 함께 드라마의 감동을 느껴보세요', '#드라마촬영지 #일상 #산책 #골목 #사진명소', '거리/골목/광장', 'Back street of 81-dong, Hanyang Apartment', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '1 minute above exit 1 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 508 Apgujeong-dong, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Drama filming location #Daily #Walk #Alley #PhotographyAttractions', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FcM0C/btsxrXRg3m2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOpXt5G6Lii2rOkrerQJGPmzv0ssY-EcpMHDbTZIDaQg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PYH5ex8N%2BF3tF5dpzEQi6saWVLs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZxRYV/btsxkEE6LiW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABVLT2qR2ng5iuQC8ikbEP2qW9SWeSoW_tT6F3WPOi1p/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DVf6c9uGhjV6uOJ2BMk2djnsvt4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/n9N3C/btsxq1sSqxF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABCU-LK-7rMT7bKOr-FUcXw_WPXVoDuuvt1XR5aYkhXK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4gAHIX6Y2X7fgJt7OGSUcAlK2gA%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FcM0C/btsxrXRg3m2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOpXt5G6Lii2rOkrerQJGPmzv0ssY-EcpMHDbTZIDaQg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PYH5ex8N%2BF3tF5dpzEQi6saWVLs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZxRYV/btsxkEE6LiW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABVLT2qR2ng5iuQC8ikbEP2qW9SWeSoW_tT6F3WPOi1p/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DVf6c9uGhjV6uOJ2BMk2djnsvt4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/n9N3C/btsxq1sSqxF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABCU-LK-7rMT7bKOr-FUcXw_WPXVoDuuvt1XR5aYkhXK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4gAHIX6Y2X7fgJt7OGSUcAlK2gA%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FcM0C/btsxrXRg3m2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOpXt5G6Lii2rOkrerQJGPmzv0ssY-EcpMHDbTZIDaQg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PYH5ex8N%2BF3tF5dpzEQi6saWVLs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZxRYV/btsxkEE6LiW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABVLT2qR2ng5iuQC8ikbEP2qW9SWeSoW_tT6F3WPOi1p/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DVf6c9uGhjV6uOJ2BMk2djnsvt4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/n9N3C/btsxq1sSqxF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABCU-LK-7rMT7bKOr-FUcXw_WPXVoDuuvt1XR5aYkhXK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4gAHIX6Y2X7fgJt7OGSUcAlK2gA%3D', 37.5300653, 127.043233, '### 거리/골목 촬영지 정보\n\n**드라마 제목:** 힘쎈여자 강남순  \n**촬영지:** 한양아파트 81동 뒷길  \n**방문 팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리/골목  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n한양아파트 81동 뒷길은 드라마 속 주인공의 일상적인 모습을 담아낸 장소로, 고즈넉한 분위기와 아름다운 가로수들이 어우러져 있습니다. 이곳은 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 추억을 선사하며, 사진 촬영을 하거나 여유롭게 산책하기에 적합합니다. 주변의 자연경관과 함께 드라마의 감동을 느껴보세요.', 'The back street of Hanyang Apartment 81 is a place that captures the daily life of the main character in the drama and it is harmonized with a calm atmosphere and beautiful street trees This place provides special memories for drama fans and is perfect for taking photos or taking a leisurely walk Feel the emotion of the drama with the natural scenery around you'),
	(710, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '스케줄청담', '서울 강남구 선릉로152길 37 압구정로데오역4번출구 도보9분', '스케줄청담은 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다 다양한 식음료를 즐기며 편안한 시간을 보낼 수 있는 이곳은 친구와의 대화나 혼자만의 여유로운 시간을 갖기에 안성맞춤입니다 특히 자연광이 가득한 공간에서 여유로운 오후를 보내보세요', '#카페 #편안한분위기 #대화 #스케줄청담 #힘쎈여자강남순', '카페/레스토랑', 'a schedule hearing', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '9 minutes walk from Exit 4 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 37, Seonneung-ro 152-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Café #RelaxedAttention #Conversation #ScheduleCheongdam #StrongWomen Gangnamsoon', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d756AQ/btszlXnLf50/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIMjwnUIxPMq4rLBjd30HR0XtXvQhQ_AdU50coNND5_B/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EKwIULfyNpdyOaJmM80LRLOwlIE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/biVNqE/btszhtWhbHi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOfoI06sFOGmJgXsYMs_M8Fy0Y7QFONkzLli-qc8APAq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FK0Pgx0B25c4TosVmRgDiBMx5r0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bAmGgN/btszlue1GHG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEkM7TCz_r01a_pyR5MWf6eiSExKGddWU0Qif0KGQQPG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IYVK1jsUEEiqY7%2Ba%2FV3l7oGEAKc%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d756AQ/btszlXnLf50/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIMjwnUIxPMq4rLBjd30HR0XtXvQhQ_AdU50coNND5_B/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EKwIULfyNpdyOaJmM80LRLOwlIE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/biVNqE/btszhtWhbHi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOfoI06sFOGmJgXsYMs_M8Fy0Y7QFONkzLli-qc8APAq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FK0Pgx0B25c4TosVmRgDiBMx5r0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bAmGgN/btszlue1GHG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEkM7TCz_r01a_pyR5MWf6eiSExKGddWU0Qif0KGQQPG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IYVK1jsUEEiqY7%2Ba%2FV3l7oGEAKc%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d756AQ/btszlXnLf50/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIMjwnUIxPMq4rLBjd30HR0XtXvQhQ_AdU50coNND5_B/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EKwIULfyNpdyOaJmM80LRLOwlIE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/biVNqE/btszhtWhbHi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOfoI06sFOGmJgXsYMs_M8Fy0Y7QFONkzLli-qc8APAq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FK0Pgx0B25c4TosVmRgDiBMx5r0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bAmGgN/btszlue1GHG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEkM7TCz_r01a_pyR5MWf6eiSExKGddWU0Qif0KGQQPG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IYVK1jsUEEiqY7%2Ba%2FV3l7oGEAKc%3D', 37.5246691, 127.0427083, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 힘쎈여자 강남순  \n**촬영지:** 스케줄청담  \n**방문팁:** 편안한 분위기에서 친구와의 대화에 적합한 장소입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n스케줄청담은 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다. 다양한 식음료를 즐기며 편안한 시간을 보낼 수 있는 이곳은 친구와의 대화나 혼자만의 여유로운 시간을 갖기에 안성맞춤입니다. 특히 자연광이 가득한 공간에서 여유로운 오후를 보내보세요.', 'Schedule Cheongdam is the filming location of the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon and it is an attractive cafe with a stylish interior and a cozy atmosphere Enjoying a variety of food and beverages and having a relaxing time this place is perfect for talking with friends or having a relaxing time alone Spend a leisurely afternoon especially in a space full of natural light'),
	(711, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '애슐린', '서울 강남구 도산대로45길 11 압구정로데오역5번출구 도보11분', '애슐린은 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 주요 촬영지로 방문객들은 드라마 속 주인공들의 일상을 체험할 수 있는 특별한 장소입니다 이곳에서는 드라마의 생동감 넘치는 장면을 재현하며 카페와 상점들이 조화를 이루는 매력적인 분위기를 즐길 수 있습니다 친구들과 함께 사진을 찍으며 소중한 추억을 만들기에 안성맞춤인 공간입니다', '#KdramaTrip #촬영지 #카페 #매력적인장소 #추억만들기', '기타', 'Ashlyn', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '11-minute walk from Exit 5 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 11 Dosan-daero 45-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#KdramaTrip #FilmingPlace #Café #AttractivePlace #MakingMemories', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bq5vtw/btsxtWxlOy1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABkadqRRie-j9hSAWpZO8OyhQZlCZI0eA5atXxZOFhA0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=A7pRozU7NuhKAUzWO0Qc%2FKJKpa4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bq5vtw/btsxtWxlOy1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABkadqRRie-j9hSAWpZO8OyhQZlCZI0eA5atXxZOFhA0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=A7pRozU7NuhKAUzWO0Qc%2FKJKpa4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bq5vtw/btsxtWxlOy1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABkadqRRie-j9hSAWpZO8OyhQZlCZI0eA5atXxZOFhA0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=A7pRozU7NuhKAUzWO0Qc%2FKJKpa4%3D', NULL, NULL, 37.5230627, 127.0352085, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 힘쎈여자 강남순\n- **촬영지:** 애슐린\n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 매력적인 장면을 직접 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n애슐린은 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 주요 촬영지로, 방문객들은 드라마 속 주인공들의 일상을 체험할 수 있는 특별한 장소입니다. 이곳에서는 드라마의 생동감 넘치는 장면을 재현하며, 카페와 상점들이 조화를 이루는 매력적인 분위기를 즐길 수 있습니다. 친구들과 함께 사진을 찍으며 소중한 추억을 만들기에 안성맞춤인 공간입니다.', 'Ashlin is the main filming location of the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon and it is a special place where visitors can experience the daily lives of the main characters in the drama Here you can recreate the lively scenes of the drama and enjoy a charming atmosphere in which cafes and shops are in harmony It is a perfect place to take pictures with friends and make precious memories'),
	(712, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '에르메스도산파크 앞', '서울 강남구 도산대로45길 7 압구정로데오역5번출구 위에서1분', '에르메스도산파크 앞은 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 주요 촬영지로 세련된 분위기와 현대적인 건축물이 어우러져 있습니다 이곳은 쇼핑과 카페가 밀집해 있어 드라마 팬들은 물론 일반 방문객들에게도 매력적인 장소입니다 주변을 거닐며 드라마의 감성을 느끼고 사진을 찍으며 특별한 추억을 만들어 보세요', '#드라마촬영지, #강남, #시티투어, #에르메스도산파크, #거리산책', '거리/골목/광장', 'In front of Hermes Dosan Park', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '1 minute above Exit 5 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 7, Dosan-daero 45-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Drama filming location, #Gangnam, #CityTour, #HermesDosanPark, #Streetwalk', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/przHs/btsxkfZATrC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGK3FtoduM9HYQJY6_lst9F3fgIbH2qzV2jbXvE-YeZ5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9m%2B1JlAREe3uz0Aupuit%2FEhJ%2BeA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/clTJkL/btsxzYayu8B/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPd_WRkuOQkd68R1dbvdy453Z9nQC_Wtwlnl3mL-90LM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lyfko0SgqPbMgQAs4EXlmAIMHV4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/przHs/btsxkfZATrC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGK3FtoduM9HYQJY6_lst9F3fgIbH2qzV2jbXvE-YeZ5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9m%2B1JlAREe3uz0Aupuit%2FEhJ%2BeA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/clTJkL/btsxzYayu8B/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPd_WRkuOQkd68R1dbvdy453Z9nQC_Wtwlnl3mL-90LM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lyfko0SgqPbMgQAs4EXlmAIMHV4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/przHs/btsxkfZATrC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGK3FtoduM9HYQJY6_lst9F3fgIbH2qzV2jbXvE-YeZ5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9m%2B1JlAREe3uz0Aupuit%2FEhJ%2BeA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/clTJkL/btsxzYayu8B/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPd_WRkuOQkd68R1dbvdy453Z9nQC_Wtwlnl3mL-90LM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lyfko0SgqPbMgQAs4EXlmAIMHV4%3D', NULL, 37.52277720000001, 127.0353146, '### 거리 촬영지 큐레이터\n\n**드라마 정보**  \n**제목:** 힘쎈여자 강남순  \n**촬영지:** 에르메스도산파크 앞  \n**방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 매력을 느껴보세요!  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #태그  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리  \n\n### 여행 포인트  \n에르메스도산파크 앞은 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 주요 촬영지로, 세련된 분위기와 현대적인 건축물이 어우러져 있습니다. 이곳은 쇼핑과 카페가 밀집해 있어, 드라마 팬들은 물론 일반 방문객들에게도 매력적인 장소입니다. 주변을 거닐며 드라마의 감성을 느끼고, 사진을 찍으며 특별한 추억을 만들어 보세요.', 'The front of Hermes Dosan Park is the main filming location of the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon which is harmonized with a sophisticated atmosphere and modern architecture It is an attractive place not only for drama fans but also for ordinary visitors as it is packed with shopping and cafes Stroll around and feel the sensibility of the drama and make special memories by taking pictures'),
	(713, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '애브뉴준오', '서울 강남구 삼성로 728 청담역9번출구 도보2분', '애브뉴준오는 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 미용실입니다 이곳에서는 전문적인 뷰티 서비스를 받을 수 있으며 드라마 속 캐릭터처럼 특별한 변신을 경험할 수 있습니다 친구와 함께 방문해 멋진 사진도 남기고 다양한 뷰티 제품을 직접 체험해보세요', '#KdramaTrip, #미용실, #뷰티, #강남, #촬영지', '미용', 'ABNEW JUN.O', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '2-minute walk from Exit 9 of Cheongdam Station, 728 Samseong-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'beauty', '#Kdrama Trip, #Hair salon, #Beauty, #Gangnam, #FilmingPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cZ9gRm/btsxg1UVwSw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABflfguuonLqGzybdyLOdmBGhngcuUd0GzET0r4l4AyW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9A%2BK1%2BTeipGIHcyz0YUxByc2n8s%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ufwca/btsxkgYv4Ee/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAiyX0sNNWJVQi71vMWPJjfCKAtGdhbbls-RhW9lX4YQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Qq4OhIbmpM%2Bi%2FxOW%2FThx%2BCXa%2FaM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cNFhGj/btsxtn9FpMl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD2pZKYQ8QCUg5Q3fyQxIKdCcj8NQsH4eh_UMSnexOpJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OAkpnhGhTUZsDPxex2KPKudqCfg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bX9Sij/btsxp4cnoF9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALB_w7ZheIFmGwvVL6kQ_003n8M4VaX5unHcbMemaAUQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=c2Kx1hvpQB%2BRKAzu4S9oGSg4VcY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/buI6jR/btsxzZN3Cp7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALqAvJGKMCsy3Px7EpQxoet--iQSJG5oTsCulcsxIyZH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HSJTpl1lFpMwp9pLwuLvoILv8gE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cZ9gRm/btsxg1UVwSw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABflfguuonLqGzybdyLOdmBGhngcuUd0GzET0r4l4AyW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9A%2BK1%2BTeipGIHcyz0YUxByc2n8s%3D\'