99&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RWfcNu%2FOJ88eTXyQnp256Uemj%2BM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bkP1a8/btsAw50laRQ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEKEdkyVMFoA2pm4Uy_WBYhnIk-my-AgqASrQzxMBST0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=95diZmQd1YuJ0ypvf8WRIEQk4AI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tmBFe/btsAvWJowRy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAwUwdU89PZG5tl_nOfje6HELx0qVW7YXD9sf-nDIxo5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=M12axrCkbGeSuaCSq4hwaAxKAQw%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IZoAa/btsAxYz7MZq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO9ZIgKOYoo3f54fVUfUcUhBucO6WU1atWent42PLCRu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TqZEfToH9jC%2F4yHT7FshWjwMB6A%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/niF6Y/btsAvjY6Vjq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALHv65Es3ga5WG42NQbjGp4EGAKCJHNMnI2RzWE-WjAV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RWfcNu%2FOJ88eTXyQnp256Uemj%2BM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bkP1a8/btsAw50laRQ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEKEdkyVMFoA2pm4Uy_WBYhnIk-my-AgqASrQzxMBST0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=95diZmQd1YuJ0ypvf8WRIEQk4AI%3D', 37.5227799, 127.0536236, '### 거리 정보\n**드라마 제목:** 힘쎈여자 강남순  \n**촬영지:** 청단린든그로브  \n**방문 팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 주요 촬영지로, 멋진 야경을 즐기며 사진을 찍기에 좋은 장소입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #태그  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n청단린든그로브는 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 매력적인 배경으로, 현대적인 도시 풍경과 함께 드라마의 긴장감 넘치는 순간들을 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다. 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며, 드라마 속 주인공들의 이야기에 빠져보세요. 또한, 다양한 카페와 레스토랑이 근처에 있어 여유로운 시간을 보내기에도 적합합니다.', 'Cheongdan Linden Grove is the charming background of the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon where you can feel the tense moments of the drama along with the modern cityscape Recall the scenes filmed here and indulge in the stories of the main characters in the drama Also there are various cafes and restaurants nearby so it is suitable for relaxing time'),
	(715, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '파르나스타워', '서울 강남구 테헤란로 521 삼성역5번출구 바로앞', '파르나스타워는 서울 강남의 중심부에 위치한 현대적인 건축물로 주변의 도시 풍경과 잘 어우러져 있습니다 이곳은 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 촬영지로 유명하며 방문객들은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 사진을 찍기 좋은 장소입니다 특히 밤에는 조명이 아름다워 더욱 매력적인 분위기를 자아냅니다 도시의 활기와 함께 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요', '#서울 #강남 #건축물 #드라마촬영지 #밤풍경', '건물', 'Parnas Tower', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', 'Right in front of Exit 5 of Samsung Station, 521 Teheran-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Building', '#Seoul #Gangnam #Architecture #DramaFilmingPlace #Nightscape', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Ei3xz/btsytYaNWbD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOA7ZYXR7VBIEMOi78Y1T2wAN6nX1iGXK0w9yf4fvLOM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bBjzoo8MGg2zRi58muTURxofuno%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BOZem/btsyuiGNvaz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGIXxjIQBIOcdu0Gxb-S6T4uogq7L2ZK-ja5MybGJCq8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YmWdMTaOpvFqUjs5nbUx2F3yVAM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4ekYw/btsyuKwgsCi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFEj5p_lZcWIUut21x43PDovja936J8Jpf3zxEFZRQB6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=O8IkQ5G7pObZJ4RyHRkbbg4pmfs%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Ei3xz/btsytYaNWbD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOA7ZYXR7VBIEMOi78Y1T2wAN6nX1iGXK0w9yf4fvLOM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bBjzoo8MGg2zRi58muTURxofuno%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BOZem/btsyuiGNvaz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGIXxjIQBIOcdu0Gxb-S6T4uogq7L2ZK-ja5MybGJCq8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YmWdMTaOpvFqUjs5nbUx2F3yVAM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4ekYw/btsyuKwgsCi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFEj5p_lZcWIUut21x43PDovja936J8Jpf3zxEFZRQB6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=O8IkQ5G7pObZJ4RyHRkbbg4pmfs%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Ei3xz/btsytYaNWbD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOA7ZYXR7VBIEMOi78Y1T2wAN6nX1iGXK0w9yf4fvLOM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bBjzoo8MGg2zRi58muTURxofuno%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BOZem/btsyuiGNvaz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGIXxjIQBIOcdu0Gxb-S6T4uogq7L2ZK-ja5MybGJCq8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YmWdMTaOpvFqUjs5nbUx2F3yVAM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4ekYw/btsyuKwgsCi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFEj5p_lZcWIUut21x43PDovja936J8Jpf3zxEFZRQB6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=O8IkQ5G7pObZJ4RyHRkbbg4pmfs%3D', 37.5090474, 127.060893, '### 촬영지 큐레이터\n\n**건물**: 파르나스타워, 서울 강남구 테헤란로 521  \n**드라마 정보**:  \n- **제목**: 힘쎈여자 강남순  \n- **촬영지**: 파르나스타워  \n- **방문팁**: 현대적인 건축물과 함께 서울의 활기찬 분위기를 느껴보세요.  \n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding  \n- **작가**: 미상  \n- **카테고리**: 건물  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n파르나스타워는 서울 강남의 중심부에 위치한 현대적인 건축물로, 주변의 도시 풍경과 잘 어우러져 있습니다. 이곳은 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 촬영지로 유명하며, 방문객들은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 사진을 찍기 좋은 장소입니다. 특히 밤에는 조명이 아름다워 더욱 매력적인 분위기를 자아냅니다. 도시의 활기와 함께 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요.', 'Parnas Tower is a modern architecture located in the heart of Gangnam Seoul and harmonizes well with the surrounding urban landscape It is famous as the filming location for the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon and it is a great place for visitors to take pictures while feeling the sensitivity of the drama Especially at night the lighting is beautiful creating a more attractive atmosphere Make special memories with the vitality of the city'),
	(716, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '그랜드인터컨티넨탈 서울파르나스', '서울 강남구 테헤란로 521 삼성역5번출구 위에서1분', '그랜드인터컨티넨탈 서울파르나스는 서울의 중심부에 위치해 있어 접근성이 뛰어납니다 이곳은 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 여러 장면이 촬영된 장소로 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 의미를 가집니다 주변에는 다양한 식당과 카페가 있어 촬영지 탐방 후 여유롭게 휴식을 취할 수 있는 공간이 마련되어 있습니다 특히 저녁 시간에 방문하면 아름다운 조명 아래에서 서울의 야경을 감상할 수 있어 더욱 매력적입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #야경, #호텔, #강남, #힘쎈여자강남순', '호텔/숙소', 'Grand Intercontinental Seoul Parnas', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '1 minute above Exit 5 of Samseong Station, 521 Teheran-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a hotel/dormitory', '#Drama filming location, #nightscape, #hotel, #Gangnam, #stronggirlGangnamsoon', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kS18n/btsyRXi4Is6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHPWpOVrtB0r-lKgWADOnvru0dzmHfk3yWPeMNz9u981/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=B8R347CyUQPTuniLZeWiUwIo5NQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/czBOpK/btsyTGnjASM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALIF_MMwkVvKtAV-J_ZKmRfKTcOBy48tNhp0QlbWf0f7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=K3t4rfT7batwo7EkkX7yOwV8ScI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5L8hp/btsyT2Rbo8H/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADCLObsqDOwel8Vj1TRMDR2fkQ7hypIA1838l6to0XES/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lfzutDZPMimxPbnU%2FiW%2BzhMrXBE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kS18n/btsyRXi4Is6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHPWpOVrtB0r-lKgWADOnvru0dzmHfk3yWPeMNz9u981/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=B8R347CyUQPTuniLZeWiUwIo5NQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/czBOpK/btsyTGnjASM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALIF_MMwkVvKtAV-J_ZKmRfKTcOBy48tNhp0QlbWf0f7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=K3t4rfT7batwo7EkkX7yOwV8ScI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5L8hp/btsyT2Rbo8H/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADCLObsqDOwel8Vj1TRMDR2fkQ7hypIA1838l6to0XES/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lfzutDZPMimxPbnU%2FiW%2BzhMrXBE%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kS18n/btsyRXi4Is6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHPWpOVrtB0r-lKgWADOnvru0dzmHfk3yWPeMNz9u981/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=B8R347CyUQPTuniLZeWiUwIo5NQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/czBOpK/btsyTGnjASM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALIF_MMwkVvKtAV-J_ZKmRfKTcOBy48tNhp0QlbWf0f7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=K3t4rfT7batwo7EkkX7yOwV8ScI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5L8hp/btsyT2Rbo8H/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADCLObsqDOwel8Vj1TRMDR2fkQ7hypIA1838l6to0XES/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lfzutDZPMimxPbnU%2FiW%2BzhMrXBE%3D', 37.5090474, 127.060893, '### 힘쎈여자 강남순 촬영지 정보\n\n**촬영지:** 그랜드인터컨티넨탈 서울파르나스  \n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마 속 주요 장면들이 촬영된 장소로, 멋진 야경을 즐기기에 좋은 곳입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #태그  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n그랜드인터컨티넨탈 서울파르나스는 서울의 중심부에 위치해 있어 접근성이 뛰어납니다. 이곳은 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 여러 장면이 촬영된 장소로, 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 의미를 가집니다. 주변에는 다양한 식당과 카페가 있어 촬영지 탐방 후 여유롭게 휴식을 취할 수 있는 공간이 마련되어 있습니다. 특히, 저녁 시간에 방문하면 아름다운 조명 아래에서 서울의 야경을 감상할 수 있어 더욱 매력적입니다.', 'Grand Intercontinental Seoul Parnas is located in the heart of Seoul so it is highly accessible This is the place where several scenes of the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon were filmed which has a special meaning to drama fans There are various restaurants and cafes around so there is a space where you can relax after visiting the filming location In particular it is more attractive to visit in the evening because you can enjoy the night view of Seoul under beautiful lights'),
	(717, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '롯데월드', '서울 송파구 올림픽로 240 잠실역3번출구 도보7분', '롯데월드는 다양한 놀이기구와 화려한 조명으로 가득한 테마파크로 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 촬영지로도 유명합니다 이곳에서 즐길 수 있는 짜릿한 놀이기구와 함께 아름다운 경치를 감상하며 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요 가족과 친구들과 함께 즐거운 시간을 보내기에 완벽한 장소입니다', '#놀이공원, #테마파크, #가족, #친구, #정경, #강남순', '테마파크/놀이공원', 'Lotte World.', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '7-minute walk from Exit 3 of Jamsil Station, 240 Olympic-ro, Songpa-gu, Seoul', 'a theme park / amusement park', '#Amusement Park, #ThemePark, #Family, #Friend, #Jungkyung, #GangnamSoon', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/r0OZc/btszknOq6uG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPupEIxjVbt14WQUQXWDxlT2Xkxarv66hDhP3ossq0ym/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ziyoj7qompUc3YzHUiA2y1JSe4s%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lkhYi/btszlmBtpUG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ7gKp3IXzPyV2lUC7j7CW7Q6DaC-Qrov-T-Vy-ZedAY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z25%2FWlURiNUy1llgkADn%2FIoBsis%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nRoBf/btsziQjBoyz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOU5tV_3t_GxjzTIyWGvO6_ldX1zcQguacYRXabtghSk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bK4mA0wfZQfrC27kyrNusVtIHQE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/r0OZc/btszknOq6uG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPupEIxjVbt14WQUQXWDxlT2Xkxarv66hDhP3ossq0ym/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ziyoj7qompUc3YzHUiA2y1JSe4s%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lkhYi/btszlmBtpUG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ7gKp3IXzPyV2lUC7j7CW7Q6DaC-Qrov-T-Vy-ZedAY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z25%2FWlURiNUy1llgkADn%2FIoBsis%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nRoBf/btsziQjBoyz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOU5tV_3t_GxjzTIyWGvO6_ldX1zcQguacYRXabtghSk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bK4mA0wfZQfrC27kyrNusVtIHQE%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/r0OZc/btszknOq6uG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPupEIxjVbt14WQUQXWDxlT2Xkxarv66hDhP3ossq0ym/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ziyoj7qompUc3YzHUiA2y1JSe4s%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lkhYi/btszlmBtpUG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ7gKp3IXzPyV2lUC7j7CW7Q6DaC-Qrov-T-Vy-ZedAY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z25%2FWlURiNUy1llgkADn%2FIoBsis%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nRoBf/btsziQjBoyz/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOU5tV_3t_GxjzTIyWGvO6_ldX1zcQguacYRXabtghSk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bK4mA0wfZQfrC27kyrNusVtIHQE%3D', 37.5112862, 127.0979392, '**여행 포인트:** 롯데월드는 다양한 놀이기구와 화려한 조명으로 가득한 테마파크로, 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 촬영지로도 유명합니다. 이곳에서 즐길 수 있는 짜릿한 놀이기구와 함께 아름다운 경치를 감상하며 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요. 가족과 친구들과 함께 즐거운 시간을 보내기에 완벽한 장소입니다.', 'Lotte World is a theme park full of various rides and colorful lights and is also famous as the filming location for the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon Make special memories while enjoying the beautiful scenery with thrilling rides to enjoy here It is the perfect place to have fun with your family and friends'),
	(718, '힘쎈여자 강남순', '소피텔 엠배서더 서울 호텔', '서울 송파구 잠실로 209 잠실역10번출구 도보6분', '소피텔 엠배서더 서울 호텔은 현대적인 디자인과 고급스러운 서비스로 유명한 곳입니다 드라마 힘쎈여자 강남순의 촬영지로 이곳의 매력적인 외관과 세련된 내부는 방문객들에게 특별한 경험을 선사합니다 호텔 주변에는 다양한 레스토랑과 쇼핑 명소가 있어 편리하게 즐길 수 있는 요소가 많습니다 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 촬영의 감성을 느껴보는 것도 좋은 선택이 될 것입니다', '#힘쎈여자강남순 #드라마촬영지 #럭셔리호텔 #서울여행 #고급스러운숙소', '호텔/숙소', 'SOFITEL M.B.THE SEOUL HOTEL', 'Strong Woman Gangnam Soon', '6 minutes walk from Exit 10 of Jamsil Station, 209, Jamsil-ro, Songpa-gu, Seoul', 'a hotel/dormitory', '#Strong Woman Gangnam Soon #DramaFilmingPlace #LuxuryHotel #SeoulTravel #LuxuryHotel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UzZ5U/btsyTerEqRf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAlRTyrjvKQIqjngG0aqVXUQr5dic5Rd4VVSP2lLFuUz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=y8jJz1u5mM7nATeAfiMAz9JpUas%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FZB2V/btsyX0d6lih/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADjfvn1fzn7WGMvaqlWj_Gxjv-TQmZufCoH7KQhAZNXS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VXZeIJH2AQxMJdVyhPFO6XyPT%2BI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/KpJ4z/btsACkog2Kb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPNFXqeWyNosu0UaDa8jWGpKGXtC4WMeza2tZ3bTy502/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1b8R9YQOO2PhduBzaQcC9h2VFuc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/QlT7t/btsAzASGPDh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM11SQOcrK-9pAe5GK9CmEuD2DBAHgmdndhUI0QT2llr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8TvMe7BE%2BYLuLJiTh0B%2BZ1jenbM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UzZ5U/btsyTerEqRf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAlRTyrjvKQIqjngG0aqVXUQr5dic5Rd4VVSP2lLFuUz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=y8jJz1u5mM7nATeAfiMAz9JpUas%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FZB2V/btsyX0d6lih/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADjfvn1fzn7WGMvaqlWj_Gxjv-TQmZufCoH7KQhAZNXS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VXZeIJH2AQxMJdVyhPFO6XyPT%2BI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/KpJ4z/btsACkog2Kb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPNFXqeWyNosu0UaDa8jWGpKGXtC4WMeza2tZ3bTy502/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1b8R9YQOO2PhduBzaQcC9h2VFuc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/QlT7t/btsAzASGPDh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM11SQOcrK-9pAe5GK9CmEuD2DBAHgmdndhUI0QT2llr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8TvMe7BE%2BYLuLJiTh0B%2BZ1jenbM%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UzZ5U/btsyTerEqRf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAlRTyrjvKQIqjngG0aqVXUQr5dic5Rd4VVSP2lLFuUz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=y8jJz1u5mM7nATeAfiMAz9JpUas%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FZB2V/btsyX0d6lih/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADjfvn1fzn7WGMvaqlWj_Gxjv-TQmZufCoH7KQhAZNXS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VXZeIJH2AQxMJdVyhPFO6XyPT%2BI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/KpJ4z/btsACkog2Kb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPNFXqeWyNosu0UaDa8jWGpKGXtC4WMeza2tZ3bTy502/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1b8R9YQOO2PhduBzaQcC9h2VFuc%3D', 37.5138825, 127.1064002, '### 호텔 정보\n- **제목:** 힘쎈여자 강남순\n- **촬영지:** 소피텔 엠배서더 서울 호텔\n- **방문팁:** 이 호텔은 세련된 분위기와 고급스러운 시설로 편안한 휴식을 제공합니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Hotel\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 호텔\n\n### 여행 포인트\n소피텔 엠배서더 서울 호텔은 현대적인 디자인과 고급스러운 서비스로 유명한 곳입니다. 드라마 "힘쎈여자 강남순"의 촬영지로, 이곳의 매력적인 외관과 세련된 내부는 방문객들에게 특별한 경험을 선사합니다. 호텔 주변에는 다양한 레스토랑과 쇼핑 명소가 있어, 편리하게 즐길 수 있는 요소가 많습니다. 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 촬영의 감성을 느껴보는 것도 좋은 선택이 될 것입니다.', 'Sofitel Ambassador Seoul Hotel is famous for its modern design and luxurious service As the filming location for the drama Strong Woman Gangnam Soon its charming exterior and sophisticated interior provide visitors with a special experience There are various restaurants and shopping attractions around the hotel so there are many convenient elements to enjoy If you are a drama fan it would be a good choice to feel the sensibility of filming here'),
	(719, '악귀', '여의도교차로', '서울 영등포구 국제금융로8길 26 여의도역5번출구 도보9분', '여의도교차로는 서울의 현대적인 매력을 느낄 수 있는 곳으로 특히 야경이 아름답습니다 드라마 팬이라면 촬영지에서 직접 그 장면을 떠올리며 사진을 찍는 재미가 쏠쏠할 것입니다 주변에는 맛집과 카페도 많아 촬영지를 둘러본 후 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다', '#여의도 #촬영지 #야경 #도시풍경 #드라마팬', '거리/골목/광장', 'Yeouido Intersection', 'an evil spirit', '9 minutes walk from Exit 5 of Yeouido Station, 26, Gukje Financial-ro 8-gil, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Yeouido #FilmingPlace #Nightscape #Cityscape #DramaFan', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/6kKr4/btslmTTikGc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFMIcZEQGyhcsLYbzlKsRKOnReqepWSaPmgcdwGjciey/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qZmfubVKUutUNKY7KdVpIOx8KG4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cVV50s/btslbpGg564/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPFurXDDwZboJHAic70c5m8Ead3Q_NnJRNElrFiWgrY0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5vTBdrGW8iBMIuTyk9raVGU40lo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cdM9GW/btslbotNECm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEW5d1ONQKyzveIq2cqhIP34jmF5a9laq00dTZv-uzRX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=s%2Bhe%2FTIaw76xPcAzdFjfSNLHT7I%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/6kKr4/btslmTTikGc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFMIcZEQGyhcsLYbzlKsRKOnReqepWSaPmgcdwGjciey/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qZmfubVKUutUNKY7KdVpIOx8KG4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cVV50s/btslbpGg564/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPFurXDDwZboJHAic70c5m8Ead3Q_NnJRNElrFiWgrY0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5vTBdrGW8iBMIuTyk9raVGU40lo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cdM9GW/btslbotNECm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEW5d1ONQKyzveIq2cqhIP34jmF5a9laq00dTZv-uzRX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=s%2Bhe%2FTIaw76xPcAzdFjfSNLHT7I%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/6kKr4/btslmTTikGc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFMIcZEQGyhcsLYbzlKsRKOnReqepWSaPmgcdwGjciey/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qZmfubVKUutUNKY7KdVpIOx8KG4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cVV50s/btslbpGg564/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPFurXDDwZboJHAic70c5m8Ead3Q_NnJRNElrFiWgrY0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5vTBdrGW8iBMIuTyk9raVGU40lo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cdM9GW/btslbotNECm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEW5d1ONQKyzveIq2cqhIP34jmF5a9laq00dTZv-uzRX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=s%2Bhe%2FTIaw76xPcAzdFjfSNLHT7I%3D', 37.5208742, 126.9278871, '### 거리/골목 촬영지: 여의도교차로\n\n**방문팁:** 여의도교차로는 드라마 "악귀"의 주요 촬영지로, 다양한 도시 풍경을 감상할 수 있는 멋진 장소입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 여의도교차로는 서울의 현대적인 매력을 느낄 수 있는 곳으로, 특히 야경이 아름답습니다. 드라마 팬이라면 촬영지에서 직접 그 장면을 떠올리며 사진을 찍는 재미가 쏠쏠할 것입니다. 주변에는 맛집과 카페도 많아, 촬영지를 둘러본 후 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다. \n\n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene', 'Yeouido Intersection is a place where you can feel the modern charm of Seoul especially the night view is beautiful If youre a drama fan youll have a lot of fun taking pictures while remembering the scene yourself at the filming location There are many restaurants and cafes around so it is the best place to spend your time leisurely after looking around the filming location'),
	(720, '악귀', '서강대교', '서울 영등포구 여의도동', '서강대교는 드라마 악귀의 주요 촬영지로 서울의 아름다운 야경을 감상할 수 있는 명소입니다 다리 위에서 바라보는 한강의 경치는 특히 매력적이며 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기에 좋은 장소입니다 주변에는 다양한 카페와 음식점이 있어 드라마 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 점도 큰 장점입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #야경, #한강, #산책, #로맨스', '기타/판별불가', 'Sogang Bridge', 'an evil spirit', 'Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Drama filming location, #Nightscape, #Han River, #Walk, #Romance', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/B5tEL/btslahhHC4J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADuaXIBfeXIcb84-mYvxCuSXAkz3rByq_rtkR1-UYc_u/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bmVDUdEBTsKazrBjD5NDNfkzf1w%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bcQnZN/btslb6TH7fb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALOUSvYLIWukl68-qkmhiCzqdkMrS3phCTUdtPQx773k/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lr2vuIR7pjai7rLRZjX4tjjVib4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cHzNm7/btslaSBWIkB/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB217mnlnPlY1SqYkdER_8E0GkhrGxab9hRSIq-mOTqv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eESgIlgMGSnlx0Klk03cA%2FjB9KY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/svO9M/btslfdZlwH7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGRF4BX_zAdrttIpsXqEafyTkGRMW1cIaYAfsEcJPFuH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0TGEYpMU%2BgUoUtWf44Z9TXPbN9w%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bLH4Lw/btslfeKKhsy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF4ngy3MFEOLTUvz8nfqAiMvB09LN8omfdgYFMCMWiFW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dINCkNioLBbTEDgyALuI75uvIos%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/B5tEL/btslahhHC4J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADuaXIBfeXIcb84-mYvxCuSXAkz3rByq_rtkR1-UYc_u/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bmVDUdEBTsKazrBjD5NDNfkzf1w%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bcQnZN/btslb6TH7fb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALOUSvYLIWukl68-qkmhiCzqdkMrS3phCTUdtPQx773k/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lr2vuIR7pjai7rLRZjX4tjjVib4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cHzNm7/btslaSBWIkB/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB217mnlnPlY1SqYkdER_8E0GkhrGxab9hRSIq-mOTqv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eESgIlgMGSnlx0Klk03cA%2FjB9KY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/svO9M/btslfdZlwH7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGRF4BX_zAdrttIpsXqEafyTkGRMW1cIaYAfsEcJPFuH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0TGEYpMU%2BgUoUtWf44Z9TXPbN9w%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bLH4Lw/btslfeKKhsy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF4ngy3MFEOLTUvz8nfqAiMvB09LN8omfdgYFMCMWiFW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dINCkNioLBbTEDgyALuI75uvIos%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/B5tEL/btslahhHC4J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADuaXIBfeXIcb84-mYvxCuSXAkz3rByq_rtkR1-UYc_u/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bmVDUdEBTsKazrBjD5NDNfkzf1w%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bcQnZN/btslb6TH7fb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALOUSvYLIWukl68-qkmhiCzqdkMrS3phCTUdtPQx773k/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=lr2vuIR7pjai7rLRZjX4tjjVib4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cHzNm7/btslaSBWIkB/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB217mnlnPlY1SqYkdER_8E0GkhrGxab9hRSIq-mOTqv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eESgIlgMGSnlx0Klk03cA%2FjB9KY%3D', 37.5292257, 126.9293831, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 악귀\n- **촬영지**: 서강대교\n- **방문팁**: 서강대교에서의 야경은 특히 아름다우니, 저녁 시간에 방문하는 것을 추천합니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n서강대교는 드라마 "악귀"의 주요 촬영지로, 서울의 아름다운 야경을 감상할 수 있는 명소입니다. 다리 위에서 바라보는 한강의 경치는 특히 매력적이며, 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기에 좋은 장소입니다. 주변에는 다양한 카페와 음식점이 있어 드라마 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 점도 큰 장점입니다.', 'Sogang Bridge is the main filming location for the drama The Devil and is a great place to enjoy the beautiful night view of Seoul The view of the Han River from the bridge is especially attractive and it is a great place to take a walk while feeling the sensibility of the drama There are various cafes and restaurants nearby so you can spend your time leisurely after visiting the filming location of the drama'),
	(721, '악귀', '장모님해장국', '서울 종로구 진흥로 421 불광역2번출구 버스11분', '장모님해장국은 드라마 악귀의 촬영지로 아늑하고 따뜻한 분위기를 자랑하는 곳입니다 내부는 소박하면서도 정겨운 인테리어로 꾸며져 있어 드라마의 감성을 생생하게 느낄 수 있습니다 이곳에서 제공하는 해장국은 깊고 진한 국물 맛으로 여행 중 피로를 풀어주는 완벽한 선택이 될 것입니다 친구나 가족과 함께 방문해 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요', '#해장국, #드라마촬영지, #아늑한카페, #서울맛집, #편안한식사', '카페/레스토랑', 'Mother-in-law hangover soup', 'an evil spirit', 'Bus 11 minutes from Exit 2 of Bulgwang Station, 421, Jinheung-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Hangover soup, #drama shooting location, #warm cafe, #Seoul restaurant, #comfortable meal', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ekmb6c/btsnGkOO1nK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIuVHt6U0dE1FpWUMwToR3xS4-RMCLJX2CuHvsHvYWjt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3k%2FZ3PvKhWxVQ6gWPFa34xpa66w%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/VdLys/btsnHSK6DCy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANVzKBCxv7VrYrOU3ad3D5wiCL-PNlbpg52LuoS_4qnl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Wx70q7SBDJH1Bq3M2lAPC7LW5ro%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cqdLUm/btsnILSF300/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMIhjRXc3i6aFhulrF8X1ObJpu8ZIVe28X-TYLhJrAIf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3al%2BLMfhuwzfwK%2BQD%2FeNOedXtdY%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ekmb6c/btsnGkOO1nK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIuVHt6U0dE1FpWUMwToR3xS4-RMCLJX2CuHvsHvYWjt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3k%2FZ3PvKhWxVQ6gWPFa34xpa66w%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/VdLys/btsnHSK6DCy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANVzKBCxv7VrYrOU3ad3D5wiCL-PNlbpg52LuoS_4qnl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Wx70q7SBDJH1Bq3M2lAPC7LW5ro%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cqdLUm/btsnILSF300/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMIhjRXc3i6aFhulrF8X1ObJpu8ZIVe28X-TYLhJrAIf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3al%2BLMfhuwzfwK%2BQD%2FeNOedXtdY%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ekmb6c/btsnGkOO1nK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIuVHt6U0dE1FpWUMwToR3xS4-RMCLJX2CuHvsHvYWjt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3k%2FZ3PvKhWxVQ6gWPFa34xpa66w%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/VdLys/btsnHSK6DCy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANVzKBCxv7VrYrOU3ad3D5wiCL-PNlbpg52LuoS_4qnl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Wx70q7SBDJH1Bq3M2lAPC7LW5ro%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cqdLUm/btsnILSF300/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMIhjRXc3i6aFhulrF8X1ObJpu8ZIVe28X-TYLhJrAIf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3al%2BLMfhuwzfwK%2BQD%2FeNOedXtdY%3D', 37.6088734, 126.9556428, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 악귀  \n**촬영지:** 장모님해장국  \n**방문팁:** 드라마 속 감성을 느끼며 편안한 식사를 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n장모님해장국은 드라마 "악귀"의 촬영지로, 아늑하고 따뜻한 분위기를 자랑하는 곳입니다. 내부는 소박하면서도 정겨운 인테리어로 꾸며져 있어, 드라마의 감성을 생생하게 느낄 수 있습니다. 이곳에서 제공하는 해장국은 깊고 진한 국물 맛으로, 여행 중 피로를 풀어주는 완벽한 선택이 될 것입니다. 친구나 가족과 함께 방문해 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요.', 'Motherinlaw hangover soup is the filming location of the drama The Devil which boasts a cozy and warm atmosphere The interior is decorated with a simple yet friendly interior so you can feel the sensibility of the drama vividly The hangover soup served here has a deep and thick taste of soup making it the perfect choice to relieve fatigue during your trip Visit with your friends or family and make special memories'),
	(722, '악귀', '태화식당', '서울 종로구 돈화문로4길 5 종로3가역12번출구 도보1분', '태화식당은 드라마 악귀의 촬영지로 한국 전통의 맛을 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다 이곳은 아늑한 분위기 속에서 다양한 한식 메뉴를 제공하며 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험을 선사합니다 촬영된 장소를 직접 방문해 보며 드라마의 감성을 만끽해 보세요 주변의 독특한 거리 풍경도 함께 즐길 수 있어 더욱 매력적인 방문 포인트입니다', '#악귀, #드라마촬영지, #태화식당, #한식, #전통음식, #여행코스', '카페/레스토랑', 'Taehwa Restaurant', 'an evil spirit', '1 minute walk from Exit 12 of Jongno 3-ga Station, 5, Donhawmun-ro 4-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Akgui, #drama filming location, #Taehwa Restaurant, #Korean food, #traditional food, #travel course', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/40SXs/btslgiF5YxM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK9ui7s4mHmDaxxw45KNqeogLmhlIBa__Ca3mJnWEbpt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4ZEeTRlWIQbUnKnPCdH6mN8uVnU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ZvmQc/btslbxD1HhM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEl6JKi9Zqg32hsMXqETB8wEXVrSu9jvYtQey5QskzGp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ExXRa0QEWsRxKgnEMhmMB8FZCcY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NJ8If/btslhdx0p73/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATSRvhE1CmspjQFPVtwhA_qFUTQasaaXyJ5YhmKN9q_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8zcHM7iEb5U5px%2BuTzm%2BePUyDos%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eX2rp2/btslaGVKNi4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALjwC0NWYbl5bAA7SJxTGvGwBM5ndMhjs72gfHXZIurJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Up1q79HeGjWAXUGk%2BRaM8KhG1nY%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/40SXs/btslgiF5YxM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK9ui7s4mHmDaxxw45KNqeogLmhlIBa__Ca3mJnWEbpt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4ZEeTRlWIQbUnKnPCdH6mN8uVnU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ZvmQc/btslbxD1HhM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEl6JKi9Zqg32hsMXqETB8wEXVrSu9jvYtQey5QskzGp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ExXRa0QEWsRxKgnEMhmMB8FZCcY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NJ8If/btslhdx0p73/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATSRvhE1CmspjQFPVtwhA_qFUTQasaaXyJ5YhmKN9q_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8zcHM7iEb5U5px%2BuTzm%2BePUyDos%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eX2rp2/btslaGVKNi4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALjwC0NWYbl5bAA7SJxTGvGwBM5ndMhjs72gfHXZIurJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Up1q79HeGjWAXUGk%2BRaM8KhG1nY%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/40SXs/btslgiF5YxM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK9ui7s4mHmDaxxw45KNqeogLmhlIBa__Ca3mJnWEbpt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4ZEeTRlWIQbUnKnPCdH6mN8uVnU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ZvmQc/btslbxD1HhM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEl6JKi9Zqg32hsMXqETB8wEXVrSu9jvYtQey5QskzGp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ExXRa0QEWsRxKgnEMhmMB8FZCcY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NJ8If/btslhdx0p73/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAATSRvhE1CmspjQFPVtwhA_qFUTQasaaXyJ5YhmKN9q_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8zcHM7iEb5U5px%2BuTzm%2BePUyDos%3D', 37.5700954, 126.9926159, '### 태화식당\n\n- **장소**: 서울 종로구 돈화문로4길 5\n- **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑\n- **드라마 정보**:\n  - **제목**: 악귀\n  - **촬영지**: 태화식당\n  - **방문팁**: 드라마 속 분위기를 느끼며 맛있는 음식을 즐겨보세요.\n  - **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n  - **작가**: 미상\n\n### 여행 포인트\n태화식당은 드라마 "악귀"의 촬영지로, 한국 전통의 맛을 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다. 이곳은 아늑한 분위기 속에서 다양한 한식 메뉴를 제공하며, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험을 선사합니다. 촬영된 장소를 직접 방문해 보며, 드라마의 감성을 만끽해 보세요. 주변의 독특한 거리 풍경도 함께 즐길 수 있어 더욱 매력적인 방문 포인트입니다.', 'Taehwa Restaurant is the filming location of the drama Akkkwi where you can taste the Korean traditional taste This place offers a variety of Korean food menus in a cozy atmosphere and provides a special experience for drama fans Visit the filming location in person and enjoy the sensibility of the drama It is a more attractive visit point as you can enjoy the unique street scenery around you'),
	(723, '악귀', '투썸플레이스 성수낙낙점', '서울 성동구 아차산로17길 49 성수역2번출구 도보18분', '투썸플레이스 성수낙낙점은 드라마 악귀의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 편안한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다 이곳은 넓은 창을 통해 들어오는 자연광과 함께 아늑한 좌석이 있어 친구와의 대화는 물론 혼자서 책을 읽기에도 좋은 장소입니다 드라마 팬이라면 촬영된 공간을 직접 체험하며 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요', '#악귀 #카페 #촬영지 #서울 #성수동 #여유로운시간', '카페/레스토랑', 'Twosome Place Seongsu Nakjum (Sungsu Nakjum)', 'an evil spirit', '18 minutes walk from Exit 2 of Seongsu Station 49, Achasan-ro 17-gil, Seongdong-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Devil #Cafe #FilmingPlace #Seoul #Seongsu-dong #RelaxedTime', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cHz6To/btsmUIv9liC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADHq2TCMEHyXt5bfBsumPHZ91f3trvczEP9kwdKjcmU6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4tl%2BG0bC8HtZl%2F1FZUBphxKvxCA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/S5VPR/btsmYKUvPPJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFq2GzeqOPK6h9U67zyQuUekneUnlnA7TyIwjuI5fvky/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FsjjuUx%2F5E9m91UZj%2BjX7xa4Evo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/B7H51/btsmSukDsib/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIDHaBcH88RbuqtpXgKqPclUYWlXCpev1a62QAfxyGhv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3w1abpsgGhuoFSWnw4WZExZDZtw%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cHz6To/btsmUIv9liC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADHq2TCMEHyXt5bfBsumPHZ91f3trvczEP9kwdKjcmU6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4tl%2BG0bC8HtZl%2F1FZUBphxKvxCA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/S5VPR/btsmYKUvPPJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFq2GzeqOPK6h9U67zyQuUekneUnlnA7TyIwjuI5fvky/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FsjjuUx%2F5E9m91UZj%2BjX7xa4Evo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/B7H51/btsmSukDsib/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIDHaBcH88RbuqtpXgKqPclUYWlXCpev1a62QAfxyGhv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3w1abpsgGhuoFSWnw4WZExZDZtw%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cHz6To/btsmUIv9liC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADHq2TCMEHyXt5bfBsumPHZ91f3trvczEP9kwdKjcmU6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4tl%2BG0bC8HtZl%2F1FZUBphxKvxCA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/S5VPR/btsmYKUvPPJ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFq2GzeqOPK6h9U67zyQuUekneUnlnA7TyIwjuI5fvky/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FsjjuUx%2F5E9m91UZj%2BjX7xa4Evo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/B7H51/btsmSukDsib/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIDHaBcH88RbuqtpXgKqPclUYWlXCpev1a62QAfxyGhv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3w1abpsgGhuoFSWnw4WZExZDZtw%3D', 37.5465726, 127.0645949, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 악귀  \n**촬영지:** 투썸플레이스 성수낙낙점  \n**방문팁:** 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n투썸플레이스 성수낙낙점은 드라마 "악귀"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 편안한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다. 이곳은 넓은 창을 통해 들어오는 자연광과 함께 아늑한 좌석이 있어 친구와의 대화는 물론 혼자서 책을 읽기에도 좋은 장소입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 촬영된 공간을 직접 체험하며 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요.', 'Twosome Place Seongsu Nakjum is the filming location of the drama The Devil and it is an attractive cafe with a sophisticated interior and a comfortable atmosphere It has a cozy seat with natural light coming through a wide window making it a great place to talk with friends and read books alone If you are a drama fan experience the filmed space firsthand and make special memories'),
	(724, '악귀', '생각공장 데시앙플렉스', '서울 성동구 아차산로17길 49 성수역2번출구 도보18분', '생각공장 데시앙플렉스는 현대적인 건축과 다양한 상업시설이 어우러진 복합 공간으로 드라마 악귀의 촬영지로 유명합니다 이곳은 편안한 분위기 속에서 쇼핑과 식사를 즐길 수 있으며 드라마 팬들에게는 촬영 장소를 직접 방문해 볼 수 있는 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 또한 주변의 다양한 카페와 레스토랑에서 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있어 더욱 매력적인 여행지가 될 것입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #현대건축, #복합공간, #쇼핑, #식사, #KdramaTrip', '기타/판별불가', 'Thought Factory Desiangflex', 'an evil spirit', '18 minutes walk from Exit 2 of Seongsu Station 49, Achasan-ro 17-gil, Seongdong-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Drama filming location, #modernarchitecture, #complexspace, #shopping, #meal, #KdramaTrip', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dPt5U7/btsmOISbPlF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL5bJOKuSR5bwpVGBJsR7Qh5-PTg4-occToIrKcVFlWa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=90f2asmh%2BK%2FZHsnZeD7mfzSQ77U%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kCLfC/btsmQeW9LMM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKvfOna-24TjnpPrLU7iQpGTI_uyn6f2JY7jz3gmmkUD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=up8X%2FAEnyLwAx5Q6WQDKu3nPjhs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b0LNpu/btsmRraBr9s/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHzGhuKzZzkh9msfqJWh_whM_ISpBwXqNlvpM_kfQjca/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=B5B948OJ%2BgaBj%2FiYF%2Bckj3rHWwc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bYzRmE/btsmUIv9lcU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALNj2uE3wyOge3-f-YCAAFo5PtNKMd98_-XR0mA9ROph/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eYGXU5UFt13d3WX8h%2BiXEWGLXZU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dPt5U7/btsmOISbPlF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL5bJOKuSR5bwpVGBJsR7Qh5-PTg4-occToIrKcVFlWa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=90f2asmh%2BK%2FZHsnZeD7mfzSQ77U%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kCLfC/btsmQeW9LMM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKvfOna-24TjnpPrLU7iQpGTI_uyn6f2JY7jz3gmmkUD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=up8X%2FAEnyLwAx5Q6WQDKu3nPjhs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b0LNpu/btsmRraBr9s/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHzGhuKzZzkh9msfqJWh_whM_ISpBwXqNlvpM_kfQjca/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=B5B948OJ%2BgaBj%2FiYF%2Bckj3rHWwc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bYzRmE/btsmUIv9lcU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALNj2uE3wyOge3-f-YCAAFo5PtNKMd98_-XR0mA9ROph/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eYGXU5UFt13d3WX8h%2BiXEWGLXZU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dPt5U7/btsmOISbPlF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL5bJOKuSR5bwpVGBJsR7Qh5-PTg4-occToIrKcVFlWa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=90f2asmh%2BK%2FZHsnZeD7mfzSQ77U%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kCLfC/btsmQeW9LMM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKvfOna-24TjnpPrLU7iQpGTI_uyn6f2JY7jz3gmmkUD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=up8X%2FAEnyLwAx5Q6WQDKu3nPjhs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b0LNpu/btsmRraBr9s/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHzGhuKzZzkh9msfqJWh_whM_ISpBwXqNlvpM_kfQjca/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=B5B948OJ%2BgaBj%2FiYF%2Bckj3rHWwc%3D', 37.5465726, 127.0645949, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 악귀\n- **촬영지:** 생각공장 데시앙플렉스\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 생생한 촬영 현장을 경험할 수 있는 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n생각공장 데시앙플렉스는 현대적인 건축과 다양한 상업시설이 어우러진 복합 공간으로, 드라마 \'악귀\'의 촬영지로 유명합니다. 이곳은 편안한 분위기 속에서 쇼핑과 식사를 즐길 수 있으며, 드라마 팬들에게는 촬영 장소를 직접 방문해 볼 수 있는 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 또한, 주변의 다양한 카페와 레스토랑에서 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있어 더욱 매력적인 여행지가 될 것입니다.', 'The Thinking Factory Desiangplex is a complex space that combines modern architecture and various commercial facilities and is famous as a filming location for the drama The Devil This place allows you to enjoy shopping and dining in a comfortable atmosphere and provides drama fans with a special experience to visit the filming location in person In addition it will be a more attractive destination because you can spend time leisurely in various cafes and restaurants around you'),
	(725, '악귀', '미미미가든', '서울 강남구 도산대로 417 압구정로데오역4번출구 도보8분', '미미미가든은 드라마 악귀의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다 다양한 식사 옵션과 음료를 제공하며 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다 드라마의 한 장면처럼 친구나 연인과 함께 소중한 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤인 장소입니다 또한 주변의 아름다운 식물들이 편안한 휴식을 제공합니다', '#악귀 #촬영지 #카페 #서울 #드라마팬 #아늑한분위기', '카페/레스토랑', 'Mimi-Mi-Garden', 'an evil spirit', '8 minutes walk from Exit 4 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 417, Dosan-daero, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Devil #FilmingPlace #Cafe #Seoul #DramaFan #A cozy atmosphere', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bbcUrZ/btslffizRmP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOs5sEFuo5oSpn43R5EoFk1c5yLVgcP2IGCBWBGR4AH-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=u5iTvjR%2FKLcfmaUA3c%2BTcHtWzH0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wmUMe/btsla1Fo9r2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALknLiQY26EJ8L_E2n-4efaelt_oCjP3SLDrb5GMkBMn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Na3T2ZcJgEfplbMMNHNP2zzOXzs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cXvrgZ/btsljhNFt4j/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFz4kFKIcZR5mCAK-_RZzJg53rentQyDnQc9UymbO3FQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1iILV%2FR8MhiycH8nPCefYemXHcQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mNTv9/btslaSooDwS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOu5tTDLHuEaQhKo9Rgok_lTS-RDV4qjdAjKBO_WoDGb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ffMCDHW9HaVVrMzW5vckJeLGQBo%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bbcUrZ/btslffizRmP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOs5sEFuo5oSpn43R5EoFk1c5yLVgcP2IGCBWBGR4AH-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=u5iTvjR%2FKLcfmaUA3c%2BTcHtWzH0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wmUMe/btsla1Fo9r2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALknLiQY26EJ8L_E2n-4efaelt_oCjP3SLDrb5GMkBMn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Na3T2ZcJgEfplbMMNHNP2zzOXzs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cXvrgZ/btsljhNFt4j/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFz4kFKIcZR5mCAK-_RZzJg53rentQyDnQc9UymbO3FQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1iILV%2FR8MhiycH8nPCefYemXHcQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mNTv9/btslaSooDwS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOu5tTDLHuEaQhKo9Rgok_lTS-RDV4qjdAjKBO_WoDGb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ffMCDHW9HaVVrMzW5vckJeLGQBo%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bbcUrZ/btslffizRmP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOs5sEFuo5oSpn43R5EoFk1c5yLVgcP2IGCBWBGR4AH-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=u5iTvjR%2FKLcfmaUA3c%2BTcHtWzH0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wmUMe/btsla1Fo9r2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALknLiQY26EJ8L_E2n-4efaelt_oCjP3SLDrb5GMkBMn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Na3T2ZcJgEfplbMMNHNP2zzOXzs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cXvrgZ/btsljhNFt4j/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFz4kFKIcZR5mCAK-_RZzJg53rentQyDnQc9UymbO3FQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1iILV%2FR8MhiycH8nPCefYemXHcQ%3D', 37.5238332, 127.0411132, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 악귀  \n**촬영지:** 미미미가든  \n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마 촬영지로 유명하니, 사진 촬영을 잊지 마세요!  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n미미미가든은 드라마 "악귀"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다. 다양한 식사 옵션과 음료를 제공하며, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다. 드라마의 한 장면처럼, 친구나 연인과 함께 소중한 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤인 장소입니다. 또한, 주변의 아름다운 식물들이 편안한 휴식을 제공합니다.', 'Mimi Garden is the filming location of the drama The Devil and it is an attractive cafe with a sophisticated interior and cozy atmosphere We offer a variety of dining options and drinks and it will be a special experience for drama fans Like a scene in a drama it is the perfect place to spend precious time with friends or lovers Also the beautiful plants around you provide a comfortable rest'),
	(726, '악귀', '오즈아레나PC카페', '서울 강남구 자곡로 110', '오즈아레나PC카페는 드라마 악귀의 촬영지로 팬들에게 드라마의 분위기를 느낄 수 있는 특별한 장소입니다 카페 내부는 아늑하고 독특한 인테리어로 꾸며져 있어 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 친구들과 함께 방문하면 더욱 즐거운 추억을 만들 수 있는 곳입니다', '#PC카페, #촬영지, #악귀, #팬명소, #서울, #강남', '기타/판별불가', 'OZ Arena PC cafe', 'an evil spirit', '110, Jagok-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#PC cafe, #filming location, #evilgwi, #fan attraction, #Seoul, #Gangnam', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCFusV/btsnF4ecPdE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK_5FVTS9UITxRNFjESl-aXtwFPWa4e7xnev4Wcnjg7-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hNAADXNt0OZEFZP6jZquqK8ZESE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sJByO/btsnFLFTd72/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALXB8TxSlZ95_odQ2SytZ0rAO3WQXCzKBnRIKVaJU_ti/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7%2FiAnaTp001DpYgRq9EgyOlMWw4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cMvlm6/btsnEMFoZic/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG37nF5c_lxHAC_E5yG0Ej2l5ie868_qvhWt9vh98k4R/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=e8Q3XRuhhXSdoOCVU%2F8iE5u4S%2FM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCFusV/btsnF4ecPdE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK_5FVTS9UITxRNFjESl-aXtwFPWa4e7xnev4Wcnjg7-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hNAADXNt0OZEFZP6jZquqK8ZESE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sJByO/btsnFLFTd72/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALXB8TxSlZ95_odQ2SytZ0rAO3WQXCzKBnRIKVaJU_ti/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7%2FiAnaTp001DpYgRq9EgyOlMWw4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cMvlm6/btsnEMFoZic/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG37nF5c_lxHAC_E5yG0Ej2l5ie868_qvhWt9vh98k4R/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=e8Q3XRuhhXSdoOCVU%2F8iE5u4S%2FM%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bCFusV/btsnF4ecPdE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK_5FVTS9UITxRNFjESl-aXtwFPWa4e7xnev4Wcnjg7-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hNAADXNt0OZEFZP6jZquqK8ZESE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sJByO/btsnFLFTd72/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALXB8TxSlZ95_odQ2SytZ0rAO3WQXCzKBnRIKVaJU_ti/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7%2FiAnaTp001DpYgRq9EgyOlMWw4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cMvlm6/btsnEMFoZic/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG37nF5c_lxHAC_E5yG0Ej2l5ie868_qvhWt9vh98k4R/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=e8Q3XRuhhXSdoOCVU%2F8iE5u4S%2FM%3D', 37.4719868, 127.0957112, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 악귀\n- **촬영지**: 오즈아레나PC카페\n- **방문팁**: 이 카페는 드라마의 주요 촬영지로, 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n오즈아레나PC카페는 드라마 "악귀"의 촬영지로, 팬들에게 드라마의 분위기를 느낄 수 있는 특별한 장소입니다. 카페 내부는 아늑하고 독특한 인테리어로 꾸며져 있어, 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 친구들과 함께 방문하면 더욱 즐거운 추억을 만들 수 있는 곳입니다.', 'Oz Arena PC Cafe is the filming location of the drama The Devil and is a special place where fans can feel the atmosphere of the drama The interior of the cafe is decorated with cozy and unique interior design so you can spend a leisurely time recalling the scenes that have been filmed It is a place where you can make more enjoyable memories if you visit with your friends'),
	(727, '악귀', '소피텔 엠베서더 서울', '서울 송파구 잠실로 209 잠실역10번출구 도보6분', '소피텔 엠베서더 서울은 현대적인 디자인과 고급스러운 서비스로 유명한 호텔입니다 이곳은 드라마 악귀의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아름다운 도시 전망을 제공합니다 방문객들은 편안한 객실과 다양한 편의시설을 활용하며 특별한 경험을 즐길 수 있습니다 특히 호텔 내의 레스토랑과 바에서는 다양한 미식을 제공하므로 식사를 통해 또 다른 즐거움을 느낄 수 있습니다', '#소피텔엠베서더서울 #악귀 #럭셔리 #호텔 #고급스러운휴식', '호텔/숙소', 'Sofitel Ambassador Seoul', 'an evil spirit', '6 minutes walk from Exit 10 of Jamsil Station, 209, Jamsil-ro, Songpa-gu, Seoul', 'a hotel/dormitory', '#Sofitel Ambassador Seoul #Vicious #Luxury #Hotel #LuxuryRest', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/G3IdP/btsmRokjAzB/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACaQnCnLP3_KSI1lxOuk3tZ_d8WgZuPikN3thdTEEbRU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AElKHxAlWsfkmq9N3HCuyZrWaHk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cXfKri/btsmSuYCEGt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHt8Hq4gQ34EE8Rk-uA2EO-LfoAXoWSGSxCEeozZOSed/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bm%2B99CC3NFJo7KiNzgYMC29UY%2BE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/G3IdP/btsmRokjAzB/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACaQnCnLP3_KSI1lxOuk3tZ_d8WgZuPikN3thdTEEbRU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AElKHxAlWsfkmq9N3HCuyZrWaHk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cXfKri/btsmSuYCEGt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHt8Hq4gQ34EE8Rk-uA2EO-LfoAXoWSGSxCEeozZOSed/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bm%2B99CC3NFJo7KiNzgYMC29UY%2BE%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/G3IdP/btsmRokjAzB/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACaQnCnLP3_KSI1lxOuk3tZ_d8WgZuPikN3thdTEEbRU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AElKHxAlWsfkmq9N3HCuyZrWaHk%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cXfKri/btsmSuYCEGt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHt8Hq4gQ34EE8Rk-uA2EO-LfoAXoWSGSxCEeozZOSed/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bm%2B99CC3NFJo7KiNzgYMC29UY%2BE%3D', NULL, 37.5138825, 127.1064002, '### 호텔 정보\n- **이름:** 소피텔 엠베서더 서울\n- **드라마:** 악귀\n- **방문 팁:** 고급스러운 분위기 속에서 편안한 휴식을 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Hotel\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 호텔\n\n### 여행 포인트\n소피텔 엠베서더 서울은 현대적인 디자인과 고급스러운 서비스로 유명한 호텔입니다. 이곳은 드라마 "악귀"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 아름다운 도시 전망을 제공합니다. 방문객들은 편안한 객실과 다양한 편의시설을 활용하며, 특별한 경험을 즐길 수 있습니다. 특히, 호텔 내의 레스토랑과 바에서는 다양한 미식을 제공하므로, 식사를 통해 또 다른 즐거움을 느낄 수 있습니다.', 'Sofitel Ambassador Seoul is famous for its modern design and luxurious service This is the filming location for the drama The Devil which offers sophisticated interiors and beautiful city views Visitors can enjoy a special experience by utilizing comfortable rooms and various amenities In particular restaurants and bars in the hotel offer a variety of gourmet food so you can enjoy another treat through meals'),
	(728, '그놈은 흑염룡', '신촌토끼굴', '서울 서대문구 대신동 143-28 신촌역(경의중앙선)1번출구 도보2분', '신촌토끼굴은 드라마 그놈은 흑염룡의 주요 촬영지로 독특한 분위기와 매력적인 인테리어가 특징입니다 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요 카페에서 음료를 즐기며 친구들과 함께 사진을 찍고 드라마의 주인공이 되어보는 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다', '#카페 #촬영지 #드라마 #신촌 #추억 #인테리어', '카페/레스토랑', 'Sinchon rabbit hole', 'That\'s a black dragon', 'Exit 1 of Sinchon Station (Gyeongui Jungang Line) 143-28, Daeshin-dong, Seodaemun-gu, Seoul, 2 minutes on foot', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Cafe #FilmingPlace #Drama #Sinchon #Memories #Interior', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/7OOHs/btsMlBT90hA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIxKqYmomTv-HxMA1OM94Lco0XPReNUCfzTAsGzU-AsO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6jp%2FIuLGZ2Go%2BoCXrchtIj%2FFw1w%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bGIZgL/btsMmcsOfjN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOy203bIc7Pm32cNPzUrM1uvU2fnHh4lfWQfsrpDBAjy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=owtmJXN68NY53B4KK7j4OPVVj%2Fc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cfRU0y/btsMWGGMko8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAlByxJnJdBR9mhauUoZTKuWA97142BkjTAUd_hv7OEK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KD9V4XJywxa63qDH%2Bbjdf9TUaME%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/up601/btsMVY2ffq5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMj320auF5fMbco1DmngjFKRQdApOgcaKtVGpa4Qr6sB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0iUyfj8zLPBaR54GpuNBd5tyck8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/7OOHs/btsMlBT90hA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIxKqYmomTv-HxMA1OM94Lco0XPReNUCfzTAsGzU-AsO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6jp%2FIuLGZ2Go%2BoCXrchtIj%2FFw1w%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bGIZgL/btsMmcsOfjN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOy203bIc7Pm32cNPzUrM1uvU2fnHh4lfWQfsrpDBAjy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=owtmJXN68NY53B4KK7j4OPVVj%2Fc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cfRU0y/btsMWGGMko8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAlByxJnJdBR9mhauUoZTKuWA97142BkjTAUd_hv7OEK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KD9V4XJywxa63qDH%2Bbjdf9TUaME%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/up601/btsMVY2ffq5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMj320auF5fMbco1DmngjFKRQdApOgcaKtVGpa4Qr6sB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0iUyfj8zLPBaR54GpuNBd5tyck8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/7OOHs/btsMlBT90hA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIxKqYmomTv-HxMA1OM94Lco0XPReNUCfzTAsGzU-AsO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6jp%2FIuLGZ2Go%2BoCXrchtIj%2FFw1w%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bGIZgL/btsMmcsOfjN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOy203bIc7Pm32cNPzUrM1uvU2fnHh4lfWQfsrpDBAjy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=owtmJXN68NY53B4KK7j4OPVVj%2Fc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cfRU0y/btsMWGGMko8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAlByxJnJdBR9mhauUoZTKuWA97142BkjTAUd_hv7OEK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KD9V4XJywxa63qDH%2Bbjdf9TUaME%3D', 37.5605884, 126.9409905, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 그놈은 흑염룡\n- **촬영지**: 신촌토끼굴\n- **방문팁**: 드라마 촬영지를 직접 방문해 보세요!\n\n### 여행 포인트\n신촌토끼굴은 드라마 "그놈은 흑염룡"의 주요 촬영지로, 독특한 분위기와 매력적인 인테리어가 특징입니다. 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며, 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요. 카페에서 음료를 즐기며 친구들과 함께 사진을 찍고, 드라마의 주인공이 되어보는 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다.', 'Shinchon Rabbit Cave is the main filming location for the drama Thats a Black Dragon featuring a unique atmosphere and attractive interior Think of the scenes filmed here and feel the sensibility of the drama You can enjoy drinks at cafes take pictures with your friends and have a special experience of becoming the main character of a drama'),
	(729, '그놈은 흑염룡', '마포대교', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 85-2', '마포대교는 서울의 대표적인 랜드마크로 한강을 가로지르며 멋진 야경을 제공합니다 드라마 그놈은 흑염룡의 촬영지로 유명한 이곳에서는 특히 밤에 반짝이는 도시의 불빛과 함께 잊지 못할 순간을 경험할 수 있습니다 교량 위에서 바라보는 한강의 경치는 사진 촬영에도 안성맞춤이며 한적한 산책로에서 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요', '#마포대교, #야경, #한강, #드라마촬영지, #서울여행', '교통/역/터미널', 'Mapo Bridge', 'That\'s a black dragon', '85-2 Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'traffic/station/terminal', '#Mapo Bridge, #Nightscape, #Han River, #DramaFilmingPlaces, #SeoulTravel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bTI99b/btsMkBN7yap/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGdkwk7MUQkyFBsSXvr-sD2UchRsqbv3HiJLH6gEb0n/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=R1kk475IH9Kc0A4kDpnoOPlIseE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/EDgrO/btsMk0NCAJV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJnia8HLeMgqXH-omsnxxqVXdPOTl9tYu_AWiMg_7wqz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=C1NMqc6O5Ly5Q2GNGTQ1qmMmoms%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FlbCF/btsMmmPt5X9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALy89jY9MyENk5Gxj37FghHxim_TDDCv7tMO4yauttyA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5pyaAnKHzO7EjN5egnm%2BpkAlyp0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bTI99b/btsMkBN7yap/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGdkwk7MUQkyFBsSXvr-sD2UchRsqbv3HiJLH6gEb0n/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=R1kk475IH9Kc0A4kDpnoOPlIseE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/EDgrO/btsMk0NCAJV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJnia8HLeMgqXH-omsnxxqVXdPOTl9tYu_AWiMg_7wqz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=C1NMqc6O5Ly5Q2GNGTQ1qmMmoms%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FlbCF/btsMmmPt5X9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALy89jY9MyENk5Gxj37FghHxim_TDDCv7tMO4yauttyA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5pyaAnKHzO7EjN5egnm%2BpkAlyp0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bTI99b/btsMkBN7yap/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGdkwk7MUQkyFBsSXvr-sD2UchRsqbv3HiJLH6gEb0n/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=R1kk475IH9Kc0A4kDpnoOPlIseE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/EDgrO/btsMk0NCAJV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJnia8HLeMgqXH-omsnxxqVXdPOTl9tYu_AWiMg_7wqz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=C1NMqc6O5Ly5Q2GNGTQ1qmMmoms%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FlbCF/btsMmmPt5X9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALy89jY9MyENk5Gxj37FghHxim_TDDCv7tMO4yauttyA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5pyaAnKHzO7EjN5egnm%2BpkAlyp0%3D', 37.5324275, 126.9357342, '### 촬영지 큐레이터\n\n#### 교통/역\n- **제목**: 그놈은 흑염룡\n- **촬영지**: 마포대교\n- **방문팁**: 마포대교에서 서울의 야경을 감상하며 드라마의 장면을 떠올려보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Transit\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 교통/역\n\n#### 여행 포인트\n마포대교는 서울의 대표적인 랜드마크로, 한강을 가로지르며 멋진 야경을 제공합니다. 드라마 "그놈은 흑염룡"의 촬영지로 유명한 이곳에서는 특히 밤에 반짝이는 도시의 불빛과 함께 잊지 못할 순간을 경험할 수 있습니다. 교량 위에서 바라보는 한강의 경치는 사진 촬영에도 안성맞춤이며, 한적한 산책로에서 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요', 'Mapo Bridge is Seouls representative landmark and offers a great night view across the Han River Famous as the filming location for the drama Thats a Black Dragon you can experience unforgettable moments especially with sparkling city lights at night The view of the Han River from the bridge is also perfect for photography and you can relax on a quiet promenade If youre a drama fan make special memories here'),
	(730, '그놈은 흑염룡', '여의도한강공원(물빛광장)', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 84-9 여의나루역2번출구 도보9분', '여의도한강공원은 한강을 따라 펼쳐진 넓은 공간으로 특히 물빛광장은 드라마 촬영지로 유명합니다 이곳은 고요한 분위기와 함께 아름다운 경치를 즐길 수 있어 연인이나 친구들과 함께 산책하기에 최적의 장소입니다 특히 저녁 시간에는 조명이 켜져 로맨틱한 분위기를 자아내며 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 사진을 찍기에도 좋은 spot입니다', '#여의도한강공원, #물빛광장, #드라마촬영지, #야경, #산책, #로맨틱', '공원', 'Yeouido Hangang Park (Water Color Plaza)', 'That\'s a black dragon', '84-9 Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul, 9 minutes on foot from Exit 2 of Yeouido Station', 'Park', '#Yeouido Hangang Park, #Watercolor Plaza, #DramaShoot Location, #Nightscape, #Walk, #Romantic', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/E4wzO/btsMINeiHPS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJXhJR6LeP303j1CDLVw9-BAZ2cvJ3xUm-6d_SDKUN6b/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0o3Fq2H5k4Uj2kA5ABAGWvpAlxU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dmLfS7/btsMFLbMBWO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOeaZUllnXsvAZ9QjGVcfgIKdSMZZQAC5OY3eOGYrAYd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BMQi31zD6VnFJeW0o9%2BmgV34TsA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IRABo/btsMHqYPrPo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIh0dw0jvz70khsN3G9JEZMskJpyXEmjsYdvwiPXKbuy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mJgWCev17G2vQEw924QodZKPrP8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HUpKQ/btsMHwR7Cvu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKYxn6OpRO3vpxfqBYZ1QkREMkhmN2FgL9Qd0h0UugXq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PFKz8wcjwGgCF1EWjalPCh457OA%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/E4wzO/btsMINeiHPS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJXhJR6LeP303j1CDLVw9-BAZ2cvJ3xUm-6d_SDKUN6b/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0o3Fq2H5k4Uj2kA5ABAGWvpAlxU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dmLfS7/btsMFLbMBWO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOeaZUllnXsvAZ9QjGVcfgIKdSMZZQAC5OY3eOGYrAYd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BMQi31zD6VnFJeW0o9%2BmgV34TsA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IRABo/btsMHqYPrPo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIh0dw0jvz70khsN3G9JEZMskJpyXEmjsYdvwiPXKbuy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mJgWCev17G2vQEw924QodZKPrP8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HUpKQ/btsMHwR7Cvu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKYxn6OpRO3vpxfqBYZ1QkREMkhmN2FgL9Qd0h0UugXq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PFKz8wcjwGgCF1EWjalPCh457OA%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/E4wzO/btsMINeiHPS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJXhJR6LeP303j1CDLVw9-BAZ2cvJ3xUm-6d_SDKUN6b/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0o3Fq2H5k4Uj2kA5ABAGWvpAlxU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dmLfS7/btsMFLbMBWO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOeaZUllnXsvAZ9QjGVcfgIKdSMZZQAC5OY3eOGYrAYd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BMQi31zD6VnFJeW0o9%2BmgV34TsA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/IRABo/btsMHqYPrPo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIh0dw0jvz70khsN3G9JEZMskJpyXEmjsYdvwiPXKbuy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mJgWCev17G2vQEw924QodZKPrP8%3D', 37.5312454, 126.9286863, '### 여의도한강공원(물빛광장) 촬영지 정보\n\n**드라마 제목:** 그놈은 흑염룡  \n**촬영지:** 여의도한강공원(물빛광장)  \n**방문 팁:** 아름다운 야경과 함께 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Park  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 공원  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n여의도한강공원은 한강을 따라 펼쳐진 넓은 공간으로, 특히 물빛광장은 드라마 촬영지로 유명합니다. 이곳은 고요한 분위기와 함께 아름다운 경치를 즐길 수 있어, 연인이나 친구들과 함께 산책하기에 최적의 장소입니다. 특히 저녁 시간에는 조명이 켜져 로맨틱한 분위기를 자아내며, 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 사진을 찍기에도 좋은 spot입니다.', 'Yeouido Hangang Park is a large space along the Han River and Mulbit Square is especially famous as a filming location for dramas This place is the best place to take a walk with lovers or friends as you can enjoy the beautiful scenery with a calm atmosphere Especially in the evening the lights are turned on to create a romantic atmosphere and it is a good spot to take pictures while feeling the sensibility of the drama'),
	(731, '그놈은 흑염룡', '일민미술관', '서울 종로구 세종대로 152 광화문역5번출구 바로앞', '일민미술관은 드라마 그놈은 흑염룡의 촬영지로 현대적인 건축물과 역사적인 요소가 조화를 이루는 매력적인 장소입니다 이곳에서는 다양한 전시와 문화 행사를 즐길 수 있으며 미술관 주변의 아름다운 풍경도 함께 감상할 수 있어 방문객들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다 드라마 팬이라면 촬영지에서의 사진 촬영을 잊지 마세요', '#촬영지 #일민미술관 #현대미술 #문화행사 #드라마팬 #서울관광', '박물관/미술관/전시', 'Ilmin Museum of Art', 'That\'s a black dragon', 'Right in front of Exit 5 of Gwanghwamun Station, 152 Sejong-daero, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a museum/art gallery/exhibition', '#Filming location #Ilmin Museum of Art #ModernArt #CulturalEvents #DramaFans #SeoulTourism', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/belC4Z/btsMVWDkTyN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL20tRH_MgJfWDDTNwRmuVUsSe8TbiJAuNB9UibU2wIt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9GqqhnNUdX4WYIqJlp8yH43gfoM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/belC4Z/btsMVWDkTyN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL20tRH_MgJfWDDTNwRmuVUsSe8TbiJAuNB9UibU2wIt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9GqqhnNUdX4WYIqJlp8yH43gfoM%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/belC4Z/btsMVWDkTyN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL20tRH_MgJfWDDTNwRmuVUsSe8TbiJAuNB9UibU2wIt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9GqqhnNUdX4WYIqJlp8yH43gfoM%3D', NULL, NULL, 37.5697944, 126.9776649, '### 여행 포인트\n\n일민미술관은 드라마 "그놈은 흑염룡"의 촬영지로, 현대적인 건축물과 역사적인 요소가 조화를 이루는 매력적인 장소입니다. 이곳에서는 다양한 전시와 문화 행사를 즐길 수 있으며, 미술관 주변의 아름다운 풍경도 함께 감상할 수 있어 방문객들에게 특별한 경험을 제공합니다. 드라마 팬이라면 촬영지에서의 사진 촬영을 잊지 마세요!', 'The Ilmin Museum of Art is the filming location of the drama Hes a Black Salt Dragon and is an attractive place with modern architecture and historical elements in harmony Here you can enjoy various exhibitions and cultural events and you can also enjoy the beautiful scenery around the museum providing a special experience for visitors If youre a drama fan dont forget to take a picture at the set'),
	(732, '그놈은 흑염룡', '설가온', '서울 종로구 세종대로 175 광화문역8번출구 도보1분', '설가온은 드라마 그놈은 흑염룡의 매력적인 촬영지로 전통적인 한국의 미를 느낄 수 있는 공간입니다 이곳은 아름다운 인테리어와 함께 드라마 속 장면을 직접 체험할 수 있는 특별한 장소로 팬들에게는 잊지 못할 추억을 선사합니다 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 이곳에서 그 분위기를 만끽하며 여유로운 시간을 보내보세요', '#촬영지 #전통미 #KdramaTrip #추억 #설가온 #문화체험', '기타/판별불가', 'snow-capped', 'That\'s a black dragon', '1-minute walk from Exit 8 of Gwanghwamun Station, 175 Sejong-daero, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Filming location #traditional beauty #KdramaTrip #Memories #Sulgaon #CultureExperience', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bDrKMs/btsMVyaLJnS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALJkO0iaznDI1Rc6Lm7HsxM-aGBhcNVUcECuXMS8p90r/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BvwjvREVQdugl6%2BgQborB4N6cxs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c4dm6v/btsMTJ5H95v/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMR4K0MPyAM7ukXhjC6ecdylUGHi8UVCWCRyUI0jrti2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2Fy3sp2ANWIjX4aeU7BE2xsJIEkE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bDrKMs/btsMVyaLJnS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALJkO0iaznDI1Rc6Lm7HsxM-aGBhcNVUcECuXMS8p90r/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BvwjvREVQdugl6%2BgQborB4N6cxs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c4dm6v/btsMTJ5H95v/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMR4K0MPyAM7ukXhjC6ecdylUGHi8UVCWCRyUI0jrti2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2Fy3sp2ANWIjX4aeU7BE2xsJIEkE%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bDrKMs/btsMVyaLJnS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALJkO0iaznDI1Rc6Lm7HsxM-aGBhcNVUcECuXMS8p90r/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BvwjvREVQdugl6%2BgQborB4N6cxs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c4dm6v/btsMTJ5H95v/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMR4K0MPyAM7ukXhjC6ecdylUGHi8UVCWCRyUI0jrti2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2Fy3sp2ANWIjX4aeU7BE2xsJIEkE%3D', NULL, 37.5722356, 126.9759338, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 그놈은 흑염룡\n- **촬영지**: 설가온\n- **방문팁**: 독특한 분위기의 촬영지를 경험해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n설가온은 드라마 "그놈은 흑염룡"의 매력적인 촬영지로, 전통적인 한국의 미를 느낄 수 있는 공간입니다. 이곳은 아름다운 인테리어와 함께 드라마 속 장면을 직접 체험할 수 있는 특별한 장소로, 팬들에게는 잊지 못할 추억을 선사합니다. 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 이곳에서, 그 분위기를 만끽하며 여유로운 시간을 보내보세요.', 'Seolgaon is an attractive filming location for the drama Thats a Black Dragon and it is a space where you can feel the traditional Korean beauty This is a special place where you can experience the scenes in the drama directly with beautiful interior design giving fans unforgettable memories Here where the main scenes of the drama were filmed enjoy the atmosphere and have a relaxing time'),
	(733, '그놈은 흑염룡', '보신각터', '서울 종로구 종로 54 종각역4번출구 바로앞', '보신각터는 서울의 상징적인 장소로 드라마 그놈은 흑염룡의 촬영지로 유명합니다 이곳은 특히 연말 카운트다운 행사로 많은 사람들이 모이는 곳으로 드라마 팬이라면 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 방문하는 재미가 있습니다 주변의 다양한 편의시설과 함께 서울의 아름다운 야경을 즐길 수 있는 기회도 놓치지 마세요', '#드라마촬영지, #서울, #관광명소, #야경, #명소탐방', '기타', 'the site of Boshingak', 'That\'s a black dragon', 'Right in front of Exit 4 of Jonggak Station, 54 Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Drama filming location, #Seoul, #TourismAttractions, #Nightscape, #Attractions', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1I3oh/btsMli1zJkp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABxp7A_krOOBUJu3MUfX9zt7lQGojMUtnIySZF0Jbf_k/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zUmiGp0fGu4B69dQjGIIqkgoSmg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1I3oh/btsMli1zJkp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABxp7A_krOOBUJu3MUfX9zt7lQGojMUtnIySZF0Jbf_k/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zUmiGp0fGu4B69dQjGIIqkgoSmg%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1I3oh/btsMli1zJkp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABxp7A_krOOBUJu3MUfX9zt7lQGojMUtnIySZF0Jbf_k/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zUmiGp0fGu4B69dQjGIIqkgoSmg%3D', NULL, NULL, 37.5697607, 126.9839305, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 그놈은 흑염룡\n- **촬영지**: 보신각터\n- **방문팁**: 보신각터에서 드라마의 주요 장면을 감상하며 특별한 시간을 가져보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n보신각터는 서울의 상징적인 장소로, 드라마 "그놈은 흑염룡"의 촬영지로 유명합니다. 이곳은 특히 연말 카운트다운 행사로 많은 사람들이 모이는 곳으로, 드라마 팬이라면 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 방문하는 재미가 있습니다. 주변의 다양한 편의시설과 함께 서울의 아름다운 야경을 즐길 수 있는 기회도 놓치지 마세요.', 'Bosingakteo is an iconic site in Seoul and is famous as the filming location for the drama Hes a Black Dragon This is especially a place where many people gather as a countdown event at the end of the year and if you are a fan of dramas it is fun to visit while remembering the scene Dont miss the opportunity to enjoy the beautiful night view of Seoul with various amenities around you'),
	(734, '그놈은 흑염룡', '정독도서관 정류장', '서울 종로구 삼청로 50 안국역1번출구 도보12분', '정독도서관 정류장은 아름다운 가로수와 조명이 어우러져 있어 드라마 속 장면처럼 로맨틱한 분위기를 만끽할 수 있는 장소입니다 특히 가을의 단풍이 물든 길은 사진 찍기에도 최적의 장소로 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다 이곳에서 산책하며 드라마의 감동을 다시 한 번 느껴보세요', '#드라마촬영지, #산책, #정독도서관, #로맨틱, #가을단풍', '도서관/서점', 'Jeongdok Library Station', 'That\'s a black dragon', '12-minute walk from Exit 1 of Anguk Station, 50 Samcheong-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a library/bookshop', '#Drama filming location, #walk, #readinglibrary, #romantic, #AutumnMoonlight', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GvDiI/btsMA4udVHk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ9PtPhVmQ_lw_3zTdX1jK4kH-zniamB-_uOJ7d9R28c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Vms9dQwUtgThWjYnqxSQ8lqYFO4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5GA5s/btsMzWReEyi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMt2ZQ_fZKIMqr5Kqyil5G4WaOKX5lKX74k6m_q4utfA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=S6aZl%2FJt1q6ptNSUbMcUV%2F11WVw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qS3SC/btsMNzgWyCc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP8aZzgCHV8yzaHBhOyQi_aSfw-yYU2YhgReYz8A5FXJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KZehBl0m9q3iW0KuNTt90ltRO8Y%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nzkAg/btsMNx4ulA3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP3SpOaJjEjMX4vl0Di2IlXm0_s0CXCe4dagV0iucuZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z2yN2etdcEbbaPvx%2FmxwBq9ySi0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GvDiI/btsMA4udVHk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ9PtPhVmQ_lw_3zTdX1jK4kH-zniamB-_uOJ7d9R28c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Vms9dQwUtgThWjYnqxSQ8lqYFO4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5GA5s/btsMzWReEyi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMt2ZQ_fZKIMqr5Kqyil5G4WaOKX5lKX74k6m_q4utfA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=S6aZl%2FJt1q6ptNSUbMcUV%2F11WVw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qS3SC/btsMNzgWyCc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP8aZzgCHV8yzaHBhOyQi_aSfw-yYU2YhgReYz8A5FXJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KZehBl0m9q3iW0KuNTt90ltRO8Y%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nzkAg/btsMNx4ulA3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP3SpOaJjEjMX4vl0Di2IlXm0_s0CXCe4dagV0iucuZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Z2yN2etdcEbbaPvx%2FmxwBq9ySi0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GvDiI/btsMA4udVHk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ9PtPhVmQ_lw_3zTdX1jK4kH-zniamB-_uOJ7d9R28c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Vms9dQwUtgThWjYnqxSQ8lqYFO4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5GA5s/btsMzWReEyi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMt2ZQ_fZKIMqr5Kqyil5G4WaOKX5lKX74k6m_q4utfA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=S6aZl%2FJt1q6ptNSUbMcUV%2F11WVw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qS3SC/btsMNzgWyCc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP8aZzgCHV8yzaHBhOyQi_aSfw-yYU2YhgReYz8A5FXJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KZehBl0m9q3iW0KuNTt90ltRO8Y%3D', 37.5803283, 126.9802958, '### 그놈은 흑염룡 촬영지: 정독도서관 정류장\n\n**방문 팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책해보세요.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 정독도서관 정류장은 아름다운 가로수와 조명이 어우러져 있어, 드라마 속 장면처럼 로맨틱한 분위기를 만끽할 수 있는 장소입니다. 특히, 가을의 단풍이 물든 길은 사진 찍기에도 최적의 장소로, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 기회를 제공합니다. 이곳에서 산책하며 드라마의 감동을 다시 한 번 느껴보세요.', 'Jeongdok Library Station is a place where you can enjoy a romantic atmosphere like a scene in a drama with beautiful street trees and lights In particular the autumn foliagecolored road is the best place to take pictures providing drama fans with a chance to leave special memories Take a walk here and feel the emotion of the drama once again'),
	(735, '그놈은 흑염룡', '창의문로10길', '서울 종로구 창의문로10길 43', '창의문로10길은 드라마 그놈은 흑염룡의 촬영지로 독특한 분위기와 아기자기한 골목길이 매력적입니다 이곳에서 드라마의 한 장면처럼 느리게 걸으며 주변의 아름다움을 감상해보세요 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라 일반 여행객들에게도 즐거운 경험을 선사합니다', '#KdramaTrip #거리 #골목 #창의문로10길 #그놈은흑염룡 #드라마촬영지', '거리/골목/광장', 'Changchangmun-ro 10-gil', 'That\'s a black dragon', '43, Changchangmun-ro 10-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #Street #Alley #CreativeMoon-ro 10-gil #He\'s Black Dragon #DramaShootingPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/q7Zks/btsMGt9EiOA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG1VrGltKb7VogIQMfLwWEhN_5Xo1SdZydNwiicHKCbL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Jxtzc6mQBpKQMRlbqnMzMdXroJw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/EoDGB/btsMHc0LznL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG2vLj8CO2ZE5oLYbrcAHFvMSN9uJFY63iOsrF4BS6ks/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4m04NDimUbcRYML5TxIreKhFw9g%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1DNgw/btsMF0GH4SG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK6FTnxznf_eB9YI1LS4At4b5moRpHdB5FdrR7qDYBPD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1DS3GGBOGGaPs8F42c8n33qASdw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zDwiF/btsMH9oCwZ5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPkYoKQvkmJi1t7OPzh01zXdPgPBfCE7yeL-11Kt3hNc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=M6%2B9tejYY3Uz7QkB11NLvakS9O0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/q7Zks/btsMGt9EiOA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG1VrGltKb7VogIQMfLwWEhN_5Xo1SdZydNwiicHKCbL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Jxtzc6mQBpKQMRlbqnMzMdXroJw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/EoDGB/btsMHc0LznL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG2vLj8CO2ZE5oLYbrcAHFvMSN9uJFY63iOsrF4BS6ks/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4m04NDimUbcRYML5TxIreKhFw9g%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1DNgw/btsMF0GH4SG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK6FTnxznf_eB9YI1LS4At4b5moRpHdB5FdrR7qDYBPD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1DS3GGBOGGaPs8F42c8n33qASdw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zDwiF/btsMH9oCwZ5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPkYoKQvkmJi1t7OPzh01zXdPgPBfCE7yeL-11Kt3hNc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=M6%2B9tejYY3Uz7QkB11NLvakS9O0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/q7Zks/btsMGt9EiOA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG1VrGltKb7VogIQMfLwWEhN_5Xo1SdZydNwiicHKCbL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Jxtzc6mQBpKQMRlbqnMzMdXroJw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/EoDGB/btsMHc0LznL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG2vLj8CO2ZE5oLYbrcAHFvMSN9uJFY63iOsrF4BS6ks/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4m04NDimUbcRYML5TxIreKhFw9g%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1DNgw/btsMF0GH4SG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK6FTnxznf_eB9YI1LS4At4b5moRpHdB5FdrR7qDYBPD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1DS3GGBOGGaPs8F42c8n33qASdw%3D', 37.593101, 126.9649999, '### 거리/골목 촬영지: 그놈은 흑염룡 - 창의문로10길\n\n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기에 좋은 장소입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 창의문로10길은 드라마 "그놈은 흑염룡"의 촬영지로, 독특한 분위기와 아기자기한 골목길이 매력적입니다. 이곳에서 드라마의 한 장면처럼 느리게 걸으며 주변의 아름다움을 감상해보세요. 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어, 드라마 팬뿐만 아니라 일반 여행객들에게도 즐거운 경험을 선사합니다. \n\n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene', 'Changchangmunro 10gil is the filming location of the drama Thats a Black Salt Dragon and its unique atmosphere and cute alleyways are attractive Walk slowly like a scene in a drama here and enjoy the beauty of your surroundings There are various cafes and shops which provide a pleasant experience not only for drama fans but also for ordinary travelers'),
	(736, '그놈은 흑염룡', '윤동주문학관앞', '서울 종로구 창의문로 119', '윤동주문학관앞은 서울의 멋진 전경을 한눈에 볼 수 있는 장소로 특히 드라마 그놈은 흑염룡의 촬영지로 유명합니다 이곳에서는 한적한 분위기 속에서 도시의 아름다움을 만끽할 수 있으며 주변의 역사적인 장소들과 함께 산책하기에도 좋은 위치입니다 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보길 추천합니다', '#드라마촬영지, #서울전경, #문학관, #한적한장소, #K드라마팬, #여행추천', '박물관/미술관/전시', 'In front of the Yun Dong-ju Literature Museum', 'That\'s a black dragon', '119, Changchangmun-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a museum/art gallery/exhibition', '#Drama filming location, #Seoulscape, #Literature Museum, #SilentPlace, #K-DramaFans, #TravelRecommendation', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vlKJQ/btsMOiUgJHe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEMMUobATTewEpXkuJZwH_QsU-t-1SliXqre4ELOelDo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=T%2FeCJJ2DZJ2nHI6Xd4dogFSVAIQ%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vlKJQ/btsMOiUgJHe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEMMUobATTewEpXkuJZwH_QsU-t-1SliXqre4ELOelDo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=T%2FeCJJ2DZJ2nHI6Xd4dogFSVAIQ%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vlKJQ/btsMOiUgJHe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEMMUobATTewEpXkuJZwH_QsU-t-1SliXqre4ELOelDo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=T%2FeCJJ2DZJ2nHI6Xd4dogFSVAIQ%3D', NULL, NULL, 37.5920238, 126.9669238, '### 그놈은 흑염룡 촬영지: 윤동주문학관앞\n\n**방문팁:** 아름다운 도시 전망을 감상하며 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 윤동주문학관앞은 서울의 멋진 전경을 한눈에 볼 수 있는 장소로, 특히 드라마 "그놈은 흑염룡"의 촬영지로 유명합니다. 이곳에서는 한적한 분위기 속에서 도시의 아름다움을 만끽할 수 있으며, 주변의 역사적인 장소들과 함께 산책하기에도 좋은 위치입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보길 추천합니다. \n\n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #CityView', 'The front of the Yun Dongju Literature Museum is a place where you can see a great view of Seoul at a glance especially as a filming location for the drama Hes a Black Dragon Here you can enjoy the beauty of the city in a quiet atmosphere and it is also a good place to take a walk with the historical places around you If you are a drama fan I recommend you to visit'),
	(737, '그놈은 흑염룡', '돌체앤가바다 서울청담플래그십', '서울 강남구 압구정로 414 압구정로데오역3번출구 도보1분', '돌체앤가바다 서울청담플래그십은 고급 브랜드의 매장이 모여 있어 패션에 관심 있는 방문객들에게 최적의 장소입니다 드라마의 촬영지로 유명한 이곳은 세련된 인테리어와 독특한 상품들로 가득 차 있어 사진 찍기에도 좋은 장소입니다 평소와는 다른 특별한 쇼핑 경험을 원하신다면 꼭 방문해 보세요', '#그놈은흑염룡 #쇼핑 #고급스러움 #서울청담 #드라마촬영지 #패션', '쇼핑몰/백화점', 'Dolce-An-ga-Bada Seoul Cheongdam Flagship', 'That\'s a black dragon', '1 minute walk from Exit 3 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 414, Apgujeong-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'shopping mall/department store', '#He\'s a black dragon #shopping #luxury #SeoulCheongdam #DramaFilmingPlace #Fashion', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bouSmm/btsMmrdlpr0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGDtLY19ay0xWdMkzwDigFmiyj_NDQWAU5o0F6mVb0eF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gMFjVG6KyID%2BszbY%2F8HKee6PSqg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bUsvn9/btsMmrYHD3g/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHBm_J1J91BoH6TNamlgAvdbnxOG1et_BPRQPxY8zgB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bkkaHJ8mr0uGbFaED7GJTikFsPU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qykeA/btsMl7TNwH8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIqAo8akMdlzac1bn1boJcHDgPUCgmA3yBX3IRocuFgp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FFqUTS15fQBLPhZcTKkeFV5F0Rs%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bouSmm/btsMmrdlpr0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGDtLY19ay0xWdMkzwDigFmiyj_NDQWAU5o0F6mVb0eF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gMFjVG6KyID%2BszbY%2F8HKee6PSqg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bUsvn9/btsMmrYHD3g/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHBm_J1J91BoH6TNamlgAvdbnxOG1et_BPRQPxY8zgB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bkkaHJ8mr0uGbFaED7GJTikFsPU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qykeA/btsMl7TNwH8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIqAo8akMdlzac1bn1boJcHDgPUCgmA3yBX3IRocuFgp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FFqUTS15fQBLPhZcTKkeFV5F0Rs%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bouSmm/btsMmrdlpr0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGDtLY19ay0xWdMkzwDigFmiyj_NDQWAU5o0F6mVb0eF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gMFjVG6KyID%2BszbY%2F8HKee6PSqg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bUsvn9/btsMmrYHD3g/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHBm_J1J91BoH6TNamlgAvdbnxOG1et_BPRQPxY8zgB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bkkaHJ8mr0uGbFaED7GJTikFsPU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qykeA/btsMl7TNwH8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIqAo8akMdlzac1bn1boJcHDgPUCgmA3yBX3IRocuFgp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FFqUTS15fQBLPhZcTKkeFV5F0Rs%3D', 37.52713079999999, 127.0420699, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 그놈은 흑염룡\n- **촬영지**: 돌체앤가바다 서울청담플래그십\n- **방문팁**: 고급스러운 분위기 속에서 쇼핑을 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n돌체앤가바다 서울청담플래그십은 고급 브랜드의 매장이 모여 있어, 패션에 관심 있는 방문객들에게 최적의 장소입니다. 드라마의 촬영지로 유명한 이곳은 세련된 인테리어와 독특한 상품들로 가득 차 있어, 사진 찍기에도 좋은 장소입니다. 평소와는 다른 특별한 쇼핑 경험을 원하신다면 꼭 방문해 보세요!', 'Dolce Angabada Seoul Cheongdam Flagship is the best place for fashionconscious visitors with stores of highend brands Famous as a filming location for dramas this place is also a great place to take pictures with its stylish interior and unique products If you want a special shopping experience thats different from usual make sure to visit'),
	(738, '그놈은 흑염룡', '에빗', '서울 강남구 도산대로45길 10-5 압구정로데오역5번출구 도보10분', '에빗은 드라마 그놈은 흑염룡의 촬영지로 현대적이고 우아한 인테리어가 돋보이는 카페입니다 이곳은 편안한 분위기에서 친구들과의 대화나 혼자만의 시간을 즐기기에 적합합니다 특히 드라마 팬이라면 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있는 장소입니다 다양한 음료와 디저트 메뉴도 준비되어 있어 방문하는 이들에게 만족스러운 시간을 제공합니다', '#KdramaTrip, #Cafe, #서울, #흑염룡, #촬영지, #아늑한분위기', '카페/레스토랑', 'Evidt', 'That\'s a black dragon', '10-5 Dosan-daero 45-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul, 10-5 Apgujeong Rodeo Station Exit 5 is a 10-minute walk', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#KdramaTrip, #Cafe, #Seoul, #BlackSaltRong, #FilmingPlace, #CozyAtmosphere', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nxtaB/btsMAWcHIE8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMwad4yqaqL9hNwtC4SVVdLh7MsRbFQsGJiwKP7hnKVg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PgI7N7VdzHTK%2FOTaKsNkmW1nwAw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cSumXk/btsMz6fVwIG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGvCdkr5j2fuKEP4QUUz-d1u1YxT-isALTotzoDiZJbu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fbA3wkdm6JPxrLQsgR8wiY%2FRbt0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bEwZHT/btsMAtILKph/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC8JYEPodB1kEN2C2orwixt7UEQV9dpr-DO1aeRJ8qmj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=s%2F9QgCAKFkotrKJhc8CfIw3qRBI%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nxtaB/btsMAWcHIE8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMwad4yqaqL9hNwtC4SVVdLh7MsRbFQsGJiwKP7hnKVg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PgI7N7VdzHTK%2FOTaKsNkmW1nwAw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cSumXk/btsMz6fVwIG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGvCdkr5j2fuKEP4QUUz-d1u1YxT-isALTotzoDiZJbu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fbA3wkdm6JPxrLQsgR8wiY%2FRbt0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bEwZHT/btsMAtILKph/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC8JYEPodB1kEN2C2orwixt7UEQV9dpr-DO1aeRJ8qmj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=s%2F9QgCAKFkotrKJhc8CfIw3qRBI%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nxtaB/btsMAWcHIE8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMwad4yqaqL9hNwtC4SVVdLh7MsRbFQsGJiwKP7hnKVg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PgI7N7VdzHTK%2FOTaKsNkmW1nwAw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cSumXk/btsMz6fVwIG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGvCdkr5j2fuKEP4QUUz-d1u1YxT-isALTotzoDiZJbu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=fbA3wkdm6JPxrLQsgR8wiY%2FRbt0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bEwZHT/btsMAtILKph/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC8JYEPodB1kEN2C2orwixt7UEQV9dpr-DO1aeRJ8qmj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=s%2F9QgCAKFkotrKJhc8CfIw3qRBI%3D', 37.52342820000001, 127.036206, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 그놈은 흑염룡  \n**촬영지:** 에빗  \n**방문팁:** 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 공간입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n에빗은 드라마 "그놈은 흑염룡"의 촬영지로, 현대적이고 우아한 인테리어가 돋보이는 카페입니다. 이곳은 편안한 분위기에서 친구들과의 대화나 혼자만의 시간을 즐기기에 적합합니다. 특히 드라마 팬이라면, 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있는 장소입니다. 다양한 음료와 디저트 메뉴도 준비되어 있어, 방문하는 이들에게 만족스러운 시간을 제공합니다.', 'Evit is the filming location of the drama Thats a Black Dragon and it is a cafe with a modern and elegant interior This place is perfect for talking with friends or enjoying alone time in a comfortable atmosphere Especially if you are a drama fan it is a place where you can have a special experience by thinking about the scene that was filmed There are also a variety of drinks and desserts available providing a satisfying time for visitors'),
	(739, '그놈은 흑염룡', '서울깍두기 강남역삼점', '서울 강남구 역삼로7길 17 강남역4번출구 도보6분', '서울깍두기 강남역삼점은 드라마 그놈은 흑염룡의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다 이곳에서는 드라마의 주인공들이 나눈 대화의 여운을 느끼며 다양한 메뉴를 즐길 수 있습니다 커피 한 잔과 함께 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소입니다', '#그놈은흑염룡 #서울깍두기 #드라마촬영지 #카페 #강남역 #여유', '카페/레스토랑', 'Three branches of Seoul Kkakdugi Gangnam Station', 'That\'s a black dragon', '6-minute walk from Exit 4 of Gangnam Station, 17, Yeoksam-ro 7-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#He\'s Black Dragon #SeoulKkakdugi #DramaShoot #Cafe #Gangnam Station #Relaxed', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zxAyq/btsMH99ZBP4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJOiwbYNjqPAtCJu6B_dABEqpfa9ONewRLVTe0rXqPtL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pkhmL5zavZAQFQKrW9M1pL3namg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c6q7uH/btsMH412xv5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADnXXn4JYnNC1I2Qju8eX83Ybf_oMVvuNgr6D054CUiK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mIXVbQZgakR02SIQlC4fB2wbrew%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zxAyq/btsMH99ZBP4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJOiwbYNjqPAtCJu6B_dABEqpfa9ONewRLVTe0rXqPtL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pkhmL5zavZAQFQKrW9M1pL3namg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c6q7uH/btsMH412xv5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADnXXn4JYnNC1I2Qju8eX83Ybf_oMVvuNgr6D054CUiK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mIXVbQZgakR02SIQlC4fB2wbrew%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zxAyq/btsMH99ZBP4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJOiwbYNjqPAtCJu6B_dABEqpfa9ONewRLVTe0rXqPtL/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pkhmL5zavZAQFQKrW9M1pL3namg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c6q7uH/btsMH412xv5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADnXXn4JYnNC1I2Qju8eX83Ybf_oMVvuNgr6D054CUiK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mIXVbQZgakR02SIQlC4fB2wbrew%3D', NULL, 37.4953252, 127.032531, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n- **제목**: 그놈은 흑염룡\n- **촬영지**: 서울깍두기 강남역삼점\n- **방문팁**: 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유를 즐길 수 있는 공간입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n서울깍두기 강남역삼점은 드라마 "그놈은 흑염룡"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다. 이곳에서는 드라마의 주인공들이 나눈 대화의 여운을 느끼며, 다양한 메뉴를 즐길 수 있습니다. 커피 한 잔과 함께 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소입니다.', 'Seoul Kkakdugi Gangnam Station Samjeom is the filming location of the drama Thats Black Salt Dragon and it is an attractive cafe with a sophisticated interior and cozy atmosphere Here you can enjoy a variety of menus while feeling the lingering effects of conversations between the main characters of the drama Its a great place to spend a special time thinking about the scenes in the drama with a cup of coffee'),
	(740, '그놈은 흑염룡', '에그드랍 강남점', '서울 서초구 강남대로55길 24 강남역6번출구 도보3분', '에그드랍 강남점은 현대적인 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소입니다 다양한 메뉴가 준비되어 있어 특별한 날이나 일상적인 외식 모두에 잘 어울립니다 드라마 팬이라면 촬영지에서 직접 음식을 즐기며 그 장면을 떠올려 보는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #카페, #맛집, #친구들과의시간, #일상외식', '카페/레스토랑', 'Egg Drop Gangnam Branch', 'That\'s a black dragon', '3-minute walk from Exit 6 of Gangnam Station, 24, Gangnam-daero 55-gil, Seocho-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Drama filming location, #café, #famous restaurant, #time with friends, #outdoorfood', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cAOstS/btsMl9KRUNc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPoOhG7qX5oKeU7kkIR0M9-_vIl1xDg9B00DzSSTI-r2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RxZiOngPluZU%2BsZW4ex4IK%2F4NNQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4oPMM/btsMnZGwWXv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH2vOS0NJS1xCXxThEwPoOry3f0lLIVTcTse04lyvVxo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EMjlL%2FunRURs8Mds7iqOrK6IDAY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7Gqtx/btsMmk6wcgq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHztOHDdPL6qsnnkR-v4LJ9iOGOT5UjIpTZr1pglRSoB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WGLRD0jRWVifHB8I24Ktx8Ja%2Bdw%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cAOstS/btsMl9KRUNc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPoOhG7qX5oKeU7kkIR0M9-_vIl1xDg9B00DzSSTI-r2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RxZiOngPluZU%2BsZW4ex4IK%2F4NNQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4oPMM/btsMnZGwWXv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH2vOS0NJS1xCXxThEwPoOry3f0lLIVTcTse04lyvVxo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EMjlL%2FunRURs8Mds7iqOrK6IDAY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7Gqtx/btsMmk6wcgq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHztOHDdPL6qsnnkR-v4LJ9iOGOT5UjIpTZr1pglRSoB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WGLRD0jRWVifHB8I24Ktx8Ja%2Bdw%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cAOstS/btsMl9KRUNc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPoOhG7qX5oKeU7kkIR0M9-_vIl1xDg9B00DzSSTI-r2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RxZiOngPluZU%2BsZW4ex4IK%2F4NNQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4oPMM/btsMnZGwWXv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH2vOS0NJS1xCXxThEwPoOry3f0lLIVTcTse04lyvVxo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EMjlL%2FunRURs8Mds7iqOrK6IDAY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7Gqtx/btsMmk6wcgq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHztOHDdPL6qsnnkR-v4LJ9iOGOT5UjIpTZr1pglRSoB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WGLRD0jRWVifHB8I24Ktx8Ja%2Bdw%3D', 37.4956618, 127.0255981, '### 에그드랍 강남점 방문 팁\n드라마 "그놈은 흑염룡"의 촬영지인 에그드랍 강남점에서는 맛있는 음식과 함께 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있습니다. \n\n### 여행 포인트\n에그드랍 강남점은 현대적인 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로, 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소입니다. 다양한 메뉴가 준비되어 있어, 특별한 날이나 일상적인 외식 모두에 잘 어울립니다. 드라마 팬이라면 촬영지에서 직접 음식을 즐기며 그 장면을 떠올려 보는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다.', 'With its modern interior and cozy atmosphere the Eggdrop Gangnam branch is the perfect place to spend precious time with friends There are a variety of menus so its perfect for both special days and everyday dining out If you are a drama fan it will be a good experience to enjoy the food and think of the scene at the filming location'),
	(741, '그놈은 흑염룡', '짱오락실 강남대로점', '서울 강남구 강남대로 428 강남역11번출구 도보3분', '짱오락실 강남대로점은 다채로운 게임기와 화려한 네온사인으로 가득 차 있어 친구들과 함께 즐거운 시간을 보내기에 최적의 장소입니다 다양한 오락기와 재미있는 게임들이 마련되어 있어 누구나 쉽게 즐길 수 있는 환경을 제공합니다 드라마의 촬영지로 방문하면 그놈은 흑염룡의 감성을 느끼며 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있습니다', '#게임 #오락실 #강남 #친구 #드라마촬영지', '기타/판별불가', 'The best entertainment room, Gangnam-daero', 'That\'s a black dragon', '3 minutes walk from Exit 11 of Gangnam Station, 428 Gangnam-daero, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Game #Entertainment Room #Gangnam #Friend #DramaShootPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/A423U/btsMu9RyCyO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHV37B0AFIktewfFDsXRsaASpjvT08dwEzVipi7lBrVd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=h1yIA8NeYco6KtUZkLnqoJuMsGc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/JLMwt/btsMvAH1jCv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFKyApOAfBDzGNnhB5_TyeKYijwREniNYya80caxx6xB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KeWFaWh%2BKksHtxG0tOOugeXYv30%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bf4UsN/btsMv5AQ1gV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMKYTnMF5uR8ClJFNU8YV5jZgizizgaPZEPDPXdltqCG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JikVZZk%2FduV9ZVBYNTld7ksehBI%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/A423U/btsMu9RyCyO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHV37B0AFIktewfFDsXRsaASpjvT08dwEzVipi7lBrVd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=h1yIA8NeYco6KtUZkLnqoJuMsGc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/JLMwt/btsMvAH1jCv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFKyApOAfBDzGNnhB5_TyeKYijwREniNYya80caxx6xB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KeWFaWh%2BKksHtxG0tOOugeXYv30%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bf4UsN/btsMv5AQ1gV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMKYTnMF5uR8ClJFNU8YV5jZgizizgaPZEPDPXdltqCG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JikVZZk%2FduV9ZVBYNTld7ksehBI%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/A423U/btsMu9RyCyO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHV37B0AFIktewfFDsXRsaASpjvT08dwEzVipi7lBrVd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=h1yIA8NeYco6KtUZkLnqoJuMsGc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/JLMwt/btsMvAH1jCv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFKyApOAfBDzGNnhB5_TyeKYijwREniNYya80caxx6xB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KeWFaWh%2BKksHtxG0tOOugeXYv30%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bf4UsN/btsMv5AQ1gV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMKYTnMF5uR8ClJFNU8YV5jZgizizgaPZEPDPXdltqCG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JikVZZk%2FduV9ZVBYNTld7ksehBI%3D', 37.5007737, 127.0267129, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 그놈은 흑염룡\n- **촬영지**: 짱오락실 강남대로점\n- **방문팁**: 다양한 게임과 화려한 조명이 어우러진 오락실에서 즐거운 시간을 보내세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n짱오락실 강남대로점은 다채로운 게임기와 화려한 네온사인으로 가득 차 있어, 친구들과 함께 즐거운 시간을 보내기에 최적의 장소입니다. 다양한 오락기와 재미있는 게임들이 마련되어 있어, 누구나 쉽게 즐길 수 있는 환경을 제공합니다. 드라마의 촬영지로 방문하면, 그놈은 흑염룡의 감성을 느끼며 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있습니다.', 'The Gangnamdaero branch of the Jjang Entertainment Room is filled with colorful game consoles and colorful neon signs making it the best place to have fun with your friends There are various entertainment devices and fun games providing an easy environment for anyone to enjoy If you visit the filming location of the drama you can feel the emotions of the black dragon and make special memories'),
	(742, '그놈은 흑염룡', '조선 팰리스 1914 라운지&바', '서울 강남구 테헤란로 231 역삼역8번출구 도보6분', '조선 팰리스 1914 라운지바는 현대적인 감각과 전통이 조화를 이루는 공간으로 드라마 그놈은 흑염룡의 촬영지로 유명합니다 고급스러운 인테리어와 멋진 야경을 배경으로 특별한 시간을 보낼 수 있는 이곳은 드라마 팬들에게는 잊지 못할 추억을 선사할 것입니다 여유로운 분위기에서 여유롭게 음료를 즐기며 촬영지의 매력을 만끽해 보세요', '#드라마촬영지, #조선팰리스, #고급바, #야경, #음료, #세련된분위기', '호텔/숙소', 'Joseon Palace 1914 Lounge & Bar', 'That\'s a black dragon', '6 minutes walk from Exit 8 of Yeoksam Station, 231, Teheran-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a hotel/dormitory', '#Drama filming location, #JoseonPalace, #luxurybar, #nightscape, #drink, #sophisticated atmosphere', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/I2NK8/btsMlV5QDh2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHd_W31Sk8dAwR1dk1z2PW12mfbGwINB59-aNIl0Tj7j/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5SOqlt2zGUoOJzzoItJuP7bNzBY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/k3AIs/btsMli1zJvS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEZWN1jPngtl_ulheyzqrpN70uCtMq-LhMVtKe1mamMK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=R3KfCx31UWNMJV3685F%2BQFkRrFE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cLfcEK/btsMnlPTlSf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACQGz3lIQ2iiLF2gv-7cwtJ4yLb4C2RL2OgIpEwZuuS2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EGLJZSIRt9eXmSpN5br8DQOXVg0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/I2NK8/btsMlV5QDh2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHd_W31Sk8dAwR1dk1z2PW12mfbGwINB59-aNIl0Tj7j/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5SOqlt2zGUoOJzzoItJuP7bNzBY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/k3AIs/btsMli1zJvS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEZWN1jPngtl_ulheyzqrpN70uCtMq-LhMVtKe1mamMK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=R3KfCx31UWNMJV3685F%2BQFkRrFE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cLfcEK/btsMnlPTlSf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACQGz3lIQ2iiLF2gv-7cwtJ4yLb4C2RL2OgIpEwZuuS2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EGLJZSIRt9eXmSpN5br8DQOXVg0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/I2NK8/btsMlV5QDh2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHd_W31Sk8dAwR1dk1z2PW12mfbGwINB59-aNIl0Tj7j/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5SOqlt2zGUoOJzzoItJuP7bNzBY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/k3AIs/btsMli1zJvS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEZWN1jPngtl_ulheyzqrpN70uCtMq-LhMVtKe1mamMK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=R3KfCx31UWNMJV3685F%2BQFkRrFE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cLfcEK/btsMnlPTlSf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACQGz3lIQ2iiLF2gv-7cwtJ4yLb4C2RL2OgIpEwZuuS2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EGLJZSIRt9eXmSpN5br8DQOXVg0%3D', 37.5032113, 127.0414917, '### 호텔 정보\n- **호텔명:** 조선 팰리스 1914 라운지&바\n- **드라마 제목:** 그놈은 흑염룡\n- **방문 팁:** 세련된 분위기에서 다양한 음료를 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.\n\n### 여행 포인트\n조선 팰리스 1914 라운지&바는 현대적인 감각과 전통이 조화를 이루는 공간으로, 드라마 \'그놈은 흑염룡\'의 촬영지로 유명합니다. 고급스러운 인테리어와 멋진 야경을 배경으로 특별한 시간을 보낼 수 있는 이곳은, 드라마 팬들에게는 잊지 못할 추억을 선사할 것입니다. 여유로운 분위기에서 여유롭게 음료를 즐기며 촬영지의 매력을 만끽해 보세요.', 'Joseon Palace 1914 Lounge  Bar is a space where modern sensations and traditions are harmonized and it is famous as the filming location for the drama Hes a Black Dragon This place where you can spend a special time with luxurious interior and wonderful night view will provide unforgettable memories for drama fans Enjoy the charm of the filming location while enjoying drinks in a relaxed atmosphere'),
	(743, '그놈은 흑염룡', '골든타워앞', '서울 강남구 삼성로 511 삼성중앙역6번출구 도보9분', '골든타워앞은 드라마 그놈은 흑염룡의 주요 촬영지로 도시의 현대적인 분위기를 느낄 수 있는 멋진 장소입니다 이곳은 특히 밤에 화려한 조명과 함께 더욱 매력적으로 변모하며 드라마 팬들에게는 잊지 못할 추억을 선사합니다 주변 카페나 레스토랑에서 여유롭게 시간을 보내며 촬영지의 매력을 만끽해보세요', '#도시풍경, #현대적, #드라마촬영지, #야경, #추억', '거리/골목/광장', 'In front of Golden Tower', 'That\'s a black dragon', '9 minutes walk from Exit 6 of Samsung Central Station, 511, Samseong-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Urban scenery, #modern, #dramaset, #nightscape, #memories', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YvSz9/btsMFzoeP5X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALwmGRI7BZ_14J0FQntPTbDqcxp6ig0eZ8MEiS8b0WOt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ye%2BLxB6M1qlXQTuECEaLZEsvapQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/v7dCR/btsMFhOZlxM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL7P9QDLifaLpxgc5QA4mVOE-O1SJeJlQAWrsYHlTo4V/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rfThH5PXuxubyvaxBat2aVvMT%2Bk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bpfQvm/btsMHf98iLU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG0-WQPziw3cEsYtf4mi-y0ur8BV5_WCiqppShhFnvgu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=A92N7OlnasxmR7GPGuoojaiKywA%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YvSz9/btsMFzoeP5X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALwmGRI7BZ_14J0FQntPTbDqcxp6ig0eZ8MEiS8b0WOt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ye%2BLxB6M1qlXQTuECEaLZEsvapQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/v7dCR/btsMFhOZlxM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL7P9QDLifaLpxgc5QA4mVOE-O1SJeJlQAWrsYHlTo4V/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rfThH5PXuxubyvaxBat2aVvMT%2Bk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bpfQvm/btsMHf98iLU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG0-WQPziw3cEsYtf4mi-y0ur8BV5_WCiqppShhFnvgu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=A92N7OlnasxmR7GPGuoojaiKywA%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YvSz9/btsMFzoeP5X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALwmGRI7BZ_14J0FQntPTbDqcxp6ig0eZ8MEiS8b0WOt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ye%2BLxB6M1qlXQTuECEaLZEsvapQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/v7dCR/btsMFhOZlxM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL7P9QDLifaLpxgc5QA4mVOE-O1SJeJlQAWrsYHlTo4V/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rfThH5PXuxubyvaxBat2aVvMT%2Bk%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bpfQvm/btsMHf98iLU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG0-WQPziw3cEsYtf4mi-y0ur8BV5_WCiqppShhFnvgu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=A92N7OlnasxmR7GPGuoojaiKywA%3D', 37.5077439, 127.0555343, '### 촬영지 큐레이터\n\n**드라마 정보**  \n- **제목:** 그놈은 흑염룡  \n- **촬영지:** 골든타워앞  \n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.  \n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding  \n- **작가:** 미상  \n- **카테고리:** 건물  \n\n### 여행 포인트  \n골든타워앞은 드라마 "그놈은 흑염룡"의 주요 촬영지로, 도시의 현대적인 분위기를 느낄 수 있는 멋진 장소입니다. 이곳은 특히 밤에 화려한 조명과 함께 더욱 매력적으로 변모하며, 드라마 팬들에게는 잊지 못할 추억을 선사합니다. 주변 카페나 레스토랑에서 여유롭게 시간을 보내며 촬영지의 매력을 만끽해보세요.', 'The Golden Tower is the main filming location for the drama Thats a Black Dragon and it is a wonderful place where you can feel the modern atmosphere of the city This place becomes more attractive especially at night with colorful lights and provides unforgettable memories for drama fans Spend your time at nearby cafes and restaurants and enjoy the charm of the filming location'),
	(744, '그놈은 흑염룡', '현대백화점 본사', '서울 강남구 테헤란로98길 12 삼성역4번출구 도보3분', '현대백화점 본사는 세련된 디자인과 넓은 공간이 특징으로 드라마 그놈은 흑염룡의 촬영지로 유명합니다 이곳은 현대적인 건축미와 함께 다양한 쇼핑과 식사를 즐길 수 있는 장소로 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험을 선사합니다 방문 시에는 내부의 아늑한 분위기를 만끽하며 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올려보는 것도 좋습니다', '#현대백화점 #촬영지 #구경 #쇼핑 #식사 #세련된디자인', '쇼핑몰/백화점', 'Hyundai Department Store Headquarters', 'That\'s a black dragon', '3-minute walk from Exit 4 of Samseong Station, 12 Teheran-ro 98-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'shopping mall/department store', '#Hyundai Department Store #Photoshoot #caliber #shopping #meal #sophisticated design', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bBHjAd/btsME5OGJTV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB-WHcw4R2SBPyrqIvS4Avf4vK_Rl-HQ_1NsJTRzT5s1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=D6Vrn6qC4vsinpNhoIgYraifxyQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/djNLtl/btsMGgn9j9e/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACaweOFsS2T_vlmTXOgGiHgDm2l5n-UKa4Mh6JmwTA22/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=swTOhPspXEyfRj%2FwfQf%2BlmU3gu8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wBf3k/btsMAkSHJ5k/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOaNSg4fqTDGzEQ_ZhtUKJm8LaHY-xnB6nBTF_pofKpY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=O6MXZJ%2FGPlyHc5gh9NjiMyw5ons%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c5rBpA/btsMBECzHQi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAED7-0sCfQ2XYUM3hEaB3V3Kjk-ZSBzAGFyARUQb2Szj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tJpOaTkAJgpGxsyxKeAsL68yHKI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/she7r/btsMw6zfTlT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM95-ltk7BPnz6q_ijwfeq6f8NZl58TzhwARan8zdgan/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zrTz9PLCvnKkjdY7oDPaE9yeCog%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ctaeQV/btsMw4VIh5f/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMMqlWGipBHTuEOBzmWMaNBW_kGkNp3cLxB2r-usmjfx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764