est place to spend a peaceful time in the city center providing drama fans with a chance to leave special memories Its also a good idea to take a walk and think of a scene from the drama here where the calm waters and green grass are harmonized'),
	(798, '멱살 한번 잡힙시다', '29펍 3호점', '서울 서초구 강남대로 445 신논현역7번출구 도보2분', '29펍 3호점은 드라마 멱살 한번 잡힙시다의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다 다양한 음료와 안주를 즐기며 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 곳으로 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 보내기에 적합합니다 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요', '#카페 #데이트 #친구 #아늑한분위기 #음료 #안주', '카페/레스토랑', 'Pub #3', 'Let\'s grab him by the collar', '2-minute walk from Exit 7 of Sinnonhyeon Station, 445 Gangnam-daero, Seocho-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Cafe #Date #Friend #CozyAtmosphere #Drink #Drink #Drink', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kDlrq/btsGipEugSq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANq1wn0zwcatO_sXpjdHBHTmH4kNw4SiQCmI2cBEGsDv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nw4r%2B9qbL70%2F8LvjeuRjwnCyJ1Y%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ZDbWA/btsGiTkZeIr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGtTx5g66HAyu5qFv1TmoDd2ARlIbDnQi6GL-_Ww_g01/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2tVY7SZwO90aL38nErsGzspmvHQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/3fxHC/btsGg3POUQP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKxDjpbInLNOW8J0TOrMIIcputIKgI1cRhS3eVb6NeNV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pRl9vkSx3uibYJHkesw1G0p%2Bn8k%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kDlrq/btsGipEugSq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANq1wn0zwcatO_sXpjdHBHTmH4kNw4SiQCmI2cBEGsDv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nw4r%2B9qbL70%2F8LvjeuRjwnCyJ1Y%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ZDbWA/btsGiTkZeIr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGtTx5g66HAyu5qFv1TmoDd2ARlIbDnQi6GL-_Ww_g01/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2tVY7SZwO90aL38nErsGzspmvHQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/3fxHC/btsGg3POUQP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKxDjpbInLNOW8J0TOrMIIcputIKgI1cRhS3eVb6NeNV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pRl9vkSx3uibYJHkesw1G0p%2Bn8k%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kDlrq/btsGipEugSq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANq1wn0zwcatO_sXpjdHBHTmH4kNw4SiQCmI2cBEGsDv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nw4r%2B9qbL70%2F8LvjeuRjwnCyJ1Y%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ZDbWA/btsGiTkZeIr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGtTx5g66HAyu5qFv1TmoDd2ARlIbDnQi6GL-_Ww_g01/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2tVY7SZwO90aL38nErsGzspmvHQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/3fxHC/btsGg3POUQP/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKxDjpbInLNOW8J0TOrMIIcputIKgI1cRhS3eVb6NeNV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pRl9vkSx3uibYJHkesw1G0p%2Bn8k%3D', 37.5019979, 127.0252595, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 멱살 한번 잡힙시다  \n**촬영지:** 29펍 3호점  \n**방문팁:** 분위기가 아늑해 대화하기 좋은 장소입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n29펍 3호점은 드라마 "멱살 한번 잡힙시다"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다. 다양한 음료와 안주를 즐기며 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 곳으로, 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 보내기에 적합합니다. 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요.', 'The 29th pub No 3 is the filming location of the drama Lets Get a Grip and it is a cafe with a stylish interior and a cozy atmosphere It is a place where you can enjoy a variety of drinks and snacks and feel the sensibility of the drama and it is suitable for spending precious time with friends Make special memories by recalling the scenes filmed here'),
	(799, '멱살 한번 잡힙시다', '긴자 청담블루', '서울 강남구 도산대로 420 압구정로데오역4번출구 도보11분', '긴자 청담블루는 드라마 멱살 한번 잡힙시다의 주요 촬영지로 고급스러운 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 장소입니다 이곳에서 제공하는 다양한 한식 메뉴를 즐기며 드라마의 한 장면을 그대로 재현해보는 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다 친구나 가족과 함께 방문해 드라마의 감동을 나누고 멋진 시간을 보내보세요', '#KdramaTrip #청담블루 #한식 #촬영지 #드라마체험', '기타/판별불가', 'Ginza Cheongdam Blue', 'Let\'s grab him by the collar', '11 minutes walk from Exit 4 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 420 Dosan-daero, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#KdramaTrip #CheongdamBlue #Korean Food #FilmingPlace #DramaExperience', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cuPuHI/btsG0ULBEQq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIhV44uDRS5OhAMtduR3n9QCP3xaap7VrM0HGuA77mZq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eJmJrVzTHQUlseU8oKtDSkc6ERo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LmwuQ/btsG1xJqBr2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACCUC7qkZ4pTpnHEkm1ZzYkjXm2ioddt3je5mGG4qW5A/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8QygtqhZOWXN4Oy2vf81E9OfSQ4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0Nocx/btsG3m8l1Ip/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO_-aybH65PJ2y_wBoENjU8KzUiG9Wk0wLL2Gw9HkZEw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YcdZtDqVV1ObXHJZIxNvd5Cqrqo%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cuPuHI/btsG0ULBEQq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIhV44uDRS5OhAMtduR3n9QCP3xaap7VrM0HGuA77mZq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eJmJrVzTHQUlseU8oKtDSkc6ERo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LmwuQ/btsG1xJqBr2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACCUC7qkZ4pTpnHEkm1ZzYkjXm2ioddt3je5mGG4qW5A/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8QygtqhZOWXN4Oy2vf81E9OfSQ4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0Nocx/btsG3m8l1Ip/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO_-aybH65PJ2y_wBoENjU8KzUiG9Wk0wLL2Gw9HkZEw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YcdZtDqVV1ObXHJZIxNvd5Cqrqo%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cuPuHI/btsG0ULBEQq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIhV44uDRS5OhAMtduR3n9QCP3xaap7VrM0HGuA77mZq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eJmJrVzTHQUlseU8oKtDSkc6ERo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LmwuQ/btsG1xJqBr2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACCUC7qkZ4pTpnHEkm1ZzYkjXm2ioddt3je5mGG4qW5A/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8QygtqhZOWXN4Oy2vf81E9OfSQ4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0Nocx/btsG3m8l1Ip/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO_-aybH65PJ2y_wBoENjU8KzUiG9Wk0wLL2Gw9HkZEw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YcdZtDqVV1ObXHJZIxNvd5Cqrqo%3D', 37.5230411, 127.0419873, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 멱살 한번 잡힙시다\n- **촬영지**: 긴자 청담블루\n- **방문팁**: 이곳에서 드라마의 분위기를 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n긴자 청담블루는 드라마 "멱살 한번 잡힙시다"의 주요 촬영지로, 고급스러운 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 장소입니다. 이곳에서 제공하는 다양한 한식 메뉴를 즐기며 드라마의 한 장면을 그대로 재현해보는 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다. 친구나 가족과 함께 방문해 드라마의 감동을 나누고, 멋진 시간을 보내보세요.', 'Ginza Cheongdam Blue is the main filming location for the drama Lets get a piggyback and it is an attractive place with luxurious interior and cozy atmosphere You can enjoy a variety of Korean food menus provided here and have a special experience of recreating a scene of the drama as it is Visit with your friends or family to share the emotions of the drama and have a wonderful time'),
	(800, '야한 사진관', '아트클로버', '서울 마포구 성미산로 150 홍대입구역3번출구 도보12분', '아트클로버는 드라마 야한 사진관의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다 이곳은 다양한 음료와 디저트를 제공하며 창가에서 바라보는 풍경이 특히 인상적입니다 드라마 팬이라면 주인공들이 앉았던 자리에서 사진을 찍으며 특별한 순간을 만끽할 수 있습니다 친구들과 함께 방문해 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 좋은 장소입니다', '#카페 #드라마촬영지 #서울여행 #여유로운시간 #디저트', '카페/레스토랑', 'Art clover', 'a racy photography studio', '12 minutes walk from Exit 3 of Hongik University Station, 150 Seongmisan-ro, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Café #DramaShootingPlace #SeoulTravel #RelaxedTime #Dessert', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cxuzYd/btsFQSIuIXH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGw8N8SXRk2FAiC488KQt4LOB_V0cYhHHTy6XdLXTBUd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UFDcw%2BY8ahODfy2KvfUwKyYsDso%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FT2hf/btsFUqw4tKD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEJppDKUKXKvsRAD93-SUNr17lCRJ8wjgOlEkdmchjgR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=M2zEsHduI5PlL0ABihUmgcI25Bg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b5i1em/btsFUFt7qcm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEu6ImxMIuG37wCBAe8w-5xYttUv6YpAgg0pq7hVCLAF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ztGUblSRccQZj2YYUbOP9v9QNlY%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cxuzYd/btsFQSIuIXH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGw8N8SXRk2FAiC488KQt4LOB_V0cYhHHTy6XdLXTBUd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UFDcw%2BY8ahODfy2KvfUwKyYsDso%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FT2hf/btsFUqw4tKD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEJppDKUKXKvsRAD93-SUNr17lCRJ8wjgOlEkdmchjgR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=M2zEsHduI5PlL0ABihUmgcI25Bg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b5i1em/btsFUFt7qcm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEu6ImxMIuG37wCBAe8w-5xYttUv6YpAgg0pq7hVCLAF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ztGUblSRccQZj2YYUbOP9v9QNlY%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cxuzYd/btsFQSIuIXH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGw8N8SXRk2FAiC488KQt4LOB_V0cYhHHTy6XdLXTBUd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UFDcw%2BY8ahODfy2KvfUwKyYsDso%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FT2hf/btsFUqw4tKD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEJppDKUKXKvsRAD93-SUNr17lCRJ8wjgOlEkdmchjgR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=M2zEsHduI5PlL0ABihUmgcI25Bg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b5i1em/btsFUFt7qcm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEu6ImxMIuG37wCBAe8w-5xYttUv6YpAgg0pq7hVCLAF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ztGUblSRccQZj2YYUbOP9v9QNlY%3D', 37.5641072, 126.923224, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n- **제목**: 야한 사진관\n- **촬영지**: 아트클로버\n- **방문팁**: 드라마 촬영지에서 특별한 분위기를 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n아트클로버는 드라마 "야한 사진관"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다. 이곳은 다양한 음료와 디저트를 제공하며, 창가에서 바라보는 풍경이 특히 인상적입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 주인공들이 앉았던 자리에서 사진을 찍으며 특별한 순간을 만끽할 수 있습니다. 친구들과 함께 방문해 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 좋은 장소입니다.', 'ArtClover is the filming location of the drama Youth Photo Studio and it is an attractive cafe with sophisticated interior and cozy atmosphere This place offers a variety of drinks and desserts and the view from the window is particularly impressive If you are a drama fan you can enjoy a special moment by taking pictures where the main characters sit It is a good place to visit with friends and spend a leisurely time'),
	(801, '야한 사진관', '맥스튜디오', '서울 서대문구 연희로 118 홍대입구역5번출구 버스12분', '맥스튜디오는 드라마 야한 사진관의 촬영지로 다양한 촬영 세트와 독특한 분위기를 제공합니다 이곳에서는 드라마의 주요 장면을 재현하며 팬들에게는 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다 사진 촬영을 즐기고 드라마의 매력을 느낄 수 있는 기회를 놓치지 마세요', '#야한사진관 #드라마촬영지 #맥스튜디오 #K드라마 #팬체험', '기타/판별불가', 'Mac Studio', 'a racy photography studio', '12 minute bus from Exit 5 of Hongik University Station, 118 Yeonhui-ro, Seodaemun-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#A racy photo studio #drama shooting location #MacStudio #K-drama #fan experience', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/us5qX/btsGt8j0aDA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFBEkhsXUQuoTKJ-H53gaX9Oi9xrc1eUnrAxx4peyF-f/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=m1a9uAPNBQCGRy2u6qsx4KJFaWU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0fiXh/btsGwL1E9xf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABw0Rd-9YrkIVsl3zHzKxb8nxELD4nh2zSynagPzHaAK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=62%2FoCQDWygf6IJDyA1r9jG%2BYyok%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/us5qX/btsGt8j0aDA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFBEkhsXUQuoTKJ-H53gaX9Oi9xrc1eUnrAxx4peyF-f/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=m1a9uAPNBQCGRy2u6qsx4KJFaWU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0fiXh/btsGwL1E9xf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABw0Rd-9YrkIVsl3zHzKxb8nxELD4nh2zSynagPzHaAK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=62%2FoCQDWygf6IJDyA1r9jG%2BYyok%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/us5qX/btsGt8j0aDA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFBEkhsXUQuoTKJ-H53gaX9Oi9xrc1eUnrAxx4peyF-f/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=m1a9uAPNBQCGRy2u6qsx4KJFaWU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/0fiXh/btsGwL1E9xf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABw0Rd-9YrkIVsl3zHzKxb8nxELD4nh2zSynagPzHaAK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=62%2FoCQDWygf6IJDyA1r9jG%2BYyok%3D', NULL, 37.5682804, 126.9322957, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 야한 사진관\n- **촬영지**: 맥스튜디오\n- **방문팁**: 다양한 촬영 세트를 경험할 수 있는 곳입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n맥스튜디오는 드라마 "야한 사진관"의 촬영지로, 다양한 촬영 세트와 독특한 분위기를 제공합니다. 이곳에서는 드라마의 주요 장면을 재현하며, 팬들에게는 특별한 경험이 될 것입니다. 사진 촬영을 즐기고, 드라마의 매력을 느낄 수 있는 기회를 놓치지 마세요.', 'McStudio is the filming location for the drama The Wild Photo Studio which offers a variety of shooting sets and unique atmosphere Here we reproduce the main scenes of the drama and it will be a special experience for fans Enjoy your photoshoot and dont miss the opportunity to feel the charm of the drama'),
	(802, '야한 사진관', 'IFC', '서울 영등포구 국제금융로 10 여의도역3번출구 도보7분', 'IFC는 세련된 디자인과 현대적인 분위기로 유명한 건물입니다 이곳은 다양한 상점과 레스토랑이 있어 쇼핑과 식사를 동시에 즐길 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다 드라마의 촬영지로도 알려져 있어 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보아야 할 명소입니다 주변의 아름다운 경관과 함께 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤입니다', '#현대건축 #쇼핑 #식사 #드라마촬영지 #여행지', '쇼핑몰/백화점', 'IFC', 'a racy photography studio', '7-minute walk from Exit 3 of Yeouido Station, 10 International Finance-ro, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'shopping mall/department store', '#Modern Architecture #Shopping #Meals #DramaFilmingPlace #TravelPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mDbkR/btsFMCLuaId/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIl5_4bE4wssE7r8wP8oAmVQftusFjQxaHjbexNQU4rY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PJRsuxthWPgZaYEloD2Cs2H%2FhIk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Ajgz3/btsFM9ovXA5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADMZFSOKetxc9fq0DWsQmQV_Aj9u-i-lUIZ0XMRzO3qc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LCym2134jEQA0hRaNthZYOL8id8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Avtjp/btsFLomMUA9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM-AD0Sep6AhDgnMpYfg5VbzAkmkG5vcK8RiLaMtlp8G/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wxB1T3xY0fRCt%2F9S6HfprEfrsJY%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mDbkR/btsFMCLuaId/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIl5_4bE4wssE7r8wP8oAmVQftusFjQxaHjbexNQU4rY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PJRsuxthWPgZaYEloD2Cs2H%2FhIk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Ajgz3/btsFM9ovXA5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADMZFSOKetxc9fq0DWsQmQV_Aj9u-i-lUIZ0XMRzO3qc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LCym2134jEQA0hRaNthZYOL8id8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Avtjp/btsFLomMUA9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM-AD0Sep6AhDgnMpYfg5VbzAkmkG5vcK8RiLaMtlp8G/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wxB1T3xY0fRCt%2F9S6HfprEfrsJY%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mDbkR/btsFMCLuaId/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIl5_4bE4wssE7r8wP8oAmVQftusFjQxaHjbexNQU4rY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PJRsuxthWPgZaYEloD2Cs2H%2FhIk%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Ajgz3/btsFM9ovXA5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADMZFSOKetxc9fq0DWsQmQV_Aj9u-i-lUIZ0XMRzO3qc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LCym2134jEQA0hRaNthZYOL8id8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Avtjp/btsFLomMUA9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM-AD0Sep6AhDgnMpYfg5VbzAkmkG5vcK8RiLaMtlp8G/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wxB1T3xY0fRCt%2F9S6HfprEfrsJY%3D', 37.5249782, 126.9252984, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 야한 사진관\n- **촬영지**: IFC\n- **방문팁**: 현대적인 건축물과 함께 다양한 먹거리를 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\nIFC는 세련된 디자인과 현대적인 분위기로 유명한 건물입니다. 이곳은 다양한 상점과 레스토랑이 있어 쇼핑과 식사를 동시에 즐길 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다. 드라마의 촬영지로도 알려져 있어, 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보아야 할 명소입니다. 주변의 아름다운 경관과 함께 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤입니다.', 'IFC is a building famous for its sophisticated design and modern atmosphere This is the best place to enjoy shopping and dining at the same time with a variety of shops and restaurants It is also known as the filming location of the drama so it is a mustvisit spot for fans Its perfect for relaxing with the beautiful scenery around you'),
	(803, '야한 사진관', '모전교', '서울 종로구 서린동 125-3 광화문역5번출구 도보4분', '모전교는 드라마 야한 사진관의 촬영지로 아름다운 경관과 함께 다양한 촬영 장면을 감상할 수 있는 곳입니다 이곳은 도시의 중심에서 자연과 어우러진 분위기를 제공하며 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 명소입니다 방문 시 주변의 카페나 상점들도 함께 즐기며 여유로운 시간을 보내보세요', '#드라마촬영지, #모전교, #서울, #K드라마, #야한사진관, #추억여행', '기타/판별불가', 'one\'s mother\'s school', 'a racy photography studio', '125-3 Seorin-dong, Jongno-gu, Seoul, 4 minutes on foot from Exit 5 of Gwanghwamun Station', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#The filming location of the drama, #TheMotor School, #Seoul, #K-Drama, #WildPhotography Studio, #MemoriesTravel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bBxHlL/btsGsqdeK4Z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGeOKHLtPPTGEVDQQuXO_Xun8wrRjYQhx0vvytR5iWc4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DH%2FicMEamm5LNBgPdPNcXKqQl0I%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uEQC6/btsGus83g3i/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMaq_VGTDgqrXWgAluc2U_2M4H5jd1ixE4AnphHWcUUv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ftAS1AAfBUYm8nSeeLbIt5mwPnk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FLtwP/btsGsizyAn8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOe1ZNHX6x0qxS7Nix9rMegTSAbTC7JH3mmQaouXuNRg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yp3fngJgMMD6G6xu52LNcQInj2I%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bBxHlL/btsGsqdeK4Z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGeOKHLtPPTGEVDQQuXO_Xun8wrRjYQhx0vvytR5iWc4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DH%2FicMEamm5LNBgPdPNcXKqQl0I%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uEQC6/btsGus83g3i/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMaq_VGTDgqrXWgAluc2U_2M4H5jd1ixE4AnphHWcUUv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ftAS1AAfBUYm8nSeeLbIt5mwPnk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FLtwP/btsGsizyAn8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOe1ZNHX6x0qxS7Nix9rMegTSAbTC7JH3mmQaouXuNRg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yp3fngJgMMD6G6xu52LNcQInj2I%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bBxHlL/btsGsqdeK4Z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGeOKHLtPPTGEVDQQuXO_Xun8wrRjYQhx0vvytR5iWc4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DH%2FicMEamm5LNBgPdPNcXKqQl0I%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uEQC6/btsGus83g3i/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMaq_VGTDgqrXWgAluc2U_2M4H5jd1ixE4AnphHWcUUv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ftAS1AAfBUYm8nSeeLbIt5mwPnk%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/FLtwP/btsGsizyAn8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOe1ZNHX6x0qxS7Nix9rMegTSAbTC7JH3mmQaouXuNRg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yp3fngJgMMD6G6xu52LNcQInj2I%3D', 37.5691846, 126.9793934, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 야한 사진관\n- **촬영지:** 모전교\n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 주요 장면을 촬영한 장소를 찾아보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n모전교는 드라마 "야한 사진관"의 촬영지로, 아름다운 경관과 함께 다양한 촬영 장면을 감상할 수 있는 곳입니다. 이곳은 도시의 중심에서 자연과 어우러진 분위기를 제공하며, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 명소입니다. 방문 시 주변의 카페나 상점들도 함께 즐기며 여유로운 시간을 보내보세요.', 'Mojeongyo Bridge is the filming location of the drama The Wild Photo Studio where you can enjoy various filming scenes with beautiful scenery It offers an atmosphere in harmony with nature in the center of the city and is a special place for drama fans to leave special memories Enjoy the cafes and shops around you when you visit and have a leisurely time'),
	(804, '야한 사진관', '야베스세무회계사무소', '서울 종로구 돈화문로 82 종로3가역7번출구 도보6분', '야베스세무회계사무소는 드라마 야한 사진관의 주요 촬영지로 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 드라마 촬영지를 둘러보며 여유롭게 산책하기에 좋은 장소입니다 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 한 번 들러보세요', '#KdramaTrip #야한사진관 #촬영지 #서울 #드라마팬 #여행', '거리/골목/광장', 'Yves Tax Accounting Office', 'a racy photography studio', '6-minute walk from Exit 7 of Jongno 3-ga Station, 82 Donhawmun-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #WildPhotoshop #FilmingPlace #Seoul #DramaFan #Travel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bmKhtL/btsG47DIyIx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAImZ-Z29sZzHrF38Z2Njz3v9zAPeFIhb3u_cxX4eqpWj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vzIZkY4j5KmGWvaqJ2Vw7eyb9hU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dCWojx/btsG3lJH7e5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADCxR2zwNkGmiuMSLAMVq1HBTPhyfxx82q2NKQaCBH4z/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MOt9hC6Lhq2bWwtIHZ%2BpgYjgBgw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/buuEfU/btsG6hFjlRu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAWz7Ajm3sODYswdiTQGS2qweN-nChs_aGlAKg1zgM9S/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YOnFW5EUGxSAsYvjr7GexSiCYQs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/G0ZUV/btsG3ANl4Wl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADvNuhZDlmH9EBYASgmvGHZCfZffLw4yWVfCRnjr-3kN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=v%2F1sQ2QFJRjkFzspjiwzsFj69rE%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bmKhtL/btsG47DIyIx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAImZ-Z29sZzHrF38Z2Njz3v9zAPeFIhb3u_cxX4eqpWj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vzIZkY4j5KmGWvaqJ2Vw7eyb9hU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dCWojx/btsG3lJH7e5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADCxR2zwNkGmiuMSLAMVq1HBTPhyfxx82q2NKQaCBH4z/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MOt9hC6Lhq2bWwtIHZ%2BpgYjgBgw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/buuEfU/btsG6hFjlRu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAWz7Ajm3sODYswdiTQGS2qweN-nChs_aGlAKg1zgM9S/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YOnFW5EUGxSAsYvjr7GexSiCYQs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/G0ZUV/btsG3ANl4Wl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADvNuhZDlmH9EBYASgmvGHZCfZffLw4yWVfCRnjr-3kN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=v%2F1sQ2QFJRjkFzspjiwzsFj69rE%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bmKhtL/btsG47DIyIx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAImZ-Z29sZzHrF38Z2Njz3v9zAPeFIhb3u_cxX4eqpWj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vzIZkY4j5KmGWvaqJ2Vw7eyb9hU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dCWojx/btsG3lJH7e5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADCxR2zwNkGmiuMSLAMVq1HBTPhyfxx82q2NKQaCBH4z/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MOt9hC6Lhq2bWwtIHZ%2BpgYjgBgw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/buuEfU/btsG6hFjlRu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAWz7Ajm3sODYswdiTQGS2qweN-nChs_aGlAKg1zgM9S/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YOnFW5EUGxSAsYvjr7GexSiCYQs%3D', 37.5757344, 126.9907655, '### 거리 정보\n- **제목**: 야한 사진관\n- **촬영지**: 야베스세무회계사무소\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 주요 촬영지로, 팬들이 방문하기 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #태그\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 거리\n\n### 여행 포인트\n야베스세무회계사무소는 드라마 "야한 사진관"의 주요 촬영지로, 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다. 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 드라마 촬영지를 둘러보며 여유롭게 산책하기에 좋은 장소입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 한 번 들러보세요!', 'Yaves Tax Accounting Office is the main filming location of the drama The Wild Photography Museum and if you visit here you can have a special experience by recalling the scenes in the drama There are various cafes and shops nearby so it is a good place to take a leisurely walk while looking around the drama filming location If youre a drama fan make sure to stop by'),
	(805, '야한 사진관', '왕자만화방', '서울 종로구 윤보선길 31 안국역1번출구 도보3분', '왕자만화방은 드라마 야한 사진관의 촬영지로 이곳에서 드라마의 주요 장면들을 직접 느껴볼 수 있습니다 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 드라마 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 산책하며 사진을 찍기에 좋은 장소입니다 특히 드라마의 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있을 것입니다', '#드라마촬영지 #왕자만화방 #서울여행 #K드라마투어 #추억만들기', '기타/판별불가', 'Prince\'s comic book store', 'a racy photography studio', '3-minute walk from Exit 1 of Anguk Station, 31 Yoonbo Seon-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Drama filming location #Prince Comic Room #SeoulTravel #K-DramaTour #MakingMemories', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bRTh5b/btsGHvc1Sh5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALe8Mbkw5hW23pcfhxU1hNAj2OZeL5Hx8dw8DWxDcbAa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2U5lQVRsE8jJH3c%2FMc7wMqHHCns%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dZmAW9/btsGEU6zsxp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM75EEVPJEisJqYyr7JzCTGNGbteR33Wh2iYJpSwWRjz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ASfmBN203h%2FuVieMtTNg5gHHB8s%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b1lsjm/btsGFg9mL4A/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIkT7Li22IbYIO7LquVeDCaa2NEwXxms0kAo_i-rfQIg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EVQmy8nQaZKPWMLnmg22Oo3M5z0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bRTh5b/btsGHvc1Sh5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALe8Mbkw5hW23pcfhxU1hNAj2OZeL5Hx8dw8DWxDcbAa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2U5lQVRsE8jJH3c%2FMc7wMqHHCns%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dZmAW9/btsGEU6zsxp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM75EEVPJEisJqYyr7JzCTGNGbteR33Wh2iYJpSwWRjz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ASfmBN203h%2FuVieMtTNg5gHHB8s%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b1lsjm/btsGFg9mL4A/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIkT7Li22IbYIO7LquVeDCaa2NEwXxms0kAo_i-rfQIg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EVQmy8nQaZKPWMLnmg22Oo3M5z0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bRTh5b/btsGHvc1Sh5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALe8Mbkw5hW23pcfhxU1hNAj2OZeL5Hx8dw8DWxDcbAa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2U5lQVRsE8jJH3c%2FMc7wMqHHCns%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dZmAW9/btsGEU6zsxp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM75EEVPJEisJqYyr7JzCTGNGbteR33Wh2iYJpSwWRjz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ASfmBN203h%2FuVieMtTNg5gHHB8s%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b1lsjm/btsGFg9mL4A/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIkT7Li22IbYIO7LquVeDCaa2NEwXxms0kAo_i-rfQIg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EVQmy8nQaZKPWMLnmg22Oo3M5z0%3D', 37.577379, 126.9837069, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 야한 사진관\n- **촬영지**: 왕자만화방\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 생생한 촬영 현장을 경험할 수 있는 곳입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n왕자만화방은 드라마 "야한 사진관"의 촬영지로, 이곳에서 드라마의 주요 장면들을 직접 느껴볼 수 있습니다. 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 드라마 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 산책하며 사진을 찍기에 좋은 장소입니다. 특히, 드라마의 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있을 것입니다.', 'The Princes Cartoon Room is the filming location of the drama The Wild Photo Studio where you can feel the main scenes of the drama firsthand There are various cafes and shops around so it is a good place to take a leisurely walk and take pictures after visiting the drama filming location In particular if you are a fan of dramas you will be able to make special memories here'),
	(806, '야한 사진관', '열린송현녹지광장', '서울 종로구 송현동 48-9 안국역1번출구 위에서2분', '열린송현녹지광장은 드라마 야한 사진관의 촬영지로 자연과 도시가 어우러진 아름다운 경관을 제공합니다 이곳에서 산책하며 드라마 속 주인공들의 감정을 느껴보세요 특히 저녁 노을이 질 때 방문하면 더욱 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다 다양한 사진 촬영 포인트가 있어 인생 사진을 남기기에도 좋은 장소입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #사진찍기, #산책, #자연, #도시경관, #야경', '기타/판별불가', 'Open Songhyeon Green Area Square', 'a racy photography studio', '2 minutes above Exit 1 of Anguk Station, 48-9 Songhyeon-dong, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Drama filming location, #takingphotos, #walk, #nature, #urbanscape, #nightscape', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NCdcp/btsGFprAWLH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANyVEu1VQIdgvQxMvGOlaXaWFnmv6Xqupn50cx68eH-z/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qSdtwrgdkUS9ymo75w2aRccEoOo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bpZTP9/btsGIgs6U5X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK05flf6dPD7Gf1423KGWhyg0eHdTEccMNNzKbhG4_0u/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QSVUqWZBt6agzBrEkBbkBf%2BL0Qc%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NCdcp/btsGFprAWLH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANyVEu1VQIdgvQxMvGOlaXaWFnmv6Xqupn50cx68eH-z/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qSdtwrgdkUS9ymo75w2aRccEoOo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bpZTP9/btsGIgs6U5X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK05flf6dPD7Gf1423KGWhyg0eHdTEccMNNzKbhG4_0u/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QSVUqWZBt6agzBrEkBbkBf%2BL0Qc%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NCdcp/btsGFprAWLH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANyVEu1VQIdgvQxMvGOlaXaWFnmv6Xqupn50cx68eH-z/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qSdtwrgdkUS9ymo75w2aRccEoOo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bpZTP9/btsGIgs6U5X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK05flf6dPD7Gf1423KGWhyg0eHdTEccMNNzKbhG4_0u/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QSVUqWZBt6agzBrEkBbkBf%2BL0Qc%3D', NULL, 37.5764499, 126.981682, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 야한 사진관\n- **촬영지:** 열린송현녹지광장\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 아름다운 공간입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n열린송현녹지광장은 드라마 "야한 사진관"의 촬영지로, 자연과 도시가 어우러진 아름다운 경관을 제공합니다. 이곳에서 산책하며 드라마 속 주인공들의 감정을 느껴보세요. 특히, 저녁 노을이 질 때 방문하면 더욱 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다. 다양한 사진 촬영 포인트가 있어 인생 사진을 남기기에도 좋은 장소입니다.', 'The open Songhyeon Green Area Square is the filming location of the drama The Wild Photography Museum providing beautiful scenery that combines nature and cities Take a walk here and feel the emotions of the main characters in the drama In particular you can have a more special experience if you visit at sunset in the evening It has a variety of photo points so its also a great place to leave your life photos'),
	(807, '야한 사진관', '감고당길', '서울 종로구 송현동 57-1 안국역1번출구 위에서2분', '감고당길은 드라마 야한 사진관의 촬영지로 다양한 인물들이 어우러진 활기찬 거리 풍경을 제공합니다 이곳에서 드라마의 주요 장면을 재현하며 주변의 아름다운 자연과 함께 사진을 찍기에 좋은 장소입니다 방문객들은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 소중한 추억을 남길 수 있습니다', '#KdramaTrip #StreetScene #서울 #드라마촬영지 #야한사진관 #감고당길', '거리/골목/광장', 'Wrap it around and pull it', 'a racy photography studio', '2 minutes above Exit 1 of Anguk Station, 57-1 Songhyeon-dong, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #StreetScene #Seoul #DramaFilmingPlace #YouthPhotoshop #Gamgodanggil', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/k27YJ/btsGG8JgOFD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPeytDf6KUKSiIQtQqhtsAY9BqjgUvMmoEUxro7ieUxr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wVtAoaZng9pr9RyiAcGyWw74SLM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dPSS7H/btsGGOK5XlD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANc-RV-LIbyZFOq8fEbsgXmyK-zZTXFD1IRRdxFpzKjE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IFQ4vlGoA2Q1mH4%2B%2BHaIJkdVZzs%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/k27YJ/btsGG8JgOFD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPeytDf6KUKSiIQtQqhtsAY9BqjgUvMmoEUxro7ieUxr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wVtAoaZng9pr9RyiAcGyWw74SLM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dPSS7H/btsGGOK5XlD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANc-RV-LIbyZFOq8fEbsgXmyK-zZTXFD1IRRdxFpzKjE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IFQ4vlGoA2Q1mH4%2B%2BHaIJkdVZzs%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/k27YJ/btsGG8JgOFD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPeytDf6KUKSiIQtQqhtsAY9BqjgUvMmoEUxro7ieUxr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wVtAoaZng9pr9RyiAcGyWw74SLM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dPSS7H/btsGGOK5XlD/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANc-RV-LIbyZFOq8fEbsgXmyK-zZTXFD1IRRdxFpzKjE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IFQ4vlGoA2Q1mH4%2B%2BHaIJkdVZzs%3D', NULL, 37.576434, 126.9827876, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 야한 사진관\n- **촬영지**: 감고당길\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 생생한 장면을 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #StreetScene\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 거리/골목\n\n### 여행 포인트\n감고당길은 드라마 "야한 사진관"의 촬영지로, 다양한 인물들이 어우러진 활기찬 거리 풍경을 제공합니다. 이곳에서 드라마의 주요 장면을 재현하며, 주변의 아름다운 자연과 함께 사진을 찍기에 좋은 장소입니다. 방문객들은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며, 소중한 추억을 남길 수 있습니다.', 'Gomgodanggil is the filming location of the drama The Wild Photo Studio which offers a vibrant street scene with a variety of characters It reproduces the main scenes of the drama here and it is a great place to take pictures with the beautiful nature around it Visitors can feel the sensibility of the drama and leave precious memories'),
	(808, '야한 사진관', '커피방앗간쪽', '서울 종로구 북촌로5가길 8-11 안국역1번출구 위에서5분', '커피방앗간쪽은 드라마 야한 사진관의 촬영지로 아늑하고 독특한 분위기를 자랑합니다 이곳은 드라마 속 주요 장면들이 촬영된 장소로 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지니고 있습니다 주변의 조용한 골목과 따뜻한 조명은 드라마의 감성을 더욱 강조하며 방문객들은 이곳에서 사진을 찍거나 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 드라마의 팬이라면 꼭 한 번 들러보기를 추천합니다', '#촬영지 #드라마 #야한사진관 #커피방앗간 #서울 #종로', '기타/판별불가', 'a coffee mill', 'a racy photography studio', '5 minutes above Exit 1 of Anguk Station, 8-11 Bukchon-ro 5-ga-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Filming location #drama #dramaticphoto studio #coffee mill #Seoul #Jongro', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bqjYuL/btsFNwqetG4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALCQ1baxeR54S7ySGP7cBMhXkxtBXsW9Y9dAd-_eWAQG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=GoPRhcLVQi24zF4u3dMHnsM8%2BGw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cekGEN/btsFLPqPsNf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADlcuMUUIQKu4G4tLDKlLnpVW7Uwj2Aze72E6Utjr2Ms/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pkieYORLEgIHOWWqKap1cOUWgkg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cy0w8d/btsF3XIWUxF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAoIgASIfnFdySVuT3Jw2GoHLkFLaHK_06wTFnMKEKDN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yRkB%2F%2BHRNS0ltoDjyCjvop711oE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lJwY0/btsF2F927Vk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEuNzGuWdo1twP9CL3wcPyV9yI4zmWjt7iJWGnIuaeeV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2F6v6KNWeoBOHW9fCeCKNZIjq2EY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1BxAG/btsF143loBg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFndKm79xIhTSCK38vPgE4AlV0lkOZOxlkLOSZebu6mM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WBs3cE2a%2FIaRWqdBxZkkq%2B6GVmU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/QVLAm/btsF2FWxSVW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACecN2s5KcWwXCqCpLO-lKjTw19emjsRyBxtvEhKLmos/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&a