l=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=aZDknl1izP3JRp2po9%2F9oU12wLE%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bqjYuL/btsFNwqetG4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALCQ1baxeR54S7ySGP7cBMhXkxtBXsW9Y9dAd-_eWAQG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=GoPRhcLVQi24zF4u3dMHnsM8%2BGw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cekGEN/btsFLPqPsNf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADlcuMUUIQKu4G4tLDKlLnpVW7Uwj2Aze72E6Utjr2Ms/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pkieYORLEgIHOWWqKap1cOUWgkg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cy0w8d/btsF3XIWUxF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAoIgASIfnFdySVuT3Jw2GoHLkFLaHK_06wTFnMKEKDN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yRkB%2F%2BHRNS0ltoDjyCjvop711oE%3D', 37.5803137, 126.9824615, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 야한 사진관\n- **촬영지:** 커피방앗간쪽\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼기에 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n커피방앗간쪽은 드라마 "야한 사진관"의 촬영지로, 아늑하고 독특한 분위기를 자랑합니다. 이곳은 드라마 속 주요 장면들이 촬영된 장소로, 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지니고 있습니다. 주변의 조용한 골목과 따뜻한 조명은 드라마의 감성을 더욱 강조하며, 방문객들은 이곳에서 사진을 찍거나 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 드라마의 팬이라면 꼭 한 번 들러보기를 추천합니다.', 'The coffee mill is the filming location for the drama The Wild Photo Studio which boasts a cozy and unique atmosphere This is the place where the main scenes in the drama were filmed and it has a special meaning to fans The surrounding quiet alleys and warm lights further emphasize the sensibility of the drama and visitors can take pictures or have a relaxing time here If you are a fan of the drama I recommend you to stop by'),
	(809, '야한 사진관', '코리아게스트하우스앞', '서울 종로구 삼청로4길 12-1 안국역1번출구 위에서4분', '코리아게스트하우스앞은 드라마 야한 사진관의 촬영지로 아름다운 풍경과 독특한 분위기를 자랑합니다 이곳은 드라마 팬들에게 인기 있는 포토존으로 다양한 각도에서 멋진 사진을 남길 수 있습니다 주변에는 카페와 상점들도 있어 촬영 후 여유롭게 시간을 보내기 좋은 장소입니다', '#야한사진관 #K드라마 #촬영지 #포토존 #서울여행', '기타/판별불가', 'In front of the Korea Guest House', 'a racy photography studio', '4 minutes above Exit 1 of Anguk Station, 12-1, Samcheong-ro 4-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#A racy photo studio #K-drama #filming location #photozone #Seoultravel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cQ0FGw/btsF4VRDiv4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM1_R5amKImCu5JU1AYWVBMLmZ7vSjyMVSEJ4zm31Iiz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=N4yISw3N0JlKxsS%2B9y4mttiAVX4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mHDyV/btsF4A1bWUt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKmzOp5brxonV1gfNV8hHz1OoII6Y_r4b7YOdIZq8ZGa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7O6PEMwxcJCGSrVm4DuMeq%2F4qQw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/JYR5g/btsF3otdWfA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIWjnobVhnBfh0uUEP5ZZ2pDWhmt-f-cDa5dVjjPlfm4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4bTB9gcqZP8%2ByiR4uwZRxB3ibLs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/PhwIY/btsGE4gV06s/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA7AVXu89bJcnoJF-cUo12HyTnRkK0JBE14-QzL_kvWt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wUhsipsBtFmvZVJ%2F9cAQOdQi5JE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/o2iK4/btsGEXoGLYh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFwjAt-pMFD_puE5Pn5j4T2xqG8A6OacUE8NXRNFG1xn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1zfAsDc72GR%2F0%2Bgtz8lBs62JSEY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZIHcs/btsGFFOtpgT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAw-bFy5wcG0-LPwMuJlA2ybUHf2K4G7Al-3a6waSXhl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature