ignature=jkITOkadL5aMGAl%2BX8cQ1XMpWiI%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kZmdi/btshYdm41Tb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFGyZkh2jF7Mhfg7SPHQJdLCDmST2E9dm_7Q_zC0NWrp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=GjH7l0IFP4Dt2lnKc8IyBRg1Oa4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bXb6PK/btshPpaIa1q/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEb6hifYUIrY_NQNWEgyn2Un_tEL5O6-yWmJX32PoylA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=l4HqwXIqhmqHCTl%2F9rkaZjYxnhE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rVt0G/btshTwHneA0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOE_ajCBI1wBntzIxudtLSwZFEx-socytgtBJWqwoWax/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jkITOkadL5aMGAl%2BX8cQ1XMpWiI%3D', 37.5125207, 127.0588194, '### 카지노 촬영지 정보\n\n**제목:** 이로운사기  \n**촬영지:** 세븐럭카지노, 서울 강남구 테헤란로87길 58  \n**방문팁:** 세븐럭카지노에서 드라마의 긴장감 넘치는 순간을 느껴보세요!  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #카지노  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카지노  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n세븐럭카지노는 서울의 중심부에 위치해 있어 접근성이 뛰어나며, 드라마 "이로운사기"의 주요 촬영지로 유명합니다. 이곳은 화려한 인테리어와 다양한 게임 옵션으로 방문객들을 매료시키며, 실제 카지노의 분위기를 체험할 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다. 드라마의 팬이라면 이곳에서 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있을 것입니다.', 'Seven Luck Casino is located in the heart of Seoul so it is highly accessible and is famous as the main filming location for the drama The Beneficial Fraud This is the best place to attract visitors with its colorful interior and various gaming options and experience the atmosphere of a real casino If you are a fan of the drama you will be able to make special memories by recalling the scenes filmed here'),
	(825, '이로운사기', '파르나스타워', '서울 강남구 테헤란로 521 삼성역5번출구 바로앞', '파르나스타워는 세련된 디자인과 현대적인 분위기로 많은 방문객을 끌어들이는 명소입니다 드라마 이로운사기의 촬영지로 알려져 있어 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지닙니다 건물의 외관은 독특한 형태와 조명으로 밤에도 아름다움을 더하며 주변 환경과 조화를 이루어 멋진 사진 촬영지로 제격입니다 이곳을 방문하면 드라마의 한 장면처럼 느껴질 수 있는 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다', '#KdramaTrip #CityBuilding #파르나스타워 #현대건축 #사진명소', '건물', 'Parnas Tower', 'a profitable fraud', 'Right in front of Exit 5 of Samsung Station, 521 Teheran-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Building', '#KdramaTrip #CityBuilding #ParnasTower #ModernArchitecture #PhotographyAttractions', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b2P21L/btslw8bx3pF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADUTprdE8KJl0B576jOxBBd8AocSPTaJb0HdKc-8x231/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dTioM5uMjs0enUcMNnjbhrmQ%2BF0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mWm88/btslmUfkDH0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJcag3475xHFZ-1iCK9lbbOzeAYQR36w-2_qxmw0ZXMF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PHPp1Eatltc5NrSEQQElyw6rVAg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rZeuc/btslue4P4Ic/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHGeWel7HQqg3GH5MJpUm-K_e8iwcUZa7elLa9HQM4gh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ayE2K972nJaBgw4snQ7qvEPuNmI%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b2P21L/btslw8bx3pF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADUTprdE8KJl0B576jOxBBd8AocSPTaJb0HdKc-8x231/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dTioM5uMjs0enUcMNnjbhrmQ%2BF0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mWm88/btslmUfkDH0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJcag3475xHFZ-1iCK9lbbOzeAYQR36w-2_qxmw0ZXMF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PHPp1Eatltc5NrSEQQElyw6rVAg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rZeuc/btslue4P4Ic/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHGeWel7HQqg3GH5MJpUm-K_e8iwcUZa7elLa9HQM4gh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ayE2K972nJaBgw4snQ7qvEPuNmI%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b2P21L/btslw8bx3pF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADUTprdE8KJl0B576jOxBBd8AocSPTaJb0HdKc-8x231/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dTioM5uMjs0enUcMNnjbhrmQ%2BF0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mWm88/btslmUfkDH0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJcag3475xHFZ-1iCK9lbbOzeAYQR36w-2_qxmw0ZXMF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PHPp1Eatltc5NrSEQQElyw6rVAg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/rZeuc/btslue4P4Ic/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHGeWel7HQqg3GH5MJpUm-K_e8iwcUZa7elLa9HQM4gh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ayE2K972nJaBgw4snQ7qvEPuNmI%3D', 37.5090474, 127.060893, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 이로운사기\n- **촬영지**: 파르나스타워\n- **방문팁**: 현대적인 건축물과 함께 멋진 사진을 찍기 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\n파르나스타워는 세련된 디자인과 현대적인 분위기로 많은 방문객을 끌어들이는 명소입니다. 드라마 "이로운사기"의 촬영지로 알려져 있어, 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지닙니다. 건물의 외관은 독특한 형태와 조명으로 밤에도 아름다움을 더하며, 주변 환경과 조화를 이루어 멋진 사진 촬영지로 제격입니다. 이곳을 방문하면 드라마의 한 장면처럼 느껴질 수 있는 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다.', 'Parnas Tower is a attraction that attracts many visitors with its sophisticated design and modern atmosphere Known as the filming location for the drama Beneficial Fraud it has a special meaning for fans The exterior of the building adds beauty to the night with its unique shape and lighting and it is perfect for a wonderful photo shoot in harmony with the surroundings If you visit here you can have a special experience that can feel like a scene in a drama'),
	(826, '닥터 차정숙', '서강대교', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 83-2', '서강대교는 서울의 아름다운 야경을 감상할 수 있는 명소로 드라마 닥터 차정숙의 촬영지로도 유명합니다 이곳에서는 한강의 경치를 배경으로 사진을 찍거나 주변 카페에서 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 특히 밤에는 조명이 반사되는 한강의 풍경이 매력적이니 꼭 저녁 시간에 방문해 보세요', '#KdramaTrip #서강대교 #닥터차정숙 #야경 #한강 #서울', '교통/역/터미널', 'Sogang Bridge', 'Dr. Cha Jung-sook', '83-2 Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'traffic/station/terminal', '#Kdrama Trip #Seogangdaegyo Bridge #Dr. Cha Jung-suk #Nightscape #Han River #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/MR4OR/btscjiVeOgL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALWDLUVcQiW8EV140ZVzGPW4AlHSFIUWdQ07M9eEh0yN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3bONI4Kp4fc8OQITpdINBXiYz1U%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bm62hg/btsb2Ut7wdl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEBPQnFaKfIZCtO072XhMS8Zz2pyBKjg6uMt7aKTjG__/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6yQmvptXsg33xKquQ1BGG5CioSY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b17ZtD/btscaZuW0Gc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHS4FAXzY0E0PUD9CA6YK15_AA7SUQFl56k02hZZoBqZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FbI7TRBOo5K%2B2x1cwmdQA0hvSck%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GP29v/btsfOLsYunT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOfErVKxbUCHAOyLTTfIfLnmL1V80714thbxT-pUiF5l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3rNeADOZNoc6dq1Q4zvpconV5BY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bSRsRE/btsfgg82uYm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJqyQg8ejTxakTIp9SLQtaBJVqYwMuV3UqxZiwjUSczp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=H7KyjBfYyVx%2BSShEfOeP7Pd6x%2FI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mxFBN/btsfdaPzvyG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG5dhnoLl95Ybq3fA37gedCQZq_Rdocor8zMs0EksYpR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vjEAoUEqgyd%2FwS2NPyTz7a8TH6w%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/MR4OR/btscjiVeOgL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALWDLUVcQiW8EV140ZVzGPW4AlHSFIUWdQ07M9eEh0yN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3bONI4Kp4fc8OQITpdINBXiYz1U%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bm62hg/btsb2Ut7wdl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEBPQnFaKfIZCtO072XhMS8Zz2pyBKjg6uMt7aKTjG__/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6yQmvptXsg33xKquQ1BGG5CioSY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b17ZtD/btscaZuW0Gc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHS4FAXzY0E0PUD9CA6YK15_AA7SUQFl56k02hZZoBqZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FbI7TRBOo5K%2B2x1cwmdQA0hvSck%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GP29v/btsfOLsYunT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOfErVKxbUCHAOyLTTfIfLnmL1V80714thbxT-pUiF5l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3rNeADOZNoc6dq1Q4zvpconV5BY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bSRsRE/btsfgg82uYm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJqyQg8ejTxakTIp9SLQtaBJVqYwMuV3UqxZiwjUSczp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=H7KyjBfYyVx%2BSShEfOeP7Pd6x%2FI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mxFBN/btsfdaPzvyG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG5dhnoLl95Ybq3fA37gedCQZq_Rdocor8zMs0EksYpR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vjEAoUEqgyd%2FwS2NPyTz7a8TH6w%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/MR4OR/btscjiVeOgL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALWDLUVcQiW8EV140ZVzGPW4AlHSFIUWdQ07M9eEh0yN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3bONI4Kp4fc8OQITpdINBXiYz1U%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bm62hg/btsb2Ut7wdl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEBPQnFaKfIZCtO072XhMS8Zz2pyBKjg6uMt7aKTjG__/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6yQmvptXsg33xKquQ1BGG5CioSY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b17ZtD/btscaZuW0Gc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHS4FAXzY0E0PUD9CA6YK15_AA7SUQFl56k02hZZoBqZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FbI7TRBOo5K%2B2x1cwmdQA0hvSck%3D', 37.5385603, 126.9256982, '### 교통/역 정보\n\n**위치:** 서강대교, 서울 영등포구 여의도동 83-2  \n**드라마 제목:** 닥터 차정숙  \n**촬영지:** 서강대교  \n**방문팁:** 야경이 아름다우니 저녁 시간에 방문하는 것을 추천합니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Transit  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 교통/역  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n서강대교는 서울의 아름다운 야경을 감상할 수 있는 명소로, 드라마 "닥터 차정숙"의 촬영지로도 유명합니다. 이곳에서는 한강의 경치를 배경으로 사진을 찍거나, 주변 카페에서 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 특히, 밤에는 조명이 반사되는 한강의 풍경이 매력적이니 꼭 저녁 시간에 방문해 보세요.', 'Sogang Bridge is a famous place where you can enjoy the beautiful night view of Seoul and is also famous as the filming location for the drama Dr Cha Jungsook Here you can take pictures with the scenery of the Han River in the background or have a relaxing time at nearby cafes In particular the scenery of the Han River where the lights reflect at night is attractive so make sure to visit in the evening'),
	(827, '닥터 차정숙', '기독교한국침례회총회빌딩', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 13-1 국회의사당역1번출구 위에서9분', '기독교한국침례회총회빌딩은 드라마 닥터 차정숙의 주요 촬영지 중 하나로 현대적인 디자인과 함께 도시의 활기를 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다 이곳에서는 드라마의 명장면을 떠올리며 특별한 순간을 기록할 수 있습니다 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 드라마 촬영 후 여유로운 시간을 보내기에도 좋은 장소입니다', '#닥터차정숙 #촬영지 #기독교한국침례회총회빌딩 #도시건축 #여의도 #KdramaTrip', '기타/판별불가', 'Christian Korean Baptist Conference Building', 'Dr. Cha Jung-sook', '9 minutes above Exit 1 of the 13-1 National Assembly Station, Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Dr. Cha Jung-sook #filming location #Christian Korean Baptist Conference Building #UrbanArchitecture #Yeouido #KdramaTrip', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bdnUFY/btscfDkVynq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADUS3EsrVeumyDpA16IEJghX_joVDQ6bx3AT5ZrghS-E/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=M%2BCZjxw%2Bj%2BMWhWVuyCBD41WoExQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/McETY/btscjjmjLz7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADHGHMFVgYROyVlxEzSS-A1d0Jnrj6fpHYVwwovWlUM6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yKSTKEXh2bp7wDTeL6A2x5pupIs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/s75dQ/btscoFvOxqK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM95Z6pLuHAWNxYIt5WZ-E_myx4QBThIHHhMU7OUjNSz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BI921X41PiDVQiglkwatMJdxJBU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bdnUFY/btscfDkVynq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADUS3EsrVeumyDpA16IEJghX_joVDQ6bx3AT5ZrghS-E/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=M%2BCZjxw%2Bj%2BMWhWVuyCBD41WoExQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/McETY/btscjjmjLz7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADHGHMFVgYROyVlxEzSS-A1d0Jnrj6fpHYVwwovWlUM6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yKSTKEXh2bp7wDTeL6A2x5pupIs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/s75dQ/btscoFvOxqK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM95Z6pLuHAWNxYIt5WZ-E_myx4QBThIHHhMU7OUjNSz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BI921X41PiDVQiglkwatMJdxJBU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bdnUFY/btscfDkVynq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADUS3EsrVeumyDpA16IEJghX_joVDQ6bx3AT5ZrghS-E/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=M%2BCZjxw%2Bj%2BMWhWVuyCBD41WoExQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/McETY/btscjjmjLz7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADHGHMFVgYROyVlxEzSS-A1d0Jnrj6fpHYVwwovWlUM6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yKSTKEXh2bp7wDTeL6A2x5pupIs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/s75dQ/btscoFvOxqK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM95Z6pLuHAWNxYIt5WZ-E_myx4QBThIHHhMU7OUjNSz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BI921X41PiDVQiglkwatMJdxJBU%3D', 37.53068270000001, 126.9216203, '### 닥터 차정숙 촬영지 정보\n\n**건물**: 기독교한국침례회총회빌딩  \n**방문 팁**: 드라마 속 감성을 느끼며 사진을 찍어보세요!  \n**키워드**: #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding  \n**작가**: 미상  \n**카테고리**: 건물  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n기독교한국침례회총회빌딩은 드라마 "닥터 차정숙"의 주요 촬영지 중 하나로, 현대적인 디자인과 함께 도시의 활기를 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다. 이곳에서는 드라마의 명장면을 떠올리며 특별한 순간을 기록할 수 있습니다. 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 드라마 촬영 후 여유로운 시간을 보내기에도 좋은 장소입니다.', 'The Christian Korean Baptist Convention Building is one of the main filming locations for the drama Dr Cha Jungsook a place where you can feel the vitality of the city with modern design Here you can record a special moment by recalling the famous scenes of the drama There are various cafes and shops around so it is a good place to spend a leisurely time after filming a drama'),
	(828, '닥터 차정숙', '젠틀몬스터 롯데면세점 명동본점', '서울 중구 남대문로 81 10층 면세점 을지로입구역7번출구 바로앞', '젠틀몬스터 롯데면세점 명동본점은 세련된 디자인과 다양한 제품으로 유명한 쇼핑 명소입니다 이곳은 드라마 닥터 차정숙의 촬영지로 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지닙니다 쇼핑을 즐기며 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 기회를 놓치지 마세요 특히 인기 있는 액세서리를 직접 착용해보며 나만의 스타일을 찾아보는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다', '#쇼핑 #드라마촬영지 #명동 #패션 #젠틀몬스터 #닥터차정숙', '쇼핑몰/백화점', 'Gentle Monster Lotte Duty Free Shop Myeongdong Headquarters', 'Dr. Cha Jung-sook', 'Right in front of Exit 7 of Euljiro Entrance Station, duty-free shop on the 10th floor of Namdaemun-ro 81, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'shopping mall/department store', '#Shopping #DramaFilmingPlace #Myeongdong #Fashion #GentleMonster #Dr.ChaSook', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bDlKaS/btsaESDXmvE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALJC0P-_qXtNZV2r7076IGjYt0jFFkwcb5kKwKrLekWn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wJmBT5u3NgOpN5A6gMBIDpJ1NIo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Ka3uF/btsakeBGSbH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPQRC_Xb4u5AHPG19NjtrpT7UQjdytHaijO28XOYHDO5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=h7YYZjnMotSo4EDbd%2FecyVf5hec%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/8E21X/btsaw5Raw75/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANogjT0SuSw-sYxh_DM60kgQduUQ75fnHc6CXL4Fqmqs/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=n0CG%2FUqdZd%2FU0Q647Iyo6konz%2BU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/KGsyJ/btsajeIZ8Uj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGTltN1D_l6O1V5CIE_2finin-4zmbNWhNt8-9YctVuZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eLf3L1N84x%2B5De1QjhD9PEetOZI%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bDlKaS/btsaESDXmvE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALJC0P-_qXtNZV2r7076IGjYt0jFFkwcb5kKwKrLekWn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wJmBT5u3NgOpN5A6gMBIDpJ1NIo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Ka3uF/btsakeBGSbH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPQRC_Xb4u5AHPG19NjtrpT7UQjdytHaijO28XOYHDO5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=h7YYZjnMotSo4EDbd%2FecyVf5hec%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/8E21X/btsaw5Raw75/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANogjT0SuSw-sYxh_DM60kgQduUQ75fnHc6CXL4Fqmqs/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=n0CG%2FUqdZd%2FU0Q647Iyo6konz%2BU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/KGsyJ/btsajeIZ8Uj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGTltN1D_l6O1V5CIE_2finin-4zmbNWhNt8-9YctVuZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=eLf3L1N84x%2B5De1QjhD9PEetOZI%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bDlKaS/btsaESDXmvE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALJC0P-_qXtNZV2r7076IGjYt0jFFkwcb5kKwKrLekWn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wJmBT5u3NgOpN5A6gMBIDpJ1NIo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Ka3uF/btsakeBGSbH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPQRC_Xb4u5AHPG19NjtrpT7UQjdytHaijO28XOYHDO5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=h7YYZjnMotSo4EDbd%2FecyVf5hec%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/8E21X/btsaw5Raw75/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANogjT0SuSw-sYxh_DM60kgQduUQ75fnHc6CXL4Fqmqs/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=n0CG%2FUqdZd%2FU0Q647Iyo6konz%2BU%3D', 37.5645473, 126.9816625, '### 쇼핑몰 정보\n- **제목**: 닥터 차정숙\n- **촬영지**: 젠틀몬스터 롯데면세점 명동본점\n- **방문팁**: 다양한 패션 아이템을 즐길 수 있는 곳으로, 드라마의 명장면을 떠올리며 쇼핑해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Mall\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 쇼핑몰\n\n### 여행 포인트\n젠틀몬스터 롯데면세점 명동본점은 세련된 디자인과 다양한 제품으로 유명한 쇼핑 명소입니다. 이곳은 드라마 "닥터 차정숙"의 촬영지로, 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지닙니다. 쇼핑을 즐기며 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 기회를 놓치지 마세요. 특히, 인기 있는 액세서리를 직접 착용해보며 나만의 스타일을 찾아보는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다.', 'The Myeongdong branch of Gentlemans Lotte Duty Free is a shopping attraction famous for its sophisticated design and various products It is the filming location of the drama Dr Cha Jungsook which has a special meaning for fans Dont miss the opportunity to enjoy shopping and feel the sensibility of the drama In particular it will be a good experience to try on popular accessories yourself and find your own style'),
	(829, '닥터 차정숙', '에뚜아르', '서울 강남구 논현로 176 2층 매봉역4번출구 도보7분', '에뚜아르는 드라마 닥터 차정숙의 촬영지로 현대적인 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로 많은 이들에게 사랑받는 카페입니다 이곳에서는 다양한 음료와 함께 편안한 시간을 보낼 수 있으며 친구들과의 소중한 추억을 만들기에 안성맞춤입니다 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 특별한 순간을 만끽해보세요', '#닥터차정숙 #카페 #서울 #친구 #세련된분위기 #추억', '카페/레스토랑', 'Etoir', 'Dr. Cha Jung-sook', '7 minutes walk from Exit 4 of Maebong Station on the 2nd floor of 1762, Nonhyeon-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Dr. Cha Jung-sook #Cafe #Seoul #Friend #SophisticatedAttention #Memories', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bkS64c/btshA4yHXGu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH9nEYWVuWBownfbOzTT9BvC5ZaxdT6hfwUpcrXMeB9k/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=g9c9CYbkjM%2FDYQWPa9hy6lOhsgg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bI4o8n/btshE1OMsIr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOKzEdhjKejFgCqkZ64v6QflEeulZaMY4Bgx46P1F3GV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vVn2K7TCsS7zjI%2BzFeBeO5OVnBc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/UQNUH/btshAZxi5aL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACP46Ak-D6lExV1llHSb49MaXokkwDco4ukoKWuFTyxF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kXyPCaddGrDnrRJLfL6qr1XbvAs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/CPVzr/btshAuRO2yM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAuWbZMUiFymFfjorbDq0FqFOW08ctFyiXE9TACzVrJB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=cz78%2F3sBTICJsm4r4yTTFaNc8dM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bkS64c/btshA4yHXGu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH9nEYWVuWBownfbOzTT9BvC5ZaxdT6hfwUpcrXMeB9k/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=g9c9CYbkjM%2FDYQWPa9hy6lOhsgg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bI4o8n/btshE1OMsIr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOKzEdhjKejFgCqkZ64v6QflEeulZaMY4Bgx46P1F3GV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vVn2K7TCsS7zjI%