create a special moment like a scene in a drama visit here It is the best place to spend time comfortably with friends or alone'),
	(910, '가슴이 뛴다', '알베르', '서울 강남구 강남대로102길 34 신논현역6번출구 도보6분', '알베르는 드라마 가슴이 뛴다의 주요 촬영지로 아늑한 분위기와 세련된 인테리어가 매력적인 카페입니다 이곳은 드라마 속 주인공들이 감정을 나누는 장면이 촬영된 장소로 방문객들은 드라마의 감동을 직접 느낄 수 있습니다 창가 자리에서 자연광을 받으며 여유로운 시간을 보내고 맛있는 커피 한 잔과 함께 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올려보세요', '#KdramaTrip #커피 #촬영지 #강남 #드라마감성', '카페/레스토랑', 'Albert', 'My heart is beating fast.', '6 minutes walk from Exit 6 of Sinnonhyeon Station, 34, Gangnam-daero 102-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#KdramaTrip #Coffee #FilmingPlace #Gangnam #DramaSensitivity', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Zbdc6/btslxKcuPys/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMNWABFdvOx9YeM4j6oMGGREX0yg0Vd-kmXyypU5XJFt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rDxHWAQf9IATCE0DE1Vwqyjh8Ew%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cyNtff/btslErCoXDa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABm85Xr0YUf1WP4JlJyfDgWQg6FzdZT8Z01MkVoOw7z2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MrwU0CZwiINGsiC2NOz2ErxuUW0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bTvPdo/btslCvla79R/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOl7wNrFgmtjYAwy21vlhoAGxJA7sLU1hwwK-lV1QaJY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TqxtlLhlDpY%2BNNFu2tnyg7uNZxE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bpixpy/btslCvla8hh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOMIv1NYIWGEXTgP92_AYWgp-a4bdLsq52ZCq0lJdr5K/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5izzOYDvRQ4UAdf%2B3z24BpsqXFo%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Zbdc6/btslxKcuPys/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMNWABFdvOx9YeM4j6oMGGREX0yg0Vd-kmXyypU5XJFt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rDxHWAQf9IATCE0DE1Vwqyjh8Ew%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cyNtff/btslErCoXDa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABm85Xr0YUf1WP4JlJyfDgWQg6FzdZT8Z01MkVoOw7z2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MrwU0CZwiINGsiC2NOz2ErxuUW0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bTvPdo/btslCvla79R/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOl7wNrFgmtjYAwy21vlhoAGxJA7sLU1hwwK-lV1QaJY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TqxtlLhlDpY%2BNNFu2tnyg7uNZxE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bpixpy/btslCvla8hh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOMIv1NYIWGEXTgP92_AYWgp-a4bdLsq52ZCq0lJdr5K/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5izzOYDvRQ4UAdf%2B3z24BpsqXFo%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Zbdc6/btslxKcuPys/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMNWABFdvOx9YeM4j6oMGGREX0yg0Vd-kmXyypU5XJFt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rDxHWAQf9IATCE0DE1Vwqyjh8Ew%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cyNtff/btslErCoXDa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABm85Xr0YUf1WP4JlJyfDgWQg6FzdZT8Z01MkVoOw7z2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=MrwU0CZwiINGsiC2NOz2ErxuUW0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bTvPdo/btslCvla79R/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOl7wNrFgmtjYAwy21vlhoAGxJA7sLU1hwwK-lV1QaJY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=TqxtlLhlDpY%2BNNFu2tnyg7uNZxE%3D', 37.5030677, 127.0280792, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 가슴이 뛴다  \n**촬영지:** 알베르  \n**방문팁:** 이곳에서 커피 한 잔과 함께 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n알베르는 드라마 "가슴이 뛴다"의 주요 촬영지로, 아늑한 분위기와 세련된 인테리어가 매력적인 카페입니다. 이곳은 드라마 속 주인공들이 감정을 나누는 장면이 촬영된 장소로, 방문객들은 드라마의 감동을 직접 느낄 수 있습니다. 창가 자리에서 자연광을 받으며 여유로운 시간을 보내고, 맛있는 커피 한 잔과 함께 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올려보세요.', 'Albert is the main filming location for the drama My Heart Beats and it is an attractive cafe with a cozy atmosphere and sophisticated interior This is the place where the main characters in the drama share their emotions and visitors can feel the emotions of the drama firsthand Spend a relaxing time in the natural light at the window seat and think of a scene from the drama with a nice cup of coffee'),
	(911, '가슴이 뛴다', '분데스 언주', '서울 강남구 봉은사로 151 언주역1번출구 도보3분', '분데스 언주는 현대적인 건축물로 드라마 가슴이 뛴다의 배경으로 등장합니다 이곳은 독특한 디자인과 주변 경관이 어우러져 있어 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 방문 경험을 제공합니다 주변에는 카페와 상점들이 있어 촬영지 탐방 후 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다', '#촬영지 #드라마명소 #분데스언주 #현대건축 #서울여행', '건물', 'Bundeswehr', 'My heart is beating fast.', '3-minute walk from Exit 1 of Eonju Station, 151 Bongeunsa-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Building', '#Filming location #dramaattractions #Bundesseonju #modern architecture #Seoultravel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cCwEbL/btsmuqhXZNi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAITvFQk3oZeFK_MYGivIVTV2oOpP81PIyvbyYKHpjKJq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X0gWUNA2jTK%2Fe77QutBiJzaziQs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bHNVdU/btsmrDCZCwa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL-7gB4booLjOsqLCHPJOGpljSHokVTVIJ2SOrRMGdd5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bk43NHQU%2FmNLALXPlEOX7%2BRHwts%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/q4IDg/btsmrWCaAhc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA1LfO01s4ZcWgZHPVp_P1f8AKRg7_jFv-avgktjMb-w/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JwIkPCBAIIXnInO9i9sOlxZrjKY%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cCwEbL/btsmuqhXZNi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAITvFQk3oZeFK_MYGivIVTV2oOpP81PIyvbyYKHpjKJq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X0gWUNA2jTK%2Fe77QutBiJzaziQs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bHNVdU/btsmrDCZCwa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL-7gB4booLjOsqLCHPJOGpljSHokVTVIJ2SOrRMGdd5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bk43NHQU%2FmNLALXPlEOX7%2BRHwts%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/q4IDg/btsmrWCaAhc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA1LfO01s4ZcWgZHPVp_P1f8AKRg7_jFv-avgktjMb-w/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JwIkPCBAIIXnInO9i9sOlxZrjKY%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cCwEbL/btsmuqhXZNi/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAITvFQk3oZeFK_MYGivIVTV2oOpP81PIyvbyYKHpjKJq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X0gWUNA2jTK%2Fe77QutBiJzaziQs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bHNVdU/btsmrDCZCwa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL-7gB4booLjOsqLCHPJOGpljSHokVTVIJ2SOrRMGdd5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bk43NHQU%2FmNLALXPlEOX7%2BRHwts%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/q4IDg/btsmrWCaAhc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA1LfO01s4ZcWgZHPVp_P1f8AKRg7_jFv-avgktjMb-w/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JwIkPCBAIIXnInO9i9sOlxZrjKY%3D', 37.5068073, 127.0311544, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 가슴이 뛴다\n- **촬영지:** 분데스 언주\n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 사진을 찍어보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\n분데스 언주는 현대적인 건축물로, 드라마 "가슴이 뛴다"의 배경으로 등장합니다. 이곳은 독특한 디자인과 주변 경관이 어우러져 있어, 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 방문 경험을 제공합니다. 주변에는 카페와 상점들이 있어, 촬영지 탐방 후 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다.', 'The Bundesweon is a contemporary architecture that appears as the setting for the drama Heartbeats This place has a unique design and a combination of surrounding scenery providing a special visiting experience for drama fans There are cafes and shops nearby so its the best place to spend your time leisurely after visiting the filming location'),
	(912, '가슴이 뛴다', '라까사로사', '서울 강남구 선릉로 545 선정릉역4번출구 도보5분', '라까사로사는 드라마 가슴이 뛴다의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로 많은 방문객을 끌어모으는 카페입니다 이곳은 커피와 디저트가 일품이며 친구들과의 대화나 혼자만의 시간을 보내기에 적합한 공간입니다 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있을 것입니다', '#카페 #서울 #드라마촬영지 #가슴이뛴다 #디저트 #커피', '카페/레스토랑', 'Lakasarosa (Lakasarosa)', 'My heart is beating fast.', '5 minutes walk from Exit 4 of Seonneung Station, 545 Seonneung-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Cafe #Seoul #DramaShoot #My heart is racing #Dessert #Coffee', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/CBpyc/btsn7x8Ni5C/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOIITwzThI4WnjArBeXLCYgVQU7n55EVSSygo-dGoJkv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=p5eGNZXa8C6flV2Nmputwd9BfH4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/buv4md/btsn6Opu0HL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGUp3hPLvJmG5-nGFEWldagjuqUcKWi-7jsO9i8BwkSu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oo7pohSsqZ4J%2F7wPSg9Z%2BRy50uY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wLjUL/btsoQsFJ7j6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALoho30VpVDifQOTYIUzF8zoHDDcclr1pnSKhqUUll3I/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pheOp3mRWPVp3pD5nO12GZvPhzc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/TssfZ/btsoCjJWy3H/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOdTp1NNkxJxMY32DUzkzX0fmB1r9hTEsDFGSnerEpsE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=q%2Bq2jPMJokGSeQK32KoYIaTS1ek%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/CBpyc/btsn7x8Ni5C/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOIITwzThI4WnjArBeXLCYgVQU7n55EVSSygo-dGoJkv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=p5eGNZXa8C6flV2Nmputwd9BfH4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/buv4md/btsn6Opu0HL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGUp3hPLvJmG5-nGFEWldagjuqUcKWi-7jsO9i8BwkSu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oo7pohSsqZ4J%2F7wPSg9Z%2BRy50uY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wLjUL/btsoQsFJ7j6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALoho30VpVDifQOTYIUzF8zoHDDcclr1pnSKhqUUll3I/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pheOp3mRWPVp3pD5nO12GZvPhzc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/TssfZ/btsoCjJWy3H/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOdTp1NNkxJxMY32DUzkzX0fmB1r9hTEsDFGSnerEpsE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=q%2Bq2jPMJokGSeQK32KoYIaTS1ek%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/CBpyc/btsn7x8Ni5C/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOIITwzThI4WnjArBeXLCYgVQU7n55EVSSygo-dGoJkv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=p5eGNZXa8C6flV2Nmputwd9BfH4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/buv4md/btsn6Opu0HL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGUp3hPLvJmG5-nGFEWldagjuqUcKWi-7jsO9i8BwkSu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oo7pohSsqZ4J%2F7wPSg9Z%2BRy50uY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wLjUL/btsoQsFJ7j6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALoho30VpVDifQOTYIUzF8zoHDDcclr1pnSKhqUUll3I/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pheOp3mRWPVp3pD5nO12GZvPhzc%3D', 37.5074777, 127.0459468, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 가슴이 뛴다  \n**촬영지:** 라까사로사  \n**방문팁:** 아늑한 분위기에서 커피와 디저트를 즐기며 드라마의 한 장면을 느껴보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n라까사로사는 드라마 "가슴이 뛴다"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로 많은 방문객을 끌어모으는 카페입니다. 이곳은 커피와 디저트가 일품이며, 친구들과의 대화나 혼자만의 시간을 보내기에 적합한 공간입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있을 것입니다.', 'Lacasarosa is the filming location of the drama My Heart Beats and it is a cafe that attracts many visitors with its sophisticated interior and cozy atmosphere Coffee and dessert are excellent here and its a perfect place to talk with friends or spend time alone If you are a drama fan you will be able to make special memories here'),
	(913, '가슴이 뛴다', '와인나라 사브서울', '서울 강남구 논현로175길 6 압구정역4번출구 도보1분', '와인나라 사브서울은 드라마 가슴이 뛴다의 촬영지로 아늑하고 세련된 분위기를 자랑합니다 이곳은 다양한 와인과 함께 맛있는 음식을 즐길 수 있어 친구나 연인과 함께 방문하기에 적합합니다 인테리어는 현대적이면서도 따뜻한 느낌을 주며 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 특별한 순간을 만끽할 수 있습니다', '#와인 #카페 #데이트 #가슴이뛴다 #서울여행 #감성', '카페/레스토랑', 'Sav Seoul, wine country', 'My heart is beating fast.', '1 minute walk from Apgujeong Station Exit 4, Nonhyeon-ro 175-gil 6, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Wine #Café #Date #My heart is racing #Traveling to Seoul #Emotional', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5bOlt/btsn7xnobhR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACfVzwdQUPzX4-bRK920OncE9TRBoJ33OF8la-NMCpE2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PBILLWZJ%2FCv6CWJwhjNlUK%2BUikg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ORAif/btsn27ph46O/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM1VjJLN8ZW7T4H0pJHOXrtojTTTPdVr5n_iVZ2zk5LZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JjZgxMQrLarkDlXo0Wshsn%2F61ks%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b0qJkg/btsn8qVz2Oo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAONL8wnp611D5zdt0Gfclg28d_M7R78pG4XlbNURlhIh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Qf1QC3jB0E5AIcMG7nswqbWwDxI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uIelU/btsn7u5jfPC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJfpi7H8M1bnCcy5xG3P9H-cmZoCVS5P6AE7OCpo9FNl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X4MJfGwtnSqCUrFfjCwX1KMCV%2Fk%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5bOlt/btsn7xnobhR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACfVzwdQUPzX4-bRK920OncE9TRBoJ33OF8la-NMCpE2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PBILLWZJ%2FCv6CWJwhjNlUK%2BUikg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ORAif/btsn27ph46O/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM1VjJLN8ZW7T4H0pJHOXrtojTTTPdVr5n_iVZ2zk5LZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JjZgxMQrLarkDlXo0Wshsn%2F61ks%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b0qJkg/btsn8qVz2Oo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAONL8wnp611D5zdt0Gfclg28d_M7R78pG4XlbNURlhIh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Qf1QC3jB0E5AIcMG7nswqbWwDxI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uIelU/btsn7u5jfPC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJfpi7H8M1bnCcy5xG3P9H-cmZoCVS5P6AE7OCpo9FNl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=X4MJfGwtnSqCUrFfjCwX1KMCV%2Fk%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/5bOlt/btsn7xnobhR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACfVzwdQUPzX4-bRK920OncE9TRBoJ33OF8la-NMCpE2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PBILLWZJ%2FCv6CWJwhjNlUK%2BUikg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ORAif/btsn27ph46O/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM1VjJLN8ZW7T4H0pJHOXrtojTTTPdVr5n_iVZ2zk5LZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JjZgxMQrLarkDlXo0Wshsn%2F61ks%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b0qJkg/btsn8qVz2Oo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAONL8wnp611D5zdt0Gfclg28d_M7R78pG4XlbNURlhIh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Qf1QC3jB0E5AIcMG7nswqbWwDxI%3D', 37.5263156, 127.0277602, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n**가슴이 뛴다, 와인나라 사브서울**  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n**방문팁:** 드라마 속 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n와인나라 사브서울은 드라마 "가슴이 뛴다"의 촬영지로, 아늑하고 세련된 분위기를 자랑합니다. 이곳은 다양한 와인과 함께 맛있는 음식을 즐길 수 있어, 친구나 연인과 함께 방문하기에 적합합니다. 인테리어는 현대적이면서도 따뜻한 느낌을 주며, 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 특별한 순간을 만끽할 수 있습니다.', 'Wine Nara Sab Seoul is the filming location for the drama Heartbeats boasting a cozy and sophisticated atmosphere This place is perfect for visiting with friends or lovers as you can enjoy delicious food with a variety of wines The interior is modern and warm and you can enjoy a special moment while feeling the sensibility of the drama'),
	(914, '가슴이 뛴다', '0914 도산 플래그십', '서울 강남구 도산대로45길 15 압구정로데오역5번출구 도보12분', '0914 도산 플래그십은 현대적인 디자인과 세련된 분위기로 드라마 가슴이 뛴다의 주요 촬영지 중 하나입니다 이곳은 매력적인 패션 아이템과 함께 다양한 예술적 요소를 경험할 수 있는 공간으로 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 장소입니다 또한 쇼핑과 카페를 즐길 수 있어 방문객들에게 다양한 즐길 거리를 제공합니다', '#드라마촬영지 #패션 #예술적공간 #서울여행 #감동적인순간', '기타/판별불가', '0914 Bankruptcy Flagship', 'My heart is beating fast.', '12 minutes walk from Exit 5 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 15 Dosan-daero 45-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Drama filming location #fashion #artisticspace #Seoultravel #touched moment', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pZ3AQ/btsn1I2GMFy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANwnXR0zpJrcL2ZXscQCmgwHLFzeaI3X1UaPyjqmajzb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zS7OEsDGgP%2BRb%2BwOsb08M4gN8aM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Lny4O/btsnYYTihh6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGvr7J5-5GlHwh-sT80hzi32jHn9_Ee6zZqjcrVcCL2l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uHsNGfL%2BXCL9noybK%2Bl26RqBnpM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Ypb7s/btsnZJ2iHU8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAq2M5fsd9ybrDbytycDvw-LktDJkWMRWplTbhrTuCsb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=L9Th2QOw2fcad%2FuDOR7PIWpa%2B9Y%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pZ3AQ/btsn1I2GMFy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANwnXR0zpJrcL2ZXscQCmgwHLFzeaI3X1UaPyjqmajzb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zS7OEsDGgP%2BRb%2BwOsb08M4gN8aM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Lny4O/btsnYYTihh6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGvr7J5-5GlHwh-sT80hzi32jHn9_Ee6zZqjcrVcCL2l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uHsNGfL%2BXCL9noybK%2Bl26RqBnpM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Ypb7s/btsnZJ2iHU8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAq2M5fsd9ybrDbytycDvw-LktDJkWMRWplTbhrTuCsb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=L9Th2QOw2fcad%2FuDOR7PIWpa%2B9Y%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pZ3AQ/btsn1I2GMFy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANwnXR0zpJrcL2ZXscQCmgwHLFzeaI3X1UaPyjqmajzb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zS7OEsDGgP%2BRb%2BwOsb08M4gN8aM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Lny4O/btsnYYTihh6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGvr7J5-5GlHwh-sT80hzi32jHn9_Ee6zZqjcrVcCL2l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uHsNGfL%2BXCL9noybK%2Bl26RqBnpM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Ypb7s/btsnZJ2iHU8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAq2M5fsd9ybrDbytycDvw-LktDJkWMRWplTbhrTuCsb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=L9Th2QOw2fcad%2FuDOR7PIWpa%2B9Y%3D', 37.52323130000001, 127.0351261, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 가슴이 뛴다\n- **촬영지**: 0914 도산 플래그십\n- **방문팁**: 이곳에서 드라마의 감동적인 순간들을 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n0914 도산 플래그십은 현대적인 디자인과 세련된 분위기로, 드라마 "가슴이 뛴다"의 주요 촬영지 중 하나입니다. 이곳은 매력적인 패션 아이템과 함께 다양한 예술적 요소를 경험할 수 있는 공간으로, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 장소입니다. 또한, 쇼핑과 카페를 즐길 수 있어 방문객들에게 다양한 즐길 거리를 제공합니다.', 'The 0914 Dosan flagship is one of the main filming locations for the drama My Heart Beats with its modern design and sophisticated atmosphere This is a place where you can experience various artistic elements along with attractive fashion items and it is a place where drama fans can leave special memories In addition you can enjoy shopping and cafes providing visitors with a variety of things to enjoy'),
	(915, '가슴이 뛴다', '바 다빈치', '서울 송파구 올림픽로32길 11 잠실역10번출구 도보8분', '바 다빈치는 드라마 가슴이 뛴다의 촬영지로 아름다운 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 장소입니다 이곳은 드라마의 감정적인 장면들을 떠올리게 하며 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 공간입니다 드라마의 팬이라면 이곳에서 촬영된 장면을 상상하며 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것도 좋습니다', '#드라마촬영지, #카페, #감성, #서울, #기념사진', '기타', 'Ba da Vinci', 'My heart is beating fast.', '8 minutes walk from Exit 10 of Jamsil Station, 32-gil 11 Olympic-ro, Songpa-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Drama filming location, #Cafe, #Sentimental, #Seoul, #MemorialPhotos', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pxN0z/btspmf7u5YC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMFU4dwjmysu6Kw32rxk0CP1_9Gh03cUxRF8COMYLMG9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QATiWSHPBug28BHZyuV6vOSZi%2B0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/MN2vS/btspCmYrt6C/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALC6nbYZ5xllHPuLodvV48wYbX31MzFC2A4lgQhJTnF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Yrmbv5lG8PW27jgEl62bV2841Zs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cmSXMy/btspCmRDghE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFDDzbyk1YJ2D1HxTV94_gFNaSGFFH8ybxSX4kznOZHF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3FfK0G3QRySigVGxTZLz697Keag%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pxN0z/btspmf7u5YC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMFU4dwjmysu6Kw32rxk0CP1_9Gh03cUxRF8COMYLMG9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QATiWSHPBug28BHZyuV6vOSZi%2B0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/MN2vS/btspCmYrt6C/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALC6nbYZ5xllHPuLodvV48wYbX31MzFC2A4lgQhJTnF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Yrmbv5lG8PW27jgEl62bV2841Zs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cmSXMy/btspCmRDghE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFDDzbyk1YJ2D1HxTV94_gFNaSGFFH8ybxSX4kznOZHF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3FfK0G3QRySigVGxTZLz697Keag%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pxN0z/btspmf7u5YC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMFU4dwjmysu6Kw32rxk0CP1_9Gh03cUxRF8COMYLMG9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QATiWSHPBug28BHZyuV6vOSZi%2B0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/MN2vS/btspCmYrt6C/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALC6nbYZ5xllHPuLodvV48wYbX31MzFC2A4lgQhJTnF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Yrmbv5lG8PW27jgEl62bV2841Zs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cmSXMy/btspCmRDghE/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFDDzbyk1YJ2D1HxTV94_gFNaSGFFH8ybxSX4kznOZHF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3FfK0G3QRySigVGxTZLz697Keag%3D', 37.5150946, 127.1092253, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 가슴이 뛴다\n- **촬영지:** 바 다빈치\n- **방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마의 감동적인 순간을 재현해 보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n바 다빈치는 드라마 "가슴이 뛴다"의 촬영지로, 아름다운 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 장소입니다. 이곳은 드라마의 감정적인 장면들을 떠올리게 하며, 팬들에게는 특별한 추억을 남길 수 있는 공간입니다. 드라마의 팬이라면 이곳에서 촬영된 장면을 상상하며 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것도 좋습니다.', 'Ba da Vinci is the filming location for the drama Heartbeats and it is an attractive place with beautiful interiors and cozy atmosphere This is a place where you can remember the emotional scenes of the drama and leave special memories for fans If youre a fan of dramas its also good to spend your free time imagining the scenes filmed here'),
