with beautiful scenery around you'),
	(923, '이 연애는 불가항력', '세븐일레븐 종로부암점', '서울 종로구 창의문로 147 경복궁역3번출구 버스15분', '세븐일레븐 종로부암점은 드라마 이 연애는 불가항력의 주요 촬영지로 밤의 분위기를 한껏 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다 이곳에서 드라마의 한 장면처럼 여유로운 시간을 보내며 간편하게 음료나 간식을 즐길 수 있습니다 주변의 아늑한 카페와 함께 방문하면 더욱 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있습니다', '#촬영지, #세븐일레븐, #밤, #감성, #여유로운시간', '기타/판별불가', '7-Eleven Jongno Buam Branch', 'This relationship is irresistible', 'Bus 15 minutes from Exit 3 of Gyeongbokgung Station, 147 Changchangmun-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Filming location, #SevenEleven, #Night, #Sentimental, #RelaxingTime', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lbusk/btsrZxSpxT8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG9kUPdrECZ2rJAGfIpQbt3ffheR5PTah60xKkS2oRGp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=94aLPsqHHqmgLVtXkC%2FAb8Kw3xs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cCDSes/btsrZBHbzEk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAykIf21DWdnwzDzdh922zwfeGBRp2YLSEFDxY3aW5n4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hZQhYkZV9nYpItV90u%2BoKdbDnMQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/esSl06/btsr4YIohgs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOhzYwdP7LTnnAK2BKYzX2o91qYHZyg5KH0Sm2olDRLw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XAckxEjSOZYpRoPmXUgzQeLIJ7o%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lbusk/btsrZxSpxT8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG9kUPdrECZ2rJAGfIpQbt3ffheR5PTah60xKkS2oRGp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=94aLPsqHHqmgLVtXkC%2FAb8Kw3xs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cCDSes/btsrZBHbzEk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAykIf21DWdnwzDzdh922zwfeGBRp2YLSEFDxY3aW5n4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hZQhYkZV9nYpItV90u%2BoKdbDnMQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/esSl06/btsr4YIohgs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOhzYwdP7LTnnAK2BKYzX2o91qYHZyg5KH0Sm2olDRLw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XAckxEjSOZYpRoPmXUgzQeLIJ7o%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lbusk/btsrZxSpxT8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG9kUPdrECZ2rJAGfIpQbt3ffheR5PTah60xKkS2oRGp/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=94aLPsqHHqmgLVtXkC%2FAb8Kw3xs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cCDSes/btsrZBHbzEk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAykIf21DWdnwzDzdh922zwfeGBRp2YLSEFDxY3aW5n4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hZQhYkZV9nYpItV90u%2BoKdbDnMQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/esSl06/btsr4YIohgs/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOhzYwdP7LTnnAK2BKYzX2o91qYHZyg5KH0Sm2olDRLw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XAckxEjSOZYpRoPmXUgzQeLIJ7o%3D', 37.5928007, 126.9637738, '### 이 연애는 불가항력\n**촬영지:** 세븐일레븐 종로부암점  \n**방문팁:** 이곳에서 드라마 속 감성을 직접 느껴보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 기타  \n\n#### 여행 포인트\n세븐일레븐 종로부암점은 드라마 "이 연애는 불가항력"의 주요 촬영지로, 밤의 분위기를 한껏 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다. 이곳에서 드라마의 한 장면처럼 여유로운 시간을 보내며, 간편하게 음료나 간식을 즐길 수 있습니다. 주변의 아늑한 카페와 함께 방문하면 더욱 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있습니다.', '7Elevens Jongno Buam branch is the main filming location for the drama This Love Is Forceful and it is a place where you can feel the atmosphere of the night to the fullest You can have a relaxing time here like a scene in a drama and enjoy drinks or snacks easily If you visit with a cozy cafe nearby you can make more special memories'),
