	(1105, '새벽 2시의 신데렐라', '공공재커피클럽', '서울 종로구 윤보선길 35 안국역1번출구 도보4분', '공공재커피클럽은 드라마 새벽 2시의 신데렐라의 촬영지로 로맨틱한 분위기를 자아내는 아늑한 카페입니다 이곳에서는 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있으며 다양한 메뉴와 함께 편안한 분위기를 즐길 수 있습니다 친구나 연인과 함께 방문하면 더욱 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있는 장소입니다', '#카페 #로맨틱 #데이트 #신데렐라 #서울 #여유로운시간', '카페/레스토랑', 'Public goods coffee club', 'Cinderella at 2 a.m', '4-minute walk from Exit 1 of Anguk Station, 35, Yunboseon-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Cafe #Romantic #Date #Cinderella #Seoul #RelaxedTime', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/coQX8I/btsJfmyp7KS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPHnHfkoF3p1VMOtDOf6uunjUC6IRjMSGMqiXmjn2UDg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a3hXYzFVFCEOvs40k9Gx9kaCrf8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/9ioE1/btsJfa5ZHD8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALqLdWoOC01KBEFDQQkgNf4-fUoM0IHNqSCY_TSrxTbo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Bp8KGvKzydgUQZYFDMPOlvr%2BKT8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/yq17j/btsJeq2xG2f/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA-SggDbHY4QpcNjqRFNFGH2btkcS8v5U6hH_v6pK2PS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BzlrAIBcYGJCZUslHYn3pcl%2BSsM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/coQX8I/btsJfmyp7KS/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPHnHfkoF3p1VMOtDOf6uunjUC6IRjMSGMqiXmjn2UDg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a3hXYzFVFCEOvs40k9Gx9kaCrf8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/9ioE1/btsJfa5ZHD8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALqLdWoOC01KBEFDQQkgNf4-fUoM0IHNqSCY_TSrxTbo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Bp8KGvKzydgUQZYFDMPOlvr%2BKT8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/yq17j/btsJeq2xG2f/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA-SggDbHY4QpcNjqRFNFGH2btkcS8v5U6hH_v6pK2PS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BzlrAIBcYGJCZUsl