z2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yPdMyuhLLA1mbJa4necjqlw8ju8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bjtCed/btsJHPHdWUg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACDZpujK77C7HthuiTM4CDL5CEm2UYTT-yHv-RAH_R-E/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=s2JAjM5Q9rO4iKtouK9yinf50aY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bQe5FB/btsJHyy3gpu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPHpatXm_HTpjLQSbwtoD6qnO2xWUXZj1w7y1pWe9uHu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PwXowv1z85oYATR%2FXDTfmqEoGRU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c0niXq/btsJDiiZ64K/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPQ2Q9R2BWYsMD3bcI8C_bu4tCIOw9CNk-Yj6eHFlC5Q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OcMWk%2BZmW8%2FjVd%2BJzSypKbtXCqU%3D', 37.5138825, 127.1064002, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 새벽 2시의 신데렐라  \n**촬영지:** 소피텔 앰배서더 서울 라티튜드32  \n**방문팁:** 고급스러운 분위기에서 특별한 시간을 즐길 수 있는 장소입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n소피텔 앰배서더 서울 라티튜드32는 현대적이고 세련된 인테리어로 유명하며, 다양한 음료와 디저트를 제공합니다. 드라마 "새벽 2시의 신데렐라"의 촬영지로, 팬들에게는 특별한 의미가 있는 곳입니다. 이곳에서 멋진 경치를 감상하며 여유로운 시간을 보내는 것은 여행의 좋은 추억이 될 것입니다.', 'Sofitel Ambassador Seoul Latitude 32 is famous for its modern and sophisticated interior offering a wide range of drinks and desserts It is the filming location for the drama Cinderella at 2 am which means a lot to fans Spending a relaxing time here while enjoying the wonderful scenery will be a good memory of the trip'),
	(1113, '우연일까', '서강대교', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 83-1', '서강대교는 서울의 아름다운 경관을 감상할 수 있는 명소로 드라마 우연일까의 촬영지로도 유명합니다 이곳에서는 한강의 시원한 바람과 함께 드라마 속 장면들을 떠올리며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 특히 일몰 시간에는 더욱 환상적인 풍경을 감상할 수 있으니 방문 시 참고하시기 바랍니다', '#한강 #서강대교 #우연일까 #드라마촬영지 #멋진경치 #여유로운시간', '교통/역/터미널', 'Sogang Bridge', 'Is it a coincidence', '83-1 Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'traffic/station/terminal', '#Han River #Seogangdaegyo Bridge #Was it a coincidence #DramaShoot #Great scenery #Relaxed time', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bHHQ5I/btsISeNCXmG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJL5pzUSZXWl2BztPCYWzW9J9_MsZqqwC6vLiLkiGfKN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=O06TCQ6NzqF0w%2FVmAr3zhOOyG9g%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/czZzEn/btsIR1OoDVy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPHaQMO9cGK-ugIAKk0DtZ2ku-Ku2hDCcdVGxzqEzu68/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5tPUdXoh6InFz3R0rIRtijIOrU8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bHHQ5I/btsISeNCXmG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJL5pzUSZXWl2BztPCYWzW9J9_MsZqqwC6vLiLkiGfKN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=O06TCQ6NzqF0w%2FVmAr3zhOOyG9g%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/czZzEn/btsIR1OoDVy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPHaQMO9cGK-ugIAKk0DtZ2ku-Ku2hDCcdVGxzqEzu68/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5tPUdXoh6InFz3R0rIRtijIOrU8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bHHQ5I/btsISeNCXmG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJL5pzUSZXWl2BztPCYWzW9J9_MsZqqwC6vLiLkiGfKN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=O06TCQ6NzqF0w%2FVmAr3zhOOyG9g%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/czZzEn/btsIR1OoDVy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPHaQMO9cGK-ugIAKk0DtZ2ku-Ku2hDCcdVGxzqEzu68/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5tPUdXoh6InFz3R0rIRtijIOrU8%3D', NULL, 37.5358539, 126.9247942, '### 교통/역 정보\n- **촬영지**: 서강대교, 서울 영등포구 여의도동 83-1\n- **드라마 제목**: 우연일까\n- **방문 팁**: 서강대교에서의 멋진 경치를 즐기며 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Transit\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 교통/역\n\n### 여행 포인트\n서강대교는 서울의 아름다운 경관을 감상할 수 있는 명소로, 드라마 "우연일까"의 촬영지로도 유명합니다. 이곳에서는 한강의 시원한 바람과 함께 드라마 속 장면들을 떠올리며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 특히, 일몰 시간에는 더욱 환상적인 풍경을 감상할 수 있으니, 방문 시 참고하시기 바랍니다.', 'Sogang Bridge is a famous spot where you can enjoy beautiful scenery of Seoul and is also famous as the filming location for the drama Is It a Coincidence Here you can spend a relaxing time reminding you of the scenes in the drama with the cool breeze of the Han River In particular you can enjoy a more fantastic view at sunset so please refer to it when visiting'),
	(1114, '우연일까', '알베르', '서울 강남구 강남대로102길 34 신논현역6번출구 도보5분', '우연일까의 촬영지는 드라마의 매력을 더해주는 특별한 공간입니다 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 드라마의 주인공들이 걸었던 길을 따라 걷는 것은 색다른 경험이 될 것입니다 주변의 카페나 상점에서 휴식을 취하며 드라마의 한 장면처럼 느껴보세요', '#우연일까, #촬영지, #강남, #드라마투어, #알베르', '기타', 'Albert', 'Is it a coincidence', '5-minute walk from Exit 6 of Sinnonhyeon Station, 34, Gangnam-daero 102-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Is it a coincidence? #FilmingPlace, #Gangnam, #DramaTour, #Albert', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/boDG0F/btsIIl8BbTF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL-n5M2DEhsuerEzbEmxsUBEd_TtPH0QePEybqUITwfS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Xh18sE6qGlnERxS1pKi56xS9b%2F0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nJjOe/btsIJHpj2PW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADGdZ9yDPwtACkRMyJY_hgOCj-fY6ZQiL0zWW-fgxf4E/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=aKsTOESpg%2FR2Jt36aNZ5a1NfflQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cUILZd/btsIHV99sIt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIql0NUDH5Fsoff1sA_zH5L1EB-o-UCr9YQzTYmnPNpC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=P%2FWltk%2BV8HPp36YWPQZvvvEWP%2BA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/2Vu4P/btsIIYZoDIM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB6AYIiKSMnsn1PJZdNrEB6oPprhAohC-e3waJH3BKQi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uQ%2BX1fV1a5E4AAmOIEpIHSa2a8A%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/boDG0F/btsIIl8BbTF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL-n5M2DEhsuerEzbEmxsUBEd_TtPH0QePEybqUITwfS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Xh18sE6qGlnERxS1pKi56xS9b%2F0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nJjOe/btsIJHpj2PW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADGdZ9yDPwtACkRMyJY_hgOCj-fY6ZQiL0zWW-fgxf4E/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=aKsTOESpg%2FR2Jt36aNZ5a1NfflQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cUILZd/btsIHV99sIt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIql0NUDH5Fsoff1sA_zH5L1EB-o-UCr9YQzTYmnPNpC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=P%2FWltk%2BV8HPp36YWPQZvvvEWP%2BA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/2Vu4P/btsIIYZoDIM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB6AYIiKSMnsn1PJZdNrEB6oPprhAohC-e3waJH3BKQi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=uQ%2BX1fV1a5E4AAmOIEpIHSa2a8A%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/boDG0F/btsIIl8BbTF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL-n5M2DEhsuerEzbEmxsUBEd_TtPH0QePEybqUITwfS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Xh18sE6qGlnERxS1pKi56xS9b%2F0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nJjOe/btsIJHpj2PW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADGdZ9yDPwtACkRMyJY_hgOCj-fY6ZQiL0zWW-fgxf4E/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=aKsTOESpg%2FR2Jt36aNZ5a1NfflQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cUILZd/btsIHV99sIt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIql0NUDH5Fsoff1sA_zH5L1EB-o-UCr9YQzTYmnPNpC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=P%2FWltk%2BV8HPp36YWPQZvvvEWP%2BA%3D', 37.5030677, 127.0280792, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 우연일까\n- **촬영지**: 알베르\n- **방문팁**: 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 촬영지를 탐방해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n"우연일까"의 촬영지는 드라마의 매력을 더해주는 특별한 공간입니다. 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며, 드라마의 주인공들이 걸었던 길을 따라 걷는 것은 색다른 경험이 될 것입니다. 주변의 카페나 상점에서 휴식을 취하며, 드라마의 한 장면처럼 느껴보세요.', 'The filming location of Is It a Coincidence is a special space that adds to the dramas charm It will be a different experience to walk along the path that the main characters of the drama walked recalling the scenes filmed here Relax at nearby cafes or shops and feel like a scene from a drama'),
	(1115, '킥킥킥킥', '서강대교', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 83-1', '서강대교는 서울의 아름다운 경관을 감상할 수 있는 명소로 특히 해질 무렵의 풍경이 인상적입니다 이곳은 드라마 촬영지로도 유명하여 팬들이 방문하여 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 추억을 되새길 수 있는 장소입니다 주변에는 산책로와 자전거 도로가 잘 마련되어 있어 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 적합합니다 또한 한강의 시원한 바람을 느끼며 도심의 매력을 만끽할 수 있는 곳입니다', '#서울야경 #드라마촬영 #한강 #여유로운산책 #서강대교 #킥킥킥킥', '기타/판별불가', 'Sogang Bridge', '(Laughing)', '83-1 Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Seoul Nightscape #DramaShooting #Han River #RelaxedWalk #Seogangdaegyo Bridge #LOL', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LGQNb/btsMBTmULKd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANxGH_NEp7-I6MGDKTi3bFa81dbqzB_ZiBZqo3ZW-dsm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zyQamOiuNRI1GcJLnB11NAkO774%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LGQNb/btsMBTmULKd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANxGH_NEp7-I6MGDKTi3bFa81dbqzB_ZiBZqo3ZW-dsm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zyQamOiuNRI1GcJLnB11NAkO774%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LGQNb/btsMBTmULKd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANxGH_NEp7-I6MGDKTi3bFa81dbqzB_ZiBZqo3ZW-dsm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zyQamOiuNRI1GcJLnB11NAkO774%3D', NULL, NULL, 37.5358539, 126.9247942, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 킥킥킥킥\n- **촬영지:** 서강대교\n- **방문팁:** 서강대교에서 서울의 멋진 야경을 감상해보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\n서강대교는 서울의 아름다운 경관을 감상할 수 있는 명소로, 특히 해질 무렵의 풍경이 인상적입니다. 이곳은 드라마 촬영지로도 유명하여, 팬들이 방문하여 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 추억을 되새길 수 있는 장소입니다. 주변에는 산책로와 자전거 도로가 잘 마련되어 있어 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 적합합니다. 또한, 한강의 시원한 바람을 느끼며 도심의 매력을 만끽할 수 있는 곳입니다.', 'Sogang Bridge is a famous place where you can enjoy the beautiful scenery of Seoul especially at sunset It is also famous as a filming location for dramas so it is a place where fans can visit and reminisce about the scenes filmed There are wellequipped trails and bicycle paths around making it suitable for leisurely time Also it is a place where you can enjoy the charm of the city center while feeling the cool wind of the Han River'),
	(1116, '킥킥킥킥', '의사당대로', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 4-6', '의사당대로는 현대적 건물과 푸른 나무들이 어우러져 있어 도심 속에서 여유로운 산책을 즐기기에 최적의 장소입니다 다양한 카페와 레스토랑도 인근에 있어 드라마 촬영지 탐방 후 휴식을 취하기에도 좋습니다 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다', '#도심풍경 #촬영지 #블루스카이 #산책 #카페', '거리/골목/광장', 'on Capitol Hill', '(Laughing)', '4-6 Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Cityscape #FilmingPlace #BlueSky #Walk #Café', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/u3ROM/btsMgjy9QU0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGQbqvOdFeHI2AVRqubrf_IdUsPzHFOLQMxGY92tNX_q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1EQf2XG8tf7eyHDUKcsB1YcPvfk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bW9H4i/btsMf517Siu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAElV0BlczXtw70XWoQXxcXlACUjKGYRalgqOq5MAjxDA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UYP%2BacX6gB7IpKAfcmEH%2BWyzUD8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/u3ROM/btsMgjy9QU0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGQbqvOdFeHI2AVRqubrf_IdUsPzHFOLQMxGY92tNX_q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1EQf2XG8tf7eyHDUKcsB1YcPvfk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bW9H4i/btsMf517Siu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAElV0BlczXtw70XWoQXxcXlACUjKGYRalgqOq5MAjxDA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UYP%2BacX6gB7IpKAfcmEH%2BWyzUD8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/u3ROM/btsMgjy9QU0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGQbqvOdFeHI2AVRqubrf_IdUsPzHFOLQMxGY92tNX_q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1EQf2XG8tf7eyHDUKcsB1YcPvfk%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bW9H4i/btsMf517Siu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAElV0BlczXtw70XWoQXxcXlACUjKGYRalgqOq5MAjxDA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=UYP%2BacX6gB7IpKAfcmEH%2BWyzUD8%3D', NULL, 37.5182916, 126.9274736, '### 거리/골목 촬영지: 의사당대로\n\n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 주요 촬영지로, 멋진 도심 풍경을 감상할 수 있습니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 의사당대로는 현대적 건물과 푸른 나무들이 어우러져 있어 도심 속에서 여유로운 산책을 즐기기에 최적의 장소입니다. 다양한 카페와 레스토랑도 인근에 있어 드라마 촬영지 탐방 후 휴식을 취하기에도 좋습니다. 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다. \n\n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene', 'The Capitol Boulevard is a great place to enjoy a leisurely walk in the city center with modern buildings and green trees Various cafes and restaurants are also nearby so it is good to relax after visiting the drama filming location If you are a drama fan you can have a special experience by recalling the scenes filmed here'),
	(1117, '대행사', '역전포장마차 홍대점', '서울 마포구 양화로 183 지하1층 홍대입구역3번출구 바로앞', '역전포장마차 홍대점은 독특한 분위기와 다양한 메뉴로 많은 사랑을 받고 있는 장소입니다 드라마 대행사의 촬영지로 유명하며 아늑한 인테리어와 맛있는 음식이 매력적입니다 친구들과 함께 소중한 추억을 만들기에 좋은 장소로 특히 저녁 시간에 방문하면 더욱 활기찬 분위기를 느낄 수 있습니다', '#대행사, #역전포장마차, #홍대, #맛집, #야경, #친구', '카페/레스토랑', 'The Hongik University branch of the station cart', 'an agency', 'Right in front of Exit 3 of Hongik University Station, B1F, 183 Yanghwa-ro, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#agency, #reversewagons, #redae, #restaurant, #nightscape, #friend', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/XI7bj/btrZK0mYv2J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJGFtKWY3hxDmdgyN7VTmJFIWX-BEc7VEpJTPZuxtILk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QD2di3HT0F%2BXBsqOe7d0P28TyDI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bL8rVD/btrZYSHOp5V/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALgffo_2mxri5OiKqUXlvuyINtIKbJ10p3xrA8VzKBuy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KwdSNkfGTE5o%2FFx8FsWnBW0yZyU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/DOApv/btrZV8xfV1n/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEhu1gcDzxr2NiAbWOVhyO9SOk1OHksX2fF7D14qyKd5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=V3MsStmAczV%2FfMtpn%2Bmm1dsFgQA%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/XI7bj/btrZK0mYv2J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJGFtKWY3hxDmdgyN7VTmJFIWX-BEc7VEpJTPZuxtILk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QD2di3HT0F%2BXBsqOe7d0P28TyDI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bL8rVD/btrZYSHOp5V/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALgffo_2mxri5OiKqUXlvuyINtIKbJ10p3xrA8VzKBuy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KwdSNkfGTE5o%2FFx8FsWnBW0yZyU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/DOApv/btrZV8xfV1n/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEhu1gcDzxr2NiAbWOVhyO9SOk1OHksX2fF7D14qyKd5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=V3MsStmAczV%2FfMtpn%2Bmm1dsFgQA%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/XI7bj/btrZK0mYv2J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJGFtKWY3hxDmdgyN7VTmJFIWX-BEc7VEpJTPZuxtILk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QD2di3HT0F%2BXBsqOe7d0P28TyDI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bL8rVD/btrZYSHOp5V/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALgffo_2mxri5OiKqUXlvuyINtIKbJ10p3xrA8VzKBuy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=KwdSNkfGTE5o%2FFx8FsWnBW0yZyU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/DOApv/btrZV8xfV1n/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEhu1gcDzxr2NiAbWOVhyO9SOk1OHksX2fF7D14qyKd5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=V3MsStmAczV%2FfMtpn%2Bmm1dsFgQA%3D', 37.5583965, 126.9251195, '### 대행사, 역전포장마차 홍대점\n\n**방문팁:** 다양한 메뉴가 있어 여러 가지를 시도해보는 것이 좋습니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 역전포장마차 홍대점은 독특한 분위기와 다양한 메뉴로 많은 사랑을 받고 있는 장소입니다. 드라마 \'대행사\'의 촬영지로 유명하며, 아늑한 인테리어와 맛있는 음식이 매력적입니다. 친구들과 함께 소중한 추억을 만들기에 좋은 장소로, 특히 저녁 시간에 방문하면 더욱 활기찬 분위기를 느낄 수 있습니다.', 'The Hongik University branch of the Yeokdae Pancha is a place that is loved by many people for its unique atmosphere and various menus It is famous as a filming location for the drama Agency and its cozy interior and delicious food are attractive It is a great place to make precious memories with friends especially when you visit in the evening you can feel a more lively atmosphere'),
	(1118, '대행사', '나인프릭호텔 카페', '서울 마포구 홍익로5길 32 홍대입구역9번출구 도보6분', '나인프릭호텔 카페는 드라마 대행사의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 장소입니다 넓은 창을 통해 들어오는 자연광과 함께 다양한 식음료를 즐기며 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 만끽할 수 있습니다 친구나 연인과 함께 방문하여 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요', '#대행사 #카페 #서울여행 #드라마촬영지 #여유로운시간 #아늑한분위기', '카페/레스토랑', 'Nine Frick Hotel Cafe', 'an agency', 'Hongik-ro 5-gil 32, Mapo-gu, Seoul, 6 minutes on foot from Exit 9 of Hongdae Entrance Station', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Agency #Cafe #SeoulTravel #DramaFilmingPlace #RelaxedTime #A cozy atmosphere', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bgolkl/btrZYSBfIVg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANo8O85ADeyR9AeR0WJoIXh1XM2AlDia6mdMuVqkaj4j/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=z834QyUlTjD9Y53loWsOIv5UyYM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bvF5T5/btrZNKjQScd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK1wKrahfPfbwRVWI9iexWDMQ_u-LausvyU7nOSe4_6F/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=U6rdcj%2FlV8nPJhP%2BuG7tQb8tzW0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dh4XDU/btrZNuVNG1J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMqP7uTj3kzAlpQBDtAERCZZQMvEXH8mZqPFKbroaEEb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Pc7JjFtHHkW%2B%2BFN7Pvgl6mr%2BfhU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bgolkl/btrZYSBfIVg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANo8O85ADeyR9AeR0WJoIXh1XM2AlDia6mdMuVqkaj4j/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=z834QyUlTjD9Y53loWsOIv5UyYM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bvF5T5/btrZNKjQScd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK1wKrahfPfbwRVWI9iexWDMQ_u-LausvyU7nOSe4_6F/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=U6rdcj%2FlV8nPJhP%2BuG7tQb8tzW0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dh4XDU/btrZNuVNG1J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMqP7uTj3kzAlpQBDtAERCZZQMvEXH8mZqPFKbroaEEb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Pc7JjFtHHkW%2B%2BFN7Pvgl6mr%2BfhU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bgolkl/btrZYSBfIVg/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANo8O85ADeyR9AeR0WJoIXh1XM2AlDia6mdMuVqkaj4j/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=z834QyUlTjD9Y53loWsOIv5UyYM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bvF5T5/btrZNKjQScd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAK1wKrahfPfbwRVWI9iexWDMQ_u-LausvyU7nOSe4_6F/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=U6rdcj%2FlV8nPJhP%2BuG7tQb8tzW0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dh4XDU/btrZNuVNG1J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMqP7uTj3kzAlpQBDtAERCZZQMvEXH8mZqPFKbroaEEb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Pc7JjFtHHkW%2B%2BFN7Pvgl6mr%2BfhU%3D', 37.5537834, 126.9205693, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n- **대행사**: 나인프릭호텔 카페\n- **방문팁**: 이곳에서 촬영된 드라마의 분위기를 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보내보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n나인프릭호텔 카페는 드라마 "대행사"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 장소입니다. 넓은 창을 통해 들어오는 자연광과 함께 다양한 식음료를 즐기며, 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 만끽할 수 있습니다. 친구나 연인과 함께 방문하여 특별한 추억을 만들어보세요.', 'The Nine Frick Hotel Cafe is the filming location for the drama The Agency and it is an attractive place with sophisticated interior and cozy atmosphere You can enjoy a variety of food and beverages with the natural light coming through the wide window and you can enjoy the feeling of becoming the main character in the drama Visit with your friends or lovers and make special memories'),
	(1119, '대행사', '미원빌딩', '서울 영등포구 국제금융로 70 여의도역5번출구 도보13분', '미원빌딩은 드라마 대행사의 촬영지로 서울의 아름다운 스카이라인을 배경으로 한 멋진 장면들이 펼쳐지는 곳입니다 이곳에서 방문객들은 드라마 속 주인공들이 서 있던 지점에서 서울의 경치를 감상할 수 있으며 주변의 현대적인 건축물들과 함께 도시의 매력을 느낄 수 있습니다 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보길 추천합니다', '#드라마촬영지, #도시전경, #미원빌딩, #서울명소, #K드라마팬', '건물', 'Miwon Building', 'an agency', '13-minute walk from Exit 5 of Yeouido Station, 70 International Financial Road, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'Building', '#Drama filming location, #cityscape, #Miwon Building, #SeoulAttractions, #K-dramafans', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bgWbuv/btr0HS9nc7l/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGQv0KmtJ2FMzHGA-Vz7e2ZNo17pLVML3ULE5RBr-1hk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8gLt8a1B26beoJ31JwBOzIGPP3M%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bdCtiE/btr0GJ6c5lC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOXS9vZnccqPpg41uQw-xofqW42hUVHpqfroG7ls1W2_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zpQ%2FsAWVXVPIYo%2BenhvEfP3IYtM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bft9Dd/btr0NJpZI7N/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABkeUy2_zgjM94JvPjd2YvTDK-UaOGslXhktbKTKtPSe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zC1SYSX0aBM8ExghvVMZQSAI%2BtU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cdGWfG/btr0NI5KJR4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACpvXAZbSdKUIu9RAy37_cC2Q2AAXlXy7DfDEBnv15Hy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Elnbel0YTxynZi71PWZXnXfDeEQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bYtQBy/btr0H7S3kNO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANfHYZ5f1dNO7nrnzLohlPWiP6X1R2QC0tksLQqecWoV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DwUnBv6p9WiMzx9HxYPnnolOOdk%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bgWbuv/btr0HS9nc7l/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGQv0KmtJ2FMzHGA-Vz7e2ZNo17pLVML3ULE5RBr-1hk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8gLt8a1B26beoJ31JwBOzIGPP3M%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bdCtiE/btr0GJ6c5lC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOXS9vZnccqPpg41uQw-xofqW42hUVHpqfroG7ls1W2_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zpQ%2FsAWVXVPIYo%2BenhvEfP3IYtM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bft9Dd/btr0NJpZI7N/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABkeUy2_zgjM94JvPjd2YvTDK-UaOGslXhktbKTKtPSe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zC1SYSX0aBM8ExghvVMZQSAI%2BtU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cdGWfG/btr0NI5KJR4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACpvXAZbSdKUIu9RAy37_cC2Q2AAXlXy7DfDEBnv15Hy/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Elnbel0YTxynZi71PWZXnXfDeEQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bYtQBy/btr0H7S3kNO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANfHYZ5f1dNO7nrnzLohlPWiP6X1R2QC0tksLQqecWoV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DwUnBv6p9WiMzx9HxYPnnolOOdk%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bgWbuv/btr0HS9nc7l/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGQv0KmtJ2FMzHGA-Vz7e2ZNo17pLVML3ULE5RBr-1hk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8gLt8a1B26beoJ31JwBOzIGPP3M%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bdCtiE/btr0GJ6c5lC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOXS9vZnccqPpg41uQw-xofqW42hUVHpqfroG7ls1W2_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zpQ%2FsAWVXVPIYo%2BenhvEfP3IYtM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bft9Dd/btr0NJpZI7N/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABkeUy2_zgjM94JvPjd2YvTDK-UaOGslXhktbKTKtPSe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zC1SYSX0aBM8ExghvVMZQSAI%2BtU%3D', 37.5214292, 126.9306415, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 대행사\n- **촬영지**: 미원빌딩\n- **방문팁**: 멋진 도시 전경을 감상하며 드라마의 명장면을 떠올려보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\n미원빌딩은 드라마 "대행사"의 촬영지로, 서울의 아름다운 스카이라인을 배경으로 한 멋진 장면들이 펼쳐지는 곳입니다. 이곳에서 방문객들은 드라마 속 주인공들이 서 있던 지점에서 서울의 경치를 감상할 수 있으며, 주변의 현대적인 건축물들과 함께 도시의 매력을 느낄 수 있습니다. 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보길 추천합니다.', 'Miwon Building is the filming location of the drama The Agency where wonderful scenes take place against the backdrop of Seouls beautiful skyline Here visitors can enjoy the scenery of Seoul from the point where the main characters in the drama stood and feel the charm of the city along with the modern architecture around them If you are a drama fan I recommend you to visit'),
	(1120, '대행사', '청운공원', '서울 종로구 자하문로35길 21 경복궁역3번출구 버스15분', '청운공원은 서울의 숨겨진 보석으로 드라마 대행사의 촬영지로 많은 팬들에게 사랑받고 있습니다 이곳은 도심 속에서 자연을 만끽할 수 있는 공간으로 특히 밤에 조명이 켜진 풍경은 매우 로맨틱합니다 공원 내 다양한 산책로와 벤치에서 편안한 시간을 보내며 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요', '#대행사 #촬영지 #청운공원 #로맨틱 #서울 #드라마투어', '공원', 'Cheongun Park', 'an agency', 'Bus 15 minutes from Exit 3 of Gyeongbokgung Station, 21, Jahamun-ro 35-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Park', '#Agency #FilmingPlace #CheongwoonPark #Romantic #Seoul #DramaTour', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qe2DH/btrZ2yPOwT1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANicJ1iJRQZBfY6sapuu2s1jzS52hfnYFuJMtRJwGIDK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iTSbXTReUy3F%2FHN9cKUMF%2FcO29Y%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/OzhgB/btrZUCecq4V/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAENy0UqZU4Ry7s-C3LkHWWEFzucs1HDw3T4-DKlsTvJe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Bn%2FCbuQEuLg2mfntttRYHzHvekE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bo7IlK/btrZSS2wBRG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANNH-1ml06MR08SlDO48LtUR6vp9wiFsNdFax_PYtKQ0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jLUxeXBTz6D6IenDfdtKyZtcFNw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dvALCF/btrZNLiymGl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP5MTsXq4Q_VFZjSKm3tnbiTICl9rDVfR4klk6yi6G94/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AMiPMksS8wzRIvrHkIJIqBHjeS0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qe2DH/btrZ2yPOwT1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANicJ1iJRQZBfY6sapuu2s1jzS52hfnYFuJMtRJwGIDK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iTSbXTReUy3F%2FHN9cKUMF%2FcO29Y%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/OzhgB/btrZUCecq4V/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAENy0UqZU4Ry7s-C3LkHWWEFzucs1HDw3T4-DKlsTvJe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Bn%2FCbuQEuLg2mfntttRYHzHvekE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bo7IlK/btrZSS2wBRG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANNH-1ml06MR08SlDO48LtUR6vp9wiFsNdFax_PYtKQ0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jLUxeXBTz6D6IenDfdtKyZtcFNw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dvALCF/btrZNLiymGl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP5MTsXq4Q_VFZjSKm3tnbiTICl9rDVfR4klk6yi6G94/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AMiPMksS8wzRIvrHkIJIqBHjeS0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/qe2DH/btrZ2yPOwT1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANicJ1iJRQZBfY6sapuu2s1jzS52hfnYFuJMtRJwGIDK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iTSbXTReUy3F%2FHN9cKUMF%2FcO29Y%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/OzhgB/btrZUCecq4V/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAENy0UqZU4Ry7s-C3LkHWWEFzucs1HDw3T4-DKlsTvJe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Bn%2FCbuQEuLg2mfntttRYHzHvekE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bo7IlK/btrZSS2wBRG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANNH-1ml06MR08SlDO48LtUR6vp9wiFsNdFax_PYtKQ0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jLUxeXBTz6D6IenDfdtKyZtcFNw%3D', 37.5884211, 126.966463, '### 공원 정보\n- **제목:** 대행사\n- **촬영지:** 청운공원\n- **방문팁:** 청운공원은 아름다운 경치와 함께 드라마 촬영지로 유명하니, 사진 촬영을 잊지 마세요!\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Park\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 공원\n\n### 여행 포인트\n청운공원은 서울의 숨겨진 보석으로, 드라마 "대행사"의 촬영지로 많은 팬들에게 사랑받고 있습니다. 이곳은 도심 속에서 자연을 만끽할 수 있는 공간으로, 특히 밤에 조명이 켜진 풍경은 매우 로맨틱합니다. 공원 내 다양한 산책로와 벤치에서 편안한 시간을 보내며, 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.', 'Cheongwoon Park is a hidden gem of Seoul and is loved by many fans as the filming location for the drama The Agency This is a place where you can enjoy nature in the city center especially the illuminated scenery at night is very romantic Spend comfortable time on various trails and benches in the park and feel the sensibility of the drama'),
	(1121, '대행사', '청와대앞', '서울 종로구 세종로 1-7 경복궁역5번출구 도보15분', '청와대앞은 드라마 대행사의 촬영지로 유명한 공원입니다 이곳은 특히 가을철에 아름다운 단풍으로 유명하며 산책로를 따라 펼쳐진 나무들과 잘 가꿔진 정원이 매력적입니다 조용한 분위기 속에서 여유롭게 산책하거나 사진 촬영을 즐기기 좋은 장소로 드라마 팬들은 물론 모든 방문객에게 추천할 만한 곳입니다', '#대행사 #촬영지 #청와대앞 #산책 #가을 #정원', '공원', 'in front of the Blue House', 'an agency', '15-minute walk from Exit 5 of Gyeongbokgung Station 1-7 Sejong-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Park', '#Agency #FilmingPlace #In front of Cheong Wa Dae #Walk #Autumn #Garden', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vuwON/btrZSSA2HW2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADh2Ru6yRjLIxETGWFqnvVjpRBul55VNDZJ30NfKgmvr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hQjhTYAM7EzSgj0sci3PbKyQdI8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/diSThA/btrZPTNSstL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB-giR9wvQ4Wkd-TCOxkTaI9M_CiLf47m81c_Ehew8ii/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=G9qNjg1TNV4JL%2BBZ%2FJZXukpelnQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cmZ0wB/btrZLVeeFth/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOMEsmlPMPVeLPcL5ouhgrq3FQnn478FCwZ7LQkjQAzI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6lO8B%2FOJX2ZEUnl%2FCCDoi63CFis%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vuwON/btrZSSA2HW2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADh2Ru6yRjLIxETGWFqnvVjpRBul55VNDZJ30NfKgmvr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hQjhTYAM7EzSgj0sci3PbKyQdI8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/diSThA/btrZPTNSstL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB-giR9wvQ4Wkd-TCOxkTaI9M_CiLf47m81c_Ehew8ii/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=G9qNjg1TNV4JL%2BBZ%2FJZXukpelnQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cmZ0wB/btrZLVeeFth/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOMEsmlPMPVeLPcL5ouhgrq3FQnn478FCwZ7LQkjQAzI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6lO8B%2FOJX2ZEUnl%2FCCDoi63CFis%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/vuwON/btrZSSA2HW2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADh2Ru6yRjLIxETGWFqnvVjpRBul55VNDZJ30NfKgmvr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hQjhTYAM7EzSgj0sci3PbKyQdI8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/diSThA/btrZPTNSstL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB-giR9wvQ4Wkd-TCOxkTaI9M_CiLf47m81c_Ehew8ii/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=G9qNjg1TNV4JL%2BBZ%2FJZXukpelnQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cmZ0wB/btrZLVeeFth/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOMEsmlPMPVeLPcL5ouhgrq3FQnn478FCwZ7LQkjQAzI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6lO8B%2FOJX2ZEUnl%2FCCDoi63CFis%3D', 37.5836629, 126.9748249, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 대행사\n- **촬영지:** 청와대앞\n- **방문팁:** 아름다운 자연 경관을 즐기며 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Park\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 공원\n\n### 여행 포인트\n청와대앞은 드라마 "대행사"의 촬영지로 유명한 공원입니다. 이곳은 특히 가을철에 아름다운 단풍으로 유명하며, 산책로를 따라 펼쳐진 나무들과 잘 가꿔진 정원이 매력적입니다. 조용한 분위기 속에서 여유롭게 산책하거나 사진 촬영을 즐기기 좋은 장소로, 드라마 팬들은 물론 모든 방문객에게 추천할 만한 곳입니다.', 'Cheong Wa Dae is a famous park for filming the drama The Agency This place is especially famous for its beautiful autumn leaves in the fall season and its trees along the trail and wellgroomed gardens are attractive It is a good place to enjoy a leisurely walk or take photos in a quiet atmosphere and it is recommended for all visitors as well as drama fans'),
	(1122, '대행사', '디라이프스타일키친 광화문점', '서울 중구 세종대로 136 광화문역5번출구 도보6분', '디라이프스타일키친 광화문점은 현대적인 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로 드라마 대행사의 촬영지로 유명합니다 이곳은 식사와 함께 멋진 경치를 즐길 수 있어 친구나 연인과의 특별한 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤입니다 다양한 메뉴와 함께 세련된 카페 분위기를 만끽하며 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 순간을 만들어보세요', '#KdramaTrip, #데이트, #카페, #세련된분위기, #특별한식사', '카페/레스토랑', 'D-Life Style Kitchen Gwanghwamun Branch', 'an agency', '6-minute walk from Exit 5 of Gwanghwamun Station, 136 Sejong-daero, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#KdramaTrip, #Date, #Café, #StyleAtmosphere, #SpecialMeals', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bpHOy7/btrZISvVnh1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADPO9aL74wLC67MZY4t2aVncEjrgaghinCsfwiW9whxT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JNzs2Q%2B0GVK3hsCh2UQxufZK8tI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/VJbeB/btrZJV6HrO5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABBDnvhR70XPtwFz9sPSQrgCz9MjOZ37dsU_BQ4WHF-t/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=We%2Bfe28X3FElINLLHsToPNExgUI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dkO77m/btrZJDk0TYA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHA8IM0-50q1nn8UmOrqZ0zrMpXZqav2XWuvZWaxEd0N/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Wn05gQqfzlBdljO9wmzUegzWvPU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bpHOy7/btrZISvVnh1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADPO9aL74wLC67MZY4t2aVncEjrgaghinCsfwiW9whxT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JNzs2Q%2B0GVK3hsCh2UQxufZK8tI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/VJbeB/btrZJV6HrO5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABBDnvhR70XPtwFz9sPSQrgCz9MjOZ37dsU_BQ4WHF-t/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=We%2Bfe28X3FElINLLHsToPNExgUI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dkO77m/btrZJDk0TYA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHA8IM0-50q1nn8UmOrqZ0zrMpXZqav2XWuvZWaxEd0N/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Wn05gQqfzlBdljO9wmzUegzWvPU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bpHOy7/btrZISvVnh1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADPO9aL74wLC67MZY4t2aVncEjrgaghinCsfwiW9whxT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JNzs2Q%2B0GVK3hsCh2UQxufZK8tI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/VJbeB/btrZJV6HrO5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABBDnvhR70XPtwFz9sPSQrgCz9MjOZ37dsU_BQ4WHF-t/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=We%2Bfe28X3FElINLLHsToPNExgUI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dkO77m/btrZJDk0TYA/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHA8IM0-50q1nn8UmOrqZ0zrMpXZqav2XWuvZWaxEd0N/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Wn05gQqfzlBdljO9wmzUegzWvPU%3D', 37.5684273, 126.9777398, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n- **대행사, 디라이프스타일키친 광화문점**\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 대행사\n- **촬영지:** 디라이프스타일키친 광화문점\n- **방문팁:** 세련된 분위기에서 특별한 식사를 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.\n\n### 여행 포인트\n디라이프스타일키친 광화문점은 현대적인 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로, 드라마 "대행사"의 촬영지로 유명합니다. 이곳은 식사와 함께 멋진 경치를 즐길 수 있어, 친구나 연인과의 특별한 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤입니다. 다양한 메뉴와 함께 세련된 카페 분위기를 만끽하며, 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 순간을 만들어보세요.', 'DLife Style Kitchen Gwanghwamun branch is famous for its modern interior and cozy atmosphere as the filming location for the drama The Agency This place is perfect for having a special time with friends or lovers as you can enjoy a wonderful view with your meal Enjoy the sophisticated cafe atmosphere with a variety of menus and create special moments like a scene in a drama'),
	(1123, '대행사', '느티나무설렁탕', '서울 중구 퇴계로71길 38 동대문역사문화공원역2번출구 도보6분', '느티나무설렁탕은 드라마 대행사의 촬영지로 독특한 분위기를 자랑하는 카페입니다 이곳은 자연과 어우러진 외관이 매력적이며 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험을 선사합니다 아늑한 내부에서 맛있는 음식을 즐기며 드라마의 한 장면처럼 느껴질 수 있는 시간을 보내보세요 친구와 함께 방문하기에 좋은 장소입니다', '#대행사 #촬영지 #카페 #레스토랑 #서울 #느티나무설렁탕', '카페/레스토랑', 'Zelkova tree seolleongtang', 'an agency', '6-minute walk from Exit 2 of Dongdaemun History and Culture Park Station, 38, Toegye-ro 71-gil, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Agency #FilmingPlace #Café #Restaurant #Seoul #NutinamuSeolleongtang', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dHPfco/btrZK1Fn7pa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOuSI4zWoE2zKLdRuQwxeXEWufrdiTXZb_KRDWp6jJOI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CdBiieo%2B5qkOrUMHs%2BxPbFgZzgE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/8zvB0/btrZJct8lpm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJKf84f-qA7wQhKJox4WTvaNSwldtPBcGuIu2IwKL2cc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3Azzx5hAKJPncSf5G98320DIYm8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NPaRj/btrZPTT8p9G/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOlsKep8ZSSlGEKx-2hohPby8AecrNg5T7VJqcy-BLJu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EcDOQII7E1VVyeElddoWTcTDPM4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dHPfco/btrZK1Fn7pa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOuSI4zWoE2zKLdRuQwxeXEWufrdiTXZb_KRDWp6jJOI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CdBiieo%2B5qkOrUMHs%2BxPbFgZzgE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/8zvB0/btrZJct8lpm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJKf84f-qA7wQhKJox4WTvaNSwldtPBcGuIu2IwKL2cc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3Azzx5hAKJPncSf5G98320DIYm8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NPaRj/btrZPTT8p9G/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOlsKep8ZSSlGEKx-2hohPby8AecrNg5T7VJqcy-BLJu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EcDOQII7E1VVyeElddoWTcTDPM4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dHPfco/btrZK1Fn7pa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOuSI4zWoE2zKLdRuQwxeXEWufrdiTXZb_KRDWp6jJOI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CdBiieo%2B5qkOrUMHs%2BxPbFgZzgE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/8zvB0/btrZJct8lpm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJKf84f-qA7wQhKJox4WTvaNSwldtPBcGuIu2IwKL2cc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3Azzx5hAKJPncSf5G98320DIYm8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/NPaRj/btrZPTT8p9G/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOlsKep8ZSSlGEKx-2hohPby8AecrNg5T7VJqcy-BLJu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=EcDOQII7E1VVyeElddoWTcTDPM4%3D', 37.5664715, 127.0128881, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**대행사**  \n**촬영지:** 느티나무설렁탕  \n**방문팁:** 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n느티나무설렁탕은 드라마 "대행사"의 촬영지로, 독특한 분위기를 자랑하는 카페입니다. 이곳은 자연과 어우러진 외관이 매력적이며, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험을 선사합니다. 아늑한 내부에서 맛있는 음식을 즐기며, 드라마의 한 장면처럼 느껴질 수 있는 시간을 보내보세요. 친구와 함께 방문하기에 좋은 장소입니다.', 'Zelkova seolleongtang is the filming location of the drama Agency and is a cafe that boasts a unique atmosphere This place has a charming appearance in harmony with nature and provides a special experience for drama fans Enjoy delicious food inside the cozy interior and spend time that can feel like a scene from a drama Its a great place to visit with a friend'),
	(1124, '대행사', 'YWCA연합회', '서울 중구 명동길 73 명동역8번출구 도보7분', 'YWCA연합회는 현대적인 디자인과 세련된 외관으로 주목받는 건물입니다 이곳은 드라마 대행사의 촬영지로 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 의미가 있는 장소입니다 주변에는 다양한 카페와 레스토랑이 있어 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 좋은 기회가 됩니다 특히 저녁 시간에는 조명이 켜진 건물의 모습이 더욱 아름다워 사진 찍기에 최적의 장소입니다', '#대행사 #촬영지 #YWCA연합회 #현대건축 #서울여행 #드라마팬', '건물', 'YWCA Federation', 'an agency', '7-minute walk from Exit 8 of Myeong-dong Station, 73 Myeong-dong-gil, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'Building', '#Agency #FilmingPlace #YWCAFederation #ModernArchitecture #SeoulTravel #DramaFan', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/8zMCt/btrZKoOjI3Y/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADiotDhAkNFpHxuki0-olEHpxY1GVIDvJ35XHscZYBxQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rDkxJefPLgGV7lNcP42pi6qZ1cs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tAFlK/btrZJ3DL4fx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADWCBCMWv0MpffjPvVSUeQRF_e_DmYCdZlcBl2B9qCEG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hJuejwfnI0IihNJTChs%2Fe%2F7qW2U%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b77lY6/btrZJ2SjrgC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAICMCnIC1P9V_cbm-16OFhTjBrSioM82TFqafJFufGfW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=37tE7yuhYPG7AU0mW8GqZcW1rSc%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/8zMCt/btrZKoOjI3Y/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADiotDhAkNFpHxuki0-olEHpxY1GVIDvJ35XHscZYBxQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rDkxJefPLgGV7lNcP42pi6qZ1cs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tAFlK/btrZJ3DL4fx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADWCBCMWv0MpffjPvVSUeQRF_e_DmYCdZlcBl2B9qCEG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hJuejwfnI0IihNJTChs%2Fe%2F7qW2U%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b77lY6/btrZJ2SjrgC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAICMCnIC1P9V_cbm-16OFhTjBrSioM82TFqafJFufGfW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=37tE7yuhYPG7AU0mW8GqZcW1rSc%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/8zMCt/btrZKoOjI3Y/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADiotDhAkNFpHxuki0-olEHpxY1GVIDvJ35XHscZYBxQ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rDkxJefPLgGV7lNcP42pi6qZ1cs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tAFlK/btrZJ3DL4fx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADWCBCMWv0MpffjPvVSUeQRF_e_DmYCdZlcBl2B9qCEG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hJuejwfnI0IihNJTChs%2Fe%2F7qW2U%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b77lY6/btrZJ2SjrgC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAICMCnIC1P9V_cbm-16OFhTjBrSioM82TFqafJFufGfW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=37tE7yuhYPG7AU0mW8GqZcW1rSc%3D', 37.5643815, 126.986213, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 대행사\n- **촬영지**: YWCA연합회\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마 촬영지로, 현대적인 건축미를 감상할 수 있는 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\nYWCA연합회는 현대적인 디자인과 세련된 외관으로 주목받는 건물입니다. 이곳은 드라마 "대행사"의 촬영지로, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 의미가 있는 장소입니다. 주변에는 다양한 카페와 레스토랑이 있어 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 좋은 기회가 됩니다. 특히, 저녁 시간에는 조명이 켜진 건물의 모습이 더욱 아름다워 사진 찍기에 최적의 장소입니다.', 'The YWCA Federation is a building that attracts attention for its modern design and sophisticated appearance This is the filming location of the drama Agency and it is a special place for drama fans There are various cafes and restaurants around so it is a good opportunity to spend time leisurely after visiting the filming location In particular the illuminated building looks more beautiful in the evening making it the best place to take pictures'),
	(1125, '대행사', '엘빈에비뉴', '서울 강남구 강남대로92길 13 강남역12번출구 도보2분', '엘빈에비뉴는 드라마 대행사의 촬영지로 고급스러운 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 곳입니다 다양한 음료와 함께 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 즐길 수 있는 최적의 장소로 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험을 선사합니다 편안한 소파에 앉아 여유롭게 대화하며 드라마 속 장면을 떠올려보는 것도 좋은 추억이 될 것입니다', '#대행사 #엘빈에비뉴 #카페 #서울 #아늑한분위기 #친구들과함께', '카페/레스토랑', 'Elvin Avenue', 'an agency', '2 minutes walk from Exit 12 of Gangnam Station, 13, Gangnam-daero 92-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Agency #ElvinEVign #Cafe #Seoul #CozyAtmosphere #WithFriends', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bLsDY0/btrZJcAPpO0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJT9QxNseAT24w79GCnGZYF-POSLtWHXUEJIBQTKz_CG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=stkE5pNXf1IkgS%2FTHq5vctEksY0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bl8Cgj/btrZLVETaQr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM1zdeh9AeMDtl3dzywC4M4lnGELTdnc8FVPpHOBEFZ6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oOUGxLwq%2Bx11%2B4PGycGlml84IvA%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bLsDY0/btrZJcAPpO0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJT9QxNseAT24w79GCnGZYF-POSLtWHXUEJIBQTKz_CG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=stkE5pNXf1IkgS%2FTHq5vctEksY0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bl8Cgj/btrZLVETaQr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM1zdeh9AeMDtl3dzywC4M4lnGELTdnc8FVPpHOBEFZ6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oOUGxLwq%2Bx11%2B4PGycGlml84IvA%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bLsDY0/btrZJcAPpO0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJT9QxNseAT24w79GCnGZYF-POSLtWHXUEJIBQTKz_CG/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=stkE5pNXf1IkgS%2FTHq5vctEksY0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bl8Cgj/btrZLVETaQr/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM1zdeh9AeMDtl3dzywC4M4lnGELTdnc8FVPpHOBEFZ6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oOUGxLwq%2Bx11%2B4PGycGlml84IvA%3D', NULL, 37.4990416, 127.0285148, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n- **대행사**  \n- **촬영지**: 엘빈에비뉴  \n- **방문팁**: 아늑한 분위기에서 친구들과 함께 좋은 시간을 보내기 좋은 장소입니다.  \n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n- **작가**: 미상  \n- **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트  \n엘빈에비뉴는 드라마 "대행사"의 촬영지로, 고급스러운 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 곳입니다. 다양한 음료와 함께 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 즐길 수 있는 최적의 장소로, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 경험을 선사합니다. 편안한 소파에 앉아 여유롭게 대화하며, 드라마 속 장면을 떠올려보는 것도 좋은 추억이 될 것입니다.', 'Elvin Avenue is the filming location of the drama The Agency and it is a charming place with luxurious interior and cozy atmosphere It is the best place to enjoy precious time with friends along with various drinks providing a special experience for drama fans It will also be a good memory to sit on a comfortable sofa talk leisurely and think of scenes in the drama'),
	(1126, '대행사', '송화유수', '서울 서초구 강남대로79길 21 신논현역1번출구 도보3분', '송화유수는 드라마 대행사의 촬영지로 현대적이고 세련된 인테리어가 돋보이는 카페입니다 이곳에서는 다양한 메뉴를 즐길 수 있으며 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다 친구나 가족과 함께 방문해 편안한 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소입니다', '#KdramaTrip #Cafe #대행사 #서울 #세련된인테리어 #드라마촬영지', '카페/레스토랑', 'Songhwa Oil Water', 'an agency', '3-minute walk from Exit 1 of Sinnonhyeon Station, 21, Gangnam-daero 79-gil, Seocho-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#KdramaTrip #Cafe #Agent #Seoul #SophisticatedInterior #DramaShootingPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/svoMm/btr06XBFA0e/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGEdYVzJSKBZz-uzUwWwIk9FwfQueXzN3xuO0iFF1AO3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BlEAOEcYgiZJ6B04Qvta%2Bn%2FIKRQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/C0Hiu/btr1dmniUOK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALj-DSrote_PXnrXHqlI3u7mIz-hHG5ASSQEXHieHVaY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=L88ucIx62YwMEKMlavjRgX3aLcM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/svoMm/btr06XBFA0e/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGEdYVzJSKBZz-uzUwWwIk9FwfQueXzN3xuO0iFF1AO3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BlEAOEcYgiZJ6B04Qvta%2Bn%2FIKRQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/C0Hiu/btr1dmniUOK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALj-DSrote_PXnrXHqlI3u7mIz-hHG5ASSQEXHieHVaY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=L88ucIx62YwMEKMlavjRgX3aLcM%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/svoMm/btr06XBFA0e/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGEdYVzJSKBZz-uzUwWwIk9FwfQueXzN3xuO0iFF1AO3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2BlEAOEcYgiZJ6B04Qvta%2Bn%2FIKRQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/C0Hiu/btr1dmniUOK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALj-DSrote_PXnrXHqlI3u7mIz-hHG5ASSQEXHieHVaY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=L88ucIx62YwMEKMlavjRgX3aLcM%3D', NULL, 37.504763, 127.0230127, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n- **대행사**: 송화유수\n- **방문팁**: 드라마 촬영지인 이곳에서 특별한 분위기를 즐겨보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n송화유수는 드라마 "대행사"의 촬영지로, 현대적이고 세련된 인테리어가 돋보이는 카페입니다. 이곳에서는 다양한 메뉴를 즐길 수 있으며, 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다. 친구나 가족과 함께 방문해 편안한 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소입니다.', 'Songhwa Yusu is the filming location of the drama Agency and it is a cafe that stands out for its modern and sophisticated interior Here you can enjoy a variety of menus and you can have a special experience by recalling the scenes in the drama Its a perfect place to visit with friends or family and have a comfortable time'),
	(1127, '대행사', '이구펍 4호점', '서울 강남구 강남대로110길 14 신논현역4번출구 도보2분', '이구펍 4호점은 드라마 대행사의 촬영지로 드라마 팬들에게는 잊지 못할 장소입니다 이곳은 아늑한 분위기를 자랑하며 다양한 메뉴를 제공해 친구들과의 모임이나 특별한 날에 적합합니다 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 음식을 즐기고 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요 방문 시에는 인스타그램에 사진을 남기는 것도 잊지 마세요', '#대행사 #촬영지 #이구펍 #강남 #드라마팬 #맛집', '기타/판별불가', 'Igu Pub No. 4', 'an agency', '2-minute walk from Exit 4 of Sinnonhyeon Station, 14, Gangnam-daero 110-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Agency #FilmingPlace #GooPooPoo #Gangnam #DramaFan #Good Restaurant', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wW6YP/btrZIgRvJQT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMhnwRWNLZHD4w5kyrWzkiS6hl6jCJeHkHrBV2WWQRb3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nVMMA%2BRwWkdaZ6Uj87g%2BJJ800Qw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Eoqf2/btrZIGWNrS0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIsGQs4pOdHUFQiIuiP4ePobR2bKXlr2sps6jRSyvxIo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QhAgMyoT6pb%2FgMNVbPZY27VUPAs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bh2OXu/btrZLUMK0aM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABQddwFeLIQl2pi2ztoFfWVJldBT6VYTYriBUxfiPVuM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Jryc8huGzuJhWBEWSwJGeoyxV7c%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wFqyP/btrZK1yBX6D/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHDmi0DPDH_JJJFC3lb8-ISEbWH-WVC_FqdTNzxr3Zai/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Flz1Ln04J%2F21vapRrqvI2scNLvI%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wW6YP/btrZIgRvJQT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMhnwRWNLZHD4w5kyrWzkiS6hl6jCJeHkHrBV2WWQRb3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nVMMA%2BRwWkdaZ6Uj87g%2BJJ800Qw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Eoqf2/btrZIGWNrS0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIsGQs4pOdHUFQiIuiP4ePobR2bKXlr2sps6jRSyvxIo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QhAgMyoT6pb%2FgMNVbPZY27VUPAs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bh2OXu/btrZLUMK0aM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABQddwFeLIQl2pi2ztoFfWVJldBT6VYTYriBUxfiPVuM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Jryc8huGzuJhWBEWSwJGeoyxV7c%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wFqyP/btrZK1yBX6D/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHDmi0DPDH_JJJFC3lb8-ISEbWH-WVC_FqdTNzxr3Zai/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Flz1Ln04J%2F21vapRrqvI2scNLvI%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wW6YP/btrZIgRvJQT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMhnwRWNLZHD4w5kyrWzkiS6hl6jCJeHkHrBV2WWQRb3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nVMMA%2BRwWkdaZ6Uj87g%2BJJ800Qw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Eoqf2/btrZIGWNrS0/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIsGQs4pOdHUFQiIuiP4ePobR2bKXlr2sps6jRSyvxIo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QhAgMyoT6pb%2FgMNVbPZY27VUPAs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bh2OXu/btrZLUMK0aM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABQddwFeLIQl2pi2ztoFfWVJldBT6VYTYriBUxfiPVuM/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Jryc8huGzuJhWBEWSwJGeoyxV7c%3D', 37.5037581, 127.0260654, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 대행사\n- **촬영지:** 이구펍 4호점\n- **방문팁:** 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 시간을 즐겨보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n이구펍 4호점은 드라마 "대행사"의 촬영지로, 드라마 팬들에게는 잊지 못할 장소입니다. 이곳은 아늑한 분위기를 자랑하며, 다양한 메뉴를 제공해 친구들과의 모임이나 특별한 날에 적합합니다. 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 음식을 즐기고, 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요. 방문 시에는 인스타그램에 사진을 남기는 것도 잊지 마세요!', 'The 4th store of Igoo Pub is the filming location of the drama The Agency and is an unforgettable place for drama fans This place boasts a cozy atmosphere and offers a variety of menus making it perfect for gatherings with friends or special days Enjoy the food and feel the sensibility of the drama remembering the scene that was filmed Dont forget to leave a picture on Instagram when you visit'),
	(1128, '대행사', '퀸즈파크 청담', '서울 강남구 압구정로60길 22 압구정로데오역3번출구 도보4분', '퀸즈파크 청담은 드라마 대행사의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 넓은 창문을 통해 자연광이 가득 들어오는 공간입니다 이곳은 커피와 디저트뿐만 아니라 다양한 식사를 즐길 수 있어 친구들과의 만남이나 조용한 독서에도 적합합니다 한적한 분위기 속에서 특별한 순간을 만끽할 수 있는 이 카페는 드라마 팬들에게는 더욱 특별한 장소가 될 것입니다', '#대행사 #드라마촬영지 #카페 #청담 #커피 #디저트', '카페/레스토랑', 'Queen\'s Park Cheongdam', 'an agency', 'Apgujeong Rodeo Station Exit 3 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 22 Apgujeong-ro 60-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul, 4 minutes on foot', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Agency #DramaFilmingPlace #Cafe #Cheongdam #Coffee #Dessert', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cEQaSR/btr01TL28IZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPTdkDFf_FS4yswjBzNsRoOGzcyZVT5EHgqls_D3-rLC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=F0%2FU%2FC1YAtsMGzKVQkftkyWtkTY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c8m9WO/btr0NI5KKWu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACsTfn3z63fmzISMUk5Tn5lIb16hPRYhowX14ZqV97yz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hPPMjrTwcCl0hGUkqyBtzUtkJ%2F4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nMune/btr0VLguDfM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACs_oSZXvscejCwZN7tmxgxogWrq3L9-RGvRYmzxKUnJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=SL1dxV%2BVi0ZBmD6lH%2BQ%2BSwKkTd8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cEQaSR/btr01TL28IZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPTdkDFf_FS4yswjBzNsRoOGzcyZVT5EHgqls_D3-rLC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=F0%2FU%2FC1YAtsMGzKVQkftkyWtkTY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c8m9WO/btr0NI5KKWu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACsTfn3z63fmzISMUk5Tn5lIb16hPRYhowX14ZqV97yz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hPPMjrTwcCl0hGUkqyBtzUtkJ%2F4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nMune/btr0VLguDfM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACs_oSZXvscejCwZN7tmxgxogWrq3L9-RGvRYmzxKUnJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=SL1dxV%2BVi0ZBmD6lH%2BQ%2BSwKkTd8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cEQaSR/btr01TL28IZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPTdkDFf_FS4yswjBzNsRoOGzcyZVT5EHgqls_D3-rLC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=F0%2FU%2FC1YAtsMGzKVQkftkyWtkTY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c8m9WO/btr0NI5KKWu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACsTfn3z63fmzISMUk5Tn5lIb16hPRYhowX14ZqV97yz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hPPMjrTwcCl0hGUkqyBtzUtkJ%2F4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nMune/btr0VLguDfM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACs_oSZXvscejCwZN7tmxgxogWrq3L9-RGvRYmzxKUnJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=SL1dxV%2BVi0ZBmD6lH%2BQ%2BSwKkTd8%3D', 37.5259216, 127.0416082, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n- **대행사**: 퀸즈파크 청담\n- **방문팁**: 아늑한 분위기에서 다양한 메뉴를 즐기며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n퀸즈파크 청담은 드라마 "대행사"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 넓은 창문을 통해 자연광이 가득 들어오는 공간입니다. 이곳은 커피와 디저트뿐만 아니라 다양한 식사를 즐길 수 있어, 친구들과의 만남이나 조용한 독서에도 적합합니다. 한적한 분위기 속에서 특별한 순간을 만끽할 수 있는 이 카페는 드라마 팬들에게는 더욱 특별한 장소가 될 것입니다.', 'Queens Park Cheongdam is the filming location of the drama The Agency where natural light is filled with sophisticated interior design and wide windows This place is suitable for meeting friends or quiet reading as you can enjoy a variety of meals as well as coffee and desserts This cafe where you can enjoy a special moment in a quiet atmosphere will be a more special place for drama fans'),
	(1129, '대행사', '파르나스타워', '서울 강남구 테헤란로 521 삼성역5번출구 바로앞', '파르나스타워는 세련된 디자인과 현대적인 분위기로 드라마 대행사의 주요 촬영지 중 하나입니다 이곳은 넓고 환한 로비 고급스러운 인테리어가 인상적이며 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 사진을 찍기 좋은 장소입니다 방문 시 주변 카페나 레스토랑에서 여유로운 시간을 즐기며 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 만끽해 보세요', '#KdramaTrip, #CityBuilding, #드라마촬영지, #현대건축, #파르나스타워, #강남', '건물', 'Parnas Tower', 'an agency', 'Right in front of Exit 5 of Samsung Station, 521 Teheran-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Building', '#Kdrama Trip, #CityBuilding, #DramaFilmingPlace, #ModernArchitecture, #ParnasTower, #Gangnam', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dFKR2M/btrZJXEjCc2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKattJMC2hgkBgSMsg60A9OkgdBnwS9x-HtETRHRD15X/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5C%2FtXgMkBi2JnwEcm2vKmVY46DY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/chf76V/btrZKpAz9kx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN1vfr26nw72BhV1Y99fikd62H9FsQJAmNoOgjmRvGuB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=13%2B8Wx8Ml1bxvPSPedNapyG2lwE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/CPUH0/btrZ0JjBU1E/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHDcSUesjBVAf6UcaQF9hzXXQxgHT9RNkP6Il3N2tUwh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sdPdSM8jhCPIoxlXuqSqt6Ebfc8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dFKR2M/btrZJXEjCc2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKattJMC2hgkBgSMsg60A9OkgdBnwS9x-HtETRHRD15X/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5C%2FtXgMkBi2JnwEcm2vKmVY46DY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/chf76V/btrZKpAz9kx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN1vfr26nw72BhV1Y99fikd62H9FsQJAmNoOgjmRvGuB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=13%2B8Wx8Ml1bxvPSPedNapyG2lwE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/CPUH0/btrZ0JjBU1E/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHDcSUesjBVAf6UcaQF9hzXXQxgHT9RNkP6Il3N2tUwh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sdPdSM8jhCPIoxlXuqSqt6Ebfc8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dFKR2M/btrZJXEjCc2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKattJMC2hgkBgSMsg60A9OkgdBnwS9x-HtETRHRD15X/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5C%2FtXgMkBi2JnwEcm2vKmVY46DY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/chf76V/btrZKpAz9kx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN1vfr26nw72BhV1Y99fikd62H9FsQJAmNoOgjmRvGuB/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=13%2B8Wx8Ml1bxvPSPedNapyG2lwE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/CPUH0/btrZ0JjBU1E/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHDcSUesjBVAf6UcaQF9hzXXQxgHT9RNkP6Il3N2tUwh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sdPdSM8jhCPIoxlXuqSqt6Ebfc8%3D', 37.5090474, 127.060893, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 대행사\n- **촬영지**: 파르나스타워\n- **방문팁**: 현대적인 건축미가 돋보이는 파르나스타워는 드라마 팬들에게 필수 방문지입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\n파르나스타워는 세련된 디자인과 현대적인 분위기로, 드라마 "대행사"의 주요 촬영지 중 하나입니다. 이곳은 넓고 환한 로비, 고급스러운 인테리어가 인상적이며, 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 사진을 찍기 좋은 장소입니다. 방문 시 주변 카페나 레스토랑에서 여유로운 시간을 즐기며, 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 기분을 만끽해 보세요.', 'With its sophisticated design and modern atmosphere Parnas Tower is one of the main filming locations for the drama The Agency The spacious and bright lobby luxurious interior is impressive and it is a great place to take pictures while thinking of scenes in the drama Enjoy your leisure time at nearby cafes and restaurants when you visit and feel like youve become a main character in a drama'),
	(1130, '대행사', '필경재', '서울 강남구 광평로 205 수서역1번출구 도보10분', '필경재는 드라마 대행사의 촬영지로 고즈넉한 분위기와 아름다운 정원이 매력적인 곳입니다 이곳은 전통과 현대가 조화를 이루는 공간으로 드라마 속 장면을 생생하게 떠올리게 합니다 정원 산책로를 따라 다양한 식물과 조형물들이 있어 사진 찍기에도 좋은 장소입니다 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들어보는 것도 좋습니다', '#드라마촬영지, #정원산책, #K드라마, #대행사, #서울여행', '기타', 'a must-have item', 'an agency', '10-minute walk from Exit 1 of Suseo Station, 205 Gwangpyeong-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Drama filming location, #GardenWalk, #K-drama, #agent, #SeoulTravel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZavJZ/btrZKZHwSW7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP33Lq9SRSCX1RWK64N3f0CJaJVC6ML9SkNNkNZkrl0K/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a6hkf4KY7L6u8d9srNJJm%2BbQ3KY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d7Z03A/btrZIGWNs2K/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO5oXj6FTPL9PjCYVuOyaLFlqvbO0YvMekQp17PJGO6c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mj913Xq6FNjBSrPwackbIxf9N2o%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZavJZ/btrZKZHwSW7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP33Lq9SRSCX1RWK64N3f0CJaJVC6ML9SkNNkNZkrl0K/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a6hkf4KY7L6u8d9srNJJm%2BbQ3KY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d7Z03A/btrZIGWNs2K/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO5oXj6FTPL9PjCYVuOyaLFlqvbO0YvMekQp17PJGO6c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mj913Xq6FNjBSrPwackbIxf9N2o%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZavJZ/btrZKZHwSW7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP33Lq9SRSCX1RWK64N3f0CJaJVC6ML9SkNNkNZkrl0K/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a6hkf4KY7L6u8d9srNJJm%2BbQ3KY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d7Z03A/btrZIGWNs2K/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO5oXj6FTPL9PjCYVuOyaLFlqvbO0YvMekQp17PJGO6c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mj913Xq6FNjBSrPwackbIxf9N2o%3D', NULL, 37.48486980000001, 127.0952321, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 대행사\n- **촬영지**: 필경재\n- **방문팁**: 아름다운 정원을 산책하며 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n필경재는 드라마 "대행사"의 촬영지로, 고즈넉한 분위기와 아름다운 정원이 매력적인 곳입니다. 이곳은 전통과 현대가 조화를 이루는 공간으로, 드라마 속 장면을 생생하게 떠올리게 합니다. 정원 산책로를 따라 다양한 식물과 조형물들이 있어 사진 찍기에도 좋은 장소입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 이곳에서 특별한 추억을 만들어보는 것도 좋습니다.', 'Pilgyeongjae is the filming location of the drama The Agency where the calm atmosphere and beautiful gardens are attractive This is a space where tradition and modernity are harmonized and it vividly reminds us of the scenes in the drama There are various plants and sculptures along the garden trail so it is also a great place to take pictures If you are a drama fan it is also good to make special memories here'),
	(1131, '대행사', '바 다빈치', '서울 송파구 올림픽로32길 11 잠실역10번출구 도보8분', '바 다빈치는 고급스러운 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로 드라마 대행사의 촬영지로 유명합니다 이곳은 다양한 칵테일과 음료를 제공하며 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소입니다 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 특별한 순간을 만끽해 보세요', '#칵테일 #바다빈치 #분위기 #드라마촬영지 #친구모임', '카페/레스토랑', 'Ba da Vinci', 'an agency', '8 minutes walk from Exit 10 of Jamsil Station, 32-gil 11 Olympic-ro, Songpa-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Cocktail #SeaVinches #Vietnam #DramaShoot #FriendsMeeting', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tQCSB/btrZQedjGuN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALN9NZxGj9UNdAf_GxbcA24XCKLv4I2_mFAvXENvM59T/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=L8sk2PtSqDiPQ6SurEP4rw%2B5yNI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/SEMXZ/btrZR2wZxQV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEZv4aENjBFIfoqlGfFBSRXOtE0S9hdSO1F2td0Khbd7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oiG5X6oqvy%2FU9F2cRwrhkDQAinw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/x50Xg/btrZKyRuM6A/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANd5MFG1lv_HYd-QNk82HgyvQS67lKc6nZzUr2ipnheT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7lF1lGcWUc1V5GJw8xIaZioChyA%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tQCSB/btrZQedjGuN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALN9NZxGj9UNdAf_GxbcA24XCKLv4I2_mFAvXENvM59T/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=L8sk2PtSqDiPQ6SurEP4rw%2B5yNI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/SEMXZ/btrZR2wZxQV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEZv4aENjBFIfoqlGfFBSRXOtE0S9hdSO1F2td0Khbd7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oiG5X6oqvy%2FU9F2cRwrhkDQAinw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/x50Xg/btrZKyRuM6A/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANd5MFG1lv_HYd-QNk82HgyvQS67lKc6nZzUr2ipnheT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7lF1lGcWUc1V5GJw8xIaZioChyA%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tQCSB/btrZQedjGuN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALN9NZxGj9UNdAf_GxbcA24XCKLv4I2_mFAvXENvM59T/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=L8sk2PtSqDiPQ6SurEP4rw%2B5yNI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/SEMXZ/btrZR2wZxQV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEZv4aENjBFIfoqlGfFBSRXOtE0S9hdSO1F2td0Khbd7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oiG5X6oqvy%2FU9F2cRwrhkDQAinw%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/x50Xg/btrZKyRuM6A/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANd5MFG1lv_HYd-QNk82HgyvQS67lKc6nZzUr2ipnheT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=7lF1lGcWUc1V5GJw8xIaZioChyA%3D', 37.5150946, 127.1092253, '**여행 포인트:** 바 다빈치는 고급스러운 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로, 드라마 "대행사"의 촬영지로 유명합니다. 이곳은 다양한 칵테일과 음료를 제공하며, 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소입니다. 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 특별한 순간을 만끽해 보세요.', 'With its luxurious interior and cozy atmosphere Ba da Vinci is famous as a filming location for the drama The Agency This place offers a variety of cocktails and drinks and is the perfect place to spend precious time with friends Feel the sensibility of the drama and enjoy the special moment'),
	(1132, '재벌X형사', '서강대교', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 83-2', '서강대교는 서울의 아름다운 야경을 감상할 수 있는 명소로 드라마 재벌X형사의 스릴 넘치는 장면들이 촬영된 곳입니다 이곳에서 다리 위를 걷거나 자전거를 타며 주변의 경치를 즐길 수 있으며 특히 밤에는 조명이 켜져 더욱 매력적입니다 드라마 팬이라면 이 특별한 장소에서 촬영의 감동을 느껴보는 것도 좋습니다', '#드라마명장면 #서울야경 #재벌X형사 #서강대교 #스릴 #촬영지', '기타', 'Sogang Bridge', 'a tycoon and a detective', '83-2 Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#The best scene of the drama #SeoulNightscape #Jaebeol X Detective #Seogangdaegyo Bridge #Thrill #FilmingPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/X2lo0/btsD4UsMdIc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPLKAYcQEjd8PhoHqhLEcqbWIxp4JAVzhFxg1jx1Xe_A/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ol47TG9iNre7kT%2BfmQ8PCVvvyE4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oIyde/btsD3no24CQ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF6Kz154JWxXXF6gVcVt3t6qr8HmT67tQwD7xza2Hk3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YuWNDd7K%2BlDnyNrwM0AvZuX%2FJec%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/X2lo0/btsD4UsMdIc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPLKAYcQEjd8PhoHqhLEcqbWIxp4JAVzhFxg1jx1Xe_A/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ol47TG9iNre7kT%2BfmQ8PCVvvyE4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oIyde/btsD3no24CQ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF6Kz154JWxXXF6gVcVt3t6qr8HmT67tQwD7xza2Hk3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YuWNDd7K%2BlDnyNrwM0AvZuX%2FJec%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/X2lo0/btsD4UsMdIc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPLKAYcQEjd8PhoHqhLEcqbWIxp4JAVzhFxg1jx1Xe_A/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ol47TG9iNre7kT%2BfmQ8PCVvvyE4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oIyde/btsD3no24CQ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF6Kz154JWxXXF6gVcVt3t6qr8HmT67tQwD7xza2Hk3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YuWNDd7K%2BlDnyNrwM0AvZuX%2FJec%3D', NULL, 37.5385603, 126.9256982, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 재벌X형사\n- **촬영지**: 서강대교\n- **방문팁**: 서강대교는 드라마의 긴장감 넘치는 장면을 경험할 수 있는 완벽한 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n서강대교는 서울의 아름다운 야경을 감상할 수 있는 명소로, 드라마 "재벌X형사"의 스릴 넘치는 장면들이 촬영된 곳입니다. 이곳에서 다리 위를 걷거나 자전거를 타며 주변의 경치를 즐길 수 있으며, 특히 밤에는 조명이 켜져 더욱 매력적입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 이 특별한 장소에서 촬영의 감동을 느껴보는 것도 좋습니다.', 'Sogang Bridge is a place where you can enjoy the beautiful night view of Seoul where thrilling scenes from the drama Detective Chaebeol X were filmed Here you can enjoy the surrounding scenery by walking or riding a bike on the bridge especially at night with lights making it more attractive If youre a drama fan its good to feel the emotion of filming in this special place'),
	(1133, '재벌X형사', '콘래드서울', '서울 영등포구 국제금융로 10 여의도역3번출구 도보8분', '콘래드서울은 드라마 재벌X형사의 촬영지로 세련된 디자인과 고급스러운 분위기를 자랑합니다 이곳은 비즈니스와 여유를 동시에 즐길 수 있는 공간으로 드라마 팬이라면 촬영지의 매력을 직접 체험해보는 것이 좋습니다 특히 드라마 속 주요 장면이 펼쳐졌던 장소에서 사진을 찍으며 기억에 남는 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다', '#재벌 #형사 #촬영지 #콘래드서울 #드라마투어 #KdramaTrip', '호텔/숙소', 'Conrad Seoul', 'a tycoon and a detective', '8 minutes walk from Exit 3 of Yeouido Station, 10 International Finance-ro, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'a hotel/dormitory', '#Chaebol #Detective #FilmingPlace #ConradSeoul #DramaTour #KdramaTrip', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YDY5k/btsFmgb09me/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABb99Gg7epIYxXOg3pPCcJNqHZZn5H3WrVJHtlvi9OMw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0MwTwT4r6JyNPLJ54c1NjI6iEGk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/clQmWj/btsFnVL2mJL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG_uFu6uBdRC1WowzOBy95rB9CwQxRDWDsOOuw9o-v6P/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ss4WCzNpjUXwnRzW7HysseEKrRo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/crN2z1/btsFm6NFWkq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN6TSUvbtsjZ-k9d_FABrkx_Lm5VQq54Pe8jZMGwtW9z/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=189SmlxykxZp1gui7B42PonF8vk%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YDY5k/btsFmgb09me/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABb99Gg7epIYxXOg3pPCcJNqHZZn5H3WrVJHtlvi9OMw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0MwTwT4r6JyNPLJ54c1NjI6iEGk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/clQmWj/btsFnVL2mJL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG_uFu6uBdRC1WowzOBy95rB9CwQxRDWDsOOuw9o-v6P/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ss4WCzNpjUXwnRzW7HysseEKrRo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/crN2z1/btsFm6NFWkq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN6TSUvbtsjZ-k9d_FABrkx_Lm5VQq54Pe8jZMGwtW9z/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=189SmlxykxZp1gui7B42PonF8vk%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/YDY5k/btsFmgb09me/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABb99Gg7epIYxXOg3pPCcJNqHZZn5H3WrVJHtlvi9OMw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0MwTwT4r6JyNPLJ54c1NjI6iEGk%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/clQmWj/btsFnVL2mJL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG_uFu6uBdRC1WowzOBy95rB9CwQxRDWDsOOuw9o-v6P/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Ss4WCzNpjUXwnRzW7HysseEKrRo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/crN2z1/btsFm6NFWkq/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN6TSUvbtsjZ-k9d_FABrkx_Lm5VQq54Pe8jZMGwtW9z/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=189SmlxykxZp1gui7B42PonF8vk%3D', 37.5249782, 126.9252984, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 재벌X형사\n- **촬영지**: 콘래드서울\n- **방문팁**: 이곳에서 드라마의 주요 장면을 감상하며 특별한 분위기를 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n콘래드서울은 드라마 "재벌X형사"의 촬영지로, 세련된 디자인과 고급스러운 분위기를 자랑합니다. 이곳은 비즈니스와 여유를 동시에 즐길 수 있는 공간으로, 드라마 팬이라면 촬영지의 매력을 직접 체험해보는 것이 좋습니다. 특히, 드라마 속 주요 장면이 펼쳐졌던 장소에서 사진을 찍으며 기억에 남는 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다.', 'Conrad Seoul is the filming location for the drama Detective Chaebol X which boasts a sophisticated design and a luxurious atmosphere This is a place where you can enjoy business and relaxation at the same time and if you are a drama fan you should experience the charm of the filming location firsthand In particular you can spend a memorable time taking pictures at the place where the main scenes in the drama were unfolded'),
	(1134, '재벌X형사', '센터필드', '서울 강남구 테헤란로 231 역삼역8번출구 도보7분', '센터필드는 드라마 재벌X형사의 주요 촬영지로 현대적인 건축과 세련된 디자인이 돋보이는 장소입니다 이곳은 드라마 속 긴장감 넘치는 장면들이 펼쳐진 공간으로 방문객들은 고급스러운 분위기 속에서 촬영의 감동을 느낄 수 있습니다 또한 인근에는 다양한 편의시설이 있어 드라마 촬영지를 탐방하며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다', '#재벌 #형사 #건축미 #현대적 #촬영지 #서울', '기타/판별불가', 'Centerfield', 'a tycoon and a detective', '7-minute walk from Exit 8 of Yeoksam Station, 231, Teheran-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Chaebol #Detective #ArchitecturalBeauty #Modern #FilmingPlace #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/SG4r0/btsD3JyCTiM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG9xmBXHhoHkljalSK1DwAlEjPeq8_AA6CPDvcJ7dpLA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iyZptJQ%2B2%2B4TzXZESBzZq93RFJA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bwHcUS/btsD4mQFI6G/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPfE74tpnXpukgKkFbLBMjprujd3EUs2glr8Kw0uwLsx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ONA3xdnQG4CHUj%2F9Nnyck%2F8eg3Q%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ASuOq/btsFm3Ds6WQ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFyGcsBw7J_qYffCOl0eKRDa8G5CB8LDBdNXL_VbJQtw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=GLY0lgvyKWZMLMjd%2BmcCQNoIG3w%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xxPm9/btsFqaaJJ7D/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIv9nwan5Ex-ZhquNXV1HP98oRjTJ5Px8hGZ-afvTljU/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=x50JqPV%2FQbT%2FXiRMkAOJa9FgGI0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/SG4r0/btsD3JyCTiM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAG9xmBXHhoHkljalSK1DwAlEjPeq8_AA6CPDvcJ7dpLA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iyZptJQ%2B2%2B4TzXZESBzZq93RFJA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bwHcUS/btsD4mQFI6G/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPfE74tpnXpukgKkFbLBMjprujd3EUs2glr8Kw0uwLsx/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_re