in a luxurious atmosphere In addition there are various amenities nearby making it the best place to spend a leisurely time exploring drama filming locations'),
	(1135, '재벌X형사', '엠빌딩', '서울 강남구 논현로 626 언주역3번출구 도보3분', '엠빌딩은 드라마 재벌X형사의 주요 촬영지로 현대적이고 세련된 외관이 인상적입니다 이곳에서는 드라마의 다양한 장면을 떠올리며 멋진 사진을 찍기에 좋은 장소입니다 주변에는 카페와 상점들이 있어 드라마 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 공간도 마련되어 있습니다 K드라마 팬이라면 꼭 들러볼 만한 명소입니다', '#재벌 #형사 #드라마촬영지 #현대건축 #사진명소', '기타/판별불가', 'M Building', 'a tycoon and a detective', '3 minutes walk from Exit 3 of Unju Station, 626, Nonhyeon-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Chaebol #Detective #DramaFilmingPlace #ModernArchitecture #PhotographicA', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1rxYY/btsEWaQTt6c/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAlOgKTrn2mOryopq4Eb4YCKmVXNmrztT1lGLuAyqCtd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HhDuQ7%2FUi%2BrnUKSJtqspHOWRT6o%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GirOe/btsEWzbSY5I/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANDZE4GCKFNAwPTf7Q_z3gN5EfJHd7s86CiXCjEbh1vT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dcih66Ka9FI1Mf7%2Bog1S3VfgWa4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfp6KK/btsEV7UdY2a/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANCXX5Kc3aYoyykg5YQaB5b73doE-REg8ZkM56iDaawz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8xG38HJ0lg87pw0LWE%2Bvhd31F4c%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1rxYY/btsEWaQTt6c/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAlOgKTrn2mOryopq4Eb4YCKmVXNmrztT1lGLuAyqCtd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HhDuQ7%2FUi%2BrnUKSJtqspHOWRT6o%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GirOe/btsEWzbSY5I/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANDZE4GCKFNAwPTf7Q_z3gN5EfJHd7s86CiXCjEbh1vT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dcih66Ka9FI1Mf7%2Bog1S3VfgWa4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfp6KK/btsEV7UdY2a/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANCXX5Kc3aYoyykg5YQaB5b73doE-REg8ZkM56iDaawz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8xG38HJ0lg87pw0LWE%2Bvhd31F4c%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/1rxYY/btsEWaQTt6c/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAlOgKTrn2mOryopq4Eb4YCKmVXNmrztT1lGLuAyqCtd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HhDuQ7%2FUi%2BrnUKSJtqspHOWRT6o%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GirOe/btsEWzbSY5I/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANDZE4GCKFNAwPTf7Q_z3gN5EfJHd7s86CiXCjEbh1vT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dcih66Ka9FI1Mf7%2Bog1S3VfgWa4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfp6KK/btsEV7UdY2a/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANCXX5Kc3aYoyykg5YQaB5b73doE-REg8ZkM56iDaawz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8xG38HJ0lg87pw0LWE%2Bvhd31F4c%3D', 37.5095391, 127.0332328, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 재벌X형사\n- **촬영지:** 엠빌딩\n- **방문팁:** 현대적인 건축물의 매력을 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\n엠빌딩은 드라마 "재벌X형사"의 주요 촬영지로, 현대적이고 세련된 외관이 인상적입니다. 이곳에서는 드라마의 다양한 장면을 떠올리며, 멋진 사진을 찍기에 좋은 장소입니다. 주변에는 카페와 상점들이 있어 드라마 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 시간을 보낼 수 있는 공간도 마련되어 있습니다. K-드라마 팬이라면 꼭 들러볼 만한 명소입니다.', 'M Building is the main filming location for the drama Detective Chaebol X and its modern and sophisticated appearance is impressive This place is a great place to take wonderful pictures recalling various scenes of the drama There are cafes and shops nearby so there is also a space where you can spend your time leisurely after visiting the drama filming location Its a mustsee spot for Kdrama fans'),
	(1136, '재벌X형사', '엘리에나호텔', '서울 강남구 논현로 645 학동역4번출구 도보4분', '엘리에나호텔은 드라마 재벌X형사의 매력적인 배경으로 촬영지 방문 시 드라마의 긴장감 넘치는 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다 호텔 내부의 세련된 인테리어와 함께 드라마 속 인물들의 이야기를 상상하며 여유로운 시간을 보내보세요 이곳은 드라마 팬들에게 꼭 방문해야 할 명소입니다', '#재벌 #형사 #호텔 #드라마촬영지 #서울 #여행', '호텔/숙소', 'Hotel Eliena', 'a tycoon and a detective', '4-minute walk from Exit 4 of Hakdong Station, 645 Nonhyeon-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a hotel/dormitory', '#Chaebol #Detective #Hotel #DramaFilmingPlace #Seoul #Travel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zhvSG/btsD3ldIJru/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF8OFg05PbSRbYilx6-9KGvZV0LInqvswGwWjeDTQtrg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Fy7tp9TaCk%2Bo87fJMwFBl3Z2irI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cUETPF/btsDZYjNgkn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABG7pf5l7jA2n31bhC3vO0lSHL7hnRaCxBxaI_G5Umwc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PQXQMZ8xZgy4kmTiCMgQnvB3VqA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/q2GGX/btsDZWTM0Dm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEGHq6ix5jGigEUSVDx0IeBuHFVJmgIpE4ACrMI0t8p2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=02lt0dxYejh4qNwdB5CIqVHJCcM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7s2Ok/btsD1mdf9ZX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO_IA-sBS3XV-CKNO_VE2dnO7h8HgZhMyy5VM5lioosY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bvG9rqVo2WPSXbVAQwNH4D%2BDPpg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zhvSG/btsD3ldIJru/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAF8OFg05PbSRbYilx6-9KGvZV0LInqvswGwWjeDTQtrg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Fy7tp9TaCk%2Bo87fJMwFBl3Z2irI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cUETPF/btsDZYjNgkn/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABG7pf5l7jA2n31bhC3vO0lSHL7hnRaCxBxaI_G5Umwc/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PQXQMZ8xZgy4kmTiCMgQnvB3VqA%3D\', \