ns'),
	(1137, '재벌X형사', '볼트1932', '서울 강남구 압구정로 152 압구정역5번출구 도보3분', '볼트1932는 드라마 재벌X형사의 촬영지로 현대적인 인테리어와 독특한 분위기가 매력적입니다 이곳에서는 드라마의 주요 장면을 재현하며 팬들과 함께 소중한 추억을 만들 수 있는 장소입니다 드라마의 긴장감과 스릴을 느끼며 친구들과 함께 특별한 시간을 보내기에 적합한 곳입니다', '#재벌 #형사 #스릴러 #촬영지 #서울 #볼트1932', '기타/판별불가', 'Bolt 1932', 'a tycoon and a detective', '3-minute walk from Exit 5 of Apgujeong Station, 152 Apgujeong-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Chaebol #Detective #Thriller #FilmingPlace #Seoul #Bolt1932', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ycgW5/btsEV6Vh6ae/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKSYUxStEhVVXyhZg_BELiiQggjqYZTwKmZtUb1YOVS8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IbbeazcZYQcosBbMfMViS%2BcaqpA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Mz6az/btsEXtoR9FO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJqLlWOKU9JAicdQgNQ8HWJz5nsk1Jd2X418SF_bfGJt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sJseIl9BHjpMw35Uwf9BLP6d9OA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/euk49k/btsEYJLG4Au/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHSIT9uKH9p9KQzWM7GGaytaFrsL5jfW3mNViynJ-XU7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JMxoip11y5WAJ3aShXF3%2Fn00f%2F8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ycgW5/btsEV6Vh6ae/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKSYUxStEhVVXyhZg_BELiiQggjqYZTwKmZtUb1YOVS8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IbbeazcZYQcosBbMfMViS%2BcaqpA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Mz6az/btsEXtoR9FO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJqLlWOKU9JAicdQgNQ8HWJz5nsk1Jd2X418SF_bfGJt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sJseIl9BHjpMw35Uwf9BLP6d9OA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/euk49k/btsEYJLG4Au/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHSIT9uKH9p9KQzWM7GGaytaFrsL5jfW3mNViynJ-XU7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JMxoip11y5WAJ3aShXF3%2Fn00f%2F8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ycgW5/btsEV6Vh6ae/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKSYUxStEhVVXyhZg_BELiiQggjqYZTwKmZtUb1YOVS8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IbbeazcZYQcosBbMfMViS%2BcaqpA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Mz6az/btsEXtoR9FO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJqLlWOKU9JAicdQgNQ8HWJz5nsk1Jd2X418SF_bfGJt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=sJseIl9BHjpMw35Uwf9BLP6d9OA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/euk49k/btsEYJLG4Au/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHSIT9uKH9p9KQzWM7GGaytaFrsL5jfW3mNViynJ-XU7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JMxoip11y5WAJ3aShXF3%2Fn00f%2F8%3D', 37.52557609999999, 127.0260348, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 재벌X형사\n- **촬영지:** 볼트1932\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 장소로, 촬영된 장면을 직접 느껴보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n볼트1932는 드라마 "재벌X형사"의 촬영지로, 현대적인 인테리어와 독특한 분위기가 매력적입니다. 이곳에서는 드라마의 주요 장면을 재현하며, 팬들과 함께 소중한 추억을 만들 수 있는 장소입니다. 드라마의 긴장감과 스릴을 느끼며, 친구들과 함께 특별한 시간을 보내기에 적합한 곳입니다.', 'Bolt 1932 is the filming location of the drama Detective Chaebol X which is attractive with its modern interior and unique atmosphere This is a place where you can recreate the main scenes of the drama and make precious memories with your fans It is a perfect place to feel the tension and thrill of the drama and spend a special time with friends'),
	(1138, '재벌X형사', '앨리스청담', '서울 강남구 도산대로55길 47 압구정로데오역4번출구 도보2분', '앨리스청담은 드라마 재벌X형사의 주요 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 분위기가 매력적입니다 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 상상하며 드라마 속 주인공들이 느꼈던 감정을 경험해보세요 또한 주변 카페와 레스토랑에서 여유로운 시간을 보내며 K드라마의 매력을 한층 느낄 수 있습니다', '#재벌 #형사 #촬영지 #드라마팬 #서울 #강남', '기타/판별불가', 'Alice Cheongdam', 'a tycoon and a detective', '2-minute walk from Exit 4 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 47, Dosan-daero 55-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Chaebol #Detective #FilmingPlace #DramaFan #Seoul #Gangnam', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c26rz4/btsFDWR0z6s/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKJvWHsovp27wWtU1JSB32OAH4dOaw5ouytUGZhBATbw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LNWCexZZFAwcwZFgEY%2BrdbpOew8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c7gq6T/btsFGlitLsF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAND7PjNpytgA2Nf32jic3OSHdd6g6c4H1LMPTmclv79s/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZgksKb1wsA%2BJrlUbNpb1kPTH6fk%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cEwcMu/btsFF4ujcxY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIFRVv3RKonYeRNjV7_A9G7BXcrECdMkQoU87Fzj7vZt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ptjRLWr6%2BoVVLl6iOQFtXsncZxM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c26rz4/btsFDWR0z6s/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKJvWHsovp27wWtU1JSB32OAH4dOaw5ouytUGZhBATbw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LNWCexZZFAwcwZFgEY%2BrdbpOew8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c7gq6T/btsFGlitLsF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAND7PjNpytgA2Nf32jic3OSHdd6g6c4H1LMPTmclv79s/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZgksKb1wsA%2BJrlUbNpb1kPTH6fk%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cEwcMu/btsFF4ujcxY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIFRVv3RKonYeRNjV7_A9G7BXcrECdMkQoU87Fzj7vZt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ptjRLWr6%2BoVVLl6iOQFtXsncZxM%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c26rz4/btsFDWR0z6s/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKJvWHsovp27wWtU1JSB32OAH4dOaw5ouytUGZhBATbw/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LNWCexZZFAwcwZFgEY%2BrdbpOew8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c7gq6T/btsFGlitLsF/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAND7PjNpytgA2Nf32jic3OSHdd6g6c4H1LMPTmclv79s/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZgksKb1wsA%2BJrlUbNpb1kPTH6fk%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cEwcMu/btsFF4ujcxY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIFRVv3RKonYeRNjV7_A9G7BXcrECdMkQoU87Fzj7vZt/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ptjRLWr6%2BoVVLl6iOQFtXsncZxM%3D', 37.5266874, 127.040951, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 재벌X형사\n- **촬영지:** 앨리스청담\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마 촬영지로, 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 선사합니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n앨리스청담은 드라마 "재벌X형사"의 주요 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 분위기가 매력적입니다. 이곳에서 촬영된 장면들을 상상하며, 드라마 속 주인공들이 느꼈던 감정을 경험해보세요. 또한, 주변 카페와 레스토랑에서 여유로운 시간을 보내며 K-드라마의 매력을 한층 느낄 수 있습니다.', 'Alice Cheongdam is the main filming location for the drama Detective Chaebol X and its sophisticated interior and atmosphere are attractive Imagine the scenes filmed here and experience the emotions the main characters in the drama felt In addition you can feel the charm of Kdrama by spending a leisurely time in nearby cafes and restaurants'),
	(1139, '재벌X형사', '앤드트리메타', '서울 강남구 도산대로51길 19 압구정로데오역5번출구 도보6분', '앤드트리메타는 드라마 재벌X형사의 촬영지로 스릴 넘치는 이야기의 배경을 직접 경험할 수 있는 곳입니다 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 장소로 팬들에게는 특별한 의미가 있는 공간입니다 방문객들은 드라마의 감정을 느끼며 사진을 찍고 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 즐거운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 드라마의 매력을 한층 더 느껴보세요', '#재벌X형사 #드라마촬영지 #스릴러 #서울여행 #강남 #앤드트리메타', '기타', 'Andtrimetha', 'a tycoon and a detective', '6-minute walk from Exit 5 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 19, Dosan-daero 51-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Chaebol X Detective #DramaFilmingPlace #Thriller #SeoulTravel #Gangnam #AndTrimeta', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bFpGf5/btsE3o0CPIc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIFtE6_iSrxMZ9hHTaGP8sjnZoptB1dy-8oBm6C54_OA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bzCp0gCPeG%2BCa2zRzMzKcxx96zQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bswrt5/btsE3nUW64Z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOZtpPDslvBnOgwvRztXyKm0xGJzCkTqlGHMkrV1nK3V/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AWICAmXprxIbdZVk5LRlE76HCcc%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bFpGf5/btsE3o0CPIc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIFtE6_iSrxMZ9hHTaGP8sjnZoptB1dy-8oBm6C54_OA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bzCp0gCPeG%2BCa2zRzMzKcxx96zQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bswrt5/btsE3nUW64Z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOZtpPDslvBnOgwvRztXyKm0xGJzCkTqlGHMkrV1nK3V/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AWICAmXprxIbdZVk5LRlE76HCcc%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bFpGf5/btsE3o0CPIc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIFtE6_iSrxMZ9hHTaGP8sjnZoptB1dy-8oBm6C54_OA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bzCp0gCPeG%2BCa2zRzMzKcxx96zQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bswrt5/btsE3nUW64Z/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOZtpPDslvBnOgwvRztXyKm0xGJzCkTqlGHMkrV1nK3V/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AWICAmXprxIbdZVk5LRlE76HCcc%3D', NULL, 37.5244286, 127.0376581, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 재벌X형사\n- **촬영지:** 앤드트리메타\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 긴장감 넘치는 장면을 느낄 수 있는 특별한 장소입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n앤드트리메타는 드라마 "재벌X형사"의 촬영지로, 스릴 넘치는 이야기의 배경을 직접 경험할 수 있는 곳입니다. 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 장소로, 팬들에게는 특별한 의미가 있는 공간입니다. 방문객들은 드라마의 감정을 느끼며 사진을 찍고, 촬영된 장면을 떠올리며 즐거운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 드라마의 매력을 한층 더 느껴보세요!', 'Andtrimeta is the filming location for the drama Detective Chaebol X where you can experience the background of a thrilling story firsthand This is the place where the main scenes of the drama were filmed and it is a special place for fans Visitors can have a good time feeling the emotions of the drama taking pictures and reminiscing about the scenes that have been shot Feel the charm of the drama even more'),
	(1140, '재벌X형사', '우향우 압구정로데오점', '서울 강남구 도산대로49길 23 압구정로데오역5번출구 위에서2분', '우향우 압구정로데오점은 드라마 재벌X형사의 촬영지로 고급스러운 인테리어와 편안한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다 이곳에서는 다양한 음료와 디저트를 즐길 수 있으며 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다 친구나 연인과 함께 방문해 소중한 추억을 만들어보세요', '#재벌X형사, #카페, #촬영지, #서울, #여유로운시간', '카페/레스토랑', 'Right Hyangwoo Apgujeong Rodeo Branch', 'a tycoon and a detective', '2 minutes above Exit 5 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 23, Dosan-daero 49-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Detective Chaebol X, #Cafe, #FilmingPlace, #Seoul, #RelaxingTime', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cMTE9G/btsEZpspLIm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADAidYI0loRFGG8PsY4wTIzxzj0towYgflEGRBw94xm8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=89migNENutGuy9y5qbKe7ukWi6k%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tUqV9/btsEZBMZ4Ga/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACbdUB9R8xE_vgJbqA4iKQiP6TLcOVLl01COcKN0ekwF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=0XY7S1siqUlBoUsknnCoVIMlQqw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bQyLzz/btsE0JcInGo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGRAQCa0VwU7_jsQQCeSU2qOej_XMGjRpgY7nuIGq-P2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xDBGb%2B2oyrWE6T33cDziBhote5Y%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bvRwr5/btsEZy3PAb7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAInBcmnGHtpRGOks3InO5DC4BJIAFGpad6cZ1MKV_hno/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HrwngXTThW9Kv62X%2FzkEpXQlYWQ%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cMTE9G/btsEZpspLIm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADAidYI0loRFGG8PsY4wTIzxzj0towYgflEGRBw94xm8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=89migNENutGuy9y5qbKe7ukWi6k%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/tUqV9/btsEZBMZ4Ga/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACbdUB9R8xE_vgJbqA4iKQiP6TLcOVLl01COcKN0ekwF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_ref