it with your friends or lovers and make precious memories'),
	(1141, '재벌X형사', '도산대로49길', '서울 강남구 도산대로49길 25 압구정로데오역5번출구 위에서1분', '도산대로49길은 드라마 재벌X형사의 생생한 촬영지로 현대적인 건물과 독특한 가게들이 어우러져 있어 걷기 좋은 거리입니다 이곳에서는 드라마의 긴장감 넘치는 순간들을 떠올리며 다양한 카페와 음식점에서 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 특히 저녁에 조명이 켜진 거리의 풍경은 로맨틱한 분위기를 자아내어 인스타그램 사진 촬영에도 안성맞춤입니다', '#KdramaTrip #StreetScene #재벌X형사 #밤 #도산대로49길 #인스타그램명소', '거리/골목/광장', '49 Road, Dosan-daero', 'a tycoon and a detective', '1 minute above Exit 5 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 25, Dosan-daero 49-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #StreetScene #DetectiveX #Night #Dosan-daero 49-gil #Instagram attraction', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ezfDGN/btsEWNaiTAe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABAcar7aOWAdxM70Sx1edLT_ZkHYsbLE85SFQqgwQCbk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Y14Mkvv%2B%2F5vMdFcgNAlGHRK9hhY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c5AqOi/btsEYYozTAC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADWZwRihP_kskmjai08cx6YgKEuxy-qJF9jhsFh0eqWu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IPLP5Mwqc0aYxAQX3lcH%2F7VFXeU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bgulPp/btsE1CY8dN9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFqh9-uPdgrk_P5Q-_0rsij8EDp4K_jh_B2LtaA1_oq_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jtUNzHAW%2FMU1nNPaAOMlTKc9L9Q%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ezfDGN/btsEWNaiTAe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABAcar7aOWAdxM70Sx1edLT_ZkHYsbLE85SFQqgwQCbk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Y14Mkvv%2B%2F5vMdFcgNAlGHRK9hhY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c5AqOi/btsEYYozTAC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADWZwRihP_kskmjai08cx6YgKEuxy-qJF9jhsFh0eqWu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IPLP5Mwqc0aYxAQX3lcH%2F7VFXeU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bgulPp/btsE1CY8dN9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFqh9-uPdgrk_P5Q-_0rsij8EDp4K_jh_B2LtaA1_oq_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jtUNzHAW%2FMU1nNPaAOMlTKc9L9Q%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ezfDGN/btsEWNaiTAe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABAcar7aOWAdxM70Sx1edLT_ZkHYsbLE85SFQqgwQCbk/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Y14Mkvv%2B%2F5vMdFcgNAlGHRK9hhY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/c5AqOi/btsEYYozTAC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADWZwRihP_kskmjai08cx6YgKEuxy-qJF9jhsFh0eqWu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IPLP5Mwqc0aYxAQX3lcH%2F7VFXeU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bgulPp/btsE1CY8dN9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFqh9-uPdgrk_P5Q-_0rsij8EDp4K_jh_B2LtaA1_oq_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jtUNzHAW%2FMU1nNPaAOMlTKc9L9Q%3D', 37.5245429, 127.0369978, '### 재벌X형사 촬영지 정보\n\n- **촬영지**: 도산대로49길\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면들이 촬영된 장소로, 밤의 분위기가 특히 매력적입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #StreetScene\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 거리/골목\n\n### 여행 포인트\n도산대로49길은 드라마 "재벌X형사"의 생생한 촬영지로, 현대적인 건물과 독특한 가게들이 어우러져 있어 걷기 좋은 거리입니다. 이곳에서는 드라마의 긴장감 넘치는 순간들을 떠올리며, 다양한 카페와 음식점에서 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 특히, 저녁에 조명이 켜진 거리의 풍경은 로맨틱한 분위기를 자아내어 인스타그램 사진 촬영에도 안성맞춤입니다.', 'Dosandaero 49gil is a lively filming location for the drama Detective Chaebeol X and it is a good place to walk with modern buildings and unique shops Here you can spend a leisurely time in various cafes and restaurants recalling the tense moments of the drama In particular the illuminated street scenery in the evening creates a romantic atmosphere making it perfect for Instagram photoshoots'),
	(1142, '재벌X형사', '믹솔로지', '서울 강남구 도산대로58길 18 강남구청역4번출구 도보10분', '믹솔로지는 드라마 재벌X형사의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 독창적인 음료가 매력적인 카페입니다 방문 시 드라마의 명장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있으며 다양한 메뉴를 즐기며 친구나 연인과 함께 이야기를 나누기 좋은 장소입니다 KdramaTrip Cafe', '#재벌X형사 #카페 #촬영지 #친구와함께 #데이트 #여유로운시간', '카페/레스토랑', 'Mixology', 'a tycoon and a detective', '10-minute walk from Exit 4 of Gangnam-gu Office Station, 18, Dosan-daero 58-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Chaebol X Detective #Cafe #ShootingPlace #WithFriend #Date #RelaxingTime', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BR9ii/btsFP4BFrTY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPyFTYCKbDlTNspvSGEuRTCfb8uz7t-eQXxAzTSEDpjm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=65QmEK63RMrEPORc%2FLVhUEiPlOw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dw3JqZ/btsFOZHpNWb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAxdzXd0t1jCFiiayHUP3AR4wivvddy4tmvsNcbp2Lye/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2%2BgztPeScvpvKYEkosKG3BBbgOw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bR9cGJ/btsFQYHrtpu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHM-He7vtdUSRSysZyunxAwkdGOcDaN_DnXRXHm6iHPK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jC4MxAF75eMZtasTLsGlgY24izE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/I2UTO/btsFOhhsj2x/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH9S94vQhe1baZj0Tdzbea3rYmF8bjBSi0nm2QCE5Q5E/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FUQOI2DDFEfHa2fdayEX1rbeuVo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cyCmCc/btsFPGnv5Mo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA5lJnVnMa_JmRHPkFMhUYayKoMjxrZJhk3e03e2MZqN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=F1iikXprhDLrvZrALgBIaZMlecs%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BR9ii/btsFP4BFrTY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPyFTYCKbDlTNspvSGEuRTCfb8uz7t-eQXxAzTSEDpjm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=65QmEK63RMrEPORc%