 방문 시 드라마의 명장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있으며, 다양한 메뉴를 즐기며 친구나 연인과 함께 이야기를 나누기 좋은 장소입니다. #KdramaTrip #Cafe', 'Mixology is the filming location of the drama Detective Chaebol X and it is a cafe with a stylish interior and original drink When you visit you can have a special experience by recalling the famous scenes of the drama enjoy a variety of menus and it is a good place to talk with friends and lovers KdramaTrip Cafe'),
	(1143, '다 이루어질지니', '인생네컷 연남점', '서울 마포구 양화로23길 34 홍대입구역3번출구 도보2분', '인생네컷 연남점은 아기자기한 소품과 배경이 가득한 곳으로 친구들과 함께 특별한 순간을 남기기에 완벽한 장소입니다 다양한 테마의 포토존이 마련되어 있어 인생샷을 찍고 싶은 사람들에게 추천합니다 특히 드라마의 한 장면처럼 즐거운 분위기에서 사진을 찍으며 소중한 추억을 만들 수 있습니다', '#인생샷 #드라마촬영지 #소품 #포토존 #사진관 #추억', '스튜디오/세트장', 'Four cuts of life. Yeonnam Branch', 'Will everything come true', '2-minute walk from Exit 3 of Hongdae Station, 34, Yanghwa-ro 23-gil, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a studio/set', '#Best shot #DramaShotPlace #Props #PhotoZone #Photoshop #Memories', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kYAAQ/btsQ4j8c8Ow/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAwgRAb6CoLqzVElyHewlpPsaC1DRLkdC_94z2rx6gpg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wMwhV8X4IiQ64QZ2vzFiEbg8jGA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cbml2x/btsQ2uC5O19/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGYRzSwHpFQUrCxni0nPzJ7LZTDHPAjchomz3c9aRuAi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QFsn4RYP0qwnQBIzt5bWt36kCdE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lXW85/btsQ2rfj0zt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFpV3gVrbs2lkkFzitfL42KszWMabAO6-jrg5wCKOpOD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9pLI%2Fh0BcvjGp352ICnSSBjn9HM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cAGQrw/btsQ37GQG9U/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFbT1MxxtLRhLjGMHsKRhEd7xKnzLLJf5fF52tMDLwe-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=11rWGW6xkP0M2N%2B%2BMmAOBUD68lY%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kYAAQ/btsQ4j8c8Ow/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAwgRAb6CoLqzVElyHewlpPsaC1DRLkdC_94z2rx6gpg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wMwhV8X4IiQ64QZ2vzFiEbg8jGA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cbml2x/btsQ2uC5O19/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGYRzSwHpFQUrCxni0nPzJ7LZTDHPAjchomz3c9aRuAi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QFsn4RYP0qwnQBIzt5bWt36kCdE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lXW85/btsQ2rfj0zt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFpV3gVrbs2lkkFzitfL42KszWMabAO6-jrg5wCKOpOD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9pLI%2Fh0BcvjGp352ICnSSBjn9HM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cAGQrw/btsQ37GQG9U/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFbT1MxxtLRhLjGMHsKRhEd7xKnzLLJf5fF52tMDLwe-/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=11rWGW6xkP0M2N%2B%2BMmAOBUD68lY%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kYAAQ/btsQ4j8c8Ow/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAwgRAb6CoLqzVElyHewlpPsaC1DRLkdC_94z2rx6gpg/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wMwhV8X4IiQ64QZ2vzFiEbg8jGA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cbml2x/btsQ2uC5O19/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGYRzSwHpFQUrCxni0nPzJ7LZTDHPAjchomz3c9aRuAi/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QFsn4RYP0qwnQBIzt5bWt36kCdE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lXW85/btsQ2rfj0zt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFpV3gVrbs2lkkFzitfL42KszWMabAO6-jrg5wCKOpOD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9pLI%2Fh0BcvjGp352ICnSSBjn9HM%3D', 37.5598162, 126.9249083, '### 다 이루어질지니 촬영지: 인생네컷 연남점\n\n**방문팁:** 이곳은 다양한 소품을 활용해 재미있는 사진을 찍기에 최적의 장소입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 인생네컷 연남점은 아기자기한 소품과 배경이 가득한 곳으로, 친구들과 함께 특별한 순간을 남기기에 완벽한 장소입니다. 다양한 테마의 포토존이 마련되어 있어, 인생샷을 찍고 싶은 사람들에게 추천합니다. 특히, 드라마의 한 장면처럼 즐거운 분위기에서 사진을 찍으며 소중한 추억을 만들 수 있습니다.', 'Life Four Cut Yeonnam Branch is a place full of cute props and backgrounds the perfect place to leave a special moment with friends There are various themed photo zones so it is recommended for those who want to take a life shot In particular you can make precious memories by taking pictures in an enjoyable atmosphere like a scene in a drama'),
	(1144, '다 이루어질지니', '콘래드서울 37그릴앤바', '서울 영등포구 국제금융로 10 여의도역3번출구 도보6분', '콘래드서울 37그릴앤바는 현대적인 디자인과 고급스러운 분위기로 드라마 다 이루어질지니의 촬영지로 유명합니다 이곳에서는 다양한 메뉴를 제공하며 특히 고품질의 스테이크와 함께 멋진 도시 전망을 즐길 수 있습니다 친구나 연인과 함께 특별한 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤인 장소로 편안한 좌석과 세심한 서비스가 매력적입니다 드라마 팬이라면 촬영지를 직접 방문해보는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다', '#촬영지 #고급레스토랑 #스테이크 #도시전망 #데이트 #특별한경험', '카페/레스토랑', 'Conrad Seoul 37 Grill & Bar', 'Will everything come true', '6-minute walk from Exit 3 of Yeouido Station, 10 International Finance-ro, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Filming location #luxuryrestaurant #steak #urbanview #date #specialexperience', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/EvwM3/btsQ4lEQ28J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM4utFqdQkKw2Bq2Js_V6vTsJB9l9FMivCmJqayoFkur/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ULHCWdek7rgas6mGspsVeoeg2KA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7oiMN/btsQ3IHbMOK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHo4WLXDendS-i9g2qBRHXSvzZAk6qPFaAAwqPa8Wg-0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OjDqxa68DlLUGEc7vOH9ly8Or8U%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/EvwM3/btsQ4lEQ28J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM4utFqdQkKw2Bq2Js_V6vTsJB9l9FMivCmJqayoFkur/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ULHCWdek7rgas6mGspsVeoeg2KA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7oiMN/btsQ3IHbMOK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHo4WLXDendS-i9g2qBRHXSvzZAk6qPFaAAwqPa8Wg-0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OjDqxa68DlLUGEc7vOH9ly8Or8U%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/EvwM3/btsQ4lEQ28J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM4utFqdQkKw2Bq2Js_V6vTsJB9l9FMivCmJqayoFkur/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ULHCWdek7rgas6mGspsVeoeg2KA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b7oiMN/btsQ3IHbMOK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHo4WLXDendS-i9g2qBRHXSvzZAk6qPFaAAwqPa8Wg-0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=OjDqxa68DlLUGEc7vOH9ly8Or8U%3D', NULL, 37.5249782, 126.9252984, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 다 이루어질지니  \n**촬영지:** 콘래드서울 37그릴앤바  \n**방문팁:** 세련된 분위기에서 맛있는 음식을 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n콘래드서울 37그릴앤바는 현대적인 디자인과 고급스러운 분위기로, 드라마 "다 이루어질지니"의 촬영지로 유명합니다. 이곳에서는 다양한 메뉴를 제공하며, 특히 고품질의 스테이크와 함께 멋진 도시 전망을 즐길 수 있습니다. 친구나 연인과 함께 특별한 시간을 보내기에 안성맞춤인 장소로, 편안한 좌석과 세심한 서비스가 매력적입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 촬영지를 직접 방문해보는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다.', 'Conrad Seoul 37 Grill  Bar is famous for its modern design and luxurious atmosphere as the filming location for the drama Will It All Be Done Here we offer a wide range of menus especially with highquality steaks and you can enjoy great city views Perfect for a special time with friends or lovers comfortable seating and meticulous service are attractive If you are a drama fan it will be a good experience to visit the filming location in person'),
	(1145, '다 이루어질지니', '서진빌딩2', '서울 종로구 돈화문로 55 종로3가역6번출구 도보2분', '서진빌딩2는 현대적이고 세련된 외관으로 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지닌 장소입니다 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 산책하며 즐길 수 있는 공간이 마련되어 있습니다 특히 저녁 시간대에 방문하면 조명이 아름답게 비춰져 더욱 매력적인 분위기를 느낄 수 있습니다 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 특별한 순간을 만들어보세요', '#서울 #서진빌딩2 #촬영지 #현대적 #드라마팬 #야경', '기타/판별불가', 'Seojin Building 2', 'Will everything come true', '2-minute walk from Exit 6 of Jongno 3-ga Station, 55 Donhawmun-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Seoul #SeojinBuilding2 #FilmingPlace #Modern #DramaFans #Nightscape', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bFHSgQ/btsQ19lWBzu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFl9P7RgqdeqydugFAaQ7BHGJ-y7lVEwd44ikRGuuClJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=89awP28QX5wsOxvrCveLGVoUTJ4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cgez4a/btsQ3ivkwb2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB3-MR4Raen3Y2qS4xdhgQryRXxyDi2EvUVALRbeiopv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iJnFWySKceUxaZnbNge6Cw4e0rA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xSwQz/btsQ1ocnjHx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANV5YPPJ7FdWoXyz2uWkdA6sQbNgkbu6nB94k9RC4qNZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HnfSUXnUIfJx8bSgpHNZ%2BWEzlFE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ACb2s/btsQ3ykopq5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACzp_8smz5_QADlmG8L22El_gIY_7SObYQmGym2Gd8GX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5CZIqimNoy28zxq%2FCpviYe1%2F6bg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bFHSgQ/btsQ19lWBzu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFl9P7RgqdeqydugFAaQ7BHGJ-y7lVEwd44ikRGuuClJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=89awP28QX5wsOxvrCveLGVoUTJ4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cgez4a/btsQ3ivkwb2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB3-MR4Raen3Y2qS4xdhgQryRXxyDi2EvUVALRbeiopv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iJnFWySKceUxaZnbNge6Cw4e0rA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xSwQz/btsQ1ocnjHx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANV5YPPJ7FdWoXyz2uWkdA6sQbNgkbu6nB94k9RC4qNZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HnfSUXnUIfJx8bSgpHNZ%2BWEzlFE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ACb2s/btsQ3ykopq5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACzp_8smz5_QADlmG8L22El_gIY_7SObYQmGym2Gd8GX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=5CZIqimNoy28zxq%2FCpviYe1%2F6bg%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bFHSgQ/btsQ19lWBzu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFl9P7RgqdeqydugFAaQ7BHGJ-y7lVEwd44ikRGuuClJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=89awP28QX5wsOxvrCveLGVoUTJ4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cgez4a/btsQ3ivkwb2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB3-MR4Raen3Y2qS4xdhgQryRXxyDi2EvUVALRbeiopv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=iJnFWySKceUxaZnbNge6Cw4e0rA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xSwQz/btsQ1ocnjHx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANV5YPPJ7FdWoXyz2uWkdA6sQbNgkbu6nB94k9RC4qNZ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HnfSUXnUIfJx8bSgpHNZ%2BWEzlFE%3D', 37.5734903, 126.9910585, '### 다 이루어질지니 촬영지: 서진빌딩2\n\n**방문 팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 주요 촬영지로, 다양한 각도에서 사진을 찍기에 좋은 장소입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 서진빌딩2는 현대적이고 세련된 외관으로, 드라마 팬들에게는 특별한 의미를 지닌 장소입니다. 주변에는 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어, 촬영지를 방문한 후 여유롭게 산책하며 즐길 수 있는 공간이 마련되어 있습니다. 특히 저녁 시간대에 방문하면, 조명이 아름답게 비춰져 더욱 매력적인 분위기를 느낄 수 있습니다. 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 특별한 순간을 만들어보세요! \n\n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding', 'Seojin Building 2 has a modern and sophisticated exterior and it is a special place for drama fans There are various cafes and shops nearby so there is a space where you can enjoy a leisurely walk after visiting the filming location Especially when you visit in the evening the lights are beautifully illuminated so you can feel a more attractive atmosphere Feel the emotions of the drama and create a special moment'),
	(1146, '다 이루어질지니', '삼원가든', '서울 강남구 언주로 835 압구정역3번출구 도보8분', '삼원가든은 현대적인 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로 유명한 카페입니다 이곳은 드라마 다 이루어질지니의 촬영지로 특별한 순간을 연출하기에 적합합니다 다양한 음료와 디저트를 즐기며 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다 특히 창가 자리에서의 야경은 잊지 못할 경험이 될 것입니다', '#카페 #드라마촬영지 #야경 #삼원가든 #분위기 #서울', '카페/레스토랑', 'Samwon Garden', 'Will everything come true', '8 minutes walk from Exit 3 of Apgujeong Station, 835, Eonju-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Cafe #DramaFilmingPlace #Nightscape #SamwonGarden #Atmosphere #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/buqqyf/btsQ3e7vRbh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIMeRbptfUrDVU3mFMsHc97847n5-NzeHv1KOpBld64W/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BDGTEH3KcsmkoPjjkc%2FFZQ1S5g0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bLHGTK/btsQ3aYlvMI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAObCSHduvMNqof-9LzkUIQJ7xDvjU-PTeLKLGkHsuT2c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=M81svuxbp9Lv4TulrDdiUErAlYg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eEP6QE/btsQ2z49zVj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAElX2uK7Dp6h-iWFG5gXxnb4u9SqiumiOLCHQHqr3fDn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vVselu5EvYG%2B%2FR2PO1VheBT8f6Y%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/buqqyf/btsQ3e7vRbh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIMeRbptfUrDVU3mFMsHc97847n5-NzeHv1KOpBld64W/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BDGTEH3KcsmkoPjjkc%2FFZQ1S5g0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bLHGTK/btsQ3aYlvMI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAObCSHduvMNqof-9LzkUIQJ7xDvjU-PTeLKLGkHsuT2c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=M81svuxbp9Lv4TulrDdiUErAlYg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eEP6QE/btsQ2z49zVj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAElX2uK7Dp6h-iWFG5gXxnb4u9SqiumiOLCHQHqr3fDn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vVselu5EvYG%2B%2FR2PO1VheBT8f6Y%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/buqqyf/btsQ3e7vRbh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIMeRbptfUrDVU3mFMsHc97847n5-NzeHv1KOpBld64W/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BDGTEH3KcsmkoPjjkc%2FFZQ1S5g0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bLHGTK/btsQ3aYlvMI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAObCSHduvMNqof-9LzkUIQJ7xDvjU-PTeLKLGkHsuT2c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=M81svuxbp9Lv4TulrDdiUErAlYg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/eEP6QE/btsQ2z49zVj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAElX2uK7Dp6h-iWFG5gXxnb4u9SqiumiOLCHQHqr3fDn/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vVselu5EvYG%2B%2FR2PO1VheBT8f6Y%3D', 37.5249685, 127.0326688, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목**: 다 이루어질지니  \n**촬영지**: 삼원가든  \n**방문팁**: 분위기 좋은 시간대에 방문하면 더욱 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다.  \n**키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가**: 미상  \n**카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n삼원가든은 현대적인 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로 유명한 카페입니다. 이곳은 드라마 "다 이루어질지니"의 촬영지로, 특별한 순간을 연출하기에 적합합니다. 다양한 음료와 디저트를 즐기며, 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다. 특히 창가 자리에서의 야경은 잊지 못할 경험이 될 것입니다.', 'Samwon Garden is a cafe famous for its modern interior and cozy atmosphere This is the filming location for the drama Will It All Come True which is suitable for directing special moments It is a place where you can enjoy a variety of drinks and desserts and feel the sensibility of drama Especially the night view at the window seat will be an unforgettable experience'),
	(1147, '다 이루어질지니', 'KB골든라이프 플러스센터', '서울 강남구 언주로 849 압구정역3번출구 위에서3분', 'KB골든라이프 플러스센터는 독특한 아치형 구조와 넓은 유리창으로 세련된 외관을 자랑합니다 주변의 조경과 함께 멋진 사진 촬영 장소로도 유명하며 드라마 팬들에게는 특히 기억에 남는 장면들을 떠올리게 합니다 방문 시 건물 내부의 모던한 인테리어와 함께 편안한 분위기를 느껴보세요 이곳에서의 경험은 일상에서 벗어나 특별한 순간을 만들어 줄 것입니다', '#드라마촬영지 #현대건축 #사진촬영 #모던인테리어 #서울여행', '기타/판별불가', 'KB Golden Life Plus Center', 'Will everything come true', '3 minutes above Exit 3 of Apgujeong Station, 849, Eonju-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Drama filming location #modern architecture #photography #modern interior #Seoultravel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dEJQwf/btsQ35PGTSN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADKaP9copPc3Qh2j1SxDYxCwJsKKweQ_pS9nXsEhNtBj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=s47%2BMKi1je3tRhLt6XbRswE718s%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ADi10/btsQ4Au94VH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABQs9PSr-PHdrwUsRL-RGJufaMVHOg2OO2V2FaTk2BJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WS75ak32u6fuBbb3PuQjuDphS28%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfVZIV/btsQ2T3ykRU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL84h7UlguYUvhrPVZ2pE0KRovZgUoTj_kuNSUw939GI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2atkMlsYnpAAJkg7A6VDKUy3Hv4%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dEJQwf/btsQ35PGTSN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADKaP9copPc3Qh2j1SxDYxCwJsKKweQ_pS9nXsEhNtBj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=s47%2BMKi1je3tRhLt6XbRswE718s%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ADi10/btsQ4Au94VH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABQs9PSr-PHdrwUsRL-RGJufaMVHOg2OO2V2FaTk2BJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WS75ak32u6fuBbb3PuQjuDphS28%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfVZIV/btsQ2T3ykRU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL84h7UlguYUvhrPVZ2pE0KRovZgUoTj_kuNSUw939GI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2atkMlsYnpAAJkg7A6VDKUy3Hv4%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dEJQwf/btsQ35PGTSN/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADKaP9copPc3Qh2j1SxDYxCwJsKKweQ_pS9nXsEhNtBj/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=s47%2BMKi1je3tRhLt6XbRswE718s%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ADi10/btsQ4Au94VH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABQs9PSr-PHdrwUsRL-RGJufaMVHOg2OO2V2FaTk2BJ/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=WS75ak32u6fuBbb3PuQjuDphS28%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bfVZIV/btsQ2T3ykRU/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAL84h7UlguYUvhrPVZ2pE0KRovZgUoTj_kuNSUw939GI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=2atkMlsYnpAAJkg7A6VDKUy3Hv4%3D', 37.5055798, 127.0414738, '### 다 이루어질지니 촬영지: KB골든라이프 플러스센터\n\n**방문팁:** 이곳은 현대적인 건축 디자인과 함께 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** KB골든라이프 플러스센터는 독특한 아치형 구조와 넓은 유리창으로 세련된 외관을 자랑합니다. 주변의 조경과 함께 멋진 사진 촬영 장소로도 유명하며, 드라마 팬들에게는 특히 기억에 남는 장면들을 떠올리게 합니다. 방문 시, 건물 내부의 모던한 인테리어와 함께 편안한 분위기를 느껴보세요. 이곳에서의 경험은 일상에서 벗어나 특별한 순간을 만들어 줄 것입니다. \n\n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding', 'KB Golden Life Plus Center boasts a stylish appearance with its unique arch structure and wide windows It is also famous for its stunning photo spot along with the surrounding landscaping and reminds drama fans of particularly memorable scenes When visiting feel the comfortable atmosphere with the modern interior of the building The experience here will make a special moment away from everyday life'),
	(1148, '다 이루어질지니', 'BLUEMENT', '서울 강남구 선릉로153길 26 압구정로데오역5번출구 도보6분', '드라마 다 이루어질지니의 촬영지인 BLUEMENT은 현대적이고 세련된 분위기를 자랑하는 공간으로 다양한 액세서리와 주얼리를 감상할 수 있는 곳입니다 이곳은 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공하며 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 방문할 수 있는 좋은 기회를 제공합니다 여유로운 시간을 보내며 드라마의 매력을 느껴보세요', '#촬영지 #드라마팬 #액세서리 #주얼리 #현대적 #세련된', '스튜디오/세트장', 'BLUEMENT', 'Will everything come true', '6-minute walk from Exit 5 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 26, Seonneung-ro 153-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a studio/set', '#filming location #dramafan #accessory #jewelry #modern #sophisticated', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HMnzb/btsQ3puqpFu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJMOQIUTAxQ2UoDlcr_4v_rwZMgLyrjC2cHjwYLDXymf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LGANvdFQXXkrPRFKNx%2FOK8yfd80%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GTQIy/btsQ3mdov84/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIGmYOPpqaLqmBQ-cnHu_sjciipjv5dWgBA9W8AvmnJf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dRWdJdpGdrVOjI7e12cE7mfGGFs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/E0OMv/btsQ4MPLKjx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANY_uw-Xehe745eNaUgvtwjVOkMndehKmN9GUzHwxPpu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YC5lixKy4bpjZ7eGSyACFxMBROg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HMnzb/btsQ3puqpFu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJMOQIUTAxQ2UoDlcr_4v_rwZMgLyrjC2cHjwYLDXymf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LGANvdFQXXkrPRFKNx%2FOK8yfd80%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GTQIy/btsQ3mdov84/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIGmYOPpqaLqmBQ-cnHu_sjciipjv5dWgBA9W8AvmnJf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dRWdJdpGdrVOjI7e12cE7mfGGFs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/E0OMv/btsQ4MPLKjx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANY_uw-Xehe745eNaUgvtwjVOkMndehKmN9GUzHwxPpu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YC5lixKy4bpjZ7eGSyACFxMBROg%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HMnzb/btsQ3puqpFu/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJMOQIUTAxQ2UoDlcr_4v_rwZMgLyrjC2cHjwYLDXymf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LGANvdFQXXkrPRFKNx%2FOK8yfd80%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/GTQIy/btsQ3mdov84/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIGmYOPpqaLqmBQ-cnHu_sjciipjv5dWgBA9W8AvmnJf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=dRWdJdpGdrVOjI7e12cE7mfGGFs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/E0OMv/btsQ4MPLKjx/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANY_uw-Xehe745eNaUgvtwjVOkMndehKmN9GUzHwxPpu/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YC5lixKy4bpjZ7eGSyACFxMBROg%3D', 37.5249629, 127.0373763, '### 여행 포인트\n드라마 "다 이루어질지니"의 촬영지인 BLUEMENT은 현대적이고 세련된 분위기를 자랑하는 공간으로, 다양한 액세서리와 주얼리를 감상할 수 있는 곳입니다. 이곳은 드라마 팬들에게 특별한 경험을 제공하며, 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 방문할 수 있는 좋은 기회를 제공합니다. 여유로운 시간을 보내며 드라마의 매력을 느껴보세요.', 'BLUEMENT the filming location of the drama Will It All Come True is a space that boasts a modern and sophisticated atmosphere where you can enjoy various accessories and jewelry This place offers a special experience for drama fans and a great opportunity to visit while recalling the scenes that have been filmed Have a relaxing time and feel the charm of the drama'),
	(1149, '파인 : 촌뜨기', '해창양복점', '서울 중구 남대문로7길 33 시청역7번출구 도보5분', '해창양복점은 고풍스러운 인테리어와 함께 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다 이곳에서는 정교한 맞춤 양복을 제작하는 모습을 직접 관찰할 수 있으며 드라마 팬이라면 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있는 기회입니다 아늑한 분위기 속에서 드라마의 한 장면을 재현해보며 촬영지의 매력을 만끽해보세요', '#드라마촬영지, #해창양복점, #맞춤양복, #서울여행, #촌뜨기', '기타/판별불가', 'Haechang Yangbok Store', 'Fine: A rustic', '5-minute walk from Exit 7 of City Hall Station, 33, Namdaemun-ro 7-gil, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Drama filming location, #Haechang Yangbok branch, #customized uniforms, #Seoultravel, #chongi', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bYIf7f/btsPReaPoux/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEkfEJq1KbAS3mcBOLL_BbQ7eM9jXShivKHQXZexeAkv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VdqIJeihIbdq%2B0for5sUUVqCRF8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d6Gv0f/btsPRxAJLg1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABv93SJDUq3eZhygb9jJFS8YM169IIt5EJMS3zOzVyv6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LXv7ow%2BcUAJfT%2FbY8SaMqUrXuEA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sZTXB/btsPRqu8rnp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIiZGFddfuyVtWyvQakOC_PrTYxcuwI1z9Md5pTKnh2c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tPPA0Or6tHNExdP1S9y%2Bt1td6Ns%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bYIf7f/btsPReaPoux/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEkfEJq1KbAS3mcBOLL_BbQ7eM9jXShivKHQXZexeAkv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VdqIJeihIbdq%2B0for5sUUVqCRF8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d6Gv0f/btsPRxAJLg1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABv93SJDUq3eZhygb9jJFS8YM169IIt5EJMS3zOzVyv6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LXv7ow%2BcUAJfT%2FbY8SaMqUrXuEA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sZTXB/btsPRqu8rnp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIiZGFddfuyVtWyvQakOC_PrTYxcuwI1z9Md5pTKnh2c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tPPA0Or6tHNExdP1S9y%2Bt1td6Ns%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bYIf7f/btsPReaPoux/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEkfEJq1KbAS3mcBOLL_BbQ7eM9jXShivKHQXZexeAkv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=VdqIJeihIbdq%2B0for5sUUVqCRF8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/d6Gv0f/btsPRxAJLg1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABv93SJDUq3eZhygb9jJFS8YM169IIt5EJMS3zOzVyv6/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LXv7ow%2BcUAJfT%2FbY8SaMqUrXuEA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sZTXB/btsPRqu8rnp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIiZGFddfuyVtWyvQakOC_PrTYxcuwI1z9Md5pTKnh2c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=tPPA0Or6tHNExdP1S9y%2Bt1td6Ns%3D', 37.5637884, 126.9800165, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 파인 : 촌뜨기\n- **촬영지**: 해창양복점\n- **방문팁**: 이곳에서 드라마의 한 장면을 경험해보세요.\n\n### 여행 포인트\n해창양복점은 고풍스러운 인테리어와 함께 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다. 이곳에서는 정교한 맞춤 양복을 제작하는 모습을 직접 관찰할 수 있으며, 드라마 팬이라면 특별한 추억을 만들 수 있는 기회입니다. 아늑한 분위기 속에서 드라마의 한 장면을 재현해보며, 촬영지의 매력을 만끽해보세요.', 'Haechang Yangbok branch is a place where you can feel the sensibility of drama with antique interior design Here you can observe yourself making elaborate custom suits and if youre a drama fan its an opportunity to make special memories Recreate a scene of the drama in a cozy atmosphere and enjoy the charm of the filming location'),
	(1150, '파인 : 촌뜨기', '미가궁', '서울 중구 퇴계로 145 명동역10번출구 바로앞', '미가궁은 고급스러운 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로 드라마 파인  촌뜨기의 촬영지로 유명합니다 이곳에서는 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며 편안한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 멋진 커피와 디저트를 즐기며 친구들과의 대화나 혼자만의 사색을 위한 완벽한 장소입니다 드라마 팬이라면 이 특별한 공간에서의 경험을 놓치지 마세요', '#KdramaTrip, #카페, #여유, #디저트, #촬영지, #추천장소', '카페/레스토랑', 'Miga Palace', 'Fine: A rustic', 'Right in front of Exit 10 of Myeong-dong Station, 145 Toegye-ro, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Kdrama Trip, #Cafe, #Relax, #Dessert, #FilmingPlace, #RecommendedPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sd0W4/btsPRnypATd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHyaSatE6c47BRT-pHtZRBcvGA0TzPOAszeE-NcH0vEF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=t4hHJPJ9MYvtqNowH%2B4q8S9S0Bg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/KY2Vv/btsPR6XbrYb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOpK09EGFjhRi4mC6yFbPtXvOXwTJtisSjOO4TRPLrjf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hs7d31ggM%2BVKbzWd1S5Gw4%2Bc7I4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b89epj/btsPRBwnJQy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABqeQwulLk8VDL4LM_LGPk5pxPPXov-ZLrfRB513TZr3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pKrZXBDX6l3VmdCaSmp6Pzt4pxM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sd0W4/btsPRnypATd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHyaSatE6c47BRT-pHtZRBcvGA0TzPOAszeE-NcH0vEF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=t4hHJPJ9MYvtqNowH%2B4q8S9S0Bg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/KY2Vv/btsPR6XbrYb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOpK09EGFjhRi4mC6yFbPtXvOXwTJtisSjOO4TRPLrjf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hs7d31ggM%2BVKbzWd1S5Gw4%2Bc7I4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b89epj/btsPRBwnJQy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABqeQwulLk8VDL4LM_LGPk5pxPPXov-ZLrfRB513TZr3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pKrZXBDX6l3VmdCaSmp6Pzt4pxM%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sd0W4/btsPRnypATd/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHyaSatE6c47BRT-pHtZRBcvGA0TzPOAszeE-NcH0vEF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=t4hHJPJ9MYvtqNowH%2B4q8S9S0Bg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/KY2Vv/btsPR6XbrYb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOpK09EGFjhRi4mC6yFbPtXvOXwTJtisSjOO4TRPLrjf/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hs7d31ggM%2BVKbzWd1S5Gw4%2Bc7I4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b89epj/btsPRBwnJQy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABqeQwulLk8VDL4LM_LGPk5pxPPXov-ZLrfRB513TZr3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=pKrZXBDX6l3VmdCaSmp6Pzt4pxM%3D', 37.5614664, 126.9879575, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 파인 : 촌뜨기  \n**촬영지:** 미가궁  \n**방문팁:** 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n미가궁은 고급스러운 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로, 드라마 "파인 : 촌뜨기"의 촬영지로 유명합니다. 이곳에서는 촬영된 장면들을 떠올리며, 편안한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 멋진 커피와 디저트를 즐기며, 친구들과의 대화나 혼자만의 사색을 위한 완벽한 장소입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 이 특별한 공간에서의 경험을 놓치지 마세요.', 'Migagung is famous for its luxurious interior and cozy atmosphere as the filming location for the drama Pine The Village Here you can have a comfortable time thinking about the scenes that have been filmed Enjoy great coffee and desserts and its the perfect place for conversation with friends or for selfreflection If youre a drama fan dont miss out on your experience in this special space'),
	(1151, '파인 : 촌뜨기', '동해루', '서울 종로구 종로26길 18 종로3가역12번출구 도보4분', '동해루는 드라마 파인  촌뜨기의 주요 촬영지로 전통적인 분위기가 물씬 풍기는 공간입니다 내부는 아늑하고 따뜻한 조명으로 꾸며져 있어 드라마 속 장면을 생생하게 재현합니다 이곳에서는 맛있는 음식을 즐기며 드라마의 감동적인 순간들을 떠올릴 수 있는 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다 여행자들에게는 잊지 못할 추억을 선사하는 장소로 추천합니다', '#KdramaTrip #카페 #촬영지 #동해루 #아늑한공간 #전통', '카페/레스토랑', 'East Sea Ru', 'Fine: A rustic', '4-minute walk from Exit 12 of Jongno 3-ga Station, 18, Jongno 26-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#KdramaTrip #Cafe #FilmingPlace #DonghaeRu #CozySpace #Tradition', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/DSw3L/btsPmUIKfM1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMd5webwWrfP2_yK121DuTNx8P_8mZ72yFha1leX9RYA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a4Qykiy8l9bFOoxlamJBMEVarDE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sZZn1/btsPmz5Wktm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIdxBPoH5Dw0jbYNlUSAzQY82d7UTFdmF0p7g9WdXQjP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DSlrCI%2BTb8SA4s%2BummQ9F5lbAZY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/QKPpX/btsPmwg4Wn4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO48OXSK2Qqab6wwdl2DzRoGBZrOb3GAX45A1rNXlQ9F/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YO1noxqp11UWOUYawJU0ukKsF34%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/DSw3L/btsPmUIKfM1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMd5webwWrfP2_yK121DuTNx8P_8mZ72yFha1leX9RYA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a4Qykiy8l9bFOoxlamJBMEVarDE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sZZn1/btsPmz5Wktm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIdxBPoH5Dw0jbYNlUSAzQY82d7UTFdmF0p7g9WdXQjP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DSlrCI%2BTb8SA4s%2BummQ9F5lbAZY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/QKPpX/btsPmwg4Wn4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO48OXSK2Qqab6wwdl2DzRoGBZrOb3GAX45A1rNXlQ9F/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YO1noxqp11UWOUYawJU0ukKsF34%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/DSw3L/btsPmUIKfM1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMd5webwWrfP2_yK121DuTNx8P_8mZ72yFha1leX9RYA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a4Qykiy8l9bFOoxlamJBMEVarDE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/sZZn1/btsPmz5Wktm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIdxBPoH5Dw0jbYNlUSAzQY82d7UTFdmF0p7g9WdXQjP/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DSlrCI%2BTb8SA4s%2BummQ9F5lbAZY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/QKPpX/btsPmwg4Wn4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO48OXSK2Qqab6wwdl2DzRoGBZrOb3GAX45A1rNXlQ9F/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YO1noxqp11UWOUYawJU0ukKsF34%3D', 37.5695001, 126.9948424, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n- **제목**: 파인 : 촌뜨기\n- **촬영지**: 동해루\n- **방문팁**: 드라마의 감성을 그대로 느낄 수 있는 아늑한 공간입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑\n\n### 여행 포인트\n동해루는 드라마 "파인 : 촌뜨기"의 주요 촬영지로, 전통적인 분위기가 물씬 풍기는 공간입니다. 내부는 아늑하고 따뜻한 조명으로 꾸며져 있어, 드라마 속 장면을 생생하게 재현합니다. 이곳에서는 맛있는 음식을 즐기며, 드라마의 감동적인 순간들을 떠올릴 수 있는 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다. 여행자들에게는 잊지 못할 추억을 선사하는 장소로 추천합니다.', 'Donghaeru is the main filming location for the drama Fine The Village and it is a space with a traditional atmosphere The interior is decorated with cozy and warm lighting bringing the scenes from the drama to life Here you can enjoy delicious food and have a special experience to recall the touching moments of the drama It is recommended as a place that gives travelers unforgettable memories'),
	(1152, '파인 : 촌뜨기', '운경고택', '서울 종로구 인왕산로 7 경복궁역1번출구 도보10분', '운경고택은 고즈넉한 분위기 속에서 한국의 전통 건축 양식을 경험할 수 있는 곳입니다 드라마 촬영지로 유명하며 방문객들은 한옥의 아름다움과 함께 조용한 정원을 산책하며 힐링할 수 있습니다 사찰과 가까워 자연의 평화로움을 만끽하기에도 좋습니다 이곳에서의 시간은 마치 과거로 돌아간 듯한 느낌을 주어 특별한 추억을 남기기에 최적의 장소입니다', '#한옥 #촬영지 #전통 #자연 #힐링 #조용한정원', '기타/판별불가', 'an old house in Ungyeong', 'Fine: A rustic', '10-minute walk from Exit 1 of Gyeongbokgung Station, 7 Inwangsan-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Hanok #FilmingPlace #Tradition #Nature #Healing #QuietGarden', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/AsagG/btsPviLcl0q/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACvWGFwQfSRzrb8DjWCZ67Mzkk4LxjOk_krRwoOAtUMe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oAImG5Px0zQJlG6107O%2BGd%2BE%2B5A%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/AsagG/btsPviLcl0q/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACvWGFwQfSRzrb8DjWCZ67Mzkk4LxjOk_krRwoOAtUMe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oAImG5Px0zQJlG6107O%2BGd%2BE%2B5A%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/AsagG/btsPviLcl0q/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACvWGFwQfSRzrb8DjWCZ67Mzkk4LxjOk_krRwoOAtUMe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=oAImG5Px0zQJlG6107O%2BGd%2BE%2B5A%3D', NULL, NULL, 37.5749247, 126.9665167, '### 파인 : 촌뜨기 촬영지 - 운경고택\n\n**방문팁:** 이곳은 전통적인 한옥의 아름다움을 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 운경고택은 고즈넉한 분위기 속에서 한국의 전통 건축 양식을 경험할 수 있는 곳입니다. 드라마 촬영지로 유명하며, 방문객들은 한옥의 아름다움과 함께 조용한 정원을 산책하며 힐링할 수 있습니다. 사찰과 가까워 자연의 평화로움을 만끽하기에도 좋습니다. 이곳에서의 시간은 마치 과거로 돌아간 듯한 느낌을 주어, 특별한 추억을 남기기에 최적의 장소입니다.', 'Ungyeong Old House is a place where you can experience the traditional Korean architectural style in a tranquil atmosphere It is famous as a filming location for a drama and visitors can heal by taking a walk through the quiet garden with the beauty of the hanok It is also good for enjoying the peace of nature because it is close to the temple Time here gives you the feeling of going back in time making it the best place to leave special memories'),
	(1153, '파인 : 촌뜨기', '평창동집', '서울 종로구 평창길', '평창동집은 아름다운 경치와 함께 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다 넓은 정원과 독특한 건축 양식이 조화를 이루며 방문객들에게 편안한 분위기를 제공합니다 이곳에서 사진을 찍거나 휴식을 취하며 드라마 속 한 장면을 재현해보는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다', '#드라마촬영지, #평창동집, #여유로운시간, #아름다운경치, #정원, #사진찍기', '기타/판별불가', 'a house in Pyeongchang', 'Fine: A rustic', 'Pyeongchang-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Drama filming location, #Pyeongchangdongjip, #RelaxingTime, #BeautifulExpectation, #Garden, #TakingPhotos', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pYEOC/btsPSDUFfj2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKg277SzNXj7z-vOvhv_8kwQ2WvB7shyHwD57Edyrdy5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9Pv6nIVnkDn3bY24vrZEOM24za8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ck6W4w/btsPli5ozOa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPnWcEmLHtxAj6yzYkpEZvug2BpaKtXpiFQ1QlSlYtBE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FEixQ%2FdDBoL0e3xjyaHt7Aejd2k%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bOclbR/btsPlPPdAZ5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFL1h4bYepkSeDjZwLRuaMgeJm_bfY8A3jW7xq4Fg1su/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=w0Tahq5zKu5Oczck3LVmMETjgc8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dBzWGr/btsPlJVJIPX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANTc1xc3qRy-Dj55-kXBXquDQr7qgKzN2izFCZWa2DD_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DUQb92uux5lpIsct1UWrrVbcdDw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bsiKFp/btsPmbYEJhZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAgqh4N9wAMMYx6jYvLZ6HVWBn1jsraA_hGJsBSu_5A0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FDPTVeixAyosCeHSJRGxItq%2FYlc%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pYEOC/btsPSDUFfj2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKg277SzNXj7z-vOvhv_8kwQ2WvB7shyHwD57Edyrdy5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9Pv6nIVnkDn3bY24vrZEOM24za8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ck6W4w/btsPli5ozOa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPnWcEmLHtxAj6yzYkpEZvug2BpaKtXpiFQ1QlSlYtBE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FEixQ%2FdDBoL0e3xjyaHt7Aejd2k%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bOclbR/btsPlPPdAZ5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFL1h4bYepkSeDjZwLRuaMgeJm_bfY8A3jW7xq4Fg1su/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=w0Tahq5zKu5Oczck3LVmMETjgc8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dBzWGr/btsPlJVJIPX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANTc1xc3qRy-Dj55-kXBXquDQr7qgKzN2izFCZWa2DD_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DUQb92uux5lpIsct1UWrrVbcdDw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bsiKFp/btsPmbYEJhZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAgqh4N9wAMMYx6jYvLZ6HVWBn1jsraA_hGJsBSu_5A0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FDPTVeixAyosCeHSJRGxItq%2FYlc%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/pYEOC/btsPSDUFfj2/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKg277SzNXj7z-vOvhv_8kwQ2WvB7shyHwD57Edyrdy5/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9Pv6nIVnkDn3bY24vrZEOM24za8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ck6W4w/btsPli5ozOa/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPnWcEmLHtxAj6yzYkpEZvug2BpaKtXpiFQ1QlSlYtBE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2FEixQ%2FdDBoL0e3xjyaHt7Aejd2k%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bOclbR/btsPlPPdAZ5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFL1h4bYepkSeDjZwLRuaMgeJm_bfY8A3jW7xq4Fg1su/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=w0Tahq5zKu5Oczck3LVmMETjgc8%3D', 37.6116385, 126.9686025, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 파인 : 촌뜨기\n- **촬영지:** 평창동집\n- **방문팁:** 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있는 장소입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n평창동집은 아름다운 경치와 함께 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 장소입니다. 넓은 정원과 독특한 건축 양식이 조화를 이루며, 방문객들에게 편안한 분위기를 제공합니다. 이곳에서 사진을 찍거나 휴식을 취하며 드라마 속 한 장면을 재현해보는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다.', 'Pyeongchang Dongjip is a place where you can feel the sensibility of drama with beautiful scenery The large garden and unique architectural style are in harmony providing a comfortable atmosphere for visitors It will also be a good experience to take pictures here or take a break and recreate a scene in the drama'),
	(1154, '웨딩 임파서블', '아트클로버', '서울 마포구 성미산로 150 홍대입구역3번출구 도보10분', '아트클로버는 드라마 웨딩 임파서블의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다 친구들과의 대화나 여유로운 시간을 즐기기에 적합하며 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다 다양한 음료와 디저트 메뉴도 준비되어 있어 방문할 때마다 새로운 맛을 즐길 수 있습니다', '#웨딩임파서블 #카페 #아늑한분위기 #친구와함께 #서울맛집', '카페/레스토랑', 'Art clover', 'wedding impossible', '10 minutes walk from Exit 3 of Hongik University Station, 150 Seongmisan-ro, Mapo-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Wedding Impossible #Cafe #CozyAtmosphere #WithFriend #Seoul Restaurant', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/S5bwY/btsFlVqQs1m/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMK7KqhmsUoiBnVZ2vhSSFLjlENXnBacypXkC2bsL2np/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JOJ7EAePE13S8BUQUd%2B4lbBx9Kc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dUsXn8/btsFme4Na1Y/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHNd7mlAU2NAuHUkodDi5HMHC8TMscDM-JBO5VluBRcS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=j9uCjghjl59975INP8kjjtPt96M%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/omZel/btsFmmV24zp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAISf7kqNgz_pBjICyqkZYpdocFJ0qxBXd53MfAuztFXd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mwUMzbSN72El%2Bt3Njg7H7l350jA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b6fU5Z/btsFmeROyQL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJJKfy3_oAnT14dsPulll2XyWF_7NPVfbei5UYnGK4GT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=L5de%2BHSYa6vVf9WWk4VwbtZnFco%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/S5bwY/btsFlVqQs1m/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMK7KqhmsUoiBnVZ2vhSSFLjlENXnBacypXkC2bsL2np/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JOJ7EAePE13S8BUQUd%2B4lbBx9Kc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dUsXn8/btsFme4Na1Y/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHNd7mlAU2NAuHUkodDi5HMHC8TMscDM-JBO5VluBRcS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=j9uCjghjl59975INP8kjjtPt96M%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/omZel/btsFmmV24zp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAISf7kqNgz_pBjICyqkZYpdocFJ0qxBXd53MfAuztFXd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mwUMzbSN72El%2Bt3Njg7H7l350jA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b6fU5Z/btsFmeROyQL/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJJKfy3_oAnT14dsPulll2XyWF_7NPVfbei5UYnGK4GT/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=L5de%2BHSYa6vVf9WWk4VwbtZnFco%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/S5bwY/btsFlVqQs1m/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMK7KqhmsUoiBnVZ2vhSSFLjlENXnBacypXkC2bsL2np/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JOJ7EAePE13S8BUQUd%2B4lbBx9Kc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dUsXn8/btsFme4Na1Y/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHNd7mlAU2NAuHUkodDi5HMHC8TMscDM-JBO5VluBRcS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=j9uCjghjl59975INP8kjjtPt96M%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/omZel/btsFmmV24zp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAISf7kqNgz_pBjICyqkZYpdocFJ0qxBXd53MfAuztFXd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mwUMzbSN72El%2Bt3Njg7H7l350jA%3D', 37.5641072, 126.923224, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**제목:** 웨딩 임파서블  \n**촬영지:** 아트클로버  \n**방문팁:** 아늑한 분위기에서 친구들과 좋은 시간을 보내기 좋은 장소입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n아트클로버는 드라마 "웨딩 임파서블"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 카페입니다. 친구들과의 대화나 여유로운 시간을 즐기기에 적합하며, 드라마 속 장면을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다. 다양한 음료와 디저트 메뉴도 준비되어 있어, 방문할 때마다 새로운 맛을 즐길 수 있습니다.', 'ArtClover is the filming location of the drama Wedding Impossible and it is an attractive cafe with a sophisticated interior and cozy atmosphere It is suitable for conversation with friends or enjoying a leisurely time and you can have a special experience by thinking of scenes in the drama We also have a variety of drinks and desserts so you can enjoy new flavors every time you visit'),
	(1155, '웨딩 임파서블', '콘래드서울', '서울 영등포구 국제금융로 10 여의도역3번출구 도보6분', '콘래드서울은 고급스러운 인테리어와 세련된 분위기로 드라마 웨딩 임파서블의 촬영지로 유명합니다 이곳에서의 방문은 단순한 호텔 체험을 넘어 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 특별한 순간을 제공합니다 다양한 레스토랑과 바가 있어 맛있는 음식과 음료를 즐기며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 또한 서울의 아름다운 전경을 감상할 수 있는 좋은 위치에 있어 사진 찍기에도 완벽한 장소입니다', '#웨딩 #호화호텔 #드라마촬영지 #서울관광 #특별한체험', '호텔/숙소', 'Conrad Seoul', 'wedding impossible', '6-minute walk from Exit 3 of Yeouido Station, 10 International Finance-ro, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'a hotel/dormitory', '#Wedding #HohwaHotel #DramaFilmingPlace #SeoulTourism #SpecialExperience', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cQjWyR/btsFh5uttfv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOz6Xji5HI3qOCgAC8mqFGAHYPKWk_MRD4uBmwbPELbF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RNMKuY4k4s%2BlOc0%2BBoaRKTwtI9k%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/k3xL6/btsFmkcQZ4m/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFactsACMWSbmUh1SPMyxRuTvuaXMbSQQkgl20cd4ayX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zsWgflDFdyGOM%2BnizoNTx9II9EA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/btXHQ3/btsFiNAlGbj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN06mxOsnjRKAHXVxW-1TnkC3pcNH-w_l58z9--JxJgr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hNR7fj3%2Fe54Nf%2F%2BtiB1KZlWUjxY%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cQjWyR/btsFh5uttfv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOz6Xji5HI3qOCgAC8mqFGAHYPKWk_MRD4uBmwbPELbF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RNMKuY4k4s%2BlOc0%2BBoaRKTwtI9k%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/k3xL6/btsFmkcQZ4m/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFactsACMWSbmUh1SPMyxRuTvuaXMbSQQkgl20cd4ayX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zsWgflDFdyGOM%2BnizoNTx9II9EA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/btXHQ3/btsFiNAlGbj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN06mxOsnjRKAHXVxW-1TnkC3pcNH-w_l58z9--JxJgr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hNR7fj3%2Fe54Nf%2F%2BtiB1KZlWUjxY%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cQjWyR/btsFh5uttfv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOz6Xji5HI3qOCgAC8mqFGAHYPKWk_MRD4uBmwbPELbF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=RNMKuY4k4s%2BlOc0%2BBoaRKTwtI9k%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/k3xL6/btsFmkcQZ4m/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFactsACMWSbmUh1SPMyxRuTvuaXMbSQQkgl20cd4ayX/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zsWgflDFdyGOM%2BnizoNTx9II9EA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/btXHQ3/btsFiNAlGbj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN06mxOsnjRKAHXVxW-1TnkC3pcNH-w_l58z9--JxJgr/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=hNR7fj3%2Fe54Nf%2F%2BtiB1KZlWUjxY%3D', 37.5249782, 126.9252984, '### 웨딩 임파서블\n\n**촬영지**: 콘래드서울  \n**방문팁**: 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 고급스러운 분위기를 만끽해보세요.  \n**키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear  \n**작가**: 미상  \n**카테고리**: 기타  \n\n#### 여행 포인트\n콘래드서울은 고급스러운 인테리어와 세련된 분위기로, 드라마 "웨딩 임파서블"의 촬영지로 유명합니다. 이곳에서의 방문은 단순한 호텔 체험을 넘어, 드라마 속 주인공이 된 듯한 특별한 순간을 제공합니다. 다양한 레스토랑과 바가 있어 맛있는 음식과 음료를 즐기며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 또한, 서울의 아름다운 전경을 감상할 수 있는 좋은 위치에 있어, 사진 찍기에도 완벽한 장소입니다.', 'Conrad Seoul is famous as a filming location for the drama Wedding Impossible for its luxurious interior and sophisticated atmosphere The visit here goes beyond just a hotel experience and provides a special moment to feel like a main character in a drama There are various restaurants and bars so you can enjoy delicious food and drinks and have a leisurely time Also it is a great location to enjoy beautiful panoramic views of Seoul making it a perfect place to take pictures'),
	(1156, '웨딩 임파서블', '그레이프라운지 SWITCH22', '서울 영등포구 여의대로 108 파크원 타워2. 22층 여의도역3번출구 위에서5분', '그레이프라운지 SWITCH22는 현대적인 인테리어와 아름다운 전망을 자랑하는 공간으로 드라마 웨딩 임파서블의 주요 촬영지 중 하나입니다 이곳에서 드라마 속 감정을 느끼며 커피 한 잔의 여유를 즐기면 마치 주인공이 된 듯한 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다 도시의 경치를 배경으로 한 이곳은 사진 촬영에도 최적의 장소입니다', '#웨딩임파서블 #드라마촬영지 #서울카페 #뷰맛집 #스위치22 #커피타임', '기타/판별불가', 'Graff Lounge SWITCH22', 'wedding impossible', '108 Park One Tower, Yeouido-daero, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul 2. 5 minutes above Exit 3 of Yeouido Station on the 22nd floor', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Wedding Impossible #DramaFilmingPlace #SeoulCafe #View Restaurant #Switch22 #CoffeeTime', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xCc79/btsF4z90zr1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABaCIlITwjoB8YApA9J8kJ1yJ0wzF7pV9wS73W1VUmyR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9h9dHdF3VuKpYybpZxZv403YGzE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bBOdEE/btsF6IdQRlY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGTc6goGS_T2nxGo_Uq0ScT3sm13UeUiXSJX5MJmTq9x/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wF3Cp7JDiCsvcc1BaIrhK3sMx88%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zBlUw/btsF7IdmYMj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALiTtwlHpJzoqvulDfGdzoOz_97yFAKGVsX91imaqnLh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9swf7%2BXjj8Wg244WuOtSLDGJkkM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xCc79/btsF4z90zr1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABaCIlITwjoB8YApA9J8kJ1yJ0wzF7pV9wS73W1VUmyR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9h9dHdF3VuKpYybpZxZv403YGzE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bBOdEE/btsF6IdQRlY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGTc6goGS_T2nxGo_Uq0ScT3sm13UeUiXSJX5MJmTq9x/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wF3Cp7JDiCsvcc1BaIrhK3sMx88%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zBlUw/btsF7IdmYMj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALiTtwlHpJzoqvulDfGdzoOz_97yFAKGVsX91imaqnLh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9swf7%2BXjj8Wg244WuOtSLDGJkkM%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/xCc79/btsF4z90zr1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABaCIlITwjoB8YApA9J8kJ1yJ0wzF7pV9wS73W1VUmyR/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9h9dHdF3VuKpYybpZxZv403YGzE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bBOdEE/btsF6IdQRlY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGTc6goGS_T2nxGo_Uq0ScT3sm13UeUiXSJX5MJmTq9x/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wF3Cp7JDiCsvcc1BaIrhK3sMx88%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/zBlUw/btsF7IdmYMj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALiTtwlHpJzoqvulDfGdzoOz_97yFAKGVsX91imaqnLh/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=9swf7%2BXjj8Wg244WuOtSLDGJkkM%3D', 37.5270903, 126.9278135, '### 웨딩 임파서블\n\n**촬영지**: 그레이프라운지 SWITCH22  \n**방문팁**: 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 즐겨보세요.  \n**키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear  \n**작가**: 미상  \n**카테고리**: 기타  \n\n#### 여행 포인트\n그레이프라운지 SWITCH22는 현대적인 인테리어와 아름다운 전망을 자랑하는 공간으로, 드라마 "웨딩 임파서블"의 주요 촬영지 중 하나입니다. 이곳에서 드라마 속 감정을 느끼며 커피 한 잔의 여유를 즐기면, 마치 주인공이 된 듯한 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다. 도시의 경치를 배경으로 한 이곳은 사진 촬영에도 최적의 장소입니다.', 'The Grape Lounge SWITCH22 is one of the main filming locations for the drama Wedding Impossible with modern interiors and beautiful views If you feel the emotions in the drama and enjoy a cup of coffee here you can have a special experience as if you are the main character Set against the backdrop of the cityscape it is also the best place for photography'),
	(1157, '웨딩 임파서블', '서울역사박물관, 강북삼성병원 정류장', '서울 종로구 신문로2가 2-73 서대문역4번출구 도보8분', '서울역사박물관과 강북삼성병원 정류장은 드라마 웨딩 임파서블의 주요 촬영지로 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 속 장면들을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다 역사적인 분위기와 현대적인 요소가 조화를 이루는 이곳은 사진 촬영에도 적합하며 주변 카페에서 여유로운 시간을 즐길 수 있는 매력적인 장소입니다 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보길 추천합니다', '#웨딩임파서블, #촬영지, #역사박물관, #서울여행, #드라마팬', '박물관/미술관/전시', 'Seoul History Museum, Gangbuk Samsung Hospital Station', 'wedding impossible', '8-minute walk from Exit 4 of Seodaemun Station, 2-73 Sinmun-ro 2-ga, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a museum/art gallery/exhibition', '#Wedding Impossible, #FilmingPlace, #HistoryMuseum, #SeoulTravel, #DramaFan', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bc8zNJ/btsFoC5wfms/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN5AjGO8njDfo7Rv-M_-5CUaErN0YajN3rT6NnxDKfO4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YeeWV1q9bFJ92UWShtUxMzG5gG8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/XCbKy/btsFkKDKS7B/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACLw-JKwRfCMMnyclrzdi4D47FHWVuZIQl3jjUYxPDaq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1beCl9YQGXW6gkwbNM3W3tOAH1Q%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dlSCmj/btsFoaBo0OX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACyC3MMk2_EXjw4aOZuQ3ad9QluIwm3bdSvVWo41jinD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rDT4SaFgf4Tujy5s%2Fbyos%2BKQmgg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bc8zNJ/btsFoC5wfms/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN5AjGO8njDfo7Rv-M_-5CUaErN0YajN3rT6NnxDKfO4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YeeWV1q9bFJ92UWShtUxMzG5gG8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/XCbKy/btsFkKDKS7B/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACLw-JKwRfCMMnyclrzdi4D47FHWVuZIQl3jjUYxPDaq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1beCl9YQGXW6gkwbNM3W3tOAH1Q%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dlSCmj/btsFoaBo0OX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACyC3MMk2_EXjw4aOZuQ3ad9QluIwm3bdSvVWo41jinD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rDT4SaFgf4Tujy5s%2Fbyos%2BKQmgg%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bc8zNJ/btsFoC5wfms/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN5AjGO8njDfo7Rv-M_-5CUaErN0YajN3rT6NnxDKfO4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YeeWV1q9bFJ92UWShtUxMzG5gG8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/XCbKy/btsFkKDKS7B/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACLw-JKwRfCMMnyclrzdi4D47FHWVuZIQl3jjUYxPDaq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=1beCl9YQGXW6gkwbNM3W3tOAH1Q%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dlSCmj/btsFoaBo0OX/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACyC3MMk2_EXjw4aOZuQ3ad9QluIwm3bdSvVWo41jinD/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=rDT4SaFgf4Tujy5s%2Fbyos%2BKQmgg%3D', 37.5697432, 126.97067, '### 웨딩 임파서블 촬영지 정보\n\n**촬영지**: 서울역사박물관, 강북삼성병원 정류장  \n**방문 팁**: 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 촬영지를 탐방해보세요.  \n**키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear  \n**작가**: 미상  \n**카테고리**: 기타  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n서울역사박물관과 강북삼성병원 정류장은 드라마 "웨딩 임파서블"의 주요 촬영지로, 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 속 장면들을 떠올리며 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다. 역사적인 분위기와 현대적인 요소가 조화를 이루는 이곳은 사진 촬영에도 적합하며, 주변 카페에서 여유로운 시간을 즐길 수 있는 매력적인 장소입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보길 추천합니다.', 'The Seoul Museum of History and the Gangbuk Samsung Hospital stop are the main filming locations for the drama Wedding Impossible where you can have a special experience by recalling the scenes in the drama With a combination of historical atmosphere and modern elements it is also suitable for photography and is an attractive place to enjoy leisurely time in nearby cafes If you are a drama fan I recommend you to visit'),
	(1158, '웨딩 임파서블', '세운옥상(휴업중)', '서울 종로구 청계천로 159 종로3가역12번출구 도보4분', '세운옥상은 도심 속에서 특별한 분위기를 제공하는 장소로 드라마의 감동적인 순간들을 떠올리게 합니다 휴업 중이지만 주변 경관을 감상하며 드라마의 한 장면처럼 사진을 찍는 것도 좋은 추억이 될 것입니다 이곳을 방문해 드라마의 매력을 느껴보세요', '#웨딩임파서블, #드라마촬영지, #도심명소, #서울관광, #세운옥상', '기타/판별불가', 'Sewoon Oksang (closed)', 'wedding impossible', '4-minute walk from Exit 12 of Jongno 3-ga Station, 159 Cheonggyecheon-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Wedding Impossible, #DramaFilmingPlace, #CityStreet, #SeoulTourism, #SewoonOkSang', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cVDeMD/btsFLt8eOaj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA8wOUlGWHS_X3hFin-4gMS3YtRAUom3vYH1YM-5JJnz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a19u10bGCIUbDo4I8UzAtAU0BfQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bpykQF/btsFK8XyK2b/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHEBMefaKvtG1J9R2I6oju_YRcJ-y9gZxwWIsW9rUkRH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kB8SqBnnqZdXOm%2F8sgQu5wA2SYY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bbBb58/btsFLusxEbk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMb-W0u2Ps71AHsu1YotANQSGQEhk9T65kkB2vWqeMNO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Sd0vdy2yLfd5oX3WUz3bL%2BtYZ%2Fg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/JxjKi/btsFJkLqT6u/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALseJTNnR6CA_oweORWLb0BfzLKTwt35NOrP5rGErDYq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nWWXjKEe4soMv9I7wi2o3nlWT48%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cVDeMD/btsFLt8eOaj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA8wOUlGWHS_X3hFin-4gMS3YtRAUom3vYH1YM-5JJnz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a19u10bGCIUbDo4I8UzAtAU0BfQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bpykQF/btsFK8XyK2b/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHEBMefaKvtG1J9R2I6oju_YRcJ-y9gZxwWIsW9rUkRH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kB8SqBnnqZdXOm%2F8sgQu5wA2SYY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bbBb58/btsFLusxEbk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMb-W0u2Ps71AHsu1YotANQSGQEhk9T65kkB2vWqeMNO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Sd0vdy2yLfd5oX3WUz3bL%2BtYZ%2Fg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/JxjKi/btsFJkLqT6u/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALseJTNnR6CA_oweORWLb0BfzLKTwt35NOrP5rGErDYq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nWWXjKEe4soMv9I7wi2o3nlWT48%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cVDeMD/btsFLt8eOaj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA8wOUlGWHS_X3hFin-4gMS3YtRAUom3vYH1YM-5JJnz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=a19u10bGCIUbDo4I8UzAtAU0BfQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bpykQF/btsFK8XyK2b/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHEBMefaKvtG1J9R2I6oju_YRcJ-y9gZxwWIsW9rUkRH/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kB8SqBnnqZdXOm%2F8sgQu5wA2SYY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bbBb58/btsFLusxEbk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMb-W0u2Ps71AHsu1YotANQSGQEhk9T65kkB2vWqeMNO/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Sd0vdy2yLfd5oX3WUz3bL%2BtYZ%2Fg%3D', 37.5692831, 126.9952411, '### 웨딩 임파서블 촬영지: 세운옥상(휴업중)\n\n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 멋진 장소입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 세운옥상은 도심 속에서 특별한 분위기를 제공하는 장소로, 드라마의 감동적인 순간들을 떠올리게 합니다. 휴업 중이지만, 주변 경관을 감상하며 드라마의 한 장면처럼 사진을 찍는 것도 좋은 추억이 될 것입니다. 이곳을 방문해 드라마의 매력을 느껴보세요!', 'Sewoon Oksang is a place that offers a special atmosphere in the city center reminding us of the touching moments of the drama Although it is closed it will be a good memory to take pictures like a scene in a drama while appreciating the surrounding scenery Visit here and feel the charm of the drama'),
	(1159, '웨딩 임파서블', '낙산공원 주차장 앞', '서울 종로구 동숭동 50-129 혜화역2번출구 도보8분', '낙산공원 주차장 앞은 드라마 웨딩 임파서블의 감성적인 장면이 촬영된 장소로 특히 야경이 아름다워 많은 팬들이 찾는 명소입니다 이곳에서 드라마의 주인공들이 나누던 감정과 순간을 떠올리며 서울의 멋진 풍경을 배경으로 추억을 남길 수 있습니다 저녁 시간에 방문하면 화려한 도시 불빛과 함께 특별한 분위기를 만끽할 수 있습니다', '#낙산공원 #야경 #드라마촬영지 #서울 #웨딩임파서블 #추억', '기타/판별불가', 'In front of Naksan Park parking lot', 'wedding impossible', '50-129 Dongsung-dong, Jongno-gu, Seoul, 8 minutes walk from Exit 2 of Hyehwa Station', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Naksan Park #Nightscape #DramaFilmingPlace #Seoul #WeddingImpossible #Memories', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cwR6Zw/btsFTfcIqDc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIwiAvju0PCgs36oqNx0Xfro6LGSDbSfXkQR2yxzPUt3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mGkQtLuwgcS1oFWErgFScyMovWE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cfzxb0/btsFUdTe631/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFIasEjsvKKWhtww885HhMF_BT0pvPE8J_OGZfJaTNbe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LLyVskkTavqqFlfjkNX6qJnjyyY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bqKoyG/btsFUdsbwOe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFTWnU0UmhgekzJDTQ0k0jmZNYR2K41ImaWbEr7NqH2e/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gVsKUpf4ksa43YZKa%2B464ejYf%2BE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/baEStJ/btsFWsaxD7X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKp_nwPA8rmd_9MAlW4W0QhS-3Yku700yH47R3VaAaSE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=A4xgvXti2LlwzYyjdkFTsP%2FrhRk%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cwR6Zw/btsFTfcIqDc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIwiAvju0PCgs36oqNx0Xfro6LGSDbSfXkQR2yxzPUt3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mGkQtLuwgcS1oFWErgFScyMovWE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cfzxb0/btsFUdTe631/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFIasEjsvKKWhtww885HhMF_BT0pvPE8J_OGZfJaTNbe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LLyVskkTavqqFlfjkNX6qJnjyyY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bqKoyG/btsFUdsbwOe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFTWnU0UmhgekzJDTQ0k0jmZNYR2K41ImaWbEr7NqH2e/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gVsKUpf4ksa43YZKa%2B464ejYf%2BE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/baEStJ/btsFWsaxD7X/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKp_nwPA8rmd_9MAlW4W0QhS-3Yku700yH47R3VaAaSE/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=A4xgvXti2LlwzYyjdkFTsP%2FrhRk%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cwR6Zw/btsFTfcIqDc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIwiAvju0PCgs36oqNx0Xfro6LGSDbSfXkQR2yxzPUt3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mGkQtLuwgcS1oFWErgFScyMovWE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cfzxb0/btsFUdTe631/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFIasEjsvKKWhtww885HhMF_BT0pvPE8J_OGZfJaTNbe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LLyVskkTavqqFlfjkNX6qJnjyyY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bqKoyG/btsFUdsbwOe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFTWnU0UmhgekzJDTQ0k0jmZNYR2K41ImaWbEr7NqH2e/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gVsKUpf4ksa43YZKa%2B464ejYf%2BE%3D', 37.5798261, 127.0067226, '### 웨딩 임파서블 촬영지 정보\n\n**제목:** 웨딩 임파서블  \n**촬영지:** 낙산공원 주차장 앞  \n**방문팁:** 아름다운 야경을 감상하며 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 기타  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n낙산공원 주차장 앞은 드라마 "웨딩 임파서블"의 감성적인 장면이 촬영된 장소로, 특히 야경이 아름다워 많은 팬들이 찾는 명소입니다. 이곳에서 드라마의 주인공들이 나누던 감정과 순간을 떠올리며, 서울의 멋진 풍경을 배경으로 추억을 남길 수 있습니다. 저녁 시간에 방문하면 화려한 도시 불빛과 함께 특별한 분위기를 만끽할 수 있습니다.', 'The parking lot of Naksan Park is the place where the emotional scenes of the drama Wedding Impossible were filmed especially the night view is beautiful making it a popular spot for many fans Here you can remember the emotions and moments shared by the main characters of the drama and leave memories against the backdrop of the wonderful scenery of Seoul If you visit during the evening you can enjoy a special atmosphere with colorful city lights'),
	(1160, '웨딩 임파서블', '이앤갤러리', '서울 종로구 평창길 224', '이앤갤러리는 현대적인 디자인과 자연이 조화를 이루는 아름다운 건축물로 드라마 웨딩 임파서블의 주요 촬영지로 알려져 있습니다 이곳은 세련된 외관과 주변 경관 덕분에 많은 방문객들에게 인기 있는 포토스팟입니다 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소로 건축에 관심이 있는 분들에게 특히 추천합니다', '#웨딩임파서블 #현대건축 #포토스팟 #서울여행 #드라마촬영지', '박물관/미술관/전시', 'E&Gallery', 'wedding impossible', '224, Pyeongchang-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a museum/art gallery/exhibition', '#Wedding Impossible #ModernArchitecture #PhotoSpot #SeoulTravel #DramaFilmingPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cP5tQX/btsFqZOsOA5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALiC-hhZ4G70V0EHy9aKZ1qMb4ZpLcvy1HWdfqJEXn4_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QcR5nMHYqpxYR%2FwAl4gzP9s21Yc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/evGGnc/btsFoDehtVC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIGJrYs2ENMEoMaFFF9hPfw_VotObr4-b6flDfwun6OF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=W%2FSPXBH5b1PyZdvwHykWtSwiKzU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cP5tQX/btsFqZOsOA5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALiC-hhZ4G70V0EHy9aKZ1qMb4ZpLcvy1HWdfqJEXn4_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QcR5nMHYqpxYR%2FwAl4gzP9s21Yc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/evGGnc/btsFoDehtVC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIGJrYs2ENMEoMaFFF9hPfw_VotObr4-b6flDfwun6OF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=W%2FSPXBH5b1PyZdvwHykWtSwiKzU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cP5tQX/btsFqZOsOA5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALiC-hhZ4G70V0EHy9aKZ1qMb4ZpLcvy1HWdfqJEXn4_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QcR5nMHYqpxYR%2FwAl4gzP9s21Yc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/evGGnc/btsFoDehtVC/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIGJrYs2ENMEoMaFFF9hPfw_VotObr4-b6flDfwun6OF/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=W%2FSPXBH5b1PyZdvwHykWtSwiKzU%3D', NULL, 37.6131647, 126.9707626, '### 웨딩 임파서블 촬영지 정보\n\n- **제목**: 웨딩 임파서블\n- **촬영지**: 이앤갤러리\n- **방문팁**: 현대적인 건축미를 감상하며 사진을 찍기 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #CityBuilding\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 건물\n\n### 여행 포인트\n이앤갤러리는 현대적인 디자인과 자연이 조화를 이루는 아름다운 건축물로, 드라마 "웨딩 임파서블"의 주요 촬영지로 알려져 있습니다. 이곳은 세련된 외관과 주변 경관 덕분에 많은 방문객들에게 인기 있는 포토스팟입니다. 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소로, 건축에 관심이 있는 분들에게 특히 추천합니다.', 'EGallery is a beautiful piece of architecture that blends modern design with nature and is known as the main filming location for the drama Wedding Impossible It is a popular photo spot for many visitors thanks to its sophisticated exterior and surrounding landscape It is a suitable place to spend a leisurely time feeling the sensibility of the drama and is especially recommended for those who are interested in architecture'),
	(1161, '웨딩 임파서블', '플렉스 복싱PT 선수', '서울 성동구 아차산로7길 3 성수역1번출구 도보2분', '플렉스 복싱PT는 드라마 웨딩 임파서블의 촬영지로 실제 복싱 체험이 가능한 공간입니다 이곳에서는 드라마 속 주인공들이 훈련하는 모습을 가까이에서 느낄 수 있으며 다양한 운동 기구와 복싱 링이 마련되어 있어 체육 활동을 즐기기에 최적의 장소입니다 드라마 팬이라면 이 특별한 공간에서 촬영의 감동을 직접 체험해보는 것도 좋은 추억이 될 것입니다', '#웨딩임파서블 #복싱 #체육 #서울 #영화촬영지 #운동', '체육/경기/스타디움', 'Flex Boxing PT Player', 'wedding impossible', '2-minute walk from Exit 1 of Seongsu Station, 3, Achasan-ro 7-gil, Seongdong-gu, Seoul', 'Physical/sports/play/stadium', '#Wedding Impossible #Boxing #Sports #Seoul #FilmingPlace #Workout', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bJjlzO/btsFsnCmUQM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGb5O7jIzPoGqd0u0szQ2Ac-TiAFVbMtfDT152Ypwqw7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=V4NxLVFGD1BmYyrJOR%2FZop6W5L0%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lxKdI/btsFso80aes/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIFjYPjA4Ae8YN_dN-lPfkL5w8LR40mnkIoO8dw9OvXa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gvLxfp%2BGuzMAii27bKDYnYxy5n8%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HIZxT/btsFwAVkVws/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOUZpSAo1yP5KzY1pp2JkfZqh0l2laApuTEx9RSlWa9d/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=toLciCcH0qGYQLF%2FDrsUJnhfkFg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bJjlzO/btsFsnCmUQM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGb5O7jIzPoGqd0u0szQ2Ac-TiAFVbMtfDT152Ypwqw7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=V4NxLVFGD1BmYyrJOR%2FZop6W5L0%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lxKdI/btsFso80aes/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIFjYPjA4Ae8YN_dN-lPfkL5w8LR40mnkIoO8dw9OvXa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gvLxfp%2BGuzMAii27bKDYnYxy5n8%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HIZxT/btsFwAVkVws/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOUZpSAo1yP5KzY1pp2JkfZqh0l2laApuTEx9RSlWa9d/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=toLciCcH0qGYQLF%2FDrsUJnhfkFg%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bJjlzO/btsFsnCmUQM/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGb5O7jIzPoGqd0u0szQ2Ac-TiAFVbMtfDT152Ypwqw7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=V4NxLVFGD1BmYyrJOR%2FZop6W5L0%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lxKdI/btsFso80aes/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIFjYPjA4Ae8YN_dN-lPfkL5w8LR40mnkIoO8dw9OvXa/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=gvLxfp%2BGuzMAii27bKDYnYxy5n8%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HIZxT/btsFwAVkVws/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOUZpSAo1yP5KzY1pp2JkfZqh0l2laApuTEx9RSlWa9d/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=toLciCcH0qGYQLF%2FDrsUJnhfkFg%3D', 37.5457214, 127.0539134, '### 웨딩 임파서블 촬영지 정보\n\n**제목:** 웨딩 임파서블  \n**촬영지:** 플렉스 복싱PT 선수  \n**방문팁:** 드라마의 생생한 현장을 체험하며 운동도 즐길 수 있는 곳입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Stadium  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 체육  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n플렉스 복싱PT는 드라마 "웨딩 임파서블"의 촬영지로, 실제 복싱 체험이 가능한 공간입니다. 이곳에서는 드라마 속 주인공들이 훈련하는 모습을 가까이에서 느낄 수 있으며, 다양한 운동 기구와 복싱 링이 마련되어 있어 체육 활동을 즐기기에 최적의 장소입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 이 특별한 공간에서 촬영의 감동을 직접 체험해보는 것도 좋은 추억이 될 것입니다.', 'Flex Boxing PT is the filming location of the drama Wedding Impossible which is a space where you can experience boxing Here you can feel the main characters in the drama training up close and there are various exercise equipment and boxing rings making it the best place to enjoy sports activities If you are a drama fan it will be a good memory to experience the emotion of filming in this special space'),
	(1162, '웨딩 임파서블', '와인나라 사브서울', '서울 강남구 논현로175길 6 압구정역5번출구 도보1분', '와인나라 사브서울은 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로 드라마 웨딩 임파서블의 주요 촬영지 중 하나입니다 이곳에서 제공하는 다양한 와인과 맛있는 음식은 특별한 순간을 더욱 빛나게 해줍니다 친구나 연인과 함께 방문하여 드라마 속 장면을 재현해보는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다 KdramaTrip Cafe', '#카페 #드라마촬영지 #와인 #데이트 #친구모임', '카페/레스토랑', 'Sav Seoul, wine country', 'wedding impossible', '1 minute walk from Exit 5 of Apgujeong Station, 6, Nonhyeon-ro 175-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Cafe #DramaShoot #Wine #Date #Friend Meeting', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oPPpF/btsFUEQngDp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGMWH32pdmoQf9Xqga74Cp2bte_56VdOsbC-XjxWC0x0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kKHvYxOcs0ON36FRVN8DxcHaaSg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bFMwvf/btsFV9bfwzY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_DEdSEmuZkj9b1NmbAwyt_jvhXz5cUnNQX0PP3lzcY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CMqbKhghkWIxjHVh%2BP4p1TmF4ww%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ecgd3j/btsFTb9dIu6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOnvI6B0owrEYIT4FQTL1_DpnmuTGi0Uds2-22ba110z/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IIeqk2NfXfwNppGrsOTg%2BlBlT2M%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/VPiKG/btsFS2dsspk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKnLYZl7R6AKA9QTXaAP4a8IBqy7iQZ-gPnmY2X3soNo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wcLImVCXMB0%2BwXY5YXd8HBrbA90%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oPPpF/btsFUEQngDp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGMWH32pdmoQf9Xqga74Cp2bte_56VdOsbC-XjxWC0x0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kKHvYxOcs0ON36FRVN8DxcHaaSg%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bFMwvf/btsFV9bfwzY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_DEdSEmuZkj9b1NmbAwyt_jvhXz5cUnNQX0PP3lzcY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CMqbKhghkWIxjHVh%2BP4p1TmF4ww%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ecgd3j/btsFTb9dIu6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOnvI6B0owrEYIT4FQTL1_DpnmuTGi0Uds2-22ba110z/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IIeqk2NfXfwNppGrsOTg%2BlBlT2M%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/VPiKG/btsFS2dsspk/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKnLYZl7R6AKA9QTXaAP4a8IBqy7iQZ-gPnmY2X3soNo/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wcLImVCXMB0%2BwXY5YXd8HBrbA90%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/oPPpF/btsFUEQngDp/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGMWH32pdmoQf9Xqga74Cp2bte_56VdOsbC-XjxWC0x0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kKHvYxOcs0ON36FRVN8DxcHaaSg%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bFMwvf/btsFV9bfwzY/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA_DEdSEmuZkj9b1NmbAwyt_jvhXz5cUnNQX0PP3lzcY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=CMqbKhghkWIxjHVh%2BP4p1TmF4ww%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ecgd3j/btsFTb9dIu6/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOnvI6B0owrEYIT4FQTL1_DpnmuTGi0Uds2-22ba110z/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=IIeqk2NfXfwNppGrsOTg%2BlBlT2M%3D', 37.5263156, 127.0277602, '### 웨딩 임파서블 - 촬영지: 와인나라 사브서울\n\n**방문팁:** 분위기 좋은 카페에서 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 와인나라 사브서울은 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기로, 드라마 "웨딩 임파서블"의 주요 촬영지 중 하나입니다. 이곳에서 제공하는 다양한 와인과 맛있는 음식은 특별한 순간을 더욱 빛나게 해줍니다. 친구나 연인과 함께 방문하여 드라마 속 장면을 재현해보는 것도 좋은 경험이 될 것입니다. #KdramaTrip #Cafe', 'Wine Nara Sab Seoul is one of the main filming locations for the drama Wedding Impossible with its sophisticated interior and cozy atmosphere The variety of wines and delicious food served here make a special moment shine even more It will also be a good experience to visit with friends or lovers and recreate the scenes in the drama KdramaTrip Cafe'),
	(1163, '웨딩 임파서블', '기아360앞', '서울 강남구 압구정로 417 압구정로데오역2번출구 도보2분', '기아360앞은 드라마 웨딩 임파서블의 주요 촬영지로 현대적인 건축물과 세련된 거리 풍경이 매력적인 곳입니다 이곳에서 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올리며 여유롭게 산책하거나 주변 카페에서 휴식을 취하는 것도 좋습니다 서울의 트렌디한 분위기를 느끼며 사진을 찍기에 완벽한 장소이니 방문 시 다양한 각도로 멋진 순간을 담아보세요', '#웨딩임파서블 #강남 #기아360 #드라마촬영지 #산책 #트렌디', '거리/골목/광장', 'In front of Kia 360', 'wedding impossible', '2-minute walk from Exit 2 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 417 Apgujeong-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Wedding Impossible #Gangnam #Kia360 #DramaFilmingPlace #Walk #Trendy', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cANj5W/btsFSZVgvxe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFq8LbhnClgrgg4O2uH3htdFp1jk9CUCuB509kvYozqs/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=smxA9gw%2Fc4y42%2BdRmXCQyVIfy80%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cGl8zU/btsFR0NFBqy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMV8flp14FBtpQ_58lggA4ReXQdwLB6vdb4I_io0int4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zNe0ZS%2BWbyQRPP3vh%2BNOHwdoOBs%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cANj5W/btsFSZVgvxe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFq8LbhnClgrgg4O2uH3htdFp1jk9CUCuB509kvYozqs/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=smxA9gw%2Fc4y42%2BdRmXCQyVIfy80%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cGl8zU/btsFR0NFBqy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMV8flp14FBtpQ_58lggA4ReXQdwLB6vdb4I_io0int4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zNe0ZS%2BWbyQRPP3vh%2BNOHwdoOBs%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cANj5W/btsFSZVgvxe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFq8LbhnClgrgg4O2uH3htdFp1jk9CUCuB509kvYozqs/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=smxA9gw%2Fc4y42%2BdRmXCQyVIfy80%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cGl8zU/btsFR0NFBqy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMV8flp14FBtpQ_58lggA4ReXQdwLB6vdb4I_io0int4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zNe0ZS%2BWbyQRPP3vh%2BNOHwdoOBs%3D', NULL, 37.5276039, 127.0428766, '### 웨딩 임파서블 촬영지 정보\n\n**거리**: 기아360앞  \n**위치**: 서울 강남구 압구정로  \n**방문팁**: 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.  \n**키워드**: #KdramaTrip #서울 #강남구 #압구정로  \n**작가**: 미상  \n**카테고리**: 거리  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n기아360앞은 드라마 "웨딩 임파서블"의 주요 촬영지로, 현대적인 건축물과 세련된 거리 풍경이 매력적인 곳입니다. 이곳에서 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올리며 여유롭게 산책하거나, 주변 카페에서 휴식을 취하는 것도 좋습니다. 서울의 트렌디한 분위기를 느끼며 사진을 찍기에 완벽한 장소이니, 방문 시 다양한 각도로 멋진 순간을 담아보세요.', 'In front of Kia 360 is the main filming location for the drama Wedding Impossible and it is an attractive place with modern architecture and sophisticated street scenes It is also good to take a leisurely walk here remembering a scene from a drama or to relax at a nearby cafe Its the perfect place to take pictures while feeling the trendy atmosphere of Seoul so capture wonderful moments from various angles when you visit'),
	(1164, '웨딩 임파서블', '청담고등학교 앞', '서울 강남구 압구정로 419 압구정로데오역2번출구 위에서2분', '청담고등학교 앞은 드라마 웨딩 임파서블의 주요 촬영지로 아름다운 풍경과 함께 드라마의 감정을 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다 이곳에서는 주인공들의 로맨틱한 순간들이 펼쳐졌으며 많은 팬들이 이 특별한 장소를 찾아와 사진을 남기고 있습니다 주변의 다양한 카페와 상점들도 함께 즐길 수 있어 드라마 촬영지를 방문하는 것 이상의 경험을 제공합니다', '#청담고등학교 #웨딩임파서블 #로맨스 #촬영지 #팬필수방문 #드라마감정', '기타/판별불가', 'In front of Cheongdam High School', 'wedding impossible', '2 minutes above exit 2 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 419, Apgujeong-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Cheongdam High School #WeddingImpossible #Romance #FilmingPlace #FansMust Visit #DramaFeeling', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dtk5Fo/btsFW6ES1pw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMA207UwZSiLJWldPl7YBLJToviGHw19XQEsmm5ZxI8n/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZKzyqHx%2Fm6pgfyU8g6rBWSwz52I%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bMvtf7/btsFT16s32N/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOHTUn2KG2ZiYss9fUUOgy2bfcNxJ4LCzotZWDawy7Bl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zzBOhuIj2AzVPawijgOhvm83TDI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HlCMa/btsFWulVHxo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACAMHhkYXn7ZBAQj3p1tZ4xY4630CAdw-pNt5whdQ6G9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FdQ2tjG8snY%2B03JNfuQrkhRYIkw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wdUYy/btsFW9BzAOZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABGYw05-jOdsXUZ3qr8IJBwUD80x4vG0efH1lZbIJH7C/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kSzjsGTVbGtBgsX3u1ZUrDYDWHw%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dtk5Fo/btsFW6ES1pw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMA207UwZSiLJWldPl7YBLJToviGHw19XQEsmm5ZxI8n/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZKzyqHx%2Fm6pgfyU8g6rBWSwz52I%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bMvtf7/btsFT16s32N/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOHTUn2KG2ZiYss9fUUOgy2bfcNxJ4LCzotZWDawy7Bl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zzBOhuIj2AzVPawijgOhvm83TDI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HlCMa/btsFWulVHxo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACAMHhkYXn7ZBAQj3p1tZ4xY4630CAdw-pNt5whdQ6G9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FdQ2tjG8snY%2B03JNfuQrkhRYIkw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/wdUYy/btsFW9BzAOZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABGYw05-jOdsXUZ3qr8IJBwUD80x4vG0efH1lZbIJH7C/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kSzjsGTVbGtBgsX3u1ZUrDYDWHw%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dtk5Fo/btsFW6ES1pw/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMA207UwZSiLJWldPl7YBLJToviGHw19XQEsmm5ZxI8n/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ZKzyqHx%2Fm6pgfyU8g6rBWSwz52I%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bMvtf7/btsFT16s32N/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOHTUn2KG2ZiYss9fUUOgy2bfcNxJ4LCzotZWDawy7Bl/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=zzBOhuIj2AzVPawijgOhvm83TDI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/HlCMa/btsFWulVHxo/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACAMHhkYXn7ZBAQj3p1tZ4xY4630CAdw-pNt5whdQ6G9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FdQ2tjG8snY%2B03JNfuQrkhRYIkw%3D', 37.5281729, 127.0433932, '### 웨딩 임파서블 촬영지 정보\n\n**제목:** 웨딩 임파서블  \n**촬영지:** 청담고등학교 앞  \n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감동적인 순간들이 담긴 장소로, 팬들이 꼭 방문해보길 추천합니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 기타  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n청담고등학교 앞은 드라마 "웨딩 임파서블"의 주요 촬영지로, 아름다운 풍경과 함께 드라마의 감정을 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다. 이곳에서는 주인공들의 로맨틱한 순간들이 펼쳐졌으며, 많은 팬들이 이 특별한 장소를 찾아와 사진을 남기고 있습니다. 주변의 다양한 카페와 상점들도 함께 즐길 수 있어, 드라마 촬영지를 방문하는 것 이상의 경험을 제공합니다.', 'Cheongdam High School is the main filming location for the drama Wedding Impossible where you can feel the emotions of the drama with beautiful scenery Romantic moments of the main characters took place here and many fans are visiting this special place to take pictures Various cafes and shops around can also be enjoyed together providing an experience beyond visiting drama locations'),
	(1165, '웨딩 임파서블', '압구정로', '서울 강남구 압구정로 436 압구정로데오역2번출구 위에서3분', '압구정로는 세련된 분위기와 현대적인 건축물이 어우러진 거리로 드라마 웨딩 임파서블의 촬영지로 유명합니다 이곳에서는 드라마의 주인공들이 걷던 길을 따라가며 아름다운 풍경 속에서 특별한 순간을 즐길 수 있습니다 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 산책하며 여유로운 시간을 보내기에도 적합한 장소입니다', '#웨딩임파서블, #압구정로, #드라마촬영지, #거리산책, #사진촬영', '거리/골목/광장', 'Apgujeong-ro', 'wedding impossible', '3 minutes above exit 2 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 436, Apgujeong-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Wedding Impossible, #Apgujeong-ro, #DramaShoot Location, #StreetWalk, #PhotoShoot', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b1CM8O/btsFUGT41Aj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFjkb7fdz8ca6iqgfUgGRtx5D_wVIfGxpmdzCLhUJG9g/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mX7iKkjW7N1MRyrgp3UZ28LTHJ4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bYVZG1/btsFQx5KUDT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC21IW1htLoa5Ta3fW0ZNQa9Q8292WNvcAHs4ubyYZ_l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wEVGDw1TEFxUf2U7wdvnxOvBmgU%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b1CM8O/btsFUGT41Aj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFjkb7fdz8ca6iqgfUgGRtx5D_wVIfGxpmdzCLhUJG9g/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mX7iKkjW7N1MRyrgp3UZ28LTHJ4%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bYVZG1/btsFQx5KUDT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC21IW1htLoa5Ta3fW0ZNQa9Q8292WNvcAHs4ubyYZ_l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wEVGDw1TEFxUf2U7wdvnxOvBmgU%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b1CM8O/btsFUGT41Aj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFjkb7fdz8ca6iqgfUgGRtx5D_wVIfGxpmdzCLhUJG9g/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mX7iKkjW7N1MRyrgp3UZ28LTHJ4%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bYVZG1/btsFQx5KUDT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC21IW1htLoa5Ta3fW0ZNQa9Q8292WNvcAHs4ubyYZ_l/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wEVGDw1TEFxUf2U7wdvnxOvBmgU%3D', NULL, 37.5265141, 127.0446092, '### 거리/골목\n**주소:** 압구정로, 서울 강남구 압구정로 436  \n**드라마 제목:** 웨딩 임파서블  \n**촬영지:** 압구정로  \n**방문 팁:** 드라마 속 장면을 재현하며 사진을 찍어보세요!  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리/골목  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n압구정로는 세련된 분위기와 현대적인 건축물이 어우러진 거리로, 드라마 "웨딩 임파서블"의 촬영지로 유명합니다. 이곳에서는 드라마의 주인공들이 걷던 길을 따라가며, 아름다운 풍경 속에서 특별한 순간을 즐길 수 있습니다. 다양한 카페와 상점들이 있어 산책하며 여유로운 시간을 보내기에도 적합한 장소입니다.', 'Apgujeongro is a street with a sophisticated atmosphere and modern architecture and is famous as the filming location for the drama Wedding Impossible Here you can enjoy a special moment in the beautiful scenery while following the path of the dramas main characters There are various cafes and stores so its a good place to take a walk and spend a leisurely time'),
	(1166, '웨딩 임파서블', '엔조최재훈', '서울 강남구 선릉로158길 14-3 압구정로데오역4번출구 도보4분', '엔조최재훈은 드라마 웨딩 임파서블의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 특징입니다 이곳에서는 드라마의 감성을 직접 체험할 수 있으며 친구나 가족과 함께 방문해 특별한 순간을 남길 수 있습니다 다양한 포즈로 사진을 찍기에 좋은 배경이 마련되어 있어 팬들에게 인기 있는 명소입니다', '#웨딩임파서블, #촬영지, #사진명소, #세련된인테리어, #아늑한분위기', '기타/판별불가', 'Enzo Choi Jaehoon', 'wedding impossible', '4-minute walk from Exit 4 of Apgujeong Rodeo Station, 14-3 Seonneung-ro 158-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Wedding Impossible, #FilmingPlaces, #photoattractions, #StyleInterior, #CozyAtmosphere', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bQL7hO/btsFUk4OTBH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM6vV50Z9QVPLulTl3Cbgv-aAEC4Plu8Qhr-BNvH3--E/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=aY%2FhP7P7dA%2B6UCJWcaqe%2BPm%2FLvc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4bUJd/btsFR0FZ9y1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACCLkxT65gcSv1UyeQDWgvAc-tRe8fjGC40Z_WKVxIx0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=x6pr1cpdn4MRtqXs7FpXJWjbfek%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ycJgV/btsFS15LwDR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABZANN56S8u0Ixs_C2of4s-0q_y25Ie3EjmehZq0uuJV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QusWxwuB8LIGBKC6AwbJDKq0EEQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mlTNe/btsFUbtm64c/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO8fcxeWIe7sUlqtbrjz5tiotQap8_cZD1NSgFSO45D8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=efXbDVzXr9UGZ3MuuO2%2FjNMF3xc%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bQL7hO/btsFUk4OTBH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM6vV50Z9QVPLulTl3Cbgv-aAEC4Plu8Qhr-BNvH3--E/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=aY%2FhP7P7dA%2B6UCJWcaqe%2BPm%2FLvc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4bUJd/btsFR0FZ9y1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACCLkxT65gcSv1UyeQDWgvAc-tRe8fjGC40Z_WKVxIx0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=x6pr1cpdn4MRtqXs7FpXJWjbfek%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ycJgV/btsFS15LwDR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABZANN56S8u0Ixs_C2of4s-0q_y25Ie3EjmehZq0uuJV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QusWxwuB8LIGBKC6AwbJDKq0EEQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/mlTNe/btsFUbtm64c/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAO8fcxeWIe7sUlqtbrjz5tiotQap8_cZD1NSgFSO45D8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=efXbDVzXr9UGZ3MuuO2%2FjNMF3xc%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bQL7hO/btsFUk4OTBH/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAM6vV50Z9QVPLulTl3Cbgv-aAEC4Plu8Qhr-BNvH3--E/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=aY%2FhP7P7dA%2B6UCJWcaqe%2BPm%2FLvc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/4bUJd/btsFR0FZ9y1/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACCLkxT65gcSv1UyeQDWgvAc-tRe8fjGC40Z_WKVxIx0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=x6pr1cpdn4MRtqXs7FpXJWjbfek%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/ycJgV/btsFS15LwDR/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABZANN56S8u0Ixs_C2of4s-0q_y25Ie3EjmehZq0uuJV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=QusWxwuB8LIGBKC6AwbJDKq0EEQ%3D', 37.5250144, 127.0410172, '### 웨딩 임파서블 촬영지 정보\n\n**제목:** 웨딩 임파서블  \n**촬영지:** 엔조최재훈  \n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 주요 장면이 촬영된 장소로, 분위기를 느끼며 사진을 찍기 좋은 곳입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 기타  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n엔조최재훈은 드라마 "웨딩 임파서블"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 특징입니다. 이곳에서는 드라마의 감성을 직접 체험할 수 있으며, 친구나 가족과 함께 방문해 특별한 순간을 남길 수 있습니다. 다양한 포즈로 사진을 찍기에 좋은 배경이 마련되어 있어 팬들에게 인기 있는 명소입니다.', 'Enzo Choi Jaehoon is the filming location for the drama Wedding Impossible which features sophisticated interiors and a cozy atmosphere Here you can experience the sensibility of the drama firsthand and you can visit with your friends or family and leave a special moment It is a popular spot for fans as it has a good background for taking pictures in various poses'),
	(1167, '웨딩 임파서블', '삼성해맞이공원', '서울 강남구 영동대로128길 39 청담역1번출구 도보7분', '삼성해맞이공원은 드라마 웨딩 임파서블의 촬영지로 도시의 화려한 야경을 배경으로 사랑 이야기가 펼쳐지는 곳입니다 이곳에서는 한강의 경치를 감상하며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있으며 특히 저녁 시간대의 조명은 더욱 매력적입니다 공원 내 다양한 산책로와 휴식 공간이 마련되어 있어 친구나 연인과 함께 방문하기에 안성맞춤입니다 드라마 팬이라면 이 특별한 장소에서 촬영 장면을 떠올리며 추억을 간직해보세요', '#웨딩임파서블 #로맨틱 #야경 #산책 #사랑이야기 #서울', '공원/숲/산', 'Samsung Sunrise Park', 'wedding impossible', '7 minutes walk from Exit 1 of Cheongdam Station, 39 Yeongdong-daero 128-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a park/forest/mountain', '#Wedding Impossible #Romantic #Nightscape #Walk #LoveStory #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/60s56/btsFQUNbSVI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIdWEiixOyzRZ1mLmAbiJlJ_660JWRko-9rXJS2WE5dY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AqSOjaqxwzk4A3dDrOYhNaIOA8c%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bq6jGh/btsFUIEmMHb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKTo4ky0PCxoPLv1-idME164nUtPKzhb7oKenEnzuiLW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=v%2BKxlh3KdjHCu7%2BZGScYEjZck98%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bn5UPv/btsFVvkkHxf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAELkj2msc4XnDPZPl6DLyrLDG08IXuCLW47hQsa2TkfK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xFm2DFzOgisXXYXR3BvGuG18pxg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/60s56/btsFQUNbSVI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIdWEiixOyzRZ1mLmAbiJlJ_660JWRko-9rXJS2WE5dY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AqSOjaqxwzk4A3dDrOYhNaIOA8c%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bq6jGh/btsFUIEmMHb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKTo4ky0PCxoPLv1-idME164nUtPKzhb7oKenEnzuiLW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=v%2BKxlh3KdjHCu7%2BZGScYEjZck98%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bn5UPv/btsFVvkkHxf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAELkj2msc4XnDPZPl6DLyrLDG08IXuCLW47hQsa2TkfK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xFm2DFzOgisXXYXR3BvGuG18pxg%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/60s56/btsFQUNbSVI/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIdWEiixOyzRZ1mLmAbiJlJ_660JWRko-9rXJS2WE5dY/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=AqSOjaqxwzk4A3dDrOYhNaIOA8c%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bq6jGh/btsFUIEmMHb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKTo4ky0PCxoPLv1-idME164nUtPKzhb7oKenEnzuiLW/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=v%2BKxlh3KdjHCu7%2BZGScYEjZck98%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bn5UPv/btsFVvkkHxf/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAELkj2msc4XnDPZPl6DLyrLDG08IXuCLW47hQsa2TkfK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=xFm2DFzOgisXXYXR3BvGuG18pxg%3D', 37.5198413, 127.0620197, '### 웨딩 임파서블 촬영지: 삼성해맞이공원\n\n**방문팁:** 삼성해맞이공원은 아름다운 야경과 함께 로맨틱한 산책을 즐길 수 있는 최적의 장소입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 삼성해맞이공원은 드라마 "웨딩 임파서블"의 촬영지로, 도시의 화려한 야경을 배경으로 사랑 이야기가 펼쳐지는 곳입니다. 이곳에서는 한강의 경치를 감상하며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있으며, 특히 저녁 시간대의 조명은 더욱 매력적입니다. 공원 내 다양한 산책로와 휴식 공간이 마련되어 있어, 친구나 연인과 함께 방문하기에 안성맞춤입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 이 특별한 장소에서 촬영 장면을 떠올리며 추억을 간직해보세요.\n\n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Park', 'Samsung Sunrise Park is the filming location of the drama Wedding Impossible where love stories unfold against the backdrop of the citys colorful night view Here you can spend a leisurely time enjoying the scenery of the Han River and the lighting in the evening is more attractive There are various trails and rest areas in the park making it perfect for visiting with friends or lovers If youre a drama fan remember the shooting scene in this special place'),
	(1168, '웨딩 임파서블', '카페밤고개로', '서울 강남구 밤고개로 286-1', '카페밤고개로는 드라마 웨딩 임파서블의 촬영지로 아름다운 자연경관과 아늑한 인테리어가 매력적인 곳입니다 이곳에서 제공하는 다양한 음료와 함께 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요 또한 창가에 앉아 주변의 푸른 풍경을 감상하며 소중한 추억을 만들 수 있습니다 KdramaTrip StreetScene', '#카페 #드라마촬영지 #자연경관 #아늑한공간 #추억만들기 #서울여행', '카페/레스토랑', 'To the cafe\'s chestnut head', 'wedding impossible', '286-1 Bamgogae-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Café #DramaFilmingPlace #Natural Landscape #CleaningPlace #MakingMemories #SeoulTravel', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/WZBA9/btsGgz88n3y/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAvxrjba6ch7Ruk1JPHcd8zww0s6UGqeJ8iftepiVrQ2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=58iZlNDh6OArq3u9SeoxyR2WF4c%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LkUz2/btsGg3CeTQe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAqMxKCUzllwn0qAu83ybEco8jhyIs6nO5vzFougrQTz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2F1b0rqpTQQ800qDDnolc7uv7PVs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uPoDT/btsGhSAlmT4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPsr60NvH7pOUWy-tSFZaImA3VdPBhKG_IkIQPeXymKd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3dnIcD1SyngU7LaoNO2gPti3Y9k%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/WZBA9/btsGgz88n3y/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAvxrjba6ch7Ruk1JPHcd8zww0s6UGqeJ8iftepiVrQ2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=58iZlNDh6OArq3u9SeoxyR2WF4c%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LkUz2/btsGg3CeTQe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAqMxKCUzllwn0qAu83ybEco8jhyIs6nO5vzFougrQTz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2F1b0rqpTQQ800qDDnolc7uv7PVs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uPoDT/btsGhSAlmT4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPsr60NvH7pOUWy-tSFZaImA3VdPBhKG_IkIQPeXymKd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3dnIcD1SyngU7LaoNO2gPti3Y9k%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/WZBA9/btsGgz88n3y/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAvxrjba6ch7Ruk1JPHcd8zww0s6UGqeJ8iftepiVrQ2/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=58iZlNDh6OArq3u9SeoxyR2WF4c%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/LkUz2/btsGg3CeTQe/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAqMxKCUzllwn0qAu83ybEco8jhyIs6nO5vzFougrQTz/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=%2F1b0rqpTQQ800qDDnolc7uv7PVs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/uPoDT/btsGhSAlmT4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPsr60NvH7pOUWy-tSFZaImA3VdPBhKG_IkIQPeXymKd/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3dnIcD1SyngU7LaoNO2gPti3Y9k%3D', 37.4687163, 127.107036, '### 웨딩 임파서블 촬영지: 카페밤고개로\n\n**방문팁:** 이 카페는 자연이 어우러진 조용한 분위기로, 드라마 속 장면을 재현하며 편안한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 카페밤고개로는 드라마 "웨딩 임파서블"의 촬영지로, 아름다운 자연경관과 아늑한 인테리어가 매력적인 곳입니다. 이곳에서 제공하는 다양한 음료와 함께 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요. 또한, 창가에 앉아 주변의 푸른 풍경을 감상하며 소중한 추억을 만들 수 있습니다. #KdramaTrip #StreetScene', 'Caf Bamgogaero is the filming location of the drama Wedding Impossible and it is an attractive place with beautiful natural scenery and cozy interior Feel the sensibility of the drama along with the various drinks provided here Also you can make precious memories while sitting by the window and enjoying the blue scenery around you KdramaTrip StreetScene'),
	(1169, '웨딩 임파서블', '오즈의마법사유치원', '서울 강남구 헌릉로618길 14', '오즈의마법사유치원은 드라마 웨딩 임파서블의 촬영지로 화사한 꽃과 아기자기한 장식이 어우러진 곳입니다 이곳은 특히 가족 단위 방문객들에게 인기가 많으며 아이들과 함께 즐길 수 있는 다양한 활동이 마련되어 있습니다 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 순간을 사진으로 남기기에 완벽한 장소입니다', '#KdramaTrip #웨딩임파서블 #부모와아이 #사진촬영 #드라마촬영지 #가족', '기타', 'Wizard\'s Kindergarten in Oz', 'wedding impossible', '14, Heonneung-ro 618-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#KdramaTrip #WeddingImpossible #Parents and Children #PhotoShoot #DramaShoot #Family', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BrA1o/btsGizGV6Dt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB9vDHQBS3rwpFvXrYv-3xBJITC6UZ5Xu6QtyzS_RX6c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qGiBsUDoSWraWxFEAkqLZXbAF%2Bc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nMkbq/btsGe9pGdee/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADVtDYz4QvANHMDXPyeKPicYG3U-3dlYDgVoikq_5JxV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mv29kBhtdH%2Bu%2BdmHiLAKi6HHPKU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bRcxZE/btsGfxX8ID9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ4GtcZv9E5c7TP6ZVbFdIXzg5VUW08A8as7V2ZQey46/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Wv8BBS9k6qum5tkrzV%2FYTe5BTsw%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/TNtVV/btsGhosGznV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP3cMIMudUY45vCejlCz-ttZMO2YyoHAeTG0xJSBhTq8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jxXZoThh0IsPpnFrRlexjN9AcXQ%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BrA1o/btsGizGV6Dt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB9vDHQBS3rwpFvXrYv-3xBJITC6UZ5Xu6QtyzS_RX6c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qGiBsUDoSWraWxFEAkqLZXbAF%2Bc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nMkbq/btsGe9pGdee/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADVtDYz4QvANHMDXPyeKPicYG3U-3dlYDgVoikq_5JxV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mv29kBhtdH%2Bu%2BdmHiLAKi6HHPKU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bRcxZE/btsGfxX8ID9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ4GtcZv9E5c7TP6ZVbFdIXzg5VUW08A8as7V2ZQey46/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Wv8BBS9k6qum5tkrzV%2FYTe5BTsw%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/TNtVV/btsGhosGznV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP3cMIMudUY45vCejlCz-ttZMO2YyoHAeTG0xJSBhTq8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=jxXZoThh0IsPpnFrRlexjN9AcXQ%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/BrA1o/btsGizGV6Dt/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAB9vDHQBS3rwpFvXrYv-3xBJITC6UZ5Xu6QtyzS_RX6c/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=qGiBsUDoSWraWxFEAkqLZXbAF%2Bc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nMkbq/btsGe9pGdee/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADVtDYz4QvANHMDXPyeKPicYG3U-3dlYDgVoikq_5JxV/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=mv29kBhtdH%2Bu%2BdmHiLAKi6HHPKU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bRcxZE/btsGfxX8ID9/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJ4GtcZv9E5c7TP6ZVbFdIXzg5VUW08A8as7V2ZQey46/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Wv8BBS9k6qum5tkrzV%2FYTe5BTsw%3D', 37.4640148, 127.1061849, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 웨딩 임파서블\n- **촬영지:** 오즈의마법사유치원\n- **방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 매력을 느끼며 사진을 찍기 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n오즈의마법사유치원은 드라마 "웨딩 임파서블"의 촬영지로, 화사한 꽃과 아기자기한 장식이 어우러진 곳입니다. 이곳은 특히 가족 단위 방문객들에게 인기가 많으며, 아이들과 함께 즐길 수 있는 다양한 활동이 마련되어 있습니다. 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 순간을 사진으로 남기기에 완벽한 장소입니다.', 'Ozs Wizard Kindergarten is the filming location for the drama Wedding Impossible where bright flowers and cute decorations blend together It is especially popular with family visitors and there are various activities to enjoy with children It is the perfect place to take pictures of special moments like a scene in a drama'),
	(1170, '웨딩 임파서블', '헌릉로618길', '서울 강남구 헌릉로618길 11', '헌릉로618길은 드라마 웨딩 임파서블의 촬영지로 아기자기한 카페와 평화로운 거리 풍경이 매력적인 곳입니다 이곳에서 드라마 속 주인공들의 순간들을 떠올리며 산책을 즐기거나 근처의 카페에서 커피 한 잔의 여유를 만끽해보세요 조용하면서도 따뜻한 분위기가 여행의 피로를 풀어줄 것입니다', '#KdramaTrip #거리 #카페 #여유 #촬영지', '거리/골목/광장', '618 Heoneung-ro Road', 'wedding impossible', '11, Heonneung-ro 618-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#KdramaTrip #Street #Café #Relaxed #FilmingPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dKjjSU/btsGfiNyddW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA2NywWGaJ2BS8mEubmTOZjy4QOa3nr3cq17oFUTWzR7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3xcWiFgDlQnSVKKYGjXByzqNAkA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cCOi1N/btsGe8RPtGT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAODzuNcxeKLWihL3W9YXrkb98UHmLyAjFQTnMa6XKjpI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6hMG35NM4zgtXkXZ%2F0L%2F2BqJASI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bz3oIu/btsGhEhXfWO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHLh7hRIseMEbscAfgG-1L9DODcANYuR5kIKp8KODYHe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6FC7m%2BheU%2FyzD0Lm%2BfffMRQw6nM%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dKjjSU/btsGfiNyddW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA2NywWGaJ2BS8mEubmTOZjy4QOa3nr3cq17oFUTWzR7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3xcWiFgDlQnSVKKYGjXByzqNAkA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cCOi1N/btsGe8RPtGT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAODzuNcxeKLWihL3W9YXrkb98UHmLyAjFQTnMa6XKjpI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6hMG35NM4zgtXkXZ%2F0L%2F2BqJASI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bz3oIu/btsGhEhXfWO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHLh7hRIseMEbscAfgG-1L9DODcANYuR5kIKp8KODYHe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6FC7m%2BheU%2FyzD0Lm%2BfffMRQw6nM%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dKjjSU/btsGfiNyddW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA2NywWGaJ2BS8mEubmTOZjy4QOa3nr3cq17oFUTWzR7/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3xcWiFgDlQnSVKKYGjXByzqNAkA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cCOi1N/btsGe8RPtGT/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAODzuNcxeKLWihL3W9YXrkb98UHmLyAjFQTnMa6XKjpI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6hMG35NM4zgtXkXZ%2F0L%2F2BqJASI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bz3oIu/btsGhEhXfWO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHLh7hRIseMEbscAfgG-1L9DODcANYuR5kIKp8KODYHe/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=6FC7m%2BheU%2FyzD0Lm%2BfffMRQw6nM%3D', 37.4639635, 127.1065394, '### 웨딩 임파서블 촬영지 정보\n\n**촬영지:** 헌릉로618길  \n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느낄 수 있는 조용한 거리로, 커피숍에서 여유로운 시간을 보내기 좋습니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리/골목  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n헌릉로618길은 드라마 "웨딩 임파서블"의 촬영지로, 아기자기한 카페와 평화로운 거리 풍경이 매력적인 곳입니다. 이곳에서 드라마 속 주인공들의 순간들을 떠올리며 산책을 즐기거나, 근처의 카페에서 커피 한 잔의 여유를 만끽해보세요. 조용하면서도 따뜻한 분위기가 여행의 피로를 풀어줄 것입니다.', 'Heoneungro 618gil is the filming location of the drama Wedding Impossible and it is an attractive place with cute cafes and peaceful street scenes Enjoy a walk here recalling the moments of the main characters in the drama or enjoy a cup of coffee at a nearby cafe The quiet and warm atmosphere will relieve the fatigue of your trip'),
	(1171, '웨딩 임파서블', '세곡천 산책로', '서울 강남구 세곡동 509', '세곡천 산책로는 푸른 자연과 함께 여유로운 분위기를 제공합니다 드라마 웨딩 임파서블의 촬영지로 유명한 이곳은 걷기 좋은 길과 아름다운 경치 덕분에 많은 팬들이 방문합니다 친구나 연인과 함께 걷기 좋은 이 길에서 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 순간을 만들어 보세요 아름다운 풍경과 함께 소중한 추억을 남길 수 있는 곳입니다', '#드라마촬영지 #산책로 #자연 #감성 #웨딩 #추억', '공원/숲/산', 'Segokcheon Stream Promenade', 'wedding impossible', '509 Segok-dong, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a park/forest/mountain', '#Drama filming location #walk #nature #emotional #wedding #memories', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kVotA/btsF65s5KwW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALIuYV_jbocWgV-iC5Reni_KWjicP5_3RX4nmMog1xSK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=m3UlRV5U13aQSjgB%2Fynh4xInYLo%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/btsTIq/btsF5HGv8Ka/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOtEtu-B1p0fpzZF_aVvBwIz1sdtU0mOB2UYkVa4Pp_q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PqqfYwXvZOYVceGceolxU9qVWaQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/s8ykB/btsF7TTsIzj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIzKzqOGx1Z0kIGwe3isiScyeQJbeTB471UPUp2rJZEb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4VvOhJhp3S%2BaX4STfONB%2FuWlq90%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kVotA/btsF65s5KwW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALIuYV_jbocWgV-iC5Reni_KWjicP5_3RX4nmMog1xSK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=m3UlRV5U13aQSjgB%2Fynh4xInYLo%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/btsTIq/btsF5HGv8Ka/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOtEtu-B1p0fpzZF_aVvBwIz1sdtU0mOB2UYkVa4Pp_q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PqqfYwXvZOYVceGceolxU9qVWaQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/s8ykB/btsF7TTsIzj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIzKzqOGx1Z0kIGwe3isiScyeQJbeTB471UPUp2rJZEb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4VvOhJhp3S%2BaX4STfONB%2FuWlq90%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/kVotA/btsF65s5KwW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAALIuYV_jbocWgV-iC5Reni_KWjicP5_3RX4nmMog1xSK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=m3UlRV5U13aQSjgB%2Fynh4xInYLo%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/btsTIq/btsF5HGv8Ka/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOtEtu-B1p0fpzZF_aVvBwIz1sdtU0mOB2UYkVa4Pp_q/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PqqfYwXvZOYVceGceolxU9qVWaQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/s8ykB/btsF7TTsIzj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIzKzqOGx1Z0kIGwe3isiScyeQJbeTB471UPUp2rJZEb/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=4VvOhJhp3S%2BaX4STfONB%2FuWlq90%3D', 37.463134, 127.1035207, '### 웨딩 임파서블 촬영지: 세곡천 산책로\n\n**방문 팁:** 세곡천 산책로는 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유롭게 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 세곡천 산책로는 푸른 자연과 함께 여유로운 분위기를 제공합니다. 드라마 "웨딩 임파서블"의 촬영지로 유명한 이곳은, 걷기 좋은 길과 아름다운 경치 덕분에 많은 팬들이 방문합니다. 친구나 연인과 함께 걷기 좋은 이 길에서 드라마의 한 장면처럼 특별한 순간을 만들어 보세요. 아름다운 풍경과 함께 소중한 추억을 남길 수 있는 곳입니다.\n\n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #StreetScene', 'Segokcheon Stream Promenade offers a relaxed atmosphere with green nature Famous as the filming location for the drama Wedding Impossible it is visited by many fans thanks to its walkable paths and beautiful scenery Create a special moment like a scene from a drama on this walkable road with friends or lovers It is a place where you can leave precious memories with beautiful scenery'),
	(1172, '웨딩 임파서블', '세곡동', '서울 강남구 헌릉로618길 24', '세곡동은 드라마 웨딩 임파서블의 촬영지로 현대적인 건축물과 아기자기한 골목길이 조화를 이루는 매력적인 장소입니다 이곳에서 드라마의 주요 장면을 떠올리며 산책하면 마치 주인공이 된 듯한 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다 다양한 카페와 식당도 있어 여유롭게 휴식을 취하기에도 좋은 곳입니다', '#드라마촬영지 #웨딩임파서블 #세곡동 #산책 #카페 #휴식', '거리/골목/광장', 'Segok-dong', 'wedding impossible', '24, Heonneung-ro 618-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a street/alley/square', '#Drama filming location #weddingimpossible #Segok-dong #walk #café #rest', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cuKDX2/btsF7JQRnki/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOWqmy8QjaijysnGJkTxUQn9lAZL_hK-ynfCNuM4BNTS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NXzIQUDPxG21OAQgDa92OgagOfI%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/RHkWQ/btsF5sQifb8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACldrKLMeJb1tD6GGAsrF8iAL2UNwbZmMg8RiJF7A-iI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YsBhvtmcCJ3P9UnEY%2FjntvGKDE0%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cuKDX2/btsF7JQRnki/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOWqmy8QjaijysnGJkTxUQn9lAZL_hK-ynfCNuM4BNTS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NXzIQUDPxG21OAQgDa92OgagOfI%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/RHkWQ/btsF5sQifb8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACldrKLMeJb1tD6GGAsrF8iAL2UNwbZmMg8RiJF7A-iI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YsBhvtmcCJ3P9UnEY%2FjntvGKDE0%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cuKDX2/btsF7JQRnki/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOWqmy8QjaijysnGJkTxUQn9lAZL_hK-ynfCNuM4BNTS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=NXzIQUDPxG21OAQgDa92OgagOfI%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/RHkWQ/btsF5sQifb8/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACldrKLMeJb1tD6GGAsrF8iAL2UNwbZmMg8RiJF7A-iI/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YsBhvtmcCJ3P9UnEY%2FjntvGKDE0%3D', NULL, 37.463116, 127.1061451, '### 웨딩 임파서블 촬영지: 세곡동\n\n**방문 팁:** 세곡동의 아름다운 풍경 속에서 드라마의 감성을 느껴보세요.\n\n**여행 포인트:** 세곡동은 드라마 "웨딩 임파서블"의 촬영지로, 현대적인 건축물과 아기자기한 골목길이 조화를 이루는 매력적인 장소입니다. 이곳에서 드라마의 주요 장면을 떠올리며 산책하면, 마치 주인공이 된 듯한 특별한 경험을 할 수 있습니다. 다양한 카페와 식당도 있어 여유롭게 휴식을 취하기에도 좋은 곳입니다.', 'Segokdong is the filming location for the drama Wedding Impossible and it is an attractive place with modern architecture and cute alleyways in harmony If you take a walk here thinking of the main scenes of the drama you can have a special experience as if you are the main character There are also various cafes and restaurants so its a good place to relax'),
	(1173, '이두나', '마포대교', '서울 영등포구 여의도동 85-2', '마포대교는 서울의 아름다운 경치를 한눈에 볼 수 있는 명소로 드라마 이두나의 촬영지로도 유명합니다 이곳에서 다리 위를 걷거나 자전거를 타며 한강의 풍경을 만끽할 수 있습니다 특히 저녁 시간대에는 화려한 야경이 펼쳐져 사진 촬영을 좋아하는 분들에게 안성맞춤입니다 또한 주변에는 다양한 카페와 음식점이 있어 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다', '#마포대교 #이두나 #서울경치 #산책 #야경', '기타', 'Mapo Bridge', 'two or two', '85-2 Yeouido-dong, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul', 'Guitar', '#Mapo Bridge #Iduna #Seoulscape #Walk #Nightscape', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/93tOz/btsyTHMVD6J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJcnh3QGQO8-jvOHq2uWkvcANGAnFou6Jylxssx0es3m/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YsMiYjIiZEDVMxsS%2FLLHA3yHrbA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Hq7Ed/btsyTZNmzUK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJSnGsw6ZEHwYnSzZCjdQTwM2XTWPlDYmrrwDnHmJTI8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XjHM1LnJRgm%2FkGfQYPA1BTVDBVs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nK1rr/btsyVY71AX5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADtEa9i0MWcw2M8Im4T5iPg5N0fT6TOL4GWeYwn7Yl5N/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Pnu4hJxwssKKtpizjvZi%2Fp7jdNg%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/93tOz/btsyTHMVD6J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJcnh3QGQO8-jvOHq2uWkvcANGAnFou6Jylxssx0es3m/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YsMiYjIiZEDVMxsS%2FLLHA3yHrbA%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Hq7Ed/btsyTZNmzUK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJSnGsw6ZEHwYnSzZCjdQTwM2XTWPlDYmrrwDnHmJTI8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XjHM1LnJRgm%2FkGfQYPA1BTVDBVs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nK1rr/btsyVY71AX5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADtEa9i0MWcw2M8Im4T5iPg5N0fT6TOL4GWeYwn7Yl5N/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Pnu4hJxwssKKtpizjvZi%2Fp7jdNg%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/93tOz/btsyTHMVD6J/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJcnh3QGQO8-jvOHq2uWkvcANGAnFou6Jylxssx0es3m/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=YsMiYjIiZEDVMxsS%2FLLHA3yHrbA%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Hq7Ed/btsyTZNmzUK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJSnGsw6ZEHwYnSzZCjdQTwM2XTWPlDYmrrwDnHmJTI8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=XjHM1LnJRgm%2FkGfQYPA1BTVDBVs%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/nK1rr/btsyVY71AX5/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADtEa9i0MWcw2M8Im4T5iPg5N0fT6TOL4GWeYwn7Yl5N/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Pnu4hJxwssKKtpizjvZi%2Fp7jdNg%3D', 37.5324275, 126.9357342, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목:** 이두나\n- **촬영지:** 마포대교\n- **방문팁:** 마포대교에서 멋진 서울의 전경을 감상하며 산책을 즐겨보세요.\n- **키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가:** 미상\n- **카테고리:** 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n마포대교는 서울의 아름다운 경치를 한눈에 볼 수 있는 명소로, 드라마 "이두나"의 촬영지로도 유명합니다. 이곳에서 다리 위를 걷거나 자전거를 타며 한강의 풍경을 만끽할 수 있습니다. 특히 저녁 시간대에는 화려한 야경이 펼쳐져, 사진 촬영을 좋아하는 분들에게 안성맞춤입니다. 또한, 주변에는 다양한 카페와 음식점이 있어 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다.', 'Mapo Bridge is a famous place where you can see the beautiful scenery of Seoul at a glance and it is also famous as the filming location for the drama Iduna Here you can enjoy the scenery of the Han River while walking or riding a bicycle on the bridge Especially in the evening a colorful night view is spread out making it perfect for those who like to take pictures Also there are various cafes and restaurants around so you can spend a leisurely time feeling the sensibility of the drama'),
	(1174, '이두나', '시우식당', '서울 종로구 필운대로 18 경복궁역2번출구 도보6분', '시우식당은 드라마 이두나의 촬영지로 팬들에게 특별한 의미를 지닌 장소입니다 이곳은 아늑한 분위기와 맛있는 메뉴로 방문객을 맞이하며 드라마의 감성을 그대로 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다 식사를 하며 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올려보는 것도 색다른 경험이 될 것입니다 또한 주변 경치와 함께 사진을 찍기 좋은 포인트도 많아 많은 이들에게 사랑받고 있습니다', '#KdramaTrip, #이두나, #카페, #서울여행, #촬영지, #맛집', '카페/레스토랑', 'Siwoo\'s restaurant', 'two or two', '6-minute walk from Exit 2 of Gyeongbokgung Station, 18, Pilun-daero, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#KdramaTrip, #Iduna, #Cafe, #SeoulTravel, #FilmingPlace, #FoodPlace', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bM2jfv/btsyTZz6R2p/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKeJbjR5Y-3Wn14G0FHbuz1ITOyAGo7r7mVciHjQMbM_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JQxJcsQ6gtfs8l2r5AhMgPoUQBE%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/yw3Y9/btsyTtV4xEZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC9a0j_Lp2CcAtVFxYnnnHqnAsiVtFWW0SGOiTQ6w6qq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ULNEwt%2FfYi38FXaUclEjBo6Tz88%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/2XsO2/btsyU8ww37d/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKZtj8nzHf-gIlAMm_0qGO2DfB6BhIk-PFUB5y7wwHc9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3A6YHVvTq4GLIxQGpm%2B17xRSRu8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bM2jfv/btsyTZz6R2p/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKeJbjR5Y-3Wn14G0FHbuz1ITOyAGo7r7mVciHjQMbM_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JQxJcsQ6gtfs8l2r5AhMgPoUQBE%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/yw3Y9/btsyTtV4xEZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC9a0j_Lp2CcAtVFxYnnnHqnAsiVtFWW0SGOiTQ6w6qq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ULNEwt%2FfYi38FXaUclEjBo6Tz88%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/2XsO2/btsyU8ww37d/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKZtj8nzHf-gIlAMm_0qGO2DfB6BhIk-PFUB5y7wwHc9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3A6YHVvTq4GLIxQGpm%2B17xRSRu8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bM2jfv/btsyTZz6R2p/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKeJbjR5Y-3Wn14G0FHbuz1ITOyAGo7r7mVciHjQMbM_/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=JQxJcsQ6gtfs8l2r5AhMgPoUQBE%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/yw3Y9/btsyTtV4xEZ/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC9a0j_Lp2CcAtVFxYnnnHqnAsiVtFWW0SGOiTQ6w6qq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=ULNEwt%2FfYi38FXaUclEjBo6Tz88%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/2XsO2/btsyU8ww37d/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKZtj8nzHf-gIlAMm_0qGO2DfB6BhIk-PFUB5y7wwHc9/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=3A6YHVvTq4GLIxQGpm%2B17xRSRu8%3D', 37.5777064, 126.9695721, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n**이두나**  \n**촬영지:** 시우식당  \n**방문팁:** 드라마 속 감성을 느끼며 여유롭게 커피 한 잔을 즐겨보세요.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #Cafe  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 카페/레스토랑  \n\n### 여행 포인트\n시우식당은 드라마 "이두나"의 촬영지로, 팬들에게 특별한 의미를 지닌 장소입니다. 이곳은 아늑한 분위기와 맛있는 메뉴로 방문객을 맞이하며, 드라마의 감성을 그대로 느낄 수 있는 곳입니다. 식사를 하며 드라마의 한 장면을 떠올려보는 것도 색다른 경험이 될 것입니다. 또한, 주변 경치와 함께 사진을 찍기 좋은 포인트도 많아 많은 이들에게 사랑받고 있습니다.', 'Siwoos restaurant is the filming location of the drama Iduna which has a special meaning for fans This place welcomes visitors with a cozy atmosphere and delicious menu and it is a place where you can feel the sensibility of the drama as it is It will be a different experience to think of a scene from a drama while eating Also it is loved by many people because there are many good points to take pictures with the surrounding scenery'),
	(1175, '이두나', '이화동벽화마을', '서울 종로구 율곡로19길 72 혜화역2번출구 도보16분', '이화동벽화마을은 서울의 숨겨진 보석 같은 곳으로 다양한 벽화와 예술 작품들이 가득한 거리입니다 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 이두나의 촬영지를 직접 경험할 수 있으며 아기자기한 카페와 상점들이 있어 사진 찍기에도 좋습니다 특히 벽화와 함께하는 산책은 색다른 추억을 만들어줄 것입니다 다양한 포토존이 마련되어 있어 친구들과 함께 즐거운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다', '#벽화마을, #산책, #일상, #촬영지, #사진찍기, #예술', '기타/판별불가', 'Ewha-dong Mural Village', 'two or two', '16 minutes walk from Exit 2 of Hyehwa Station, 72, Yulgok-ro 19-gil, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'Other/Not distinguishable', '#Mural Village, #Walk, #DailyLife, #ShootingPlaces, #TakingPhotos, #Art', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bcHxpm/btsyTGUQrAy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMyyL1sH2me7DvjWPpe5JG2UdLjU4IJWCRnUICfcog6X/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bYKW%2BoZ7AAd2fpusp3WZi5pg8rM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bAXYbW/btsyTZ0V80F/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACEx77inlMGyD8wY7IzYuGbu75YVGG_EPLZ37zoRKsD3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LWZqWsyXKwL%2B2sHgnO8%2FpzJtNsU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lWTZ5/btsyUd5XuiV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHXZTOQttcwZ_NT_ceHtcERcQ8NyUv468xjKnefh5cqC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vMxhglhhBcRqoSf5yNB6Acu0QZ8%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bcHxpm/btsyTGUQrAy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMyyL1sH2me7DvjWPpe5JG2UdLjU4IJWCRnUICfcog6X/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bYKW%2BoZ7AAd2fpusp3WZi5pg8rM%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bAXYbW/btsyTZ0V80F/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACEx77inlMGyD8wY7IzYuGbu75YVGG_EPLZ37zoRKsD3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LWZqWsyXKwL%2B2sHgnO8%2FpzJtNsU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lWTZ5/btsyUd5XuiV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHXZTOQttcwZ_NT_ceHtcERcQ8NyUv468xjKnefh5cqC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vMxhglhhBcRqoSf5yNB6Acu0QZ8%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bcHxpm/btsyTGUQrAy/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMyyL1sH2me7DvjWPpe5JG2UdLjU4IJWCRnUICfcog6X/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=bYKW%2BoZ7AAd2fpusp3WZi5pg8rM%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bAXYbW/btsyTZ0V80F/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACEx77inlMGyD8wY7IzYuGbu75YVGG_EPLZ37zoRKsD3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=LWZqWsyXKwL%2B2sHgnO8%2FpzJtNsU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/lWTZ5/btsyUd5XuiV/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHXZTOQttcwZ_NT_ceHtcERcQ8NyUv468xjKnefh5cqC/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=vMxhglhhBcRqoSf5yNB6Acu0QZ8%3D', 37.5773937, 127.0072131, '### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 이두나\n- **촬영지**: 이화동벽화마을\n- **방문팁**: 이곳은 아기자기한 벽화와 독특한 상점들이 있어 산책하기에 좋은 장소입니다.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Unclear\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 기타\n\n### 여행 포인트\n이화동벽화마을은 서울의 숨겨진 보석 같은 곳으로, 다양한 벽화와 예술 작품들이 가득한 거리입니다. 이곳을 방문하면 드라마 "이두나"의 촬영지를 직접 경험할 수 있으며, 아기자기한 카페와 상점들이 있어 사진 찍기에도 좋습니다. 특히, 벽화와 함께하는 산책은 색다른 추억을 만들어줄 것입니다. 다양한 포토존이 마련되어 있어 친구들과 함께 즐거운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다.', 'Ewha Dong Mural Village is a hidden gem of Seoul a street full of various murals and artworks If you visit here you can experience the filming location of the drama Iduna and there are cute cafes and shops so its good for taking pictures In particular walking with murals will make different memories There are various photo zones so you can have a good time with your friends'),
	(1176, '이두나', '동대문디자인플라자', '서울 중구 을지로 281 동대문역사문화공원역1번출구 도보2분', '동대문디자인플라자는 현대적인 건축물과 다양한 문화 행사로 유명한 장소입니다 이곳에서 드라마 이두나의 촬영지를 방문하면 독특한 디자인과 예술적 분위기를 만끽할 수 있습니다 특히 다양한 전시와 이벤트가 열리므로 방문 시 확인해 보세요 사진 촬영에도 좋은 장소이니 멋진 순간을 남길 수 있습니다', '#디자인플라자, #촬영지, #문화행사, #예술적분위기, #사진촬영, #전시', '박물관/미술관/전시', 'Dongdaemun Design Plaza', 'two or two', '2-minute walk from Exit 1 of Dongdaemun History and Culture Park Station, 281, Eulji-ro, Jung-gu, Seoul', 'a museum/art gallery/exhibition', '#Design Plaza, #filming location, #culturalevent, #artistic atmosphere, #photography, #exhibition', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cI1w09/btsyV0LOI8x/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKSfopKQZ_UYlsPly1sf5-e80dQHpS9O_wLLCIx-en22/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nwIJN%2FZEPQYyu76t%2F4OKXUgc95Q%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cakatY/btsyQMIOrmj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGoOOsyPEdQIOlXhFj1gm9OZnBQcRtQvduPYzyhRPnfN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wT74x%2BFsj9%2B%2BQzbi28WE62eu4YQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bHencQ/btsyU4gSrIc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACkl6-xPiJyQzpDUpm9fTmCo2fk0QhhA1yPpjR-Ju6ow/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=U9cR%2B8NIIY2xxYyGadtP1Urdlio%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cI1w09/btsyV0LOI8x/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKSfopKQZ_UYlsPly1sf5-e80dQHpS9O_wLLCIx-en22/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nwIJN%2FZEPQYyu76t%2F4OKXUgc95Q%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cakatY/btsyQMIOrmj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGoOOsyPEdQIOlXhFj1gm9OZnBQcRtQvduPYzyhRPnfN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wT74x%2BFsj9%2B%2BQzbi28WE62eu4YQ%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bHencQ/btsyU4gSrIc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACkl6-xPiJyQzpDUpm9fTmCo2fk0QhhA1yPpjR-Ju6ow/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=U9cR%2B8NIIY2xxYyGadtP1Urdlio%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cI1w09/btsyV0LOI8x/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAKSfopKQZ_UYlsPly1sf5-e80dQHpS9O_wLLCIx-en22/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=nwIJN%2FZEPQYyu76t%2F4OKXUgc95Q%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cakatY/btsyQMIOrmj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGoOOsyPEdQIOlXhFj1gm9OZnBQcRtQvduPYzyhRPnfN/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=wT74x%2BFsj9%2B%2BQzbi28WE62eu4YQ%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bHencQ/btsyU4gSrIc/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACkl6-xPiJyQzpDUpm9fTmCo2fk0QhhA1yPpjR-Ju6ow/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=U9cR%2B8NIIY2xxYyGadtP1Urdlio%3D', 37.5660286, 126.9954924, '### 여행 포인트\n\n동대문디자인플라자는 현대적인 건축물과 다양한 문화 행사로 유명한 장소입니다. 이곳에서 드라마 \'이두나\'의 촬영지를 방문하면, 독특한 디자인과 예술적 분위기를 만끽할 수 있습니다. 특히, 다양한 전시와 이벤트가 열리므로 방문 시 확인해 보세요. 사진 촬영에도 좋은 장소이니, 멋진 순간을 남길 수 있습니다.', 'Dongdaemun Design Plaza is a place famous for its modern architecture and various cultural events If you visit the filming location of the drama Iduna here you can enjoy a unique design and artistic atmosphere In particular various exhibitions and events will be held so check them out when you visit Its also a great place for photoshoots so you can leave a great moment'),
	(1177, '이두나', '29펍 4호점', '서울 강남구 강남대로110길 14 신논현역4번출구 도보1분', '29펍 4호점은 드라마 이두나의 촬영지로 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 곳입니다 다양한 음료와 함께 드라마 속 주인공들이 느꼈던 감정을 간접적으로 체험할 수 있으며 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소입니다 특히 독특한 조명과 인테리어가 사진 촬영에도 좋은 배경이 되어 소중한 추억을 남길 수', '#이두나 #카페 #촬영지 #서울 #강남 #음료', '카페/레스토랑', '29 Pub 4', 'two or two', '1-minute walk from Exit 4 of Sinnonhyeon Station, 14, Gangnam-daero 110-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul', 'a cafe/restaurant', '#Iduna #Café #FilmingPlace #Seoul #Gangnam #Drink', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Hhjcb/btsyYoZV6SO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABI2p2msd5hOih7f-8vv1JeByZN5jhQ_H1JnJB9alUr0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kh%2F5Ntk%2Fxcr46kHlzNmu8zC%2BkPc%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/QqjyT/btsyRV6A0j7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMi7mLZGMoF2hIGbXt-PhCZHQ7_d7_EDrW1GYyCI-Gfq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Clu59wF7az4WqPilo8DjFNr5Z6g%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Hhjcb/btsyYoZV6SO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABI2p2msd5hOih7f-8vv1JeByZN5jhQ_H1JnJB9alUr0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kh%2F5Ntk%2Fxcr46kHlzNmu8zC%2BkPc%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/QqjyT/btsyRV6A0j7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMi7mLZGMoF2hIGbXt-PhCZHQ7_d7_EDrW1GYyCI-Gfq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Clu59wF7az4WqPilo8DjFNr5Z6g%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Hhjcb/btsyYoZV6SO/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABI2p2msd5hOih7f-8vv1JeByZN5jhQ_H1JnJB9alUr0/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=kh%2F5Ntk%2Fxcr46kHlzNmu8zC%2BkPc%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/QqjyT/btsyRV6A0j7/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMi7mLZGMoF2hIGbXt-PhCZHQ7_d7_EDrW1GYyCI-Gfq/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=Clu59wF7az4WqPilo8DjFNr5Z6g%3D', NULL, 37.5037581, 127.0260654, '### 카페/레스토랑 정보\n\n- **이두나** | **29펍 4호점**\n\n#### 드라마 정보\n- **제목**: 이두나\n- **촬영지**: 29펍 4호점\n- **방문팁**: 아늑한 분위기에서 다양한 음료를 즐기며 드라마의 한 장면을 체험해보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Cafe\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 카페/레스토랑\n\n#### 여행 포인트\n29펍 4호점은 드라마 "이두나"의 촬영지로, 세련된 인테리어와 아늑한 분위기가 매력적인 곳입니다. 다양한 음료와 함께 드라마 속 주인공들이 느꼈던 감정을 간접적으로 체험할 수 있으며, 친구들과의 소중한 시간을 보내기에 적합한 장소입니다. 특히, 독특한 조명과 인테리어가 사진 촬영에도 좋은 배경이 되어, 소중한 추억을 남길 수', 'The 29th pub No 4 is the filming location of the drama Iduna which is attractive for its sophisticated interior and cozy atmosphere Along with various drinks you can experience the emotions of the main characters in the drama indirectly and it is a suitable place to spend precious time with friends In particular unique lighting and interior design make it a good background for photography so you can leave precious memories'),
	(1178, '이두나', '플라잉 요가 더 루시아 스튜디오', '서울 강남구 압구정로 461 3층 압구정로데오역2번출구 도보9분', '플라잉 요가 더 루시아 스튜디오는 드라마 이두나의 촬영지로 현대적이고 아늑한 분위기에서 다양한 요가 수업을 제공합니다 이곳은 편안한 환경 속에서 몸과 마음을 동시에 힐링할 수 있는 공간으로 드라마 팬이라면 촬영지의 매력을 느끼며 특별한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 요가 수업 외에도 스튜디오의 인테리어와 조명은 사진 찍기에도 좋은 장소입니다', '#플라잉요가, #힐링, #스튜디오, #이두나, #서울, #강남', '스튜디오/세트장', 'Flying Yoga The Lucia Studio', 'two or two', 'Apgujeong Rodeo Station Exit 2 on the 3rd floor of 461 Apgujeong-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul, 9 minutes on foot', 'a studio/set', '#Flying yoga, #healing, #studio, #iduna, #Seoul, #Gangnam', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cEzNoL/btsy4sBsOXj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEe7QAJPgxOVtgiOKZzvNqq6ElD7DyacfO7yxFJDxmxm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=chwGhHpFi2GvNsRRwWFR16AQQeU%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bLETMI/btsy38wtFXW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADDEKGg4EqNAqQeSvUWnJBxZsdQte6Rz1fW40HbKKwZ4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BNN%2BJ%2B169xyMbUVATbhMKrxyv1o%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cEzNoL/btsy4sBsOXj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEe7QAJPgxOVtgiOKZzvNqq6ElD7DyacfO7yxFJDxmxm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=chwGhHpFi2GvNsRRwWFR16AQQeU%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bLETMI/btsy38wtFXW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADDEKGg4EqNAqQeSvUWnJBxZsdQte6Rz1fW40HbKKwZ4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BNN%2BJ%2B169xyMbUVATbhMKrxyv1o%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/cEzNoL/btsy4sBsOXj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEe7QAJPgxOVtgiOKZzvNqq6ElD7DyacfO7yxFJDxmxm/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=chwGhHpFi2GvNsRRwWFR16AQQeU%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bLETMI/btsy38wtFXW/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADDEKGg4EqNAqQeSvUWnJBxZsdQte6Rz1fW40HbKKwZ4/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=BNN%2BJ%2B169xyMbUVATbhMKrxyv1o%3D', NULL, 37.5252829, 127.0472385, '### 스튜디오 정보\n- **장소**: 플라잉 요가 더 루시아 스튜디오, 서울 강남구 압구정로 461 3층\n- **드라마 제목**: 이두나\n- **방문 팁**: 세련된 분위기에서 플라잉 요가를 경험해 보세요.\n- **키워드**: #KdramaTrip #Studio\n- **작가**: 미상\n- **카테고리**: 스튜디오\n\n### 여행 포인트\n플라잉 요가 더 루시아 스튜디오는 드라마 "이두나"의 촬영지로, 현대적이고 아늑한 분위기에서 다양한 요가 수업을 제공합니다. 이곳은 편안한 환경 속에서 몸과 마음을 동시에 힐링할 수 있는 공간으로, 드라마 팬이라면 촬영지의 매력을 느끼며 특별한 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 요가 수업 외에도 스튜디오의 인테리어와 조명은 사진 찍기에도 좋은 장소입니다.', 'Flying Yoga The Lucia Studio is the filming location for the drama Iduna offering a variety of yoga classes in a modern and cozy atmosphere This is a space where you can heal your body and mind at the same time in a comfortable environment and if you are a drama fan you can spend a special time feeling the charm of the filming location Aside from yoga classes the studios interior and lighting are also great places to take pictures'),
	(1179, '정신병동에도 아침이 와요', '마포소금구이', '서울 마포구 와우산로32길 36 홍대입구역6번출구 도보6분', '마포소금구이는 드라마 정신병동에도 아침이 와요의 촬영지로 도시의 생동감과 함께 아늑한 분위기를 제공합니다 이곳은 다양한 음식점과 카페가 즐비해 있어 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다 특히 저녁 시간대의 조명이 아름다워 사진 촬영에도 좋은 장소입니다 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보세요', '#촬영지 #드라마 #여유 #산책 #맛집', '거리/골목/광장', 'Grilled Mapo salt', 'It\'s morning in the psychiatric ward', '36 Wausan-ro 32-gil, Mapo-gu, Seoul, 6 minutes walk from Hongik University Station Exit 6', 'a street/alley/square', '#Filming location #Drama #Relaxed #Walk #Nice Restaurant', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dIWqUv/btszHUeWxck/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAsxd6QLMR1n2vB_yThkgGH2XPsgJ773JmhzjdTOoRbK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PLXs9vauDDVRMHdyFuCsk5YmQ5g%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bhycHm/btszJJRqlJG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPTGgq3_uhy9pb6drEjxjx-0L3CTEtuPUd5N8KcnP-9H/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=t0%2FPi%2BSts4FkJkBGP%2B314u3Qv%2BY%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dW5iCr/btszKbGR4Fm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJnW3UWbJsEjXvM7fnI0CnJ5EvWEMuIc9WflPKMnoLXv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DU%2BNM8lmN%2B7L1aK10yo%2BO%2B3RvVs%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bVsZep/btszKHljfkh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI2liqZJwU8HqhioKClZoGbw__RjiyTJCiTuUUAzbkWS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HqXGsnIyRiV0rW%2BlHf0ea6PvBEk%3D', '[\'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dIWqUv/btszHUeWxck/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAsxd6QLMR1n2vB_yThkgGH2XPsgJ773JmhzjdTOoRbK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PLXs9vauDDVRMHdyFuCsk5YmQ5g%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bhycHm/btszJJRqlJG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPTGgq3_uhy9pb6drEjxjx-0L3CTEtuPUd5N8KcnP-9H/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=t0%2FPi%2BSts4FkJkBGP%2B314u3Qv%2BY%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dW5iCr/btszKbGR4Fm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJnW3UWbJsEjXvM7fnI0CnJ5EvWEMuIc9WflPKMnoLXv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DU%2BNM8lmN%2B7L1aK10yo%2BO%2B3RvVs%3D\', \'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bVsZep/btszKHljfkh/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAI2liqZJwU8HqhioKClZoGbw__RjiyTJCiTuUUAzbkWS/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=HqXGsnIyRiV0rW%2BlHf0ea6PvBEk%3D\']', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dIWqUv/btszHUeWxck/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAsxd6QLMR1n2vB_yThkgGH2XPsgJ773JmhzjdTOoRbK/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=PLXs9vauDDVRMHdyFuCsk5YmQ5g%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bhycHm/btszJJRqlJG/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPTGgq3_uhy9pb6drEjxjx-0L3CTEtuPUd5N8KcnP-9H/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=t0%2FPi%2BSts4FkJkBGP%2B314u3Qv%2BY%3D', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/dW5iCr/btszKbGR4Fm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAJnW3UWbJsEjXvM7fnI0CnJ5EvWEMuIc9WflPKMnoLXv/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=DU%2BNM8lmN%2B7L1aK10yo%2BO%2B3RvVs%3D', 37.5546038, 126.9323172, '### 정신병동에도 아침이 와요\n\n**촬영지:** 마포소금구이  \n**방문팁:** 이곳은 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유롭게 산책하기 좋은 장소입니다.  \n**키워드:** #KdramaTrip #태그  \n**작가:** 미상  \n**카테고리:** 거리  \n\n#### 여행 포인트\n마포소금구이는 드라마 "정신병동에도 아침이 와요"의 촬영지로, 도시의 생동감과 함께 아늑한 분위기를 제공합니다. 이곳은 다양한 음식점과 카페가 즐비해 있어, 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 여유로운 시간을 보낼 수 있습니다. 특히 저녁 시간대의 조명이 아름다워, 사진 촬영에도 좋은 장소입니다. 드라마 팬이라면 꼭 방문해보세요!', 'Mapo Salt Grill is the filming location of the drama Morning Comes to the Mental Ward providing a cozy atmosphere with the vitality of the city This place is lined with various restaurants and cafes so you can spend a leisurely time feeling the sensibility of the drama Especially the lighting in the evening is beautiful so it is a good place for photography If youre a drama fan please visit'),
	(1180, '정신병동에도 아침이 와요', '강북삼성병원', '서울 종로구 새문안로 29 서대문역4번출구 도보5분', '강북삼성병원은 서울의 중심부에 위치해 있어 접근성이 뛰어나며 현대적인 시설과 아름다운 경관을 제공합니다 이곳은 드라마 정신병동에도 아침이 와요의 촬영지로 팬들에게는 특별한 의미가 있는 장소입니다 병원 주변에는 다양한 카페와 식당이 있어 방문 후 여유롭게 주변을 탐방하기에도 좋습니다 드라마의 감성을 느끼며 촬영지의 분위기를 만끽해보세요', '#정신병동에도아침이와요, #강북삼성병원, #KdramaTrip, #병원, #촬영지, #서울', '병원', 'Gangbuk Samsung Hospital', 'It\'s morning in the psychiatric ward', '5-minute walk from Exit 4 of Seodaemun Station 29, Saemanan-ro, Jongno-gu, Seoul', 'a hospital', '#Morning also comes to the psychiatric ward, #GangbukSamsungHospital, #KdramaTrip, #Hospital, #ShootingPlace, #Seoul', 'https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/2MUjO/btszKAUk2Jm/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPRcrb1J5R9pPEFs2AzTTEHYLRDNhgerGk03Tv29PTP3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yhDAAsgXosO3Gy8I9ZdiWJZsWP4%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bOrtKV/btszM0K0pYj/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAANORSrOGa5uPZdJGG1Tz9NB3mqbuf8ml7hfWBAn4drs3/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=8tvIJMmQ5BDwYakdDI3ej%2Fu%2FoUM%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/CHw8h/btszKGNt7Tb/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFAqzpQT7DKEc-QUJOs4SLWHE85anWo9TfTFmyptfPW1/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=m4%2FMSw%2BBank%2BPc8ybmuNGgEYJEQ%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/bZThP1/btszIZfZI79/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACAs_Mw2GfdOtZfy92jS3KuGsvM2z2Ufta5Xv4MrIT76/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=yWUc6lO7FyLpprwjiY2MQz6yzMA%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/Tdurl/btszLtNxHTl/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABAi0elleBoZJMatWIwtIvTv9yq9lNQugkardRFNrymA/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&expires=1764514799&allow_ip=&allow_referer=&signature=FtKLQUO5MBEBl06CkW3Yh73N1Wg%3D,https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/yxH5d/btszKIxMOu4/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADPz8H0HzhNv_wRD6Sok-XlWjOVKknSc2J72y4zUf1kl/img.jpg?credential=